<34> pāyasairmadhuraiḥ sarvān saṃyajenmadhurānvitaiḥ |
tattaddravyairvā matimān pūjayed doṣaśāntaye ||

divyasārasvate (-) madhye padānāṃ navakaṃ mārjayitvā prapūrayet |
sitena rajasā bhūyastaddikṣu ca catasṛṣu ||

ṣaṭkaṃ sammārjya rajasā raktena paripūrayet |
śiṣṭāni ca padānyatra yathāsthānaṃ prakalpayet ||

vicitrāṇi tato madhye brahmāṇaṃ saṃprapūjayet | iti |

brahmapūjāvidhiryathā (-) karṇikāyāṃ maṇḍūkādiparatattvāntaṃ kesareṣu 
madhye cāṇimādisarvasiddhyantā navapīṭhaśaktīḥ oṃ 
sarvajñānakriyāvyaktakamalāsanāya yogapīṭhāya nama iti madhye pīṭhaṃ ca 
sampūjya tatra yathoktaṃ brahmāṇamāvāhya oṃ namo brahmaṇa iti mantreṇa 
pañcopacārādibhirbrahmāṇaṃ pūjayet | tatastatparivāratvena anyānapi pūjayet 
| eṣāṃ dhyānaṃ tantrāntare (-)

uktānāṃ sarvadevānāṃ svarūpaṃ ca nigadyate |
akṣamālāṃ sruvaṃ dakṣe vāme daṇḍakamaṇḍalum ||

dadhānamaṣṭanayanaṃ yajenmadhye'mbujāsanam |
sarve caturbhujā devā vāstudehe vyavasthitāḥ ||

kṛtāñjalipuṭāḥ sarve khaḍgakheṭakapāṇayaḥ |
brahmāṇaṃ saṃnirīkṣante tadvaktrābhimukhāśca te ||

svasvasthānasthitāścaiva sādhāraṇamudāhṛtam |
marīciḥ śvetavarṇaḥ syād vivasvān raktavarṇakaḥ ||

śātakumbhanibho mitraḥ kṛṣṇavarṇastu bhūdharaḥ |
savitā nīlavarṇābhaḥ sāvitro dhūmravigrahaḥ ||

indraścāruṇavarṇābhaḥ śuklaścendrajayastathā |
rudraḥ prabālasadṛśaḥ pīto rudrajayastathā ||

āpo gokṣīradhavala āpavatso japādyutiḥ |
īśānaḥ kṣīradhavalaḥ parjanyo'ñjanasannibhaḥ ||

jayanto'ñjanasaṃkāśo mahendraścāmaladyutiḥ |
ādityo raktavarṇaḥ syāt satyakaścitravarṇakaḥ ||

vṛṣo bandhūkapuṣpābhaḥ kundābhaścāntarikṣakaḥ |
udyaddinakārābho'gniḥ pūṣā raktābjasannibhaḥ ||

<35> vitathaścendracāpābho vidyudvarṇo gṛharakṣakaḥ |
yamaścāñjanasaṅkāśo gandharvaḥ padmarāgavat ||

bhṛṅgarājastu bhṛṅgābho mṛgo jīmutasannibhaḥ |
nirṛtiḥ pāvakābhaśca pīto dauvārikaḥ smṛtaḥ ||

sugrīvo nīlakaṇṭhābhaścandrābhaḥ puṣpadantakaḥ |
varuṇaḥ sphaṭikābhāṅgo bhṛṅgābhaścāsuro mataḥ ||

śoṣaścotpalasaṃkāśo rogaścaivendranīlavat |
vāyuḥ kṛṣṇābhravarṇaḥ syānnāgaḥ śaṅkhendusannibhaḥ ||

mukhyo mauktikasaṅkāśo bhallāṭaḥ śvetapadmavat |
somaḥ sphaṭikasaṅkāśo'rgalo raktotpaladyutiḥ ||

ditiḥ kundendudhavalā kapilā cāditiḥ smṛtā |
carakī śaṅkhasadṛśī vidārī pāvakadyutiḥ ||

pūtanā himasaṅkāśā meghābhā pilapicchikā |
khaḍgaṃ ca pānapātraṃ ca churikāṃ kartarīṃ tathā ||

dadhānā bhīmarūpāstā rākṣasyaḥ parikīrtitāḥ |
sito raktaśca pītaśca kṛṣṇaḥ skandādikā grahāḥ ||

vajraṃ śaktiṃ ca khaḍgaṃ ca pāśaṃ ca vikṛtānanāḥ |
dadhānā bhīṣaṇāḥ proktā grahāḥ skandādikāśca te ||

atra pratidaivataṃ balidravyabhedā mantrāścoktāḥ mahākapilañcaparātre (-) 
gautamīyatantre ca (-)

pāyasaudanalājaiśca yuktaṃ dhūpaiḥ prasūnakaiḥ |
annādibhiśca saṃyuktaṃ māṣabhaktādimaṇḍitam |
gṛhāṇemaṃ baliṃ brahman vāstudoṣaṃ praṇāśaya ||

gandhādiśarkarāpūpaṃ pāyasopari saṃsthitam |
āryakākhya gṛhāṇemaṃ sarvadoṣaṃ praṇāśaya ||

candanādyarcitaṃ nātha karpūrāgurumaṇḍitam |
vivasvan vai gṛhāṇemaṃ sarvadoṣaṃ praṇāśaya ||

saguḍaṃ pāyasaṃ nātha puṣpādisusamanvitam |
gṛhāṇemaṃ baliṃ hṛdyaṃ mitra śāntiṃ prayaccha me ||

māṣaudanaṃ samāṃsañca gandhādikṣīrasaṃyutam |
gṛhāṇemaṃ mahībhṛt tvaṃ sarvadoṣaṃ praṇāśaya ||

<36> evaṃ madhye tu saṃpūjya īśānādibaliṃ haret ||

etena pūjāyāmāgneyādikrame'pi balāvīśānādikramaḥ | anyatrāpi(-)

īśānād dakṣiṇāvarto baliḥ sāmānyabhāṣitaḥ |
sarveṣāṃ khalu vastūnāṃ viśeṣaḥ padanirṇaye ||

kvacittu pūjāpi tathaivoktā (-)

īśakoṇādiṣu surān pūjayecca vidhānataḥ |

īśānādicatuṣkoṇasaṃsthitān pūjayed budhaḥ || iti |

tathā (-) kṣīraṃ khaṇḍasamāyuktaṃ puṣpādibhiralaṅkṛtam |
gṛhāṇemaṃ baliṃ hṛdyamāpa śāntiṃ prayaccha me ||

dadhīdaṃ guḍasaṃmiśraṃ gandhādibhiḥ susaṃyutam |
gṛhāṇemaṃ baliṃ vatsa vighnamatra praṇāśaya ||

puṣpādikuśapānīyaṃ karpūrāguruvāsitam |
sāvitra vai gṛhāṇemaṃ śāntimatra prayaccha me ||

piṣṭakaṃ saguḍaṃ nātha raktagandhādiśobhitam |
gṛhāṇemaṃ baliṃ sūrya vighnamatra praṇāśaya ||

śītamannaṃ tathā puṣpaṃ kuṅkumādisamanvitam |
gṛhāṇemaṃ baliṃ gṛdyaṃ śakradeva namo'stu te ||

odanaṃ ghṛtasaṃyuktaṃ vastragandhādimaṇḍitam |
gṛhāṇemaṃ baliṃ hṛdyamindrajaya namo'stu te ||

pakvāpakvamidaṃ māṃsaṃ vastrapuṣpādisaṃyutam |
gṛhāṇemaṃ baliṃ hṛdyaṃ rudradeva namāmyaham ||

samāṃsaṃ ghṛtasaṃpakvaṃ gandhapuṣpādisaṃyutam |
gṛhāṇemaṃ baliṃ rudrajaya svasti prayaccha me ||

raktapuṣpaṃ samāṃsaṃ vai raktavastrādisaṃyutam |
vidārī vai gṛhāṇemaṃ rakṣovighnaṃ vināśaya ||

pittaraktāsthisaṃyuktaṃ raktagandhādimaṇḍitam |
gṛhāṇemaṃ pūtane tvaṃ rakṣovighnaṃ vināśaya ||

saghṛtaṃ māṣabhaktaṃ ca raktagandhādisaṃyutam |
baliṃ gṛhāṇa śarva tvaṃ rakṣovighnaṃ vināśaya ||

māṃsaṃ puṣpādisaṃyuktaṃ māṣabhaktādisaṃyutam |
<37> gṛhāṇemaṃ baliṃ skanda rakṣovighnaṃ nivāraya ||

śvamāṃsaṃ piṣṭakairyuktaṃ pakvamāṃsodakānvitam |
aryaman vai gṛhāṇemaṃ sarvavighnaṃ vināśaya ||

raktamāṃsaudanaṃ matsyaṃ gandhapuṣpasamanvitam |
jṛmbhaka tvaṃ gṛhāṇemaṃ rakṣovighnaṃ praṇāśaya ||

chāgakarṇānvitaṃ māṃsaṃ vastragandhādisaṃyutam |
pilapicchi gṛhāṇemaṃ rakṣovighnaṃ vināśaya ||

ghṛtena sādhitaṃ māṃsaṃ vastragandhādisaṃyutam |
caraki tvaṃ gṛhāṇemaṃ rakṣovighnaṃ vināśaya ||

saghṛtaṃ sākṣataṃ bhaktaṃ vastragandhādyalaṅkṛtam |
gṛhāṇemaṃ baliṃ tvīśa vāstudoṣāpahārakam ||

utpalaṃ pāyasairyuktaṃ vastrādikasamanvitam |
gṛhāṇemaṃ baliṃ hṛdyaṃ megharāja namo'stu te ||

pañcahastaṃ supītaṃ ca dhvajaṃ bhaktādimaṇḍitam |
gṛhāṇemaṃ baliṃ hṛdyaṃ jiṣṇusuta namo'stu te ||

odanaṃ ghṛtasampūrṇaṃ pañcaratnādimaṇḍitam |
gṛhāṇemaṃ baliṃ hṛdyaṃ devarāja namo'stu te ||

raktapuṣpayutaṃ bhaktaṃ raktagandhādibhiryutam |
gṛhāṇemaṃ baliṃ hṛdyaṃ bhāskara tvaṃ namo'stu te ||

vitānaṃ dhūmravarṇābhaṃ gandhādikasuśobhitam |
raktayuktaṃ gṛhāṇemaṃ baliṃ satya namo'stu te ||

idaṃ tu māṣabhaktaṃ vai vastragandhādipūjitam |
gṛhāṇemaṃ vṛṣa baliṃ vāstudoṣaṃ vināśaya ||

idaṃ tu śādbalaṃ māṃsaṃ naivedyādisusaṃyutam |
gṛhāṇemaṃ baliṃ hṛdyaṃ vyoma śāntiṃ prayaccha me ||

suvarṇaṃ piṣṭakaṃ cātha vastragandhādibhiryutam |
dhṛtānvitaṃ gṛhāṇemaṃ saptajihva namo'stu te ||

kṣīraṃ lājasamāyuktaṃ gandhapuṣpādisaṃyutam |
gṛhāṇemaṃ baliṃ hṛdyaṃ pūṣadeva namo'stu te ||

māṃsaudanaṃ gandhamālyayutaṃ vastrādibhūṣitam |
<38> vitathemaṃ baliṃ gṛhṇa vāstudoṣaṃ vināśaya ||

matsyamāṃsayutaṃ bhaktaṃ gandhapuṣpādyalaṅkṛtam |
yamarāja gṛhāṇemaṃ baliṃ śāntiṃ prayaccha me ||

pakvamāṃsaudanaṃ navanītaṃ vastrādimaṇḍitam |
prītikaraṃ gṛhāṇemaṃ gṛharakṣa namo'stu te ||

nānāgandhasamāyuktaṃ raktapuṣpādibhiryutam |
baliṃ gṛhāṇa gandharva sarvadoṣaṃ praṇāśaya ||

imāṃ tu śākunīṃ jihvāṃ māṣabhaktoparisthitām |
gṛhāṇemaṃ bhṛṅgarāja baliṃ śāntiṃ prayaccha me ||

yavaṃ tilaghṛtopetaṃ gandhapuṣpādibhiryutam |
gṛhāṇemaṃ baliṃ hṛdyaṃ mṛgadeva namo'stu te ||

śarkarāmaṇḍitaṃ khaṇḍaṃ vastragandhādyalaṅkṛtam |
prīto baliṃ gṛhāṇemaṃ rakṣorāja namo'stu te ||

candanāgurukhaṇḍaṃ ca vastragandhādibhiryutam |
gṛhāṇemaṃ baliṃ hṛdyaṃ dauvārika namo'stu te ||

idaṃ tu pāyasaṃ nātha gandhapuṣpādimiśritam |
sugrīva vai gṛhāṇemaṃ baliṃ śāntiṃ prayaccha me ||

yavādyalaṅkṛtaṃ dugdhaṃ bhaktopari samarpitam |
gṛhāṇemaṃ baliṃ hṛdyaṃ jaladeva namo'stu te ||

māṣabhaktaṃ kuśastambaṃ ghṛtagandhādisaṃyutam |
puṣpadanta gṛhāṇemaṃ vāstudoṣaṃ praṇāśaya ||

madhunā sādhitaṃ piṣṭaṃ gandhādyairupaśobhitam |
baliṃ gṛhāṇāsurendra sarvadoṣaṃ praṇāśaya ||

ghṛtaṃ cānnasamāyuktaṃ karpūrādisamanvitam |
gṛhāṇemaṃ baliṃ śoṣa sarvaśāntiṃ prayaccha me ||

yavajaṃ taṇḍulaṃ nātha gandhapuṣpādiśobhitam |
gṛhāṇemaṃ baliṃ roga sarvadoṣaṃ praṇāśaya ||

saghṛtaṃ maṇḍakaṃ cedamannādyairupaśobhitam |
gṛhāṇemaṃ baliṃ hṛdyaṃ mṛgavāha namo'stu te ||

idaṃ tu kṛśarānnaṃ me dugdhagandhādisādhitam |
<39> pātāleśa gṛhāṇemaṃ vighnamatra praṇāśaya ||

nālikerodakaṃ bhaktaṃ pītavastrādisaṃyutam |
gṛhāṇemaṃ baliṃ mukhya vāstudośaṃ praṇāśaya ||

pāyasaṃ madhunā miśraṃ pītapuṣpasamanvitam |
baliṃ pragṛhyatāṃ soma sarvadoṣaṃ praṇāśaya ||

odanaṃ ghṛtasaṃmiśraṃ gandhapuṣpasamanvitam |
gṛhāṇemaṃ baliṃ hṛdyaṃ bhallāṭa tvaṃ namo'stu te ||

māṣānnantu dhṛtābhyakaṃ gandhapuṣpādimaṇḍitam |
gṛhāṇemaṃ baliṃ hṛdyamargalākhya namo'stu te ||

kṣīraṃ khaṇḍasamāyuktaṃ nānāpūjopaśobhitam |
daityamātargṛhāṇemaṃ sarvadoṣaṃ praṇāśaya ||

polikāṃ madhusaṃmiśrāṃ vastragandhādisaṃyutām |
gṛhāṇemaṃ baliṃ hṛdyaṃ devamātarnamo'stu te ||

svargapātālamartyeṣu ye devā vāstusambhavāḥ |
gṛhṇantvimaṃ baliṃ hṛdyaṃ tuṣṭā yāntu svamandiram ||

mātaro bhūtavetālā ye vānye bālikāṅkṣiṇaḥ |
viṣṇoḥ pāriṣadā ye ca te'pi gṛhṇantvimaṃ balim ||

pitṛbhyaḥ kṣetrapālebhyo baliṃ dattvā prakāmataḥ |
abhāvāduktamārgasya kuśapuṣpādibhiryajet ||

prayogasāre (-) vāstuśeṣakriyābhūtaḥ sarvarakṣāvibhūtikṛt |
bhūtaprītipradaścāsmin diśābalirudīryate ||

dikpālapariṣatsarvabhūtānuddiśya nāmabhiḥ |
pūjā visarjanāntā yat sa vijñeyo diśābaliḥ ||

dadhyambu rajanī puṣpa lāja saktu tilāndhasā |
dravyeṇa vitared dikṣu baliṃ dikkramayogataḥ ||

surāṇāṃ tejasāṃ caiva pretānāṃ rakṣasāmapi |
tathā jalānāṃ prāṇānāṃ nakṣatrāṇāṃ ca tatpunaḥ ||

vidyānāmadhipānāñca tān yathoktān baliṃ haret |
savāhanapadaṃ proktvā parivārāya śaktaye ||

tatpārśvadebhyaśca tataḥ sarvebhya iti saṃyutam |
<40> bhūtebhyaśca kramād bhūyaḥ prādakṣiṇyād kṣiped balim ||

dvipatpiśācavetāla rakṣorakṣābhayārtihā |
diśābalirviśeṣeṇa sarvasampat samṛddhidaḥ ||

vāstau grahe prarohe bhūtadrohe gṛhapraveśe ca |
vitate ca śāntihome diśāṃ baliḥ siddhaye prayoktavyaḥ ||

visarjanamantrastu (-) tantrāntare (-)

yāntu devagaṇāḥ sarve pūjāmādāya pārthivīm |
iṣṭakāmaprasiddhyarthaṃ punarāgamanāya ceti ||

atrāyaṃ kramaḥ (-) vāstumaṇḍalaṃ likhitvā rajobhiḥ padāni paripūrya 
madhye'ṣṭadalakamalaṃ vakṣyamāṇarītyā nirmāya tatroktaprakāreṇa 
brahmāṇaṃ dhyātvā tattatpadeṣu tattaddevatāśca sampūjya pūrvadiśi 
kuṇḍaṃ sthaṇḍilaṃ vā nirmāya tatra 
vakṣyamāṇakrameṇāgnimupasamādhāya maṇḍalād 
brahmādidevatāstatrāvāhya brahmaṇe'ṣṭottaraśatamanyebhyo 
daśadaśāhutīrdattvā pūrṇāhutiṃ vidhāya punarmaṇḍale devānānīya tebhyo 
yathoktadravyairyathoktamantraiśca baliṃ diśābaliṃ ca vidhāya punastān 
samabhyarcya uktamantreṇa visarjayet | tataḥ ācāryāya dakṣiṇāṃ dattvā 
śiṣyastaṃ praṇamediti |

iti vāstuyāgavidhiḥ 

atha maṇḍaparacanārthaṃ pūrvādidigjñānopāyaḥ
tantrarāje (-) bhānorgatyā diśo jñātvā kuryāt karmāṇi deśikaḥ |
vāstuvaiṣamyato yatra samyag na jñāyate kakup ||

tatra śaṅkuṃ pratiṣṭhāpya jānīyācchakradiksthitim |
tadgatyā dikparijñānaṃ śṛṇu vakṣye yathāvidhi ||

susame bhūtale kṛtvā vṛttaṃ bhramaṇarūpataḥ |
tanmadhyabindau śaṅkuntu sthāpayed dvādaśāṅgulam ||

agracchāyānvayavaśād vṛtte pūrvāparadvaye |
pūrvāparāhṇayoḥ kṛtvā cihnetamabhitastathā ||

svasamānaparibhrāntyā kṛtvā vṛttadvayaṃ punaḥ |
tayoḥ saṃśleśasaṃjātamadhyadakṣottarasthite ||

sandhidvaye ca prākpratyaksūtramadhye tu vinyaset |
sūtraṃ dakṣottaraṃ teṣāmagraiḥ prāgādi kalpayet ||

<41> kriyāsāraṃ'(*?) (-) kṛtvā bhūmiṃ samāṃ tatra vṛttaṃ hastamitaṃ samam |
dvādaśāṅgulamānoccaṃ śaṅkuṃ khādiranirmitamaḥ ||

alābhe yajñavārkṣaṃ vā tatra saṃsthāpayet sudhīḥ |
tacchāyā saṃspṛśed yatra tanmadhye madhyamaṃ smṛtam ||

tiryak prasārayet sūtraṃ madhye yāmyottare smṛte |
koṇāḥ syuranye catvāraścatuḥsūtraprasāraṇāt ||

evamāśāparijñānaṃ samākhyātaṃ yathā sphuṭam |
jñātvaivaṃ maṇḍapādīni kuryāt samyag vicakṣaṇaḥ ||

maṇḍapastu trividhaḥ uttamādhamamadhyamabhedāt | taduktaṃ 
pratiṣṭhāsārasaṃgrahe(-)

svalpo dvādaśahasto'yaṃ dvidvivṛddhyā tataḥ kramāt |

somaśambhāvapi (--------------------) maṇḍapo'rkakaro'thavā |

dvihastottarayā vṛddhyā śeṣāḥ syurmaṇḍapāḥ śubhāḥ ||

mahākapilapañcarātre'pi (-)

hastāṃstu dvādaśārabhya kramād dvau dvau pravarddhya ca |

evaṃ ca (-) bhūmiśuddhiṃ vidhāyetthaṃ racayed yāgamaṇḍapam ||
navahastaṃ pañcahastaṃ trihastaṃ vā yathāmatīti ||

gautamīyatantravacanena navahastaṃ pañcahastamityanena ca caturdaśahasto 
navahastaṃ trihastamityanena ca dvādaśahasto maṇḍapa uktaḥ | tathā (-)

pañcabhiḥ saptarbhihastairnavabhirvā matāntaram |

iti śāradāyāmapi | pañcabhiḥ saptabhirityanena dvādaśahastaḥ 
pañcabhirnavabhirityanena ca caturdaśahastaḥ saptabhirnavabhirityanena ca 
ṣoḍaśahasto maṇḍapa uktaḥ | tathā (-)

acaladormitamatra tu maṇḍapaṃ masṛṇavedikamāracayet tataḥ |

iti kramadīpikāyāmapi acalānāṃ saptānāṃ dordvayaṃ tena caturdaśahastāstat 
parimitamityarthaḥ | yathāśrute kuṇḍāṣṭakavedyṛtvikpracaraṇādyanupapatteḥ | 
yat tu (-)

rājñāṃ homābhiṣekādiprayogārthaṃ tu maṇḍapam |
vidadhyānnavahastena vistārāyāmasaṃyutam ||

iti tantrarājavacanaṃ taddīkṣātiriktakarmopayuktamaṇḍapaparam | prathamārdhe 
tathaivokteḥ siddhāntaśekhare (-) sthalādarkāṅgulocchrāyaṃ 
maṇḍapasthalamīritam |
mahākapilapañcarātre tu (-)

ucchrāyo hastamānaṃ syāt susamaṃ ca suśobhanam | ityuktam |

<42> śāradāyām (-) ṣoḍaśastambhasaṃyuktaṃ catvārasteṣu madhyagā |
aṣṭahastasamucchrāyāḥ saṃsthāpyā dvādaśābhitaḥ ||

pañcahastapramāṇāste niśchidrā ṛjavaḥ śubhāḥ |
tatpañcamāṃśaṃ nikhanen medinyāṃ tantravittamaḥ ||

nārikeladalairbāhye chādayet tatsamantataḥ ||

aṣṭahasteti | idaṃ ca śoḍaśahastamaṇḍapa eva |

maṇḍapārdhocchritān vedasaṃkhyācūḍānvitāṃstathā |

iti pañcarātravacanāt | madhye bahirvā stambhaniveśanamāgneyādikrameṇa 
kāryam |

stambhocchrāye śilānyāse sūtrayojanakīlake |
khananāvaṭasaṃskāra prārambho vahnigocare ||

iti vacanāt | siddhāntaśekhare (-)

madhye stambhacatuṣkaṃ syāttanmadhye vedikā matā |
tantrāntare (-) vedikoṇeṣu vinyasya stambhān vedasvarūpakān |
pañcarātre (-) sāradārubhavān stambhān dṛḍhān kuryādṛjūn samān ||

kriyāsāre (-) yajñīyavṛkṣo veṇurvā kramukaḥ stambhakarmaṇi |
anye viśuddhavṛkṣā vā bhaveyurnānyabhūruhāḥ ||

gṛhaśalyaḥ svayaṃ śuṣkaḥ kuṭilaśca purātanaḥ |
asaumyabhūmijanitaḥ santyājyaḥ stambhakarmaṇi ||

madhyamādhamamayordvādaśastambhapramāṇaṃ tryairāśikenāneyam |

pañcamāṃśaṃ nyased bhūmau sarvasādhāraṇo vidhiḥ |

iti vāstuśāstravacanāt |

pañcamāṃśena vā khātaṃ sarveṣāṃ ca śivoditam |

iti siddhāntaśekharavacanācca khananaṃ sarvamaṇḍapastambhānāṃ 
pañcamāṃśenaiva | nārikeladalairityādyupalakṣaṇam |

kaṭaiḥ sadbhistu saṃchādyā vijayādyāstu maṇḍapāḥ |

iti vāstuśāstravacanāt | mantramuktāvalyāṃ (-)

dikṣu dvārāṇi catvāri vidadhyāt pañcamāṃśataḥ |

pañcarātre (-) kanīyasi syād dvikaraṃ caturaṅgulavṛddhitaḥ ||

madhyamottamayordvāramiti nyasyenmanoharam ||

nehastamāha(?) maṇḍapād bahirdvāreṣu toraṇacatuṣṭayaṃ kuryāt |

<43> taduktaṃ (-) maṇḍapadvārabāhye ca vedimānena dikkramāt |
plākṣamaudumbarāśvastha vaṭotthatoraṇaṃ nyaset || iti ||

somaśambhuḥ (-) plakṣodumbarakāśvatthavaṭajāstoraṇāḥ kramāt ||

pūrvādito vidhātavyā yadvādyantaviparyayaḥ |
alābhādekamevaiṣāṃ sarvāśāsu niveśayet ||

siddhāntaśekhare (-) ekamevāmalābhe syāt tadabhāve śamīdrumaḥ |
jambūkhadirasārāśca tālo vā toraṇe smṛtāḥ ||

mahākapilapañcarātre (-)

devāstoraṇarūpeṇa saṃsthitā yajñamaṇḍape |
vighnavidhvaṃsanārthaṃ ca rakṣārthaṃ tvadhvarasya ca ||

nyasennyagrodhamaindryāṃ tu yāmyāṃ codumbaraṃ tathā |
vāruṇyāṃ pippalaṃ caiva kauveryāṃ plakṣakaṃ nyaset ||

suśobhanaṃ tu pūrvasyāmṛgvedādiṣu mantritam |
iṣe tveti ca mantreṇa subhadrākhyaṃ tu dakṣiṇe ||

sukarmākhyaṃ tu vāruṇyāṃ sāmavedādikena tu |
śanno devīti mantreṇa suhotraṃ tūttare nyaset ||

śāradāyāṃ (-) dvāreṣu toraṇāni syuḥ kramāt kṣīramahīruhām |
stambhocchrāyaḥ smṛtasteṣāṃ saptahastaiḥ pṛthak pṛthak ||

daśāṅgulapramāṇena tatparīṇāha īritaḥ |
tiryak phalakamānaṃ syāt stambhamānārddhamānataḥ |
śūlāni kalpayenmadhye toraṇe hastamānataḥ ||

saptahastairityuttamamaṇḍapapakṣe | yad vāstuśāstre (-)

pañcahastapramāṇāste vistāreṇa dvihastakāḥ |
ṣaḍaṅgulādivṛddhyā tu saptahastāstathottame ||

ṣaḍaṅgulādīti | tena adhamamaṇḍape toraṇastambhayorantarālabhūmirdvihastā | 
madhyame ṣaḍaṅgulādhikadvihastā | uttame dvādaśāṅgulādhikadvihastā | 
etena maṇḍapabhedena tiryak phalakamānamapyuktaṃ bhavati | adhamottamayoḥ 
pañcasaptahastocchrāyatākathanānmadhyame ṣaḍḍhastocchrāyatoktā bhavati | 
piṅgalāmate (-)

śūlena cihnitāḥ kāryā dvāraśākhāḥ svamastake |
ṛju vai madhyaśūlaṃ syāt kiñcid vakraṃ ca pakṣayoḥ ||

<44> ubhayaṃ tatsamākhyātaṃ tryaṅgulaṃ ropayet tadā |
kriyāsāre (-) toraṇaṃ ghaṭayitvaivaṃ mūrdhni śūlatrayaṃ nyaset ||

śūle navāṅgulaṃ dairghyaṃ turīyāṃśena vistṛtiḥ |
śeṣāṇāṃ dvyaṅgulā vṛddhirveśaścāṅgulavṛddhitaḥ ||

ayañca triśūlavinyāsaḥ śaivaśāktādau | vaiṣṇave tu viśeṣo vāstuśāstre (-)

mastake dvādaśāṃśena śaṅkhacakragadāmbujam |
prāgādikramayogena nyasetteṣāṃ svadārujam ||

śāradāyāṃ (-) dikṣu dhvajānnivaghnīyāllokapālasamaprabhān |
vitānadarbhamālādyairalaṃkurvīta maṇḍapam ||

pratiṣṭhāsārasaṃgrahe (-) pītaraktādivarṇāśca pañcahastā dhvajāḥ smṛtāḥ |

dvipañcahastairdaṇḍaiste vaṃśajaiḥ saṃyutā matāḥ ||

dvipañcahastairdaśahastaiḥ | anyatrāpi (-)

pañcahastā dhvajāḥ kāryā vaikalpe tu dvihastakāḥ |
daṇḍaśca daśahastaḥ syādaṣṭadikṣu ca tān nyaset ||

hayaśīrṣapañcarātre (-) dhvajena rahite brahman maṇḍape tu vṛthā bhavet |
pūjāhomādikaṃ sarvaṃ japādyaṃ yat kṛtaṃ budhaiḥ ||

rakṣakeṇa vinā yadvat kṣetraṃ naśyati kṣetriṇaḥ |
dhvajaṃ vinā devagṛhaṃ tathā naśyeta sarvathā ||

viṣṇupāriṣadāḥ krūrāḥ kūṣmāṇḍādyāstu ye smṛtāḥ |
pūjādikaṃ tu gṛhṇanti devaṃ dṛṣṭvā na rakṣitam ||

dṛṣṭvā dhvajāṃstu devasya maṇḍape jvalanaprabhān |
naśyanti sarve te cārkaraśmikṣiptaṃ tamo yathā ||

siddhāntaśekhare (-) cūtapallavamālāḍhyaṃ vitānairupaśobhitam |
vicitravastrasaṃchannaṃ tulāstambhavibhūṣitam ||

saphalaiḥ kadalīstambhaiḥ kramukairnārikelajaiḥ |
phalairnānāvidhairbhojyairdarpaṇaiścāmarairapi ||

bhūṣitaṃ maṇḍapaṃ kuryādratnapuṣpasamujjvalam |

hayaśīrṣapañcarātre (-) darpaṇaiścāmarairghaṇṭaiḥ stambhān 
vastrairvibhūṣayet |
kalaśairghaṭikābhiśca sādhāraiḥ karkaraistathā ||

tatra pratitoraṇamekaikaḥ kalaśaḥ svājyaḥ | pratidvārapārśvaṃ dvau dvau | 
pratikoṇaṃ
<45> caikaikaḥ | taduktam (-) gandhapuṣpāmbaropetān kumbhāṃsteṣu vinikṣipet |
teṣu toraṇeṣu (*?) dhruvaṃ dharāṃ vākpatiṃ ca vighneśaṃ teṣu pūjayet |
maṇḍapasya tu koṇasthakalaśeṣu kramādamī ||

amṛto durjayaścaiva siddhārtho maṅgalastathā |
pūjyā dvārasyakumbheṣu śakrādyāstanmanūttamaiḥ ||

anyatrāpi (-) maṇḍape kalaśau dvau dvau dvāre niveśayet |
gālitodaka sampūrṇā vāmrapallavaśobhitau ||

śāradāyāṃ (-) tattribhāgamite kṣetre'ratnimātrasamucchritām |
caturasrāṃ tato vedīṃ maṇḍalāya prakalpayet ||

anyatrāpi (-) tato maṇḍapasūtraṃ tu triguṇaṃ parikalpayet |
pūrvādiṣu kramāt tasya madhyabhāgena vedikā ||

siddhāntaśekhare'pi (-) navāṃśaṃ maṇḍapaṃ kṛtvā madhyāṃśe vedikā 
matā |
aratnimātrasamucchritāṃ hastamātronnatām |
taiścatubhirbhavenmuṣṭirvitastistaistribhirguṇaiḥ |
aratnistaddvayena syāddhastastaddvayataḥ śive ||

iti tantrarājavacanenāratnihastaśabdayoḥ paryāyatokteḥ |
tatraiva (-) (......................) tattribhāgaikabhāgataḥ |
vidadhyānmadhyato vedīṃ karamātrasamunnatāmityukteśva | mantra(-)
muktāvalyāmapi (-) iṣṭakābhirmṛdā vāpi vedī darpaṇasannibhā |
rājahastocchrayā kāryā viduṣā siddhimicchatā ||

kriyāsāre'pi (-) tribhāgaṃ maṇḍalaṃ kṛtvā madhyabhāgastu vedikā |
hastamānaṃ tadutsedhaṃ caturasraṃ samaṃ yathā ||

tathā (-) vakrapārśvā klinnamadhyā parūṣā dṛgaśobhanā |
mānahīnādhikā yā sā karttuḥ karmavināśinī ||

maṇḍapānyathābhāve doṣa uktaḥ (-) kriyāsāre (-)

anuktasādhanaiḥ klapto yadi vā kuṭilākṛtiḥ |
mānādhiko'thavā nyūno maṇḍapaḥ karmanāśakaḥ ||

ākhyātasādhanaiḥ klaptaḥ śobhanaḥ samamānakaḥ |
manojño maṇḍapo yo'sau karmakarttuḥ śubhāvahaḥ ||

iti maṇḍapalakṣaṇam

<46> atha kuṇḍāni

śāradāyām (-) prāk prokte maṇḍape vidvān vedikāyā bahistridhā |
kṣetraṃ vibhajya madhyāṃśe pūrvādi parikalpayet ||

aṣṭāsvāśāsu kuṇḍāni ramyākārāṇyanukramāt |
caturasraṃ yonimardhacandraṃ tryasraṃ suvartulam ||

ṣaḍasraṃ paṅkajākāramaṣṭāsraṃ tāni nāmataḥ |
ācāryakuṇḍaṃ madhye syād gaurīpatimahendrayoḥ ||

siddhāntaśekhare (-) purandareśayormadhye vṛttaṃ vā caturasrakam |
tadācāryasya nidiṣṭamiti ||

kriyāsāre (-) vṛttaṃ vā caturasraṃ syānmadhyasthānaṃ vṛṣeśayoḥ |

atha caturasrakuṇḍam

tantrarāje (-) prāk pratyak sūtramāsphālya tanmadhye cihnakalpanam |
kṛtvā tatpūrvataḥ paścād dvādaśāṅgulamānataḥ ||

paraṃ pramṛjya tatrāpi vidadhyāccihnayugmakam |
prākpratyakcihnamānena tayorevāvalambataḥ ||

dakṣiṇottarato haṃsapade kṛtvā tatastayoḥ |
prasārya sūtraṃ taccāpi mārjayitvoktamānataḥ ||

tatastadagrāṇyālambya madhyacihnasya mānataḥ |
kuryāddhaṃsapadaṃ koṣṭhānyamitasteṣu pātayet ||

catuṣṭayaṃ tu sūtraṃ ca caturasraṃ bhavet samam |
tasminnanyāni kuṇḍāni vadāmi tava mānataḥ ||

gautamīyatantre (-) pūrvāparāyataṃ sūtraṃ hastamānaṃ prasārya ca |
tasyāgrayormatsyayugmaṃ kuryāt spaṣṭaṃ yathā bhavet ||

dvibhāgau kṛtya tatsūtraṃ pātayed dakṣiṇottaram |
tadagrayormatsyayugmaṃ kuryāt spaṣṭaṃ yathā bhavet |

caturdikṣu catuḥsūtraṃ pātayet tatpramāṇataḥ |
caturasraṃ catuḥkoṣṭhaṃ bhavedatimanoharam ||

koṇasūtradvayaṃ dadyāt pramāṇaṃ tena lakṣayet |
caturasraṃ bhavet kuṇḍaṃ sarvalakṣaṇalakṣitam ||

<47> tathā (-) anena janayet sarvakuṇḍāni manuvittamaḥ |
śāradāyāṃ (-) caturviṃśatyaṅgulāḍhya hastaṃ tantravido viduḥ |
karturdakṣiṇahastasya madhyamāṅguliparvaṇaḥ ||

madhyasya dairghyamānena mānāṅgulamudīritam |
yavānāmaṣṭabhiḥ kḷptaṃ mānāṅgulamudīritam ||

	atra bhūvadanasamāsāddha madhyamalambena saṃguṇayedityuktarītyā 
ṣaṭsaptatyadhikapañcaśatāṅgulāni hastamātrakuṇḍasya kṣetraphalaṃ 
dvihastādau taddvaiguṇyādi | ekahastakuṇḍakarṇasūtreṇa 
dvihastakuṇḍamadhyasūtram evaṃ tatkarṇasūtreṇa 
caturhastakuṇḍamadhyasūtramavagantavyam | evamagre'pi |

taduktaṃ gautamīyatantre (-)

karṇasūtrapramāṇena dvihastaṃ kuṇḍamuddharet |
sarvakuṇḍeṣu sarvatra vardhayed vidhināmunā || iti |
	
vastuta ekahastakṣetraphalaṃ dviguṇatriguṇādi kṛtvā tanmūlamānīya 
dvihastatrihastādikuṇḍamadhyasūtraparimāṇaṃ jñeyam |

khanet tattatpramāṇena guṇitena yathākramam |

	iti jñānārṇavavacanāt | guṇitājñāne 
dvihastādikuṇḍamadhyasūtraparimāṇamabhiyuktavacanād bodhyam | yathā (-)

vistārāṅgulamānamekakarato yāvad daśa syājjinā(-)
vedatrīṇi kusāgarāḥ śarayavopetā bhujaṅgāmbudhiḥ |
niṣpādāmbudhisāyakāviyavamaṅkeṣvardhayugrāmaṣaṭ(-)
nāgāṃgāniyavānidṛṅmuniyavenonāśca ṣaṭ parvatāḥ (?) ||

	evañca caturviṃśatyaṅgulānyekahastasya vyāsaḥ (24) catustriṃśad 
dvihastasya (34) ekacatvāriṃśadaṅgulāni pañcayavāśca trihastasya (41) 
aṣṭacatvāriṃśadaṅgulāni caturhastatasya (48) tripañcāśaṅgulāni ṣaḍyavāśca 
pañcahastasya (53) aṣṭapañcāśadaṅgulāni saptayavāśca ṣaḍḍhastasya (58) 
triṣaṣṭiraṅgulāni catvāro yavāśca saptahastasya (63) saptaṣaṣṭiraṅgulāni 
saptayavāścāṣṭahastasya (67) dvāsaptatiraṅgulāni navahastasya (72) 
pañcasaptatiraṅgulāni saptayavāśca daśahastasya (75) | dvihastādikuṇḍāni tu 
prayogopayuktāni prasaṅgādatroktāni dīkṣāyāmekahastakuṇḍasyaivopayogāt |

iti caturasrakuṇḍalakṣaṇam

<48> atha yonikuṇḍalakṣaṇam

tantrarātre (-) tandhyapañcamāṃśena vikāśya brahmasūtrakam |
pūrvataḥ paścimadvandvaṃ koṣṭhayormadhyadeśataḥ ||

tatkoṇamānena tathā bhrāmayet paścimāgrakān |
uttarāgrāvadhi tathā dakṣiṇāgrāvadhi priye ||

tanmadhyatiryaksūtrāgradvayāvaṣṭambhatastathā |
vikāśitabrahmasūtrāvadhi sūtradvayaṃ bhavet |
yonikuṇḍamidaṃ bhadre syāccaturṣūbhayātmasu ||

iti yonikuṇḍalakṣaṇam

athārdhacandrakuṇḍalakṣaṇam

yathā (-) catuṣkoṇe kṣetre jinalavakamadhyasthitaguṇe
vihāyādhaḥ sārddhaṃ dvayamupari tāvacca matimān |
kalāṃśenāṃśasyonitamupari tiryak kuru guṇaṃ
bhramārdhaṃ tanmānādapi śaśidalaṃ kuṇḍamiti tu ||

atrāpi tāntrikavacanāni visaṃvādikṣetraphalakāni |

ityardhacandrakuṇḍalakṣaṇam

atha trikoṇakuṇḍalakṣaṇam

kṣetrasya madhyamaguṇe jinabhāgasakte śroṇyoḥ pṛthak śaralavān parivardhya 
dhīmān | agre jināṣṭamanavena daśātha sūtraistryastritribhirbhavati kuṇḍamiha 
prayuktaiḥ ||
ityabhiyuktadiśāpi samasūtratāyāḥ abhāvaḥ | tasmādvātriṃśadaṅgulaṃ 
madhyamalambaṃ ṣaṭtriṃśadaṅgulāṃ ca bhuvaṃ vidhāya sūtratrayadānena 
trikoṇakuṇḍaṃ sampādanīyam | tena samasūtratā kṣetraphalapūrṇatā ca 
bhavatītyākalanīyam |

iti trikoṇakuṇḍalakṣaṇam

atha vṛttakuṇḍalakṣaṇam

ṣoḍaśadhā kṛtamadhyamasūtrakṣetre puraḥparivardhitakṣetrabhāge(?) |
ekaka eva tatontaracihnān maṇḍalakuṇḍamiti bhramaṇāt syāt ||
anyāni tu vacanāni visaṃvādikṣetraphalakānītyupekṣitāni |

iti vṛttakuṇḍalakṣaṇam

<49> atha ṣaṭkoṇakuṇḍalakṣaṇam

kriyāsāre (-) kṣetraṃ vasvaṃśakaṃ kṛtvā bahiḥ pārśvadvayeṃ'śakau |
nyastvā'nena pramāṇena madhyāt tulyaṃ yathā nyaset ||

koṇānyanyāni catvāri pārśvayośca dvayaṃ dvayam |
ṣaṭsūtrāṇi nyaset teṣu tat syāt ṣaṭkoṇakuṇḍakam ||

siddhāntaśekhare (-) caturasre same siddhe kṣetramaṣṭāṃśakaṃ bahiḥ |
agrayorgarbhasūtrasya yojayet tatpradeśataḥ ||

garbhamadhyapramāṇena sūtreṇa bhramayantrakam |
garbhamadhye bahirbhāge vinyasya bhramaṇād bhavet ||

uttare dakṣiṇe bāhye matsyayordvitayaṃ tataḥ |
mīne bāhyāṃśake mīne mīnayugme tataḥ kramāt |
sūtraṣaṭkaṃ nyaset tattu kuṇḍaṃ ṣaṭkoṇamīritam ||

iti ṣaṭkoṇakuṇḍalakṣaṇam

atha padmakuṇḍalalakṣaṇam

padmakuṇḍe madhyasūtraṃ caturviṃśatidhā bhajet |
bhrāmayet karṇikāvṛttaṃ tryaṃśavṛttārdhamānataḥ ||

ṣaḍaṃśavṛttārdhamāna bhramivṛtte tu keśarāḥ |
navāṃśavṛttārdhamāne vṛtte syāt patramadhyabhūḥ ||

dvādaśāṃśāt tu vṛttārdhād vṛttaṃ patrordhvabhūḥ smṛtā |
dalāgrāṇāntu vṛttārdhaṃ kṛtvā pañcadaśāṃśakaiḥ ||

nyūnaiḥ pañcabhirekāṃśaścatuḥṣaṣṭyaṃśakairbhramāt |
rekhāgrebhyaḥ patrasīmno dalāgrāṇi prakalpayet ||

	vacanāntarāṇi tu visaṃvādikṣetraphalānītyupekṣitāni | tatra karṇikā 
tryaṃṅguloccā ṣaḍaṅgulavyāsā kāryā | taduktaṃ (-) kāmike (-)

utsedhaṃ tu tataḥ kuryāt karṇikārdhāṃśamānataḥ ||

iti padmakuṇḍalakṣaṇam

athāṣṭakoṇakuṇḍalalakṣaṇam

kuṇḍe'ṣṭāsre madhyasūtraṃ caturviṃśatidhā bhajet |
ekatridaśamāṃśāḍhyaṃ hyaṃśavṛddhyā ca vartulam ||

tanmadhye dikṣvaṣṭasūtradānādaṣṭāsrakaṃ samam |
<50> vacanāntarāṇi tu visaṃvādikṣetraphalakāni 
viṣamasūtrapratipādakānītyupekṣitāni |

ityaṣṭakoṇakuṇḍalakṣaṇam

etāvatkuṇḍakaraṇāsamarthastu caturasrakuṇḍāni vṛttakuṇḍānyeva vā sarvatra 
kuryāt |
kuṇḍāni caturasrāṇi vṛttanāmākṛtīni vetyāmnāyarahasyasya śastāni tāni 
vṛttāni caturasrāṇi vā sadeti somaśambhośca vacanāt | madhyamastu 
pañcakuṇḍīpakṣaḥ | ekakuṇḍakaraṇapakṣastu kaniṣṭhaḥ | nava pañcātha 
vaikaṃ vā kartavyaṃ lakṣaṇānvitamityāmnāyarahasyavacanāt | tanniveśanamapi 
tatraivoktam vidhāne pañcakuṇḍānāmīśāne pañcamaṃ bhavediti | 
jñānaratnāvalyāmapi dikṣu vedāsravṛttāni pañcamaṃ tvīśagocaramiti |

nāradīye tu (-) yatropadiśyate kuṇḍacatuṣkaṃ tatra karmaṇi |
vedāsramardhacandraṃ ca vṛttaṃ padmanibhaṃ tathā ||

kuryāt kuṇḍāni catvāri prācyādiṣu vicakṣaṇaḥ |
pañcamaṃ kārayet kuṇḍamīśadiggocaraṃ dvija ||

ityuktam | ekakuṇḍapakṣe niveśanamuktamācāryaiḥ (-)

athavā diśi kuṇḍamuttarasyāṃ pravidadhyāccaturasramekameveti |

somaśambhunā tu (-) ekaṃ vā śivakāṣṭhāyāṃ pratīcyāṃ kārayed budhaḥ |

ityuktam | etacca kuṇḍaṃ caturasraṃ vṛttaṃ vā kāryam | taduktaṃ kriyāsāre(-)

caturasraṃ bhavet kuṇḍaṃ vṛttaṃ kuṇḍamathāpi vā |
sthirārcane carārcāyāṃ nitye havanakarmaṇīti ||

piṅgalāmate'pi (-) kuṇḍamekakaraṃ vṛttaṃ mekhalākaṇṭhanābhimat |
nitye karmaṇi dīkṣāyāṃ śāntau puṣṭau mataṃ śubhamiti ||

atha khātam

śāradāyāṃ yāvān kuṇḍasya vistāraḥ khananaṃ tāvadīritam |
prayogasāra divyasārasvatayorapi(-)

caturasraṃ catuḥkoṣṭhaṃ sūtraiḥ kṛtvā yathā purā |
hastamānena tanmadhye tāvannimnāyataṃ khanet ||

gaṇeśvaravimarśiṇyām (-)

caturviṃśāṅgulāyāmaṃ tāvat khātasamanvitam |

yattu (-) hastamātraṃ khanet tiryagūrdhvaṃ mekhalayā saheti mohaśūre vyāsāt 
khātaḥ karaḥ prokto nimnaṃ tithyaṅgulena tviti viśvakarmaṇi kuṇḍaṃ 
jināṅgulaistiryagūrdhvaṃ mekhalayā saheti prathamatantre khātaṃ 
kuṇḍapramāṇaṃ syādūrdhvaṃ mekhalayā saheti
<51> siddhāntaśekhare ca proktaṃ tattu svalpatarahomaviṣayaṃ 
sukumāramālasyādipuṣpahāmaviṣayaṃ cetyevadhyeyam | gautamīye(-)

tataḥ kuṇḍaṃ khanenmantrī yathāśāstravidhānataḥ |
tyaktvā sarpasya gātraṃ ca śirodeśaṃ prayatnataḥ ||

śiroghāte bhavenmṛtyuḥ piṇḍeṣu piṇḍaghātanam |
pucche tu duḥkhasambhūtaṃ kroḍe sarvārthasādhanam ||

nāgaśira ādinirṇayastantrāntare (-)

vāstupramāṇena tu gātrakeṇa vāmena śete khalu nityakālam |
tribhistu māsaiḥ parivṛttya bhūmau taṃ vāstunāgaṃ pravadanti siddhāḥ ||

bhādrādike vāsavadikśirāḥ syānmārgādikeṣu triṣu yāmyamūrdhā | 
pratyakśirā syāt khalu phālgunādau jyeṣṭhādi kauveraśirāḥ sa nāgaḥ ||

atha kaṇṭhamānam

mahākapilapañcarātre (-)

caturviṃśatibhāgena kaṇṭho vai parikīrtitaḥ |
khātād bāhye'ṅgulaḥ kaṇṭhaḥ sarvakuṇḍeṣvayaṃ vidhiḥ ||
caturviṃśatimaṃ bhāgamaṅgalaṃ parikalpayet |

atha mekhalā

piṅgalāmate (-) khātādekāṅgulaṃ muktvā mekhalānāṃ sthitirbhavet |
śāradāyām (-) kuṇḍānāṃ yādṛśaṃ rūpaṃ mekhalāñca tādṛśam ||

vāyavīyasaṃhitāyāṃ (-)

mekhalānāṃ trayaṃ vāpi dvayamekamathāpi vā |
kriyāsāre (-) nābhiyonisamāyuktaṃ kuṇḍaṃ śreṣṭhaṃ trimekhalam |
kuṇḍaṃ dvimekhalaṃ madhyaṃ nīcaṃ syādekamekhalam ||

somaśambhau (-) trimekhalaṃ dvije kuṇḍaṃ kṣatriyasya dvimekhalam |
mekhalaikā tu vaiśyasveti |
tatraiva (-) kuṇḍānāṃ yaścaturviṃśo bhāgaḥ so'ṅgulasaṃjñakaḥ |
vibhajyānena kartavyā mekhalākaṇṭhanābhayaḥ ||

mahākapilapañcarātre (-)

kuṇṭhaṣaḍbhāgikā tvādyā dvitīyāṣṭāṃśakā smṛtā |
tṛtīyā dvādaśāṃśā syāditi |
<52> yoginīhṛdaye (-) mekhalā śṛṇu me devi hastādiṣu viśeṣataḥ |
ṣaḍnāgarkāṃśasaṃbhāgairmitāḥ syurgopitāḥ śubhāḥ ||

tantrāntare (-) yā yā tu mekhalā pūrvā sā sā bhūmirudāhṛtā |
atra bāhyamārabhya pūrvatvaṃ bodhyam | kriyāsāre (-)

pradhānamekhalotsedhamuktamatra navāṅgulam |
tadbāhyamekhalotsedhaṃ pañcāṅgulamiti smṛtam ||

tadbāhyamekhalotsedhamaṅguladvitayaṃ kramāt |
catustridvyaṅgulo vyāso mekhalātritayānvitaḥ ||

atroccatoktirmūlabhūmimavadhīkṛtya | lakṣaṇasaṃgrahe (-)

prathamā dvyaṅgulāyāmā unnatā sā navāṅgulaiḥ |
madhyamā tryaṅgulā bāhye tṛtīyā tu yamāṅgulaiḥ ||

yattu (-) satvapūrvakaguṇānvitāḥ kramād dvādaśāṣṭacaturaṅgulocchritāḥ |
sarvato'ṅgulacatuṣkavistṛtā mekhalāḥ sakalasiddhidā matā ||

ityācāryairuktam | tatphalaviśeṣaparam | ata eva (-)

prathamā mekhalā tatra dvādaśāṅgulavistṛtā |
caturbhiraṅgulaistasyāśconnatiśca samantataḥ ||

tasyāścopari vapraḥ syāccaturaṅgulamunnataḥ |
aṣṭābhiraṅgulaiḥ samyag vistīrṇaṃ tu samantataḥ ||

tasyopari punaḥ kāryo vapraḥ so'pi tṛtīyakaḥ |
caturaṅgulavistīrṇaśconnataśca tathāvidhaḥ ||

iti vaśiṣṭhasaṃhitāpi tathaiva | yacca (-)

vyāse caturviṃśatidhā vibhājite tisraścatustrīkṣaṇabhāgavistṛtāḥ |
samantataḥ kaṇṭhabahistu mekhalā navarturāmāṃśakatuṅgatā matāḥ ||

vistāratulyonnatayastu kaiściduktā imāḥ kenacidarkabhāgai(-)
rādyoccatoktā parayostu nāgavedāṃśamānā vidadhe krameṇa ||

iti vājayeyibhiruktam(,) tattu pramāṇābhāvādupekṣaṇīyam | gautamīye (-)

sāttvikī mekhalā pūrvā dvitīyā rājasī smṛtā |
tṛtīyā tāmasī jñeyā ityuktaṃ kuṇḍalakṣaṇam ||

pañcamekhalāpakṣe tanmānamuktaṃ lakṣaṇasaṃgrahe (-)

mekhalāḥ pañca vai kāryāḥ ṣaḍpañcābdhitripakṣakaiḥ |

<53> siddhāntaśekhare'pi (-)

ṣaḍbāṇābdhivahninetramitāḥ syuḥ pañca mekhalāḥ ||

dvimekhalāpakṣe tantrāntare (-)

ṣaṣṭhāṃśenā'ṣṭamāṃśena mekhalādvitayaṃ matam |

ekamekhalāpakṣe piṅgalāmate (-)

ekā ṣaḍaṅgulotsedha vistārā mekhalā matā |

mahākapilapañcarātre'pi (-)

sā caturthāṃśavistārā mekhalaikā'thavā smṛtā |
prathamatantre'pi (-) kaṇṭhāṅgulād bahiḥ kāryā mekhalaikā ṣaḍaṅgulā |

sidhāntaśekhare'pi (-)

kuṇḍānāṃ mekhalāṃ kuryādekāṃ cet ṣaḍbhiraṅgulaiḥ ||

atha yonilakṣaṇam

śāradāyāṃ (-) hoturagre yonirāsāmuparyaśvatthapatravat |
somaśambhau (-) tāsāmupari yoniḥ syānmadhye'śvatthadalākṛtiḥ |
svāyambhuve (-) prāgagniyāmyakuṇḍānāṃ proktā yonirudaṅmukhā |
pūrvā mukhāḥ smṛtāḥ śeṣā yathāśobhaṃ vyavasthitāḥ ||

tryailokyasāre'pi (-)

dakṣiṇasthā pūrvayāmye jalasthā paścimottare |
navamasyāpi kuṇḍasya yonirdakṣadalasthitā ||

svāyambhuve (-) mekhalā madhyato yoniḥ kuṇḍārddhatryaṃśavistṛtā |
aṅguṣṭhamānoṣṭhakaṇṭhī kāryā'śvatthadalākṛtiḥ ||

siddhāntaśekhare'pi (-)

dīrghārkaparvabhiryonirvistāreṇā'ṣṭakāṅgulā |
unnatirdvayaṃgulenā'syā (----------------) ||

prayogasāre'pi (-) tribhāgāṃ madhyato yonimāyāme dvādaśāṅgulām |
dvādaśāṃśocchritāṃ kuryāt kiñcit kuṇḍaniveśinīm ||

evañca (-) muṣṭyaratnekahastānāṃ kuṇḍānāṃ yonirīritā |
ṣaṭcaturdvyaṅgulāyāma vistāronnatiśālinīti ||

iti śāradāvacanaṃ (-)

tatṣaḍaṅgulamāyāmaṃ vistāraṃ caturaṅgulāmeti |
<54> kriyāsāravacanaṃ caikamekhalapakṣa iti rāghavabhaṭṭāḥ | vastutastu 
ṣaṭcaturdvyaṃguleti samuccitamevāyāmādiṣvanveti | taduktaṃ pañcarātre (-)

arkāṅgulocchrayāṃ yoniṃ vidadhyāt tāvadāyatām |
anyatrāpi (-) utsedhāyāmatastulyā yoniḥ syādvā daśāṅgulā |
idamapi vaśiṣṭhasaṃhitāyāmuktaṃ sthūlamekhalāpakṣe | nāradīye tu (-)

kuṇḍatryaṃśena vistāro yonerucchrāyato'ṅgulā |
kuṇḍārdhena tu dīrghā syādityekāṅgulatoccatā ||

uktā | tryailokyasāre'pi (-)

dairghyāt sūryāṅgulā yonistryaṃśonā vistareṇa tu |
ekāṅgulocchritā sā tviti |

piṅgalāmate'pi (-) vistāro'ṣṭāṅgulo yonerucchrāyo'ṅgulasammitaḥ |
aṣṭāṅgulavistāratvaṃ cādibhāge (-) agre saṅkucitatvādaśvatthapatravadityukteḥ 
|
tryailokyasāre (-------------------)praviṣṭābhyantare tathā |
kumbhadvayasamāyuktā cāśvatthadalavanmatā ||

vāyavīyasaṃhitāyāmapi (-)

mekhalāṃ madhyataḥ kuryāt paścime dakṣiṇe'pi vā |
śobhanāṃ madhyataḥ kiñcinnimnāmunmūlikāṃ śanaiḥ ||

agreṇa kuṇḍābhimukhīṃ kiñcidutsṛṣṭamekhalām |
śāradāyāṃ (-) ekāṅgulaṃ tu yonyagraṃ kuryādīṣadadhomukham |
atraikāṃśena vistāronnatiśālinī yonyupari parito nemirapi kāryā | taduktaṃ 
rāmavājapeyinā (-) kuṇḍaṃ vyāsadalāyatā'tha vitatā tryaṃśena tuṅgā catu(-)
rviṃśāṃśena ca tāvatā paridhinā yoniḥ samantād yutā |
tāvanmānanijāgrakeṇa viśatī kuṇḍāntare'ntarvilā
sā'dhovṛttadaladvayena rucirā cāśvatthapatrākṛtiriti ||

antarvileti | yathā śrutighṛtadhāraṇārthaṃ vilamevaṃ vilavatītyarthaḥ | 
adhovṛtteti |
mūlabhāge kumbhākāravṛttārdhadvayayutetyarthaḥ |

atha nālam

śāradāyāṃ (-) sthalādārabhya nālaṃ syād yonyā madhye sarandhrakam |
pañcarātre'pi (-) sthalādārabhya nālaṃ syād bāhyamekhalayā sabham ||

<55> prayogasāre tu (-) yonyāḥ paścimato nālamāyāme caturaṅgulam |
tridvyekāṅgulavistāraṃ kramānnyūnāgramiṣyate || ityuktam |

caturaṅgulatotsedha vistārā bāhyamekhalā |
salagnā caturasrā nālamūle vediḥ kāryeti sampradāyaḥ |

atha nābhilakṣaṇam

śāradāyām (-) kuṇḍānāṃ kalpayedantarnābhimambujasannibham |
tattatkuṇḍānurūpaṃ vā mānamasya nigadyate ||

muṣṭyaratnyekahastānāṃ nābhirutsedhatārataḥ |
dvitrivedāṅgulopetā kuṇḍeṣvanyeṣu vardhayet ||

yavadvayakrameṇaiva nābhiṃ pṛthagudāradhīḥ |

rāmavājapeyinā tu sarvakuṇḍānugatamekameva lakṣaṇamuktam (-)

kuṇḍārkāṃśastuṅgutāyāṃ dvinighnaḥ savyāsā syāddhīmatā kalpanīyaḥ |
śāradāyāṃ (-) tvalpāntaratvāt sthūladṛṣṭyoktam |
śāradāyāṃ (-) yonikuṇḍe yonimabjakuṇḍe nābhiṃ vivarjayet |
śāradāyām (-) nityaṃ naimittikaṃ kāmyaṃ sthaṇḍile vā samācaret |
aṅgulotsedhasaṃyuktaṃ caturasraṃ samantataḥ ||

candrapīṭhe (-) trirasraṃ caturasraṃ ca vitastyucchrāyasaṃmitam |
sikatādyairvidhātavyaṃ sthaṇḍilaṃ hastamātrakam |
dviraṅgulocchrīto vapraḥ prathamaḥ parikīrtitaḥ ||

dvyaṅgulocchrāyasaṃyuktaṃ vaprabhūmimathopari |
dvyaṅgulastatra vistāraḥ sarveṣāṃ kathito budhaiḥ ||

homādhike tatraiva (-) sārdhadviguṇitā vāpi karaṇīṃ sthaṇḍilaṃ tathā | ityuktam 
|

atha sruglakṣaṇam

śāradāyām (-) prakalpayet srucaṃ yāge vakṣyamāṇena vartmanā |
śrīparṇī śiṃśapākṣīraśākhiṣvekatamaṃ guruḥ ||

gṛhītvā vibhajeddhastamātraṃ ṣaṭtriṃśatā punaḥ |
viṃśatyaṃśairbhaved daṇḍo vedistairaṣṭabhirbhavet ||

ekāṃśena mitaḥ kaṇṭhaḥ saptabhāgamitaṃ mukham |
veditryaṃśena vistāraḥ kaṇṭhasya parikīrtitaḥ ||

<56> agraṃ kaṇṭhasamānaṃ syānmukha bhāgaṃ prakalpayat |
kaniṣṭhāṅgulimānena sarpiṣo nirgamāya ca ||

vedimadhye vidhātavyā bhāgenaikena karṇikā |
vidadhīta bahistasyā ekāṃśenā'bhito'vaṭam ||

tasya khātaṃ tribhirbhāgairvṛttamaṣṭāṃśato bahiḥ |
aṃśenaikena parito dalāni parikalpayet ||

mekhalā mukhavedyoḥ svānnemirarddhāṃśamānataḥ |
daṇḍamūlāgrayoḥ kumbhau guṇavedāṅgulaiḥ kramāt ||

gaṇḍīyugaṃ yamāṃśaiḥ syāddaṇḍasyānāha īritaḥ |
ṣaḍbhiraṃśaiḥ pṛṣṭhabhāgo vedyāḥ kūrmākṛtirbhavet ||

haṃsasya vā haṃsino vā potriṇo vā likhenmukham |
mukhasya pṛṣṭhabhāge'syāḥ saṃproktaṃ lakṣaṇaṃ sucaḥ ||

śrīparṇī gāmbhārī | kṣīraśākhinaḥ aśvatthodumbaravaṭaplakṣāḥ |
phetkārītantre (-) kāraskareṇāmalakīpalāśakhadirairapi |
suvaṇarūpyatāmrairvā ayobhirapi kārayet |

vāyavīyaṃsaṃhitāyāṃ (-)

sruksruvau taijasau grāhyau na kāṃsyāyasasīsakau |
yajñadārumayau vāpi tāntrikaiḥ śilpisaṃmatau ||

parṇe vā brahmavṛkṣāderacchidre madhya ucchrite |
atrāyase vidhiniṣedhau krūrasaumya karmaviṣayau | taduktaṃ tantrāntare (-)

sauvarṇau sruksruvau syātāṃ saumyakarmaṇi sarvataḥ |
bhavetāmāyasāvetau stambhanādiṣu karmasu ||

anyatrāpi (-) tadalābhe palāśasya parṇābhyāṃ hūyate haviḥ |
vaśiṣṭhasaṃhitāyāmapi (-)

palāśapatre niśchidre rucire sruksruvau matau |
viddhyād vāśvatthapatre saṃkṣipte homakarmaṇi ||

hastamātramiti bāhumātramityarthaḥ |

srucaṃ bāhupramāṇena homārthaṃ vidadhīta vai |

ityagastyasaṃhitāvacanāt | ṣaṭtriṃśadaṅgulā sruk syāditi 
phetkāriṇīvacanācca | vedītryaṃśena vedītṛtīyabhāgena natvaṃśatrayeṇa 
vedīpadavaiparyāpateḥ | atra dalānāṃ

<57> khananaṃ nāsti pramāṇābhāvāt | sruvamadhikṛtyaiva mantramuktāvalyām (-)

kaṇṭhādhaḥ kārayenmārgaṃ vidvānājyasya nirgame |
vedhaṃ ca mukhataḥ kuryāt taptalohaśalākayā ||

vaśiṣṭhasaṃhitāyāṃ (-) śuṣiraṃ kaṇṭhadeśe syāt viśed yāvat kanīyasī |

atha sruvalakṣaṇam

śāradāyām (-) srucaścaturviṃśatibhirbhāgairāracayet sruvam |
dvāviṃśatyā daṇḍamānamaṃśairetasya kīrtitam ||

caturbhiraṃśairānāhaḥ karṣājyagrāhi tacchiraḥ |
aṃśadvayena nikhanet paṅke mṛgapadākṛti ||

daṇḍamūlāgrayorgaṇḍī bhavet kaṅkaṇabhūṣitā |
sruvasya vidhirākhyāta iti |

gaṇḍī kalaśaḥ | mūlāgrayoḥ kārayed dvau kumbhau cātimanoharāviti 
mantramuktā valīvacanāt |

athāṅkurārpaṇam

śāradāyām (-) prāgeva dīkṣādivasāt saptabhirvidhivad dinaiḥ |
sarvamaṅgalasampattyai vidadhyādaṅkurārpaṇam ||

siddhāntaśekhare (-)

pratiṣṭhāyāṃ ca dīkṣāyāṃ svapane cotsave tathā |
saṃprokṣaṇe ca śāntyarthaṃ vivāhe mauñjibandhane ||

sarvamaṅgalakāryeṣu kārayedaṅkurārpaṇam |
pratiṣṭhādivasāt pūrvaṃ navame saptame dine ||

pañcame vā tṛtīye vā sadyo vā cāṅkurārpaṇam |
mahākapilapañcarātre'pi (-)

puṇyāhaghoṣaṇaṃ kṛtvā brāhmaṇaiḥ saha deśikaḥ |
maṅgalāṅkurasaṃropaṃ kuryāt tatraiva cāhani ||

saptamānnavamād vāpi prāgeva yajñakarmaṇaḥ |

tantrāntare'pi (-) śastayāgadivasāt tu purastāt saptame'hani śubhe navame ca |
pañcame'tha sudine sumuhūrte maṅgalāṅkuravidhiṃ vidadhīta ||

anyatrāpi (-) gururviśuddhaḥ prāgeva śuddhāhāt saptame'hani |
<58> saṅkalpyopoṣya kartavyamaṅkurāropaṇaṃ śubham ||

kuryānāndīmukhaṃ śrādhaṃ pūrvedyuḥ svastivācanam |
svagṛhyoktaprakāreṇa tadetad vidadhīta vai ||

saṃhitāyāmapi (-) sarvatrābhyudayaśrāddhamaṅkurotpādanaṃ tathā |
ādāveva prakurvīta karmaṇo'bhyudayātmanaḥ ||

śāradāyām (-) maṇḍapasyottare bhāge śālāṃ pūrvāparāyatām |
gūḍhāṃ kuryāt tatastasyāṃ maṇḍalaṃ racayet sudhīḥ ||

iyañca dakṣiṇaikadvāravatī jñeyā | tathā (-)

pañcahastapramāṇāni pañcasūtrāṇi pātayet |
pūrvāparāyatānyeṣāmantaraṃ dvādaśāṅgulam ||

dakṣiṇottarasūtrāṇi tadvadekādaśā'rpayet |
padāni tatra jāyante catvāriṃśat pramārjayet ||

paṅktayā vīthīścatasrontaścatuṣkobhayapārśvayoḥ |
vīthayau dve ca catuḥkoṣṭhatrayamatrā'vaśiṣyate ||

prayogasāre'pi (-)

prasāryāsphoṭayet sūtraṃ yathā yāmyottarāyatam |
pañcahastapramāṇena dve dve pārśve ca pātayet ||

tadvat pūrvoktamānena dvādaśadvādaśāṅgule |
prāk pratyak ca samaṃ paścāt sūtrāṇyekādaśa kramāt ||

pātayet tāsu rekhāsu pūrvasūtrāntarāntaram |

śāradāyām (-) padāni rañjayet tāni śvetapītāruṇāsitaiḥ |
rajobhiḥ śyāmalenā'tha vīthīrāpūrayet sudhīḥ ||

prapañcasāre tu (-) pītāraktasitāsitaṃ pratipadaṃ vahnyādiśarvāntakamiti 
rañjanakramo'pyuktaḥ | śāradāyām (-)

pātrāṇi trividhānyāhuraṅkurārpaṇakarmasu |
pālikāḥ pañcamukhyaśca śarāvāśva catuḥ kramāt ||

proktāḥ syuḥ sarvatantrajñairharibrahmaśivātmakāḥ |
eṣāmucchrāya unneyaḥ ṣoḍaśadvādaśāṣṭabhiḥ ||

aṅgulaiḥ kramaśastāni śubhānyāveṣṭya tantunā |
prakṣālya deśikasteṣu padeṣvāhitaśāliṣu ||

<59> sagandhadarbhakūrceṣu paścimādi niveśayet |

mahākapilapañcarātre (-)

pālikāvaktravistāraḥ ṣoḍaśāṅgula ucyate |
bhavet kaṇṭhavilaṃ vā syāt tadaṣṭāṅgulavistṛtam ||

pādapīṭhasya vistāraṃ ṣaḍaṅgulamudāhṛtam |
caturaṅgula utsedhastatsandhiścāṅgulaṃ bhavet ||

tatsandhestu bhavennāhaṃ pādapīṭhārdvameva ca |
bhavet pañcamukhī caivaṃ ghaṭikā sarvakāmadā ||

caturaṅgulavistārāṇyāhurvaktrāṇi pañca vai |
catvāri ca caturdikṣu ūrdhvamekaṃ yathāvidhi ||

ghaṭikāyāmavistāro dvādaśāṅgula ucyate |
ācāryā kathayantyeke ṣoḍaśāṅgulameva ca ||

dvādaśāṅgulavistāraṃ śarāvasya mukhaṃ smṛtam |
caturaṅgulavistāramadhastānmūlamucyate ||

anyatrāpi (-) tālamātramiha pañcamukhī syād vyāsatocchrayamitā ghaṭikā syāt |
dikṣu tanmukhacatuṣṭayamekaṃ madhyatastu samavartitabhāgam ||

tālavistṛtamukhaṃ tu śarāvaṃ vyāsato cchrayagatārdhamitāṅghri |
daṇḍamasya caturaṅgulanāhaṃ kaṇṭhamasya vilavarjamudagram |
sambhave kanakarūpyatāmroto mārtikānyabhinavānyathavā syuḥ ||

prayogasāre(-------------------------) teṣu pātrāṇi vinyaset |

vahnyādīśānaparyantaṃ catuṣkeṣu pṛthak pṛthak ||

sārasvatamate (-) prokteṣu teṣu pātreṣu brahmaviṣṇuśivān yajet |
siddhāntaśekhare'pi (-)

saṃpūjayeccharāveṣu rudraṃ candanapuṣpakaiḥ |
pālikāsu tathā viṣṇuṃ brahmāṇaṃ ghaṭikāsu ca ||

śāradāyām (-) karīṣabālukāmṛdbhistāni pātrāṇi pūrayet |
prayogasāre (-) mṛdbālukākarīṣaiścordhvataḥ pātrāṇi pūrayet |
mṛttikāyāṃ viśeṣaḥ siddhāntaśekhare (-)

gandhādibhiśca kuddālaṃ pūjayitvā dināntare |
<60> gurvādayo rathārūḍhā gajārūḍhāstathā'para |
gatvā tīraṃ taḍāgasya nadyāḥ puṣpavanasya vā ||

tatra śuddhaṃ bhuvo bhāgaṃ darbhaiḥ saṃmṛjya cāstrataḥ |
abhyukṣya cārghatoyena tattanmantramanusmaran ||

hṛdā bhūmiṃ samāvāhya gandhapuṣpaiḥ samarcayet |
kuddālīmastramantreṇa khātvā bhūmimatho mṛdam ||

gṛhitvā vāmadevena pūrayet kāṃsyapātrake |
hṛdā mṛdaṃ ca saṃmṛjya vastreṇācchādya dhārayet ||

puraṃ vā nilayaṃ vāpi sarvamaṅgalaniḥsvanaiḥ |
guruḥ pradakṣiṇaṃ kṛtvā maṇḍapaṃ tvānayet tataḥ ||

etat karma divākāle kuryādrātrau na buddhimān |
śāradāyām (-) sudhābījena bījāni dugdhaiḥ prakṣālya tantravit |
mūlamantrābhijaptāni pañcaghoṣapuraḥsaram ||

āśīrvāgbhirdvijātīnāṃ maṅgalācārapūrvakam |
nirvapet teṣu pātreṣu deśiko yatamānasaḥ ||

sārasvatamate tu (-)

bījāni tāni prakṣālya jalaiḥ kṣīreṇa ca kramāt |

iti prathamato jalena prakṣālanamuktam | siddhāntaśekhare (-)

bījamukhyena mūlena prāṅmukho vā'pyudaṅmukhaḥ |
vāpayet sarvabījāni pālikādiṣvanukramāt ||

bījānāmadhipaḥ somastasmādrātrau tu nirvapet |
bījamukhyeneti | bījaṃ bījākṣaraṃ mukhyamādau yasya tenetyarthaḥ | 
sārasvatamate (-)

bījebhyo daivatebhyaśca sa rātrau kāntimān yataḥ |
tasmād gurustu bījāni niśāyāmeva vāpayet ||

śāradāyām (-) śālīśyāmāḍhakīmudga tilaniṣpāvasarṣapāḥ |
kulatthakaṅgumāṣāśca bījānyaṅkurakarmaṇi ||

sārasvate (-) skandaṃ priyaṅgau niṣpāve vāyumagniṃ kulatthake |
āḍhakyāṃ ni(-)ṛtiṃ somaṃ mudge vaivasvataṃ tile ||

prajāpatiṃ śālībīje tvanantaṃ sarṣape'rcayet |
indraṃ śyāme tu māse ca varuṇaṃ tu nagātmaje |
<61> siddhāntaśekhare (-) somaṃ saṃpūjayennityamadhivāsadināvadhi |
adhivāsadine prāpte somamudvāsayed guruḥ ||

prayogasāre (-) tryambakāya ca śarvāya śaṅkarāya śivāya ca |
sarvalokapradhānāya śāśvatāya namo namaḥ ||

vikīryā'nena mantreṇa haridrācūrṇamiśritam |
toyaṃ pravarṣayet teṣu siñcet toyairdinaṃ prati ||

śāradāyām (-) haridrādbhiḥ samabhukṣya vastrairācchādya deśikaḥ |
baliṃ trividhapātrāṇāṃ dikṣu pūvāditaḥ kṣipet ||

praṇavādyairnamo'ntaiśca rātrau rātrīśanāmabhiḥ |

vastrairiti bahuvacanaṃ kapiñjalādhikaraṇanyāyena tritvaparam | tena catuṣṭayaṃ 
catuṣṭayamekaikena vastreṇācchādayediti phalitam | tathā (-)

bhūtāni pitaro yakṣā nāgā brahmā śivo hariḥ |
saptānāmapi rātrīṇāṃ devatāḥ samudīritāḥ ||

bhūtebhyaḥ syurlājatila haridrādadhisaktavaḥ |
sānnāḥ pitṛbhyaḥ satilāstaṇḍulāḥ parikīrtitāḥ |
karambhalājā yakṣebhyo nārikekodakānvitāḥ |
saktupiṣṭaṃ ca nāgebhyo brahmaṇe paṅkajākṣatam ||

sāpūpamannaṃ śarvāya viṣṇave syād guḍaudanam |

navarātrapakṣe (-) vaiṣṇavaṃ ca daugdhānnam | kṛśaraṃ ca vaiṣṇaveyaṃ yadi 
navarātraṃ krameṇa baliruktaḥ || ityācāryairuktam | idaṃ cādyadinadvaye 
bodhyam | pañcadinapakṣe yakṣamārabhya dinatrayapakṣe brahmāṇamārabhya 
baliḥ | śāradāyām (-)

tato lokeścarebhyo'pi vidhivad vitared balim |
sārasvatamate (-) prarūḍhānyaṅkarāṇyanyo na vīkṣeta kadācana |
ācārya eva praviśet tacchiṣyo vā tadājñayā ||

siddhāntaśekhare (-)

yajamānābhivṛddhyarthamaṅkurāṇi parīkṣayet |
samyagūrdhvaṃ prarūḍhāni komalāni sitāni ca |
dhūmravarṇānyapūrṇāni tathā tiryaggatāni ca ||

śyāmalāni ca kubjāni varjayedaśubhāni ca |
<62> apūrṇa jananāśaṃ ca durbhikṣaṃ śyāmalāṅkuram |
tiryaggate bhavet vyādhiḥ kubje śatrubhayaṃ bhavet ||

aśubhe cāṅkure jāte śāntihomaṃ samācaret |
mūlamantreṇa juhuyād gururmūrtidharaiḥ saha ||

aghorāstreṇa cāstreṇa śataṃ vātha sahasrakam |
sārasvatamate (-) prarūḍhairaṅkuraiḥ karturnirdiśecca śubhāśubham |
śyāmaiḥ kṛṣṇairaṅkurairarthahānistiryagrūḍhairvyādhirāndolitaistaiḥ
kubjairduḥkhaṃ duṣprarūḍhairmṛtiñca rogā bhugnaiḥ sthānadeśeṣṭahāniḥ ||
aṅkurārpaṇalakṣaṇaṃ samāptam

[iti mahāmahopādhyāya ṭhakkura śrīnarasiṃha viracite tārābhakti sudhārṇave 
dvitīyastaraṅgaḥ] || 2 ||



[tṛtīyastaraṅgaḥ]

atha dīkṣā


śāradāyām (-) caturvidhā sā sandiṣṭā kriyāvatyādibhedataḥ |
kriyāvatī varṇamayī kalātmā vedhamayyapi ||

tāḥ krameṇaiva kathyante tantre'smin sampadāvahāḥ |
deśiko vidhivat snātvā kṛtvā paurvāhnikīḥ kriyāḥ ||

yāyādalaṃkṛto maunī yāgārthaṃ yāgamaṇḍapam |
gautamīye (-) śiṣyaḥ snātaḥ suveśaśca sarvadravyasamanvitaḥ ||

ācāryaṃ vṛṇuyād bhaktyā vastrālaṅkārabhūṣaṇaiḥ ||

kuryānnāndīmukhaṃ śrāddhaṃ brāhmaṇān paritoṣayet |
gomūhiraṇyavastrādyaistoṣayed gurumātmanaḥ ||

yathā dadāti santuṣṭaḥ prasanno varado manum |
tathā (-) ṛtvijaṃ vṛṇuyāt tatra daśapañcadvayaṃ tathā |
yāmale (-) tata ācamanaṃ kṛtvā śiṣyo'pi vijitendriyaḥ |
ājanmapāpanāśārthamutsṛjet tilakāñcanam ||

śāradāyām (-) gurumupakramya (-)

ācamya vidhinā tatra sāmānyārghyaṃ vidhāya ca |
dvāramastrāmbubhiḥ prokṣya dvārapūjāṃ samācaret ||

snānasandhyātarpaṇadvārapūjādikaṃ nityācanataraṅge vakṣyate | tathā (-)

kiñcit spṛśan vāmaśākhāṃ dehalīṃ laṅghayed guruḥ |
aṅgaṃ saṃkocayanantaḥ praviśed dakṣiṇāṅghriṇā ||

nairṛtyāṃ diśi vāstvīśaṃ brahmāṇaṃ ca samarcayet |
pañcagavyārghyatoyābhyāṃ prokṣayed yāgamaṇḍapam ||

catuṣpathāntaṃ tacchuddhiṃ vidadhyād vīkṣaṇādibhiḥ |
vīkṣaṇaṃ mūlamantreṇa śareṇa prokṣaṇaṃ matam ||

tenaiva tāḍanaṃ kuryād varmaṇā'bhyukṣaṇaṃ matam |
candanāgurukarpūrairdhūpayedantaraṃ sudhīḥ ||

<64> vikirān vikiret tatra saptajaptāṃścharāṇunā |
lājacandanasidhārtha bhasmadūrvāṅkurākṣatāḥ ||

vikirā iti sandiṣṭāḥ sarvavighnoghanāśakāḥ ||

astrajaptena darbhāṇāṃ muṣṭinā mārjayecca tān |
īśasya diśi vardhanyā āsanāya prakalpayet ||

somaśambhau tu (-)

vikirān śuddhalājān vā saptaśastrābhimantritān |
astrāmbuprokṣitānetān kavacenā'vaguṇṭhitān ||

nānāpraharaṇākārān vighnaughavinivārakān |
darbhāṇāṃ tālamānena kṛtān ṣaṭtriṃśatā dalaiḥ ||

saptajaptāṃcchivāstreṇa muṣṭiṃ rodhaya sattama || ityuktam |
śāradāyām (-) puṣpāhaṃ vācayitvā tu brāhmaṇān paritoṣya ca |
ukteṣu maṇḍaleṣvekaṃ vedikāyāṃ samālikhet ||

maṇḍalaṃ sarvatobhadrādi | sarvatobhadramaṇḍalaṃ yathā śāradāyām (-)

caturasre catuṣkoṣṭhe karṇasūtrasamanvite |
caturṣvapi ca koṣṭheṣu koṇasūtracatuṣṭayam ||

madhye madhye yathā matsyā bhaveyuḥ pātayet tathā ||

pūrvāparāyate dve dve mantrī yāmyottarāyate ||

pātayet teṣu matsyeṣu samaṃ sūtracatuṣṭayam |
pūrvavat koṇakoṣṭheṣu karṇasūtrāṇi pātayet ||

yāvacchatadvayaṃ mantrī ṣaṭpañcāśatpadānyapi |
tāvat tenaiva vidhinā tatra sūtrāṇi pātayet ||

ṣaṭtriṃśatāpadairmadhye likhet padmaṃ sulakṣaṇam |
bahiḥ paṅktyā bhavet pīṭhaṃ paṅktiyugmena vīthikā ||

dvāraśobhopaśobhāsrān śiṣṭābhyāṃ parikalpayet |
śāstroktavidhinā mantrī tataḥ padmaṃ samālikhet ||

padmakṣetrasya saṃtyajya dvādaśāṃśaṃ bahiḥ sudhīḥ |
tanmadhyaṃ vibhajed vṛttaistribhiḥ samavibhāgataḥ ||

ādyaṃ syāt karṇikāsthānaṃ keśarāṇāṃ dvitīyakam |
tṛtīyaṃ tatra patrāṇāmuktāṃśena dalāgrakam ||

<65> bāhyavṛttāntarālasya mānaṃ yad vidhinā sudhīḥ |
nidhāya keśarāgreṣu parito'rddhaniśākarān ||

likhitvā sandhisaṃsthāni tatra sūtrāṇi pātayet |
dalāgrāṇāṃ ca yanmānaṃ tanmānaṃ vṛttamālikhet ||

tadantarāle tanmadhya sūtrasyobhayataḥ sudhīḥ |
ālikhed bāhyahastena dalāgrāṇi samantataḥ ||

yugmaśo dalamūleṣu keśarāṇi prakalpayet |
etat sādhāraṇaṃ proktaṃ paṅkajaṃ tantravedibhiḥ ||

padāni trīṇi pādārthaṃ pīṭhakoṇeṣu mārjayet |
avaśiṣṭaiḥ padairvidvān pīṭhagātrāṇi kalpayet ||

padāni vīthisaṃsthāni mārjayet paṅktyabhedataḥ |
dikṣu dvārāṇi racayed dvicatuḥkoṣṭhakaistataḥ ||

padaistribhirathaikena śobhāḥ syurdvārapārśvayoḥ |
upaśobhāḥ syurekena tribhiḥ koṣṭhairanantaram ||

avaśiṣṭaiḥ padaiḥ ṣaḍbhiḥ koṇānāṃ syāccatuṣṭayam |
rañjayet pañcabhirvaṇairmaṇḍalaṃ tanmanoharam ||

pītaṃ haridrācūrṇaḥ syāt sitaṃ taṇḍulasambhavam |
kusumbhacūrṇamaruṇaṃ kṛṣṇaṃ dagdhapulākajam ||

vilvādipatrajaṃ śyāmamityuktaṃ pañcavarṇakam |

anyatrāruṇāntaramuktam (-)

tathā doṣārajaḥ kṣārasaṃyuktaṃ raktamucyate |
iti | śyāmāntaramuktaṃ prayogasāre (-)

śyāmaṃ śyāmachadodbhūtaṃ rajaḥ proktaṃ svakarmasu |

iti | tantrāntareṣu viśeṣaḥ (-)

śaktastu vāñched yadi siddhimugrāṃ tadvarṇaratnairiha maṇḍalāni |
ābhūṣayenmauktikapuṣparāga māṇikyanīlairharitaiśca ratnaiḥ ||

mahākapilapañcarātre tu (-) asyāvaśyakatoktā (-)

pītaṃ kṣitistu vijñeyā śuklamāpaḥ prakīrtitāḥ |
tejo vai raktavarṇaṃ syācchyāgaṃ vāyuḥ prakīrtitaḥ ||

ākāśa kṛṣṇavarṇañca pañcamaṃ tu mahāmune |
<66> site'dhidevatā rudrā rakte brahmādhidevatā ||

pīte'dhidevatā viṣṇuḥ kṛṣṇe caivā'cyutaḥ smṛtaḥ |
śyāme'dhidevatā nāgaḥ samākhyāto mayā'nagha ||

śuklaṃ grahāpadaṃ hanti raktaṃ krūragaṇodbhavām |
kṛṣṇaṃ sarvāsurotsāhaṃ nīlaṃ vaināyakīṃ tathā ||

paiśācīṃ rākṣasīṃ caiva nihantī haritaṃ rajaḥ |
tasmāddhome'bhiṣeke ca yāge caiva viśeṣataḥ ||

vartayenmaṇḍalaṃ taistu devasantuṣṭikārakam |
śāradāyām (-) aṅgulotsedhavistārāḥ sīmārekhā sitāḥ śubhāḥ |
karṇikāṃ pītavarṇena keśarāṇyaruṇena ca ||

śuklavarṇena patrāṇi tatsandhīn śyāmalena ca |
rajasā rañjayenmantrī yadvā pītaiva karṇikā ||

keśarāḥ pītaraktāḥ syuraruṇāni dalānyapi |
sandhayaḥ kṛṣṇavarṇāḥ syuḥ pītenā'pyasitena vā ||

rañjayet pīṭhagarbhāṇi pādāḥ syuraruṇaprabhāḥ |
gātrāṇi tasya śuklāni vīthiṣu ca catasṛṣu ||

ālikhet kalpalatikā dalapuṣpaphalānvitāḥ |
vaṇairnānāvidhaiścitraiḥ sarvadṛṣṭimanoharāḥ ||

gautamīye tu (-) tadbahī rucirān kuryāccaturaḥ kalpaśākhinaḥ |
lalitān rūḍhakusumān phalapallavaśālinaḥ ||

jalajaiḥ sthalajaiścāpi sumanobhiḥ samanvitān |
haṃsasārasakāraṇḍa śukabhramarakokilaiḥ |
mayūracakravākādyairārūḍhaviṭapāntarān | ityuktam |

śāradāyām (-) dvārāṇi śvetavarṇāni śobhā raktāḥ samīritāḥ |
upaśobhāḥ pītavarṇāḥ koṇānyasitabhāni ca ||

trisro rekhāḥ bahiḥ kuryāt sitaraktāsitāḥ kramāt |
maṇḍalaṃ sarvatobhadrametat sādhāraṇaṃ smṛtam ||

vaśiṣṭhasaṃhitāyāntu viśeṣaḥ (-)

pītaṃ pūrve sitaṃ deyaṃ paścime'pyuttare tathā |
raktaṃ tu dakṣiṇe kṛṣṇaṃ pāṭalaṃ vahnisaṃsthitam ||

<67> nairṛtye nīlavarṇaṃ tu vāyavye dhūmravarṇakam |
īśe gauraṃ vinirdiṣṭamaṣṭapatreṣvayaṃ kramaḥ ||

	tata āsana upaviśya 
bhūtaśuddhimātṛkānyāsāntaryāgajalārghyasthāpanādi vidhāya 
sarvatobhadramaṇḍalakamalopari ādhāraśaktyādipīṭhamantraparyantaṃ 
sampūjya kalaśasthāpanaṃ kuryāditi sakalatantrakramaḥ | śāradāyām (-)

hemādiracitaṃ kumbhamastrādbhiḥ kṣālitāntaram |
candanāgurukarpūradhūpitaṃ śobhanākṛtim ||

āveṣṭitāṅgaṃ nīrarandhraṃ tantunā triguṇātmanā |
arcitaṃ gandhapuṣpādyaiḥ kūrcākṣatasamanvitam ||

navaratnodaraṃ mantrī sthāpayet tāramuccaran |
tantrāntare (-) saptaviṃśatidarbhāṇāṃ veṇyā granthivibhūṣitam |
veṣṭayet sarvayajñeṣu tat kūrcaṃ parikīrtitam ||

śāradāyām (-) aikyaṃ saṅkalpya kumbhasya pīṭhasya ca vidhānavit |
kṣīradrumakaṣāyeṇa palāśatvagbhavena vā ||

tīrthodakairvā karpūragandhapuṣpasuvāsitaiḥ |
ātmābhedena vidhivanmātṛkāṃ pratilomataḥ ||

japanmūlamanuṃ tadvat pūrayed devatādhiyā |
śaṅkhe kvāthāmbusampūrṇe gandhāṣṭakamabhīṣṭadam ||

viloḍya pūjayet tasminnāvāhya sakalāḥ kalāḥ |
daśa vahneḥ kalāḥ pūrvaṃ dvādaśa dvādaśātmanaḥ ||

kalāḥ śoḍaśa somasya paścāt pañcāśataṃ kalāḥ |
japitvā pratilomena mūlamantraṃ ca mantravit ||

samāhitena manasā dhyāyanmantrasya devatām |
prāṇapratiṣṭhāṃ kurvīta tatra tatra vicakṣaṇaḥ ||

kalātmakaṃ śaṅkhasaṃsthaṃ kvāthaṃ kumbhe ca nikṣipet |
candanāgurukarpūra corakuṅkumarocanāḥ ||

jaṭāmāṃsīkapiyutā śaktergandhāṣṭakaṃ viduḥ | iti |

hemādīti | ādipadādrājatādi | coro bhaṭa uraga iti prasiddhaḥ | kapirgeḍhīmaneti 
prasiddhaḥ | mahākapilapañcarātre (-)

sauvarṇaṃ kalaśaṃ ramyaṃ raupyaṃ tāmramathāpi vā |
<68> nirdoṣaṃ mṛnmayaṃ cāpi candanena vilepitamiti ||

kalaśaparimāṇaṃ tu (-) pañcāśadaṅgulavyāsa utsedhaḥ ṣoḍaśāṅgulaḥ |
kalaśānāṃ pramāṇaṃ tu mukhamaṣṭāṅgulaṃ bhavet ||

iti tantrāntare proktam | vāyavīyasaṃhitāyāmapi (-)

sauvarṇaṃ rājataṃ vāpi tāmraṃ mṛnmayameva vā |
gandhapuṣpākṣatākīrṇaṃ kuśadūrvāṅkurārcitam ||

sitasūtrāvṛtaṃ kaṇṭhe navavastrayugāvṛtam |

tantrau viśeṣastantrāntare (-)

kanyākartitasūtreṇa triguṇena ca varmaṇā |
guṇatrayātmakenaiva veṣṭayedabhitaḥ samamiti ||

śāradāyām (-) paścādaśvatthapanasa cūtakomalapallavaiḥ |
indravallīsamābaddhaiḥ suradrumadhiyā guruḥ ||

kumbhavaktraṃ pidhāyā'smiṃścaṣakaṃ saphalākṣatam |
saṃsthāpayet phaladhiyā vidhivat kalpaśākhinām ||

tataḥ kumbhaṃ nirmalena kṣaumayugmena veṣṭayet |
mūlena mūrtimiṣṭvāsmiṃcchākhāyāṃ kalpaśākhinām ||

āvāhya pūjayet tasyāṃ mantrī mantrasya devatām |

tathā (-) aṅgāni lokapālāntaṃ yajedāvaraṇānyapi |

pañcāyatanadīkṣāpakṣe pañcakalaśān saṃsthāpya tattaddevatāmāvāhya 
pūjayet | prokte naivaṃ kalaśavidhinaikena vānekakumbhairiti 
prapañcasāravacanāt | tatra devatāsthāpanakrama ukto jñānamālāyām (-)

yadā tu śaṅkaraṃ madhye aiśānyāṃ śrīpatiṃ yajet |
āgneyāṃ ca tathā haṃsaṃ nairṛtyāṃ pārvatīsutam ||

vāyavyāñca sadā pūjyā bhavānī bhaktavatsalā |
yadā tu madhye govindamaiśānyāṃ śaṅkaraṃ yajet ||

āgneyyāṃ gaṇanāthaṃ ca nairṛtyāṃ tapanaṃ tathā |
vāyavyāmambikāṃ caiva yajenmantrī samāhitaḥ ||

sahasrāṃśuṃ yadā madhye aiśānyāṃ pārvatīpatim |
āgneyyāmekadantañca naiṛtyāmacyutaṃ yajet ||

vāyavyāṃ pūjayed devīṃ bhogamokṣaikabhūmikām |
<69> bhavānīṃ tu yadā madhye aiśānyāṃ mādhavaṃ yajet ||

āgneyyāṃ pārvatīnāthaṃ naiṛtyāṃ gaṇanāyakam |
pradyotanaṃ tu vāyavyāmācāryastu prapūjayet ||

herambaṃ tu yadā madhye aiśānyāmacyutaṃ yajet |
āgneyyāṃ pañcavaktraṃ tu naiṛtyāṃ jagadambikām ||

vāyavyāṃ dyumaṇiṃ caiva yajenmantrī hyatandritaḥ |
svasthānavarjitā devāḥ śokaduḥkhabhayapradāḥ |
tanmaṇḍalasthito rājā sādhakaśca vinaśyati |

tantrāntare (-) śambhau madhyagate harīnaharabhūdevyo harau śaṅkare
bhāsye nāgasutā ravau haragaṇeśājāmbikāḥ sthāpitāḥ |
devyāṃ viṣṇuharaikadantaravayo lambodare'jeśvarā(-)
ryenāḥ śaṅkarabhāgato nigaditā vyastāstu te hānidāḥ ||

pūjākramastu tantrāntare (-)

mukhye puṣpāñjaliṃ dattvā gaṇeśādyarcanaṃ bhavet |
gaṇeśa eva mukhyaścet tatra sūryakramād bhavet || iti |

cāmuṇḍātantre (-)

śyāmāyāṃ bhairavī tārā chinnamastā tu bhairave |
mañjughoṣe tathā raudre pañcāṅgo neṣyate budhaiḥ ||

pañcāṅgo yāgaḥ pañcāyanadīkṣārūpaḥ | śāradāyām (-)

dakṣiṇe sthaṇḍilaṃ kṛtvā tatrādhāya hutāśanam |
saṃskṛtya vidhivad vidvān vaiśvadevaṃ samācaret ||

tatra sampūjya gandhādyairdevatāmuktavigrahām |
tāravyāhṛtibhirhutvā mūlamantreṇa mantravit ||

sarpiṣmatā pāyasena pañcaviṃśatisaṃkhyayā |
hutvā vyāhṛtibhirbhūyo gandhādyaiḥ punararcayet |
tāṃ yojayitvā pīṭhasthamūrtau vahniṃ visarjayet |
avaśiṣṭena haviṣā vikiret parito balim ||

devatāyāḥ pārśvadebhyo gandhapuṣpākṣatānvitam |

atra vaiśvadevapadena nityahoma eva ucyate | sarvadevasambandhitvavyutpatteriti 
kaumudīkṛtaḥ | nityahomād bhinna evāyaṃ vahnisaṃskāraśruteḥ | 
agnyādhānādikaṃ karma 

<70> nityahome na vidyate iti vaśiṣṭhasaṃhitāyāṃ nityahome 
vahnisaṃskāraniṣedhāt | etaddhomānantaraṃ ca laukikāgnau (-)

pariṣicya tato devi nityahomaṃ samācaret |
mūlamantreṇa deveśi hunet pañcāhutīḥ kramāt ||

prāṇāpānau tathā vyāna udānaśca samānakaḥ |
etatsvarūpaṃ jānīyādāhutīnāṃ ca pañcakam ||

ṣaḍāhutīḥ ṣaḍaṅgeṣu nityahomo'yamīritaḥ |

iti jñānārṇavoktanityahomaḥ kārya iti rāghavabhaṭṭāḥ | tanna | atra tantrāntare 
kvacidapi vaiśvadevasya karmāntaratvāśruteḥ |

nitye naimittike kāmye etadagnimukhaṃ smṛtam |

ityagastyasaṃhitāyāṃ nityahome'pi vahnisaṃskāraśruteśca | tasmānnityahome 
śāradājñānārṇavoktakramayorvikalpa eveti tattvam | śāradāyām (-)

sahasrāvṛtya saṃjapya mūlamantramananyadhīḥ |
taṃ japaṃ sarvasampattyai devatāyai samarpayet ||

tataḥ śambhordiśi gururvikare pūrvasaṃcite |
hemavastrādisaṃyuktāṃ karkarīṃ toyapūritām ||

saṃsthāpya tasyāṃ siṃhasthāṃ khaḍgakheṭakadhāriṇīm |
ghorarūpāṃ paścimāsyāṃ pūjayedastradevatām ||

calāsanena saṃpūjya tāmādāya guruḥ punaḥ |
rakṣeti lokapālānāṃ nālamuktena vāriṇā ||

devājñāṃ śrāvayannantaḥ parivṛtya pradakṣiṇam |
astramantraṃ samuccārya yathāpūrvaṃ niveśayet ||

abhyarcya bhūyo gandhādyairastraṃ tatra sthirāsane |
tataśca saṃskṛte vahnau gokṣīreṇa caruṃ pacet ||

astreṇa kṣālite pātre nave tāmramayādike |
taṇḍūlān śālisambhūtān mūlamantrābhimantritān ||

prasṛtīnāṃ pañcadaśa kṣiptvā cāstramanuṃ japet |
prakṣālya pātravadanaṃ pidhāya kavacāṇunā ||

prāṅmukho mūlamantreṇa deśikendraścaruṃ pacet |
<71> mūlena paścāt tatpātraṃ kavacenā'vatārayet |
astrajapte kuśāstīrṇe maṇḍale vidhivad guruḥ ||

taṃ vibhajya tridhā bhāgamekaṃ devāya kalpayet |
anyamagnau prajuhuyādaparaṃ deśikaḥ svayam ||

śiṣyeṇa sārdhaṃ bhuñjita vihitācamanastataḥ |

saṃskṛta iti | ayañca saṃskāra ācāryakuṇḍa eva | ācāryakartavyatvāt |
taduktaṃ prayogasāre (-) kuṇḍamastreṇa saṃprokṣya tatrādhāya hutāśanam |
sannidhānādikaṃ devaṃ yathāvatpūjayet tataḥ ||

kṛtvā taṇḍulanirvāpaṃ tasmin kṣīre paceccarum |

iti | anyamagnau prajuhuyāditi | ācārya ṛtvik ceti śeṣaḥ | tatkramastu tatraiva 
ācāryakuṇḍe ācāryakartavyāgnisaṃskāramuktvā (-)

tato'nyeṣvapi kuṇḍeṣu saṃskṛteṣu yathāvidhi |
ācāryo viharedagniṃ pūrvādiṣu samāhitaḥ |
ṛtvijo gandhapuṣpādyairaṅgādyāvaraṇānvitām |
tantroktadevatāmiṣṭvā pañcaviṃśatisaṃkhyayā ||

mūlenājyena juhuyuḥ sājyena caruṇā tathā |

ityuktaḥ | kuṇḍāntarasaṃskārastu ṛtvikkartṛkaḥ | śiṣyeṇeti | atra viśeṣaḥ

somaśambhau (-) carostṛtīyabhāgaṃ tu grāsatritayasammitam |
aṣṭagrāsapramāṇaṃ vā daśanasparśavarjitam ||

pālāśe puṭake muktau bhuktau pippalapatrake |
hṛdā saṃbhojayenmatrī pūtairācāmayejjalaiḥ ||

śāradāyām (-) ācāntaṃ śiṣyamānīya sakalīkṛtya deśikaḥ |
tālapramāṇaṃ hṛjjaptaṃ kṣīravṛkṣādisambhavam ||

dantakāṣṭhaṃ tadā dadyācchiṣyāya vinatātmane |
dantān viśodhya yatnena tat prakṣālya visarjayet ||

nārāyaṇīye (-) dantakāṣṭhaṃ hṛdā japtaṃ kṣīrivṛkṣādisambhavam |
sammārjya dantāṃstacchitvā prakṣālyaitad bhuvi kṣipet ||

dikṣu pūrvādyadhordhvāsu tasyāgrapatanaṃ kramāt |
vṛddhistāpo mṛtirvittaṃ kṣayaṃ śāntirgado dhanam ||

sukhavṛddhiḥ paraṃ duḥkhaṃ phalānyetāni śaṃsati |
<72> vāyavīyasaṃhitāyāmapi (-) tyaktaṃ taddantadhavanaṃ dṛśyate guruṇā yadi |
prāgudakpaścimeśāgryaṃ śivamanyacchivetaram ||

aśastāśāmukhe tasmin gurustaddoṣaśāntaye |
śatamardhaṃ vā juhuyāt tadardhaṃ mūlamantrataḥ ||

tantrāntare (-) athā'tra cūtavṛkṣasya dvādaśāṅgulamānataḥ |
dantakāṣṭhaṃ pradātavyaṃ taddantāgravicarvitam ||

ūrdhvāsyaṃ kṣepayet tatra maṇḍale pīṭhamunnayet |
paścimottararudrendre śubhapāto'nyathā'śubhaḥ ||

durnimittavināśāya juhuyācchatamastrataḥ |

śāradāyām (-) yathāvidhi tamācāntaṃ śikhābandhābhirakṣitam |
vidhāya sārdhamamunā vedyāṃ darbhāstare guruḥ ||

śayīta tasyāṃ tāṃ rātrimadhivāsaḥ samīritaḥ |
nārāyaṇīye (-) punastaṃ śiṣyamācāntaṃ śikhābandhābhirakṣitam |
kṛtvā vedyāṃ sahānena svaped darbhāstare guruḥ ||

piṅgalāmate (-) svapnamāṇavamāśritya svāpayet pūrvamastakam |
somaśambhāvapi (-) gṛhasthān darbhaśayyāyāṃ pūrvaśīrṣāstrarakṣitān ||

hṛdā sadbhasmaśayyāyāṃ yatīn dakṣiṇamastakān ||

vāyavīyasaṃhitāyām (-)

devasya dakṣiṇe bhāge śiṣyaṃ tamadhivāsayet |
āhatāstaraṇāstīrṇe sadarbhaśayane śuciḥ ||

mantrite ca śivaṃ dhyāyan prākśirasko niśi svapet |
śikhāvaddhasya sūtrasya śikhayā tacchikhāṃ guruḥ ||

āveṣṭyāhatavastreṇa tamāchādya ca varmaṇā |
rekhātrayaṃ ca parito bhasmanā tilasarṣapaiḥ ||

kṛtvāstrajaptaistadbāhye digīśānāṃ baliṃ haret |

mahākapilapañcarātre (-)

gurupādārcanaṃ kṛtvā upavāsī jitendriyaḥ |
darbhaśayyāṃ gato rātrau dṛṣṭvā svapnaṃ nivedayet ||

yoginītantre (-) yajjāgrato dūramudeti daivamāvṛtya mantrān prayatastriretān |
labdhaikabhugdakṣiṇapārśvaśāyī svapnaṃ parīkṣeta yathopadeśam ||

<73> bhagavan devadeveśa śūlabhṛd vṛṣavāhana |
iṣṭāniṣṭe samācakṣva mama suptasya śāśvataḥ ||

evaṃ suptaḥ kuśāstīrṇe tataḥ prayatamānasaḥ |
niśānte paśyati svapnaṃ śubhaṃ vā yadi vā'śubham ||

piṅgalāmate (-) tāro hilidvayaṃ śūlapāṇaye dviṭha īritaḥ |
svapnamānavamantro'yaṃ śambhunā parikīrtitaḥ ||

namo'jāya trinetrāya piṅgalāya mahātmane |
vāmāya viśvarūpāya svapnādhipataye namaḥ ||

svapne kathaya me tathyaṃ sarvakāryeṣvaśeṣataḥ |
kriyāsiddhiṃ vidhāsyāmi tvatprasādānmaheśvara ||

mantratantraprakāśe (-) oṃ hṛtsakalalokāya viṣṇave prabhaviṣṇave |
viśvāya viśvarūpāya svapnādhipataye namaḥ |
svapnamānavamantro'yaṃ kathito nāradādibhiḥ ||

nāradīye (-) paraṃ brahma svarūpastvamantaścarasi viśvadhṛk |
śubhāśubhagatiṃ deva svapne me vinivedaya ||

ityuccārya namaskuryājjānubhyāmavanīṃ gataḥ |
prasanno vāgyatastasmin śayīteṣṭaṃ vicintayet ||

atha śubhasvapnāḥ

yoginītantre (-) trividhaṃ darśanaṃ tasya yathārthamayathārthakam |
apākajaṃ yat svasthānāṃ saṃyatānāṃ hi darśanam ||

yathārthamayathārthaṃ tadasvasthānāṃ vikārajam |
apājakaṃ mānasaṃ ca yathārthaphalamucyate ||

āgamasiddhānte (-) ādye varṣād vatsarārdhād dvitīye yāme pāko varṣapādāt 
tṛtīye yāme pākaḥ śarvarīturyayāme sadyaḥ pāko yo visargeṣu dṛṣṭaḥ ||

tathā (-) krūre'dhamā madhyamā syādadṛṣṭe uttamottame |
svapne paśyati vai devaṃ nijeṣṭaṃ sarvatāmukham ||

guruṃ prasādasumukhaṃ nirmalaṃ candramaṇḍalam |
gaṅgāṃ bhāgīrathīṃ bhānuṃ liṅginaṃ nigamaiśvaram ||

prasannāṃ tatra jānīyāt siddhiṃ svapnanidarśane |
nāradapañcarātre (-) kṣitilābhaḥ kṣataṃ cābdhitaraṇaṃ cāgnipūjanaṃ |
<74> homaśca jvalite vahnau saṃgrāme vijayastathā ||

haṃsakokamayūrāṇāṃ rathārohaṇameva ca |

mahākapilapañcarātre (-) kanyāṃ chatraṃ rathaṃ dīpaṃ prāsādaṃ kamalaṃ 
nadīm |
kuñjaraṃ vṛṣabhaṃ mālyaṃ samudraṃ phalinaṃ drumam ||

parvataṃ ca hayaṃ medhyamāmamāṃsaṃ surāsavam |
evamādīni sarvāṇi dṛṣṭvā siddhimavāpnuyāt ||

yadā karmasu kāmyeṣu striyaṃ svapneṣu paśyati |
samṛddhiṃ tatra jānīyāt tasmin svapnanidarśane ||

nadīsamudrataraṇamākāśagamanaṃ tathā |
bhāskarodayanaṃ caiva prajvalantaṃ hutāśanam ||

grahanakṣatratārāṇāṃ candramaṇḍaladarśanam |
harmyasyārohaṇaṃ caiva prāsādaśiraso'pi vā ||

nāgāśvavṛṣabhendrāṇāṃ taruśailāgrarohaṇam |
vimānagamanaṃ caiva siddhamantrasya darśanam ||

evamādīni saṃdṛśya naraḥ siddhimavāpnuyāt |
svapne tu madirāpānamāmamāṃsasya bhojanam ||

kṛmiviṣṭhānulepaṃ ca rudhireṇābhiṣecanam |
bhojanaṃ dadhibhaktasya śvetavastrānulepanam ||

siṃhāsanaṃ rathaṃ yānaṃ dhvajaṃ rājyābhiṣecanam |
ratnānyābharaṇādīni dṛṣṭvā svapne prasīdati ||

nāradapañcarātre (-) gururdevo dvijaḥ kanyā gogajāśvāśca keśarī |
darpaṇaṃ śaṅkhabheryau ca tantrīvādyaṃ ca rocanam ||

tāmbūlabhakṣaṇaṃ caiva tathā dadhyabhivandanam |
siddhānnamāmamāṃsaṃ ca madyastrīmadirāsavāḥ ||

chatraṃ yānaṃ sitaṃ vastraṃ tathānyacchvetacandanam |
mālyamuktāphale hāraḥ pūrṇaḥ samuditaḥ śaśī ||

pracaṇḍakiraṇaḥ sūryo nimnagā'tha mahodadhiḥ |
praphullapādapaḥ śālī rocanā kuṅkumaṃ madhu ||

lājāḥ siddhārthakā bījaṃ navabhāṇḍaṃ ca pāyasam |
upāsanno'pyathācāryo gāyatrī varasaṃgatā ||

<75> sarve svapne śubhāḥ proktāḥ siddhimokṣaphalapradāḥ ||

nāradīye (-) grahaṇaṃ tu purandhrīṇāmagamyāgamanaṃ tathā |
daśanaṃ śvetanāgena bandhanaṃ śṛṅkhalādibhiḥ ||

rodanaṃ tāḍanaṃ caiva dhāvanaṃ cāṅgaghātanam |
mṛllohatrapukāṃsyasya sīsakasyāpi kutsitāt ||

dhātorlābhastathā puṣpaṃ phalaratnāvubhavāvapi |
vyajanaṃ svayamanyena dhamanaṃ ca vibhāvasoḥ ||

evamādīni cānyāni śubhānyāhurmanīṣiṇaḥ |

athāśubhasvapnāḥ

nāradapañcarātre (-) ato'nye viparītāstu manasaḥ khedadāśca ye |
garhitā lokavidviṣṭāḥ svapnāste hyaśubhāvahāḥ ||

mahākapilapañcarātre (-) cāṇḍālaṃ karabhaṃ kākaṃ gartaṃ 
śūnyamamaṅgalam |
tailābhyaktaṃ naraṃ nagnaṃ śuṣkavṛkṣaṃ sakaṇṭakam ||

prāsādamatalaṃ dṛṣṭvā naro rogamavāpnuyāt |
kapilaḥ (-) dṛṣṭvā duḥsvapnakaṃ caiva homāt siddhimanvāpnuyāt |
piṅgalāmate (-) śubhe śubhaṃ bhavet tasya juhuyādaśubhe śatam |
astreṇeti kramād vidvān vidhiḥ śiṣyādhivāsane ||

nāradapañcarātre (-) dṛṣṭvā samācareddhomaṃ dantakāṣṭhoditaṃ mune |
kevalenā'thavā'jyena siṃhamantreṇa śāntaye ||

nibandhe oṃ vajranakhadaṃṣṭrāyudhāya mahāsiṃhāya huṃ phaṭ nama iti 
mahāsiṃhamantraḥ | tathā (-)

śataṃ sahasraṃ sāṣṭaṃ vā yathāśaktyā'thavā dvijaḥ |
astrasaṃpuṭitenaiṣāṃ nāmnā svāhānvitena ca ||

doṣān jahi jahītyevaṃ padaṃ nāmāvasānakam |
astrasiṃhamantrayorvikalpaḥ | nāradīye (-)

bhakṣaṇaṃ pakvamāṃsasya karṇanāsādikarttanam |
lepanaṃ raktagandhena kardamenāpi lepanam ||

veṣṭanaṃ kṛṣṇasarpeṇa raktamālyena veṣṭanam ||

āliṅganaṃ ca kustrīṇāṃ hasanaṃ nartanaṃ tathā |
kharoṣṭramahiṣānāñca darśanārohaṇakriyā |
pātanāveśanābhyaṅgaṃ dakṣiṇāśāgataṃ tathā ||

<76> vamanaṃ rudhirādīnāṃ lābhasteṣāṃ tathaiva ca |
aṅgabhaṅgo'tha nidrā ca yamakiṅkaradarśanam ||

divyabhaumāntarīkṣāṇāmutpātānāñca darśanam |
nṛpagoguruviprāṇāṃ bhartsanaṃ viṣabhakṣaṇam ||

darśanaṃ bhīmasarpāṇāṃ puṃsi maithunameva ca |
evamādīni cānyāni garhitāni vidurvudhāḥ ||

gurustatpratikārāya sahasraṃ prajapenmanum |
tilaiḥ sahasrañca hunedevaṃ śāntimudīrayet ||

atha svapnanivedanam

tatraiva (-) śiṣyastu śucirācāntaḥ puṣpahasto gurūttamam |
praṇamya śirasā hṛṣṭastasmai svapnaṃ nivedayet ||

svapne cākṣisamakṣaṃ vā āścaryamapi harṣadam |
akasmād yadi vā paśyet nākhyātavyaṃ gurorvinā ||

mahākapilapañcarātre (-) gurupādārcanaṃ kṛtvā upavāsī jitendriyaḥ |
darbhaśayyāṃ gato rātrau dṛṣṭvā svapnaṃ nivedayet ||

atropavāsavidhiḥ kālāntarīyasvapnaparīkṣāparaḥ | dīkṣāyāṃ 
proktapāyasabhojanasyāvaśyakatvāt | piṅgalāmate (-)

sadyo'dhivāsamathavā prakūrvīta yathāvidhi |
mantratantraprakāśe (-) dinadvayenaiva kuryād dīkṣākarma vicakṣaṇaḥ |
sadyo'dhivāsanaṃ vā syādekasmin divase yadi |

atha kuṇḍasaṃskārāḥ

athoktahomopayuktāgnisaṃskāraḥ | tatra prathamaṃ kuṇḍasaṃskāro yathā (-)

śāradāyām (-) aṣṭādaśa syuḥ saṃskārāḥ kuṇḍānāṃ tantracoditāḥ |
vīkṣaṇaṃ mūlamantreṇa śareṇa prokṣaṇaṃ matam ||

tenaiva tāḍanaṃ darbhairvarmaṇā'bhyukṣaṇaṃ smrṭam |
astreṇa khananoddhārau hṛnmantreṇa prapūraṇam ||

samīkaraṇamastreṇa secanaṃ varmaṇā matam |
kuṭṭanaṃ heti mantreṇa varmamantreṇa mārjanam |
vilepanaṃ kalārūpakalpanaṃ tadanantaram |
trisūtrīkaraṇaṃ paścād hṛdayenā'rcanaṃ matam ||

<77> astreṇa vajrīkaraṇaṃ hṛnmantreṇa kuśaiḥ śubhaiḥ |
catuṣpathaṃ tanutreṇa tanuyādakṣapāṭanam ||

yāge kuṇḍāni saṃskuryāt saṃskārairebhirīritaiḥ |
athavā tāni saṃskuryāccatubhirvīkṣaṇādibhiḥ ||

kāmarūpakalpanamiti(?) | kuṇḍamadhye somasūryāgnikalānāṃ cintanamityarthaḥ 
| akṣapāṭanaṃ tu nāradapañcarātre (-) 

acchināgraistato darbhairastramantrābhimantritaiḥ |
kuṇḍamittigaṇaṃ sarvaṃ varmaṇā paribhūṣayet ||

ityevamakṣapāṭākhyaṃ kuṇḍasaṃskāraḥ īritaḥ |

ityuktam | ete ca saṃskārā yadi kuṇḍakaraṇakāle na kṛtāstadā siddhe'pi | 
tasminnadṛṣṭārthamācaraṇīyāḥ | taduktaṃ nāradapañcarātre (-)

kuṇḍasyārambhakāle tu saṃskārā na kṛtā yadi |
niṣpannasya ca te sarve vidheyāḥ syuḥ krameṇa vai || iti |

śāradāyām (-) tisrastrisro likhellekhā hṛdā prāgudagagragāḥ |
atra likhanakramaḥ sautrāmaṇitantre (-)

prācīmūrdhvamudaksaṃsthaṃ dakṣiṇārambhamālikhet |
udagragaṃ puraḥsaṃsthaṃ paścimārambhamālikhet ||

tisrastisro likhitvaivaṃ prokṣayed vāgbhavena ca |

śāradāyām (-) prāgagrāṇāṃ smṛtā devā mukundeśapurandarāḥ ||
rekhāṇāmudagagrāṇāṃ brahmavaivastatendavaḥ ||
athavā ṣaṭkoṇāvṛtaṃ trikoṇaṃ tatra saṃlikhet |
yāmale'pi (-) ṣaṭkoṇenāvṛtaṃ devi trikoṇaṃ vā samālikhet |
śāradāyām (-) sarvāṇyabhyukṣya tāreṇa yogapīṭhamathārcayet ||

atra vāgbhavatārayorvikalpaḥ | yogapīṭhamiti | ādhāraśaktimārabhya 
pīṭhamantraparyantamītyarthaḥ | atra (-) jayākhyā vijayā paścādajitā 
cā'parājitā |
nityā vilāsinī dogdhrī tvaghorā maṅgalā nava ||

iti pīṭhaśaktayaḥ | hrīṃ vāgīśvarīvāgīśvarayogapīṭhātmane namaḥ iti 
pīṭhamantraḥ | taduktaṃ 

tantrāntare (-) vāgīśvarīvāgīśvarayoryogapīṭhātmane namaḥ |
hrīmādyaḥ pīṭhamantro'yamāvāhyā'smin prapūjayet ||

śāradāyām (-) vāgīśvarīmṛtusnātāṃ nīlendīvarasannibhām |
<78> gaṇeśvaravimarśiṇyām (-) śaktibījena vāgīśīṃ vāgīśaṃ 
sādhyamantrataḥ |

pūjayediti śeṣaḥ | rudrayāmale tu (-)

tataḥ śivāya śaktyai ca namo'ntau kathitau manū |
ābhyāṃ tristriśca saṃpūjya praṇamenmanunā'munā ||

vāgīśvarīmṛtusnātāṃ samastābharaṇānvitām |
vāgīśvareṇa saṃyuktāṃ namāmyalikhasiddhaye ||

ityuktam | vaiṣṇave tu (-) vāgīśvarī vāgīśvarayoḥ sthāne lakṣmīnārāyaṇau 
pūjyau taduktaṃ tattvasārasaṃhitāyām (-)

lakṣmīmṛtumatīṃ tatra prabhornārāyaṇasya ca |
grāmyadharmeṇa saṃjātamagniṃ tatra vicintayet ||

atra ca (-) vibhūtirunnatiḥ kāntiḥ sṛṣṭiḥ kīrtiśca sannatiḥ |
puṣṭirutkṛṣṭi ṛddhiśca saṃproktā nava saktayaḥ ||

iti pīṭhaśaktayaḥ | bījādyamāsanaṃ dattveti vacanāt śrīṃ 
lakṣmīnārāyaṇayoryogapīṭhātmane namaḥ iti pīṭhamantraḥ | śrīvidyāyāntu (-)

jñānārṇave (-) kāmeśvarīṃ kuṇḍamadhye sakāmāmṛtusaṃyutām |
samārādhya ca saṃpūjya tadgarbhe vahnimāvahet ||

śāradāyām (-) sūryakāntādisambhūtaṃ yadvā śrotriyagehajam |
ānīya vahniṃ pātreṇa kravyādāṃśaṃ parityajet ||

gautamīye (-) pāṣāṇabhavamagniṃ ca yadi vā'raṇisambhavam |
śrotriyāṇāṃ gehajañca vanasthamathavā haret ||

yadṛcchālābhasaṃprāptaścā'yogyo yāgakarmaṇi |
niragnibrāhmaṇāllabdho hyardhalābhakaro bhavet |
kṣatrāllabdhe caturthāṃśaṃ phalaṃ dadyāddhutāśanaḥ |
vaiśyācchudrācca viphalaṃ jāyate homakarma tat ||

uḍḍīśe (-) śrotriyāgārajaṃ vāpi sūryakāntodbhavaṃ tu vā |
araṇīsambhavaṃ vāpi kṣiptaṃ svarṇādibhājane ||

tāmrapātrādinā mantrī pihitaṃ tu samānayet |
athavānītamabhitaḥ sthāpayet kāṃsyabhājane ||

atrirapi (-) pātrāntareṇa pihite tāmrapātrādike śubhe |
agnipraṇayanaṃ kuryāccharāve tādṛśe'pi vā ||

<79> smṛtisāre tu (-) śarāve bhinnapātre vā kapāle colmuke'pi vā |
nāgnipraṇayanaṃ kuryād vyādhihānibhayāvaham ||

iti śarāvaniṣedhastāmrādipātrasadbhāve bodhyaḥ | kravyādāṃśaparityāge 
viśeṣaḥ
stantrāntare (-) astreṇāgniṃ samādhāya kavacena pidhāya tu |
kravyādāṃśaṃ tu cāstreṇa naiṛtye saṃtyajet priye ||

mantramuktāvalyāmapi (-)

ānīyāstreṇa naiṛtye kravyādāśaṃ parityajet |
devāṃśaṃ mūlamantreṇa sthāpayet purataḥ sudhīḥ ||

uḍḍīśe tu (-) kūrcāstrābhyāṃ ca naiṛtyāṃ kravyādāṃśaṃ parityajet | 
ityuktam |
gaṇeśvare'pi (-) hūṃ phaḍantena mūlena kravyādāṃśaṃ parityajet |
kriyāsāre (-) śmaśānādāvāmamāṃsamatti yo vahnirucyate |
kravyādastasya nāmāsya tyajet kiñciddhutāśanāt ||

śāradāyām (-) saṃskuryāt taṃ yathānyāyaṃ deśiko vīkṣaṇādibhiḥ |
audāryavaindavāgnibhyāṃ bhaumasyaikyaṃ smaran vasoḥ ||

yojayed vahnibījena caitanyaṃ pāvake tathā ||

sārasaṃgrahe (-) pradīpakalikākāraṃ teja āvāhya yatnataḥ |
aikyaṃ jāṭharavaindava vahnibhyāṃ pārthivasya ca ||

smṛtvā'gnibījakenā'sya caitanyaṃ yojayedatha |

vaindavastu bhrūmadhyastho vahniḥ | uḍḍīśe (-)

dīpād dīpāntaranyāyāt sphurantaṃ sarvatomukham |
śvāsamārgeṇa manuvit kavacena tato'rcayet ||

śāradāyām (-) tāreṇa mantritaṃ mantrī dhenumudrāmṛtīkṛtam |
astreṇa rakṣitaṃ paścāt tanutreṇā'vaguṇṭhitam ||

arcitaṃ triḥ paribhrāmya kuṇḍasyopari deśikaḥ |
pradakṣiṇaṃ tadā tāramantroccāraṇapūrvakam ||

ātmano'bhimukhaṃ vahniṃ jānuspṛṣṭamahītalaḥ |
śivabījadhiyā devyā yonāvenaṃ viniḥkṣipet ||

uḍḍīśe (-) bhūmau ca jānunī kṛtvā kūrcabījaṃ ca vahni ca |
caitanyaṃ ṅe namo'ntaḥ syādanenotthāpayecchucim ||

śivabījadhiyā tasyā yonau vahniṃ vinikṣipet |
<80> tripurāsārasamuccaye (-) yonāvenaṃ vinyaset svābhivaktraṃ paścādagniṃ 
mūlamantreṇa mantrī |

ityuktam | śivabījadhiyeti | śaivaśāktaviṣayam | vaiṣṇavādau tu (-) viṣṇādi 
bījadhiyeti bodhyam | vāyavīyasaṃhitāyāntu (-)

vahnibījaṃ samuccarya tvādadhītāgnimāsane |
yonimārgeṇa vai tadvadātmanaḥ sammukhena vā ||

yonimārgeṇa mekhaloparisthāpitayonirandhreṇa | śāradāyām (-)

paścāt devasya devyāśca dadyādācamanādikam |
jvālayenmanunā'nena tamamnimatha deśikaḥ ||

citpiṅgalahanadaha pacayugmānyudīrya ca |
sarvajñājñāpaya svāhā mantro'yaṃ prāgudīritaḥ ||

rudrayāmale tu (-) hrīṃ hrīṃ jvalayugaṃ devi prajvaladvitayaṃ tataḥ |
huṃ phaṭ svāheti mantreṇa jvālayet pāvakaṃ sudhīḥ ||

ityuktaṃ | jvālanaṃ tu mukhenaiva | taduktam (-)

juhuyuśca hutāgniśca pāṇiśūrpasrugādibhiḥ |
na kuryādagnidhamanaṃ na kuryād vyajanādinā ||

mukhenaiva dhamedagniṃ mukhādeṣo hyajāyata |
nāgniṃ mukhaneti tu yat laukike yojayet tu tat ||

iti | atra jvālinī homakarmaṇītyuktalakṣaṇā | yāmale (-)

tata utthāya vidhivat kṛtvā pāṇipuṭaṃ sudhīḥ |
agniṃ prajvalitaṃ vande jātavedaṃ hutāśanam ||

suvarṇavarṇamamalaṃ samiddhaṃ viśvatomukham |
upatiṣṭheta vidhivanmantreṇā'nena pāvakam ||

uḍḍīśe (-) prādeśamātrāṃ samidhaṃ mūlāgraghṛtasaṃplutām |
tūṣṇīṃ vahno samutkṣipya jihvāyāṃ devatāṃ nyaset |

śāradāyām (-) vinyasedātmano dehe mantrairjihvā havirbhujaḥ |
liṅgapāyuśirovaktra ghrāṇanetreṣu sarvataḥ ||

vahnīrāghīṃśasaṃyuktāssādiyāntāḥ sabindavaḥ |
varṇā mantraḥ samuddiṣṭā jihvānāṃ saptadeśikaiḥ ||

jihvāstāstrividhāḥ proktā guṇabhedena karmasu |
hiraṇyā gaganā raktā kṛṣṇānyā suprabhā matā |
81> bahurūpā'tiraktā ca sāttvikyo yāgakarmasu ||

vahniḥ rephaḥ | iro yakāraḥ | arghīśo dīrghokāraḥ | atra (-) sāttvikarasanāyāṃ 
bahurūpātiraktayoḥ paurvāparyaṃ bījakramānurodhena na tu 
nyāsakramānurodhena bahurūpāyāḥ sarvāṅge nyasanīyatvāt | taduktaṃ 
tantrāntare (-)

saliṅgagudamūrdhāsya nāsānetreṣu ca kramāt |
vinyasedatiraktāṃ tāṃ sarvāṅge bahurūpiṇīm ||

iti rāghavabhaṭṭāḥ | vastuto (-)

hiraṇyā gaganā raktā kṛṣṇā caiva tu suprabhā |
bahurūpā maheśāni atiraktā tathaiva ca ||

ityanantaram (-) ekaikaṃ vinyased devi liṅge pāyau śirasyatha |
vaktre ghrāṇe tathā netre sarvāṅge ca nyaset tataḥ ||

iti vīracūḍāmaṇivacanāt (-)

tataḥ pravinyasej jihvāṃ dehe mantrī vibhāvasoḥ |
saliṅgagudamūrddhāsya nāsānetreṣu ca kramāt ||

sarvāṅgeṣu ca jihvāstā vakṣyante trividhātmikāḥ |
hiraṇyā gaganā raktā kṛṣṇā caiva tu suprabhā ||

bahurūpā'tiraktā ca jihvāḥ sapteti sāttvikāḥ |

iti mantratantraprakāśavacanāccātiraktāyāḥ sarvāṅge eva nyāsaḥ sādhīyān | 
rāghavabhaṭṭalikhitavacanaṃ ca yadi pramāṇa tadā vikalpa eveti tatvam | 
śāradāyām (-)

padmarāgā suvarṇā'nyā tṛtīyā bhadralohitā |
lohitānantaraṃ śvetā dhūminī ca karālikā ||

rājasyo rasanā vahnervihitāḥ kāmyakarmasu |
viśvamūrtti sphuliṅginyau dhūmravarṇā manojavā ||

lohitā'nyā karālākhyā kālī tāmasya īritāḥ |
etāḥ sapta niyujyante krūrakarmasu mantribhiḥ ||

svasvanāmasamābhāḥ syurjihvāḥ kalyāṇaretasaḥ |
amartyapitṛgandharva yakṣanāgapiśācakāḥ ||

rākṣasāḥ saptajihvānāmiritā adhidevatāḥ |
adhidevatoktistattajjihvāsthāne nyāsārthaṃ pūjārthaṃ ca |
jihvāsu tridaśādīnāṃ tattatkāryasamāptaye |

<82> juhuyād vāñchitāṃ siddhiṃ dadyustā devatāmayāḥ ||

iti prapañcasāravacanāt tattajjihvāyāṃ tattaddravyeṇa homapakṣe tāsāṃ 
homārthaṃ ca |

kriyāsāre (-) asya bhṛgū ṛṣiśchando gāyatryagnistu devatā |
bījaṃ śaktistu raṃ svāhā ṛṣyādīn pūrvavan nyaset ||

śāradāyām (-) vahneraṅgamanūn nyasyet tanāvuktena vartmanā |
sahasrārciḥ svastipūrṇa uttiṣṭhapuruṣaḥ punaḥ ||

dhūmavyāpī saptajihvo dhanurddhara iti kramāt |
ṣaḍaṅgamanavaḥ proktā jātibhiḥ saha saṃyutāḥ ||

mūrtīraṣṭau tanau nyasyed deśiko jātavedasaḥ |
mūrdhāṃsapārśvakaṭyandhu kaṭipārśvāṃsakeṣu ca ||

pradakṣiṇavaśān nyasyeducyante vā yathākramāt |
jātavedāḥ saptajihvo havyavāhanasaṃjñakaḥ ||

aśvodarajasaṃjño'nyaḥ punarvaiśyānarāhvayaḥ |
kaumāratejāḥ syād viśvamukho devamukhaḥ smṛtaḥ ||

tārāgnaye padādyāḥ syurnatyantā vahnimūrttayaḥ |
āsanaṃ kalpayitvā'gnermūrtiṃ tasya vicintayet ||

āsanaṃ pīṭham | tanāviti śeṣaḥ | tatrādhāraśaktyādivahnimaṇḍalāntaṃ 
vinyasya keśareṣu madhye ca pīṭhaśaktīḥ tatraiva raṃ vahniyogapīṭhāya namaḥ 
iti pīṭhaṃ ca nyaset |

taduktaṃ tatraiva (-) svamaṇḍalāntaṃ prayajet pīṭheśanavaśaktikam |
pītā śvetā'ruṇā kṛṣṇā dhūmrā tīvrā sphuliṅginī ||

rucirā jvālinī proktāḥ kṛśānornava śaktayaḥ |
svabījenāsanaṃ dattvā mūrtiṃ mūlena kalpayet || iti |

tathā (-) iṣṭaṃ śaktiṃ svastikābhītimuccairdīrghairdorbhirdhārayantaṃ javābham 
|
hemākalpaṃ padmasaṃsthaṃ trinetraṃ dhyāyed vahniṃ baddhamauliṃ jaṭābhiḥ 
||

dhyānāntaramuktaṃ rudrayāmale (-)

bandhūkapuṣpasaṃkāśaṃ sutaptakanakaprabham |
padmasthaṃ yajamānārthaṃ vadanadvayaśobhitam ||

saptacchandomayaṃ devaṃ vimānopari saṃsthitam |
tridhāgrīvaṃ tripādābjaṃ havyakavyavināśakam ||

brahmādhvaryūdgātṛhotṛ catuḥśṛṅgavirājitam |
<83> pāñcarātraṃ pāśupataṃ kāpilaṃ ca mahāmatam ||

bauddhaṃ vaidikamityetat ṣaṭpiṅgalavilocanam |
vedārthaṃ ca catuḥśrotraṃ śrautaśāstramayadhvanim ||

sapāṭalajaṭābaddhamaṇikoṭīrabhāsvaram |
hemālaṅkārasaṃyuktaṃ hemakuṇḍalamaṇḍitam ||

raktāmbhoruhamadhyasthaṃ svastikāsanasaṃsthitam |
pṛṣṭhadeśasamālambi tārtīyacaraṇāmbujam ||

sadā śabdāyamānaṃ ca rājamānaṃ svatejasā |
śaktiṃ vajraṃ sruksruvau ca caturbhirdakṣabāhubhiḥ ||

tomaraṃ tālavṛntaṃ ca sauvarṇaṃ ghṛtapātrakam |
samaistribhirbāhubhiśca dadhānaṃ raktavāsasam ||

hiraṇyā kanakā raktā kṛṣṇā dakṣānane sthitāḥ |
suprabhā cātiraktā ca bahurūpā ca jihvikā ||

imā rasajñāstadvāmavadane nityamāsthitāḥ |
etābhiḥ saptajihvābhirupetaṃ pāṭitānanam ||

śāradāyām (-) pariṣiñcet tatastoyairviśuddhairmekhalopari |
darbhairagarbhairmadhyasthamekhalāyāṃ paristaret ||

kuloḍḍīśe (-) evaṃ vinyastadehaḥ san paristaraṇamācaret |
arghyodakena saṃprokṣya madhyasthamekhalopari ||

uttarāgraṃ pūrvadeśe pūrvāgraṃ dakṣiṇe tataḥ |
uttarāgraṃ paścime tu prāgagramuttare tathā ||

mūlamācchāditaṃ kṛtvā trivāraṃ tu paristaret |
tathā (-) mekhalāsu ca sarvāsu dīpamālāṃ prakalpayet |
gaṇeśvaravimarśinyām (-) pūrvāgrairuttarāgraiśca darbhairagniṃ paristaret |
dakṣiṇottarayoḥ pūrvāgraiḥ pūrvapaścimayoruttarāgrairityarthaḥ | 
tripurāsāramuccaye (-)

ekamekhalakuṇḍe niśitamatirmekhalādhastāt paristared dvimekhale 
dvitīyamekhalopari trimekhale tadantarālamekhalopari nyaset ||

śāradāyām (-) nikṣiped dikṣu paridhīn prācīvarjaṃ gurūttamaḥ |
kātyāyanaḥ (-) paridhīn paridadhatyārdrānekavṛkṣīyān bāhumātrān 
pālāśavaikaṅkatakāśmaryavailvāniti | tantrāntare (-)

<84> bāhye'tha sthaṇḍilaṃ ca triparidhisahitaṃ prāgudagrāgradarbham |

tripurāsārasamuccaye'pi (-)

sthaṇḍilake sikatānāṃ bāhye'tha trirnyaset paridhīn |

śāradāyām (-) prādakṣiṇyena sampūjyāsteṣu brahmādimūrtayaḥ |

sautrāmaṇitantre (-) kuṇḍamadhye vidhātavyā pīṭhapūjāvidhānavit |
padmāsanāntamādhāraśaktyādimanubhiḥ kramāt ||

uparyupari sampūjyā vahnerāsanaśaktayaḥ |
pūrvādidalamūleṣu madhye pūjyāḥ krameṇa tu ||

āsanaśaktayaḥ pūrvoktāḥ pīṭhaśaktayaḥ | śāradāyām (-)

dhyātaṃ vahniṃ yajenmadhyergandhādyairmanunā'munā |
vaiśvānarajātavedapade paścādihāvaha ||

lohitākṣapadasyānte sarvakarmāṇi sādhaya |
vahnijāyāvadhiḥ prokto mantraḥ pāvakavallabhaḥ ||

madhye ṣaṭsvapi koṇeṣu jihvā jvālāruco yajet |
atra ṣaṭsu koṇeṣu madhye ca yajedityanvayaḥ | koṇeṣu ca īśānādikramaḥ | 
taduktaṃ

somaśambhau (-) rudrendra vahnimāṃsāda varuṇānilagocare |
hiraṇyādyāḥ sthitā vahne rasanāḥ ṣaḍanukramāt ||

madhyato bahurūpā tviti |

vāyavīyasaṃhitāyām (-)

hiraṇyā prāgudag jihvā kanakā pūrvataḥ sthitā |
raktāgneyī naiṛtī ca kṛṣṇā'nyā suprabhā matā ||

atiraktā marujjihvā svanāmasvaguṇaprabhā |
triśikhā madhyamā jihvā bahurūpā samāhvayā ||

tacchikhaikā dakṣiṇato jvalantī vāmataḥ parā |
svabījānantaraṃ vācyā iti ||

gaṇeśvaravimarśiṇyāmapi (-)

kroṇaṣaṭke ca madhye ca jihvāḥ saṃpūjayet tataḥ |
hiraṇyā taptahemābhā śūlapāṇidiśi sthitā ||

vaidūryavarṇā gaganā prācyāṃ diśi vyavasthitā |
taruṇādityasaṃkāśā raktā jihvā'gnidiksthitā ||

<85> kṛṣṇā nīlābjasaṅkāśā nairṛtyāṃ diśi saṃsthitā |
suprabhā padmarāgābhā vāruṇyāṃ diśi saṃsthitā ||

atiraktā javābhāsā vāyavyāṃ diśi saṃsthitā |
bahurūpā yathārthābhā dakṣiṇottarasaṃsthitā ||

etā jvālā rucāvītā varābhayakarā api |

tripurāsārasamuccaye'pi (-)

sutaptacāmīkaracāruvarṇā sthitā hiraṇyā diśi śūlapāṇeḥ |
vaidūryavarṇā kanakābhidhānā yā sā niṣaṇṇā diśi vāsavasya ||

yā raktā taruṇā divākarābhavarṇā sā jihvā hariti susaṃsthitā kṛśānoḥ |
yā kṛṣṇā vikasitanīlanīrajābhā sā rakṣaḥparivṛtadigvibhāgalagnā ||

padmarāgasadṛśaprabhojvalā suprabhā varuṇadiśyavasthitā |
yā mahārajatapuṣpasaṃnibhā gandhavāhadiśi sā'tiraktikā ||

yathārthasaṃjñā bahurūpikā sā jihvottare dakṣiṇataḥ sthitā sā |

home'pi viśeṣa ukto gaṇeśvaravimarśiṇyām (-)

edhāṃsi ca hiraṇyāyāṃ gaganāyāṃ caruṃ ghṛtam |
siddhārthaṃ bahurūpāyāṃ raktāyāntu yavāṃstathā ||

kṛṣṇāyāntu hunellājaiḥ suprabhāyāntu śaktubhiḥ |
tilāṃścaivā'tirāktāyāṃ kanakāyāntu sarvadā |
sarvadravyāṇi juhuyāt sādhakaḥ sarvakarmasu ||

tantrāntare (-) phalaṃ tu kāmabhedena kramādāsāmudīryate |
vaśyākarṣaṇayorādyā gaganā stambhane matā ||

vidveṣamohayo raktā kṛṣṇā māraṇakarmaṇi |
suprabhā śāntike puṣṭau suraktoccāṭane matā ||

ekaiva bahurūpā tu sarvakāmaphalapradā |
śāradāyām (-) kesareṣūktamārgeṇa pūjayedaṅgadevatāḥ |
daleṣu pūjayenmūrtīḥ śaktisvastikadhāriṇīḥ |
lokapālāṃstato dikṣu pūjayeduktalakṣaṇān ||

atra lokapālapūjā mekhalāsthadarbhopari kāryā | taduktaṃ tantrāntare (-)

koṇaṣaṭke ca madhye ca jihvābhiḥ keśareṣvapi |
aṅgamantraistato bāhye aṣṭābhirmūrtibhiḥ kramāt |
<86> mekhalāśritadarbheṣu dikpatīn pūrvato yajet ||

tattvasārasaṃhitāyām

pātrāṇyāsādya vidhivad dvandvaśaścāpi mantravit |
tānyavekṣya pavitreṇa cottānāni vidhāya ca ||

punaḥ prakṣālayet pātraṃ paripūrya śubhāmbunā |
dattvā'kṣatān pavitraṃ ca tadutpūya nidhāpayet ||

diśyuttarasyā tatpātraṃ praṇītetyucyate budhaiḥ |
tataḥ kiñcit praṇītāmbu prokṣaṇyādāya tajjalaiḥ ||

yajñasādhanasambhāraṃ prokṣayenmūlamantrataḥ |
tato brahmāṇamāvāhyā'bhyarcayenmūlamantrataḥ ||

anyatrāpi (-) vāme cāstīrya darbhān balaripuharidagrāṃstadūrdhvaṃ nidhāya 
pātrāṇi dvandvaśo'dhovadanamatha tathottānavaktrāṇi kṛtvā |
hṛnmantreṇābhipūryānyatamamatha jalairmantrapūtairathaibhi (-)
rabhyukṣyā'nyaiśca kūrcaiḥ sakalamapi hṛdā savyagaṃ havyajātam || iti

tantrāntare (-) svavāmabhāge prāgagrān darbhānāstīrya copari |
yathāvittānusāreṇa sauvarṇādīni karmaṇi ||

adhomukhāni pātrāṇi dvandvarūpeṇa vinyaset |
uttānīkṛtya pātrāṇi jalādyaiḥ saṃprapūrayet ||

tripurāsārasamuccaye (-)

tato vāmabhāge paristīrya darbhān pulomātmajāvallabhāśāgatāgrān |
tadūrdhvaṃ nyased dvandvarūpeṇa pātrāṇyathādhogatāsyāni sarvāṇi 
dhīmān ||

athottāniteṣveṣu pātreṣu pātraṃ jalairekamāpūrya tīrthāni tatra |
susañcintya taiḥ prokṣayet kūrcadarbhairhṛdā savyabhāge sthitaṃ dravyajātam ||

pātreṣvapi viśeṣastatraiva (-)

sauvarṇānyapi rājatānyapi tathā pātrāṇi śolvāni vā |
mṛtpātrāṇyapi śāntikādiṣu paraṃ śastāni karmasviha |
śelvakṣadrumaśigrubhūruhakṛtānyetāni vidveṣaṇo (-)
ccāṭotsādanamāraṇādiṣu bhṛśaṃ śastāni pātrāṇyapi ||

śaulvaṃ tāmram | śelurbahuvārakaḥ | akṣadrumo vibhītakadrumaḥ | śigruḥ 
śobhāñjanaḥ | 
śāradāyām (-) paścādādāya pāṇibhyāṃ sruksruvau tāvadhomukhau |

<87> triśaḥ pratāpayed vahnau darbhānādāya deśikaḥ ||

tadagramadhyamūlāni śodhayet tairyathākramāt |
gṛhītvā vāmahastena prokṣayed dakṣiṇena tau ||

punaḥ pratāpya tau mantrī darbhānagnau vinikṣipet |
ātmanā dakṣiṇe bhāge sthāpyet tau kuśāstare ||

tantrāntare (-) gṛhītvā sruksruvāvūrdhvamukhau cādhomukhau kramāt |
pratāpyā'gnau tridhā darbhamūlamadhyāgrakaiḥ spṛśet ||

punastriśaḥ pratāpyā'dhomukhāvagnau kuśān kṣipet |
mūlamadhyāgrake nyasyecchaktīricchādikāḥ kramāt ||

sruci śaktiṃ sruve śambhuṃ vinyased hṛdayāṇunā |

icchādikā iti icchājñānakriyā ityarthaḥ | śaivāgame (-)

gṛhītvā sruksruvāvūrdhvavaktrāvadhomukhau kramāt |
pratāpyā'gnau tridhā darbhamūlamadhyāgrakaiḥ spṛśet ||

trisūtraveṣṭitagrīvau pūjitau kusumādibhiḥ |
kuśānāmupariṣṭāttau sthāpayitvā svadakṣiṇe || ityuktam |

śāradāyām (-) ājyasthālīmathādāya prokṣayedastravāriṇā |
tasyāmājyaṃ vinikṣipya saṃskṛtaṃ vīkṣaṇadibhiḥ ||

tantrāntare (-) gavyamājyaṃ samādāya mūlenaivā'bhimantritam |
svakāṃ brahmamayīṃ mūrtiṃ sañcintyā'gnau pratāpayet ||

śaivāgame'pi (-) gavyamājyaṃ samādāya mūlamantrābhimantritam |
svakāṃ brahmamayīṃ mūrttiṃ sañcintya ceti ||

gavyamityuttamakalpamabhipretyoktam | taduktaṃ piṅgalāmate (-)

uttamaṃ goghṛtaṃ proktaṃ madhyamaṃ mahiṣībhavam |
adhamaṃ chāgalījātaṃ tasmād gavyaṃ praśasyate || iti |

vāyavīyasaṃhitāyām (-) nyasya mantraṃ ghṛte mudrāṃ darśayed 
dhenusaṃjñikām |
śāradāyām (-) niruhya vāyavyeṅgārān hṛdā teṣu niveśayet |
idaṃ tāpanamuddiṣṭaṃ deśikaistantravedibhiḥ ||

sandīpya darbhayugalamājye kṣiptvā'nale kṣipet |
gururhṛdayamantreṇa pavitrīkaraṇantvidam ||

dīptena darbhayugmena nīrājyā'jyaṃ savarmaṇā |
<88> agnau visarjayed darbhamabhidyotanamīritam ||

ghṛte prajvalitān darbhān pradarśyā'strāṇunā guruḥ |
jātavedasi tān nyasyedudyotanamidaṃ matam ||

gṛhītvā ghṛtamaṅgārān pratyūhyā'gnau jalaṃ spṛśet |
aṅguṣṭhopakaniṣṭhābhyāṃ darbhau pādeśasammitau ||

dhṛtvotpunīyādastreṇa ghṛtamutpavanaṃ tvidam |
tadvaddhṛdayamantreṇa kuśābhyāmātmasammukham ||

ghṛte saṃplavanaṃ kuryāt saṃskārāḥ ṣaḍudīritāḥ |

	aṅguṣṭhopakaniṣṭhābhyāmiti | hastadvayasyeti śeṣaḥ | utpunīyāditi | 
agnisammukhamiti śeṣaḥ | taduktaṃ śaivāgame (-)

prādeśamātradarbhābhyāmaṅguṣṭhānāmikāgrakaiḥ |
ghṛtābhyāṃ sammukhaṃ vahnerastreṇotplavamācaret || iti |

śāradāyām (-) prādeśamātraṃ sagranthi darbhayugmaṃ ghṛtāntare |
nikṣipya bhāgau dvau kṛtvā pakṣau śukletarau smaret ||

vāme nāḍīmiḍāṃ bhāge dakṣiṇe piṅgalāṃ punaḥ |
suṣumṇāṃ madhyato dhyātvā kuryāddhomaṃ yathāvidhi ||

tatra sruksruvadhāraṇaprakāro nāradīye

hīyate yajamāno vai sruvamūlasya darśanāt |
tasmāt saṃgopayenmūlaṃ homakāle sruvasya ca ||

agre vyādhikaraṃ proktaṃ madhye śokakaraṃ smṛtam |
mūle hānikaraṃ proktaṃ sruvaṃ dhārayate katham ||

vedāṅgulaṃ parityajya agre caiva dviraṣṭakam |
vedāṅgulaṃ tu tanmadhye dhārayecchaṅkhamudrayā ||

homasāre (-) mūlāt ṣaḍaṅgulaṃ tyaktvā caturaṅgulameva vā |
prakoṣṭhe mūlamācchādya dhārayecchaṅkhamudrayā ||

śāradāyām (-) sruveṇa dakṣiṇād bhāgādādāyā'jyaṃ hṛdā guruḥ |
juhuyādagnaye svāhetyagnerdakṣiṇalocane ||

vāmatastadvadādāya vāme vahnivilocane |
juhuyādatha somāya svāheti hṛdayāṇunā ||

madhyādājyaṃ samādāya vahnerbhālavilocane |
<89> juhuyādagnīṣomābhyāṃ svāheti hṛdayāṇunā ||

hṛnmantreṇa sruveṇā'jyaṃ bhāgādādāya dakṣiṇāt |
juhuyādagnaye sviṣṭikṛte svāheti tanmukhe |
heti sampātayed bhāge svājyasyā'nvāhutikramāt ||

ityagninetravaktrāṇāṃ kuryādudghāṭanaṃ guruḥ |

sampātayed bhāga iti | yasmād bhāgādājyaṃ gṛhītvā hutaṃ tadbhāge 
hutaśeṣaṃ kṣipedityarthaḥ | taduktaṃ śaivāgame (-)

(----------------------------) sruveṇādāya homayet |
svetyagnau heti tadbhāge śeṣamājyaṃ kṣipet kramāt || iti |
śāradāyām (-) satārābhirvyāhṛtibhirājyena juhuyāt punaḥ |

atra oṃ svāhā bhūḥ svāhā bhuvaḥ svāhā svaḥ svāhā oṃ bhūrbhuvaḥ svāheti 
vyastasamastābhiḥ pañcāhutayaḥ | pañcabhirmanubhirhunediti 
nārāyaṇīyatantravacanāt |

uḍḍīśe tu (-) devyā vyāhṛtihomaśca tārādyena caturhunet |
bhūragnaye pṛthivyai ca mahate vahnivallabhā ||

bhuvaḥ padād vāyave ca antarīkṣāya śabdataḥ |
divyāya mahate caiva vahnijāyāvadhiḥ smṛtaḥ ||

svarādityacandramasau ṅentau nakṣapadāt tataḥ |
trebhyaḥ svāhāpadāntaśca bhūrbhuvaḥsvaḥ padaṃ tataḥ ||

agnyādityacandramaso ṅentā nakṣatra ityapi |
bhyasantaścaiva digbhyaśca mahate vahnivallabhā ||

śāradāyām (-) juhuyādagnimantreṇa trivāraṃ deśikottamaḥ |
garbhādhānādikā vahneḥ kriyā nirvarttayet kramāt ||

aṣṭābhirājyāhutibhiḥ praṇavena pṛthak pṛthak |
garbhādhānaṃ puṃsavanaṃ sīmantonnayanaṃ punaḥ ||

anantaraṃ jātakarma syānnāmakaraṇaṃ tathā |
upaniṣkramaṇaṃ paścādannaprāśanamīritam ||

caulopanayane bhūyo mahānāmnyaṃ mahāvratam |
athopaniṣadaṃ paścād godānodvāhakau mṛtiḥ ||

śubheṣu syurvivāhāntāḥ kriyāstāḥ krūrakarmasu |
maraṇāntāḥ samuddiṣṭā vahnerāgamavedibhiḥ ||

<90> tataśca pitarā tasya sampūjyātmani yojayet |
samidhaḥ pañca juhuyānmūlāgraghṛtasaplutāḥ ||

uḍḍiśe (-) idamagneḥ karomyatra garbhādhānamiti kramāt |
praṇavaṃ pūrvamuddhṛtya śeṣe vahnivadhūṃ vadet ||

hutvā saptāhutīrevaṃ samidhāṃ kṣepaṇaṃ tathā |
evaṃ kramāt puṃsavanaṃ sīmantonnayanaṃ tathā ||

jātakarma samāpyā'tha śramāpanodanāya ca |
oṃ kāmeśvarakāmeśībhyāṃ svāheti trirvinikṣipet ||

vahniśca pitarau mantrī svadehe viniyojayet |
iṣṭadevasya nāmnā tu vahnernāma samācaret ||

kāmeśvarakāmeśvarībhyāmiti tu śrīvidyāyām | anyatra 
vāgīśvaravāgīśvarībhyāmiti jñeyam | tūrṇāyāge (-)

ājyāhutyaṣṭakaṃ hutvā nāmakarma samācaret |
deśikastvamuko'sīti mūlamantreṇa kalpayet |

vāyavīyasaṃhitāyām (-)

jātaṃ dhyātvaivamākāraṃ jātakarma samācaret |
nālāpanayanaṃ kṛtvā tataḥ saṃśodhya sūtakam ||

śivāgniriti nāmāsya kṛtvā'hutipuraḥsaram |
pitrorvisarjanaṃ kṛtvā caulopanayanādikam ||

athodvāhāvasānañca kṛtvā saṃskāramasya tu ||

nālāpanayanaprakārastu śaivāgame (-)

vahnerihā'stramantreṇa tato nālāpanuttaye |
samidhaḥ pañca juhuyāt prānte mūle ghṛtāplutāḥ || iti |

vāyavīyasaṃhitāyām (-)

tāḥ pālāśyaḥ parā vāpi yajñīyā dvādaśāṅgulāḥ |
avakrā na svayaṃ śuṣkāḥ satvaco nirvraṇāḥ samāḥ ||

daśāṅgulā vā vihitāḥ kaniṣṭhāṅgulisammitāḥ |
prādeśamātrā vā'lābhe hotavyāḥ sakalā apīti ||

evañca sakalasaṃskāraśeṣe tatpitrorvisarjanaṃ nālāpanayanīye 
pañcasamiddhomañca vadan śāradākāro vadhnā(?)maiva | atha godānānantaraṃ 
samāvartanamapi karttavyam | taduktaṃ

<91> gaṇeśvaravimarśinyām (-) samāvartanamudvāhamādhānañca tataḥ paramiti |
tripurāsāre'pi (-) tenaiva samāvarttanavivāhayorāhutīrjuhuyāt |

śāradāyām (-) mantrairjihvāṅgamūrtīnāṃ kramād vahneryathāvidhi |
pratyekaṃ juhuyādekāmāhutiṃ mantravittamaḥ ||

gaṇeśvaravimarśinyām (-)

juhuyādaṅgamantrādyaistārādyaiśca sakṛt sakṛt |
tattatsthāneṣu śitadhīḥ svāhāntaiśca yathākramam ||

atrā'dyapadena lokapālatadastrāṇāṃ grahaṇaṃ | śāradāyām (-)

avadāya sruveṇājyaṃ catuḥ sruci pidhāya tām |
sruveṇa tiṣṭhannevā'gnau deśiko yatamānasaḥ ||

juhuyād vahnimantreṇa vauṣaḍantena sampade |

śaivāgame tu viśeṣaḥ (-) ghṛtena sruci pūrṇāyāṃ nidhāyā'dhomukhaṃ 
sruvam |
śṛṅgāgre puṣpamāropya paścād vāmena pāṇinā ||

punaḥ savyena tau dhṛtvā śaṅkhasannibhamudrayā |
samudgatordhvakāyaśca samapādaḥ samutthitaḥ ||

nābhau tanmūlamādhāya śṛṅgāgre vyagralocanaḥ |
vāmastanāntamānīya tayormūlamatandritaḥ || iti |

gaṇeśvara vimarśinyām (-)

mahāgaṇeśamantreṇa pūrvapūrvayutena ca |
tārādibījaṣaṭkeṣu karaṇeṣvadrivarṇakaiḥ ||

bhinneṣu daśadhā hutvā samastena sureśvari |

prapañcasāre'pi (-) tārādyairdaśabhirbhedaiḥ pūrvapūrvasamanvitaiḥ |
manunā gāṇapatyena juhuyācca daśāhutīḥ ||

juhuyācca caturvāraṃ samastenaiva tena tu |
tanmantrastṛḍḍīśe (-) praṇavaṃ śrīrmahāmāyā smaraṃ glaumātmakaṃ punaḥ 
|
pañcāntakaṃ binduyutaṃ ṅentaṃ gaṇapatiṃ tataḥ ||

varānte varade ceti sarvānte jayamālikhet |
me vaśamānaya svāhā viṃśatyarṇau gajāntakaḥ ||

śāradāyām (-) tataḥ pīṭhaṃ samabhyarcya devatāyā hutāśane |
arcayed vahnirūpāṃ tāṃ devatāmiṣṭadāyinīm ||

<92> vīracūḍāmaṇau tu (-) paścātpīṭhadevatānāmekaikājyāhutīstataḥ |
arcayed vahnirūpāṃ tāṃ gandhapuṣpādibhiḥ kramāt ||

ityuktam | tenādhāraśaktyādipīṭhamantrāntaṃ sampūjya ekaikāmāhutiṃ 
dattvā iṣṭa devatāṃ tatrāvāhyopacāraiḥ sampūjyāvaraṇadevatā api 
pūjayediti siddham | uḍḍīśe (-)

vahnimukhe yantrarājaṃ raśmijālasamanvitam |
vibhāvyārādhayenmantrī śrīmattripurasundarīm ||

tathā (-) tata āvṛttadevānāmekaikāmāhutiṃ hunet |
saṅkalpañca tataḥ kṛtvā kāmyahomaṃ samācaret ||

svāhāntaṃ mūlamuccārya devatāyai tvidaṃ bruvan |
juhuyājjvālite vahnau saṃkhyā ca paritaścaret ||

śāradāyām (-) tanmukhe juhuyānmantrī pañcaviṃśatisaṃkhyayā |
ājyena mūlamantreṇa vaktraikīkaraṇaṃ tvidam ||

śaivāgame (-) itīṣṭavaktre vaktrāṇāmantarbhāvastu caikatā |
athavā kuṇḍamānatvaṃ yadīṣṭavadane smaret ||
antarbhāvyāni vaktrāṇi tadekīkaraṇaṃ matam |
vahnidaivatayoraikyamātmanā saha bhāvayen |
mūlamantreṇa juhuyādājyenaikādaśāhutīḥ ||

nāḍīsandhānamuddiṣṭametadāgamavedibhiḥ |
juhuyādaṅgamukhyānāmāvṛtīnāmanukramāt ||

ekaikāmāhutiṃ samyak sarpiṣā deśikottamaḥ |
ante mūlena daśāhutayo deyāḥ | taduktaṃ tripurāsāre (-)

parivārasyaikaikāṃ devyāstu daśāhutīrjuhuyāt |

ityadhivāsavidhiḥ

atha dinakṛtyam

śāradāyām (-) prātarutthāya juhuyuḥ punarājyānvitaistilaiḥ |
dravyairvā kalpavihitaiḥ sahasraṃ sāṣṭakaṃ pṛthak ||

juhuyuriti | ācārya ṛtvijaścatyarthaḥ | atra tilādayaḥ sruveṇa kareṇa vā hotavyāḥ 
| taduktaṃ vāyavīyasaṃhitāyām (-)

sruveṇājyaṃ samitpāṇyā srucā śeṣaṃ kareṇa vā |
tatra divyena hotavyaṃ tīrthenārṣeṇa vā tatheti ||

<93> mahākapilapañcarātre (-) apradīpte na hotavyaṃ madhyame cāpyanindhite |
pradīpte lelihāne'gnau hotavyaṃ karmasiddhaye ||

ahvṛcapariśiṣṭe'pi (-)

adhomukhaḥ sadhūme tu juhuyād yo hutāśane |
yajamāno bhavedandhaḥ suputra iti ca śrutiḥ ||

chandogapariśiṣṭe'pi (-)

yo'narcipi juhotyagnau vyaṅgāriṇi ca mānavaḥ |
mandāgnirāmayāvī ca daridraścopajāyate ||

tripurāsāre (-) agneḥ karṇe homato vyādhivādhānetre'ndhatvaṃ 
nāsikāyāmathādhiḥ |
dravyacchedo mastake syānmukhāntarhomaṃ kuryāt tena nityaṃ vipaśvit ||

tantrāntare (-) yataḥ kāṣṭhaṃ tataḥ śrotraṃ yatra dhūmo'tra nāsikā |
yatrā'lpajvalanaṃ netraṃ yatrāṅgārastataḥ śiraḥ ||

yatra prajvalitā jvālā jihvā sā jātavedasaḥ |
anyatrāpi (-) sadhūmo'gniḥ śiro jñeyaṃ nirdhūmaścakṣareva ca |
jvalatkṛśo bhavet karṇaḥ kāṣṭhalagnaśca nāsikā ||

agnirjvālāyate yatra śuddhasphaṭikasannibhaḥ |
tanmukhaṃ tatra vijñeyaṃ caturaṅgulamānataḥ ||

vanadurgākalpe (-) yatra kāṣṭhaṃ tatra śrotre yatra dhūmastu nāsike |
yatrā'lpajvalanaṃ netraṃ yatra bhasma tu tacchiraḥ ||

yatraiva jvalito vahnistatra jihvā prakīrtitā |
śāradāyām (-) vaiśvānaraṃ sthitaṃ dhyāyet samiddhomeṣu deśikaḥ |
śayānamājyahomeṣu niṣaṇṇaṃ śeṣavastuṣu ||

tathā (-) svarṇasindūrabālārka kuṅkumakṣaudrasannibhaḥ |
suvarṇaretaso varṇaḥ śobhanaḥ parikīrtitaḥ ||

bherīvāridahastīndra dhvanirvahneḥ śubhāvahaḥ |
nāgacampakapunnāga pāṭalāyūdhikānibhaḥ ||

padmendīvarakalhāra sarpirguggulusannibhaḥ |
pāvakasya śubho gandha ityuktastantravedibhiḥ ||

pradakṣiṇāstyaktakampāśchatrābhāḥ śikhinaḥ śikhāḥ |
śubhadā yajamānasya rājyasyāpi viśeṣataḥ ||

<94> kundedudhavalo dhūmo vahneḥ proktaḥ śubhāvahaḥ |
kṛṣṇaḥ kṛṣṇagatervarṇo yajamānaṃ vināśayet ||

śveto rājyaṃ nihatyāśu vāyasasvarasannibhaḥ |
kharasvarasamo vahnerdhvaniḥ sarvavināśakṛt ||

pūtigandho hutabhujo hoturduḥkhaprado bhavet |
chinnavṛttāṃ śikhāṃ kuryānmṛtyuṃ dhanaparikṣayam ||

śukapakṣanibho dhūmaḥ pārāvatasamaprabhaḥ |
hāniṃ turagajātīnāṃ gavāñca kurute cirāt ||

evaṃvidheṣu doṣeṣu prāyaścittāya deśikaḥ |
mūlenājyena juhuyātpañcaviṃśatimāhutim ||

tripurāsāre tu (-) vasvadhikaṃ śatamājyairjuhuyācchāntikamamīṣu doṣeṣu |
astreṇa sādhakendrastanuyādatha cakrapūjāṃ ca || ityuktam |
śāradāyām (-) tataḥ sudhautadantāsyaṃ snātaṃ śiṣyaṃ samāhitam |
pāyayitvā pañcagavyaṃ kuṇḍasyāntikamānayet ||

prayogasāre (-) pañcagavyaṃ yathāproktaṃ pītvācāntaṃ yathāvidhi |
dvāreṇa dakṣiṇenā'tha yāgasthānaṃ praveśayet ||

śāradāyām (-) vilokya divyadṛṣṭyā taṃ taccaitanyaṃ hṛdambujāt |
gururātmani saṃyojya kuryādadhvaviśodhanam ||

tantrāntare (-) hṛdi sthitaṃ taccaitanyaṃ prasphurattārakākṛtim |
ādāya sthāpayet svīye hṛdaye'ṅkuśamudrayā ||

ṣaḍanvayamahāratne (-) śodhanaṃ nāma tattvānāṃ kāraṇaikatvacintanam |
varṇādīnāṃ kalānāñca tasyāṃ cidaikyacintanam ||

athādhvaśodhanam

śāradāyām (-) uktaṃ kalādhvā tattvādhvā bhuvanādhveti ca trayam |
varṇādhvā ca padādhvā ca mantrādhvetyaparaṃ trayam ||

vāyavīyasaṃhitāyāṃ (-) atra śabdāstrayo'dhvānastrayastvarthāḥ samīritāḥ |
tantrāntare (-) mantrādhvā ca padādhvā ca varṇādhveti ca śabdataḥ |
bhuvanādhvā ca tattvādhvā kalādhvā cārthatastridhā ||

atra tu saṃhārakrameṇoktiḥ | śāradāyāntu sṛṣṭikrameṇeti jñeyam |
śāradāyām (-) nivṛttādyāḥ kalāḥ pañca kalādhveti prakīrtitaḥ ||

<95> tattvādhvā bahudhā bhinnāḥ saivādyāgamabhedataḥ |
ṣaṭtriṃśacchaivatattvāni dvātriṃśadvaiṣṇavāni tu ||

caturviṃśatitattvāni maitrāṇi prakṛteḥ punaḥ |
uktāni daśatattvāni sapta ca tripadātmanaḥ ||

tattvāni śaivānyucyante śivaḥ śaktiḥ sadāśivaḥ |
īśvaro vidyayā sārdhaṃ pañca śuddhānyamūni hi ||

māyā kālaśca niyatiḥ kalā vidyā punaḥ smṛtiḥ |
rāgaḥ puruṣa etāni śuddhāśudhāni sapta ca |
prakṛtirbuddhyahaṅkārau mano jñānendriyāṇyatha ||

karmendriyāṇi tanmātrā pañcabhūtāni deśikāḥ |
etānyāhuraśuddhāni caturviṃśatimāgame ||

śaivānāmapi tattvānāṃ vibhāgo'tra pradarśitaḥ |

śuddhānīti (-) āṇava kārmaṇa māyīya malatrayarahitatvaṃ śuddhatvaṃ | tatra 
āṇave nāma sadāśivatvena svasyānavamarśaḥ | kārmaṇo nāma 
puṇyapāpavānahamiti pratītiḥ māyīyo nāma ahaṅkārādāvātmabuddhiḥ | 
śuddhāśuddhānīti | kāraṇatvena malatrayarāhityā cchuddhāni | 
kāryarūpatvena tadyuktatvādaśuddhānītyarthaḥ |

tathā (-) jīvaprāṇadhiyaścittaṃ jñānakarmendriyāṇyatha |
tanmātrāḥ pañcabhūtāni hṛtpadmaṃ tejasāṃ trayam ||

vāsudevādayaśceti tattvānyetāni śārṅgiṇaḥ |
pañcabhūtāni tanmātrā indriyāṇi manastathā ||

garvo buddhiḥ pradhānañca maitrāṇīti vidurbudhāḥ |
nivṛttādyāḥ kalāḥ pañca tata binduḥ kalā punaḥ ||

nādaḥ śaktiḥ sadāpūrvaḥ śivaśca prakṛterviduḥ |
ātmavidyā śivaḥ paścācchivo vidyā svayaṃ punaḥ ||

sarvatattvaṃ ca tattvāni proktāni tripadātmanaḥ |
tattvādhvā kathito hyeṣaḥ tattadāgamavedibhiḥ ||

īrito bhuvanādhveti bhuvanāni manīṣibhiḥ |

bhuvanāni caturdaśa | bhuvanādhveti kathito bhuvanāni caturdaśeti gautamīyatantra 
vacanāt | vāyavīyasaṃhitāyāntu (-)

ādhārādyunmanyantaṃ ca bhuvanādhvā prakīrtitaḥ | ityuktam |

<96> tathā varṇādhveti vadantyarṇānādikṣāntānmanīṣiṇaḥ |
varṇasiṃhaḥ padādhvā syānmantrādhvā mantrarāśayaḥ ||

vāyavīyasaṃhitāyāntu (-)

anekabhedasaṃbhinnaḥ padādhvā padasaṃhatiḥ |
mahāmantropamantrāṇāṃ varttate'vayavātmanā ||

pradhānāvayavatvena so'dhvā pañcapadātmakaḥ |

gautamīye'pi (-) padādhvā padasamūhaḥ syādityuktam | mantrarāśaya iti | 
vaidikatāntrikamantrasamūhaḥ (-) mantrādhvā mantrarāśiḥ syātte hi 
vaidikatāntrikāḥ |

iti gautamīyavacanāt | śāradāyām (-)

kramādetādadhvanaḥ ṣaṭ śodhayed gurusattamaḥ |
padāndhunābhihṛdbhāla mūrdhvasvapi śiśoḥ smaret ||

tataḥ kūrcena vidhivat taṃ spṛśan juhuyād guruḥ |
ācāryakuṇḍe saṃśuddhaistilairājyapariplutaiḥ ||

śodhayāmyamumadhvānaṃ svāheti pṛthagadhvanā |
tārādyamāhutīraṣṭau kramāt tān vilayaṃ nayet ||

śive śivāt tān saṃlīnān janayet sṛṣṭimārgataḥ |
vilokayan divyadṛṣṭyā taṃ śiśuṃ deśikottamaḥ ||

ātmasthitaṃ taccaitanyaṃ punaḥ śiṣye niyojayet |
kulārṇave (-) śūdrasaṃkarajātīnāṃ nādhvaśuddhirvidhīyate |
pādodakapradānādyaiḥ kuryātpāpavimocanan ||

śāradāyām (-) srucā pūrṇāhutiṃ dattvā mūlamantreṇa deśikaḥ |

vāyavīyasaṃhitāyām (-)

tato homāvaśiṣṭena ghṛtenāpūrya vai srucam |
nidhāya puṣpaṃ tasyāgre sruveṇā'dhomukhena tām ||

sadarbheṇa samācchādya mūlenā'ñjalinotthitaḥ |
vauṣaḍantena juhuyāt dhārāṃ tu yavasammitām ||

hayaśīrṣapañcarātre (-) hutvā ca haviṣā dadyāt srucā pūrṇāhutitrayam |
vauṣaḍantena mantreṇa (---------------------) || iti |

nāradapañcarātre (-) abhāve tu ghṛtasyaiva homadravyeṇa pūrayet |
tasyopari ghṛtaṃ dadyāt tadūrdhvaṃ kuṅkumādikam

<97> tūrṇāyāge (-) mūlaṃ namo'ntamuccārya vāmapādapuraḥsaram |
dadyāt pūrṇāhutiṃ mantrī parāmṛtadhiyā tataḥ ||

atreṣṭadevatāvaraṇadevatābhya ekaikāmāhutiṃ prayacchati | gautamīyatantre (-)

sruksruvau ca samādāya ghṛtenāpūrya tatpunaḥ |
homadravyāṇi niḥkṣipya nābhau saṃsthāpya tau punaḥ ||

brahmārpaṇena manunā dadyāt pūrṇāhutiṃ punaḥ |

itaḥpūrvaṃ prāṇabuddhidehadharmādhikārato jāgratsvapnasuṣuptyavasthāsu 
manasā vācā karmaṇā hastābhyāṃ padbhyāmudareṇa śikṣā yat smṛtaṃ 
yaduktaṃ yat kṛtaṃ tat sarvaṃ brahmārpaṇaṃ bhavatu svāhā |

brahmārpaṇamanuḥ so'yaṃ brahmārpaṇavidhau smṛtaḥ |
evaṃ homavidhiṃ kṛtvā kuṇḍasthaṇḍiladevatāḥ ||

dikpāladevatāścāpi aṅkurārpaṇadevatāḥ |
ānayet kalaśe cāpi kṛṣṇaikyaṃ bhāvayed guruḥ ||

kṛṣṇeti | prakṛtābhiprāyeṇa | śāradāyām (-)

udvāsya devatāṃ kumbhe sāṅgāṃ sāvaraṇāṃ guruḥ |
punarvyāhṛtibhirhutvā jihvādīnāṃ vibhāvasoḥ ||

ekaikāmāhutiṃ dattvā pariṣicyā'dbhirātmani |
pāvakaṃ yojayitvā sve paridhīn saparistarān ||

naimittike dahenmantrī nitye tu na dahedimān |

vyāhṛtibhirmahāvyāhṛtibhiḥ punaḥ samāpayeddhomaṃ 
mahāvyāhṛtipūrvakamiti vacanāt | tatprakārastu gautamīye (-)

pūrṇāhutiṃ tato dadyādadbhiścaiva vidhānavit |
oṃ bhūragnaye pṛthivyai ca mahate svāhayā tathā ||

bhuvo vāyave cāntarīkṣāya mahate svāhayā tataḥ |
svaścandramase digbhyaśca nakṣatrebhyaśca svāhā ||

oṃ bhūrbhuvaḥsvaścandramase nakṣatrebhyo digbhyaśca mahate svāhā | pāvakaṃ 
yojayitveti tatprakārastu gaṇeśvaravimarśiṇyām (-)

bho bho vahne mahāśakte sarvakarmaprasādhaka |
karmāntare'pi samprāpte sannidhiṃ kuru sādaram ||

iti mantreṇa saṃprārthya vahnimudvāsayedapīti |
<98> śāradāyām (-) netre śiṣyasya badhnīyān netramantreṇa vāsasā |
