kalaśe devatāprītyai kṣepayenmūlamuccaran |
nārāyaṇīye (-) nyāsaṃ śiṣyatanau kṛtvā taṃ pradakṣiṇamānayet |
paścimadvāramānīya kṣepayet kusumāñjalim ||

piṅgalāmate (-) puṣpairañjalimāpūrya yogapīṭhe pradāpayet |
paścimottararudraindre puṣpapātaḥ śubho'śubhe ||

ātmayāgakramād bhūyaḥ saṃhṛtyotpādya deśikaḥ |
tattanmantroditān nyāsān kuryād dehe śiśostadā ||

ātmayāgo bhūtaśuddhiḥ | prayogasāre (-)

guṇāṃśena pṛthivyādibhūtāni vilayaṃ nayet |
