śāradāyām (-) pañcopacāraiḥ kumbhasthāṃ pūjayitveṣṭadevatām |
tasyāstantroktamārgeṇa vidadhyāt sakalīkṛtim ||

etadanantaraṃ devatāsakāśād varaprārthanamuktamācāryaiḥ (-)

kāruṇyanilaye devi sarvasannidhisaṃśraye |
śaraṇyavatsale mātaḥ kṛpāmasmin śiśau kuru ||

āṇavapramukhaiḥ pāśaiḥ pāśitasya sureśvari |
dīnasyāsya dayādhāre kuru kāruṇyamīśvari ||

aihikāmuṣmikairbhogairapi saṃbardhyatāmasau |
svabhaktiḥ sakalā cāsmai dīyatāṃ niṣkalāśraye || iti |

prayogasāre (-) athaiśānyāṃ diśi yadā mantravin nyastavigraham |
pīṭhasya caturasrāyāṃ vedyāṃ darbhāgrapāṇinā ||

<99> abhiṣiñcet svakaṃ śiṣyamātmatatvānuvartinam |
somaśambhau (-) yāgālayād diśīśasya racite snānamaṇḍape |
kuryāt karadvayāyāmāṃ vedimaṣṭāṅgulocchritām ||

śrīparṇyādyāsane tatra vinyasyānatamāsane |
śiṣyaṃ niveśya pūrvāsyaṃ sakalīkṛtya pūjayet ||

tatraiva (-) snāne tūdanmukhaṃ muktau pūrvavaktraṃ ca bhuktaye |
anyatrāpi (-) maṇḍalaṃ tvīśadik kṛtvā mumukṣūnuttarānanān |
bhuktaye pūrvavaktrāṃśca śiṣyāṃstatra niveśayet |

śāradāyām (-) tadatsu pañcavādyeṣu sārdhaṃ viprāśiṣā guruḥ |
vidhivat kumbhamuddhṛtya tanmukhasthān suradrumān |
śiśoḥ śirasi vinyasya mātṛkāṃ manasā japan |
mūlena sādhitaistoyairabhiṣiñcet tamātmavit ||

mātṛkāṃ vilomamātṛkām | 
kṣādyairāntairarṇairabhipūrṇatattvastriruktamantrādyairiti dīpikāvacanāt |

śiṣyaśirasi saṃyojya vilomamātṛkāṃ japan |
mūlamantraṃ tathā japtvā kuryād devābhiṣecanam ||

iti gautamīyavacanācca | tathā (-)

pūjitāṃ punarādāya vardhanīmastrarūpiṇīm |
tasyāḥ susādhitaistoyaiḥ siñcedrakṣārthamañjasā ||

avaśiṣṭena toyena śiṣyamācāmayed guruḥ |
tatastaṃ sakalīkṛtya devatātmānamātmavit ||

utthāya śiṣyo vimale vāsasī paridhāya ca |
ācamya vāgyato bhūtvā niṣīdet sannidhau guroḥ ||

devatāmātmanaḥ śiṣye saṃkrāntāṃ deśikottamaḥ |
pūjayed gandhapuṣpādyairaikyaṃ sambhāvayaṃstayoḥ ||

dadyād vidyāṃ tatastasmai vinītāyāmbupūrvakam |
vaṣiṣṭhasaṃhitāyāṃ (-) tatastacchirasi svasya hastaṃ dattvā śataṃ japet |
aṣṭottaraśataṃ vāpi dadyādudakapūrvakam ||

gautamīye (-) nyāsajālaṃ tasya dehe guruḥ saṃnyasya yatnataḥ |
dakṣakarṇe vadenmantraṃ trivāraṃ pūrṇamānasaḥ ||

<100> kulāmṛte (-) vidyāṃ triḥ kathayet karṇe cāvijñāne ca vā punaḥ |
dīpikāyāṃ (-) ṛṣyādiyuktamathaṃ mantravaraṃ yathāvad brūyāttriśo 
gururanarghyamavāmakaṇ

anyatrāpi (-) dakṣakarṇe triśo vidyāmekoccāreṇa coccaret |
eṣa vidhirdvijātīnāṃ strīśūdrāṇāñca vāmataḥ |
tantrāntare (-) āvayostulyaphalado bhavatvevamudīrayet |
prasannavadanastasmai śiṣyāya munipuṅgavaḥ ||

svato jyotirmayīṃ vidyāṃ gacchantīṃ bhāvayed guruḥ |
āgatāṃ bhāvayecchiṣyo nato'smīti viśeṣataḥ || iti |

gautamīye (-) gaṇeśādimanuṃ coktvā samayān kathayed guruḥ |
gaṇeśādimantradānaṃ pañcāyatanadīkṣāpakṣe | 
dakṣiṇāmūrttisaṃhitāyām (-)

samīpe cakrarājasya samyagabhyarcya deśikaḥ |
ādyākṣareṇa saṃlagnaṃ sundaraṃ nāma kalpayet ||

ātmānaṃ yojayitvā tu gurubhirmānavaistataḥ |
smarttavyā guravaḥ sarve samyak praṇatipūrvakam ||

bhūmau likhitvā vidyāṃ ca samyak puṣpādibhiryajet |
śiṣyāya darśayed vidyāṃ prajaptāṃ śatadhā priye ||

yadi syānmahatī prītiḥ śiṣyasya praṇatasya ca |
tadaikoccāramātreṇa dakṣakarṇe japet parām ||

tantrarāje (-) uktalakṣaṇasampannaṃ śiṣyamācārabhūṣaṇam |
pañcaṣaṭkūṭavidyābhyāṃ śodhitaṃ bahuvāsaraiḥ ||

kalaśairabhiṣicyāmuṃ śrīcakre sanniveśya vai |
ādhāre hṛdaye mūrdhni cakraṃ sañcintya madhyataḥ ||

svāntādāvāhya saṃsthāpya saṃpūjya nyāsasaṃyutām |
triśo vidyāṃ vadet karṇe devyātmā pūrṇamānasaḥ ||

devatāgurumantrātmatattvaikyaṃ bhāvayenmudā |
śataṃ japet tadagrastho nikaṭe tridinaṃ vaset ||

na cet sañcāriṇīśaktirgurumeti na saṃśayaḥ |
tasmāt tadantike tasya pūjādeśādikṛd vaset ||

gautamīye (-) tridinaṃ nivased bhaktyā siddhaye gurusannidhau |
anyathā tadgataṃ tejo gurumeti na saṃśayaḥ ||

<101> mantratantraprakāśe (-) ācāryādanabhiprāptaḥ prāptaścādattadakṣiṇaḥ |
satataṃ japyamāno'pi mantraḥ siddhiṃ na gacchati ||

sarvasvaṃ vā tadardhaṃ vā vittaśāṭhyavivarjitām |
gurave dakṣiṇāṃ dattvā tato mantragraho mataḥ ||

tantrāntare (-) gobhūhiraṇyaṃ vipulaṃ gṛhakṣetrādikaṃ bahu |
na cedardhaṃ tadardhaṃ vā taddaśāṃśamathāpi vā ||

akleśādannavastrādi dadyād vittānusārataḥ |
brahmasaṃhitāyām (-) adakṣiṇaṃ kṛtaṃ vṛthā nārada niścitam |
vīiṇāṃ me dakṣiṇāṃ dehi sākṣasūtrakamaṇḍalum ||

tato mantraṃ gṛhāṇa tvaṃ yathāvidhi mahāmune |
vidhihīnaṃ kṛtaṃ karma siddhiṃ naiva prayacchati ||

gautamīye (-) gurave dakṣiṇāṃ dadyād vittārdhaṃ bhaktitatparaḥ |
tadardhaṃ vā tato dadyād yathāśaktyā'tha bhaktitaḥ ||

vittaśāṭhyaṃ na kurvīta kṛte'narthaṃ samāvahet |
gobhūhiraṇyavastrādi gurave'tha nivedayet ||

guruputrāya tatpatnyai tacchiṣyāya svaśaktitaḥ |
vastrālaṅkaraṇaṃ dadyād bhojyamiṣṭaṃ yathāruci ||

ṛtvigbhyo dakṣiṇāṃ dadyāt vastrālaṅkārasaṃyutām |
brahmasaṃhitāyām (-) praṇītāmārjanaṃ kṛtvā dadyācca brahmadakṣiṇām |
svasvavittānusāreṇa lobhamohavivarjitaḥ ||

tato brahmāṇamudvāsya brāhmaṇān bhojayedatha |
āśīrvacobhirviduṣāmedhyamānaḥ sukhī bhavet ||

hutaśeṣaṃ tataḥ prāśya kukkuṭāṇḍapramāṇakam |
mantritaṃ mantragāyatryā 	|| iti |

vāyavīyasaṃhitāyām (-)

maṇḍapaṃ gurave dadyād yāgopakaraṇaiḥ saha |
nārāyaṇīya mahākapilapañcarātrayoḥ (-)

mantraṃ dattvā sahasraṃ vai svasiddhyai deśiko japet |
anyatrāpi (-) aṣṭottaraṃ sahasraṃ svaśaktihānānavāptaye | japyāt |
kulāmṛte (-) daṇḍavat praṇataṃ śiṣyaṃ sarvācārāṃśca śikṣayet |

<102> tantrāntare (-) snānasandhye sadācāraṃ nityaṃ kāmyaṃ tathaiva ca |
mantrasiddhiprakārāṃśca śiṣyāyā'bhivaded guruḥ ||

samayācāraśca vakṣyate | dīkṣādivase upavāso niṣiddhaḥ | taduktaṃ (-)

yoginītantre (-) mantraṃ dattvā guruścaiva upavāsaṃ ya ācaret |
mahāndhakāranarake kṛmirbhavati nānyathā ||

dīkṣāṃ dattvā yadā mantrī copavāsaṃ samācaret |
tasya devaḥ sadā ruṣṭaḥ śāpaṃ dattvā puraṃ vrajet ||

atha vīradīkṣāyāṃ viśeṣaḥ

tatrabhūtaśuddhi (-) mātṛkānyāsa ṣoḍhānyāsādikaṃ sarvaṃ guruḥ svaśarīre 
śaktiśarīre ca vidhāya kalaśasthāpanaṃ śrīpātrādisthāpanaṃ ca kṛtvā 
dūtīyāgakrameṇa kuṇḍagolotthadravyamutpādya saṃskṛtya 
matsyamāṃsāderapi saṃskāraṃ vidhāya vakṣyamāṇavīrapūjākrameṇa 
devatāḥ saṃpūjya śiṣyāya mantradānasamaye (-)

śiṣyahaste maheśāni pātraṃ dattvā kuleśvari |

iti vīracūḍāmaṇyuktavīrapātram (-)

idaṃ pavitramamṛtaṃ pīyatāṃ bhavabheṣajam |
paśupāśasamucchedakāraṇaṃ bhairavoditam ||

iti kulārṇavoktamantreṇa śiṣyahaste dadyāt | śiṣyo'pyanenaiva mantreṇa 
pīyatāmityatra pibāmīti paṭhitvā vakṣyamāṇa dharmādharmahavirdīpta 
ityādimantreṇa pibet | tato gururmantraṃ dadyāt | tatra (-)

yāmale (-) ṛṣyādisahitāmenāṃ likhitvā bhūmimadhyagām |
puṣpādinā samabhyarcya śiṣyāyā'tha pradarśayet ||

yadi śiṣye mahāprītistadā karṇe vaded guruḥ |
tato'pyatitarāṃ śiṣyo guroścet prītibhājanam ||

tadā gaṇḍūṣapūrvaṃ hi dadyādenāṃ gurūttamaḥ |
nirvikalpo'pi śiṣyastāṃ gṛhṇīyād hṛṣṭamānasaḥ ||

tadabhāve na siddhiḥ syād devatāśāpamāpnuyāt |

dakṣiṇāmūrttisaṃhitāyām (-)

kalaśasthaiḥ pallavaistu trivāraṃ prokṣayecchubham |
bhaved yadābhiṣiktastu tadāsau deśikāgraṇīḥ ||

gaṇḍūṣatattvasaṃyuktastadā'rho'yaṃ śivārcane |
<103> anyathā naiva siddhiḥ syāt savikalpasya pārvati ||

gaṇḍūṣadāne śiṣyasya vikalpo yadi jāyate |
na siddhistasya kutrāpi śrīvidyāpi parāṅmukhī ||

śeṣaṃ paśudīkṣāsamānam | atha tārādīkṣāyāṃ viśeṣo nīlatantre (-)

aṣṭottarasahasrahomaṃ vilvapatreṇa kārayet |
athavā'ṣṭaśataṃ kuryādaṃṣṭāviṃśatimeva vā ||

pāyasaṃ kṛsaraṃ dadyānmodakaṃ khaṇḍaśarkarām |
baliṃ dattvā chāgalaṃ vai godhāmāṃsamanuttamam |
rambhāpuṣpaṃ śālamatsyaṃ juhuyācca prayatnataḥ ||

yavakṣīraṃ tato hutvā śālyannaṃ madhunā saha |
gobhūhiraṇyavastrādyaistoṣayed gurumātmanaḥ ||

cāmuṇḍātantre (-)

upavidyāsu sarvāsu ṣaṭkarmādiprasādhane |
nātra dīkṣetyapekṣāsti nātrāṅgādiprapūjanam ||

upavidyā yakṣiṇyādiḥ | ṣaṭkarmādiprasādhanamantrā yathā 
kālikāmantraprayoge vaśyādau mantraviśeṣāḥ | nanu (-)

pustake likhito mantro yena sundari japyate |
na tasya jāyate siddhirhānireva pade pade ||

gurumukhyaḥ kriyāḥ sarvā bhuktimuktiphalapradāḥ |
gurvanuktāḥ kriyāḥ sarvā niṣphalāḥ syuryato dhruvam ||

ityādinānāvacanāt kathamevamiti cet | na | 
kuṇḍamaṇḍapācāryādivaraṇahomādipūrvakadīkṣāniṣedhe'pyupadeśā(-)
niṣedhāt | tantrāntare (-)

candrasūryagrahe tīrthe siddhikṣetre śivālaye |
mantramātraprakathanamupadeśaḥ sa ucyate ||

ityādinā upadeśasyāpi vihitatvāt | na ca (-)

śāstrād vā guruvaktrād vā jñātvā mantraṃ prasādhayet |

iti vacanāt pustakādapi mantrajñānaṃ siddhijanakamiti vācyam | 
tatretikartavyatayoḥ śāstreṇa jñānavidhānāt mantramityasya 
prasādhayedityanenaivā'nvayāt |

iti kriyāvatīdīkṣāvidhiḥ

<104> atha varṇamayī dīkṣā

etadaśaktau varṇamayyādyanyatamadīkṣā vidheyā | tatra varṇamayī yathā 
śāradāyām

atha varṇātmikāṃ vakṣye dīkṣāmāgamaveditām |
puṃprakṛtyātmakā varṇāḥ śarīramapi tādṛśam ||

yatastasmāt tanau nyasyed varṇān śiṣyasya deśikaḥ |
tattatsthānayutān varṇān pratilomena saṃharet ||

svājñayā devatābhāvād vidhinā deśikottamaḥ |
tadā vilīnatattvo'yaṃ śiṣyo divyatanurbhavet ||

paramātmani saṃyojya taccaitanyaṃ gurūttamaḥ |
tasmādutpādya tān varṇān nyasyecchiṣyatanau punaḥ ||

sṛṣṭikrameṇa vidhivac caitanyaṃ ca niyojayet |
jāyate devatābhāvaḥ parānandamayaḥ śiśuḥ ||

eṣā varṇamayī dīkṣā proktā saṃvitpradāyinī ||

iti varṇamayī dīkṣāvidhiḥ

atha kalāvatī

tatraiva (-) tataḥ kalāvatī dīkṣā yathāvadabhidhīyate |
nivṛttādyāḥ kalāḥ pañca bhūtānāṃ śaktayo yataḥ ||

tasmād bhūtamaye dehe dhyātvā tā vedhayecchiśoḥ |
nivṛttirjānuparyantaṃ talādārābhya saṃsthitā ||

jānunornābhiparyantaṃ pratiṣṭhā vyāpya tiṣṭhati |
nābheḥ kaṇṭhāvadhivyāptā vidyāśāntistataḥ param ||

kaṇṭhāllalāṭaparyantaṃ vyāptā tasmācchikhāvadhi |
śāntyatītā kalā jñeyā kalāvyāptiritīritā ||

saṃhārakramayogena sthānāt sthānāntare guruḥ |
saṃyojya vedhayed vidvānājñayā tāḥ śivāvadhi ||

iyaṃ proktā kalā dīkṣā divyabhāvapradāyinī ||

iti kalāvatīdīkṣāvidhiḥ

atha vedhamayī

tatraiva (-) tato vedhamayīṃ vakṣye dīkṣāṃ saṃsāramocanīm |
dhyāyecchiṣyatanormadhye mūlādhāre caturdale ||

<105> trikoṇamadhye vimale tejastrayavijṛmbhite |
valayatrayasaṃyuktāṃ taḍitkoṭisamaprabhām ||

śivaśaktimayīṃ devīṃ cetanāmātravigrahām |
sūkṣmāṃ sūkṣmatarāṃ śaktiṃ bhittvā ṣaṭcakramañjasā ||

gacchantīṃ madhyamārgeṇa divyāṃ paraśivāvadhi |
vādisāntadalasthārṇān saṃharet kamalāsane ||

taṃ ṣaṭpatramaye padme vādilāntākṣarānvite |
svādhiṣṭhāne samāyojya vedhayedājñayā guruḥ ||

tān varṇān saṃhared viṣṇau taṃ punarnābhipaṅkaje |
daśapatre ḍādiphāntavarṇāḍhye yojayed guruḥ ||

tān varṇān saṃhared rudre taṃ punarhṛdayāmbuje |
kādiṭhāntārkavarṇāḍhye yojayitveśvare guruḥ ||

tān varṇān saṃharedasmiṃstaṃ bhūyaḥ kaṇṭhapaṅkaje |
svarāḍhye ṣoḍaśadale yojayitvā svarān punaḥ ||

sadāśive tān saṃhṛtya taṃ punarbhrūsaroruhe |
dvipatre hakṣalasite yojayitvā tato guruḥ ||

tadarṇau saṃhared bindau kalāyāṃ taṃ niyojayet |
tāṃ nāde'nantaraṃ nādaṃ nādānte yojayed guruḥ ||

tamunmanyāṃ samāyojya viṣṇuvaktrāntare ca tām |
tatpunarguruvaktre tu yojayed deśikottamaḥ ||

sahaivamātmanā śaktiṃ vedhayet parame śive |
gurvājñayā chinnapāśastadā śiṣyaḥ pated bhuvi ||

saṃjātadivyabodho'sau sarvaṃ vindati tatkṣaṇāt |
sākṣācchivo bhavatyeṣa nātra kāryā vicāraṇā ||

eṣā vedhamayī dīkṣā proktā saṃvitpradāyinī |

iti vedhamayī dīkṣāvidhiḥ

athāṇavīdīkṣābhedāḥ

ṣaḍanvayamahāratne (-) āṇavī bahudhā dīkṣā śākteyī śāmbhavī punaḥ |
ekadhaiveti vidvadbhiḥ paṭhyate śāstrakovidaiḥ ||

āṇavī bahudhetyuktvā tadbhedamadhunocyate |
106> smārtī mānasikī yaugī cākṣuṣī spārśanī tathā ||
vācikī mantrikī hotrī śāstrī cetyabhiṣecikī |

atha smārtī dīkṣā

videśasthaṃ guruḥ smṛtvā śiṣyaṃ pāśatrayaṃ kramāt ||

viśliṣya layabhogasya vidhānena pare śive |
samyag yojanarūpaiṣā smārtī dīkṣeti kathyate ||

atha mānasī dīkṣā

svasannidhau samāsīnamālokya manasā śucim |
malatrayādupāyairyā mocakī sā tu mānasī ||

atha yogadīkṣā

yogoktakramato yogī śiṣyadehaṃ praviṣya tu |
gṛhītvā tasya cātmānaṃ svātmanā yojanātmikā |
yogadīkṣeti sā proktā malatrayavināśinī ||

atha cākṣuṣī dīkṣā

śivo'hamiti niścitya vīkṣaṇaṃ karuṇārdrayā ||

dṛśā sā cākṣuṣī dīkṣā sarvapāpapraṇāśinī |

atha sparśadīkṣā

svayaṃ paraśivo bhūtvā niḥsandigdhamanā guruḥ ||
śivahastena śiṣyasya samantraṃ mūrdhni saṃspṛśet |
sparśadīkṣeti sā proktā śivābhivyaktikāriṇī ||

atha vācikī dīkṣā

guruvaktraṃ nijaṃ vaktraṃ vibhāvya gururādarāt |
guruvaktraprayogena divyamantrādikaṃ śiśau ||

mudrānyāsādibhiḥ sārdhaṃ dadyāt seyaṃ hi vācikī |

atha māntrī dīkṣā

dīkṣā parā tathā mantranyāsasaṃyuktavigrahaḥ ||

svayaṃ mantratanurbhūtvā sakramaṃ mantramādarāt |
dadyācchiṣyāya sā dīkṣā māntrī malavighātinī ||

<107> atha hotrī dīkṣā

śivahasteneti | (-) gandhairmaṇḍalakaṃ svīye vidadhyāddakṣiṇe kare |
vidhinā'trārcayed devamitthaṃ syācchivahastakam ||

iti somaśambhuproktarūpeṇetyarthaḥ |

kuṇḍe vā sthaṇḍile vāpi nikṣipyā'gniṃ vidhānataḥ |
layayogakrameṇaiva pratyadhvānaṃ yathākramam ||

mantravarṇakalātattvapadaviṣṭapameva ca |
śuddhyarthaṃ homayedeṣā hotrī dīkṣā samīritā ||

atha śāstro dīkṣā

yogyaśiṣyāya bhaktāya śuśrūṣārcāparāya ca |
sārdhaṃ śāstrapradā trayyā śāstrī dīkṣeti cocyate ||

athābhiṣecikī dīkṣā

śivaṃ ca śivapatnīṃ ca kumbhe sampūjya sādaram |
śivakumbhābhiṣekāt sā dīkṣā syādabhiṣecikī ||

layayogakrameṇeti | vedhadīkṣākrameṇa 
mūlādhārādhiṣṭhitavarṇadevatāsaṃhārarūpeṇetyarthaḥ |

atha pūrṇābhiṣekaḥ

sārasaṃgrahe (-) pūrṇābhiṣekaṃ vakṣyāmi sādhakānāṃ śubhāvaham |
vinā yenābhiṣekena sādhakaḥ pūrṇabodhatām ||

ācāryatvaṃ na cāpnoti sadgatiṃ ca samīhitām |
tasmād guruḥ priyaṃ śiṣyaṃ bodhayitvābhiṣecayet ||

viracya vipulaṃ cakraṃ maṇḍape'timanoharam |
khārītoyabhṛtaṃ kumbhaṃ sthāpayeccakramadhyataḥ ||

anyeṣu kalaśāṃstatra vastrahemasamanvitān |
daleṣu vividhāḥ sthāpyāstatrāvāhyeṣṭadevatām ||

abhyarcya madhye cānteṣu sāṅgāvaraṇadevatāḥ |
śiṣyasya janmanakṣatre prāgvat tairabhiṣecayet ||

triśaktiratne (-) nānopacāraiḥ sampūjya sahasraṃ juhuyācchucau ||

abhiṣiñced guruḥ śiṣyaṃ nāmāsmai pradiśet svayam |
pūrṇābhiṣekakhyāto'yamācāryatvapradāyakaḥ ||

<108> sārasaṃgrahe (-) ayaṃ pūrṇābhiṣekaḥ syāt sādhakābhīṣṭasiddhidaḥ |
khārīlakṣaṇaṃ skandapurāṇe (-)

paladvayaṃ tu prasṛtiḥ kuḍavaṃ dviguṇaṃ matam |
caturbhiḥ kuḍavaiḥ prastha āḍhakastaiścaturguṇaiḥ ||

caturguṇo bhaved droṇaḥ kumbhastaddvayataḥ smṛtaḥ |
kumbhaistairaṣṭabhiḥ khārī (---------------) iti ||

ayañca pūrṇābhiṣekaḥ kaulikānāmāvaśyakaḥ |

pūrṇābhiṣekahīnastu kauliko mriyate yadi ||
piśācatvamavāpnoti yāvadābhūtasaṃplavam |

iti kulārṇavavacanāt | kauliko vīraḥ |

iti pūrṇābhiṣekaḥ

atha mantrasaṃskāravidhiḥ

tantraśekhare (-) chinnādidoṣaduṣṭā ye manavaḥ saṃprakīrtitāḥ |
satataṃ sevyamānāste na bhavanti phalapradāḥ ||

atastaddoṣanāśāya saṃskārān śṛṇu cakṣmahe |
trikoṇaṃ saptadhā mantrī vibhajya samabhāgataḥ ||

īśakoṇāt tathā kuryāt tathā pāvakakoṇataḥ |
ūnapañcāśadevaṃ syuryonayastatra sarvataḥ ||

īśānādi likhenmantrī varuṇāntaṃ lipiṃ kramāt |
atra devīṃ samabhyarcya tato mantrān samuddharet ||

etaj jananamityāhuratho dīpanamucyate |
puṭitaṃ hasaṃmantreṇa sahasraṃ saṃjapenmanum ||

idaṃ dīpanamākhyātaṃ bodhanaṃ tannigadyate |
varmaṇā rephayuktena puṭitaṃ saṃjapenmanum || 

sahasraiḥ pañcabhirmantrī bodhanaṃ saṃsmṛtaṃ tvidam |
astrasaṃpuṭitaṃ mantraṃ sahasraṃ prajapet sudhīḥ ||

aitattāḍanamākhyātamabhiṣeka udīryate |
vāg haṃsapraṇavairmantrī sahasraṃ saṃjapejjalam ||

imaṃ mantraṃ paṭhan mantramabhiṣiñcyājjalaiḥ śubhaiḥ |
tāvat sromiti mantreṇa vaṣaḍantena saṃpuṭam ||

<109> sahasraṃ saṃjapenmantraṃ vimalīkaraṇaṃ tvidam |
svadhāśikhāpuṭaṃ mantraṃ sahasraṃ saṃjapet sudhīḥ ||

etaj jīvanamākhyātaṃ dugdhājyamilitairjalaiḥ |
tarpaṇaṃ tarpaṇaṃ khyātaṃ māyayā saṃpuṭo manuḥ ||

sahasraiḥ pañcabhirjapto gopanaṃ tat samucyate |

gautamīye tu (-) madhunā śaktimantre tu vaiṣṇave cendumajjalaiḥ ||

ghṛtena tarpaṇaṃ śaive mantribhiḥ samyagīritam |
tathā (-) śvetacandrānugrahendusaṃpuṭaṃ prajapenmanum |
etadāpyāyanaṃ proktaṃ mantraśāstraviśāradaiḥ ||

saṃproktā daśasaṃskārā mantrāṇāṃ tatra coditāḥ |
śāradātilakādau prakārāntareṇa daśa saṃskārā uktāste 
tatraivā'nusandheyāḥ |

athārimantratyāgavidhiḥ

athā'niṣṭaphaladamantraparityāgavidhirucyate | tantre (-)

athā'rimantrasaṃtyāgavidhiḥ samyak prakāśyate |
arītyupalakṣaṇam aniṣṭaphaladeti bodhyam | tathā (-)

śuciḥ samāhito bhūtvā prārabheta vare dine |
aśeṣaduḥkhanāśāya deśikaḥ pravaraṃ vidhim ||

tatrādau ramyabhavane kumbhaṃ dīkṣāvidhikramāt |
maṇḍale sthāpayed vidvān pūrayet taṃ jalaiḥ śubhaiḥ ||

sakalīkṛtya saṃpūjyāvaraṇāni prapūjayet |
evaṃ sāvaraṇāmiṣṭvā mantrī mantrasya devatām |
hutvā vilomamantreṇa sarpiṣā gorapi dvijaḥ ||

aṣṭottarasahasraṃ vā tathaivāṣṭaśataṃ sudhīḥ |
brahmārpaṇena manunā tathānte tarpayet prabhum ||

tato yathāvad dugdhānnairdevatābhyo baliṃ haret |
vidikṣu dikṣu ca tathā vakṣyamāṇairmanūttamaiḥ ||

āyāhīndra surādhīśa śatamanyo śacīpate |
namastubhyaṃ gṛhāṇemaṃ puṣpadhūpādikaṃ balim ||

āyāhi tejasāṃ nātha havyavāha varaprada |
gṛhāṇa puṣpadhūpādibalimenaṃ supūjitam ||

<110> pretarāja samāyāhi bhinnāñjanasamadyute |
baliṃ dattaṃ gṛhītvemaṃ suprīto varado bhava ||

namaste rakṣasāṃ nātha nir(-)ṛte tvamihāgataḥ |
gṛhāṇa balipūjādi mayā bhaktyā niveditam ||

ehi paścimadikpāla jalanātha namo'stute |
bhaktyā niveditāṃ pūjāṃ gṛhītvā prītimāpnuhi ||

prabhañjana prāṇapate tvamehi saparicchadaḥ |
mayā prayuktaṃ vidhivad gṛhāṇa balimādarāt ||

kubera tārakādhīśāvāgacchetāṃ surottamau |
puṣpadhūpādibhiḥ prītau bhavetāṃ varadau mama ||

īśa tvameva bhagavan sarvavidyāśrayaprabhau |
pūjitaḥ puṣpadhūpādyaiḥ prīto bhava vibhūtaye ||

āyāhi sarvalokānāṃ nātha brahman samarcanam |
gṛhāṇa sarvavighnān me nivartaya namo'stu te ||

āgaccha varadā'vyakta viṣṇo viśvasya nāyaka |
pūjitaḥ parayā bhaktyā bhava tvaṃ sukhado mama ||

tataḥ saparivārāṃ ca pūjayenmantradevatām |
mantreṇa viparītena puṣpadīpopacārakaiḥ |
tatastu prārthayed vidvān pūjitāṃ mantradevatām ||

ānukūlyamanālocya mayā taralabuddhinā ||

yadupāttaṃ pūjitaṃ ca prabho mantrasvarūpakam |
tena me manasaḥ kṣobhamaśeṣaṃ vinivartaya ||

pāpaṃ pratihataṃ cāstu bhūyācchreyaḥ sanātanam |
tanotu mama kalyāṇaṃ pāvanī bhaktireva te ||

iti saṃprārthya mantreśīṃ mantraṃ patre vilomataḥ |
likhitvā'malakarpūracandanena samarcayet ||

kalaśopari saṃsthāpya bhaktyā paramayā yutaḥ |
tatpatraṃ matimān paścād baddhvā nijaśirasyatha ||

snāyāt pūjitakumbhasthatoyairmantramayaiḥ śubhaiḥ |
bhūyaścānyena toyena kumbhamāpūrya saṃyataḥ ||

<111> tanmadhye mantrapatraṃ ca nikṣipyā'tha prapūjayet |
taṃ kumbhaṃ nimnagātīre śuddhe vā'nyajalāśaye ||

nikṣipedatha viprāṃśca yathāśaktyā ca bhojayet |
itthaṃ kṛtavidhānasya ripumantrodbhavā rujaḥ ||

naśyantyeva na sandehaḥ kramāccittaprasannatā |
jāyate'tīvasampanno vardhate tat kulaṃ kramāt ||

[iti mahāmahopādhyāya ṭhakkura śrīnarasiṃhaviracite tārābhaktisudhārṇave 
tṛtīyastaraṅgaḥ] || 3 ||


[caturthastaraṅgaḥ]

atha gurubhaktiḥ

kulārṇave (-) nārāyaṇe mahādeve mātāpitrośca rājani |
yathā bhaktirbhaved devi tathā kāryā nije gurau ||

tathā (-) ekagrāmasthitaḥ śiṣyastrisandhyaṃ praṇamed gurum |
ekakrośasthitaścāpi guruṃ pratidinaṃ namet ||

ardhayojanagaḥ śiṣyaḥ praṇamet pañcaparvasu |
ekayojanamārabhya yojanadvādaśāvadhi ||

tattadyojanasaṃkhyātairmāsairgatvā named gurum |
atidūre sthitaḥ śiṣyo yadecchā syāt tadā vrajet ||
 
riktahastastu nopeyād rājānaṃ daivataṃ gurum |
phalapuṣpāmbarādīni yathā śaktyā samarpayet ||

tathā (-) gurvagre na tapaḥ kuryānna snāyādātmatṛptaye |
na niyogaṃ gurordadyād yuṣmadā nābhibhāṣayet ||

tathā (-) ṛṇadānaṃ tathādānaṃ vastūnāṃ krayavikrayam |
na kuryād gurubhiḥ sārdhaṃ śiṣyo bhūtvā kadācana ||

gurau sannihite yastu pūjayedanyamambike |
sa yāti narakaṃ ghoraṃ pūjā sā viphalā bhavet ||

yasmin dravye gurorasti spṛhā nānubhavecca tat |
avaśyaṃ yadi vāñchā syādanubhūyāttadājñayā ||

atyalpaṃ hi gurordravyamadattaṃ svīkaroti yaḥ |
tiraścāṃ yonimāpannaḥ kravyādairbhakṣyate priye ||

gurudravyābhilāṣī ca gurustrīgamanotsukaḥ |
patitaḥ syānna sandehaḥ prāyaścittaṃ na vidyate ||

gurusthānaṃ sampradāyaṃ taddharmaṃ yo nivārayet |
gurubhiḥ sa bahiṣkāryo daṇḍyo vedhyaśca pātakī ||

pādukāmāsanaṃ vastraṃ vāhanaṃ chatracāmare |
dṛṣṭā gurornamaskuryānna tad bhogāya kalpayet ||

<113> uktānukteṣu kāryeṣu nopekṣāṃ kārayet priye |
sadasad yad gururbrūyāt tat kāryamaviśaṅkayā ||

brahmahatyāśataṃ kṛtvā gurvājñāṃ paripālayet |
na viśedāsane devi devatāgurusannidhau ||

jātividyādhanāḍhyo vā dūre dṛṣṭvā guruṃ mudā |
daṇḍapraṇāmaṃ kṛtvaikaṃ tripradakṣiṇamācaret ||

tathā (-) gurutadguruyoge tu vandeta praguruṃ priye |
tato named guruṃ so'pi gurvājñāṃ na vicārayet ||

praguroḥ sannidhau śiṣyaḥ svaguruṃ manasā namet |
śrīguruṃ na tyajet kvāpi tadādiṣṭo vrajet priye ||

adhasthite gurāvūrdhvaṃ na tiṣṭhet tu kadācana |
na gacchedagratasteṣāṃ na tiṣṭhedutthite gurau ||

tiṣṭhedupaviṣṭa iti śeṣaḥ |

yatra śrīgurunindā syāt pidhāya śravaṇe svake |
sadyastasmādupakrāmed dūraṃ na śṛṇuyād yathā ||

gurunāma japet paścācchravaṇe sā pratikriyā |
gurumitrasuhṛddāsīdāsādyān nāvamānayet ||

guruśaktiśca tatputro jyeṣṭho bhrātā guroḥ samaḥ |
ātmavacca kanīyāṃsaḥ putravat kulapālikāḥ ||

tapacaryā iti śeṣaḥ |

atha samayācāraḥ

bhairavatantre (-) mahācīnakrameṇaiva tārā śīghraphalapradā |
gandharvākhyakrameṇaiva pañcamī caiva durlabhā ||

mahānīlakrameṇaiva kālikā phaladāyinī |
tathā (-) mahācīnakrameṇaiva chinnamastāvidhirmataḥ |
kālītantre (-) mahācīnakrameṇaiva tārā śrīghraphalapradā |
mahācīno bauddhabahulo deśaviśeṣaḥ | tatkramaścoktaḥ sārasaṃgrahe (-)

snānādi mānasaṃ śaucaṃ pūjanaṃ cāpi tarpaṇam |
sarva eva śubhaḥ kālo nāśubho vidyate kvacit ||

<114> na viśeṣo divā rātrau na sandhyāyāṃ navā niśi |
sarvadā pūjayed devīmasnātaḥ kṛtabhojanaḥ ||

mahāniśyaśucau deśe baliṃ mantreṇa dāpayet |
strīdveṣo naiva kartavyo viśeṣāt pūjanaṃ striyaḥ ||

japasthāne mahāśaṅkhaṃ niveśyordhve carejjapam |
striyaṃ gacchan spṛśan paśyan yatra kutrāpyacūḍake ||

bhakṣan tāmbūlamanyāṃśca śubhadravyān yathāruci |
matsyaṃ māṃsaṃ tathā kṣaudraṃ payaḥ śākādyamaikṣavam ||

bhaktyā hyaśeṣadravyāṇi dattvā bhuktvā carejjapam |
digdeśaniyamo nātra sthityādiniyamo na ca ||

na jape kālaniyamo nārcādiṣu baliṣvapi |
svecchāniyama ukto'tra mahāmantrasya sādhane ||

nādharmo jāyate tatra kiṃ ca dharmaḥ prajāyate |
svecchācāro'tra kathitaḥ pracared hṛṣṭamānasaḥ ||

kṛtārthaṃ manyamānastu santoṣya nijamānasam |
yasmin mantre ya ācārastatra dharmastu tādṛśaḥ ||

kṛtārthastena jāyeta svargo vā mokṣa eva vā |

svacchandabhairavatantre

na śaucādikriyāḥ kāryāḥ smṛtiśāstrapracoditāḥ |
ekaṃ liṅge gude tisra ityādyā yāḥ prakīrtitāḥ ||

na tāḥ kāryāḥ sādhakendrairyadīccheccirajīvitam |
yāmale (-) athācāraṃ pravakṣyāmi yatkṛte'mṛtamaśnute |
sarvabhūtahite raktaḥ samayācārapālakaḥ ||

anityakarmasaṃtyāgī nityānuṣṭhānatatparaḥ |
parasyāṃ devatāyāntu sarvakarmanivedakaḥ ||

syāditi śeṣaḥ | anityakarmetyādi | mokṣakāmaḥ kāmanayā kimapi karma na 
kuryāt | nityanaimittikakarmaparo mantrārādhanenaiva mama śivaṃ bhaviteti 
bhāvayan kṛtaṃ karma devatāyai samarpayedityākhaṇḍalakārthaḥ |

anyamantrārcanaśraddhāmanyamantrasya pūjanam |
kulastrīvīranindāṃ ca tad dravyasyāpahāraṇam ||

<115> strīṣu roṣaṃ prahārañca varjayenmatimān sadā |
strīmayaṃ ca jagat sarvaṃ svayaṃ tāvat tathā bhavet ||

peyaṃ carvyaṃ tathā coṣyaṃ bhakṣyaṃ lehyaṃ gṛhaṃ sukham |
sarvaṃ ca yuvatīrūpaṃ bhāvayed yatamānasaḥ ||

kulajāṃ yuvatīṃ vīkṣya namaskuryāt samāhitaḥ |
yadi bhāgyabalenaiva kuladṛṣṭistu jāyate ||

tadaiva mānasīṃ pūjāṃ tadā tāsāṃ prakalpayet |
bālāṃ vā yauvanonmattāṃ vṛddhāṃ vā sundarīṃ tathā ||

kutsitāṃ vā mahāduṣṭāṃ namaskṛtya vibhāvayet |
tāsāṃ prahāraṃ nindāṃ ca kauṭilyamapriyaṃ tathā ||

sarvathā na ca karttavyamanyathā siddhirodhakṛt |
striyo devāḥ striyaḥ prāṇāḥ striya eva vibhūṣaṇam ||

strisaṅginā sadā bhāvyamabhāve svastriyāmapi |
taddhastāracitaṃ puṣpaṃ taddhastāvarjitaṃ jalam ||

taddhastāracitaṃ bhojyaṃ devatābhyo nivedayet |
śatāparādhe vanitāṃ puṣpeṇāpi na tāḍayet ||

doṣānna gaṇayeddhīmān guṇāneva prakāśayet |
rudrayāmale (-) strīsuptaṃ gurusuptaṃ ca jyeṣṭhasuptaṃ ca nagnakān |
daivāt daddarśane devi śrīcakraṃ kārayed budhaḥ ||

suptamityupalakṣaṇam | anavadhānena nagnānetānna paśyedityarthaḥ |
kulārṇave (-) śrīguroḥ pādukāṃ mudrāṃ mūlamantraṃ ca pādukām |
śiṣyādanyatra deveśi na dadyād yasya kasyacit ||

pāramparyāgamāmnāyaṃ mantraṃ tantrādikaṃ priye |
sarvaṃ gurumukhāllabdhaṃ saphalaṃ syān na cānyathā ||

svadāravanniṣeveta kulaśāstrāṇi pārvati |
paśuśāstrāṇi sarvāṇi varjayet paradāravat ||

śvacarmasthaṃ yathā kṣīraṃ na peyaṃ syād dvijottamaiḥ |
tathā paśumukhād dhamro na śrotavyaśca kaulikaiḥ ||

tathā (-) āmamāṃsaṃ surākumbhaṃ mattebhaṃ siddhaliṅginam |
sahakāramaśokaṃ ca krīḍālolāḥ kumārikāḥ ||

<116> ekavṛkṣaṃ śmaśānañca samūhaṃ yāṣitāmapi |
nārīṃ ca raktavasanāṃ dṛṣṭvā vandeta bhaktitaḥ ||

guruśaktisutajyeṣṭha kaniṣṭhān kuladeśikān |
kuladarśanaśāstrāṇi kuladravyāṇi kaulikān ||

prerakān sūcakāṃścāpi vācakān darśakāṃstathā |
śikṣakān bodhakān yogi yoginīsiddhapuruṣān ||

kanyāḥ kumārikā nagnā unmattāḥ prakaṭastanīḥ |
na nindenna jugupseta na hasennāvamānayet ||

nānṛtaṃ nāpriyaṃ brūyāt kasyāpi kulayoginaḥ |
kurūpeti ca kṛṣṇeti na vadet kulayoginīm ||

na paśyet patitāṃ nagnāmunmattāṃ prakaṭastanīm |
na divā sevayennārīṃ na tad yoniṃ nirīkṣayet ||

yā kācidaṅganā loke sā mātṛkulasambhavā |
kupyanti kulayoginyo vanitānāmatikramāt ||

rudrayāmale (-) asaṃskāraṃ pibed dravyaṃ balātkāreṇa maithunam |
svahastena paśuṃ hatvā rauravaṃ narakaṃ vrajet ||

kulārṇave (-) prāyaścittaṃ bhṛgoḥ pātaṃ sannyāsaṃ vratadhāraṇam |
tīrthayātrābhigamanaṃ kaulaḥ pañca vivarjayet ||

vīrahatyā vṛthāpānaṃ vīradravyāpahāraṇam |
vīrastrīgamanaṃ caiva tatsaṃyogaśca pañcamaḥ ||

mahāpātakamityuktaṃ kaulikānāṃ kulānvaye |

prāyaścittaṃ tantroktaṃbhinnam | vratadhāraṇamapi tathaiva | 
tīrthayātrābhigamanaṃ smārttaprakāreṇa pīṭhayātrāyāstantreṣu vihitatvāt | 
vīrastrīgamanaṃ ca tatsvāmyanumatyā na niṣiddham |

bhaginīṃ vā sutāṃ bhāryāṃ yo dadyāt kulayogine |
madhumattāya deveśi tasya puṇyaṃ na gaṇyate ||

iti kulārṇavavacanāt | tathā (-)

gurau manuṣyabuddhiṃ ca mantre cākṣarabuddhitām |
pratimāsu śilābuddhiṃ kurvāṇo narakaṃ vrajet ||

pūrvadoṣayoḥ satoreva ubhayatyāge doṣādhikyamidam |
viṇmūtrocchiṣṭaṃ śaṅkābhiryuktaḥ karma karoti yat |
<117> tapo'rcanādi tatsarvamapavitraṃ bhavet priye ||
tathā (-) vivikṣurdeśikāvāsaṃ śāntacitto'tibhaktimān |
vyajanaṃ pādukāṃ chatraṃ vasanaṃ vāhanādikam ||

tāmbūlaṃ kajjalaṃ veśamutsṛjya praviśecchanaiḥ |
pādaprakṣālanaṃ snānamabhyaṅgaṃ dantadhāvanam ||

mūtraṃ niṣṭīvanaṃ kṣauraṃ śayanaṃ strīniṣevanam |
vīrāsanaṃ ca durvākyamatihāsāṅgamoṭanam ||

keśamocanamuṣṇīṣaṃ kañcukaṃ nagnatāṃ tathā |
pādaprasāraṇaṃ vādaṃ kalahaṃ dūṣaṇaṃ priye ||

aṅgavādyāṅgabhaṅgādi (-) karāsphālanadhūnanam |
dyūtaṃ kukkuṭamalādiyuddhamityādi cāmbike ||

guruyogimahāsiddhipīṭhakṣetrāśramādiṣu |
nācaredācaranmohād devatāśāpamāpnuyāt ||

kālīkalpe (-) rātrau paryaṭanaṃ caiva rātrau śaktiprapūjanam |
akṛtvā kathamīśāna madbhaktaḥ kauliko bhavet ||

kulāmṛtadīpikāyām (-)

pūjākālaṃ vinā naiva paśyecchaktiṃ digambarām |
pūjākālaṃ vinā naivamupeyā sā hi sādhakaiḥ ||

ayañcācāraḥ sarvadā gopanīyaḥ | tathā hi kulārṇave (-)

vedaśāstrapurāṇāni spaṣṭā veśyāṃganā iva |
iyaṃ ca śāmbhavī vidyā guptā kulavadhūriva ||

suguptakaulikācāramanugṛhṇanti devatāḥ |
vāñchāsiddhiṃ prayacchanti nāśayanti prakāśanāt ||

kūlacūḍāmaṇau (-) kulācāraṃ dakṣiṇākhyaṃ kathitaṃ tava suvrate |
na kasmaicit pravaktavyaṃ yadīcchet priyamātmanaḥ ||

kulapuṣpaṃ kuladravyaṃ kulapūjāṃ kulaṃ japam |
guruṃ kulapatiṃ cāpi kulamālāṃ kulākulam ||

kulacakraṃ kuladhyānaṃ sarvathā na prakāśayet |
prakāśāt siddhihāniḥ syāt prakāśād bandhanādikam ||

prakāśād balahāniḥ syāt prakāśād devahiṃsanam |
<118> prakāśānmṛtyulābhaḥ syānna prakāśyaṃ kadācana ||

pūjākāle maheśāni yadi ko'pyatra gacchati ||

darśayed vaiṣṇavīṃ mudrāṃ viṣṇunyāsaṃ yathāstavam ||

kadācidaṅgahāniḥ syānna ca vyaktiḥ kadācana |
paraṃ pūjā na kartavyā na ca vyaktiḥ kadācana ||

antaḥ śāktā bahiḥ śaivāḥ sabhāyāṃ vaiṣṇavā matāḥ |
nānārūpadharā vīrā vicaranti mahītale ||

phetkāriṇītantre śrītārākalpe (-)

sarvadā gopayedenaṃ manuṃ ca gurumeva ca |
tena vīryavatī vidyā nirvīryā syāt prakāśataḥ ||

tantre (-) nopaveśyaṃ mahātīre na śayyā timirāntare |
na ninded yoginīcakraṃ na ninded vāmalocanām ||

bhasmasnānaṃ prakurvīta tathā bhaktyā'valokanam |
vajrapuṣpāṅkitaṃ yantraṃ vajrapuṣpeṇa pūjayet ||

pūjākāle viśeṣeṇa na smareddharināma ca |
anyagandhaṃ parityajya candanaṃ raktacandanam ||

raktapuṣpaiḥ samabhyarcya bilvapatreṇa cārcayet |
tulasī mālatī dhātrī maruvakena nārcayet ||

śaktiṃ vināpi deveśi japahomāditarpaṇam |
dhyānapūjādikaṃ sarvaṃ siddhirodhāya jāyate ||

paṣṭīpauṣpādikaṃ dravyamanyadravyaṃ parityajet |
vīrapūjā maheśāni yāminyāḥ prahare gate ||

nopavāsaṃ prakurvīta na cānyad vratamācaret |
maṇḍapaṃ vidhivat kṛtvā patākā nīlatoraṇam ||

nāgaśūlāṅkitaṃ devi kuryāt kuṇḍaṃ trikoṇakam |

atha bhāvāḥ

bhāvacūḍāmaṇau (-) devyuvāca (-)

vīrabhāvo mahādeva kathyate śṛṇu bhairava |
nirdvandvamānaso bhūtvā hṛdā kāmakalā tanuḥ ||

<119> niśāsu pūjā pravarā hetuyuktā sadaiva hi |
nijaṃ kulaṃ samādhāya svayaṃ bhairavarūpadhṛk ||

kulaṃ ca bhairavīrūpaṃ tadgātre nyāsavistaram |
vinyasya sakalaṃ nyāsaṃ navayonyātmakaṃ tathā ||

navayonyātmakamiti śrīvidyāparam |

prasūnatūlikāmadhye puṣpaprakarasaṃyute |
nānāgandhasamākīrṇe kuladravyeṇa yantrakam ||

likhitvā pūjayecchaktau ghaṭasthāpanapūrvakam |
svavāmabhāge ṣaṭkoṇaṃ tanmadhye brahmarandhrakam ||

likhitvā tatra kumbhaṃ vai sauvarṇaṃ rājataṃ tathā |
tāmraṃ bhūmimayaṃ vāpi mahālohavivarjitam |
sthāpayet kalaśādhāraṃ kumbhaṃ sugandhivāsitam |
hetudravyaṃ brāhmaṇādi bhedataḥ saṃprapūrayet ||

brahmaṇādibhedata iti | kṣīrājyamadhvāsavarūpaṃ brāhmaṇādibhiḥ 
pūraṇīyamityarthaḥ |
evaṃ ca vīrasyāpi brāhmaṇasya hetusthāne kṣīrameva | anyasya tu tadapi na iti 
bodhyam |

tatra yantraṃ vilikhyādau yad yat kulasamudbhavam |
dhyātveṣṭadevatāṃ tatra japedaṣṭottaraṃ śatam ||

dhenuyonī pradarśyā'tha prasṛtaṃ tad vicintayet |
dṛṣṭvāmṛtamupāttaṃ vai nṛtyanti yoginīgaṇāḥ ||

nṛtyanti bhairavāḥ sarve nṛtyanti mātaro'pi ca |
indrādayaḥ surāḥ sarve nṛtyanti madhulolupāḥ ||

brahmaviṣṇumaheśādyā nṛtyanti harṣatatparāḥ |
ardhabhāṇḍaṃ tridhā kṛtvā gurave caikabhāgakam ||

ekaṃ kulāya vai dattvā ekena devatarpaṇam |
pītvā kularasaṃ nānāvastrālaṅkārabhūṣitaḥ ||

sākṣād yadi gururna syāt tadā toye visarjayet |
ānandarūpavān bhūtvā pūjayet parameśvarīm ||

tattatkalpavidhānena tat tad yatnena pūjayet |
visarjanaṃ vidhāyā'nte svakule yojayet tataḥ ||

 <120> tadbimbarasapānena amṛtaṃ bhujyate mayā |
taccakorarasāsvāde sammado mama jāyate ||

tatphalagrahaṇādeva meruśṛṅgāvarohaṇam |
latāliṅganamātreṇa sudhādhautakalevaraḥ ||

mūlayoge kṛte tatra japedaṣṭasahasrakam |
nityajāpe ca home ca yatra saṃkhyā na coditā ||

tatreyaṃ gaṇanā proktā aṣṭottarasahasrakam |
jalapūtaṃ havidravyaṃ gṛhītvā tarpayet tataḥ ||

vidhāya tarpaṇaṃ deva pradakṣiṇamanuvrajet |
stutvā praṇamya kalpoktastavena toṣayet tataḥ ||

iti vīrakulaṃ deva devabandyaṃ manoharam |
yaddeśe vidyate vīrastatkulaṃ vāpi bhairava ||

na ca mārībhayaṃ tatra na ca rājabhayādikam |
sumaṅgalaṃ sadā tatra dhanaputravivardhanam ||

lakṣmīstatra mahādeva susthirā bhavati dhruvam |
mantraḥ svapnaprabodhinyā avaśyaṃ vṛkṣamūlake ||

yojanīyaḥ prayatnena na ca vighnaḥ prajāyate |
nānyavīrasya tadyogyaṃ grahaṇairdevatairapi ||

yoginībhirna luptaṃ ca tanna pāpena lipyate |
yatra tatra kuje vāre śmaśānagamane kṛte ||

pūjāphalaṃ bhavet tatra saptavāsarasammitam |
caturdaśyāṃ gate tatra pakṣapūjāphalaṃ bhavet ||

na gacchennāryataḥ sthāne paśureva na saṃśayaḥ |
nāstyasmādadhikaṃ deva iti cintāparāyaṇaḥ ||

madena dravyabhoktā tu bhavet kulaparāyaṇaḥ |
sādhake kṣobhamāpanne mama kṣobhaḥ prajāyate ||

tasmād yatnād vīravaro bhaved bhogayutaḥ sukhī |
bhogena mokṣamāpnoti bhogena kulasādhanam ||

vinā hetumanāsvādya kṣobhayukto maheśvaraḥ |
na pūjā mama samparkaṃ na dhyānamanucintanam ||

<121> tasmād bhuktvā ca pītvā ca pūjayet parameśvarīm |
nātra pracyutidoṣo'sti nāparaṃ doṣabhūṣaṇam ||

yad yad vadati nidrāti yat karoti yadarcati |
tat sarvaṃ kularūpaṃ tu dhyātvā ca viharet sukhī ||

ekākī nirjane deśe śmaśāne parvate vane |
śūnyagehe nadītīre niḥsaṅgo viharen mudā ||

vīrāṇāṃ japakālastu sarvakālaḥ praśasyate |
sarvadeśe sarvapīṭhe karttavyaṃ ca na saṃśayaḥ ||

yadi vipro bhaved bhraṣṭaḥ kuladharmaparāyaṇaḥ |
tadānena vidhānena karttavyaṃ kulatoṣaṇam ||

vipro vīra eva |

aparāpuṣpagarbhe tu kulasthānaṃ manoharam |
sarvadevamukhaṃ tatra mahākāmakalātmakam ||

hayārikusume devaḥ svayamasti sadāśivaḥ |
tanmadhye laghumādāya puṣpamadhye tu candanam ||

raktaṃ vā kusumaṃ dattvā dhyātvātmānaṃ śivātmakam |
yojayecchivaśaktyostu aikyaṃ saṃbhāvayed dhiyā ||

kṣaṇaṃ vicintya tatraiva sampūjya parameśvarīm |
japtvā tadeva kuṇḍākhyaṃ dravyaṃ paramadurlabham ||

yatrā'parājitāpuṣpaṃ javāpuṣpaṃ ca bhairava |
karavīre raktaśukle droṇapuṣpaṃ ca tiṣṭhati ||

tatra devī vasena nityaṃ tad yantre pūjayen mama |
datte caiva javāpuṣpe paṭṭavastraphalaṃ labhet ||

brahmahatyādikaṃ pāpaṃ kṣaṇān naśyati niścitam |
aparāyāstu māhātmyaṃ vaktuṃ nahi maheśvara ||

vīrasādhanakāryaṃ ca kartavyaṃ vīrapūruṣaiḥ |
divyairapi ca karttavyaṃ paśubhirna ca pāmaraiḥ ||

varaṃ pāmarakāryaṃ ca na paśoriti niścitam |
yad yanna sat purā proktaṃ saṃketamantrasādhane ||

añjanaṃ guṭikādiṃ ca kuryād vīro mahābalaḥ |
<122> divye vīre na bhedo'sti yad bhedaṃ tat tu kathyate ||

śānto vinīto madhuraḥ kalālāvaṇyasaṃyutaḥ |
divyastu devavat prāyo vīraścoddhatamānasaḥ ||

vibhūtibhūṣaṇairvāpi candanairvā vilepitaḥ |
ākāragopano vāpi tyakto vā kulabhairava ||

raktacandanadigdho vā vaibhava(?)ścāpyavaiṣṇavaḥ |
apamāne ca pūjāyāṃ hṛṣṭaḥ puṣṭaḥ sadā bhavet ||

devanindāparo vāpi tattatpūjāparo'pi vā |
pūjāparastadrahitaḥ kulākulamate sthitaḥ ||

nijabhāvasamāyukto devavat viharet kṣitau |
svakulānte puraścaryā kāryā rātrau na cānyathā ||

vedahīne dvije deva yathā na śrutisaṃkathā |
viṣṇubhaktiṃ vinā devībhaktirna prabhaved yathā ||

śāktajñānaṃ vinā muktiryathā hāsyāya kalpate |
guruṃ vinā yathā tantre nādhikāraḥ kathañcana ||

patihīnā yathā nārī sarvakarmavivarjitā |
kulaṃ vinā devavidhau kadāpi mama sādhane ||

nā'dhikārīti kauleyastasmād bhāvaparo bhava |
avinītaṃ kulaṃ yasya sa kathaṃ mama pūjakaḥ |
tasmād yatnāt tathā kāryaṃ yathā syād vinayānvitam ||

bhāvābhāvāt kule śāstre nādhikāraḥ kathañcana |
tena bhāvaviśuddhastu sādhakaḥ kauliko bhavet ||

iti vīrabhāvakramaḥ

atha paśubhāvaḥ

(bhāvacūḍāmaṇau) devyuvāca (-)

paśubhāvaṃ pravakṣyāmi śṛṇu vatsa samāhitaḥ |
yathāvidhi paśorvidyāṃ gṛhītvā bhāvatatparaḥ ||

prathamaṃ pūrvasevārthaṃ yatnataḥ śuddhimācaret |
na matsyabhojanaṃ kuryān na striyaṃ manasā smaret ||

na paradravyalobhī syānna bhoge mānasaṃ bhajet |
<123> sindhutīre parvate vā kānane ca surālaye ||

bilvamūle vivikte ca puṇyakṣetre ca śobhane |
na śūdradarśanaṃ kuryāt kauṭilyaṃ yatnatastyajet ||

devatā śubhavarṇā tu dhyātavyā susamāhitaiḥ |
trisandhyaṃ devapūjā tu trisandhyaṃ japamācaret ||

rātrau mantraṃ ca mālāṃ ca spṛśennaiva kadācana |
na mantramuccared bhuktvā maunī syāt sarvakarmasu ||

parvakāle striyaṃ naiva gacchet sādhakasattamaḥ |
puṣpaṃ gandhaṃ jalaṃ caiva svayamānīya pūjayet ||

maithunaṃ tatkathālāpaṃ tadgoṣṭhīṃ parivarjayet |
ṛtukālaṃ vinā cāpi gacchenna striyamādarāt |
purāṇaśravaṇe śraddhā vedavedārthatatparaḥ |
na rātrau bhojayed vidvān tāmbūlaṃ parameśvara ||

guruṇā yad yadādiṣṭaṃ tat sarvaṃ yatnataścaret |
svajātakusumaṃ caiva hetudravyaṃ ca bhairava ||

spṛṣṭvā tathā samāghrāya pañcagavyena śudhyati |
raktavastraṃ na gṛhṇīyād devībhaktiparāyaṇaḥ ||

viṣṇutantreṣu kalyāṇi tadanuṣṭhānameva ca |
kāryaṃ vīrakathālāpaṃ na kuryād vīravandita ||

nityaśrāddhaṃ gayāśrādhaṃ sandhyāvandanameva ca |
tīrthasnānaṃ pīṭhadeśagamanaṃ dharmatatparaḥ ||

paśustu dvividho deva pūrveṇa saha bhairava |
asyādhikāraḥ pūjāyāṃ na gurutve kadācana ||

pūrvasya nādhikāro'sti pūjādeśagatāgatau |
pūrvastu sarvakaulārhairbahiṣkāryaḥ svadeśataḥ ||

pūrvadarśanamātreṇa kuladarśanamācaret |
brahmahatyādikaṃ pāpaṃ varaṃ satyaṃ na ca prabho ||

pūrvadarśanamevātra satyaṃ satyaṃ vadāmyaham |
mamātmā so'pi deveśa vibhurityapi sa prabho ||

tathāpi tatra me śaṅkā jāyate tat pade pade |
<124> varaṃ kulaṃ parityājyaṃ varaṃ svakulahiṃsanam ||

varaṃ svakulahānistu svakulakuṭṭanam |
kāyena manasā vācā varaṃ svakulapālanam ||

na kurvīta paśoḥ saṅgaṃ svamārgakṣayakāraṇāt |
kulaśāstre dvayaṃ pāpaṃ gariṣṭhaṃ kulanāśanam ||

svakule mahatī nindā parayogaḥ kuleśvara |
tasmādapi mahāpāpaṃ paśusaṅgāt prajāyate ||

sa bhāvaḥ paśubhāvena janmatrayavibhāvanāt |
vīrabhāvo bhaved deva tato daivaḥ prajāyate ||

daivācca jāyate vīro vīrād daivaḥ prajāyate |
sarvathā tatra bhāvau dvau na prakāśyau kuleśvara ||

daive vīre na sandehaḥ sāmyamityabhidhīyate |
bhāvastu mānaso dharmaḥ śābdaḥ sa hi kathaṃ bhavet ||

tasmād bhāvo na vaktavyo diṅmātraṃ samudāhṛtam |
yathekṣudaṇḍamādhuryamaśanairjñāyate prabho |
tathā bhāvavibhāvastu manasā paribhāvyate ||

[iti mahāmahopādhyāya ṭhakkura śrīnarasiṃhaviracite tārābhaktisudhārṇave 
caturthastaraṅgaḥ] || 4 ||



[pañcamastaraṅgaḥ]

atha nityavidhiḥ

kulacūḍāmaṇau (-) sādhakaḥ prātarutthāya kulavṛkṣaṃ praṇamya ca |
mūlādibrahmarandhrāntaṃ kulaṃ dhyātvā guruṃ smaret ||

kulavṛkṣā rudrayāmale (-)

śleṣmātakaṃ karañjaṃ ca nimbāśvatthakadambakam |
bilvaṃ vaṭaṃ śālatālaṃ śākhoṭaṃ kharjuraṃ tathā ||

kulavṛkṣāḥ samuddiṣṭā | iti |

vastutaḥ kulavṛkṣo varāṅganeti rahasyavidaḥ | vīracūḍāmaṇau (-)

sādhakaḥ prātarutthāya saṃsmared gurumādarāt |
mahācīnaguruṃ dhyātvā'thavarṣigurukramam ||

pañcopacāraiḥ sampūjya vīradravyakrameṇa tu |
nīlāmbaraṃ nīlavilepayuktaṃ śaṅkhādibhūṣitatanuṃ muditaṃ dvinetram |
vāmāṅkapīṭhasthitanīlaśaktiṃ vandāmi vīraṃ karuṇānidhānam ||

parāṃ tu devatāṃ dhyātvā hṛdaye nīlasundarīm |
kharvāṃ nīlāṃ viśālākṣīṃ pañcamudrāvibhūṣitām ||

kapālakartṛkāhastāṃ khaḍgendīvaradhāriṇīm |
vyālamālājaṭājūṭāṃ pīnonnatapayodharām ||

navayauvanasampūrṇāṃ madaghūrṇitalocanām |
evaṃ dhyātvā mahādevīṃ sarvajñaḥ sādhako bhavet ||

vīrahaṃsamahāvidyāsaṅkalpaṃ kārayed budhaḥ |
haṃsākhyā sādhanaṃ vakṣye mantriṇāṃ hitakāmyayā ||

yasya vijñānamātreṇa sarvajño bhuvi jāyate |
haṃsātmikāṃ bhagavatīṃ jīvo japati sarvadā ||

asyāḥ smaraṇamātreṇa jīvanmukto bhavennaraḥ |
ṛṣirhaṃsaḥ samākhyātaḥ parahaṃsaśca devatā ||

avyaktaśchando gāyatrī viniyogo yogasiddhidaḥ |
surendrasaṃhitāyām (-) ṛṣirhaṃso vyaktapūrvo gāyatraṃ chanda ucyate |
 <126> devatāparamādityo haṃso haṃ bījamucyate ||

aḥ śaktiḥ kīlakaḥ so'haṃ praṇavastattvameva hi |
udāttaḥ svara ityevaṃ manorasya prakīrtitaḥ ||

mokṣārthe viniyogaḥ syādevaṃ kuryāt sadā naraḥ ||

vīracūḍāmaṇau (-) sūryātmane ca hṛd devi somātmane śirastathā |
nirañjanaṃ śikhā jyotirnirābhāsā tathāpare ||

avyaktaṃ netrayornyasya ananto'stre phaḍaṃpyajet (?) |
evaṃ nyāsavidhiṃ kṛtvā gaṇeśādau samarpayet ||

surendrasaṃhitāyām (-) haṃsātmikāṃ bhagavatīṃ jīvo japati sarvadā |
hakāreṇa bahiryāti sakāreṇa viśet punaḥ ||

asyāḥ sambodhamātreṇa jīvanmukto bhavennaraḥ ||

prāṇāyāmaprabhāveṇa jīvanmuktastu jāyate ||

ekaviṃśatisāhasraṃ ṣaṭśatādhikameva ca |
prajapet pratyahaṃ jīvo brahmānandamayīṃ parām ||

utpattirjapa ārambho mṛtirasya nivedanam |
vinā japena satataṃ japo bhavati sarvadā ||

evaṃ japastu vijñāto gaṇeśādau nivedayet |
vīracūḍāmaṇau (-) ṣaṭśatāni gaṇeśasya ṣaṭsahasraṃ prajāpateḥ |
ṣaṭsahasraṃ gadāpāṇau ṣaṭsahasraṃ pinākinaḥ ||

sahasramātmane caiva sahasraṃ paramātmane |
sahasraṃ gurave caiva saṅkalpo'yaṃ yathāvidhi ||

raktavarṇaṃ gaṇeśañca mūlādhāre caturdale |
vādivedasamāyukte ṣaṭśataṃ ca samarpayet ||

svādhiṣṭhānaṃ vidrumābhaṃ ṣaṭkoṇaṃ vādiṣaṭkakam |
sāvitryā ca samāyukte brahmaṇe ca samarpayet ||

vidyutpuñjaprabhābhaṃ ca dalaṃ ḍādidaśākṣaram |
lakṣmīnārāyaṇau vande ṣaṭ sahasraṃ nivedayet ||

mahānīlaprabhābhe ca kādidvādaśapatrake |
umāmaheśvarau vande ṣaṭ sahasraṃ samarpayet ||

viśuddhe dhūmrapatre ca kalāpatre svarān nyaset |
<127> prāṇaśaktyātmako vande sahasraṃ ca samarpayet ||

ājñāyāṃ vidyudābhāyāṃ śubhau hakṣau niyojayet |
paramātmani parāśaktau sahasraṃ ca samarpayet ||

karpūradyutisaṃrājat  sahasradalapaṅkaje |
nīlātmakaṃ guruṃ dhyāyet sahasraṃ ca samarpayet ||

samudramekhale devi parvatastanmaṇḍale |
viṣṇupatni namaste'stu pādasparśaṃ kṣamasva me ||

caraṇaṃ dhārayed devi ātmaśvāsānusārataḥ |
dehaśaucādikaṃ kuryād bhasmasnānaṃ samācaret ||

vīrāsanopaviṣṭastu vīrabhasmānulepanam |
vīraṃ dhyātvā mahādevi vīramālāṃ japed budhaḥ ||

aṣṭottarasahasraṃ ca vāmahaste samarpayet |
vīrabhasma śmaśānabhasma | vāmahasta ityabhidhānān mūlamantrajapo'yamiti 
pratibhāti | viśuddheśvare tu (-)

yathā śaktyā japaṃ kṛtvā stutvā santoṣayecchivām |

ityuktam | etatpūrvamanyatra gurumantrajapo'pyuktaḥ | taduktaṃ tattvacintāmaṇau 
(-)

athavā vāgbhavaṃ māyāṃ lakṣmībījaṃ samuddharet |
hasakhaphreṃ tathānandabhairavākhyaṃ sahakhaphreṃ ||

gurunāma tathā śaktināma śrīpādukāṃ smaret |
daśadhā saptadhā vāpi tridhā vā prajapet sudhīḥ ||

japaṃ samarpayet paścāt śrīgurordakṣiṇe kare | iti |

vīracūḍāmaṇau (-) vajrapuṣpaṃ varārohe kārayed dantadhāvanam |
vajrapuṣpamārtavaṃ javākusumaṃ vā | idaṃ ca dantadhāvanaṃ 
dehaśaucānantarameva kāryam |
anyatra tathā darśanāt | nyāsaṃ kuryānmaheśāni śaktiṃ sāṅgo spṛśed 
budhaḥ |
hāvabhāvādikaṃ kuryāt snānakarma samācaret ||

vīrabhasmānulepanādi vīrasādhakamātraparam | idañca 
prātaḥkṛtyamāvaśyakam |
taduktaṃ yāmale (-) prātaḥkṛtyamakṛtvā ca yo devīṃ bhaktito'rcayet |
pūjā ca viphalā tasya śaucahīnā yathā kriyā ||

atha snānam 

tacca trividham | ādakamāntramānasabhedāt | tatrādau pradhānatvādaudakaṃ 
nirūpyate |

<128> nāradapañcarātre (-) śaṅkunāstrābhijaptena śuciḥ snāyāt tu mṛttikām |
gṛhītvā'streṇa saṃmantrya yathā jalaniketanam ||

tatrādau jalakulaṃ tu kṣālayedastravāriṇā |
mṛdaṃ kṛtvā dvidhā tatra ekabhāgopagaṃ tataḥ ||

nidhāya gomayaṃ darbhāt tilāṃścaivābhimantritān |
laukikaṃ gaṇamādyena bhāgenaikena yatnataḥ ||

malasnānaṃ purā kṛtvā vidhisnānaṃ samācaret |
kūlacūḍāmaṇau (-) atha vakṣyāmi te vatsa snānaṃ kulasukhāvaham |
kṛṣṇaraktaharillīlā vividhā mama mūrtayaḥ ||

tatra yatkulagaḥ śiṣyaḥ sa tadrūpaṃ parāmṛśet |
ācāntaḥ kuladarbheṇa sadarbhaḥ kulapuṣpakam ||

kulapātre sadarbhaṃ ca satilaṃ sajalaṃ tataḥ |
gṛhītvā kuladevasya prītaye snānamācaret ||

kṛtasaṅkalpa evāsau kulacakraṃ jale nyaset |
kulasurāt samānīya kulamudrāṃ kuśena ca ||

kulatīrthāni tatraiva samānīya kulātmakam |
tat toyaṃ ca tridhā pītvā tridhā ca prokṣaṇaṃ tanoḥ ||

yatkulagaḥ samantradīkṣitaḥ | kuladarbho yathā rudrayāmale (-)

trayo darbhāḥ samuddiṣṭāḥ suvarṇai rajataiḥ kuśaiḥ |
tatra śākte dvayaṃ cānyadanyeṣāṃ tu trayo matāḥ ||

suvarṇaṃ rajataṃ caiva japapūjādikarmasu |
kuśakāryakaraṃ proktaṃ na tu vanyakuśāḥ kuśāḥ ||

anyatrāpi (-) tarjanyā rajataṃ dhāryaṃ svarṇaṃ dhāryamanāmayā |
eṣa eva kuśaḥ prokto na darbho vanasambhavaḥ ||

yāmale (-) vinārvai dūrvayā devī pūjā nāstīha karhicit |
tasmād dūrvā gṛhītavyā sarvapuṣpamayī śubhā |
haste dūrvāṅkuraṃ dattvā ācāmed vidhipūrvakam |
kulapuṣpaṃ javāpuṣpādikam | kulapātraṃ suvarṇādipātram | kuladevasya 
iṣṭadevatāyāḥ | kulacakraṃ trikoṇacakram | tallikhanaprakārastu mālinītantre (-)

trikoṇaṃ mūlamantreṇa sāvitre haṃsakaṃ japan |
<129> dakṣāvarttakrameṇaiva likhed devi samāhitaḥ ||

mūlabījeneti | mantrāntare | sāvitre sūryamantre | haṃsakaṃ haṃsa iti mantram | 
aṅkuśamudrā ca (-) dakṣamuṣṭiṃ vidhāyā'tha tarjanyaṅkuśarūpiṇī |
aṅkuśākhyā mahāmudrā tryailokyākarṣaṇakṣamā ||

iti tantroktā | tīrthāvāhanamantraśca śrīkramasaṃhitāyām (-)

gaṅge ca yamune caiva godāvari sarasvati |
narmade sindhukāveri jale'smin sannidhiṃ kuru ||

tridhā toyapānamācamanarūpameva | tacca mūlamantreṇa | prokṣaṇamapi tenaiva 
| taduktaṃ
triśaktiratne (-) trirācamya ca mūlena mudrayā kumbhasaṃjñayā |
trivāraṃ mantrapūtena śiraḥ saṃprokṣayet sudhīḥ ||

mudrā ceyamuktā tantre (-)

dakṣāṅguṣṭhe parāṅguṣṭhaṃ kṣiptvā hastadvayena tu |
sāvakāśā caikamuṣṭirmudreyaṃ kumbhasaṃjñitā ||

gandharvatantre (-) mūlaṃ paṭhan mūrdhni toyaṃ mudrayā kumbhasaṃjñayā |
kṣiptvā vāratrayaṃ paścādācāmet sādhakāgraṇīḥ ||

ātmavidyāśivaistattvaistato yāgagṛhaṃ vrajet |
ātmavidyāśivaistattvairiti | ātmatattvena sthūladehaṃ śodhayāmi svāhā | 
vidyātattvena sūkṣmadehaṃ śodhayāmi svāhā | śivatattvena paradehaṃ 
śodhayāmi svāheti mantratrayeṇa culukatrayaṃ gṛhṇīyādityarthaḥ | nīlatantre (-)

vidyayā trirnimajyaivamācāmet pāthasā tathā |
vaśiṣṭhasaṃhitāyām (-) kṛtvādau vaidikaṃ snānaṃ tatastāntrikamācaret |
vinyasyāṅge ṣaḍaṅgāni prāṇāyāmapuraḥsaram ||

śrīsūryamaṇḍalāt tīrthamākṛṣyā'ṅkuśamudrayā |
vamityanena cāplāvya kavacenā'vaguṇṭhayet ||

saṃrakṣyā'streṇa mūlena mantrayed rudrasaṃkhyayā |
ātmarakṣāṃ tataḥ kuryād vārikṣepeṇa cāstrataḥ ||

nimajya tatra śrīdevaṃ dhyāyecchaktyā manuṃ japet |
unmayya kumbhamudrāṃ ca baddhvā siñcet svamūrdhani ||

tripurārṇave (-) vidhāya vaidikaṃ snānaṃ tatastāntrikamācaret |
mṛdamastreṇa cādāya tena tāmabhiṣicya ca ||

<130> śikhāmantreṇa saṃśodhya mantrayenmūlamantrataḥ |
mūrdhādipādaparyantaṃ vilipya ca tayā vapuḥ ||

sammukhīkaraṇīṃ mudrāṃ baddhvā prāṇaṃ nirudhya ca |
nimajya tūṣṇīmutthāya nābhimātre jale sthitaḥ ||

prāṇāyāmatrayaṃ kṛtvā mūlamantreṇa mantravit |
vinyasya ca ṣaḍaṅgāni kalpayet tīrthamagrataḥ ||

tataḥ saṃprārthayet tīrthaṃ sūryamaṇḍalagaṃ tataḥ |
ghṛṇīmantreṇa mantrajño bhittvā cāṅkuśamudrayā ||

tīrthāvāhanamantreṇa tīrthamāvāhayet priye |
mūlamantreṇa saṃyojya kalpite tīrthamaṇḍale ||

tīrthaśaktiṃ ca tatraiva samāvāhyā'rkamaṇḍalāt |
dhyātvā tanmanunā'bhyarcya gaṅgāmantreṇa mantrayet ||

saptakṛtvaḥ śive cāsmin śṛṇu mantradvayaṃ priye |
jalasthaṃ vyomaṣaḍdīrgha svarabhinnaṃ sabindukam ||

sarvānandamaye tīrthe śakte ehyehiyugaṃ dviṭhaḥ |
ekaviṃśākṣaraḥ proktastīrthaśaktimanuḥ priye ||

tāraṃ namo bhagavati brūyādambe tato'mbike |
ambālike mahāmālinyehyehi bhagavatyatha ||

aśeṣatīrthālabāle māyāśrībījamuccaret |
śivajaṭādhirūḍhe ca gaṅge gaṅgāmbike dviṭhaḥ ||

gaṅgāvidyeyamākhyātā tripañcāśadbhirakṣaraiḥ |
bhuvaneśyā samāloḍyā'mṛtīkṛtya sudhāṇunā ||

kavacenā'vaguṇṭhyā'tha saṃrakṣyā'streṇa mantravit |
mūlena devatāṃ tatra sāṅgāṃ sāvaraṇāṃ tathā ||

samāvāhya jale dhyātvā tatpādadvayanirgatam |
dhyātvā tīrthaṃ smaran mūlamantraṃ snāyājjale triśaḥ ||

unmajya mūlamantreṇa siñcet kaṃ kumbhamudrayā |
ācamya vidhinā paścān mūlamantreṇa tarpayet ||

tridhā devīṃ samuttirya jalāddhaute śubhāmbare |
paridhāyā'tha tilakaṃ kṛtvā sandhyāṃ samācaret ||

<131> saṃprārthayediti (-) brahmāṇḍodaratīrthāni karaiḥ spṛṣṭāni te rave |
tena satyena me deveśa tīrthaṃ dehi divākara ||

ityenenetyarthaḥ | tīrthāvāhanamantreṇeti | gaṅge cetyanenetyarthaḥ | dhyātveti (-)

sarvānandamayīmaśeṣadūritadhvaṃsāṃ mṛgāṅkaprabhāṃ
tryakṣāmūrdhvakaradvayena dadhatīṃ pāśaṃ śṛṇiṃ vāmataḥ |
antaścāmṛtapūrṇahemakalaśau muktākṣamālāṃ varāṃ
gaṅgāṃ sindhusaridvarādisahitāṃ śrītīrthaśaktiṃ bhaje ||

iti prakāreṇa | eteṣāṃ prakārāṇāmavirodhe samuccayaḥ | virodhe vikalpaḥ | 
tripurārṇavoktaprakārastu traipura evetyapi vadanti |

atha māntrasnānam

nāradapañcarātre (-) atha māntraṃ śubhaṃ śṛṇu ityupakramya (-)

toyābhāve tu yat kāryaṃ durge kāle vaśī tataḥ |
gamane kṣiprasiddhyarthaṃ gurukāryeṣvatandritaḥ ||

prāptāpadyatha viprendra niśābhāge tathā mune |
prakṣālya pādāvācamya proddhṛtena tu vāriṇā ||

sthānaṃ daśa diśaḥ prāgvat saṃśodhyopoviśet tataḥ |
astraṃ hastatale nyasya kramān nyāsān tataścaret ||

mūlamantrāditaḥ kuryāt sarvamantragaṇena vai |
kevalādudakasnānāt saṃskāraparivarjitāt ||

prabhāsādiṣu tīrtheṣu yat phalaṃ snātakasya tu |
jñeyaṃ daśaguṇaṃ tasmānmantrasnānasya niścayāt ||

toyābhāve audakasnānakṣamatoyābhāve | astramityādi | svavidyāyā 
astramantraṃ karayorvinyasya mantranyāsapūrvakaṃ svatantroktanyāsajālaṃ 
kuryādityarthaḥ | kevalāditi | snānamiha nyāsarūpameva | tantrāntare tu (-)

maṇibandhādadho hastau pādau gulphādathānanam |
kṣālayet snānametat syāt pañcāṅgaṃ śuddhidāyakam ||

atha mānasasnānam

śaivāgame (-) manasā mūlamantreṇa prāṇāyāmapuraḥsaram |
kurvīta mānasaṃ snānaṃ sarvatra vihitaṃ ca yat ||

sarvatra sarvavidyāsu |

<132> nāradapañcarātre (-) dhyānasnānamatho vakṣye dvābhyāmapi paraṃ ca yat |
khasthitaṃ puṇḍarīkākṣaṃ mantramūrtiṃ prabhuṃ smaret |
tatpādodakajāṃ dhārāṃ nipatantīṃ svamūrdhani |
cintayet sūkṣmarandhreṇa praviśantīṃ svakāṃ tanum ||

tayā saṃkṣālayet sarvametaddehagataṃ malam |
tat kṣaṇād virajā mantrī jāyate sphaṭikopamaḥ ||

idaṃ snānavaraṃ mantrasnānācchataguṇaṃ smṛtam |

puṇḍarīkākṣamityupalakṣaṇam |  yā yasya devatā sa tāṃ smarediti tātparyam |
dvābhyāmiti | alpāyāsena tatphalakatvād dvābhyāṃ śreṣṭhamityuktam | na 
tvatastat pradhānamiti bodhyam | asyāstu vidyāyā mahīcīnakramopāsyatvādatra 
mānasasnānameva pradhānam | tata utthāya vāsasī bṛbhṛyāt | taduktaṃ 
kulacūḍāmaṇau (-)

utthāya kulavastre dve paridhāya kulena tu |
tilakaṃ kularūpaṃ tu kṛtvā'vaśyaṃ samāpya ca ||

kulavastra ityatra kulapadamutkṛṣṭaraktavāci | kulena mūlamantreṇa | kularūpaṃ 
tilakam | śmaśānamṛdbhiḥ satataṃ tripuṇḍraṃ kārayet sudhīriti 
matsyasūktoktaṃ vīratilakam |

nāradapañcarātre (-) sudhautaṃ paridhāyā'tha vastrayugmamakhedakam |
tadabhāvādatha śāṭīṃ yogapaṭṭakasaṃyutām ||

na caikavāsasā yasmād bhavitavyaṃ kadācana |

svatantratrantre (-) mokṣārthī raktavastre dve bhogārthī śvetavāsasī |
paridhāya tato vidvān yāgabhūmiṃ yathā viśet ||

yāmale (-) bibhṛyād vāsasī śubhre tilakaṃ vaṇabhedataḥ |
varṇabhedata iti (-) brāhmaṇasyordhvapuṇḍraṃ syāt kṣatriyasya tripuṇḍrakam |
vaiśyānāmardhacandraṃ syācchudrasya vartulākṛtīti ||

nāradapañcarātroktakrameṇetyarthaḥ | samayātantre (-)

bhasmanā tilakaṃ kuryād mṛdbhirvā puṇḍrakatrayam |
bhairavītantre (-) tilakaṃ raktagandhena gopīcandanakena vā |
devyastraṃ vilikhed bhāle tārabījaṃ tato hṛdi ||

śaktiṃ madhyagatāṃ kuryāt sādhako narapuṅgavaḥ |
bhairavītantre (-) ācamya prāṅmukho bhūtvā upaviśya ca mantravit |
vaidikīṃ tāntrikīṃ kuryāt tataḥ sandhyāṃ samāhitaḥ ||

<133> śaivāgame (-) prāṇāyāmatrayaṃ kṛtvā mūlamantreṇa mantravit |
aṅgāni vinyased dehe karanyāsapuraḥsaram ||

amṛtīkṛtya purato jalaṃ ca dhenumudrayā |
abhimantrya ca mūlena saptavāraṃ ca sādhakaḥ ||

akārādikṣakārāntairmātṛkārṇaiḥ sabindubhiḥ |
pratyarṇaṃ prokṣayenmūrdhni kuśairmūlena vā tridhā ||

kumārīkalpe (-) praṇavaṃ pūrvamuddhṛtya maṇidharaṇī vajriṇi |
rakṣadvayaṃ tathā hūṃ phaṭ svāheti tadanantaram ||

anenaiva hi mantreṇa rakṣāṃ kuryād vicakṣaṇaḥ |
punarācamya vinyasya ṣaḍaṅgamapi mantravit ||

vāmahaste jalaṃ gṛhya galitodakabindubhiḥ |
saptadhā prokṣaṇaṃ kṛtvā mūrdhni mantraṃ samudgiran ||

avaśiṣṭodakaṃ dakṣe haste saṃgṛhya mantravit |
iḍayā kṛṣṇadehāntaḥ kṣālitaṃ pāpasañcayam ||

kṛṣṇavarṇaṃ tadudakaṃ dakṣanāsābhirecitam |
dakṣahastena tanmantrī pāparūpaṃ vicintya ca ||

purato vajrapāṣāṇe prakṣipedastramantrataḥ |
rakṣā śikhābandhanarūpaiveti tattvavidaḥ | yāmale (-)

ṣaḍaṅganyāsamācarya vāmahaste jalaṃ tataḥ |
gṛhītvā dakṣiṇenaiva saṃpuṭaṃ kārayet tataḥ ||

śivavāyujalapṛthvī vahnibījaistridhā punaḥ |
abhimantrya ca mūlena saptadhā tattvamudrayā ||

nikṣipet tajjalaṃ mūrdhni śeṣaṃ dakṣe nidhāya ca |
śarīrāntasthitaṃ pāpaṃ kṣālayet sādhakāgraṇīḥ ||

mūlena tilakaṃ kuryāt sandhyaivaiva hi kaulikī |
uddiśya kulagaṃ śiṣyaṃ kathitā kulaṃsundari ||

śivabījaṃ hakāraḥ | vāyubījaṃ yakāraḥ | jalabījaṃ vakāraḥ | pṛthvībījaṃ 
lakāraḥ | vahnibījaṃ rephaḥ | eteṣāṃ ca sānusvārāṇāṃ bījatvam | sajalaṃ 
vāmahastaṃ dakṣahastena saṃpuṭīkṛtya ebhirbījaistridhā jalamabhimantrayet | 
tattvamudrā anāmāṅguṣṭhayogena bhavati | tathā ca hastasthameva jalaṃ 
mūlamantreṇa saptadhā mūrdhni kṣipedityarthaḥ |

<134> tadatra kumārīkalpa yāmalayorvikalpo gurukramaparicchedyaḥ | 
vīracūḍāmaṇau (-)

viyadvahniṃ samuccārya nārāyaṇaṃ sabindukam |
māyābījaṃ samuccārya gaganaṃ vahnisaṃyutam ||

ardhacandrasamāyuktaṃ vāmakarṇavibhūṣitam |
haṃsa ityuccaret paścāt sūryamaṇḍalaṅentakam |
tārāyai padamuccārya hṛdayānte'ñjaliṃ kṣipet ||

tato gāyatrīṃ japet | taduktaṃ śaivāgame (-)

gāyatryā vātha mūlena dadyādarghyatrayaṃ tataḥ |
śivāya maṇḍalasthāya mukhe mūlena tarpayet ||

tridhā japtvātha gāyatrīṃ aṣṭāviṃśativārakam |
gāyatrīṃ sveṣṭadevatāgāyatrīm | tārāgāyatrī coktā kālikārṇave (-)

aiṃ bhagavatyekajaṭe vidmahe ca padaṃ tataḥ |
vikaṭadaṃṣṭre dhīmahi tannastāre pracodayāt ||

mālinītantre (-) mahogrāyai ca vidmahe tārāyai dhīmahi priye |
tanno devī ca śabdānte dhiyo yo naḥ prayodayāt ||

vīracūḍāmaṇau (-) aṣṭadhā daśadhā vāpi gāyatrīṃ ca japed budhaḥ |
vāgbhavaṃ ca samuccārya ekajaṭāyai vidmahe ||

devi strīṃ ca samuccārya nīlasarasvatyai dhīmahi |
hṛllekhāṃ ca samuccārya tatastāre pracodayāt ||

japtvā samarpaṇaṃ kuryād devatāvāmahastake |

gāyatrīdhyānaṃ tu tantre (-)

udyadādityasaṅkāśāṃ pustakāḍhyakarāṃ smaret |
kṛṣṇājinadharāṃ brāhmīṃ dhyāyettārakitāmbare ||

madhyāhne (-) śyāmavarṇāṃ caturbāhuṃ śaṅkhacakralasatkarām |
gadāpadmadharāṃ devīṃ sūryabimbakṛtāśrayām ||

sāyāhne varadāṃ devīṃ gāyatrīṃ saṃsmared budhaḥ |
śuklāṃ śuklāmbaradharāṃ vṛṣāsanakṛtāśrayām |
trinetrāṃ varadāṃ pāśaṃ śūlaṃ ca nṛkaroṭikām ||

gautamīye (-) saṃkṣepasandhyāmathavā kuryānmantrī hyaśaktitaḥ |
sāyaṃ prātaśca madhyāhne kṛṣṇaṃ dhyātvā manuṃ japet ||

<135> iti sandhyātrayaṃ proktaṃ karmiṇāṃ siddhidāyakam |
kṛṣṇamityupalakṣaṇam | sveṣṭadevatāmityarthaḥ | saivāgame (-)

sandhyālopo na kartavyaḥ śambhorājñaivameva hi |
dīkṣitaḥ sandhyayā hīno na dīkṣāphalamaśnute ||

sandhyāhīno'nyasandhyāyāṃ pūrvasandhyākriyāmatha |
vidhāyottarasandhyāyāḥ kriyāṃ kuryādatandritaḥ ||

gautamīye (-) sandhyāyāṃ patitāyāṃ vā gāyatrīṃ daśadhā japet |
tantrarāje tu (-) snānasandhyārcanālope japedaṣṭottaraṃ śatam | ityuktam |

atha tarpaṇam

kūlacūḍāmaṇau (-) devān ṛṣīn pitṝṃścaiva toṣayet kulavāriṇā |
kulātmakān punardhyātvā kule saṃlīya toṣayet ||

kulavāriṇā āhūtakulavīryamayavāriṇā | kulātmakān 
divyoghasiddhaughamānavaughān | kule pūjācakre | saṃlīya āvāhya | tathā (-)

bhairavāya ca devāya bhairavāveśakāriṇe |
bhairavākhyaṃ pradātavyaṃ mantramuccārya pūrvataḥ ||

bhairavākhyaṃ mantramityanvayaḥ | sa cānandabhairavamantro vakṣyate | pūrvata 
oghatrayatarpaṇāt pūrvam | yāmale (-)

tarpaṇādau prayuñjīta tṛpyatāṃ brahmabhairavaḥ |
tarpaṇe pitṝṇāṃ bhairavatvenollekhastu vīraviṣayaḥ | paśunā tu mālinītantre (-)

dakṣiṇāśāmukho bhūtvā saṃgṛhya moṭakaṃ tataḥ |
tṛpyantu pitaraḥ proktvā caitat tarpaṇamācaret ||

śaivāgame (-) dhyātvā devaṃ jale samyak pūjayitvā'tha mūlataḥ |
aṣṭottaraśatāvṛttyā tarpayenmūlamantrataḥ ||

tadardhena tadardhena daśadhā vātha tarpayet |
tatastadaṅgāvaraṇadevatāstarpayet kramāt ||

ekaikāñjalinā tadvanmūlamantrapuraḥsaram |
tataḥ sampūjya deveśaṃ sāṅgāvaraṇakaṃ tataḥ ||

saṃbaddhāsye hṛdi svīye ātmānaṃ tanmayaṃ smaret |
yāmale (-) yantrarājaṃ jale dhyātvā tatra devīṃ nidhāya ca |
devaṣipitṛpūrvāṃ tu sāyudhāṃ saparivārām ||

<136> vala(?) vā tarpayed devīṃ gṛhe vā tarpayet sudhīḥ |
gurupaṅktiṃ ca santarpya vaṭukādīṃśca tarpayet ||

mūladevīṃ ca santarpya tarpayet parivārakān |
tarpayed dvārapālādīṃstathaivāṅgādidevatāḥ ||

śeṣikāṃ sundarīṃ paścādaiśyāṃ ca paramaṃ gurum |
agnau parāparaṃ caiva nairṛtyāṃ parameṣṭhinam ||

vyāyavyādīśaparyantaṃ gurupaṅktiṃ ca tarpayet |
aṅgāni tattatsthāneṣu madhye devīṃ ca tarpayet ||

tārāyāṃ tu viśeṣo mālinītantre (-)

tīrthodakaṃ tilaṃ kalkaṃ kṣīrākṣatasamanvitam |
uttarāśāmukho bhūtvā devīmātraṃ pratarpayet ||

mātrapadāt parivāratarpaṇaṃ kevalaṃ jalenaiva | iṣṭadevatātarpaṇaprakāro 
nīlatantre (-)

mūlānte tarpayāmīti svāhāntaṃ tarpaṇaṃ matam |
evaṃ tridhā tarpaṇaṃ tu kṛtvā pāpakṣayo bhavet ||

tarpayāmītyataḥ pūrvaṃ dvitīyāntadevatānāma yojyam kriyāyāḥ 
karmasāpekṣatvāt | tathaiva sarvatra darśanācca |

mūlānte tāriṇīṃ procya tarpayāmyagnivallabhā |

iti mālinītantravacanācca | tarpaṇamiṣṭadevatāyāḥ tatraiva mūlamantrānvayasya 
yuktatvāt | idaṃ tu vaiṣṇavānyaparam | vaiṣṇave tu gautamīye (-)

ādau mantraṃ samuccārya śrīpūrvaṃ kṛṣṇamityapi |
tarpayāmi padaṃ coktvā namontaṃ tarpayennaraḥ ||

anyatra tu (-) tarpayāmi padaṃ yojyaṃ mantrānte sveṣu nāmasu |
dvitīyānteṣu cetyevaṃ tarpaṇasya manurmataḥ ||

evaṃ ca mukhyatarpaṇamaṣṭottaraśatāvṛttyeti prathamaḥ pakṣaḥ | pāpakṣayo 
bhavedityato nityakāmyametadavasīyate | pratyekamaṅgaparivāratarpaṇāśaktau 
sāṅgāṃ saparivārāṃ savāhanāṃ sāyudhāṃ amukadevatāṃ tarpayāmi 
svāhetyevaṃ yathāśakti devatāmeva tarpayedityāgamikāḥ | tataḥ 
sūryāyārghyaṃ dadyāt | taduktaṃ yāmale (-)

mārtaṇḍabhairavāyeti tridhā cārghyaṃ prakalpayet |

mārtaṇḍabhairavāyetyekadeśagrahaṇam | tanmantrastu hrīṃ haṃsaḥ 
mārtaṇḍabhairavāya prakāśaśaktisahitāya idamarghaṃ svāheti |
 
<137> tantrarājottare (-) saṃsmṛtya bhairavaṃ devaṃ mārtaṇḍākhyamumāpatim |
mūlena manunā devi sūryasya manunā'thavā ||

māyābījaṃ samuddhṛtya so'haṃ tu viparītakam |
mārttaṇḍabhairavaṃ ṅentaṃ prakāśaśaktisaṃyutam ||

sūryasya mantraḥ saṃprokta iti |

nandikeśvarasaṃhitāyām (-)

dineśāya kṣipet tiṣṭhan vāriṇā cāñjalitrayam |
yāvanna dīyate cārghyaṃ bhāskarāya nivedanam |
tāvanna pūjayed viṣṇuṃ śaṅkaraṃ vā sureśvarīm ||

tataḥ sūryamaṇḍalasthāyai devyai arghyaṃ dadyāt | taduktaṃ nīlatantre (-)

kuśītamoḍrapuṣpaṃ ca kulapuṣpaṃ kuśājalam |
akṣatāṃśca tathā tāmre kṛtvā cārghyaṃ nivedayet ||

mūlānte codyadādityapadānmaṇḍalavarttinyai |
śivacaitanyamayyai ca svāheti tanmanuḥ smṛtaḥ ||

kuśītaṃ raktacandanam | kulapuṣpamārtavam | atra kālītattvakṛtaḥ uktenaiva 
vidhānena snānaṃ kṛtvā tu tāntrikamiti vacanāt sandhyaiṣaiva hi kaulikī | 
uddiśya kulagaṃ śiṣyaṃ kathiteti brahmayāmalavacanāt (-)

kaulikaṃ kurvataḥ karma vaidikaṃ nābhidhīyate |
vaidikaṃ kurvataḥ karma kaulikaṃ nābhidhīyate ||

iti rudrayāmalavacanāt atha yonirupekṣameva (?) karmetyatharvavedācca 
kaulikairvaidikasnānasandhyātarpaṇādīni na kāryāṇīti vadanti | tanna | kṛtvādau 
vaidikaṃ snānaṃ tatastāntrikamācaret iti vaśiṣṭhasaṃhitāvacanasya vidhāya 
vaidikaṃ snānaṃ tatastāntrikamācaret iti tripurārṇavavacanasya ca (-) vaidikīṃ 
tāntrikīṃ sandhyāṃ kṛtvā tarpaṇamācaret iti tantrāntaravacanasya ca virodhāt 
tadvacanānāmanyathārthaḥ kalpyate | tathāhi uktenaiveti | evakāro bhinnakramaḥ 
kṛtvaivetyatrānveti | sandhyaiṣaivetyevakārastāntrikaṃ kalpāntaraṃ 
nāstītyetadarthakaḥ |

	kaulikaṃ kurvata iti rudrayāmalavacanam atharvavacanaṃ ca 
sarvaśākhāpratyayamekaṃ karmeti 
nyāyaprāptayugapadubhayetikartavyatācaraṇapratiṣedhakamiti na kiñcidetat |

atha pūjā

sā ca trividhā uttamamadhyamakaniṣṭhabhedāt | tathocoktaṃ phetkāriṇītantre (-)

<138> śaktibhirmūrtibhiścaiva lokapālaiśca saṃyutaḥ |
pīṭhayantrakramād yāgo nityayāgaḥ sa uttamaḥ ||

pīṭhenaiva samastena bahirāvaraṇaṃ vinā |
agnikāryeṇa haviṣā bhūṣaṇaiśca samanvitaḥ ||

mantrapūrvakṛto yāgo nityayāgaḥ sa madhyamaḥ |
dravyaśuddhisamāyuktaṃ tattatsaṃpūjanaṃ tathā ||

vastrālaṅkāravastūni varjayitvā pṛthagvidham |
agnikāryavihīnaṃ ca kāladeśānusārataḥ ||

upacārairyutaṃ dravyairadhamaṃ pūjanaṃ matam |
atra śaktyapekṣamācaraṇam | tattvasārasaṃhitāyām (-)

anirmālyaṃ sanirmālyamarcanaṃ dvividhaṃ smṛtam |
divyaṃ manobhavairdravyairgandhapuṣpaiḥ sragādibhiḥ ||

yadarcanamanirmālyaṃ divyabhogāpavargadam |
grāmāraṇyādisambhūtairyāgadravyairmanoharaiḥ ||

bhaktairyat kriyate samyak sanirmālyaṃ tadarcanam |
jātamātrāṇi puṣpāṇi ghrātānyeva nisargataḥ ||

pañcabhiśca mahābhūtairbhānunā śaśinā tathā |
prāṇibhiśca dvirephādyaiḥ pauṣpaireva na saṃśayaḥ ||

ato nirmālyamityuktamiti |

atra yatīnāmādāvevādhikāraḥ | agastyaḥ (-)

dvividhaṃ syāllabdhamanorbāhyāntaramupāsanam |
nyāsināmāntaraṃ proktamanyeṣāmubhayaṃ viduriti ||

manasā pūjayed yogī puṣpairāraṇyasambhavaiḥ |
śivārthe puṣpahiṃsāyāṃ na bhavet tat tu hiṃsanam ||

iti śivarahasyavacanamajitendriyaparam |

parivrāḍ jñānamātreṇa homadānādibhirvinā |
sarvaduḥkhapiśācebhyo mukto bhavati nānyathā ||

pārivrāḍaviraktaśca viraktaśca tathā gṛhī |
kumbhīpāke tu majjete tāvubhau kamalānane ||

puṇyastriyo gṛhasthāśca yadyevaṃ kuryuranvaham |
<139> saṃsārānna nivarttante vidhyatikramadoṣataḥ ||

iti agastyasaṃhitāvacanāt | padmapurāṇe (-)

smaraṇe kīrttane viṣṇostathā mānasapūjane |
sadādhikāraḥ sarveṣāṃ mahāpātakināmapi ||

na gṛhī jñānamātreṇa paratreha ca maṅgalam |
prāpnoti candravadane dānahomādibhirvinā ||

gṛhastho yadi dānādi dadyānna juhuyādapi |
pūjayed vidhinā'nena kaḥ kuryādetadanvaham ||

na brahmacāriṇo dātumadhikāro'sti bhāvini |
gurubhyo'pi ca sarvebhyaḥ ko vā dadyādapekṣitam ||

ghrātapuṣpāt phalaṃ sidhyedalpaṃ no mānasaṃ yathā |
tasmādaparihāryatvādanyathā cānupāyataḥ ||

analpabuddhitandrīṇāṃ bāhyapuṣpairbhavet kriyā |

tattvasārasaṃhitāyām (-)

pūjā pañcavidhā proktā pañcarātrāditantrake |
tāścābhigamanaṃ copādānejyādhyāyayogakāḥ ||

tatrābhigamanaṃ nāma mantribhiḥ parikīrtyate |
saṃmārjanopalepādisaṃskāro devamandire ||

upādānaṃ bhaved devapūjāsādhanamelanam |
tataścāpi bhavedijyā gandhapuṣpādibhiḥ punaḥ |
pīṭhapūjā ca devasya sāṅgāvaraṇapūjanam ||

mantrārthabhāvanāpūrvaṃ japo mantrasya kīrtanam |
tacchāstramananaṃ samyak svādhyāyo mantribhiḥ smṛtaḥ ||

gurudevātmanāmaikyabhāvanā yoga ucyate |
sālokyamapi sārūpyaṃ sāmīpyaṃ sārṣṭināmakam ||

sāyujyamapi pañcānāṃ phalānyevaṃ viduḥ kramāditi |

tatrādau deśāḥ phetkāriṇīye (-)

ekaliṅge śmaśāne ca śūnyāgāre catuṣpathe |
tatrasthaḥ sādhayed yogī vidyāṃ tribhuvaneśvarīm ||

ekaliṅgamuktaṃ tatraiva (-) pañcakrośāntare yatra na liṅgāntaramīkṣate |

<140> tadekaliṅgamākhyātaṃ tatra siddhiranuttamā ||

śmaśānādikamuktaṃ triśaktiratne (-)

dahyate vyasavo yatra śavakīlakasaṅkule |
gṛdhragomāyukākādyairmāṃsalubdhairyadāvṛtam ||

tacchmaśānamiti khyātaṃ piśācagaṇasevitam |
kākādinīḍasaṃyuktaṃ kṛtticchatrādisaṃyutam ||

nāgarairdūranirmuktaṃ sādhyasodvegakārakam |
saudhasaṃrūḍhaghāsāḍhyaṃ śūnyāgāraṃ taducyate ||

caturṇāṃ ca pathāṃ yatra saṃpāto yugapad bhavet |
taccatuṣpathamityuktaṃ rajanyāmiṣṭadāyakam ||

pūrvapūrvamidaṃ śastaṃ jaghanyaṃ cottarottaram |
kumārītantre (-) kāmarūpe pūrṇagirau divye coḍḍānake tathā |
vārāṇasyāṃ ca lauhitye karatoyānadījale ||

āryāvarte prayāge ca brahmāvarte tathaiva ca |
anantaphaladā pūjā sarvatraivaṃ jale sthale ||

tadabhāve puṇyagehe sindūrādibhiraṅkite |
khaḍgaśūlagadākartrīcāmaravyajanādibhiḥ ||

vitānadhvajasaṃkīrṇe kṛṣṇāgurusudhūpite |
yuvatīnāṃ surāpīnāṃ veśyāgaṇasuśobhite ||

śaṅkhaghaṇṭāravākīrṇe dīpāvalivirājite |
evambhūte gṛhe pūjā kālikāyāḥ suśobhanā ||

kāmarūpādividhirguṇaphalaḥ | rudrayāmale (-)

ekaliṅge śmaśāne ca śūnyāgāre catuṣpathe |
śavopari citāstho vā kulapādapamūlake ||

yauno vā yoniyantre vā yonipuṣpairviśeṣataḥ |
sudravyaiḥ pūjayed vidyāṃ javāpāvakasindūraiḥ (?) ||

matsyamāṃsairdhūpadīparnaivedyairvividhaistathā |
ṣaṭsahasrapramāṇena pratisandhyaṃ japennaraḥ ||

mahāvidyāviśeṣeṇa japamātreṇa siddhidā |
tatrasthaḥ sādhayed yogī vidyāṃ tribhavamocanīm ||

<141> haragaurīsaṃvāde (-) pūjanīyā prayatnena śūnyāgāre catuṣpathe |
śivālaye vilvamūle sarvadā kulamaṇḍale ||

vīratantre'pi (-) sarva eva śubhaḥ kālo nāśubho vidyate kvacit |
na viśeṣo divā rātrau sandhyāyāmathavā niśi |
phetkāriṇyām (-) balipūjādikaṃ sarvaṃ rātrau tu kriyate yadi |
tattadakṣayatāṃ yāti tārādevyāḥ prasādataḥ ||

atha pañcaśuddhiḥ

kulārṇave (-) ātmasthānamanudravya devaśuddhiśca pañcamī |
yāvanna kriyate devi tāvad devārcanaṃ na hi ||

ātmaśuddhyādirvakṣyate |

sammārjanopalepādyairdarpaṇodaravat kṛtam |
vitānadhūpadīpādivitatadhvajasevitam ||

pañcavarṇarajaścitraṃ sthānaśuddhiritīritā |
tataśca sādhakaśreṣṭho hṛdi mantraṃ parāmṛśan ||

abahirmānaso yogī yāgabhūmimathāviśet |
kumārīkalpe (-) tāravajrodake hūṃ phaṭ svāhāmantreṇa mantravit |
jalamānīya savye tu āsanaṃ śodhayet tataḥ ||

savye vāmadiśītyarthaḥ | tathā (-)

praṇavaṃ pūrvamuddhṛtya lajjābījaṃ tathaiva ca |
tato viśuddhānte sarvapāpāni śamayeti ca ||

aśeṣānte vikalpaṃ syādapanaya tataḥ param |
kūrcabījaṃ bhavenmantraḥ pādaprakṣālane priye ||

vedādyaṃ ca tathā māyā svāhetyācamanaṃ matam |

tārārahasyavṛttau (-) pādaprakṣālanācamanamantrayorvaiparītyamuktam | 
prathamamantre ca viśuddhaśabdāt pūrvaṃ sukārānte dharmagātrīti padaṃ 
kūrcabījānantaraṃ phaṭ svāheti coktam | tadanusāryeva sampradāyaḥ | pheravīye 
(-)

dvirācamya śikhāṃ baddhvā tato bhūmiviśodhanam |

atra ca maṇidhari vajriṇi śikhariṇi sarvavaśaṅkariṇī huṃ phaṭ svāheti mantreṇa 
śikhābandhanaṃ matsyasūkte uktam | bhūmiśodhanamagre vakṣyate | 
bhairavatantre (-)

tārābhedaistribhiḥ pītvā māyayā kṣālayet karam |

<142> strīṃ hūṃ oṣṭhau dviranmṛjya phaṭkāraiḥ kṣālayet karam ||

āsyanāsekṣaṇaśrotra nābhivakṣaḥśirobhujān |
vairocanādibhiḥ spṛṣṭvā sarvapāpaiḥ pramucyate ||

ācamya bhairavo bhūtvā vatsarāt tāṃ prapaśyati |
tārābhedaiḥ | tāraikajaṭānīlasarasvatīrūpaiḥ | uttaratantre (-)

ācāntaḥ śucitāṃ prāptaḥ susnāto devapūjane |
pūjāvedyā bahiḥ sthitvā caturhastāntare dhiyā ||

gṛhe ced dvāradeśasthaḥ praṇamya śirasā gurum |
praṇamediṣṭadevaṃ svaṃ dikpālānapi cetasā ||

yat pāpamarjitaṃ pūrvaṃ taddine'nyadine'pi vā |
prāyaścittairna lupyeta taddhi pāpaṃ smared dhiyā ||

tatpāpasyāpaneyārthaṃ ślokadvayamudīrayet |
devi tvaṃ prākṛtaṃ cittaṃ pāpākrāntamabhūn mama ||

tanniḥsāraya cittān me pāpaṃ hūṃ phaṭ ca te namaḥ |
sūryaḥ somo yamaḥ kālo mahābhūtāni pañca ca ||

ete śubhāśubhasyeha karmaṇo nava sākṣiṇaḥ |
tataḥ punarhūṃ phaḍiti pārśvamūrdhvamadhastathā ||

ātmanaḥ krodhadṛṣṭyā'tha nirīkṣan sumanā bhavet |
evaṃ kṛte prathamataḥ pāpotsāraṇakarmaṇi |
yat syād dṛḍhataraṃ pāpaṃ taddūre cāvatiṣṭhate ||

atīte pūjane sthānaṃ svaṃ prayāti punaśca tat |
yat syādalpataraṃ pāpaṃ tannāśamupagacchati ||

pūjane tyaktapāpasya kāmamiṣṭaṃ kṣaṇād bhavet |

svatantre (-) bhūmivyomasthitān sarvān vighnajātān sahākṣataiḥ |
siddhārthaistilasaṃmiśraiḥ protsārya cāsane viśet ||

yāmale (-) bhūtāpasāraṇaṃ kuryānmantreṇā'nena sādhakaḥ |
yasmin kṛte sthale bhūtā dūraṃ yānti surārcane ||

sthiteṣu tatra bhūteṣu naivedyaṃ maṇḍalaṃ tathā |
vilumpanti sadā lubdhā na gṛhṇanti ca devatāḥ ||

oṃ apasarpantu te bhūtā ye bhūtā bhuvi saṃsthitāḥ |
ye bhūtā vighnakartāraste naśyantu śivājñayā ||

bhairavatantre (-) tata ācamanaṃ kṛtvā sāmānyārghyaṃ prakalpayet |
trikoṇavṛttabhūbimbamaṇḍalaṃ racayet tataḥ ||

ādhāraśaktiṃ sampūjya tatrādhāraṃ vinikṣipet |
astreṇa pātraṃ saṃśodhya hṛnmantreṇa ca pūrayet ||

nikṣipet tīrthamāvāhya gandhādīn praṇavena ca |
darśayed dhenumudrāṃ vai sāmānyārghyavidhirmataḥ ||

sāmānyārghyeṇa deveśi pūjayed dvāradevatāḥ |
gaṇeśaṃ kṣetrapālaṃ ca vaṭukaṃ yoginīmapi |
gaṅgāṃ ca yamunāṃ caiva lakṣmīṃ vāṇīṃ tato viśet ||

tantre (-) gāṃ bījādyaṃ gaṇeśaṃ ca vāmādyaṃ vaṭukaṃ tathā |
kṣāmādyaṃ kṣetrapālaṃ ca yāmādyāṃ yoginīṃ tathā ||

ūrdhve vāme ca dakṣe ca adhaścaiva yathākramam |

ūrdhvādikaṃ dehalyāḥ prakaraṇāt | evaṃ gāṃ gaṅgāṃ yāṃ yamunāṃ 
śrīṃ lakṣmīṃ aiṃ sarasvatīṃ pūjayanti | tathā dūrvādikaṃ gṛhe parito 
vikīrya vighnānapasṛtān dhyāyet | tanmatraḥ

kumārīke (-) paṇavaṃ pūrvamuddhṛtya sarvavighnāṃstataḥ param |
utsārayadvayaṃ hūṃ phaṭ svāhā ca tadanantaram ||

anenaiva ca mantreṇa vighnānutsārayet sudhīḥ |
praṇavaṃ pūrvamuddhṛtya rakṣa rakṣetyanantaram ||

hūṃ phaṭ svāheti mantreṇa bhūmiṃ ca pariśodhayet |

śodhanaṃ jalasekarūpamiti tāntrikāḥ | idaṃ ca bhūmiśodhanaṃ pheravīye 
vighnotsādanāt pūrvamuktam | tathā (-)

tataḥ pavitravajrādau praṇavaṃ pūrvamuddharet |
rakṣadvayamato hūṃ phaṭ svāhā ca tadanantaram ||

anenaiva ca mantreṇa kuryād bhūmyabhimantraṇam ||

athāsanavidhiḥ

svatantratantre (-) bhūmau trikoṇamālikhyādhāraśaktyādipūjanam |
merupṛṣṭha ṛṣiḥ proktaḥ sutalaṃ chanda īritam ||

kūrmo'tra devatā devi āsanopaniveśane |
viniyogaśca kathitaḥ paṭhed dhṛtvāsanaṃ mataḥ ||

<144> pṛthvi tvayā dhṛtā lokā devi tvaṃ viṣṇunā dhṛtā |
tvaṃ ca dhāraya māṃ bhadre pavitraṃ kuru cāsanam ||

iti dhṛtvā tu deveśi kuśāṃstatraiva pādayet |
kuśāniti | vakṣyamāṇapakṣaprāptānuvādaḥ | tathā (-)

māyābījaṃ samuccārya ādhāraśaktaye tataḥ |
kamalāsanamullikhya ṅenamo'ntaṃ ca pūjayet ||

ṅenamo'ntamiti | kamalāsanapadaṃ caturthyantaṃ namaskāreṇa yojayedityarthaḥ |

mantracūḍāmaṇau (-) tatra mṛddhāsanaṃ pīṭhaṃ pīṭhamantreṇa pūjayet |
oṃ aiṃ klīṃ kāmapīṭhāya hṛdayānto'yamīritaḥ ||

tatra baddhvāsanaṃ vīra ātmānaṃ śodhayet tataḥ |
uttaratantre (-) ātmamantreṇopaviśet tadā tasmin varāsane ||

duḥśilpiracitatvādi yad yadāsanadūṣaṇam |
ajñātaṃ vilayaṃ yāti upaveśe tu mantritam ||

svanāmādyakṣaraṃ puṃsaḥ somasāmisamanvitam |
ādyavarṇaṃ vijānīyādātmamantraṃ tu sādhakaḥ ||

somasāmi candrārdham | yāmale (-)

ātmānaṃ rakṣayet tatra vahniprākārayogataḥ |
vahnibījena paritaḥ prākāraṃ bhāvayed dhiyā ||

āḥkārānte surekhe ca vajrarekhe tataḥ param |
hūṃ phaṭ svāheti kuryāt tu maṇḍalaṃ vai śavāsane ||

āsanaviśeṣo matsyasūkte (-)

mṛdukambalamāsīno'nyeṣu komalakeṣu vā |
viṣṭare vā samāsīnaḥ sādhayet siddhimuttamām ||

saṃgrāmapatitaṃ vāpi vyāpāditamacūḍakam |
ṣaṇmāsaniḥsṛtaṃ prāpya citāyāṃ vā tadantike |
kṛṣṇasāraṃ dvīpicarma acūḍaṃ kambalaṃ tathā |
pītaṃ ca śvetavarṇaṃ vā āsanāya prakalpayet ||

ṣaṇmāsaniḥsṛtapadena mṛdukambalasya punarabhidhānamādarātiśayārtham |
tadantoktiḥ prasaṅgāt | śrīkrame'pi (-)

ṣaṇmāsānantaraṃ yāvad daśamāsācca pūrvakam |
<145> garbhacyutaṃ mṛtaṃ bālaṃ garbhāṣṭamāt paraṃ śavam ||

bālamityantoktameva mṛdupadena matsyasūkte uktam | tantre (-)

nivṛttacūḍako bālo hīnopanayanaḥ pumān |
yo mṛtaḥ pañcame varṣe tameva komalaṃ viduḥ ||

pañcavarṣābhyantaraṃ yāvad bhaved bālamacūḍakam |
atra napuṃsakaliṅgatā tāntrikī | vīratantre (-)

śavābhāve viṣṭaraṃ tu śavarūpaṃ prakalpayet |
pañcāśadbhirbhaved brahmā tadardhena tu viṣṭaram ||

kālītantre (-) mṛtābhāve śavarūpaṃ viṣṭaraṃ parikalpayet |
mṛtābhāva iti vacanāt paśoḥ śavānukalpakuśaviṣṭaramapi nāsti | 
mukhye'dhikāriṇa evā'nukalpe'dhikārāt | svatantratantre (-)

kambale lohite vāpi kṛṣṇe vā vyāghracarmaṇi |
sanyāsī brahmacārī tu viśet kṛṣṇasya carmaṇi ||

vyāghrājinaṃ sarvasiddhyai jñānasiddhirmṛgājine |
vastrāsanaṃ rogaharaṃ vetrajaṃ prītivardhanam ||

kauśeyaṃ puṣṭidaṃ proktaṃ kambalaṃ sarvasiddhidam |
śuklaṃ vā yadi vā kṛṣṇaṃ viśeṣādraktakambalam ||

mṛdu komalamāstīrṇaṃ saṃgrāmapatitaṃ ca yat |
jantuvyāpāditaṃ vāpi mṛtaṃ vānaramāsanam ||

garbhacyutañca nārīṇāmathavā yonijāṃ tvacam |
tattaccharīrākāraṃ vā kuryācchive tato'rcanam ||

ṛturaktāktavastraṃ vā āsanāya prakalpayet |
śmaśānakāṣṭhaghaṭitaṃ pīṭhaṃ vā yajñadārujam ||

nādīkṣito viśej jātu kṛṣṇasārājine gṛhī |
tathā (-) ekahastaṃ dvihastaṃ vā caturaṅgulamucchritam ||

viśuddhe āsane kuryāt sthāpanaṃ pūjanaṃ budhaḥ |
kecit tu svatantrādau kambalādividhirna svātantryeṇa kintu 
vīrāsanāvaguṇṭhanatvena vīrāsanasyāvaśyakatvāt | taduktam (-)

kālītantre (-) mṛtāsanaṃ vinā devi yo japet kālikāṃ naraḥ |
tāvat sa nārakī jñeyo yāvadāhūtasaṃplavam ||

<146> vastuta idaṃ vīraparam | atra śavāsaneṣvaicchiko vikalpaḥ | kāṣṭhāsanaṃ 
vihitetaraṃ niṣiddham | brahmayāmale (-)

tṛṇapallavakāṣṭhāni pāṣāṇaṃ mṛṇmayaṃ tathā |
vaṃśāsanaṃ ca vastraṃ ca kevalaṃ kṣitimāsanam ||

evamaṣṭavidhaṃ devi cāsanaṃ parivarjayet |

vastrāsanavidhiḥ kāmye | vārāhītantre (-)

uttarābhimukho bhūtvā viśenmṛdvāsanopari |
kambale satvarā siddhiḥ śrīmokṣau vyāghracarmaṇi ||

ajine śrīrbhavet kāmye vaśyaṃ ca pītavāsasi |
dārave siddhināśaḥ syād bhūtale kulanāśanam ||

tvaci patre daridraḥ syāt tṛṇe cāpi hataśriyaḥ |
kuśasya kaṭake mokṣaḥ kāṣṭhe śrīparṇī śasyate ||

abhāve cūtavilvānāṃ mattake (?) picumardake |
āmranimbakadambānāmāsanaṃ sarvanāśanam ||

āmramāmrātakam |

panase kiṃśuke cāpi vakule ca hataśriyaḥ |

kumārīkalpe (-) vīrāsanenopaviśet saṃpūjyāsanameva tu |
tatropaviśya vidhinā bhuktvā dravyaṃ sahetukam ||

vīrāsanamuktaṃ gorakṣasaṃhitāyām (-)

ekapādamathaikasmin vinyasyoruṇi saṃsthitaḥ | iti |
yāmale (-) rātrāvudaṅmukhaḥ kuryāt pūrvottaramukho divā |
sadottaramukhaḥ kuryācchivapūjāṃ vicakṣaṇaḥ ||

phetkāriṇyām (-) padmāsanena vidyārthī kuryāt sarvaṃ samāhitaḥ |
prāṅmukhodaṅmukho vāpi vakṣyamāṇakrameṇa tu ||

śrīkāmaḥ svastikeneha paścimābhimukhaḥ sthitaḥ |
kālikāpurāṇe (-) digvibhāgeṣu kauberī dik śivāprītidāyinī |
tasmāt tanmukha āsīnaḥ pūjayeccaṇḍikāṃ sadā ||

atra hetugrahaṇamapyuktaṃ bhāvacūḍāmaṇau (-)

vinā hetukamāsvādya kṣobhayukto maheśvara |

na pūjāmāsanaṃ kuryānna ca dhyānaṃ na cintanam ||

<147> tasmād bhuktvā ca pītvā ca pūjayet parameśvarīm |

kulārṇave'pi (-) vinā dravyādhivāsena na smarenna japet priye |
ye smaranti mahādevi teṣāṃ duḥkhaṃ pade pade ||

nāsavena vinā mantra na mantreṇa vināsavam |
parasparavirodhitvāt kathaṃ pūjā vidhīyate ||

tatsaṃśayanivṛttiṃ ca jñātvā gurumukhād yajet |
vīkṣaṇaprokṣaṇadhyāna mantramudrāvibhūṣitam ||

dravyaṃ tarpaṇayogyaṃ syād devatāprītikāraṇam |

vīkṣaṇaṃ divyadṛṣṭyā | prokṣaṇaṃ mūlābhimantritajalena | 
dhyānamamṛtatvena | mantramaṣṭavārajaptam | mudrā dhenvākhyeti 
sampradāyavidaḥ | idamupalakṣaṇam | agre vaktravyaḥ sakalasaṃskāro'pi jñeyaḥ 
| pūrvadivasīyapūjāvaśiṣṭatat sattvenaitat samācaraṇamiti | tarpaṇamatra 
pānameva | idaṃ tu brāhmaṇetaraviṣayam | brāhmaṇasya tadupādānaniṣedhāt |

nanu (-) brāhmaṇaistu sadā peyaṃ kṣatriyaistu raṇāgame |
vaiśyairdhanaprayoge ca śūdrairnaiva kadācaneti || kulārṇave (-)

sautrāmaṇyāṃ kulācāre brāhmaṇaḥ prapivet surāmiti (-) samayācāre (-)

satye kramāccaturvarṇaiḥ kṣīrājyamadhupiṣṭajaiḥ |
tretāyāṃ pūjitā devī ghṛtena sarvajātibhiḥ ||

madhubhiḥ sarvavarṇaistu pūjitā dvāpare yuge |
pūjanīyā kalau devī kevalairāsavairiti || yāmale (-)

coktatvāt kathaṃ brāhmaṇasyānadhikāra iti cet | ucyate | viprāḥ kṣauṇībhujo 
viśastaditare kṣīrājyamadhvāsavairiti laghustave (-) varṇānukramabhedena 
dravyabhedā bhavanti vai iti jñānārṇave (-) dravyeṇa sāttvikenaiva brāhmaṇaḥ 
pūjayecchivāmiti 

āsavabhedamuktvā (-) evaṃ dadyāt kṣatriyo'pi paiṣṭikīṃ na kadācana |
nārikelodakaṃ kāṃsye tāmre gavyaṃ tathā madhu ||

rājanyavaiśyayordānaṃ na dvijasya kadācana |
evaṃ pradānamātreṇa hīnāyurbrāhmaṇo bhavediti ||

mahākālasaṃhitāyāṃ (-) kṣīreṇa brāhmaṇaistarpyā ghṛtena nṛpavaṃśajaiḥ |
mākṣikairvaiśyavarṇaistu āsavaiḥ śūdrajātibhiḥ || iti

bhairavītantre (-) yatrāvaśyaṃ vinirdiṣṭaṃ madirādānapūjanam |
brāhmaṇastāmrapātreṣu madhu madyaṃ prakalpayet || iti

<148> kulacūḍāmaṇau (-) brāhmaṇo madirāṃ dattvā brāhmaṇyādeva hīyate |
svagātrarudhiraṃ dattvā svātmahatyāmavāpnuyāt || iti

haṃsamāheśvaratantre (-) kalidharmaprakaraṇe gṛhyapariśiṣṭe 
ahināthopādhyāyaiḥ sautrāmaṇyāṃ surāgrahaṇaniṣedhasyoktatvāt | 
brāhmaṇaistu sadā peyamityatrāpyakārapraśleṣāt (-------------)

