atha prāṇāyāmaḥ

prāṇāyāmairvinā yad yad kṛtaṃ karma nirarthakam |
ato yatnena kartavyāḥ prāṇāyāmāḥ śubhārthibhiḥ ||

tantre (-) prāṇāyāmatrayaṃ kuryānmūlena praṇavena vā |
athavā mantrabījena yathoktavidhinā sudhīḥ ||

tathā (-) pūrayet ṣoḍaśabhirvāyuṃ kumbhayecca caturguṇaiḥ |
recayet kumbhakārdhena aśaktastatturīyataḥ ||

anyatrāpi (-) tadaśaktau taccaturthaiḥ syādevaṃ prāṇasaṃyamaḥ |
prāṇāyāmaṃ vinā naiva pūjanādiṣu yogyatā ||

viśuddheśvare (-) prāṇāyāmatrayaṃ kuryād vidyayā tadanantaram |
samayāṅkamātṛkāyām (-)

iḍayā pūrayed vāyuṃ sakṛcca mūlavidyayā |
madhyanāḍyā kumbhayecca vedasaṃkhyāvarānane ||

netrasaṃkhyākrameṇaiva recayet piṅgalādhvanā |
punaḥ punaḥ krameṇaiva yathā vāratrayaṃ bhavet ||

kumārītantre (-) tataḥ ṣoḍaśavarṣīyāṃ nārīmānīya yatnataḥ |
yuvatīṃ kāmadonmattāṃ suveśāṃ cāruhāsinīm ||

sadārate sābhilāṣāṃ sindūrāṅkitabhālikām |
sādhake premaśīlāṃ tāṃ vāme saṃsthāpayed budhaḥ ||

vāma ityupalakṣaṇam | vīracūḍāmaṇyuktapūjitayantroparītyapi draṣṭavyam |


