<149> samayācāre (-) vāmaskandhe karaṃ dattvā tadaṅke dehamātmanaḥ |
dattvā cālasyabhāvena pūjā kāryā yathāvidhi ||

pheravīye (-) yathācamanamantrapuṣpādhiṣṭhānameva ca |
granthibandhanamantraṃ ca kāyavākcittaśodhanam ||

atra mantramukhena karmaṇa evābhidhānam | ācamanamantraḥ pūrvameva 
likhitaḥ | puṣpādhiṣṭhānamantraśca kumārīkalpe (-)

adhiṣṭhāne tu puṣpasya praṇavaṃ pūrvamuccaret |
śatābhiṣeketi padaṃ śatābhīti tataḥ param ||

ṣeketi ca padaṃ proktaṃ hūṃ phaṭ svāhā tataḥ param |
praṇavaṃ puṣpaketuśca tathā rājārhate'pi ca ||

puṣpe puṣpe mahāpuṣpe supuṣpe puṣpasambhave |
puṣpacayāvarkīṇe ca hūṃ phaṭ svāhā tataḥ param ||

manunānena devyāstu puṣpaśuddhimathācaret |

granthibandhanaṃ ca uttarīyāñcale vikiradravyaiḥ 
sandhyāvandanoktaśikhābandhana mantreṇeti sampradāyaḥ | 
kāyādi'sodhanamantraḥ (-)

kumārītantre (-) praṇavaṃ pūrvamuddhṛtya tadanantarameva ca |
hūṃ phaṭ svāhā manuḥ proktaḥ kāyavākcittaśodhane ||

rakṣa rakṣa hūṃ phaṭ svāhā mantraḥ syādātmarakṣaṇe |

atha karaśuddhiṃ kuryāt | tatprakāra uttaratantre (-)

kṛtāñjalipuṭo bhūtvā vāmadakṣiṇapārśvayoḥ |
natvā guruṃ gaṇeśānaṃ purataḥ sveṣṭadevatām ||

sraggandhapuṣpāṇyādāya candanāktāni mantravit |
mardayitvā karau samyak surabhīkṛtya sādhakaḥ ||

vāmahaste samādāya nirmathyāghrāya tatpunaḥ |
vakṣyamāṇena mantreṇa caiśānyāṃ dūratastyajet ||

mantrastu (-) te sarve vilayaṃ yāntu ye māṃ hiṃsanti hiṃsakāḥ |
mṛtyurogabhayakleśāḥ patantu ripumastake || iti |

tyāgaśca nārācamudrayā | tyajeduttarataḥ puṣpaṃ mantrī nārācamudraye 
sārasaṃgrahāt | uttaratantre (-)

kusumaṃ viṣṇumantreṇa svāṅgulyagreṇa sādhakaḥ |
<150> vimardanāthaṃ gṛhṇīyāt karaśodhanakarmaṇi ||

prāsādena tu mantreṇa karābhyāṃ puṣpamardanam |
nirmañchet kāmabījena jighred brāhmeṇa tat punaḥ ||

prāsādena parityāgo diśyaiśānyāṃ viśeṣataḥ |
saṃmṛjya savyahastena ghrātvā vāmakareṇa tu ||

aiśānyāṃ niḥkṣipedetat puṣpaṃ hastatalasthitam |
evaṃ kṛte tu talayorviśuddhiratulā bhavet ||

aṅgulyagrāṇi śuddhāni puṣpāṇāṃ grahaṇād viduḥ |
taladvayaṃ vimardāktaviśuddhamabhijāyate ||

nirmañchanāt pāṇipṛṣṭaṃ ghrāṇānnāsāgramuttamam |
tīrthāni ca samāyānti nāsikāgraṃ karaṃ prati ||

tasmād yatnena kāryāṇi karmāṇyetāni bhairava |
upānta ādau candreṇa rañjitaḥ śūnyasaṃyutaḥ ||

rudrāntoparisaṃpṛṣṭo mantro'yaṃ vaiṣṇavo mataḥ |

upānto hakāraḥ | ādau mastake | candreṇa ardhacandramanusvāraḥ | rudrānto 
dīrgha ukāraḥ | tena hūṃ |

prāntādirvāsudevena varṇenāpi ca saṃyutaḥ ||

śambhucūḍāśikhābinduyuktaḥ prāsāda ucyate |

prāntādirhakāraḥ | vāsudeva okāraḥ | tataḥ sandhiḥ | tena hau | 
śambhucūḍāśikhā ardhacandraḥ |

kāmabījaṃ tu vijñeyaṃ vāsudevendubindunā |
vyañjanaṃ cādyadantyaṃ ca prāntadantyārṇapūrvakam ||

ādyadantyadvayaṃ paścād vyañjanaṃ praṇavottaram |
brahmabījamidaṃ proktaṃ sarvapāpapraṇāśanam ||

vijñeyaṃ tantrāntarāditi śeṣaḥ | brahmabījamuddharati (-) vāsudeva okāraḥ | 
indurardhacandraḥ | binduranusvāraḥ tena oṃ | ādyadantyaḥ takāraḥ | vyañjanaṃ 
svaraśūnyam | prāntadantyārṇaḥ sakāraḥ | sa eva pūrvaṃ yasya tena sat | 
praṇavottaraṃ praṇavānte | ādyadantyadvayaṃ takāradvayaṃ | tatra viśeṣamāha 
(-) paścād dvitīyatakāraḥ | vyañjanaṃ svaraśūnyaḥ | tena oṃ tatsaditi niṣpaṇṇam 
|

karaśuddhiṃ samāpyā'tha kuryāt tālatrayaṃ tataḥ |
<151> ūrdhvādhaṃ mūlamantreṇa digbandhamapi deśikaḥ ||

tena saṃjanitaṃ tejo rakṣāṃ kuryāt samantataḥ |

nīlatantre (-) kullukāṃ ca na jānāti mama mantraṃ japannaraḥ |
pañcatvaṃ jāyate tasya athavā vātulo bhavet |
tāriṇīkullukāyāśca mantraḥ kullukavarjitaḥ |
matimān sadvijātīnāṃ nopastheyaḥ kadācana ||

kullukāṃ ca śire dhṛtvā sarvayajñaphalaṃ labhet |
nānyo vicāraḥ sarvatra virūpākṣasya sammatam ||

kullukāvarjite puṃsāṃ yajñenopasthitirbhavet |
mama pūjā sadā vyarthā mama yajñastathaiva ca ||

tārāmantrasya kullukaṃ tryakṣaraṃ mantramuttamam |
mahogrāyāḥ sadā pūjā pūjane kullukā parā ||

stotramantravratādīnāmanuṣṭhāne ca sarvadā |
ananuṣṭhānatastasyāḥ sarvaṃ tanniṣphalaṃ bhavet ||

matsyasūkte (-) ṣaḍakṣaraṃ paraṃ brahma yo japet tu narādhamaḥ |
tāriṇī caṇḍikāyāśca mantraṃ kullukavarjitam ||

sa brahma steyakṛt tena narake pūrṇaśoṇite |
kumbhīpāke mahāghore pacyate pitṛbhiḥ saha ||

ṣaḍakṣare tu kullukāṃ jānīyānmantravit sadā |
dhārayet tu śirodeśe sarvakāmapradāyakam ||

kullukāṃ ca śire dhṛtvā sarvayajñaphalaṃ labhet |
asyādhikāraḥ sarvatra virūpākṣasya sammatam ||

kulluke varjite puṃsāṃ yajñenopasthitirbhavet |
sarve te niṣphalā yajñā bhaveyurnarakaṃ vrajet ||

ajñātvā kullukāṃ devīṃ ye japanti ca tāriṇīm |
kulakṣayaṃ tu te yānti narakaṃ ca vrajanti te ||

devīpūjā sadā vyarthā devīyāgastathaiva ca |

kullukāmantraśca mantroddhāraprakaraṇe evoktaḥ | tena 
tryakṣarīnīlasarasvatīrūpakullukāmantraṃ ca vilikhya śirasi dhṛtvā nityārcanaṃ 
kuryāditi paryavyasito'rthaḥ | brahmasaṃhitāyāntu (-) tāriṇī kullukā proktā 
sarvasiddhipradā sadā |

<152> tasyoddhāramahaṃ vakṣye śṛṇuṣvaikamanā mune ||

praṇavaṃ pūrvamūdhṛtya padmeyugmaṃ tathaiva ca |
mahāpadmepadaṃ paścāt padmāvatipadaṃ śubham ||

māye svāheti mantro'yaṃ saptadaśākṣaro manuḥ |
rakṣākarī ca sā proktā sadā paramasādhakaḥ ||

tathā (-) athavā tryakṣaraṃ mantraṃ kullukātāriṇī bhavet |
kullukāṃ ca vinā pūjāṃ kṛtvā'nte durgatiṃ vrajet ||

devīpūjā sadā vyarthā || iti

nānāvacanenāsya kratvarthatāvagamāt | sarvayajñaphalaṃ labhedityarthavādaḥ | 
vastutastu yathā saṃyogapṛthakatvādhikaraṇanyāyena dadhnā juhotītyanena 
kratvarthatvaṃ dadhnendriyakāmasye tyanena puruṣārthatvañcāvagamyate | 
tathā'trāpyubhayārthatvamiti dhyeyam |

tantracūḍāmaṇau (-) mantravidyāṃ ca saṃdhārya vāsudevaṃ ca yo'rcayet |
prāpnoti tatphalaṃ samyag harisāyujyatāṃ vrajet ||

vāsudevo haro brahmā tāriṇī prakṛtiḥ sadā |
ekamūrtiḥ sadā cintyā ekamūrtiḥ sadā sthitā ||

tathā phetkāriṇyām (-)

suvimalanakhadantapāṇipādo muditamanāḥ paradūṣaṇeṣu maunī |
hariharacaraṇārabindabhakto cirāyuḥ sarasvatīnivāsaḥ ||

ityādinā kullukāvidyādhāraṇottaraṃ haripūjanasyāṅgatā'trāvagamyate | 
ekavīrākalpe puraścaraṇaprakaraṇe (-)

mantrakāle tu satataṃ bhāryāṃ yatnena varjayet |
varjayed vaiṣṇavaṃ kalpaṃ varjayet tulasīdalam ||

tathā haragaurīsambāde (-) sahasranāmastotrakathanānantaram (-)

yāni nāmāni santyatra prasaṅgānmukhyavairiṇaḥ |
grāhyāṇi tāni kalpāni nānyāni tu kadācana ||

ityādinā tatpūjanādervaiguṇyāpādakatvamavadhāryate | tenā'tirātre 
ṣoḍaśinaṃ gṛhṇāti nātirātre ṣoḍaśinaṃ gṛhṇātityādivat 
vikalpo'vadhāryate | atirātre ṣoḍaśigrahaṇapakṣe phalabhūmākalpanavadatrāpi 
phalasiddhau tadananuṣṭhānalakṣaṇāprāmāṇyāpatteḥ | ata eva prāpnoti 
tatphalaṃ samyagityabhidhānaṃ saṃgacchate | vastutastu mantrakāla 

<153> iti vacanād bhāryāvacanasamabhivyāhārāt 
puraścaraṇavaiguṇyāpādakataiva tatpūjanasya na tu 
nityapūjāvaiguṇyāpādakatāpi | tantracūḍāmaṇivacanavirodhāt | evaṃ 
stotraprakaraṇāmnānāt pāṭhāṅgataiva tannāmagrahaṇāderityūhyam | tena 
nityapūjāyāṃ prasaktatatpūjanasya puraścaraṇādau niṣedhaḥ 
sambhavatyanyathā'prasaktatatpratiṣedhāpatteḥ | na ca 
pañcāyatanadīkṣāpakṣaprāptatatpūjananiṣedho'yaṃ nityapūjāyāmeveti 
vācyam | tantracūḍāmaṇivirodhāt | atra pañcāyatanadīkṣāyā niṣedhācca | ata 
evādhikārinindārthamaprasaktasyāpi tatpūjanasya niṣedhaḥ | 
ayajñīyavaibhāṣā itivaditi parāstam |

kiṃca (-) varjayed vaiṣṇavaṃ kalpamityanena na tatpūjāyāṃ niṣedho'pi tu 
tatkalpasyetikarttavyatā | tathā ca viṣṇumantroktetikartavyatayā devīpūjanaṃ 
varjayedityarthaḥ | ata 
evānyamantretikartavyatayā'nyamantropāsanasyāsambhavamāśaṅkya 
tatraivoktam (-) varjayet tulasīdalamiti | tathā ca tulasīdalādinā pūjaiva 
tatkalpapadārthaḥ | sa ca nāsambhāvita iti tasminneṣedhaḥ śakyaḥ kartumiti 
tadabhiprāyaḥ | evaṃ ca nityārcanakāle naimittikapuraścaraṇādyarcanakāle'pi 
haripūjanamaṅgam | tadabhāve devīpūjāphalābhāva iti paryavasitam | evaṃ ca 
yāni nāmānītyādinā anaṅgavyavāyadoṣaparihārārthaṃ stotrapāṭhasamaye 
harerapi nāma madhye na grāhyam | kimutānyasya | 
prāpnotītyādisambhāvanāyāmācamanānukalpa viṣṇunāmagrahaṇaprāptau ca 
yānyeva prasaṅgādatropanibaddhāni tānyeva grāhyāni natvanyāni | evaṃ ca 
vedo veti nyāyān na gṛhṇīyāddharernāma ityatrāpi 
strotrānupāttaharināmagrahaṇaniṣedhaḥ | athavā arthavādamātrasyānarthakyāt 
nāmasambhāvanāyāṃ hareḥ svattvāspadībhūtaṃ tulasīdalamapi na gṛhṇīyāt 
| na svīkuryānna spṛśedapītyarthaḥ |

	yadvā sādhakāstrividhā divyavīrapaśubhedāt | tatra paśuparatayā 
tantracūḍāmaṇyādivākyāni haripūjāṅgatāpratipādakāni | vīraparatayā 
caikavīrākalpādivākyāni haripūjāniṣedhakāni niyojyānīti siddhāntarahasyam |

atha bhūtaśuddhiḥ

bhairavatantre (-) aṅke pāṇiyugaṃ kṛtvā viyadbinduyuto bhṛguḥ |
sargavāniti mantreṇa satatvaṃ kuṇḍalīyutam ||

jīvaṃ cakrāṇi bhittvā'tha śirasthakamale śive |
saṃyojya citkalāṃ raktāṃ nābhau dhyāyan paṭhan śanaiḥ ||

vāmanāseritaṃ vāyuṃ jvalitenāpi vahninā |
saṃśoṣya dehaṃ saṃdahya sapāpaṃ dakṣayā tataḥ ||

<154> recayet tu vadhūbījaṃ pītābhaṃ vāyurūpiṇam |
hṛdi dhyāyan paṭhan dakṣanāsayā pūritānilaiḥ ||

vāmanāsāpuṭenaiva bhasma protsārayed bahiḥ |
hūṃkāraṃ pūrṇacandrābhaṃ lalāṭe śaśimaṇḍale ||

bhītvaitasya japādasmānnipātya cāmṛtaṃ tataḥ |
tadasthi plāvitaṃ kṛtvā dehamutpādayet tataḥ ||

so'haṃ mantreṇa tattvāni jīvaṃ kuṇḍalinīṃ kramāt |
yathāsthānaṃ samānīya nivartya tāriṇīmayam ||

vārāhītantre (-) mūlādhārodgataṃ prāṇaṃ brahmamārgeṇa tāntrikaḥ |
haṃsena puṣkarasthāne paramātmani yojayet ||

rudrayāmale (-) varṇasaṃhārakaṃ kuryāt kṣādyakārāntavarṇakam |
pratilomena saṃhṛtya paramātmani yojayet ||

pañcabhūtaṃ tataḥ paścād yo japet paramātmani |
svatantre (-) saṃhārakramayogena pañcatatvaṃ samuddharet ||

pañcatattvaṃ pañcabhūtāni | taduddhāraprakāro jñānonnayane (-)

pādayorjānuparyantaṃ caturasraṃ savajrakam |
laṃyutaṃ pītavarṇaṃ ca bhūsthānaṃ ca vicintayet ||

jānvorānābhicandrārdhanibhaṃ padmena lāñchitam |
śuklavarṇaṃ svabījena yuktaṃ dhyāyedapāṃ sthalam ||

nābhitaḥ kaṇṭhaparyantaṃ trikoṇaṃ raktavarṇakam |
sasvastikaṃ svabījena yuktaṃ vahnestu maṇḍalam ||

kaṇṭhād bhramadhyaparyantaṃ kṛṣṇaṃ vāyostu maṇḍalam |
ṣaṭkoṇaṃ bindubhiḥ ṣaḍbhiryuktaṃ bījena cintayet ||

bhrūmadhyād brahmarandhrāntaṃ vartulaṃ dhvajalāñchitam |
dhūmravarṇaṃ svabījena yuktaṃ dhyāyennabhaḥsthalam ||

evaṃ dhyātvā tatastāni bhūtāni pravilopayet |
pṛthvīmapsu ca tā vahnau vahniṃ vāyau samīraṇam ||

pravilāpya tathākāśe ākāśaṃ prakṛtau tataḥ |
aparabrahmarūpāṃ tāṃ māyāśaktiṃ parātmani ||

evaṃ samastadehādiprapañcaṃ paramātmani |
<155> pravilāpya parabrahmarūpe tiṣṭhet kiyat kṣaṇam ||

tataḥ puruṣanibhaṃ pāpamanādibhavasañcitam |
brahmahatyāśiraskaṃ ca svarṇasteyabhujadvayam ||

surāpānahṛdā yuktaṃ gurutalpakaṭidvayam |
tatsaṃsargapadadvandvamaṅgapratyaṅgapātakam ||

upapātakaromāṇaṃ raktaśmaśruvilocanam |
khaḍgacarmadharaṃ kukṣau kṛṣṇaṃ dakṣiṇataḥ smaret ||

tantrāntare (-) khaḍgacarmadharaṃ pāpamaṅguṣṭhaparimāṇakam |
adhomukhaṃ kṛṣṇavarṇaṃ dakṣakukṣau vicintayet ||

vīratantre (-) bhūtaśuddhiṃ tataḥ kuryāt svamantrākṣarayogataḥ |
pheravīye (-) māyāṃ nābhau raktavarṇāṃ dhyātvā tajjātavahninā |
sūkṣmaṃ pāpātmakaṃ dehaṃ dagdhaṃ vicintayet tataḥ ||

trīṃkāraṃ hṛdi pītābhaṃ tadudbhūtena vāyunā |
bhasma protsāritaṃ kṛtvā lalāṭe cintayet tataḥ ||

kūrcaṃ tuṣāravarṇābhaṃ tadudbhūtāmṛtena ca |
tadasthi plāvitaṃ buddhvā tatrātmānaṃ vicintayet ||

sarvavyathāvinirmuktaṃ nirmalaṃ devatātmakam |
viśvavyāpakatoyāntaḥ śvetābjodbhavakarṇike ||

rudrayāmale (-) tārābhūtaśuddhiprakaraṇe (-)

yaṃ mantraṃ vāyubījena iḍayā pūrayet tanum |
ṣoḍaśasvaravarṇena || iti

anayorvikalpaḥ | sāmpradāyikastu prāktana eva panthāḥ | yāmale (-)

bhūtaśuddhiṃ tataḥ kuryāt sthiracittastu sādhakaḥ |
vinidhāya nijāṅke tu samuttānau karau svayam ||

mūlādhāre mūlavidyāsvarūpāṃ kulakuṇḍalīm |
prasuptabhujagākārāṃ sārdhatribalayātmakām ||

nīvāraśukavat tanvīṃ sarvavidyāsvarūpiṇīm |
vidyutkoṭipratīkāśāṃ svayambhūliṅgaveṣṭinīm ||

dhyātvā tāṃ haṃsamantreṇa praṇavenā'thavā punaḥ |
kūrcabījena vā devi dṛḍhaṃ vibhāvayed guruḥ ||

<156> ekībhāvaṃ tayoḥ kṛtvā jīvātmaparamātmanoḥ |
vicintya śūnyaṃ paramaṃ pārthivāṃśaṃ jalairgatam ||

jalaṃ ca tejasā kṛṣṇaṃ tejorūpaṃ vicintayet |
nirvāṇaṃ vāyunā vahniṃ vāyurūpaṃ vibhāvayet ||

ākāśenāhṛto vāyuḥ khaṃ vai manasi līyate |
mano'haṃkāravaśagamahaṃ tu mahādāhṛtam ||

prakṛtyā ca mahattattvaṃ prakṛtiṃ yojayedatha |
prakāśarūpiṇī nityā brahmavidyāsvarūpiṇī ||

kaivalyā kevalā śāntā nirguṇā paramātmikā |
saiṣā ca paramā jyotiḥ paramaṃ ca nirāmayam ||

sahasradalamadhyasthaṃ śūnyarūpaṃ paraṃ padam |
tathā (-) nābhideśe ca yaṃkāraṃ dhūmraṃ vāyuṃ vicintayet |
tenaiva śoṣayelliṅgaṃ tanuṃ ṣoḍaśamātrayā ||

karmātmakaṃ catuḥṣaṣṭyā kumbhayitvā samācaret |
dvātriṃśanmātrayā dakṣe recanaṃ tena vā punaḥ ||

raktavarṇaṃ vahnibījaṃ meḍhramūle vicintayet |
malāsanātmakaṃ liṅgaṃ śarīraṃ tena dāhayet ||

pūrvoktakramayogena dakṣanāsākrameṇa tu |
deśikastu tathā saṃkhyā vāmanāsena recayet ||

vaṃkāraṃ vāruṇaṃ bījaṃ ghaṭikāyāṃ vibhāvya ca |
tenāmṛtaṃ samutpādya sahasradalapaṅkajāt ||

plāvayet pūrakādīni kṛtvā pādatalāvadhi |
laṃkāraṃ pṛthivībījaṃ gudamūle vibhāvayet ||

tenaiva kramayogena dhiyā saṃplāvayed budhaḥ |
pāpapuṇyavinirmuktaṃ śarīraṃ śāmbhavaṃ param ||

tenaiva pūrṇamārgeṇa sampādayedanantaram |
sohaṃmantreṇa jīvaṃ tu hṛtsaroje samānayet ||

punastāṃ kuṇḍalīṃ devīṃ mūlādhāre samānayet |
phetkāriṇyām (-) liṅgaṃ kāryahṛdisthaṃ tu caitanyaṃ sarvasākṣiṇam |
praṇavena viniḥsārya brahmarandhrād bahirbudhaḥ ||

<157> tenaiva saṃpuṭīkṛtya mastakopari dhārayet |
caitanyarahitaṃ dehaṃ bāhyamabhyantaraṃ tathā ||

nābhimaṇḍalamadhyastha vāyumaṇḍalamadhyagam |
yaṃ bījaṃ dhūmravarṇaṃ ca dhyātvā tena viśodhayet ||

agnimaṇḍalasaṃsthena raṃbījenā'gnirūpiṇā |
nirdahedatha tad bhasmarāśirdehākṛtirbhavet ||

bhrūmadhyasthaṃ hṛdisthaṃ vā dhyāyed varuṇamaṇḍalam |
ardhacandrākṛtiścetaṃ padmadvayapadāṅkitam ||

tatastena prakāreṇa plāvayenmanurūpiṇīm |
bījaṃ tu pārthivaṃ nyasya cintayeddhemamaṇḍalam ||

praṇavena dvidhā kṛtvā tatra caitanyarūpiṇam |
ātmānaṃ cintayenmantradevatārūpiṇaṃ tataḥ ||

prāṇāyāmarūpāṃ bhūtaśuddhimuktvā uḍḍīśe (-)

athavā kuṇḍalīdevīṃ pañcabhūtādinā saha |
paramātmani saṃyojya tayoraikyaṃ vibhāvayet ||

dhyānayogena manasā sohaṃ sohaṃ vibhāvayet |
idaṃ cāśaktaparam | śāradāyāmapyayameva krama uktaḥ | nīlatantre (-)

bhūtaśuddhiṃ vidhāyetthaṃ śūnyaṃ viśvaṃ vicintayet |
nirlepaṃ nirguṇaṃ śuddhamātmānaṃ tāriṇīmayam ||

antarikṣe tato dhyāyedākārādraktapaṅkajam |
bhūyastasyopari dhyāyet ṭaṅkāre śvetapaṅkajam |
tasyopari punardhyāyed dhūṅkāraṃ nīlasannibham ||

tato hūṃkārabījena kartṛkāṃ bījabhūṣitām |
kartyuparigataṃ dhyāyed dehañca paramātmanaḥ ||

śabdabrahmātmikā māyā mātṛkā prakṛtiḥ parā |
ajāyata jaganmāturākāśaṃ nabhaso'nilaḥ ||

samīraṇādabhūdagniragnerāpastato mahī |
svīyamebhyo'pi bhūtebhyastejorūpaṃ kalevaram ||

devatārādhane yogyaṃ samutpannaṃ vibhāvayet |
vaśiṣṭhasaṃhitāyām (-) sohaṃ mantreṇatāmādyāṃ nādānte siddhabhāvitām 
|
<158> dhyātvaivaṃ brahmarandhrāt tu hṛdi jīvakalāṃ nyaset ||

tantre (-) tato jīvaṃ pravinyasyet prāṇamantreṇa deśikaḥ |
śāradāyām (-) brahmaviṣṇuśivāḥ proktā munayastantravedibhiḥ ||

uktamṛgyajuṣoḥ sāmnaśchandaśchandoviśāradaiḥ ||

caitanyarūpā prāṇātmā devatā śaktirīritā |
kavargeṇa viyatpūrvabhūtairhṛdayamīritam ||

śiraścavargaśabdādyairīritaṃ tadanantaram |
jñānendriyaiṣṭavargādyaistacchikhā parikīrtitā ||

karmendriyaistavargādyaiḥ kavacaṃ parikīrtitam |
vacanādyaiḥ pavargādyairvilocanamudīritam ||

buddhyādyairyādisaṃyuktairastramasya samīritam |
ātmane'ntāḥ samākhyātā aṅgamantrāḥ sajātayaḥ ||

nābheścaraṇaparyantaṃ pāśabījaṃ pravinyaset |
hṛdayānnābhiparyantaṃ śaktibījaṃ tataḥ param ||

mūrdhvādi hṛdayaṃ yāvadaṅkuśaṃ vinyaset sudhīḥ |
hṛdaye dhātuṣu nyased yādīn sapta yathākramam ||

prāṇe jīve tato nyasyeddhaṃsavarṇadvayaṃ pṛthak |
kuryād vyāpakametena samastena vidhānavit ||

vīracūḍāmaṇau tu (-) ṣaḍaṅganyāsādīnanyathoktaḥ | yathā (-)

a(-)ā madhye kavargaṃ ca i(-)ī madhye cavargakam |
u(-)ū madhye ṭavargaṃ ca e(-)ai madhye tavargakam ||

o au madhye pavargaṃ ca śeṣamadhye yavargakam |
nyāsaṃ kuryānmaheśāni hṛdayādiṣaḍaṅgakam ||

tathā (-) evaṃ nyāsavidhiṃ kṛtvā varṇanyāsamathācaret |
nābhau nārāyaṇaḥ prokto māyā tūdaramadhyataḥ ||

vāmāṃśe medo vinyasya majjāsthinī kare nyaset |
śukraṃ vai dakṣiṇe pāde viyad vāme pravinyaset ||

nyaset krodhaṃ mahādevi mastakāccaraṇāvadhi |

nārāyaṇaḥ āṃkrāraḥ(?) | śāradāyām (-)

tato vicintayed devīṃ jīvabhūtāṃ jaganmayīm |
<159> raktābdhipotāruṇamadhyasasthā pāśāṅkuśāvikṣuśarāsabāṇān |
śūlaṃ kapālaṃ dadhatīṃ karābjai raktāṃ trinetrāṃ praṇamāmi devīm ||

tato vakṣyamāṇalelihānamudrayā hṛdayaṃ spṛśan prāṇamantraṃ japet |  
mantrastu tatraiva (-)

pāśāditryakṣarātmānte syādamuṣyapadaṃ tataḥ |
kramāt prāṇā iha prāṇāstathā jīva iha sthitaḥ ||

amuṣya sarvendriyāṇi bhūyā'muṣyapadaṃ bhavet |
vāṅmanonayanaśrotra ghrāṇaprāṇapadānyatha ||

paścādihāgatya sukhaṃ ciraṃ tiṣṭhantu ṭhadvayam |
ayaṃ prāṇamanuḥ proktaḥ sarvajīvapradāyakaḥ ||

atrāmuṣyapadasthāne devatānāma deyam | taduktaṃ rudrayāmale (-)

amukapadaṃ yadrūpaṃ yatra mantre ca dṛśyate |
sādhyābhidhānaṃ tadrūpaṃ tatra sthāne niyojayet || iti |

vaśiṣṭhasaṃhitāyām (-) tato janmādikadvyaṣṭakriyā saṃskārasiddhaye |
ṣoḍaśapraṇavāvṛttīḥ kṛtvā śaktiṃ parāṃ smaret ||

atha mātṛkānyāsaḥ

phetkāriṇītantre (-) mantrā mūkatvamāyānti vinyāsena vinā lipeḥ |
sarvamantraprasiddhyarthaṃ tasmādādau lipiṃ nyaset ||

tantrāntare (-) iḍayā pūrayet prāṇaṃ svaraiḥ sparśaiśca kumbhayet |
recayed yādikairuṣmaistataḥ piṅgalayā punaḥ ||

tathaiva pūraṇaṃ vāyoḥ kumbhanaṃ recanaṃ punaḥ |
iḍayā syāt tato dvābhyāṃ pūraṇāditrayaṃ punaḥ ||

prāṇāyāmatrayaṃ kṛtvā paścād vyāpakamācaret |
akārādyaiḥ kṣāntavaṇairāpādatalamastakam |
śāradāyām (-) ṛṣirbrahmā samuddiṣṭo gāyatrī chanda īritam ||

sarasvatī samākhyātā devatā deśikottamaiḥ |
aklībahrasvadīrghāntargataiḥ ṣaḍvarṇakaiḥ kramāt |
ṣaḍaṅgāni vidheyāni jātiyuktāni deśikaiḥ ||

pañcāśallipibhirvibhaktamukhadoḥpanmadhyavakṣasthalāṃ
bhāsvanmaulinibaddhacandraśakalāmāpīnatuṅgastanīm |
<160> mudrāmakṣaguṇaṃ sudhāḍhyakalaśaṃ vidyāṃ ca hastāmbujai(-)
rbibhrāṇāṃ viśadaprabhāṃ trinayanāṃ vāgdevatāmāśraye ||

mantratantraprakāśe (-) ādāvabhyantare nyasya ṣaḍādhāreṣu pārvati |
akārādikṣakārāntān sthūladehe bahirnyaset ||

dakṣiṇāmūrttiḥ (-) kalāpatrāmbuje kaṇṭhe svarān samyak pravinyaset |
hṛdyarkapatre tadvarṇān nābhau daśadale nyaset ||

daśavarṇān liṅgamūle ṣaḍdale ṣaḍ daleśvari |
caturdale tathādhāre caturvarṇāṃstato nyaset ||

bhrūmadhye dvidale hakṣāvityantarmātṛkāṃ nyaset |
vaiṣṇave tu gautamīye (-) ekaikaṃ varṇamuccārya mūlādhārācchiro'ntakam |
namo'ntamiti vinyāsa āntaraḥ parikīrtitaḥ ||

tathā (-) mūlādhāre caturdale tathāntarmātṛkāṃ nyaset |
ṣaḍdale vidyudākāre svādhiṣṭhāne'nalatviṣi |
babhamairyaralairyukte varṇaiḥ ṣaḍbhiśca suvrate ||

maṇipūre daśadale nīlajīmūtasannibhe |
ḍādiphāntākṣarairyukte bindūbhūṣitamastakaiḥ ||

anāhate dvādaśāre prabālarucisannibhe |
kādiṭhāntākṣarairyukte yoginīhṛdayaṅgame ||

viśuddhe ṣoḍaśadale dhūmrābhe svarabhūṣite |
ājñācakre ca candrābhe dvidale hakṣalācchite ||

sahasrāre hemanibhe savavarṇavibhūṣite ||

akathāditrirekhāsu halakṣatrayabhūṣite |
tanmadhye parabinduṃ ca sṛṣṭisthitilayātmakam ||

evaṃ samāhitamanā dhyāyen nyāso'yamāntaraḥ |
mūlādibrahmarandhrāntaṃ viṣṇuṃ dhyāyet cidātmakam ||

bindusrutasudhāsāraistarpayan mātṛkāṃ nyaset |
ekaikaṃ varṇamuccārya mūlādhārād bhruvāntakam ||

namo'ntamiti vinyāsa āntaraḥ parikīrtitaḥ |

antarmātṛkānyāso manasaiva kāryaḥ | puṣpairanāmayā vāpi manasā vā 
nyasedamūniti mantratantraprakāśavacanāt | anamayā sāṅguṣṭhayā |

<161> aṅguṣṭhānāmikābhyāṃ tu nyāsaḥ sarvatra sammataḥ |

iti padyavāhinī (?)vacanāt | atraivaṃ vyavasthā(-)puṣpairdevatāmūrtau anamayā 
svadehe manasā mūlādhārādiṣu | idañca 
ṛṣyādikaraṣaḍaṅganyāsabahirmātṛkādivyatirikteṣu tatra mudrāntaravidhānāt | 
kulārṇave (-)

yativaikhānasaiḥ kāryaḥ saṃhārāntaḥ kuleśvari |
nyāso gṛhasthaiḥ sthityantaḥ sṛṣṭyanto varṇināṃ bhavet ||

tantre (-) ityantarmātṛkāṃ nyasya bahistāṃ tu pravinyaset |

atha mātṛkānyāsasthānāni

gautamīye (-) lalāṭamukhavṛttākṣi śrutighrāṇeṣu gaṇḍayoḥ |
oṣṭhadantottamāṅgāsye doḥpatsandhyagrakeṣu ca ||

pārśvayoḥ pṛṣṭhato nābhau jaṭhare hṛdaye'ṃsake |
kakudyaṃse ca hṛtpūrva pāṇipādayuge tataḥ ||

jaṭharānanayornyasyen mātṛkārṇān yathākramāt |
tvagasṛṅmāṃsamedo'sthimajjāśukrātmakān viduḥ ||

yādīn hādīn nyasedātmaparamajñānapūrvakān |

vīracūḍāmaṇau tu (-) mūrdhni vaktre tathā netraṃ karṇayornāsikāpuṭe |
kapole oṣṭhadante ca jihvāgre kaṇṭhadeśataḥ ||

kādiṃ dakṣiṇahaste ca cavargaṃ vāmahastake |
ṭavar.gaṃ dakṣiṇe pāde tavargaṃ vāmato nyaset ||

kukṣau pṛṣṭhe'tha nābhau ca udare pādipañcakam |
tvagasṛṅmāṃsamedo'sthimajjāśukrāṇi dhātavaḥ ||

jīvātmā paramātmā ca nyased yādīṃstataḥ kramāt |
hṛdaye dakṣiṇāṃse ca kakudvāmāṃsato nyaset ||

hastayoḥ pādayoḥ paścādācaraṇaṃ mastakāvadhi |
mūrdhādicaraṇaparyantaṃ nyaset sādhakasattamaḥ ||

ityuktam | tadanayorvikalpaḥ | kulāvatāre (-)

pañcāśadakṣaranyāsaḥ krameṇa parikīrtitaḥ |
omādyanto namo'nto vā sabindurbinduvarjitaḥ ||

pañcāśadvarṇavinyāsaḥ kramādukto manīṣibhiḥ |
savisargaḥ sobhayaśca rahasyaṃ tat tu kathyate ||

<162> vittaprado binduyuto vidyādau binduvarjitaḥ |
putrapradaḥ savisargaḥ sobhayo bhaktidāyakaḥ ||

māyālakṣmībījapūrvo vāgbhavādyo'thavā punaḥ |
tribījādyo ramādyo vā nyastavyaḥ sādhakottamaiḥ ||

atha sṛṣṭyādinyāsaḥ

vīracūḍāmaṇau (-) mātṛkātritayaṃ kuryāt sṛṣṭisaṃhārakasthitim |
nyāsaṃ kuryānmaheśāni kalpoktaṃ ca viśeṣataḥ ||

kulāvatāre (-) sṛṣṭestu sutapuṣṭyādi sthitestatpālanaṃ bhavet |
saṃhṛterdoṣasaṃhārastasmāt tritayamācaret ||

śāradāyām (-) nyaset sargānvitān sṛṣṭyā dhyātvā devīṃ yathāvidhi |
bunduyuktāmimāṃ nyasyet saṃhṛtyā pratilomataḥ ||

vidyāt pūrvoditān vidvān ṛṣyādīnaṅgasaṃyutān |
dhyeyā varṇamaye pīṭhe devī vāgvallabhā śivā ||

akṣasrajaṃ hariṇapotamudgaṭaṅkaṃ vidyāṃ karairavirataṃ dadhatīṃ trinetrām |
ardhendumaulimaruṇāmaravindavāsāṃ varṇeśvarīṃ praṇamata 
stanabhāranabhrām ||

sargabindvantikān nyasya ḍārṇādyān sthitivartmanā ||

phetkāriṇītantre (-)

udaropakramān nyāso hṛdayāntaṃ sthitirmatā |

ityuktam | idaṃ cāntarmātṛkārītyoktamiti phalato na kaścid viśeṣaḥ |

triśaktiratne (-) akathāditribhedena vibhajya manuvallipim |
kavargaṃ prathamaṃ nyasyedavargaṃ ca tataḥ param ||

tavargaṃ vinyaset paścāt sthitireṣā prakīrtitā |
yakārādyaṃ tathā taṃ ca amārabhya mamāntakam |
yathāsthānaṃ pravinyasyet sthitiryadveyamīritā ||

bhamārabhya kṣakārāntamakārādyaṃ ca paścimam |
pūrvasthāneṣu vinyasyedathaveyaṃ sthitirbhavet ||

śāradāyām (-) vidyāt pūrvoditān vidvān ṛṣyādīnaṅgasaṃyutān |
dhyāyed varṇeśvarīmatra vallabhena samanvitām ||

sindūrakāntimamitābharaṇāṃ trinetrāṃ vidyākṣasūtramṛgapotavarān 
dadhānām |
pārśvasthitāṃ bhagavatīmapi kāñcanāṅgīṃ 
dhyāyetkarābjadhṛtapustakavarṇamālām ||

<163> atha mātṛkānyāsamudāḥ

tantrāntare (-) lalāṭe'nāmikāmadhye nyasecca mukhavṛttake |
tarjanīmadhyamānāmā vinyaseccaiva netrayoḥ ||

tarjanyanāme saṃyujya nyaset sādhakasattamaḥ |
aṅguṣṭhaṃ karṇayornyasya kaniṣṭhāṅguṣṭhakau nasoḥ ||

madhyamāṃ gaṇḍayornyasya madhyamāmoṣṭhayornyaset |
anāmāṃ dantayornyasya madhyamāmuttamāṅgake ||

mukhe'nāmāṃ madhyamāṃ ca haste pāde ca pārśvayoḥ |
kaniṣṭhānāmikāmadhyā nyastavyāḥ pṛṣṭhatastathā ||

tāḥ sāguṣṭhā nābhideśe sarvāḥ kukṣau ca vinyaset |
hṛdaye sādhakaḥ sarvā aṃsayośca kakutsthale ||

hṛtpūrvahastapatkukṣi(-)mukheṣu talameva ca |
etāstu mātṛkāmudrāḥ krameṇa parikīrtitāḥ ||

ajñātvā vinyased yastu nyāsaḥ syāt tasya niṣphalaḥ |

atra kecit (-) nyāsaṃ nirvarttayed devi ṣoḍhānyāsapuraḥsaramiti 
tantracūḍāmaṇivacanāt sarvādau ṣoḍhānyāsavidhānāt (-)

aṅganyāsakaranyāsau kuryādatraiva kevalam |
atroktamācaredasminnānyat saṃcārayed budhaḥ ||

iti phetkāriṇīvacanācca mātṛkānyāsaṃ nāstīti vadanti | tanna (-)

mantrā mūkatvamāyānti vinyāsena vinā lipeḥ |
sarvamantraprasiddhyarthaṃ tasmādādau lipiṃ nyaset ||

iti phetkāriṇītantravacanāt (-)

mātṛkātritayaṃ kuryāt sṛṣṭisaṃhārakasthitim |
nyāsaṃ kuryānmaheśāni kalpoktaṃ ca viśeṣataḥ ||

iti tārāprakāraṇīyavīracūḍāmaṇivacanācca | tenādau mātṛkaiva nyasanīyā |
ṣoḍhānyāsapuraḥsaratā tu nyāsāntarāpekṣayaiva sambhavatīti 
tantracūḍāmaṇivacanaṃ vinigakam |

atha ṣoḍhānyāsaḥ

tantracuḍāmaṇau (-) tārāṣoḍhāṃ pravakṣyāmi sarvatantreṣu gopitām |
sarvavighnopaśamanāṃ sarvapāpapraṇāśinīm ||

<164> mahādāridryaśamanīṃ sarvasampatpradāyinīm |
sarvakāmapradāṃ nityāṃ sarvasāmrājyadāyinīm ||

śiṣyāya bhaktiyuktāya vinītāya mahātmane |
vadānyāya kulīnāya śuddhācāraratāya ca ||

evaṃ vidhāya deveśi sādhakāya prakāśayet |
anyathā siddhihāniḥ syādityājñā śambhunā kṛtā ||

rudraistu prathamo nyāso dvitīyastu grahairmataḥ |
lokapālaistṛtīyaḥ syācchivaśaktyā caturthakaḥ ||

tārādibhiḥ pañcamaḥ syāt ṣaṣṭhaḥ pīṭhairnigadyate |

atha rudranyāsaḥ

ekena sahitā rudrāḥ pañcāśat parikīrtitāḥ |
binduyuktairmātṛkārṇaistryakṣarībījapūrvakaiḥ ||

ṅentairnamontairdeveśi vinyaset tān kramāt sudhīḥ |
tāriṇī tryakṣarī proktā bhavabandhavināśinī ||

nīlavarṇāṃ trinayanāṃ śavāsanasamāyutām |
vibhratīṃ vividhākalpān maulāvakṣobhya(rdhendu)bhūṣitām ||

evaṃ dhyātvā tāriṇīṃ tu samāhitamanāściram |

ekena sahitā iti | te ca śāradāyām (-)

śrīkaṇṭho'nantasūkṣmau ca trimūrtiramareśvaraḥ |
arghīśo bhārabhūtīśastithīśaḥ sthāṇuko haraḥ ||

jhiṇṭīśo bhautikaḥ sadyojātaścānugraheśvaraḥ |
akrūraśca mahāsenaḥ ṣoḍaśa svaramūrtayaḥ ||

paścāt krodhīśacaṇḍeśa(-)pañcāntakaśivottamāḥ |
athaikarudrakūrmaika(-)netrāhvacaturānanāḥ ||

ajeśasarvasomeśāstathā lāṅgalidārukau |
ardhanārīśvaraścomā kāntaścāṣāḍhidaṇḍinau ||

syuradrimīnameṣākhya lohitāśca śikhī tathā |
chagalaṇḍa dviraṇḍeśau mahākālākhyabālinau ||

bhujaṅgeśa pinākīśa khaḍgīśākhyavakāstathā |
śvetabhṛgvīśanakuliśivāḥ saṃvarttakastathā ||

<165> ete rudrāḥ smṛtā raktā dhṛtaśūlakapālakāḥ | iti |

binduyuktairityādi | tena hrīṃ trīṃ hūṃ aṃ śrīkaṇṭheśāya namaḥ | hrīṃ 
trīṃ hūṃ āṃ ananteśāya namaḥ ityādayaḥ prayogāḥ | kecit tu 
pūrṇodaryādiśaktisahitānetān nyasanti | śaktayaśca śāradāyām (-)

pūrṇodarī syād virajā śālmalī tadanantaram |
lolākṣī vartulākṣī ca dīrghaghoṇā samīritā ||

sudīrghamukhī gomukhyau dīrghajihvā tathaiva ca |
kuṇḍodaryūrdhvakeśī ca tathā vikṛtamukhyapi ||

jvālāmukhī tato jñeyā paścādulkāmukhī tathā |
suśrīmukhī ca vidyāmukhyetāḥ syuḥ svaraśaktayaḥ ||

mahākālī sarasvatyau sarvasiddhisamanvite |
gaurī tryailokyavidyā syānmantraśaktistataḥ param ||

ātmaśaktirbhūtamātā tathā lambodarī matā |
drāviṇī nāgarī bhūyaḥ khecarī cāpi mañjarī ||

rūpiṇī vīriṇī paścāt kākodaryapi pūtanā |
syād bhadrakālī yoginyau śaṅkhinī garjinī tathā ||

kālarātriśca kubjinyā kapardinyapi vajriṇī |
jayā ca sumukheśvaryā revatī mādhavī tathā ||

vāruṇī vāyavī proktā paścādrakṣovidāriṇī |
tataśca sahajā lakṣmīrvyāpinī māyayā'nvitā ||

etā rudrāṅkapīṭhasthāḥ sindūrāruṇavigrahāḥ |
raktotpala kapālābhyāmalaṅkṛtakarāmbujāḥ ||

iti rudranyāsaḥ

atha grahanyāsaḥ

svarairhṛdi nyaset sūryaṃ raktaṃ tryakṣarapūrvakaiḥ |
bhruvormadhye yavargeṇa somaṃ śuklaṃ tu vinyaset ||

netratraye kavargeṇa maṅgalaṃ lohitaṃ nyaset |
cavargeṇa budhaṃ śyāmaṃ nyased hṛdayamaṇḍale ||

ṭavargeṇa kaṇṭhakupe pītavarṇaṃ bṛhaspatim |
galadeśe tavargeṇa pāṇḍaraṃ bhārgavaṃ nyaset ||

<166> nābhideśe pavargeṇa nīlavarṇaṃ śaniṃ nyaset |
śavargeṇa dhūmravarṇaṃ rāhuṃ vaktre nyaset tataḥ ||

la(-)kṣābhyāṃ gudadeśe tu ketuṃ dhūmraṃ varānane |
kāmarūpadharān sarvān sarvābharaṇabhūṣitān ||

iti grahanyāsaḥ

atha lokapālanyāsaḥ

indramagniṃ yamaṃ rakṣo varuṇaṃ pavanaṃ vibhum |
īśānamātmano mūrdhni dikṣu cāṣṭasu ca kramāt ||

adho'nantaṃ mūrdhnideśe brahmāṇaṃ ca tathā nyaset |
hrasva dīrgha svaraiścāṣṭavargaistryakṣarapūrvakaiḥ ||

hrasvetyādi | tena hrīṃ trīṃ hūṃ aṃ iṃ uṃ ṛṃ ḷṃ eṃ oṃ aṃ indrāya 
namaḥ iti pūrvalalāṭe | hrīṃ trīṃ hūṃ āṃ īṃ ūṃ ṝṃ ḹṃ aiṃ oṃ aḥ 
agnaye namaḥ ityagnau dakṣiṇakarṇopari | aṣṭavargāḥ kacaṭatapayaśalāḥ | iti 
lokapālanyāsaḥ

atha śivaśaktinyāsaḥ

brahmā viṣṇuśca rudraśca īśvaraśca sadāśivaḥ |
tataḥ paraśivo devi ṣaṭ śivāḥ parikīrtitāḥ ||

mūlādhāre tu brahmāṇaṃ ḍākinīsahitaṃ nyaset |
sarvatra tryakṣarīyuktaṃ vādisāntaṃ sabindukam ||

svadhiṣṭhānākhyacakre tu saviṣṇurākiṇīṃ tathā |
vādilāntaṃ pravinyasya nābhau tu maṇipūrake ||

ḍādiphāntārṇasahitaṃ rudraṃ ca lākinīṃ tathā |
anāhate kādiṭhāntamīśvaraṃ kākinīṃ nyaset ||

viśuddhākhye mahācakre ṣoḍaśasvarasaṃyutam |
sadāśivaṃ śākinīṃ tu vinyasya pūrvavat tataḥ ||

ājñācakre tu deveśi hakṣavarṇasamanvitam |
paraṃ śivaṃ brahmarūpaṃ hākinīsahitaṃ nyaset ||

iti śivaśaktinyāsaḥ

atha tārādinyāsaḥ

tārā cogrā mahogrā ca vajrā kālī sarasvatī |
kāmeśvarī ca cāmuṇḍā ityaṣṭau tāriṇī matāḥ ||

<167> sarvatrādau tryakṣarīṃ tu samuccārya krameṇa tu |
svarayugmena vargeṇa bhūṣitena ca bindunā ||

ṅentā namo'ntāstārādyā nyastavyā dhyānapūrvikāḥ |
brahmarandhre lalāṭe ca bhrūmadhye kaṇṭhagahvare ||
hṛdaye nābhideśe ca liṅge cādhārake nyaset |

hrīṃ trīṃ hūṃ aṃ āṃ kaṃ khaṃ gaṃ ghaṃ ṅaṃ tārāyai namaḥ ityādayaḥ 
prayogāḥ |

iti tārādinyāsaḥ

atha pīṭhanyāsaḥ

mūlādhāre kāmarūpaṃ hṛdi jālandharaṃ tataḥ |
lalāṭe pūrṇagiryākhyamuḍḍiyānaṃ tadūrdhvake ||

vārāṇasīṃ bhrūvormadhye cāva(jvala)ntīṃ locanatraye |
māyāvatīṃ mukhavṛtte kaṇṭhe madhupurīṃ tataḥ ||

ayodhyāṃ nābhideśe tu kaṭyāṃ kāñcīṃ vinirdiśet |
daśaitāni pradhānāni(-)piṭhāni kramato viduḥ ||

hrasvadīrghaiścāṣṭavargairnamontaiḥ kramato nyaset |

iti pīṭhanyāsaḥ

iti tantracūḍāmaṇyuktamahāṣoḍhānyāsaḥ

atha nīlatantroktatārāṣoḍhānyāsaḥ

nīlatantre (-) mantreṇā'ntaritāṃ kṛtvā ṣaḍvāraṃ mātṛkāṃ nyaset |
kramotkramād varārohe tārāṣoḍhā prakīrtitā ||

kṛte tu nyāsamātre tu sarvapāpaṃ vinaśyati |
yoginīnāṃ bhavet pūjyaḥ sa devo na tu mānuṣaḥ ||

yaṃ namanti maheśāni ṣoḍhā racitavigrahāḥ |
alpāyuḥ sa bhavet sadyo devatā kampate bhiyā ||

nāstyasya pūjyo lokeṣu pitṛmātṛmukhojjvalaḥ |

ṣaḍvāraṃ sṛṣṭisthitisaṃhārakramāt | tena sṛṣṭisthitisaṃhāra 
saṃhārasthitisṛṣṭaya iti krama iti kecit | anye tu saṃhāra(-)sṛṣṭi(-)sthitayaḥ punarapi 
tathaiveti vadanti | vastutaḥ kramotkramayoreva vacanārūḍhatvāt 
akārādikṣakārāntān kṣakārādyakārāntān mantrāntaritān vāratrayaṃ 
nyaset | evaṃ ṣoḍhānyāso bhavatīti mama pratibhāti | iti 
nīlatantroktatārāṣoḍhānyāsaḥ

<168> atha rudrayāmaloktatārāṣoḍhānyāsaḥ

rudrayāmale (-) śṛṇu devi pravakṣyāmi guhyaṣoḍhā tviyaṃ priye |
na prakāśyamidaṃ kvāpi mantriṇaḥ kāyarakṣaṇe ||

praṇavaṃ mātṛkāvarṇaiḥ puṭitaṃ mātṛkāsthale |
tenaiva puṭitaṃ varṇaṃ nyaset tatraiva pārvati ||

māyābījaṃ tathā devi nyastavyaṃ tu prayatnataḥ |
badhūbījaṃ tathā caiva vinyaset susamāhitaḥ ||

kūrcabījaṃ tathā devi nyasanīyamaśeṣataḥ |
astraṃ caiva tathā nyastvā sakalaṃ tadanantaram ||

guhyaṣoḍhā tviyaṃ devi na prakāśyā kadācana |
avaśyaṃ pratyahaṃ kāryā dhyānaṃ pūjā japastathā ||

atra aṃ oṃ aṃ oṃ aṃ oṃ namaḥ iti lalāṭe | evaṃ prathamanyāsaḥ | aṃ hrīṃ aṃ 
hrīṃ aṃ hrīṃ namaḥ iti lalāṭe iti dvitīyakramaḥ | aṃ trīṃ aṃ trīṃ aṃ trīṃ 
namaḥ iti tṛtīyakramaḥ | aṃ hūṃ aṃ hūṃ aṃ hūṃ ityādi caturthe | aṃ phaṭ 
aṃ phaṭ aṃ phaṭ namaḥ ityādi pañcame | a oṃ hrīṃ trīṃ hūṃ phaṭ aṃ oṃ hrīṃ 
trīṃ hūṃ phaṭ aṃ oṃ hrīṃ trīṃ hūṃ phaṭ namaḥ ityādi ṣaṣṭhakramaḥ |

iti rudrayāmaloktatārāṣoḍhānyāsaḥ

vīratantroktaṣoḍhānyāsastu kālīprakaraṇe vakṣyate |

atha tārakānyāsaḥ

vīratantre (-) akādikramato nyasyedrohiṇyādikrameṇa tu |
vyutkrameṇa ca tattvāni śeṣaṃ śeṣeṇa yojayet ||

rohiṇyādimahānyāsaṃ kṛtvā naravaraḥ sudhīḥ |
rohiṇīsutavat sṛṣṭyāmaśocyo bhavati dhruvam ||

gadyapadyamayī vāṇī kathāyāṃ tasya jāyate |
adṛṣṭaśrutaśāstrāṇāṃ vyākhyātā bhavati dhruvam ||

akṛtvā tārakānyāsaṃ tāriṇīṃ prajaped yadi |
śatalakṣaprajapto'pi na mantraḥ siddhidāyakaḥ ||

tatra sampradāyānusārī prayogaḥ | aṃ kaṃ ākāśatattvātmikāyai 
rohiṇīrūpāyai namaḥ śirasi | āṃ khaṃ vāyutattvātmikāyai mṛgaśirarūpāyai 
namo mukhe | iṃ gaṃ tejastatvātmikāyai ārdrārūpāyai namo hṛdi | īṃ ghaṃ 
jalatattvātmikāyai punarvasurūpāyai namo guhya | 

<169> uṃ ūṃ pṛthivītattvātmikāyai puṣparūpāyai namaḥ pādayoḥ | ūṃ caṃ 
ghrāṇatattvātmikāyai aśleṣārūpāyai namo nasoḥ | ṛṃ chaṃ 
rasanātattvātmikāyai maghārūpāyai namo jihvāyām | ṛṃ jaṃ 
cakṣustattvātmikāyai pūrvaphalgunīrūpāyai namaścakṣuṣoḥ | ḷṃ jhaṃ tvak 
tattvātmikāyai uttaraphalgunīrūpāyai namaḥ sarvāṅgeḥ | ḹṃ ñaṃ 
śrotratattvātmikāyai hastārūpāyai namaḥ śrotrayoḥ | eṃ ṭaṃ 
gandhatattvātmikāyai citrārūpāyai namo nasoḥ | aiṃ ṭhaṃ rasatattvātmikāyai 
svātīrūpāyai namo jihvāyām | oṃ ḍaṃ rūpatatvātmikāyai 
viśākhārūpāyai namaścakṣuṣo | auṃ ḍhaṃ rasatattvātmikāyai 
svātīrūpāyai namaḥ sarvāṅge | aṃ ṇaṃ śabdatattvātmikāyai 
jyeṣṭhārūpāyai namaḥ śrotrayoḥ | aḥ taṃ upasthatattvātmikāyai 
mūlārūpāyai namo liṅge | aṃ thaṃ pāyutattvātmikāyai 
pūrvāṣāḍhārūpāyai namo guhye | āṃ daṃ pādatattvātmikāyai 
uttarāṣāḍhārūpāyai namaḥ pādayoḥ | iṃ dhaṃ pāṇitattvātmikāyai 
śravaṇārūpāyai namo hastayoḥ | īṃ naṃ vāktatvātmikāyai 
dhaniṣṭhārūpāyai namo mukhe | uṃ paṃ ānandatattvātmikāyai 
śatabhiṣārūpāyai namo liṅge | ūṃ phaṃ visargatattvātmikāyai 
pūrvabhādrapadarūpāyai namo guhye | ṛṃ vaṃ gatitattvātmikāyai 
uttarabhādrarūpāyai namaḥ pādayoḥ | ṛṃ bhaṃ ādānatattvātmikāyai 
revatīrūpāyai namo hastayoḥ | ḷṃ maṃ vacanatattvātmikāyai aśvinīrūpāyai 
namo mukhe | ḹṃ eṃ aiṃ oṃ yaṃ raṃ laṃ vaṃ adhastattvātmikāyai 
bharaṇīrūpāyai namo nābhyādipādaparyantaṃ nyaset | auṃ aṃ aḥ śaṃ ṣaṃ 
saṃ haṃ laṃ kṣaṃ ūrdhvatattvātmikāyai kṛttikārūpāyai namo nābhyādi 
mastakaparyantaṃ nyaset |

iti tārakānyāsaḥ

atha ṛṣyādinyāsaḥ

tantre (-) ṛṣicchando devatānāṃ vinyāsena vinā yadā |
japyate sādhito'pyeṣa tasya tucchaṃ phalaṃ bhavet ||

mantracūḍāmaṇau (-) akṣobhya ṛṣiretasyā bṛhatī chanda īritam |
nīlasarasvatī devī triṣu lokeṣu gopitā ||

hūṃ bījamastraṃ śaktiḥ syāccaturvargaphalapradā |
śiro vadana hṛdaya liṅga pādasarvāṅgeṣu teṣāṃ nyāsaḥ | taduktaṃ tantre (-)

ṛṣinyāso mūrdhni deśe chandastu mukhapaṅkaje |
devatā hṛdaye caiva bījaṃ guhyapradeśake ||

śaktiṃ ca pādayoścaiva sarvāṅge kīlakaṃ nyaset |

yoginītantre (-) ṛṣyādīn vinyased devi caturthīhṛdayāntakān |
caturthī vibhaktiḥ | hṛdayaṃ namaḥ |

<170> sārasaṃgrahe (-) ṛṣicchandodevatānāṃ nyāse tvaṅgulayaḥ smṛtāḥ |
catusro'ṅguṣṭharahitāḥ śaktyantaṃ vinyaset tataḥ || iti |
bījaśaktinyāso'pyevameva | kīlakanyāso vyastahastābhyāṃ sarvāṅge | 
taduktam 

kīlakaṃ vyastahastābhyāṃ sarvāṅge sādhakāgraṇīḥ |

atha karāṅganyāsaḥ

phetkāriṇyām (-) ṣaḍdīrghādyādyabījena karāṅganyasanaṃ tataḥ | karanyāse 
viśeṣastatraiva(-) 

vṛddhāṅguṣṭhaṃ samārabhya kaniṣṭhāntaṃ tathā punaḥ |
utpattisaṃjñako nyāsaḥ saṃhāro'sya viparyayaḥ ||

madhyamāmūlamārabhya cobhayorapi hastayoḥ |
tarjanyantaṃ caren nyāsaṃ sthitirnāmakṛtodayaḥ |

siddhasārasvate (-) akhilavāgrūpiṇīṃ procya hṛdayāya namo vadet ||

akhaṇḍavāgrūpiṇīṃ ca śirase vahnivallabhā ||

brahmavāgrūpiṇīmuktvā śikhāyai vaṣaḍityapi |
viṣṇuvāgrūpiṇīmuktvā kavacāya humuccaret ||

rudravāgrūpiṇīṃ netratrayāya vauṣaḍityapi |
sarvavāgrūpiṇīmuktvā cāstrāya phaḍiti smaret ||

ṣaḍdīrghamāyayā bījaṃ bījānte tāni yojayet |

tantracūḍāmaṇau (-) bījānte ekajaṭāyai hṛdayaṃ parikīrtitam |
tāriṇyai śirase tadvad vajrodake śikhāṃ tathā ||

ugrajaṭe ca kavacaṃ mahāparisare tathā |
piṅgograikajaṭe tadvan netrāstre parikīrtite ||

ityuktam | tena phetkāriṇīvacanamanyabhāgopalakṣaṇaparam | 
siddhasārasvatatantracūḍāmaṇiproktaprakārayorvikalpaḥ | 
siddhasārasvataproktaṣaḍaṅganyāso nīlasarasvatyāṃ 
tantracūḍāmaṇiproktaṣaḍaṅganyāsaprakārastāraikajaṭayorityapi vadanti |

tantre (-) hṛdaye madhyamānāmātarjanībhirnyaset budhaḥ |
madhyamātarjanībhyāṃ ca śirasi nyāsamācaret ||

aṅguṣṭhena śikhāyāṃ ca daśabhiḥ kavace nyaset |
netreṣu tisṛbhiśca syādastramūrdhvordhvagaṃ triśaḥ ||

madhyamātarjanībhyāṃ syādaṅgamudrāḥ smṛtā api |
madhyamātarjanībhyāmūrdhvordhvakrameṇa tālatrayaṃ kuryādityarthaḥ |

<171> svatantra (-) anuktāṅgeṣu mantreṣu padaśo varṇaśo'pi vā |
svenaivāṅgāni kalyāni mūlena sakalena vā ||

atha vyāpakanyāsaḥ

bhairavatantre (-) pañcadhā navadhā vāpi mūlena saptadhā tathā |

vyāpayediti śeṣaḥ | svatantratantre'pi (-)

mūlena vyāpakaṃ nyāsaṃ navadhā kārayet priye |

atra yogapīṭhanyāso nāsti | tārātantre kvacidapyabhidhānādarśanāt | nānyat 
sañcārayed budha ityabhidhānācca | yadi kālītantrātideśena tatprāptirucitā 
tadāgre vakṣyamāṇapīṭhapūjākrameṇa tannyāso'vagantavyaḥ |

kumārītantre (-) tataḥ strīveśadhārī syāt sindūrāṅkitabhālakaḥ |
śṛṅgārojjvalabhūṣāḍhyastāmbūlapūritānanaḥ ||

evaṃ veśādikaṃ sarvaṃ vanitāmapi kārayet |
ādipadena bhūtaśuddhyādivyāpakāntaṃ pañcamayogoktanyāsādikaṃ cocyate 
|

kulārṇave (-) yo nyāsakavacacchanno mantraṃ japati taṃ priye |
vighnā dṛṣṭvā palāyante siṃhaṃ dṛṣṭvā yathā gajāḥ ||

akṛtvā nyāsajālaṃ yo mūḍhātmā prajapen manum |
sarvavighnaiḥ sa vādhyeta vāghrairmṛgaśiśuryathā ||

svatantratantre (-) itthaṃ vinyastadehaḥ san cakrarājaṃ samālikhet |
svarṇe vā rājate tāmre pāṣāṇe cāṣṭadhātuṣu ||

svayambhukusumaṃ kuṇḍagolottharocanāguruḥ |
kāśmīraṃ mṛganābhiśca kulaṃ ca malayodbhavam ||

eṣa gandhaḥ samākhyātaḥ sarvadā caṇḍikāpriyaḥ |
etena gandhayogena yonicakraṃ samālikhet ||

atra gandhānāmaicchikagrahaṇam | kumārītantre (-)

etat tu vilikhet tāmre kuṇḍagolavilepite |
rudrayāmale (-) tataḥ kuṅkumasindūraiḥ kāryaṃ yantraṃ tu yoginā |
sauvarṇe rājate tāmre sphāṭike vaidrume tathā ||

cakre yathoktavidhinā pūjyā devī narottamaiḥ |
sphāṭikādau sthirarekhārūpamapi yantraṃ praśastam | ata eva sārasaṃgrahe (-)

tāmre dvādaśakaṃ varṣaṃ sphāṭikādau tu sarvadā |
<172> teṣāṃ madhye sphāṭikaṃ tu sarvasiddhipradaṃ bhavet ||

tantrāntare (-) yāvajjivaṃ suvarṇaṃ syād raupyaṃ dvāviṃśatiḥ priye |
tāmre dvādaśakaṃ varṣaṃ tadūrdhvaṃ bhūrjapatrake ||

rudrayāmale (-) ekatolaṃ dvitolaṃ vā tritolaṃ vedatolakam |
svecchātolaṃ naraḥ kṛtvā pratyavāyaṃ samaśnute |

tathā (-) tāmre lakṣaguṇaṃ proktaṃ raupye koṭiguṇaṃ bhavet ||

sauvarṇe'nantaphaladaṃ maṇyādau kiṃ vadāmi te |
vidrume racite yantre padmarāge'thavā priye |
indranīle'tha vaidūrye sphāṭike marakare(?)'pi vā ||

dhanaṃ putraṃ tathā dārān yaśāṃsi labhendhruvam(?) |
ratnasāgare (-) abdhyaṅgulena hemasya rajatasya tathaiva ca ||

tāmrasya pūrvasaṃkhyaiva māṇikyādau yathecchayā ||

gaurīyāmale (-) cāturvidhyaṃ hi cakrasya prastārāśca bhavanti hi |
bhūkūrmapadmaprastārā meruścāpi tathāvidhaḥ ||

nimnarekhāsamāyogo bhūprastāro mayoditaḥ ||

kūrmapadmakaprastāra ūrdhvarekhaṃ mayoditam ||

sautrāmaṇitantre (-) ṛjurekhe bhavellakṣmīrvakrarekhe daridratā |
kulārṇave (-) ābhirupyācca bimbasya pūjāyāśca viśeṣataḥ |
sādhakasya ca viśvāsād devatāsannidhirbhavet |

pheravīye (-) aṣṭapatraṃ likhet padma trikoṇojjvalakarṇikam |
māyāṃ pūrvadale nyasya yāmye bījaṃ dvitīyakam ||

tathottare paścime ca phaṭkārau vilikhet tataḥ |
madhye bījaṃ likhitvā tu bhūtaśuddhiṃ samācaret ||

bhūtaśuddhimiti makārapañcakaśuddhimityarthaḥ | bhūtapadasya 
pañcasaṃkhyārthakatvāt | 

anyathā (-) itthaṃ vinyastadehaḥ san cakrarājaṃ samālikhedityanena virodhāpatteḥ 
|

kecit tu (-) bhūtaśuddhiyantralikhanayoḥ paurvāparyavikalpamevecchanti |
vīratantre (-) ṣaṭkoṇaṃ vilikhet padmamaṣṭapatraṃ salakṣaṇam |

phetkāriṇītantre (-) sayoni gomayenāṣṭapatramabjaṃ suśobhanam |
bhūpuraṃ vasuvajrāḍhyaṃ yantramekajaṭātmakamiti ||

<173> bhūpuramapyadhikamuktam | evaṃ ca ṣaṭkoṇatrikoṇayorvikalpaḥ | samuccaya 
eveti vīracūḍāmaṇimataṃ vakṣyate |

nīlatantre (-) vyomendau rasanārṇakarṇikamacāṃ dvandvaiḥ sphuratkeśaraṃ
vargollāsivasucchadaṃ vasumatīgehena saveṣṭitam |
tārādhīśvaravārivarṇavilasad dikkoṇasaṃśobhitaṃ
yantra nīlatanoḥ paraṃ nigaditaṃ sarvārthasiddhipradam ||

atra nīlatanorityabhidhānāt tryakṣaropāsakenāsmin yantre pūjā 
caturakṣarapañcākṣaropāsakena tu phetkāriṇyādyuktayantre | 
vyomendāvityādinā dhāraṇayantramuktamityapi vadanti |

matsyasūkte (-) anuktakalpe yantraṃ tu likhet padmaṃ dalāṣṭakam |
ṣaṭkoṇakarṇikaṃ vṛttaṃ vedadvāropaśobhitam ||

tantre (-) āḥ surekhe vajrarekhe hūṃ phaṭ ca vahnivallabhā |
mantreṇānena vilikhet padmapatraṃ manoharam |

kumārītantre (-) svayambhūpuṣpasaṃyukte kuṅkumāruṇasevite |
śuddhāsane ca paśubhiradṛṣṭe purato nyaset ||

dakṣiṇāmūrtisaṃhitāyām (-)

śrīkhaṇḍaraktaśrīkhaṇḍa śrāparṇīsambhave paṭe |
cakraṃ saṃsthāpayed devi nānyatra varavarṇini ||

kulārṇave (-) yantre sā pūjitā devi sahasaiva prasīdati |
kāmakrodhādidoṣotthasarvaduḥkhaniyantraṇāt ||

yantramityāhuretasmin devaḥ prīṇāti tattvataḥ |
śarīramiva jīvasya dīpasya snehavat priye ||

sarveṣāmapi devānāṃ tathā yantraṃ pratiṣṭhitam |
tasmād yantraṃ likhitvā'tha dhyātvā vāsāvṛtiṃ śivam ||

jñātvā gurumukhāt pūrvaṃ pūjayed vidhinā priye ||

tathā (-) na rātrāvaṅkayed yantraṃ sādhakastu kadācana |
pramādādaṅkite caiva devatāśāpamāpnuyāt ||

siddheśvarītantre (-) saṃsthāpya purato devi śubhe pīṭhe sureśvari |
dadyāt puṣpāñjaliṃ tatra mūlamantreṇa sādhakaḥ |

yoginītantre (-) yoginīmūlamantreṇa tatra puṣpāñjaliṃ kṣipet |

<174> aśūnyaṃ kusumaiḥ kuryācchūnyaṃ vighnaṃ vinirdiśet ||

yoginīmūlamantro yathā (-) bhairavatantre (-)

hrasvaḥ sākṣibhayaṃ śveto bhagavān madano vakaḥ |
tābhiṣekaṃ tathā coktvā bhṛguḥ kālī marut priye ||

kūrcāstraṃ vahnibhāryeti yantre puṣpāñjaliṃ kṣipet |

hrasvo'kāraḥ | bhayaṃ bhakāraḥ | sākṣi hrasvekārayuktam | śveto 
mūrdhanyaṣakāraḥ | bhagavān ekārayuktaḥ | madanaḥ kakāraḥ | vakaḥ 
tālavyaśakāraḥ | tābhiṣeketi svarūpam | bhṛgurdantyasakāraḥ | kālī makāraḥ | 
marut yakāraḥ | kūrcaṃ hūṃkāraḥ | astraṃ phaṭ | vahnibhāryā svāhā | 
kumārītantre (-)

pīṭhanyāsaṃ tataḥ kuryādādhāraśaktipūrvakam |
prakṛtiṃ kamaṭhaṃ caiva śeṣaṃ pṛthvīṃ tathā punaḥ ||

sudhāmbudhiṃ maṇidvīpaṃ cintāmaṇigṛhaṃ tathā |
śmaśānaṃ pārijātaṃ ca tanmūle ratnavedikām ||

tasyopari maṇeḥ pīṭhaṃ nyaset sādhakasattamaḥ |
caturdikṣu munīn devān śavāṃśca śavamuṇḍakān ||

dharmādīṃścāpyadharmādīn pādagātracatuṣṭaye |
hṛdi padmaṃ tathā padme sūryasomau maheśvari ||

vaiśvānaraṃ tathā sattvaṃ rajaścaiva tamastathā |
ātmānaṃ caiva vinyasya śaktīrhṛtpadmake nyaset ||

atra pīṭhanyāsaṃ tataḥ kuryādityatra nyāsapadopādānaṃ 
kālikākramābhiprāyeṇa kumārītantrasya tadīyatvāditi vadanti | atra ca 
bāhyapīṭhārcanakrame tadupayogaḥ | dharmādīniti | tena koṇacatuṣṭaye 
dharmajñānavairāgyaiścaryāṇi dikcatuṣṭaye 
adharmājñānāvairāgyānaiścaryāṇi pūjayedityarthaḥ | śaktīḥ pīṭhaśaktīḥ | 
tārārṇave (-)

ṣaṭkoṇāntargataṃ padmaṃ bhūbimbadvitayaṃ punaḥ |
tanmadhye pūjayed devyā vāhanaṃ śavameva ca ||

śmaśānaṃ tatra saṃcintya tatra kalpadrumaṃ smaret |
tanmūle maṇipīṭhaṃ ca nānāmaṇivibhūṣitam ||

nānālaṅkārabhūṣāḍhyaṃ munidevaiśca bhūṣitam |
śivābhirbahumāṃsāsthimodamānābhirantataḥ |
caturdikṣu śavān muṇḍān citāṅgārāsthivibhūṣitān ||

<175> keśareṣu pīṭhaśaktayaḥ pūjyāḥ | tāśca siddhasārasvate (-)

lakṣmīḥ sarasvatī caiva ratiḥ prītistathaiva ca |
kīrtiḥ śāntiśca puṣṭiśca tuṣṭirityaṣṭaśaktayaḥ ||

sārasaṃgrahe (-) pīṭhaśaktirathābhyarcyet kesareṣu samantataḥ |
varadābhayadhāriṇyaḥ pīṭhaṃ pīṭhāṇunā yajet ||

vīracūḍāmaṇau tu (-) pīṭhaśaktividhānena navaśaktīḥ prapūjayet |
ratiḥ prītiḥ priyā kāntiḥ kāminī kāmamālinī ||

kandarpadalinī durgā bhāvinī navaśaktayaḥ |
viyad bhṛguṃ samuccārya manuṃ bindukalānvitam ||

mahāpretapadaṃ paścāt hṛdayāntamayo manuḥ |
manuḥ pīṭhamanuḥ | kumārītantre (-) pīṭhamantraṃ tantrāntaramuktam |
yathā (-) vāgbhavaṃ prathamaṃ coktvā parāyai tadanantaram |
aparāyai parāparāyai hsaurvācyamataḥ param ||

sadāśivamahāpretaṅentaṃ padmāsanaṃ tathā |
nama ityeva mantro'yaṃ pīṭhanyāsa udāhṛtaḥ ||

yadyapi kumārītantraṃ kālīpradhānam tathāpyatideśādatrāpi tadanvetīti 
vadanti | vaśiṣṭhasaṃhitāyām (-)

tatastu kārayed vidvān saptacchadavṛttiṃ dvijaḥ |
hrīṃkārasampuṭaṃ kṛtvā oṃkāreṇa samanvitam ||

pūjādau pratyahaṃ vipraḥ saptakṛtvo japenmanum |
anena tu vidhānena sarakṣā mantratejasaḥ ||

devībhūtāni sarvāṇi tathā ca sādhkottamāḥ |
bhairavastu svayaṃ devo mantratejasi lolupāḥ ||

haranti sarve tejāṃsi rakṣāṃ saptachadaṃ vinā |

atha mantraśuddhiḥ

kulārṇave (-) grathitvā mātṛkāvarṇairmūlamantrākṣarāṇi ca |
kramotkramād dvirāvṛtyā mantraśuddhiriyaṃ bhavet ||

atha dravyaśuddhiḥ

kulārṇave (-) pūjādravyāṇi saṃprokṣya mūlāstrādbhirvidhānataḥ |
darśayed dhenumudrāṃ ca dravyaśuddhiḥ prakīrtitā ||

<176> atha viśeṣaśuddhiḥ

kulārṇave (-) kuladravyaśaktiśuddhiragre vācyā | oṃ pratadviṣṇu stuvate vīryeṇa 
mṛgona bhīmaḥ kucaro gariṣṭhāḥ yasyoruṣu triṣu vikramaṇeṣvadhi kṣiyanti 
bhuvanāni viśvā iti mantreṇa māṃsaṃ śodhayet | pratad viṣṇuriti mantraṃ 
māṃsaśuddhau niyojayediti vacanāt | oṃ tryambakaṃ yajāmahe sugandhiṃ 
puṣṭivardhanam | urvārukamiva bandhanānmṛtyormukṣīya mā mṛtāt | iti 
mantreṇa matsyaṃ śodhayet | tryambakasya tu mantreṇa matsyaśuddhiṃ 
samācarediti vacanāt | oṃ tad viṣṇoḥ paramaṃ padaṃ sadā paśyanti sūrayaḥ | 
divīva cakṣurātatam | tadviprāso vipaṇyavo jāgṛvāṃ sa samindhate viṣṇoryat 
paramaṃ padam | iti mantreṇa mudrāṃ śodhayet | tadviṣṇoriti mantreṇa 
tadviprāso'ṇunā tathā | mudrāṃ tu śodhayenmatrī devatākārikāmiti vacanāt | 
oṃ viṣṇuryoniṃ kalpayatu tvaṣṭā rūpāṇi piṃśatu āsiṃcatu prajāpatirdhātā 
garbhaṃ dadhātu vai garbhaṃ dehi sinīvāli garbhaṃ dehi sarasvati | garbhaṃ 
dhehyaśvinau devā bādhattāṃ puṣkarasrajau | ābhyāṃ mantrābhyāṃ 
kuṇḍagolotthau śodhayet | viṣṇuryonimamuṃ mantraṃ garbhaṃ dhehīti vai tathā | 
kuṇḍagolotthayoḥ śudhauḥ sādhako viniyojayet | iti vacanāt | tantre (-) 

tāraṃ kūrcāstramuddhṛtya śivāditrayabinduyuk |
vahnijāyā tāramāyā śrībījaṃ suratapriye ||

tāramāyāramāstraṃ ca vahnijāyāṃ ca vartulam |
tato mṛtodbhavāyetyamṛtavarṣiṇi tatparam ||

priye devipadaṃ yuktaṃ śāpaṃ mocaya yugmakam |
amṛtaṃ srāvayadvandvaṃ amṛtaṃ kuruyugmakam |
vahnijāyāntamantreṇa śukraśuddhiṃ samācaret ||

varttulaṃ makāraḥ | rudrayāmale (-)

māsaṃ tu trividhaṃ proktaṃ jalakhecarabhūcaram |
tathā (-) gonarebhāśca mahiṣavarāhātramṛgodbhavām ||

mahāmāṃsāṣṭakaṃ proktaṃ devatāprītikārakam |
kulārṇave (-) matsyaṃ ca trividhaṃ proktamuttamādhamamadhyamam |
uttamaṃ trividhaṃ devi kṣālapāṭhānarohitāḥ ||

pravīṇaṃ kaṇṭakairhīnaṃ tailakaṃ svādusaṃyutam |
devyāḥ prītikaraṃ caiva madhyamaṃ tadudāhṛtam ||

kṣudrāṇi tāni sarvāṇi adhamānyāhuruttamāḥ |
<177> tathā (-) vreheyaṃ maṇḍalākāra candravimbanibhaṃ śubham |
cārupakvaṃ manohāri śarkarādyaiḥ prapūritam ||

pūjākāle ca devīnāṃ mudraiṣā parikīrtitā |
tantrāntare tu (-) mudrā tu devi saṃproktā bharjitaṃ caṇakādikam |
bhṛṣṭadhānyādikaṃ yāvaccarvaṇīyaṃ prakalpayet |
tasya saṃjñā kṛtā mudrā mahāmodapravardhinī || ityuktam |

muṇḍamālāyām (-) sādhavāratisambhūtaṃ kuṇḍamuttamabhūtidam |
vidhavāratisambhūtaṃ golaṃ siddhipradaṃ bhuvi ||

kulārṇave (-) kuladravyairvinā kuryājjapa yajña tapo vratam |
niṣphalaṃ tad bhaved devi bhasmanīva hutaṃ yathā ||

athānukalpaḥ

tatraiva (-) madyābhāve tu vaṭikāṃ jale saṃloḍya tarpayet |
guḍamiśreṇa takreṇa tacca vā madhubhājanam ||

sauvīreṇā'thavā kuryādetat karma na lopayet |

vaṭikāprakārastu tatraivoktaḥ (-)

madyaṃ māṃsaṃ ca vijayāṃ cāṣṭagandhaiḥ sumiśritām |
samarcya vaṭikāṃ kṛtvā parigṛhyād vicakṣaṇaḥ ||

iti madhubhājanaṃ kuryādityanuṣaṅgaḥ | sauvīraṃ kāñjikam |
kumārītantre (-) nālikerodakaṃ kāṃsye tāmre vā visṛjen madhu |
gavyaṃ ca tāmrapātrasthaṃ surātulyaṃ ghṛtaṃ vinā ||

samayācāre (-) takraṃ kṣīraṃ guḍaṃ kṣaudraṃ madhvājyatilaśarkarāḥ |
tailaṃ majjāranālaṃ ca dravyaṃ daśavidhaṃ smṛtam |

dvitīyānukalpastatraiva (-)

māṃsābhāve tu lasunamārdrakaṃ nāgaraṃ tu vā |
ādāya pūjayed devīmanyathā niṣphalaṃ bhavet ||

tathā (-) lavaṇārdrapiyālaṃ ca godhūmaṃ māṣapañcamam |
lasunaṃ ca mahādevi māṃsapratinidhau smṛtam ||

pañcamānukalpo bhāvacūḍāmaṇau (-)

yadi vipro bhavet trastaḥ kulapūjāparāyaṇaḥ |
tadānena vidhānena kuryāt kulasamudbhavam ||

<178> aparāpuṣpagarbhe tu kulasthānaṃ manoharam |
hayārikusume deva svayamasti sadāśivaḥ ||

tanmadhye laghumādhāya puṣpamadhye tu candanam |
raktaṃ vā kusumaṃ dattvā dhyātvātmānaṃ śivātmakam ||

yojayecchivaśaktyostadaikyaṃ sambhāvayan dhiyā |
kṣaṇaṃ vicintya tatraiva saṃcintya parameśvarīm ||

japtvā tadeva kuṇḍākhyaṃ dravyaṃ paramadurlabham |

laghumārtavam | raktaṃ vā kusumamityārtavālābhe | puṣpamadhye 
karavīrapuṣpamadhye | candanaṃ śvetacandanam | bhairavītantre (-)

svayambhūkusumābhāve raktacandanakaṃ kṣipet |
idaṃ sarvaṃ vīramātraparamiti bodhyam |

atha sādanam

kulacūḍāmaṇau (-) nānāvidhāni puṣpāṇi gandhāni vividhāni ca |
karpūrajātidhūpādivāsitaṃ paṭavāsitam |
tāmbūlaṃ deyadravyaṃ ca dhūpadīpādikaṃ ca yat ||

sarvālaṅkārabhūṣābhirbhūṣitaḥ kaulikeśvaraḥ |
mūlamantrajaptatoyaiḥ prokṣitaṃ sthāpayet tataḥ ||

sarvaṃ svadakṣiṇe sthāpyaṃ vāme cārghyaṃ niveśayet |
paścime devatāyāśca kuladravyāṇi dhārayet |

kālikāpurāṇe (-) madirāṃ pṛṣṭhato dadyādanyat pānaṃ tu pṛṣṭhataḥ |
tukāro'pyarthaḥ | tathā (-)

prakṣālanāya karayoḥ paścāt pātraṃ nidhāpayet |
ghṛtādijvalitān dīpān sthāpayet paritaḥ śubhān ||

oḍrapuṣpairviśeṣeṇa vajrapuṣpeṇa miśritam |
sarvaṃ puṣpaṃ pradadyācca bhaktiyuktena cetasā ||

puṣpabhedā matsyasūkte (-)

sugandhiśvetalauhitya kusumairarcayet kulaiḥ |
bilvairmaruvakādyaiśca tulasīvarjitaiḥ śubhaiḥ ||

yāmale (-) puṣpairdevāḥ prasīdanti puṣpe devāśca saṃsthitāḥ |
kiñcātibahunoktena puṣpasyoktirmatallikā ||

<179> paraṃ jyotiḥ puṣpagataṃ puṣpeṇaiva prasīdati |
trivargasādhanaṃ puṣpaṃ puṣṭiśrīsvargamokṣadam |
puṣpamūle vased brahmā puṣpamadhye tu keśavaḥ ||

puṣpāgre ca mahādevaḥ sarve devāḥ sthitā dale |
tasmāt puṣpairyajed devān nityaṃ bhaktiyuto naraḥ ||

pūjanīyā sadā bhaktyā nṝṇāṃ śīghraphalapradā |

kalairvajrapuṣpādyaiḥ | muṇḍamālāyām (-)

puṣpāṇyapi tathā dadyādraktakṛṣṇasitāni ca |
śvetapuṣpaṃ javāpuṣpaṃ karavīraṃ tathā priye ||

tagaraṃ mālatī jātī sevantī yūthikā tathā |
dhustūrāśokavakula(-)śvetakṛṣṇāparājitāḥ ||

vakapuṣpaṃ vilvapatraṃ campakaṃ nāgakeśaram |
mallikā jhiṇṭikā kāñcī raktaṃ yat parikīrtitam ||

arkapuṣpaṃ barbaraṃ ca bandhūkaṃ ca priyaṃvadā |
aṣṭamyāṃ ca viśeṣeṇa tuṣṭā bhavati pārvati ||

padmapuṣpeṇa raktena santuṣṭāḥ sarvadevatāḥ |
kṛṣṇairvā yadi vā śuklaiḥ kālikā varadā bhavet ||

śmaśānadhustūreṇaiva tuṣṭā dhūmāvatī parā |
vanyapuṣpaiśca vividhaiḥ santuṣṭā devī pārvatī ||

āmalakyāstu puṣpeṇa tuṣṭā patreṇa pārvatī |
aṣṭamyāṃ ca caturdaśyāṃ nānāpuṣpaiḥ samarcayet ||

śmaśāne rātriśeṣe vā śanibhaumadine niśi |
mālatīvidhirdevatāntare atra niṣedhāt | tathāhi haragaurīsambāde (-)

varjayen mālatīpuṣpaṃ varjayet tulasīdalam | iti |

triśaktiratne (-) vajrapuṣpeṇa saṃmiśrairarcayet siddhihetave |
abhāvād vajrapuṣpasya smaraṇāt siddhimāpnuyāt ||

tulasīmālatīvarjaṃ puṣpaṃ dadyāt prasannadhīḥ |

kālikāpurāṇe (-)

puṣpaṃ kokanadaṃ padmaṃ javā bandhūkameva ca |
sarveṣāṃ puṣpajātīnāṃ raktapuṣpaṃ viśiṣyate ||

<180> kriyāsāre (-) devīnāmarkamandārāvāditye tagaraṃ tathā |
gaṇeśasya ca sūryasya raktapuṣpamatipriyam ||

tathā (-) vakulairnārcayed devīmapakvaṃ na nivedayet |
phalaṃ jñātvā viśuddhaṃ ca bālapakvamapi tyajet ||

nākṣatairarcayed viṣṇuṃ na tulasyā vināyakam |
na dūrvayā'rcayeccaṇḍīṃ vilvapatrairvināyakam ||

unmattamarkapuṣpaṃ ca viṣṇau varjyaṃ sadā vudhaiḥ |
śive kundaṃ madantīṃ ca yūthīṃ bandhukaketake ||

gautamīye (-) na raktacandanaṃ jātu gṛhṇīyādraktapuṣpakam |
vilvapatraistatprasūnairnārcayed devakīsutam ||

śuṣkaiśca nārcayed viṣṇuṃ puṣpaiḥ patraiḥ phalairapi |
snātvānītaiḥ paryuṣitairyācitaiḥ kṛṣṇavarṇakaiḥ ||

svayaṃ vikāśitaiḥ puṣpaiḥ svayaṃ ca patitairbhuvi |
varjayed bṛhatīpuṣpaṃ nirgandhaṃ ca viśeṣataḥ |
tripatranyūnakusumairnārcayet tu kadācana ||

kusumaṃ pāṭaliñcaiva śirīṣaṃ parivarjayet |
bhūgataṃ varjayet puṣpaṃ śephālīṃ vakulaṃ vinā ||

vāsobhiḥ saṃvṛtairnītaṃ matimān nārpayecchive |
kālikābhistathā tyājyo vinā campakapadmake ||

javāṃ raktāṃ trisandhye dve mālatīṃ ketakīṃ tathā |
ghusṛṇaṃ kumudaṃ raktahayāriṃ ca hare tyajet ||

vilvasya khadirasyaiva tathā dhātrīphalasya ca |
tamālasya ca padmasya chinnabhinne na dūṣyataḥ ||

puṣpamālāyām (-) guñjāparājitonmattaṃ varāhakrāntayā saha |
āmrātakamidaṃ puṣpaṃ niṣiddhaṃ sūryapūjane ||

niṣiddhaṃ vihitaṃ sūrye tagaraṃ kaṇṭakārikā |
mandāramarkadhustūraṃ śālmalīkāñcanārjunam ||

niṣiddhaṃ viṣṇupūjāyāṃ puṣpaṃ vebhītakaṃ tathā |
niṣiddhaṃ vihitaṃ viṣṇoḥ śirīṣaṃ śuklapuṇḍrakam ||

narasiṃhasya pūjāyāṃ niṣiddhaṃ ketakīdvayam |
<181> śirīṣabandhūkavibhītakānāṃ madantikāketakipuṇḍrakāṇām |
karañjasarjendramahīruhāṇāṃ kundasya puṣpāṇi śive praśastam ||

antarjalakṣālitamānanasthaṃ svayaṃ viśīrṇaṃ bhuvi saṃvilīnam |
etāni puṣpāṇi samastadevapūjāvidhāvāhurakarmakāṇi ||

durgānyadevīpūjāyāṃ mandārārkaḥ suśasyate |

niṣiddhāni matsyasūkte (-)

mahālakṣmyāstu tulasīṃ jhiṇṭikāṃ kāñcanaṃ tathā |
puṣpādhyāye (-) kundena nārcayet sūryaṃ na tulasyā vināyakam |
kamalaiḥ kamalāṃ naiva na śaṅkhaṃ śaṅkhavāriṇā ||

yācitaṃ niṣphalaṃ puṣpaṃ krayakrītaṃ ca niṣphalam |
tulasyagastyavilvānāṃ nāsti paryuṣitātmatā ||

vakasyāpi na ṣaṇmāsād yāvat paryuṣitātmatā |
varjyaṃ paryuṣitaṃ puṣpaṃ varjyaṃ paryuṣitaṃ jalam ||

avarjyaṃ jāhnavītoyamavarjyaṃ tulasīdalam |
kālītantre (-) nānopahārabalibhirnānāpuṣpairmanoharaiḥ |
apāmārgadalairbhṛṅgaistulasīvarjitaiḥ śubhaiḥ ||

pūjanīyā sadā bhaktyā nṛṇāṃ śīghraphalāptaye |
tulasīvarjitairiti divyavīraparam | yat tu kaulāvalīye (-)

tulasīvarjitā pūjā na jātu phaladā bhavet |

tat tu paśubhāve | tatrāpi viśeṣaḥ (-)

bhairavī(-)sundarī(-)kālī(-)brahma(-)vighna(viṣṇu)vivasvatām |
tulasīvarjitā pūjā sā pūjā saphalā bhavet ||

yāmale'pi (-) tulasyā gandhamāghrāya kruddhā bhavati sundarī |
kriyāsāre (-) sarvaiḥ puṣpaiḥ sadā pūjā vihitāvihitairapi |
kartavyā sarvadevānāṃ bhaktiyogo'tra kāraṇam ||

devīpūjā sadā śastā jalajaiḥ sthalajairapi |
vihitairvā niṣiddhairvā bhaktiyuktena cetasā |
mālinītantre (-) pūjayet parameśāni puṣpābhāvāt tu patrakaiḥ |
patrāṇāmapyalābhe tu drumagulmodbhavādibhiḥ |
tadbhuvāmapyalābhe tu tatphalena prapūjayet |
<182> akṣatairvā jalairvāpi tadabhāve tu sarṣapaiḥ ||

sitaisteṣāmapyalābhe mānasaṃ pūjanaṃ caret |
rudrayāmale (-) svadravyaiḥ pūjayed vidyāṃ javāpāvakasindūraiḥ |
tathā (-) vedanaṃ raktasaṃjñaṃ tu śoṇitaṃ samudāhṛtam |
oḍrapuṣpaṃ maheśāni yonipuṣpaṃ nigadyate ||

vajrapuṣpatraividhyaṃ muṇḍamālāyām (-)

āṣoḍaśādanūḍhāyā uttamaṃ sarvasiddhidam |
balātkāreṇa ūḍhāyā madhyamaṃ bhogavardhanam ||

rajoyogavaśādanyadadhamaṃ sukhadāyakam |
svayambhūkusumaṃ devi trividhaṃ bhuvi jāyate ||

anūḍhāyā anupabhuktāyāḥ | ūḍhāyā upabhuktāyāḥ |

atha kalaśasthāpanam

bhāvacūḍāmaṇau (-) svavāmabhāge ṣaṭkoṇaṃ tanmadhye brahmarandhrakam ||

likhitvā tatra kumbhaṃ vai sauvarṇaṃ rājataṃ tathā |
tāmraṃ bhūmimayaṃ vāpi mahālauhavivarjitam |
sthāpayet kalaśādhāraṃ kumbhaṃ sugandhavāsitam ||

ādhāraśca kulārṇave uktaḥ (-)

ādhāraṃ trividhaṃ prāhuḥ ṣaṭpadaṃ vā catuṣpadam |
athavā vartulākāraṃ kuryād devi manoharam ||

tathā (-) ādhāreṇa vinā bhraṃśo na hi tuṣyanti devatāḥ |
tasmād vidhivadādhāraṃ kalpayet kulanāyike ||

tantre (-) pañcāśadaṅgulavyāsa utsedhaḥ ṣoḍaśāṅgulaḥ |
kalaśānāṃ pramāṇaṃ tu mukhamaṣṭāṅgulaṃ bhavet ||

tathā kalaśamupakramya (-)

veṣṭitaṃ raktavastreṇa raktamālyena bhūṣitam |
vāmabhāge maheśāni maṇḍale caturasrake ||

tatra saṃsthāpayed bhadre devīkuṇḍe varānane |
maṇḍale kalaśe dravye vahnyarkaśaśimaṇḍale ||

pūjayediti śeṣaḥ | caturasra iti yathoktamaṇḍalopalakṣakam |
tantre (-) yonidvayaṃ samālikhya tadantarbrahmarandhrakam |
<183> vṛttena veṣṭayitvā tu caturasreṇa veṣṭayet ||

arghyodakena saṃprokṣya tatra saṃsthāpya yantrikam |
kalābhirdaśabhirvyāptaṃ yajet tatrāgnimaṇḍalam ||

kṣālitaṃ hetimantreṇa raktamālyavibhūṣitam |
sthāpayet kalaśaṃ tatra sauvarṇādivibhedataḥ ||

kalādvādaśasaṃyuktaṃ bhānubimbaṃ yajediha |
śuddhena hetunā mantrī mūlamantreṇa pūrayet ||

kalāṣoḍaśasaṃvyāptamindubimbaṃ yajediha |
rakṣayedastramantreṇa tanmantreṇāvaguṇṭhayet ||

vīkṣayenmūlamantreṇa tenaivābhyukṣya sādhakaḥ |
gandhādinā samabhyarcya bhāvayed devatātmakam ||

tārabhāgaistribhirmantrī bimbatritayamarcayet |

tārabhāgairiti | akāra(-)ukāra(-)makārairityarthaḥ tadayaṃ kramaḥ (-) maṃ 
daśakalātmane vahnimaṇḍalāya namaḥ ityādhāre | aṃ dvādaśakalātmane 
sūryamaṇḍalāya namaḥ iti kalaśe | uṃ ṣoḍaśakalātmane candramaṇḍalāya 
namaḥ iti dravye pūjayet | arghyādau tathā darśanāt |

dravyaśuddhiḥ

atha dravyaṃ śodhayet | kalāmṛtadīpikāyām (-)

dṛṣṭvā praṇamya prathamaṃ tadrūpāṃ vāruṇīṃ kalām |
tāreṇa kusumaṃ dattvā prokṣayedastravāriṇā ||

nārācenā'kṣatān dattvā mūlāstreṇā'bhirakṣayet ||

mocayitvā śukraśāpāt pavamānena pāvayet |
śoṣayed vāyumantreṇa vahninā saṃdahedanu ||

ūrdhvaṃ saṃcintayen mantrī bhāskaraṃ cārkamaṇḍalam |
sauramantreṇa deveśi vāruṇīṃ manasā smaran ||

arkādamāmayīṃ dhārāṃ patantīṃ cintayedanu |
somabījaṃ paṭhan hāntaṃ sendukhaṇḍaṃ sudhāmayam ||

japan saṃpūrayet pātraṃ kḷptayā dhenumudrayā |
amṛtāṃ prajapenmantrī saptadhā kūrmamudrayā ||

amṛtaṃ ca tato nītvā karpūrādyena vāsayet |
<184> kiñcidutthāpyānyapātreṇa niḥkṣipya jvalanaṃ kṣipet ||

vidyātattvena deveśi darśayed yonimudrikām |
sarvabhūtamayīṃ devīṃ tatra sañcintayedanu |
tāmātmanaikyaṃ nītvā tu yojayet tāṃ mahātmanā ||

sarvabhūtamayaṃ paścādātmānaṃ paricintayet |

tadrūpāṃ devatāsvarūpām | sauramantro haṃsa iti | amāmayīm amṛtamayīm | 
somabījaṃ sa iti | hāntaṃ hakārāntam | ardhacandrayogo hakāraḥ evaṃ sohamiti 
siddham |
amṛtā kūrmamudrā ca vakṣyate | jvalanaṃ kṣipet | anyapātrasthāmṛte | 
vidyātattveneti vidyātattvena sūkṣmadehaṃ śodhayāmi svāheti mantreṇa | 
sarvabhūtamayīmiti pūrvavat kuṇḍalinīmutthāpya śivena saha 
saṃyojyātmānaṃ sarvabhūtamayaṃ dhyāyedityarthaḥ | 
śukraśāpamocanamantrā uktāḥ |

kumārītantre (-) anyacca śṛṇu deveśi yathā kulādikarmaṇi |
hānirna jāyate devi tān vai mantrān śṛṇu priye ||

ekameva paraṃ brahma sthūlasūkṣmamayaṃ dhruvam |
kacodbhavāṃ brahmahatyāṃ tena te nāśayāmyaham ||

sūryamaṇḍalasambhūte varuṇālayasambhave |
amābījamaye devi śukraśāpād vimucyatām ||

devānāṃ praṇavo bījaṃ brahmānandamayaṃ yadi |
tena satyena deviśi brahmahatyāṃ vyapohatu ||

evaṃ mantrajapenaiva abhimantrya kulaṃ śubham |
pradadyāccaṇḍikāyai vai naivedyamudare haret ||

śāpamocanaprakārāntaraṃ tārārṇave (-)

praṇavaṃ pūrvamuddhṛtya candrabījaṃ varānane |
ṣaḍdīrghasvarasaṃyuktaṃ bindunādakalānvitam ||

śukraśāpavimocikāyai surādevyai namastataḥ |
japed dvādaśadhā mantraṃ śukraśāpavimuktaye ||

vṛttau tu (-) vedādivaruṇāntaṃ ca ṣaḍdīrghasvarabheditam |
śukraśāpavimocitāyai sudhādevyai namo'stu te ||

dvādaśadhā japenmantraṃ śukraśāpavimuktaye |

ityuktam | tadanayoḥ śukraśāpavimocanaprakārayorvikalpaḥ | tulyārthayoḥ 

<185> samarthayoḥ samuccayāsambhavāt | tataḥ oṃ vāṃ vīṃ vūṃ vaiṃ vauṃ 
vaḥ brahmaśāpavimocitāyai sudhādevyai namaḥ ityanena vā daśavārajaptena 
brahmaśāpavimocanaṃ hrīṃ śrīṃ krāṃ krīṃ krūṃ kraiṃ krauṃ kraḥ sure 
kṛṣṇaśāpaṃ mocaya amṛtaṃ srāvaya srāvaya svāhā ityanena 
dvādaśavārajaptena kṛṣṇaśāpavimocanaṃ kuryāt | taduktam (-)

vedādirvāruṇaṃ bījaṃ ṣaḍdīrghasvarabheditam |
brahmaśāpavimocitāyai sudhādevyai namo'stu ca ||

daśakṛtvo japen mantraṃ brahmaśāpavimuktaye |
māyāśriyāvaṅkuśaṃ ca ṣaḍdīrghasvarabheditam ||

sure kṣṇasvarūpānte śāpaṃ mocaya tatparam |
amṛtaṃ srāvayadvandvaṃ vahnijāyā tataḥ param ||

anena manunā mantrī kṛṣṇaśāpaṃ vimocayet |
pavamānaḥ parānandaḥ pavamānaḥ paro rasaḥ ||

pavamānaṃ pavajñānaṃ tena te pāvayāmyaham |

iti pavamānamantraṃ ca lilitvā dravyamadhye bhairavabhairavyordhyānaṃ kuryāt | 
taduktaṃ

tārārṇave (-) sūryakoṭipratīkāśaṃ candrakoṭisuśītalam |
aṣṭādaśabhujaṃ devaṃ pañcavaktraṃ trilocanam ||

amṛtārṇavamadhyasthaṃ brahmapadmoparisthitam |
vṛṣārūḍhaṃ nīlakaṇṭaṃ sarvābharaṇabhūṣitam ||

kapālakhaṭvāṅgadharaṃ ghaṇṭāḍamaruvādinam |
pāśāṅkuśaṃdharaṃ devaṃ gadāmuṣaladhāriṇam ||

khaḍgakheṭakapaṭṭīśamudgaraṃ śūladaṇḍakam |
bibhrataṃ tomaraṃ muṇḍaṃ varadābhayapāṇinam ||

lohitaṃ devadeveśaṃ bhāvayet sādhakottamaḥ |

evaṃ dhyātvā svamantreṇa puṣpāñjalitrayeṇa pūjayet | tataḥ ānandabhairavīṃ 
dhyāyet |

tatraiva (-) bhāvayecca surāṃ devīṃ candrakoṭyayutaprabhām |
himakundendudhavalāṃ pañcavaktrāṃ trilocanām ||

aṣṭādaśabhujairyuktāṃ sarvānandakarodyatām |
prahasantīṃ viśālākṣīṃ devadevasya sammukhīm ||

athavā devadeveśamardhanārīśvaraṃ yajet |

evaṃ dhyātvā svamantreṇa pūjayet |

<186> mantrau coktau tantre (-) śivacandrau mātṛkāntaṃ tathā malavavahnayaḥ |
vāyuśca vāmakarṇena pūrito bindunādataḥ ||

bījametat samuccārya tathā cānandabhairavam |
ṅentaṃ śikhāmantrayutaṃ pūrvabījaṃ susaṃlikhet ||

candraṃ hitvādimaṃ kuryāt karṇe vāmākṣi yojayet |
surādevyai tato voṣaḍiyamānandabhairavī ||

anena manuyugmena dhyānapūrvaṃ yajecca tau |

śivo hakāraḥ | candraḥ sakāraḥ | mātṛkāntaṃ kṣakāraḥ | malavasvarūpam |
vahnī rephaḥ | vāyuryakāraḥ | vāmakarṇa ūkāraḥ | etau yuktau kāryau ṅantaṃ 
caturthyantam | śikhāmantro vaṣaḍiti | bhairavīmantramāha (-) pūrvabījamityādi | 
prathamavarṇayorvyatyayaḥ kāryaḥ | caramākṣare ūkāraṃ tyaktvā vāmākṣi 
īkāro yojyaḥ | so'yamānanda bhairavīmantro bhavatītyarthaḥ |

māyayā cādisaṃyuktaṃ vahnimāyendusaṃyutam |
paramasvāmini prānte paramākāśaśūnya ca ||

vāhini candrapadānte sūryāgnibhakṣiṇīti ca |
pātraṃ viśa viśa svāhā daśadhā prajapen manum ||

vāṅmāyākamalāprānte ānandeśvari vidmahe |
sudhādevyai dhīmahīti tanno'rdhanārīśvarīti ||

pracodayāditi japed gāyatrīṃ daśadhā sudhīḥ |

svatantre (-) tataśca bhāvayed dravyamamṛte raktabhaṃ(?)priye |
akathāditripaṅktyā tu halakṣatrayamaṇḍitam ||

pūrvoktayonimudrāyāṃ śivaśaktyostu saṃgagam |
amṛtaṃ cintayed dravyamaṣṭadhā cāmṛtāṃ japet ||

idaṃ tu kāraṇaṃ devi surasaṃghaniṣevitam |
ata evamasya nāma sudheti bhuvanatraye ||

asya gandhaḥ keśavastu tenāgandhena kaulikaḥ |
na pūjayet parāṃ devīṃ caṇḍikāṃ kālikāṃ śivām |

akathetyāditrikoṇe ṣoḍaśasvarān vāmapaṃktau 
kakārādiṣoḍaśavarṇānadhaḥpaṃktau thakārādiṣoḍaśavarṇān 
dakṣiṇapaṃktau halakṣān madhye likhitvā pūrvoktavidhinā 
kuṇḍalinīmutthāpya śive saṃyojya tadgalitāmṛtadhārāṃ vahannāsāpuṭena 
dravyamadhye 

<187> patitāṃ dhyātvā dravyamamṛtamayaṃ dhyāyedityarthaḥ | atṛtāmantraḥ 
kulārṇave uktaḥ (-)

vāgbhavaṃ pāvano bhūmiḥ puṣṭibindusamanvitā |
sthitiśca pāvanānugrahārdhendusamalaṅkṛtām ||

sthirā'rghīśendusaṃyuktā śveto binduyugānvitaḥ |
athāmṛte padaṃ brūyāt tatpaścādamṛtodbhave ||

athāmṛteśvari proktvā paścādamṛtavarṣiṇi |
amṛtaṃ śrāvayayugaṃ dviṭhānto dravyaśuddhikṛt ||

amṛtākhyo manuḥ proktaḥ pañcatriṃśadbhirakṣaraiḥ |

vāgbhavamaikāraḥ | pāvano pakāraḥ | bhūmirlakāraḥ | puṣṭirūkāraḥ | 
binduranusvāraḥ | tena aiṃ plūṃ iti siddham | sthitiḥ sakāraḥ | pāvano rephaḥ | 
anugraha aukāraḥ | ardhenduḥ ardhacandrānusvāraḥ | tena srauṃ iti siddham | 
sthirā jakāraḥ | arghīśaḥ ūkāraḥ | induranusvāraḥ | evaṃ jūmiti siddham | 
śvetaḥ sakāraḥ binduyugaṃ visargaḥ | evaṃ saḥ iti siddham | dviṭhaḥ svāhā | 
sugamamanyat | asya cāṣṭadhā japaḥ likhitavacanāt | kulāmṛte 
kuṇḍalinyutthānāt pūrvamayaṃ japa uktaḥ | tadatra yathā 
susampradāyamācaraṇīyam | tantre (-)

nīlaṃ hayaṃ samadhiruhya puraḥ prayāntī 
līlāṃśukābharaṇamālyavilepanāḍhyā | 
nidrāpaṭena bhuvanāni tirodadhānā khaḍgānvitā bhagavatī paripātu bhaktāna ||

evaṃ dhyātvā japed vidyādvayaṃ ca sādhakottamaḥ |
māyālakṣmīdvayasyānte namo bhagavatīti ca ||

maheśvari svarūpānte sarvapaśujaneti ca |
manaścakṣustiraskāraṇaṃ kurudvandvaṃ ca ṭhadvayam ||

tathānyatiraskāriṇīṃ lajjākāmeśvarīṃ tataḥ |
vāṇīṃ glauṃtiraskāriṇaṃ sakalajaneti ca ||

vāgvādinīti sakalapaśuvrātajaneti ca |
manaścakṣuśrotrajihvāghrāṇoktitiraskaraṇam ||

kurudvayaṃ ṭhatrayaṃ ca savisargaṃ śiro manuḥ |
tasyopari svamūlaṃ ca varuṇaṃ saptadhā japet ||

ityanena vidhānena dravyaśuddhiṃ samācaret |

bhāvacūḍāmaṇau (-) prakārāntareṇa śodhanamuktam | tathāhi (-)

ghaṭaṃ ca hetudravyeṇa pūrayedityanuvratau (?) |
<188> tatra yantraṃ vilikhyādau yad yat kulasamudbhavam |
dhyātveṣṭadevatāṃ tatra japedaṣṭottaraṃ śatam |
dhenuyonī vicintyā'ṭha prasṛtaṃ tad vicintayet ||

dṛṣṭvā'mṛtamupāttaṃ vai nṛtyanti yoginīgaṇāḥ |
nṛtyanti bhairavāḥ sarve nṛtyanti bhairavīgaṇāḥ ||

yad yat kulasamudbhavamiti yad devatāyā yādṛśaṃ yantramityarthaḥ | dhenuyonī 
mudre ca (-)

anyonyābhimukhāśliṣṭā kaniṣṭhā'nāmikā punaḥ |
tathā ca tarjanī madhyā dhenumudrā'mṛtapradā ||

madhyame kuṭile kārye tarjanyupari saṃsthite |
anāmike madhyagate tathaiva hi kaniṣṭhike ||

sarvā ekatra saṃyojyā aṅguṣṭhaparipīḍitāḥ |
yonimudrā samākhyātā trailokyotpattimātṛkā | iti tantrokteḥ

atha pātrasthāpanam

samayācāre (-) sāmānyārghyaṃ tataḥ kṛtvā payasā sādhakottamaḥ |
tajjalairmaṇḍalaṃ kṛtvā pātrāṇi sthāpayet tataḥ |

sāmānyārghyaṃ pūjopakaraṇāsādanāt prāgeva sthāpayanti | tadvidhiśca 
tatraiva likhitaḥ | 

tantre (-) sādhyasādhakayormadhye ṣaṭtriṃśadaṅgulaṃ bhavet |
dvādaśāṅgulamūrdhvaṃ ca adhobhāge tathāṅgulam ||

dvādaśāṅgulamadhyasthaṃ tatra saṃsthāpayed budhaḥ |

tathāṅgulaṃ dvādaśāṅgulam | tathā (-)

dvātha ca dvādaśaṃ tyaktvā devārthaṃ dvādaśaṃ tyajet |
dvādaśāṅgulamadhyasthaṃ tatra cārghyaṃ nidhāpayet ||

kumārīkalpe (-) tato'rghyaṃ sthāpayen mantrī svavāme surasundari |
triśaktiratne (-) kalaśād dakṣiṇe bhāge trikoṇaṃ vṛttasaṃyutam |
ṣaṭkoṇaṃ caturasraṃ ca kṛtvā tanmadhyabhāgataḥ |
vilasaccandraśakalaṃ gandharvaṃ ca samālikhet ||

ojāpūkādikaṃ pīṭhaṃ taccaturdikṣu pūjayet |
aṅgamantraiśca ṣaṭkoṇe śaktau mūlatribhedataḥ |
ādhāraśaktiṃ sampūjya pūrvavad yāntrikāmapi ||

mahāśaṅkhaṃ nālikeraṃ sauvarṇaṃ rājataṃ tathā |
<189> tāmraṃ śuktyudbhavaṃ vāpi pātra tatra nidhāpayet ||

vilasaditi | gandharvamīkāraḥ | ojāpūkādi oḍyāna(-)jālandhara(-) pūrṇagiri(-)
kāmarūpāṇi teṣāṃ ca pūjanaṃ svāgrādi prādakṣiṇyena caturasrarekhāsu 
sampradāyāt | aṅgapūjane tanmantreṣu sarvānte namaskāra eva yojyaḥ na tu 
jātyantaram | aṅgamantrairnamo'ntakairityāderāvaraṇapūjāyāṃ tathā 
darśanāt | śaktau trikoṇe | mūlatribhedataḥ mūlakhaṇḍayeṇa pūjanam | 
ādhāraśaktirīkāraḥ | yantrikā ākāraḥ | tatpūjanaṃ ca 
daśakalātmakavahnipūjanameva | pātrabhedaḥ kulārṇave'pyuktaḥ (-)

svarṇarūpyaśilākūrma kapālālāvumṛṇmayam |
nārikelaṃ śaṅkhamuktātāmraśuktisamudbhavam ||

puṇyavṛkṣasamudbhūtaṃ pātraṃ saṃlolitaṃ śubham |

saṃlolitaṃ varttulīkṛtam | mahāhāravatantre (-)

viśvāmitrakapālaṃ tu sarvapātrottamottamam |
tathā (-) brahmahatyādipāpāni viśvāsaghātanaṃ tathā |
dṛṣṭvā pātraṃ nārikelaṃ sarvameva praṇaśyati ||

kanyākoṭipradānāni tathā homaśatāni ca |
yo dadāti maheśāni rāhugraste divākare ||

tatphalaṃ koṭiguṇitaṃ nārikelārghyapātrataḥ |
alābhe tasya pātrasya anyapātreṇa pūjayet ||

tathā (-) narapātraṃ mahābhāge vijñeyaṃ cottamottamam |
nārikelābhidhaṃ devi jñeyaṃ cottamamadhyamam ||

ratnapātraṃ ca suśroṇi jñeyaṃ cottamakalpakam |

triśaktiratne (-) pātramityunuvratau (?) (-)

samarcya pūrvavan mantrī śaṅkhaṃ dravyeṇa pūrayet |
japan vilomato varṇān mūlamantrasamujjvalān ||

sampūjya pūrvavat tatra vṛttaṃ ṣaṭkoṇamālikhet |
akathāditrirekhāntaṃ trikoṇaṃ vṛttamadhyataḥ ||

mūlakhaṇḍatrayeṇā'tha trikoṇaṃ paripūjayet |
ṣaṭkoṇe ca ṣaḍaṅgāni tatastīrthamayaṃ smaret ||

ānandabhairavaṃ dhyātvā samabhyarcya vidhānataḥ |
pūjayet pañcaratnāni kuladravyāṇi niḥkṣipet ||

<190> racayet pūrvavaccheṣabhayamarghyavidhiḥ smṛtaḥ |

ānandabhairavamityupalakṣaṇam ānandabhairavyapi pūjyā yugaladvayāvāhitvāt 
| pañcaratnapūjanaṃ cārghyasthadravye | glūṃ gaganaratnāya namaḥ slūṃ 
svargaratnāya namaḥ pluṃ pātālaratnāya namaḥ mlūṃ martyaratnāya namaḥ 
nlūṃ nāgararatnāya namaḥ iti svāgrādi caturdikṣu madhye kuryāt | 
kuladravyāṇi kuṇḍodbhavādīni | kumārīkalpe (-)

arghyadravyaṃ cārghyapātre niḥkṣipya yatnataḥ sudhīḥ |
kuṇḍagolodbhavaṃ dravyaṃ svayambhūkusumaṃ tathā ||

nādharmo vidyate subhru mahāmantrasya sādhane |
sārasaṃgrahe (-) trikoṇaṃ vṛttasaṃvītaṃ caturasreṇa veṣṭitam |
gandhalipteṣu vāmāgre vidadhyān matsyamudrayā ||

saṃpūjya gandhairdevārghyaṃ devāyānte namo'ṇunā |
aṅgāni caturasrasya koṇeṣu puratastathā ||

dikṣu cāstraṃ samabhyarcya śaṅkhādhāraṃ pravinyaset |
mūlena kṣālitaṃ śaṅkhādhāraṃ saṃsthāpayāmi ca ||

kālaṃ sabindukaṃ tadvad bhujaṅgeśaṃ samuddharet |
vahnyante maṇḍalāyeti tathā'dharmapradeti ca ||

daśakalātmane coktvā namo gandhādibhiryajet |

trikoṇamityādi cakranirmāṇaprakārāntaram | tatraiva caturasrakoṇādiṣu 
ṣaḍaṅgārcanam | tadatra pakṣadvaye yathāsvagurūpadeśamācaraṇam | 
matsyamudrā ca tantre uktā (-)

dakṣapāṇipṛṣṭhadeśe vāmapāṇitalaṃ kṣipet |
aṅguṣṭhau cālayen matsyamudreyaṃ matsyarūpiṇī ||

kālaṃ makāram | binduranusvāraḥ | bhujaṅgeśo rephaḥ | tadvad binduyutam |
atra pratyekaṃ vahnikalā api pūjyā anyatra tathā darśanāt | tathā (-)

astreṇa kṣālitaṃ śaṅkhaṃ tatra saṃsthāpya pūjayet |
arghamānaṃ tu prādeśaṃ caturaṅgulamucchritam ||

arghapātramiti proktaṃ sthāpayāmīti mantrataḥ |
amarkamaṇḍalāyeti vaded dvādaśa ityatha ||

kalātmane padaṃ coktvā arghyapātrāya hṛnmanuḥ |
anena śaṅkhamabhyarcya kalāḥ sūryasya pūjayet ||

tantrāntare (-) krodhabījāstrabījābhyāmādhāre kṣālitaṃ śubham |
<191> mahāśaṅkhaṃ tathā mantrī sthāpayet strīṃ paṭhan tataḥ ||

śivāṃ dīrghatrayopetāṃ kālībrahmāramānvitām |
dīrghaḥ śacīpatirvāyurhṛdayaṃ manmathāntimam ||

dīrghatrayasamopetaṃ tāriṇī pūrvavat punaḥ |
śivaṃ dīrghatrayopetaṃ līlāśabdāt tu pūrvavat ||

māyāśarāntimaṃ śambhuṃ vāmakarṇendusaṃyutam |
sarvakāmaḥ kālarātriḥ dīrghā lāyapadāt tataḥ ||

sarvādhārāya sarvāya sarvodbhavāya sarvataḥ |
sarvaśuddhimayāyā'tha sarvāsurapadāt tataḥ ||

rudhirāruṇakāntikṣut śubhrāya surabhājana |
āya devī kapālāya hṛdayānto manurmataḥ ||

ebhiścaturbhimanubhirmahāśaṅkhaṃ prapūjayet |

krodhabījāstrabījābhyāṃ hūṃ phaḍiti bījābhyām | strīmiti svarūpam | 
śivāṃ hrīṃkāram | dīrghatrayam ā(-)ī(-)ū rūpam | kālīti svarūpam | brahmā 
kakāraḥ | ramā pakāraḥ | āyutā ākārayuktā | dīrgha ākārayuktaḥ | 
śacīpatirlakāraḥ | vāyuryakāraḥ | hṛdayaṃ namaḥ tena hrāṃ hrīṃ hrūṃ 
kālīkapālāya namaḥ iti prathamo mantraḥ | manmathāntimaṃ strīṃkāram | 
dīrghatrayaṃ ā(-)ī(-)ū rūpam | tāriṇīti svarūpam | punaḥ pūrvavat kapālāya 
namaḥ iti | tena strāṃ strīṃ strūṃ tāriṇīkapālāya namaḥ iti dvitīyo mantraḥ | 
śivaṃ hakāraḥ | dīrghatrayopetaṃ ā(-)ī(-)ū(-)yutam | līlāśabdāt 
līletyakṣaradvayānantaraṃ pūrvavat kapālāya namaḥ iti | tena hāṃ hīṃ hūṃ 
līlākapālāya namaḥ iti tṛtīyo mantraḥ | māyā hrīṃkāram | śarāntimaṃ sa iti 
bījam | śambhuṃ hakāram | vāmakarṇendusaṃyutam ūkārānusvārayutam | 
sarveti svarūpam | kāmaṃ kakāraḥ | kālarātriḥ pakāraḥ | dīrghā ākārayuktā | 
lāyeti svarūpam | kāntirākāraḥ | kṣut yakāraḥ | tena hrīṃ saḥ hūṃ 
sarvakapālāya sarvādhārāya sarvāya sarvodbhavāya sarvaśuddhimayāya 
sarvāsurarudhirāruṇāya śubhrāya surabhājanāya devīkapālāya namaḥ iti 
caturthī mantraḥ |

tatra sampūjayen mantrī maṇḍalaṃ tigmarociṣaḥ |
mūlena pūrayen mantrī sudhābuddhyā vidhānavit ||

gandhapuṣpākṣatān kṣiptvā trikhaṇḍāṃ darśayet punaḥ |
pīyūṣarociṣo mantrī maṇḍalaṃ tatra pūjayet ||

<192> tāraṃ śaktirameśaktimanusvāravibhūṣitām |
mūlaṃ tṛtīyaṃ bhairavyāḥ krodhabījasamujjvalam ||

anena manunā mantrī bhāvayedaṣṭaśo jalam |

śaktirekāraḥ |

śaktyā sudhāṃ vinikṣipya śaṅkhayonī pradarśayet |
vṛttāṣṭadalaṣaṭkoṇe mūlagarbhe manohare ||

vakṣyamāṇaprakāreṇa saṃvicintya kuleśvarīm |
upacāraiḥ prapūjyaināṃ mūlamantreṇa mantravit ||

aṅguṣṭhānāmikāyogāt tarpayet tena tāriṇīm |
tarjanyaṅguṣṭhayogena madhyamāṅguṣṭhayogataḥ |
anāmāṅguṣṭhayogena kaniṣṭhāṅguṣṭhayogataḥ ||

tarpayed vedavāraṃ tāṃ mūlamantreṇa devatām |

tathānyatrāpi (-)

tataḥ sudhāmayaistoyai mūlāntāṃ mātṛkāṃ paṭhan |
vilomāṃ pūrayet tasmin pūjako manunā'munā ||

arghapātraṃ pūrayāmītyuktvā saṃpūrayet tataḥ |
karṇacandrau binduyutau kāmapradapadāttataḥ ||

ṣoḍaśānte kalāśabdamātmane nama ityatha |
gandhapuṣpaiḥ samabhyarcya kalāṣoḍaśakaṃ yajet ||

karṇa ukāraḥ | candro'rdhacandraḥ | binduranusvāraḥ | tena u(/) | kalāstūktāḥ (-)

kulārṇave (-) dhūmrārciruṣmā jvalinī jvālinī visphuliṅginī |
suśrīḥ svarūpā kapilā havyakavyavahe api ||

āgneyā yādivarṇotthā daśa dharmapradāḥ kalāḥ |
tapinī tāpinī dhūmrā marīcirjvālinī ruciḥ ||

suṣumṇā bhogadā viśvā bodhinī dhāriṇī kṣamā |
kamādyā vasudāḥ saurāḥ ṭhaḍāntā dvādaśeritāḥ ||

amṛtā mānadā pūṣā tuṣṭi puṣṭī ratirdhṛtiḥ |
śaśinī candrakāntiśca jyotsnā śrīḥ prītiraṅgadā ||

pūrṇā pūrṇāmṛtā ceti kathitāḥ kulanāyike |
saumyāḥ kāmapradāyinyaḥ ṣoḍaśasvarajāḥ kalāḥ ||

<193> yādivarṇottheti | binduyutān yādidaśavarṇān pūrvaṃ dattvā agnikalāḥ | 
kādiṭhāntān bhādiḍāntān pratilomavarṇāṃśca binduyuktānādau dattvā 
sūryakalāḥ | akārādiṣoḍaśasvarān binduyutān ādau dattvā candrakalāśca 
pūjyā ityarthaḥ |
tathā (merutantre) (-) prāgvat tīrthaṃ samāvāhya tīrthamantreṇa tatra ca |
saṃyojya netramantreṇa puṣpaṃ nyasya śikhāṇunā ||

pradarśya gālinīmudrāṃ mudrayā dhenusaṃjñayā |
amṛtīkṛtya vidhivat sudhābījena sādhakaḥ ||

dhyātveṣṭadevatāṃ tatra sakalīkṛtya sādhakaḥ |
aṅganyāsena cāstreṇa kalayecca diśo daśa ||

netramantreṇa saṃvīkṣya mudrayā śaṅkhasaṃjñayā |
avaṣṭabhya tato dīpya mudrayā dhenusaṃjñayā ||

gandhapuṣpādibhistatra pūjayediṣṭadevatām |
ṣaḍaṅgāni ca sampūjya mantrayen mūlamantrataḥ ||

aṣṭakṛtvastataścārghaṃ dāpayen matsyamudrayā |
ābhicārikakāryeṣu vilomena japediti ||

iti karmopadeśinyāṃ mūlamantrajape viśeṣa uktaḥ | tathā (-)

tacchaṅkhasthaṃ jalaṃ kiñcit kumbhatoye viniḥkṣipet |

prāgvadaṅkuśamudrayā | tīrthamantreṇa gaṅge cetyādimantreṇa | saṃyojya 
tīrthāni | gālinīmudrā mantratantraprakāśe uktā (-)

kaniṣṭhāṅguṣṭhakau yuktau karayoritaretaram |
tarjanīmadhyamānāmāḥ saṃhatā bhugnavarjitāḥ ||

mudraiṣā gālinī proktā śaṅkhasyopari cālitā |

sudhābījaṃ vamiti | sakalīkṛtyā'ṅganyāsenetyanvayaḥ | kalayet tālatrayaṃ 
dattvā choṭikābhirbandhayedityarthaḥ | śaṅkhamudrā tantre uktā (-)

vāmamuṣṭyantare'ṅguṣṭhaṃ niveśya saralāṅgulīḥ |
dakṣiṇasya karasyaiva vāmāṅguṣṭhena saṃspṛśet ||

śaṅkhamudreyamākhyātā mantravidbhiranuttamā |

triśaktiratne (-) kalaśoktavidhānena sthāpayet pātrasantatim |
sthāpanakramaścoktastantre (-)

śrīpātraghaṭayormadhye sarvapātrāṇi sthāpayet |

<194> gurupātraṃ ghaṭasyānte tadante bhāgapātakam ||

tadante śaktipātraṃ ca yoginīnāṃ tadantike |
tadante vīrapātraṃ ca balipātraṃ tadantike ||

pādyaṃ cācamanīyaṃ ca pātrāṇi sthāpayet kramāt |
uttamaṃ nava pātrāṇi sapta pātrāṇi madhyamam |
adhamaṃ trīṇi pātrāṇi ekapātraṃ na kārayet ||

merutantre (-) ekaikapātraṃ mūleṇa hyaṣṭakṛtvo'bhimantrayet |
pradarśayed dhenumudrāṃ						||

antaśabdaḥ sannidhivācakaḥ | pādyaṃ cācamanīyaṃ cetyupalakṣaṇam | argha 
snānīyamadhuparka punarācamanīyapātrāṇyatraiva sthāpanīyāni tāvadaśaktau 
triśaktiratne (-)

athavā kalaśaṃ śaṅkhaṃ śaktipātratrayaṃ bhavet |

atrādikalpe pādyādipātrāṇi sthāpanīyāni pūjopayuktatvāt | navaratneśvare (-)

pātradvayamabhāvādvā kuryān nyūnaṃ na cācaret |
ekapātraṃ na karttavyaṃ yadi sākṣān maheśvaraḥ ||

mantrāḥ parāṅmukhā yānti āpadaśca pade pade |
iha loke ca dāridryaṃ mṛte ca paśutāṃ vrajet ||

jalenaiva ca pādyādipātrāṇi pūrayediti ||

sāmpradāyikāḥ | ayaṃ kramo vīrakalpe | paśukalpe tu (-)

svadakṣe prokṣaṇīpātramādhāyā'dbhiḥ prapūrayet |
kiñcidarghyāmbu saṃgṛhya prokṣaṇyambhasi yojayet ||

tataḥ sādhārakaṃ pātraṃ purataḥ sthāpayed budhaḥ |
tatpārśve pādyadānaṃ ca tātpārśve'rghapradānakam ||

ācamanīyaṃ tatpārśve tadvāme madhuṣarkakam |
punarācamanīyaṃ ca snānīyaṃ tatkramān nyaset ||

iti kramaḥ | pādyādidravyāṇyuktāni phetkāriṇyām (-)

uśīraṃ rocanaṃ caiva pādyapātre tu kalpayet |
kuśāgrānakṣataṃ caiva tilavrīhiyavānapi ||

ājyasiddhārthapuṣpāṇi kṣipedarghyasya pātrake |
jātīkarpūrakakkola bahumūlatamālakām ||

cūrṇayitvā yathānyāyaṃ kṣipedācamanīyake |
<195> mākṣikaṃ śarkarā sarpirdadhikṣīrayutaṃ tathā ||

madhuparkaṃ kalpayitvā pradadyād dadhipūrvakam |

snānīyaṃ śuddhasugandhijalena | gandhādbhiḥ kārayet snānamiti 
puraścaraṇacandrikāvacanāt | punarācamanīyamācamanīyavadeva | triśaktiratne 
(-)

puṣpādinā samuddhṛtya binduṃ śaṅkhāmṛtasya ca |
nikṣipet sarvapātreṣu sarvaṃ divyaṃ vicintayet ||

atha tarpaṇam

tantre (-) evaṃ pātrāṇi saṃsthāpya tenaiva tarpaṇaṃ caret |

atra gurutarpaṇādapi prāgbhairavabhairavyorvāmahastena tattvamudrayā tarpayanti | 
tatprakārastattvārṇave uktaḥ pūrvoktadhyānamuktvā (-)

dhyātvaivaṃ tarpayen mūrdhni tāvubhau sādhakaḥ sudhīḥ |

tāvubhau bhairavyau | tābhyāṃ pūrvoktamantrābhyāmante svanāma saṃyojya 
tau tarpayediti paryavasitam |

triśaktiratne (-) brahmarandhre svake mantrī mudrayā tattvasaṃjñayā |
tarpayed gurupātrīya(-)dravyeṇaughatrayaṃ sudhīḥ ||

svagurūnapi santarpya triḥ sakṛd vā viśeṣataḥ |
ātmano hṛdayāmbhoje parivāragaṇāvṛtām ||

devīpātrāmṛtenāpi tarpayet kulanāyikām |

tattvamudrā tarpaṇe'nāmāṅguṣṭhayogena bhavati | tathāhi jñānārṇave (-)

tarpaṇāni punardadyāt trivāraṃ tattvamudrayā |

aṅguṣṭhānāmikābhyāṃ tu tattvamudreyamīritā || iti |
yā tu (-) tarjanyaṅguṣṭhayogena tattvamudrā prakīrtitā || iti |

tatroktā(,) sā tarpaṇādanyatra dhyānādau | oghatrayaṃ ca tārāyā 
bhāvacūḍāmaṇāvuktam (-)

atha tārāgurūn vakṣye dṛṣṭādṛṣṭaphalapradān |
ūrdhvakeśo vyomakeśo nīlakaṇṭho vṛṣadhvajaḥ ||

divyoghāḥ siddhidā vatsa siddhaughān śṛṇu tattvataḥ |
vaśiṣṭhaḥ kūrmanāthaśca mīnanātho maheśvaraḥ ||

harinātho mānavaughānatha vakṣyāmi sadgurūn |
tārāvatī bhānumatī jayā vidyā mahoda(heśva)rī ||

sukhānandaḥ parānandaḥ pārijātaḥ kuleśvaraḥ |
<196> virūpākṣaḥ keravī ca kathitaṃ tāriṇīkulam ||

ānandanāthaśabdāntā guravaḥ sarvasiddhidāḥ |
striyo'pi gururūpāśca devyantāḥ parikīrtitāḥ ||

svagurūn paramagurūn parāparagurūn parameṣṭhigurun |
kulacūḍāmaṇau (-) ajñāne gurunāmnāṃ vai gurutritayamarcayet |
catuṣṭhayaṃ vā saṃkoco na kartavyastataḥ param ||

bhāvanirṇaye (-) ādau sarvatra deveśi mantradaḥ paramo guruḥ |
parāparagurustvaṃ hi parameṣṭhirahaṃ (*) yataḥ ||

parāparastvadrūpatvena parameṣṭhī gururmadrūpatvena dhyātvā tarpaṇīya iti 
bhāvaḥ |
catuṣṭayamāha (-) guruḥ paramaguruścaiva parāparagurustathā |

parameṣṭhī guruścaiva kathitā guravastava ||

gurūṇāṃ laukikaṃ nāma śrīpūrvakamuccārya śeṣe guru(-)
paramagurvādipadaṃ yojayitvā amukapādukāṃ tarpayāmītyevaṃ tarpayediti 
sāmpradāyikāḥ | devīpātraṃ viśeṣārghapātrameva | taddravyeṇa sāṅgāṃ 
saparivārāṃ sāyudhāṃ savāhanāṃ śrī(-)amukadevīṃ tarpayāmītyevaṃ 
tarpayedityarthaḥ | āvāhanāt prāg bhogapātrāmṛtena vā tarpayanti |

samayācāre (-) śuddhaṃ dravyaṃ samādāya tarpaṇaṃ tattvamudrayā |
aṅguṣṭhatarjanīmadhye śuddhiṃ saṃgṛhya vāmataḥ ||

vāmena dakṣiṇenā'pi devīṃ santarpayet sudhīḥ |

vāmena dakṣiṇenā'pītyabhidhānād devītarpaṇe karayoraicchiko vikalpa iti kecit | 
anye tu vāmena śuddhiṃ saṃgṛhya dakṣiṇahastatattvamudrayā devīṃ tarpayet | 
aṅguṣṭhatarjanīmadhya iti | śuddhigrahaṇamātrā tviyam | tarpaṇe 
tattvamudrāyāḥ prakārāntareṇoktatvādityāhuḥ |

atha tattvaśuddhiḥ

atha tattvaśuddhiṃ kuryāt | tatra śrutiḥ (-) oṃ prāṇāpānavyānodānasamānā me 
śuddhyantāṃ jyotirahaṃ virajā vipāpmā bhūyāsaṃ svāhā | oṃ 
pṛthivyaptejovāyvākāśāni me śuddhyantāṃ jyotirityādi | oṃ prakṛtya(-)
haṅkāra(-)buddhi(-)manaḥ(-)śrotrāṇi me śudhyantāmityādi | oṃ tvak cakṣurjihvā(-)
ghrāṇa(-)vacāṃsi me śudhyantāmityādi | oṃ pāṇi(-)pāda(-)pāyūpastha(-)śabdā me 
śudhyantāmityādi | oṃ sparśarūparasagandhākāśāni me

(____________________)
(tāntrikaprayogo'yaṃ | bahuṣu grantheṣu tathaiva darśanāt |)

<197> śudhyantāmityādi | oṃ vāyutejaḥsalilabhūmyātmāno me 
śudhyantāmityādi saptamantrān parāmṛśan hastābhyāṃ saptadhā sarvāṅge 
spṛśediti tattvaśuddhiḥ |

atha balidānam

atha vaṭukādibaliṃ dadyāt | tathāhi kulārṇave (-)

yāvanno vaṭuke dadyāt tāvannaiva kuleśvari |
tṛpyanti devatāḥ sarvāḥ smaraṇād yajanādapi ||

vaṭukādīn yajet tasmād gandhapuṣpāsavāmiṣaiḥ |
tattanmantravidhānena devatāprītimāpnuyāt ||

yatkiñciddravyasaṃghātaṃ pūjārthaṃ bhogahetunā |
ānītaṃ dīyatāṃ bhaktyā kṣetreśe(trape)bhyaḥ kuleśvari ||

vaṭuka ityupalakṣaṇam | vaṭukādiṣvityarthaḥ | jñānārṇave (-)

īśānavahninair(-)ṛtya(-)vāyukoṇeṣu pūrvavat |
maṇḍalāni vidhāyā'tha pūrvavat pūjayet priye ||

pūrvavad balidānaṃ ca dadyāt sarvasamṛddhaye |
vaṭukāya maheśāni yoginībhyaśca vallabhe ||

gaṇeśa(-)kṣetrapālābhyāṃ pūrvavad balimutsṛjet |

samayācāre tu (-)

dakṣiṇe vaṭuke dadyāduttare yoginībalim |
pūrve bhūtabaliṃ dadyāt kṣetrapālāya paścime ||

tathā (-) aṅguṣṭhānāmikābhyāntu vaṭukāya balirmataḥ |
kaniṣṭhāṅguṣṭhayogena yoginībalimāharet ||

aṅguṣṭhatarjanībhyāṃ tu kṣetrapālabaliṃ haret |
aṅgulībhiśca sarvābhirukto bhūtabaliḥ priye ||

jñānārṇave (-) tathā muṣṭestu madhyasthāmaṅgulīṃ daṇḍavat kuru |
gajadantamahāmudrā gaṇapasya balau bhavet ||

mantrāstu jñānārṇava eva (-)

ehyehi devīputrānte vaṭukānte ca nātha ca |
kapilānte jaṭābhāra(-)bhāsvarānte trinetra ca ||

jvālāmukhaṃ ca sarvānte vighnān nāśaya nāśaya |
<198> sarvopacārasahitaṃ baliṃ gṛhṇa dvidhā padam ||

vahnijāyānvito mantro vaṭukasya samīritaḥ |
anena manunā devi vaṭukasya baliṃ haret ||

ūrdhvaṃ brahmāṇḍato vā divi gaganatale bhūtale niṣkale vā
pātāle vā'nale vā salilapavanayoryatra tatra sthitā vā |
kṣetre pīṭhopapīṭhādiṣu ca kṛtapadā puṣpadhūpādikena
prītā devyaḥ sadā naḥ śubhabalividhinā pāntu devendratulyāḥ ||

etadante maheśāni yāṃ bījaṃ yoginī tataḥ |
bhyaḥ svāhā sarvavarṇānte yoginīpadamālikhet ||

kavacaṃ cāstramālikhya vahnijāyāṃ punarlikhet |
anena manunā devi yoginībalimāharet ||

tathā (-) ṣaḍdīrghasvarasaṃbhinnaṃ kṣakāraṃ punarālikhet |

kṣakāre bindurācārāt |

punaḥ kṣetrapadaṃ pāladhūpadīpādi cālikhet |
sahitaṃ balimālikhya gṛhṇa gṛhṇa tato vadet ||

vahnijāyānvito mantraḥ kṣetrapālasya sundari ||

anena manunā devi kṣetrapālabaliṃ haret |
gāṃ gīṃ gūṃ trayamālikhya ṅentaṃ gaṇapatiṃ vadet ||

varānte varadānte ca sarvānte janamālikhet |
me vaśaṃ cānayetyuktvā baliṃ gṛhṇa dvidhā padam ||

vahnijāyānvito mantro gaṇapasya baliṃ haret |
jñānārṇave (-) vāmabhāge kṛtasyātha maṇḍalasyopari kṣipet |
ādhāraṃ pūjayet tatra pātraṃ cānnodakānvitam ||

sakāraṇaṃ mantrayitvā sarvabhūtabaliṃ haret |
ṣoḍaśārṇena manunā trivāraṃ vīravandite ||

tāraṃ ca bhuvaneśāni sarvavighnapadaṃ tataḥ |
kṛdbhyaśca sarvabhūtebhyo hūṃkāraṃ vahnivallabhām ||

samuccaran baliṃ dadyān mudrayā tattvasaṃjñayā |

idaṃ ca sampradāyānurodhenoktam | vastutaḥ puraścaraṇaprakaraṇe 
vakṣyamāṇavīracūḍāmaṇyuktamantraireva vaṭukādibalidānaṃ yuktam | 
tasyaivātrāsādhāraṇatvāt |

<199> athāvāhanam

taduktaṃ kumārīkalpe (-) tato hṛdayapadmāntaḥ sphurantīṃ vidyudākṛtim |
suṣumṇā vartmanā nītvā śiraḥsthāne maheśvari ||

vāmayā nāsayā devi vāyubījena mantravit |
deveśītyādimantreṇa cakrādāvāhayet sudhīḥ ||

dhyātvā kāmakalāmādau dhyāyed devīmataḥ param |

deveśīti mantrastu (-) deveśi bhaktisulabhe parivāra samanvite |
yāvat tvāṃ pūjayiṣyāmi tāvattvaṃ susthirā bhava ||

iti | cakrāt śirasthapadmāt | svatantratantre (-)

tataḥ kāmakalādhyānādāvāhya kālikāṃ tataḥ |
kūrmākhyamudrayā puṣpaṃ cakramadhye nidhāpayet ||

kūrmamudrā tantre uktā (-)

vāmahastasya tarjanyāṃ dakṣasya ca kaniṣṭhikā |
tathā dakṣiṇatarjanyāṃ vāmāṅguṣṭhaṃ niyojayet ||

unnataṃ dakṣiṇāṅguṣṭhaṃ vāmasya madhyamādikāḥ |
aṅgulīryojayet pṛṣṭhe dakṣiṇasya karasya ca ||

vāmasya pitṛtīrthena madhyamānāmikā tathā |
adhomukhe tataḥ kuryād dakṣiṇasya ca hastataḥ ||

kūrmapṛṣṭhasamaṃ kuryād dakṣiṇasya ca maṇḍalam |
evaṃvidhaḥ sarvasiddhiṃ dadāti karakacchapaḥ ||

kāmakalādhyānaṃ tantracūḍāmaṇau (-)

mukhaṃ binduvadākāraṃ tadadhaḥ kucayugmakam |
tadadhaḥ saparārdhaṃ ca sapariṣkṛtamaṇḍalam ||

etat kāmakalādhyānaṃ sugopyaṃ sādhakottamaiḥ |

etadrahasyaṃ svagurumukhādavagantavyam |

atha dhyānam

gandharvatantre (-) śmaśānaṃ tatra saṃcintya tatra kalpadrumaṃ smaret |
tanmūle maṇipīṭhaṃ ca nānāmaṇivibhūṣitam ||

śivābhirbahumāṃsāsthi modamānābhirantataḥ |
<200> caturdikṣu śavā muṇḍāścitāṅgārāsthibhūṣitāḥ ||

tanmadhye bhāvayed devīṃ yathokta dhyānayogataḥ |
nīlatantre (-) pratyālīḍhapadāṃ ghorāṃ muṇḍamālāvibhūṣitām |
kharvāṃ lambodarīṃ bhīmāṃ vyāghracarmāvṛtāṃ kaṭau ||

navayauvanasampannāṃ pañcamudrāvibhūṣitām |
caturbhujāṃ lalajjihvāṃ mahābhīmāṃ varapradām ||

khaḍgakarttrīdharāṃ savye vāme muṇḍotpalānvitām |
piṅgograikajaṭāṃ dhyāyen maulāvakṣobhyabhūṣitām ||

bālārkamaṇḍalākāra(-)locanatrayabhūṣitām |
prajvalatpitṛbhūmadhyagatāṃ draṃṣṭrākarālinīm |
sāveśasmareravadanā(-)masthyalaṅkārabhūṣitām |
viśvavyāpakatoyāntaḥ śvetapadmoparisthitām ||

mantracūḍāmaṇau (-) tasyopari gṛhe devīṃ kharvāṃ nīlamaṇiprabhām |
lambodarīṃ vyāghracarma(-)samāvṛtanitambinīm ||

pīnonnatapayobhārāṃ raktavartulalocanām |
lalajjihvāṃ mahābhīmāṃ draṃṣṭrākoṭisamujjvalām ||

nīlotpalalasanmālāṃ baddhajūṭāṃ bhayaṅkarīm |
śvetāsthipaṭṭikāyukta kapālapañcaśobhitām ||

lalāṭe raktanāgena kṛtakarṇāvataṃsakām |
atiśubhramahānāga(-)kṛtahāramahojjvalām ||

dūrvādalaśyāmanāga(-)kṛtayajñopavītinīm |
caturbhujāṃ raktamāṃsa(-)khaṇḍakhaṇḍitamuṣṭinā ||

jaṭājūṭākṣasūtreṇa śobhitāṃ tīkṣṇadhārayā |
khaḍgena dakṣiṇasyordhve śobhitāṃ vīranādinīm ||

tadadhaḥsthād bījavṛnta(-)karttrikālaṅkṛtāṃ parām |
vāmordhve raktanālena digambaramanoharām ||

dadhatīṃ nīlapadmaṃ ca tadadhaḥsthāt kapālakam |
jagatāṃ jāḍyasaṃyuktaṃ dadhatīṃ kundasannibham ||

dhūmrābhanāgasaṃdoha kṛtakeyūrasatvarām |
suvarṇavarṇanāgena kaṅkaṇojjvalapāṇikām ||

<201> śubhravarṇamahādeva(-)kṛtasadvimalāsanām |
niryantraṇabhiyā tadvat saṃkucatpapadātmikām ||

śavapādadvayārūḍha(-)vāmapādāṃ mahonmukhīm |
kundābhanāgasaṃśobhi(-)kaṭisūtrāṃ trilocanām ||

asṛgraktena nāgena kṛtanūpurapallavām |
sadyaśchinnagaladrakta(-)muṇḍai raktavibhūṣaṇaiḥ ||

anyonyakeśagrathitaiḥ pādapadmavilambitaiḥ |
pañcāśadbhirmahāmālā(-)śobhitāṃ parameśvarīm ||

jvalaccitāmadhyasaṃsthāṃ dvīpicarmottarāṃśukām |
akṣobhyanāgasambaddha(-)jaṭājūṭāṃ varapradām ||

evambhūtāṃ mahādevī(-)mātmānaṃ yāgavastu ca |
vijñāpayen mahādeva paṇḍito'haṃ mahākaviḥ ||

tāropaniṣadi (-) viruddhavākyārthaśarīramaṇḍale navāmbudābhāṃ 
gurumunnatodarīm |
atīva kharvāṃ navayauvanasthā(-)madhaḥsthaśārdūlakakṛttimūrdhajām ||

anaikyamāhatya śavoparisthitāṃ śavārdhamālīḍhaparītamadhyamām |
viśīrṇavarṇāṃ nṛśiraḥsrajodbhavāṃ trayīvivarttāruṇalocanatrayām ||

abhedapiṅgaikajaṭāvirājitāṃ vibhūṣaṇāchinnasitāsthibhīṣaṇām |
mahāṣṭasiddhiprakarāhibhūṣaṇā maṭṭāṭṭahāsairjagatāmabhītidām ||

jaṭāsvanantaḥ śravasośca takṣako mahāhipadmo hṛdi hārabhūṣaṇām |
tathaiva karkoṭakṛtopavītikāṃ sumekhalāyāmatha devavāsukiḥ ||

saśaṅkhapālaḥ kila kaṅkaṇo mataḥ padeṣu padmaḥ kila nūpuraśriyam |
bhūjeṣu nāgaḥ kuliko'ṅgado mato bhujo'rdhamālāmahatā sthitiḥ sthitā ||

sitaśca rakto dhavalaśca mecakastathaiva nāgo'tha sitaśca pāṇḍaraḥ |
bhujaṅgamānāmiha varṇajātayo bhavanti sarve munibhirjvalaccitām ||

kapālakartrīgrathitogramūrdhajāṃ sanālamindīvarakāntimālikām |
vikośakhaḍgaṃ satataṃ ca dakṣiṇe svapauruṣotthairdadhatīṃ bhujaiḥ sadā ||

padārthadraṃṣṭrādvayapañcamudrayā virājamānāmasitotpalasrajam |
vicintayet tāṃ ca kavitvakāriṇīṃ manogatārthaṃ prajapecca tāriṇīm ||

phetkāriṇītantre'pi (-) pratyālīḍhapadārpitāṅghriśavahṛdghorāṭṭahāsā varā 
khaḍgendīvarakartrīkharparabhujā hūṃkārabījodbhavā |
<202> kharvā nīlaviśālapiṅgalajaṭājūṭogranāgairvṛtā |
jāḍyaṃ nyasya kapālake trijagatāṃ hantyugratārā svayam ||

pratyālīḍhalakṣaṇaṃ tu saṅgītaratnākare (-)

vāmo yatra niṣaṇṇorurantare pūrvamānataḥ |
dakṣiṇaṃ caraṇaṃ cāgre pañcatālaprasāritam ||

asrau dvāvapi tadvindyādālīḍhaṃ tu sadaivatam |
ālīḍhāṅgaviparyāsāt pratyālīḍhamudāhṛtam ||

tālaṃ vitastiḥ | tālamātraṃ vitastikā iti tatraivokteḥ | asrau vakrau | 
maulāvakṣobhyabhūṣitāmityatra akṣobhyo nāgaḥ | akṣobhyo 
devīmūrdhanyastrimūrttirnāgarūpadhṛk iti bhāvacūḍāmaṇivacanāt | 
brahmasaṃhitāyām (-)

atha dhyānaṃ pravakṣyāmi tāriṇyāḥ sarvasiddhidam |

jvalatpāvakajālajvālātibhāsvaccitāmadhyasaṃsthāṃ supuṣṭāṃ sukharvām | 
śavaṃ dakṣapādena kaṇṭhe nipīḍya sthitāṃ vāmakenāṅghriṇāṅghriṃ 
nipīḍya ||

bṛhallambamānodarīṃ meghavarṇāṃ samuttuṅgapīnastanābhogaramyām |

javārāgarāgapravṛttāṃ trinetrāṃ lalajjihvayā daṃṣṭrayā bhīṣaṇāsyām ||

lasaddvīpicarmāvṛtāṅgīṃ smitāsyāṃ jaṭājūṭamadhyasthitendīvarāṅgīm |
śirodeśabhāsvatpiśaṅgābhisarpajjaṭājūṭamadhyasthitākṣobhya(-)mūrtim ||

mithaḥkeśabaddhācirachinnasamyaggalallohitāṃ mānavīṃ muṇḍamālām |
dadhānāṃ ca pañcāśadākhyānasaṃkhyāyutachinnamuṇḍābalīṃ 
nirmalāṅgīm ||

mahāsṛksamāṃsotkarādhāryasavyasphuratpāṇinā dhārayantīṃ mahāsim |
bhuje vāma īṣatsphuradraktanāla(-)sphurannīlapaṅkeruhaṃ dhārayantīm ||

kare savya uccairadhastād dadhānāṃ śitāṃ karttṛkāṃ vāmapāṇau kapālam |
jagadvartisaṃsārajāḍyātipūrṇaṃ sphuratkartṛkādhārayā khaṇḍayantīm ||

vicitrāsthimālaṃ karālaṃ kapālaṃ lalāṭe ca pañcānvitaṃ dhārayantīm |
ghanābhāhibūddhaṃ jaṭājūṭamuccairjavārāganāgollasatkuṇḍalāṃ ca ||

sphuraddhūmarocirmahākāyanāga(-)sphuraccārukeyūraśobhābhirāmām |
suvarṇābhanāgollasatkaṅkaṇena sphurantīṃ lasacchetanāgābhirāmām ||

śarīreṇa dūrvādalaśyāmanāgaiḥ kṛtaṃ cāruyajñopavītaṃ dadhānām |
dadhānāṃ ca kundābhanāgena samyak kṛtaṃ cārukāṭeyasūtraṃ pavitram ||

mahāpāṭalābhena nāgena vṛttāṃ vibhūṣāṃ ca pādadvaye saṃdadhānām |
<203> ciraṃ cintayāmīdṛśaṃ cārurūpāmameyāmadoṣāmapārāṃ sasārām ||

suraśreṇimauliprabhārañjitāṅghriṃ natāśeṣadoṣāpahāmiṣṭadātrīm |
yadīyaprasādādidaṃ viśvajātaṃ janaḥ prāpnuyān modate samyageva ||

sadaivaṃ stavaṃ yaḥ paṭhedekacitto vaśastasya loko bhavet tanna nūnam | 
na dāridryapāpe na vā durmatiḥ syāllabhetāpi mokṣaṃ tathā dharmakāmau ||

atha prāṇapratiṣṭhā

tantre (-) āvāhanaṃ sthāpanaṃ ca sannidhāpanameva ca |
sannirodhanamityuktaṃ sammukhīkaraṇaṃ tathā ||

vidhāya svasvamudrābhiḥ prāṇasthāpanamācaret |

āsāṃ lakṣaṇamuktaṃ lakṣaṇasaṃgrahe (-)

hastābhyāmañjaliṃ baddhvā'nāmikāmūlaparvaṇi |
aṅguṣṭhau niḥkṣipet seyaṃ mudrā tvāvāhanī matā ||

adhomukhī tviyaṃ vai syāt sthāpanīti nigadyate |
ucchritāṅguṣṭhamuṣṭyostu saṃyogāt sannidhāpanī ||

antaḥpraveśitā'ṅguṣṭhā saiva sarodhinī matā |
uttānamuṣṭiyugalā saṃmukhīkaraṇaṃ bhavet ||

savyahastakṛtā muṣṭirdīrghādhomukhatarjanī |
avaguṇṭhanamudreyamabhito bhrāmitā satī ||

devatāṅge ṣaḍaṅgānāṃ nyāsaḥ syāt sakalīkṛtiḥ |

amṛtīkaraṇaṃ dhenumudrayā | sā proktā |

anyonyagrathitā'ṅguṣṭhā prasāritaparāṅguliḥ |
mahāmudreyamuditā paramīkaraṇe priye ||

prayojayedimā mudrā devatāhvānakarmaṇi |

atrādyapañcamudrāsu ihāgaccha iha tiṣṭha iha sannidhehi iha sannirudhyasva iha 
sammukhībhaveti kramād vadanti |

uḍḍīśe (-) ata evābhipūrṇāyā devatāyāḥ prapūjane |
sādaraṃ sammukhībhāvamāvāhanamihocyate ||

ata eva āvāhanamudrāpradarśanādeva | tathā (-)

vibhorniveśanaṃ yantre sthāpanaṃ kathitaṃ budhaiḥ |
pūjāṃ prayujyamānāṃ tu gṛhītvā'nugrahādikam ||

<204> karttuṃ sāmarthyamasyāstu tat sānnidhyaṃ pracakṣate |
ākarmakāṇḍaparyantaṃ sānnidhyaṃ hi vibhośca yat ||

sa sannirodha uddiṣṭo bhaktito mantravin naraiḥ |
ānandāyatanaṃ tattvaṃ saccidānandalakṣaṇam ||

tadatra sakalaṃ vyāptaṃ dhyeyaṃ syādavaguṇṭhane |
sakalīkaraṇaṃ kṛtvā mantrairebhirathaikatām ||

aṅgānāmaṅginā sārdhaṃ vidadhyādamṛtīkṛtim |
kṣamā tasyāparādhānāṃ vijñeyā paramīkṛtiḥ ||

aparādhānām aparicchinnasya brahmaṇa āvāhanādimudrayā paricchinnatābhā(-)
rūpāparādhānām | mudrāntarāṇi bhairavatantre (-) 
pañcamudrāvibhūṣitāmityabhidhāyayoniśca bhūtinī caiva bījākhyā 
daityadhūminī |
lelihāneti saṃguptāḥ pañcamudrāḥ prakīrtitāḥ ||

āsāṃ bījāni tatraiva (-)

yonirmāyā'dharā dhenurbadhūḥ kūrcaṃ kramād viduḥ |
bījānyāsāṃ lakṣaṇaṃ tu krameṇa kathayāmyaham ||

yoni ai(/) | māyā hrīṃ | adharā etadanantarībhūtā | dhenuḥ vaṃ | vadhūḥ strīṃ 
kūrcaṃ hūṃ |
tathā (-) tarjanyanāmike madhye kaniṣṭhe ca kramādapi |
karayoryojayeccaiva kaniṣṭhāmūladeśataḥ ||

aṅguṣṭhāgraṃ tu nikṣipya mahāyoniḥ prakīrtitā |
adhomukhīmimāṃ mudrāṃ darśayed bījapūrvikām ||

asyāṃ tu devi tarjanyau nipātya pṛṣṭhatastataḥ |
saṃsthāpyā'ṅguṣṭhake mudrā bhūtinī parikīrtitā ||

tantrāntare'pi (-) badhvā tu yonimudrāṃ vai madhyame kuṭile kuru |
aṅguṣṭhe ca tadagre tu mudreyaṃ bhūtinī matā ||

bhairavatantre (-) parivartya karau spṛṣṭāvaṅguṣṭhatarjanīyugam |
ardhacandrākṛtinyāyaṃ yugapat kārayet samam ||

adhaḥ kaniṣṭhāmākṛṣya madhyame viniyojayet |
mudraiṣā kathitā devi bījākhyā jñānarūpiṇī ||

parivartya karau kṛtvā kaniṣṭhākṛṣṭamadhyamām |
anāmayoryugaṃ cādhastarjanīyugalaṃ pṛthak ||

<205> anyonyaṃ niviḍaṃ badhvā aṅguṣṭhāgre'nāmike |
daityānāṃ dhūmaketvākhyā mudraiṣā kathitā priye ||

vaktraṃ visphāritaṃ kṛtvāpyadho jihvāṃ ca cālayet |
pārśvasthamuṣṭiyugalaṃ lelihāneti kīrtitā ||

tataḥ purvoktaprāṇapratiṣṭhāmantreṇa lelihāmudrayā prāṇapratiṣṭhāṃ kuryāt 
| lelihāmudrā

yathā (-) tarjanīmadhyamānāmāṃ samīṃ kuryādadhomukhīm |
anāmāyāṃ kṣiped vṛddhāmṛjuṃ kṛtvā kaniṣṭhikām ||

lelihā nāma mudreyaṃ jīvanyāse prakīrtitā |

devaśuddhiḥ

atha devaśuddhiṃ kuryāt | taduktaṃ kulārṇave (-)

pīṭhe devaṃ pratiṣṭhāpya sakalīkṛtya sādhakaḥ |
mūlamantreṇa dīpinyā mālinyā'rghodakena ca ||

trivāraṃ prokṣayed vidvān devaśuddhiriyaṃ priye |

pratiṣṭhā sakalīkaraṇaṃ coktameva | prokṣaṇaṃ cātra mūlenaiva yuktisiddham | 
dīpinīmālinyoḥ parāprāsādamantraghaṭitatvena urdhvāmnāya eva niyoga iti | 
kulārṇave (-)

sakalīkṛtya tatprāṇān samuddīpyendriyāṇi ca |
pratiṣṭhāpyā'rcayed devamanyathā niṣphalaṃ bhavet ||

triśaktiratne (-) pūrvavat tarpayed devīṃ devīyātrāmṛtena hi |
phetkāriṇyām (-) āvāhya sthāpayitvā tu dhyātvā vai pūjayet tataḥ |
sārasaṃgrahe (-) mudrāḥ pradarśya vidhivadupacāraiḥ prapūjayet ||

mudrā āvāhanyādikāḥ | upacārāścoktā mantramuktāvalyām (-)

pādyārghyācamanīyāni snānaṃ vasanabhūṣaṇe |
gandhapuṣpadhūpadīpanaivedyācamanāni ca ||

tāmbūlamarcanā strotraṃ tarpaṇaṃ ca namaskriyā |
prayojayedarcanāyāmupacārāṃstu ṣoḍaśa ||

pādyamarghaṃ nivedyātha tathaivācamanīyakam |
madhuparkācamanaṃ caiva gandhaprasūnake tataḥ ||

dhūpadīpau ca naivedyaṃ daśopacārakaṃ matam |
gandhādayo naivedyāntā pūjā pañcopacārikā ||

prapañcasāre (-) saparyā trividhā proktā tāsāmekatamaṃ śrayet |

<206> trividhā ṣoḍaśa(-)daśa(-)pañcopacārabhedāt ||

kuloḍḍīśe (-) upacāreṣu sarveṣu yatkiñcid durlabhaṃ bhavet |
tat sarvaṃ manasā dhyātvā puṣpakṣepeṇa kalpayet ||

tatra tatra jalaṃ dadyādupacārāntarāntarā |

upacāravidhiḥ

athopacārāṇāṃ vidhirlikhyate | sārasaṃgrahe (-)

devasya vāmabhāge tu dadyān mūlena cāsanam |
pauṣpaṃ dārumayaṃ vāstraṃ cārma kauśaṃ ca taijasam |
ṣaḍvidhaṃ cāsanaṃ proktaṃ devatāprītikārakam |

pauṣpaṃ sugandhipuṣparacitam | dārumayaṃ kaṇṭakibhinnaṃ candanādighaṭitam 
| vāstraṃ(-)kārpāsa(-)kauśeya(-)kambalādi | kauśaṃ saptaviṃśatikulapatrāṇāṃ 
viṣṭaraḥ | 

taduktaṃ ḍāmare (-) saptaviṃśatidarbhāṇāṃ veṇyagre granthibhūṣitā |
viṣṭaraḥ sarvayajñeṣu lakṣaṇaṃ parikīrtitam || iti |
taijasaṃ suvarṇādiracitaṃ lohasīsādivarjam | cāmaṃ mṛgavyāghryādyajinam |
svāgataṃ tu svāgatamudrāṃ pradarśya śrī(-)amukadevi svāgatamityuccārya 
kartavyam |
kālīkalpe (-) pādyaṃ tu pādayordadyān namomantreṇa mantravit |
śāradāyām (-) etacchyāmākadūrvābjaviṣṇukrāntādbhirīritam |
kālīkalpe (-) svāhāmantreṇa deveśi arghyaṃ dadyācchiropari ||

śāradāyām (-) gandhapuṣpākṣatayava kuśāgratilasarṣapaiḥ |
sadūrvaiḥ sarvadevānāmetadarghyamudāhṛtam ||

kālīkalpe (-) ācamanaṃ madhuparkaṃ ca svadhāmantreṇa vai mukhe |
śāradāyām (-) svadhāmantreṇa vadane dadyādācamanīyakam |
jātīlavaṅgakakkolaistadyuktaṃ mantravedibhiḥ ||

svadhāmantreṇa vamiti bījena | taduktaṃ svatantre (-)

madhuparkaṃ mukhe dadyāj jalamantreṇa deśikaḥ |
tathā (-) svadhāṇunā tataḥ kuryān madhuparkaṃ mukhāmbuje |
ājyaṃ dadhimadhūnmiśramayamukto manīṣibhiḥ ||

kuloḍḍīśe (-) mākṣikaṃ śarkarā sarpirdadhi kṣīrayutaṃ tathā |
madhuparkaṃ kalpayitvā pradadyād vidhipūrvakam ||

<207> sarvataḥ kṣaudramadhikaṃ dadhisarpiḥsitāḥ samam |
kṣīraṃ tu sarvataḥ svalpaṃ madhuparka udāhṛtaḥ ||

śāradāyām (-) tenaiva manunā kuryādadbhirācamanīyakam |

punarācamanīyakam (-) kālīkalpe (-)

snānaṃ gandhaṃ hṛdā dadyāt puṣpāṇi vauṣaḍityapi |
tato nivedayāmīti sarvaṃ dadyān maheśvari ||

yāmale ca (-) vāruṇena ca bījena madhuparkaṃ mukhāmbuje |
tenaiva manunā kuryādadbhirācamanīyakam ||

gandhādbhiḥ kārayet snānaṃ vāsasī paridhāpayet |
dadyād divyopavītaṃ ca hārādyābharaṇāni ca ||

gandhaścandanakarpūra kālāgurubhirīritaḥ |

vasanaṃ ca dukūlaṃ deyam | dattvā sūkṣme dukūlake iti 
puraścaraṇacandrikāvacanāt | tatrāpi śakte raktavastraṃ praśastam | raktaṃ 
śaktyarkavighnānāmiti yāmalavacanāt |

mantratantraprakāśe (-) tailādidūṣitād rogaḥ sacchidrād bādhyatā bhavet |
jīrṇād daridratā kartturmalināt kāntihīnatā ||

sārasaṃgrahe (-) yajñopavītaṃ dattvā'tha bhūṣaṇāni samarpayet |
ṅentaṃ namo'ntaṃ tannāma pūjanādau prayojayet ||

tāni nānāvidhāni syurmukuṭādiprabhedataḥ |
strīṃpuṃprabhedatastāni jñeyāni tu vicakṣaṇaiḥ ||

yajñopavītaṃ puṃdaivate deyamityarthaḥ | gandhāḥ 
puraścaraṇacandrikāyāmuktāḥ (-)

candanaṃ malayotpannamanāghrātaṃ suśītalam |
karpūrāgurukastūrī himāmbukṣoditaṃ śubham ||

kṣoditaṃ ghṛṣṭham | kuṅkumaraktacandane api praśaste tantrāntarāt | tārārṇave 
(-)

rocanākapikāśmīra(-)māṃsī(-)tagarucandanaiḥ |
sacorairaṣṭagandho'yaṃ tārāyāḥ prītidāyakaḥ ||

kapirbālā | goṭhimana iti kaścit | coraḥ śaṭhī | tagarurgandhaviśeṣaḥ | atra 
vihitapuṣpāṇyāsādanaprakaraṇe proktāni | puṣpavidhiḥ 
puraścaraṇacandrikāyām (-)

ananyārpitamacchidraṃ pūtaṃ puṇyaṃ navaṃ śubham |
guṇacandanasaṃyuktaṃ nānāgandhamanoharam ||

jñānārṇave (-) puṣpaiḥ paryuṣitairdevi nārcayet svarṇajairapi |

<208> nirmālayabhūtairucchiṣṭaiḥ kusumaiḥ parameśvari ||

ucchiṣṭairanyadevatāpūjāvaśiṣṭaiḥ | jñānamālāyām (-)

patraṃ vā yadi vā puṣpaṃ phalaṃ neṣṭamadhomukham |
duḥkhadaṃ tat samākhyātaṃ yathotpannaṃ tathārpaṇam ||

tathā (-) adhomukhārpaṇaṃ neṣṭaṃ puṣpāñjalividhau na tat |
añjalidāne adhomukhatā na doṣāyetyarthaḥ | tantre (-)

aṅguṣṭhatarjanībhyāṃ ca cakre puṣpaṃ nivedayet |
dhūpavidhiḥ puraścaraṇacandrikāyām (-)

itthaṃ dhūpaṃ prakūrvīta tāmrakāṃsyādinirmite |
bhājane dvipade bhugnanāle padmāvatau śubhe ||

sārāṅgāravinikṣiptairguggulvaguruvṛkṣajaiḥ |
niryāsādyutthitairdhūmairgandhadravyairathoditaiḥ ||

niryāsaḥ sarjarasādiḥ | prapañcasāre (-) tantralīlāvatyām

jaṭāmāṃsīguggulaṃ ca candanāgurukaistathā |
candrairajanisaṃyuktairmākṣikaiḥ saha kuṅkumaiḥ ||

sarpiḥsaṃmiśritairdadyād devyai dhūpaṃ maheśvari |
saguggulvaguruśīra(-)sitājyamadhucandanaiḥ ||

sārāṅgāravinikṣiptairdhūpaṃ nīcaiḥ pradhūpayet |
kuloḍḍīśe (-) gugguluṃ saralaṃ dāru patraṃ malayasambhavam |
hrīveramaguruṃ kuṣṭhaṃ guḍaṃ sarjarasaṃ ghanam ||

harītakīṃ nakhīṃ lākṣāṃ jaṭāmāṃsīṃ ca śailajam |
ṣoḍaśāṅgaṃ vidurdhūpaṃ daive paitre ca karmaṇi ||

athavā'gurukarpūracandanaiḥ saha guggulam |
madhusarpirjaṭāmāṃsī śailajaṃ kuṅkumaṃ tathā ||

ebhirvimiśritaḥ kāryo dhūpo'yaṃ pārvatīpriyaḥ |
tantre (-) madhu mustaṃ ghṛtaṃ gandho guggulvaguruśailajam |
saralaṃ śihla(?)siddhārthaṃ daśāṅgo dhūpa iṣyate ||

sitājyamadhusaṃmiśraṃ guggulvagurucandanam |
ṣaḍaṅgadhūpametat tu savadevapriyaṃ sadā ||

śaivāgame (-) dhūpabhājanamastreṇa prokṣyā'bhyarcya hṛdāṇunā |
<209> astreṇa pūjitāṃ ghaṇṭāṃ vādayan gugguluṃ dahet ||

guggulupadaṃ vihitadhūpadravyamātropalakṣakam | tantre (-)

astreṇa dhūpadīpādīn saṃpūjya dāpayet tataḥ |
yathā gandhaṃ tathā devi dhūpaṃ dadyād vicakṣaṇaḥ ||

tatheti | madhyamāṅguṣṭhābhyāmityarthaḥ | dīpavidhiḥ kuloḍḍīśe (-)

ghṛtapradīpaḥ prathamastilatailasamudbhavaḥ |
sārṣapaḥ phalaniryāsajāto vā vārijodbhavaḥ ||

dadhijaścānnajaścaiva dīpāḥ sapta prakīrtitāḥ |
padmasūtrabhavā varttirdarbhasūtrabhavā'thavā ||

jālajā vādarī vāpi tūlakoṣodbhavā'thavā |
vartikā dīpakṛtyeṣu sadā pañcavidhā smṛtā ||

taijasaṃ rājasaṃ lauhaṃ mārtikyaṃ nārikelajam |
tṛṇarājodbhavaṃ vāpi dīpapātraṃ praśasyate ||

evaṃ dīpaṃ prakurvīta netrarañjanakāraṇam |
dīpaṃ tu yāgaparyantamadhomukhaṃ prakalpayet ||

kālikāpurāṇe (-) labhyate yasya tāpastu dīpasya caturaṅgulāt |
na sa dīpa ihākhyāta hyoghavahnistu sa smṛtaḥ ||

tathā (-) śaṇaṃ vā dārakaṃ vastraṃ jīrṇaṃ malinameva vā |
upabhuktaṃ na dadyāt tu vartikārthaṃ kadācana ||

naiva nirvāpayed dīpaṃ devārthamupakalpitam |
dīpahartā bhavedandhaḥ kāṇo nirvāpako bhavet ||

puraścaraṇacandrikāyām (-) vartyā karpūragarbhiṇyā sarpiṣā tilajena vā |
āropya darśayed dīpānuccaiḥ saurabhaśālinaḥ ||

tathā (-) dīpañca dhūpavatpātre padmākāravinirmite |
pratipatraṃ pradīptaṃ ca vartyā gavyaghṛtāktayā ||

atra gavyaghṛta(-)tailādīnāṃ vikalpo na tu samuccayaḥ |
na miśrīkṛtya dadyāt tu snehadravyān ghṛtādīkān |
dattvā miśrīkṛtaṃ snehaṃ tāmisraṃ narakaṃ vrajet ||

iti kālikāpurāṇokteḥ |

tūrṇāyāge (-) pārāvatabhramākāraṃ dīpaṃ netrādi darśayet |
<210> dakṣiṇe sarpiṣā dīpaṃ tilatailena vāmataḥ ||

sitāvartirdakṣiṇato raktāvartistu vāmataḥ |
kālikāpurāṇe (-) vakṣeṣu dīpo dātavyo na tu bhūmau kadācana |
savaṃsahā vasumatī sahate na tvidaṃ dvayam ||

akārye pādaghātaṃ ca dīpatāpaṃ tathaiva ca |
kurvaṃstu pṛthivītāpaṃ yo dīpamutsṛjen naraḥ ||

sa tāpapāpaṃ narakaṃ prāpnotyeva na saṃśayaḥ |
tantre (-) aṅguṣṭhāgreṇa deveśi dhṛtvā dīpaṃ nivedayet |
uttolanaṃ tathā kuryād gāyatryā mūlayogataḥ ||

atrā'ñjanamapyuktaṃ tantre (-) sauvīraṃ jāmbalaṃ tutthaṃ mayūraśrīkaraṃ 
tathā |
darvikā meghanīlaśca añjanāni bhavanti ṣaṭ ||

sravadrūpantu sauvīraṃ jāmbalaṃ prastaraṃ tathā |
mayūraśrīkaraṃ ratnaṃ meghanīlaṃ tu taijasam ||

ghṛṣṭvā nigāhya caitāni śilāyāṃ taijase'thavā |
pradadyāt sarvadevebhyo devībhyaścāpi putraka ||

ghṛtatailādiyogena tāmrādau dīpavahninā |
yadañjanaṃ jāyate tu darvikā parikīrtitā ||

vidhavā nāñjanaṃ kuryān mahāmāyārthamuttamam |
na mṛtprātre yojayet tu sādhako netrarañjanam ||

naivedyamuktaṃ svatantre (-)

kandupakvaṃ snehapakvaṃ ghṛtasaṃyuktapāyasam |
manaḥpriyaṃ ca naivedyaṃ dadyād devyai punaḥ punaḥ ||

matsyasūkte (-) pāyasaṃ kṛśaraṃ dadyāccharkarāguḍasaṃyutam |
ājyaṃ dadhimadhūnmiśraṃ tasmāt tāni pradāpayet ||

śālamatsyaṃ ca pāṭhīnaṃ godhikāmāṃsamuttamam |
annaṃ ca madhunā yuktaṃ yatnād dadyācca mantravit ||

śālamatsyo mahāśāla iti prasiddhaḥ | muṇḍamālāyām (-)

śālamatsyaṃ ca pāṭhīnaṃ śakulaṃ gaḍakaṃ tathā |
madguraṃ celliśaṃ dadyān māṃsaṃ māhiṣameva ca ||

pakṣimāṃsa varārohe ḍimba nānāsamudbhavam |
<211> kṛṣṇachāgaṃ mahāmāṃsaṃ godhikāṃ hariṇīṃ tathā |
jalaje matsyamāṃse ca gaṇḍakīmāṃsameva ca |
nānāvyañjanadugdhāni vyañjanāni bahūni ca ||

kumārītantre (-) anyāni ca naivedyāni sādhakānāṃ śṛṇuṣva me |
tāmbūlaṃ ca sakarpūraṃ nālikeraṃ saśarkaram ||

pāyasaṃ saghṛtaṃ caiva ārdrakaṃ saguḍaṃ tathā |
sataṇḍulaṃ tilaṃ caiva dadhi caiva saśarkaram ||

jambīraṃ panasaṃ caiva phalamāmrātakaṃ tathā |
kadalīṃ tintiḍīṃ caiva śrīphalaṃ phalamuttamam |
karañjaṃ vakulaṃ caiva tālaṃ kharjūrameva ca |
anyāni ca sugandhīni svādūni ca phalāni ca ||

rudrayāmale (-) taijaseṣu ca pātreṣu sauvarṇe rājate tathā |
tāmre vā prastare vāpi padmapatre'thavā punaḥ ||

yajñadārumaye vāpi naivedyaṃ kalpayed budhaḥ |
sarvābhāve tu māheśi svahastaghaṭitaṃ yadi ||

yad yogyamarghyapātre tu tannidhāya nivedayet |

sārasaṃgrahe (-) nidhāya svarṇaje pātre sādhāraṃ tacca maṇḍale |
nidhāya caturasre ca saṃskuryācchāstramārgataḥ ||

astramantreṇa saṃprokṣya cakramudrābhirakṣitam |
vāyubījena saṃśodhya vahnibījena tad dahet ||

spṛśan dakṣakarāgreṇa sudhābījena mantrayet |
amṛtīkṛtya tatsarvaṃ mūlamantreṇa tatpunaḥ ||

spṛśan karābhyāṃ vidhivadaṣṭadhā cābhimantrayet |
dhenumudrāṃ pradarśyā'tha gandhapuṣpaiḥ samarcayet ||

tantre (-) tattvākhyamudrayā devi naivedyaṃ vinivedayet |
mūlena dattvā tāmbūlaṃ sādhakastena mudrayā ||

tena mūlamantreṇa | mudrayā tattvamudrayā | yāmale (-)

sarvopakaraṇādīni mūlānte ca nivedayet |
aśaktau manasā dadyādetatkrama na lopayet ||

cullukaṃ vidhivad dadyāt pañcamudrāṃ pradarśayet |
<212> punaśca cullukaṃ dadyād dattvā tāmbūlamuttamam ||

elā(-)lavaṅga(-)karpūra(-)jātīphalādisaṃyutam |
tamāladalakarpūra(-)pūgabhāgaistaraṅgitam ||

mālinītantre (-) namaḥ sarvopacāreṣu prathamānteṣu yojayet |
nīlatantre (-) sarvaṃ mantramayaṃ kṛtvā devatāyai nivedayet |
phetkāriṇyāmapi (-) āvāhya sthāpayitvā tu dhyātvā vai sthāpayet tataḥ |
śrīmadekajaṭe vajrapuṣpaṃ pratīccha coccaret |
mūlenāgnipriyāntena satāreṇa ca sādhakaḥ ||

tāraṃ oṃkāraḥ | tasya cānvaya ādāveva sampradāyasiddhaḥ | ayaṃ ca mantraḥ 
sarvāsāmapi tārādidevatānāṃ pūjāyāmavikṛta eva paṭhanīyaḥ | sarvā eva 
upakramya kathanāt | anena mantreṇa viśeṣārghajalenotsṛjya sarve'pyupacārā 
yathāśāstraṃ pratipādanīyāḥ | taduktaṃ svatantre (-)

anyatoyairyadutsṛṣṭamarghapātrasthitetaraiḥ |
na gṛhṇāti mahādevī dattaṃ vidhiśatairapi ||

yāmale (-) nivedayet purobhāge gandhapuṣpaṃ ca bhūṣaṇam |
dīpān dakṣiṇato dadyāt purato vā na vāmataḥ ||

vāmatastu tathā dhūpamagrato vā na dakṣiṇe |
naivedyaṃ dakṣiṇe vāme purato na tu pṛṣṭhataḥ ||

yoginītantre (-) gandhapuṣpaṃ tathā dhūpo dīpo naivedyameva ca |
yasya yad dīyate vastramalaṅkārādikāñcanam ||

teṣāṃ daivatamuccārya kṛtvā prokṣaṇapūjane |
utsṛjya mūlamantreṇa pratināmnā nivedayet ||

gautamīye (-) amṛtopastaraṇamasi svāheti jalamarpayet |
dīpikāyām (-) grāsamudrāṃ vāmadoṣṇā vikacotpalasannibhām |
pradarśayan dakṣiṇena prāṇādīnāṃ ca darśayet ||

spṛśet kaniṣṭhopakaniṣṭhike dve svāṅguṣṭhamūrdhnā prathameha mudrā |
tathā parā tarjanīmadhyame syādanāmikāmadhyamike ca madhyā ||

anāmikātarjanīmadhyamāśca tadvaccaturthī sakaniṣṭhikāstāḥ |
syāt pañcamī tadvaditi pradiṣṭāḥ prāṇādimudrā nijamantrayuktāḥ ||

mantrāstu oṃ prāṇāya svāhetyādayaḥ | taduktaṃ candrikāyām (-)

<213> prāṇāpānasamānodānavyānāstārapūrvakāḥ |
caturthyagnivadhūyuktāḥ prāṇamantrāḥ smṛtā amī ||

tataḥ pānārthaṃ pānīyaṃ dattvā devatāṃ tṛptāṃ vibhāvya 
amṛtāpidhānamasi svāheti pratyapośānaṃ dadyāt | taduktaṃ gautamīye (-)

kṣaṇaṃ vimṛṣya matimān dadyād gaṇḍūṣakaṃ tataḥ |
amṛtāpidhānamasi svāheti manunā'munā ||

dīpikāyām (-)

gaṇḍūṣadantadhavanācamanāsyahastamṛjyānulepamukhavāsakamālyabhūṣā
m |
tāmbūlamapyabhisamarpya suvādyanṛtyagītaiḥ sutṛptamabhipūjayatāt pureva ||

gandhādibhiḥ saparivāramathārghamasmai dattvā vidhāya 
kusumāñjalimādareṇa |
stutvā praṇamya śirasā culukodakena svātmānamarpayatu taccaraṇābjamūle ||

athopacāramudrā

lakṣaṇasaṃgrahe (-) āsane padmamudrā syād hastadvayamadhomukham |
mudraiṣā kuśalapraśne tadevordhvamukhaṃ punaḥ ||

mudrā syāt svāgate cārghamudrā tvañjalirucyate |
anāmāṅguṣṭhayoryogāt saivoktā pādyamudrikā ||

uttānaṃ dakṣahastaṃ tu kṛtvā nimnatalaṃ sudhīḥ |
kaniṣṭhahīnāḥ saṃyuktāścatasro'ṅgulya unnatāḥ ||

mudraiṣācamane proktā'dhomukhī sā tvanāmayā |
spṛṣṭā'ṅguṣṭhā bhaven mudrā madhuparke varānane ||

adhomukhī dakṣahastakṛtā muṣṭiḥ kaniṣṭhayā |
viyuktā snānamudraiṣā gaditā parameśvari ||

uttānaṃ dakṣiṇaṃ hastaṃ kṛtvā tanmadhyamāṃ punaḥ |
aṅguṣṭhena spṛśedeṣā mudrā vastrasya kīrtitā ||

eṣaivā'nāmikāsparśān mudrā bhūṣaṇasaṃjñikā |
kaniṣṭhāsparśato hyeṣā upavītasya mudrikā ||

jyeṣṭhāgreṇa kaniṣṭhāgraṃ spṛśed gandhasya mudrikā |

tantrāntare (-) madhyamānāmikāṅguṣṭhairaṅgulyagreṇa pārvati |
dadyācca vimalaṃ gandhaṃ mūlamantreṇa sādhakaḥ ||

aṅguṣṭhatarjanībhyāṃ tu yantre puṣpaṃ nivedayet |
<214> tathā (-) adhomukhaṃ karaṃ kṛtvā tarjanyagre tu yojayet |
aṅguṣṭhāgraṃ tu mudreyaṃ puṣpākhyā parameśvari ||

aṅguṣṭhāgreṇa tarjanyāḥ spṛśedagraṃ maheśvari |
dhūpamudreyamākhyātā sarvadevapriyaṃkarī ||

jyeṣṭhāgreṇa spṛśedagraṃ madhyamāyāḥ surārcite |
dīpamudreyamuditā sarvadevapriyā śubhā ||

anāmāgraṃ spṛśed devi jyeṣṭhāgreṇa tu deśikaḥ |
na(-)vedyamudrā kathitā devatā tṛptikāriṇī ||

athāvaraṇapūjā

somabhujagāvalyām (-) tataśca mūlamantreṇa trivāraṃ tarpayet sudhīḥ |
gṛhītvājñāṃ mahādevyāḥ parivārān samarcayet ||

ṣaḍaṅgaiḥ prathamaḥ kalpo gurubhistu dvitīyakaḥ |
parivāraistṛtīyaḥ syāllokapālaiścaturthakaḥ ||

tadastraiḥ pañcamaḥ prokta iti sāmānyataḥ kramaḥ |
yāmale (-) pādyādinā tathā paścāt pūjayedaṅgadevatāḥ |
mālinītantre (-) atha sarvajñatā tṛptiranādibodhasaṃjñikā |
svatantratā'nyā nityā syādaluptaśaktireva ca |
ṣaḍaṅgadevatā hyetā nāmataḥ parikīrtitāḥ ||

tantre (-) ṣaḍaṅgamarcayed devyā deheṣu kesareṣu ca |

kesareṣvarcākramo jñānārṇave (-)

agnīśāsuravāyavyamadhyadikṣvaṅgapūjanam |
somabhujagāvalyām (-) iṣṭvā hṛdayamāgneyyāmaiśānyāṃ ca śiro yajet |
nair(-)ṛtyāṃ ca śikhā pūjyā vāyavyāṃ kavacaṃ yajet ||

abhyarcya purato netraṃ dikṣu cāstramathārcayet |
tantre (-) vāyavyādīśaparyantaṃ gurupaṅktiṃ samarcayet |
gurupaṅktiḥ divyaugha(-)sidhaugha mānavaughasamudāyaḥ prāgevoktaḥ 
svagurutritayaṃ ca |
mālinītantre (-) gurupūjāṃ vinā vatsa yadi pūjāṃ samācaret |
taddoṣasamaye vatsa kulapūjāṃ samācaret ||

viguṇaṃ yatra yad vāme guṇaṃ ca kulapūjanāt |
vīracūḍāmaṇau (-) āvāhya pūjayet tasyāmaṅgamāvaraṇaiḥ saha |
<215> bindumadhye maheśāni triśaktiṃ ca prapūjayet ||

ratiṃ prītiṃ priyāṃ kāntiṃ puṣpavāṇadhanurdharam |
mithunaṃ pūjayet paścād gāyatrīṃ caturānanām ||

sāvitrīṃ caramāṃ dhyāyed pūjayed viṣṇudevatām |
vāgīśvarīṃ samāvāhya rudramaithunamarcayet ||

paṅktyākāreṇa deveśi gurumakṣobhyamarcayet |
karttṛkāṃ pūjayet paścāt citāṅgāraṃ prapūjayet ||

ṣaṭkoṇe ca yajed devi ṣaḍaṅgaṃ nyasya tarpayet |
praṇavaṃ pūrvavarṇaṃ ca tannāmapadameva ca |
vajrapuṣpaṃ pratīcchoktvā dviṭhāntamanumuddharet |
nāmāni ca pravakṣyāmi sthāne sthāne yathākramam ||

vīratantre (-) tato'ṣṭayoginī bāhye saṃpūjyā dalamūlataḥ |
mahākālyatha rudrāṇī ugrā bhīmā tathaiva ca ||

ghorāśca bhrāmarī caiva mahārātriśca saptamī |
bhairavī cāṣṭamī proktā yoginīstāḥ prapūjayet |
yāmale (-) caturdikṣu dale devyāḥ pūrvādikramato'rcayet |
pūrve vairocanaṃ nāma asitābhamathottare ||

paścime padmanābhākhyaṃ dakṣiṇe śaṅkhapāṇḍavam |
vidikṣu pūjayet paścādagnikoṇāditaḥ kramāt ||

nāmakāṃ māmakāṃ caiva pāṇḍarāṃ tārakāṃ tathā |
saṃbodhanayutaṃ nāma sarvatra sādhako bhavet ||

vimalātantre (-) svanāmādyakṣaraṃ bījaṃ mantrālābhe prakīrtitam |
yāmale (-) dalāgre ca maheśāni brāhmyādi paripūjayet ||

pūjayecca caturdvāre padmāntakādikaṃ kramāt |
padmāntakaṃ yamāntakaṃ vighnāntakamataḥ param ||

narakāntakaṃ ca saṃpūjya dikpālāṃśca prapūjayet |
madhye sūryaṃ samabhyarcya gurupaṃktyuttare tataḥ ||

itare pūjayed buddhaṃ punardevīṃ prapūjayet |
puṣpāñjalītrayaṃ dadyād yathāsaṃkhyaṃ japed budhaḥ ||

svatantra (-) caturasre lokapālān tadastrāṇi ca tadbahi |
<216> trikoṇe matsyasūkte tu viśeṣaḥ (-)

kāmeśvaryādikāḥ pūjyāstrikoṇe vahnimaṇḍale |
kāmeśvarī dikkaravāsinī ca caṇḍanāyikā || ityuktam |

tataśca mūlamantreṇa puṣpāñjalitrayaṃ kṣipet |
raktapuṣpāṇi cādāya mastake kullukāṃ japet ||

ityuktam | devīmaulāvakṣobhyamapi pūjayet | maulāvakṣobhyamarcayedityukteḥ | 
idaṃ cāvaraṇapūjāyāḥ prāgācaranti |

atha pūjādau diṅnirūpaṇam

atra sarvatra diṅnirūpikā devataiva pradhānatvāt tena devīpaścād 
vāmakoṇādagravāmakoṇaparyantaṃ gurupaṃktipūjā sidhyati |

pūjyapūjakayormadhye prācī prakīrtyate budhaiḥ |
taddakṣiṇaṃ dakṣiṇaṃ syāduttaraṃ cottaraṃ bhavet ||

iti mānasollāsavacanāt |

yaṣṭurabhimukhā devā devābhimukhato daśa |
prācyādiharito jñeyā pūjāhomādikarmaṇi ||

iti sārasaṃgrahavacanācca | evaṃ ca asitābhaṃ tathottara ityādāvapi 
devīvāmadalaṃ prasiddhadakṣiṇadigavasthitamevocyate | tena vāmāvartena 
pūjākramaḥ | sampradāyastvatra (-) prasiddhaprācyādikrameṇaiva | 
brāhmyādipūjanaṃ tu devyagradalamārabhya prādakṣiṇyenaiva 
viśeṣānabhidhānāt |

athāvaraṇapūjāḥ syuḥ puraḥ prācīṃ prakalpayet |
tadādiparivārāṇāṃ prādakṣiṇyena pūjanam ||

iti nṛsiṃhakalpavacanācca | evamagre'pi bodhyam | idantvavadheyam (-) 
devatāvāhanāt prāg āgneyādikoṇe dharmādīnāṃ pūrvādyaṣṭakeśareṣu 
pīṭhaśaktīnāṃ pūjanaṃ sammukhaprācotva kalpanānusāreṇa bodhyam | 
pūjyasyānāvāhitatvena tadānīṃ pūjyapūjakayorantaratvābhāvāt |

uttarāśāmukho devi yadā cakraṃ samuddharet |
uttarāśā tadā jñeyā pūrvāśaiva na saṃśayaḥ ||

īśānakoṇaṃ deveśi tadāgneyaṃ na saṃśayaḥ |
paścimābhimukho mantrī yadā cakraṃ samuddharet ||

<217> paścimāśā tadā jñeyā pūrvāśaiva na saṃśayaḥ |
vāyukoṇaṃ tadā'gneyamīśānaṃ rākṣasaṃ bhavet ||

dakṣiṇāśāmukho mantrī yadā cakraṃ samuddharet |
pūrvāśaiva tadā rakṣo rakṣaḥkoṇaṃ tu vahnimat ||

iti jñānārṇavavacanasyānyathopapādayitumaśaktyatvāt | 
paścimāśādyabhimukhatvaṃ kāmyapūjāviśeṣaparam | nityapūjāyāṃ 
prāgānano'tha dhanadadigvadano'tha tyādinā digdvayasyaiva niyamanāt | kecit tu 
indrādīn sāhajikaprācyādi (?)ṇa pūjayanti | tatra pramāṇaṃ cintyam |

athāvaraṇadevatādhyānam

śāradātilake (-) indrakoṇe lasaddaṇḍa(-)kuṇḍikākṣaguṇābhayām |
gāyatrīṃ pūjayen mantrī brahmāṇamapi tādṛśam ||

rakṣaḥkoṇe śaṅkha(-)cakra(-)gadā(-)paṅkaja(-)dhāriṇīm |
sāvitrīṃ pītavasanāṃ yajed viṣṇuṃ ca tādṛśam ||

vāyukoṇe paraśvakṣa(-)mālābhayakarānvitām |
yajet sarasvatīmacchāṃ rudraṃ tādṛśalakṣaṇam ||

atrendrakoṇa ityādinā devatāprācyādīnāmeva pūrvādittvābhidhānam | 
ṣaḍaṅgavatānāṃ tatraiva dhyānam |

tuṣārasphāṭikaśyāma(-)nīlakṛṣṇāruṇārciṣaḥ |
varadābhayadhāriṇyaḥ pradhānatanavaḥ striyaḥ ||

dhyātavyā viduṣā tena krameṇaivā'ṅgadevatāḥ |

pradhānatanava iti | vaikalpikaṃ dhyānāntaramiti rāghavabhaṭṭāḥ | dalamūle 
mahākālādidhyānaṃ mūladevatāvad viśeṣānabhidhānāt | 
vairocanādidhyānaṃ tantrāntare (-)

vairocanaṃ dvihastaṃ ca yaṣṭitomaradhāriṇam |
pītaṃ vṛṣāsanagataṃ trinetraṃ bhaktavatsalam ||

śaṅkhaṃ triśirasaṃ devamasitābhaṃ hiraṇmayam |
pustakābhītivaradaṃ vimalaṃ śaśavāhanam ||

śaṅkhaṃ triśirasamiti | anyadasitābhavat | pustaketyādi | ekasyaiva pustakasya 
hastābhyāṃ dhāraṇāccaturbhujatvaṃ bodhyam | evamagre'pi |

padmanābhaṃ dantivaktraṃ pustakaṃ varadābhayam |
pāśaṃ ca vidhṛtaṃ devaṃ trinetraṃ varadaṃ śubham ||

<218> śvetāṃ trinetrāṃ varadāṃ pustakābhayadhāriṇīm |
māmakāṃ valayadevena saṃyuktena vibhāvitām ||

kṛṣṇāṃ karālavadanāṃ nāmakāṃ navayauvanām |
godhikāyāṃ samārūḍhāṃ śikhirūḍhāṃ ca tārakām ||

pāṇḍarāṃ śvetabījena caturbāhusamanvitām |
raktāṃ lambodarīṃ dhyāyet pañcapretāsanasthitām ||

hastadhyānaṃ tu sarvāsāṃ māmakāvat |

pūrvabījaṃ samuccārya tārāṃ śyāmāṃ samarcayet |
pūrvādipadmapatreṣu punarbījena śāṅkari ||

namo'ntena dhruvādyena pratiślokena cārcayet |

atha brāhmyādīnāṃ dhyānam

śāradāyām (-) daṇjaṃ kamaṇḍaluṃ paścādakṣasūtramathā'bhayam |
bibhratī kanakacchāyā brāhmī kṛṣṇājinojjvalā ||

śūlaṃ paraśvadhaṃ kṣudradundubhiṃ nṛkaroṭikām |
vahantī himasaṅkāśā dhyeyā māheśvarī śubhā ||

aṅkuśaṃ daṇḍa khaṭvāṅgau pāśaṃ ca dadhatī karaiḥ |
bandhūkapuṣpasaṅkāśā kaumārī varadāyinī ||

cakraṃ ghaṇṭāṃ kapālaṃ ca śaṅkhaṃ ca dadhatī karaiḥ |
tāmālaśyāmalā dhyeyā vaiṣṇavī vibhramojjvalā ||

muṣalaṃ karavālaṃ ca kheṭakaṃ dadhatī halam |
karaiścaturbhirvārāhī dhyeyā kālaghanacchaviḥ ||

aṅkuśaṃ tomaraṃ vidyut kuliśaṃ dadhatī karaiḥ |
indranīlanibhendrāṇī dhyeyā sarvasamṛddhidā ||

śūlaṃ kṛpāṇaṃ nṛśiraḥ kapālaṃ dadhatī karaiḥ |
muṇḍasraṅmaṇḍitā dhyeyā cāmuṇḍā raktavigrahā ||

akṣasrajaṃ bījapuraṃ kapālaṃ paṅkajaṃ karaiḥ |
vahantī hemasaṅkāśā mahālakṣmīḥ samīritā ||

kecit tu (-) kālīprakaraṇokta(-)brāhmī(-)nārāyaṇītyādyaṣṭakamevātra pūjyaṃ 
yathā kālī tathā tāretyukteriti vadanti | tāsāṃ ca dhyānaṃ tatraiva vakṣyate |

<219> athendrādidhyānam

tūrṇāyāge (-) itthamāvaraṇaṃ samyagabhyarcya manuvittamaḥ |
ante yajellokapālāṃsteṣāmastrāṇi ca kramāt ||

indraṃ surādhīpaṃ pītaṃ vajrahastaṃ savāhanam |
agniṃ tejo'dhipaṃ raktaṃ śaktihastaṃ subhūṣaṇam ||

yamaṃ pretādhipaṃ kṛṣṇaṃ daṇḍahastaṃ samarcayet |
rakṣo'dhipaṃ nir(-)ṛtiṃ ca khaḍgahastaṃ sudhūmrakam ||

pāśahastaṃ suśubhrāṅgaṃ varuṇaṃ yādasāṃpatim |
vāyuṃ prāṇādhipaṃ dhūmramaṅkuśāḍhyakaraṃ yajet ||

yakṣapatiṃ kuberaṃ ca śuklavarṇaṃ gadākaram |
vidyādhipaṃ tatheśānaṃ svacchaṃ śūlakaraṃ yajet ||

nāgādhipaṃ tathā'nantaṃ gauraṃ cakradharaṃ yajet |
lokādhipaṃ vidhātāraṃ raktaṃ padmakaraṃ yajet ||

airāvataṃ tathā meṣaṃ mahiṣaṃ mṛtapūruṣam |
makaraṃ mṛgama(śvaṃ)tyauṃ ca vṛṣaṃ ca ratha(-)haṃsakau ||

indrādilokapālānāṃ vāhanāni vidurbudhāḥ |
vajraṃ pītaṃ sitāṃ śaktiṃ daṇḍaṃ kṛṣṇaṃ samarcayet | 

khaḍgamākāśasaṃkāśaṃ pāśaṃ vidyunnibhaṃ smaret |
aṅkuśaṃ raktavarṇaṃ ca śuklavarṇāṃ gadāṃ yajet ||

triśūlaṃ nīlavarṇaṃ ca yajen mantrī tataḥ param |
rathāṅgaṃ karabindābhaṃ padmaṃ raktaṃ samarcayet ||

lokapālāyudhānyevaṃkrameṇa paripūjayet |

atra yadyapi hṛdayādiṣaḍaṅgānāmīndrādīnāṃ ca pūjane tantrāntare 
mantrāntarāṇyuktāni tathāpi tāni devatāntarāvaraṇapūjāparāṇi | atra ca (-)

vajrapuṣpaṃ pratīcheti hūṃ phaṭ svāheti cāntataḥ |
anena manunā sarvān parivārān samarcayet ||

iti vīratantrādivacanāt vajrapuṣpamityādimantreṇaiva sakalaparivārāṇāṃ 
pūjanam | indrādipūjottaraṃ lokapālamudrā pradarśanīyā | taduktaṃ tantre (-)

pāṇimūle susaṃlagne śākhāḥ sarvāḥ prasāritāḥ |
lokeśānāmiyaṃ mudrā teṣāmarcāsu darśayet ||

<220> tūrṇāyāge (-) abhīṣṭasiddhiṃ me dehi śaraṇāgatavatsale |
bhaktyā samarpayet tubhyaṃ prathamāvaraṇārcanam ||

iti puṣpāñjaliṃ dadyāt praṇamedatibhaktitaḥ |
pratyāvaraṇameva tu tattannāmnā samarpayet ||

svatantre (-) tataḥ punarmūladevīṃ mudrātarpaṇapūjanaiḥ |
arcayitvā japaṃ kṛtvā visarjayet tataḥ param ||

mudrā yonyākhyā | pūjāprakārastūrṇāyāge uktaḥ (-)

punarmūlaṃ samuccārya sāṅgāyai saparīti ca |
vārāyai nāma devyāśca caturthyantamudīrya ca ||

nama ityarcayed gandhapuṣpādyaiḥ sādhakastridhā |

atha balidānam

triśaktiratne (-) vāmabhāge trikoṇe ca vṛttaṃ bhūpurameva ca |
vidhāya raktamālyādyairarcayitvā yathāvidhi ||

vakṣyamāṇena manunā baliṃ devyai nivedayet |
dhruvaṃ lajjāṃ samuccārya ṅentāmekajaṭāṃ vadet ||

mahāyakṣādhipāyai syādupanītabaliṃ tathā |
gṛhṇa(-)gṛhṇāpaya dvandvaṃ mama sarvapadādatha ||

śāntiṃ kuruyugaṃ brūyāt paravidyāmataḥ param |
ākṛṣya yugalādante truṭachindhiyugaṃ vadet ||

brīḍāvahnivadhūprāntā balimantro'yamīritaḥ |

balipātrodakena viśeṣārghyodakena votsraṣṭavyaḥ | narasiṃhapurāṇe (-)
ārdrāmalakamānena kuryāddhomahavirbalīn |

chāgādibalividhiragre vācyaḥ | prathamaṃ kullukaṃ japtvaiva tārāmantrāḥ 
prajaptavyāḥ |

taduktaṃ triśaktiratne (-) ajaptvā kullukaṃ mantramasmṛtvā śrīpatiṃ harim |
yo japet tāriṇīmantraṃ narake sa nilīyate ||

japitvā kullukaṃ mantramaṣṭottaraśataṃ sudhīḥ |
prajapet tāriṇīṃ paścān nānyathā siddhimāpnuyāt ||

dhṛtvā tu kullukaṃ haste mahādevīṃ samarcayet |
athavā mūrdhni vinyasya pūjayet prajapedapi ||

brahmasaṃhitāyām (-) akṣobhyasya manuṃ tyaktvā devīṃ tārāṃ japed yadi |
<221> siddhihānirbhavet tasya rauravaṃ narakaṃ vrajet ||

tathā (-) akṣobhyasya manuṃ vipra kavacaṃ sāramuttamam |
atiguhyaṃ mahādhyānaṃ sarvadhyāneṣu cottamam ||

agre manuṃ pravakṣyāmi dhyānaṃ caiva tataḥ param |
kavacaṃ ca tataḥ paścāt kathayāmi krameṇa tu ||

anuttaraṃ samuddhṛtya papañcamavibhūṣitam |
akṣobhyeti ca svāheti ramādyantaṃ mahāmanuḥ ||

anuttaraḥ akāraḥ | papañcamo makāraḥ | tena binduḥ |
svayaṃ ṛṣiśca saṃprokto virāṭ chanda udīritaḥ |
akṣobhyo devatā proktastrimūrtirnāgarūpadhṛk |
viniyogastu niyataṃ puruṣārthacatuṣṭaye ||

atha dhyānaṃ pravakṣyāmi sarvasaubhāgyadāyakam |
sahasrādityasaṅkāśaṃ nāgarūpadharaṃ śubham |
vidyutkoṭisamaṃ vaktraṃ vahnibhāsvaralocanam |
sārdhatribalayopetaṃ jaṭākoṭyagrasaṃsthitam ||

mahālāvaṇyasaṃyuktaṃ surāsurairnamaskṛtam |
sūryavidyutsamābhāsaṃ mahāmaṇiśikhopari ||

etadrūpaṃ mahākāyaṃ devairapi supūjitam |

śiva uvāca (-)

asya kavacasya brahmaviṣṇurudrā ṛṣayo virāṭchando'kṣobhyo devatā śrīṃ 
bījaṃ svāhā śaktirdharmārthakāmamokṣārthaṃ jape viniyogaḥ |

śrīṃ bījaṃ śirase avyādādibījaṃ ca bhālake |
akāraḥ kaṇṭhaṃ me avyāt kṣokāro hṛdi rakṣatu ||

bhakāro nābhiṃ me avyād yakāro guhyadeśake |
mantraśaktiśca sarvāṅge bījaṃ netradvaye'vatu ||

sarvabhāvaiśca akṣobhyo bāhū dvau rakṣayet sadā |
brahmā rakṣatu pādau dvau viṣṇū rakṣatu jānunī ||

mūlādhāraṃ śiro me'vyāt svādhiṣṭhāne vṛṣo'vatu |
maṇipure sadā avyāt śivasya gṛhiṇī ca me ||

anāhatāmbujaṃ me'vyādindrādaśadevatā |
<222> viśuddhacakre satata rakṣāṃ karotu me raviḥ ||

maheśvaraḥ sadā rakṣedājñācakraṃ suśobhanam |
brahma śukraṃ ca me rakṣen nābhiṃ rakṣatu bhairavī ||

divyādigurupaṃktau ca sarvatrākṣobhya ucyate |
evaṃ kramavidhānena kavacaṃ ca japecchuciḥ ||

trisandhyaṃ ya paṭhen nityaṃ śraddhābhaktisamanvitaḥ |
siddhyahānirbhavet tasya nātra kāryā vicāraṇā ||

atha mālāvidhiḥ

etanmantrajape tu vīrasya rahasyamālā mukhyā praśastā ca | tathāhi triśaktiratne 
(-)

rahasyamālayā japtā tāriṇī siddhidā bhavet |
atastayā prajaptavyā mālayā siddhimicchatā ||

mahāśaṅkhamayī mālā pañcāśanmaṇinirmitā |
rahasyamālā saṃproktā gopanīyā prayatnataḥ ||

karṇanetrāntarālāsthi mahāśaṅkhaḥ prakīrtitaḥ |
tadabhāve tu kasyāpi karttavyā'vayavasya vai ||

mahāśaṅkho nṛśiro'sthi | taccādagdhaṃ vihitamiti sampradāyavidaḥ | yāmale (-)

narebhāśvoṣṭramuṇḍānāṃ chinnānāṃ raṇasaṃkaṭe |
mālāṃ vai kārayed vṛttāṃ mahāvidyāsu sādhakaḥ ||

tadabhāve sphāṭikī syān mālā sarvatra siddhidā |
muṇḍamālāyām (-) aṅguṣṭhasthāmakṣamālāṃ cālayen madhyamāgrataḥ |

aśucirna spṛśedenāṃ karabhraṣṭāṃ na kārayet |

triśaktiratne (-) athavā mātṛkāmayyā mālayā prajaped budhaḥ |
ekaikaṃ varṇamuccārya varṇenāntaritaṃ japet ||

sudhīreva lakārāntaṃ tata āntaṃ samānayet |
merurūpaṃ kṣakāraṃ hi sādhako naiva laṅghayet ||

muṇḍamālāyāmapi (-) anulomavilomasthakḷptayā varṇamālayā |
ādivarṇakrameṇaiva lāntaṃ ca parameśvari ||

kṣakāraṃ merurūpaṃ tu laṅghayenna kadācana |
meruhīnā ca yā mālā merulaṅghyā ca yā bhavet ||

aśuddhā tu bhavedatra sā mālā niṣphalā bhavet |
<223> citriṇī viśatantvābhā brahmanāḍī gatā tu yā |
tayā saṃgrathitā dhyeyā sarvakāmaphalapradā |
aṣṭottaraśatajape tvādau klīvaṃ samuccaret ||

ṛ ṝ ḷ ḹ varṇacatuṣṭayaṃ klīvaṃ pracakṣate |
vargāṇāmaṣṭakaṃ vāpi kāmyabhedakrameṇa tu ||

a ka ca ṭa ta pa ya śā ityevaṃ cāṣṭavargakam |

aṣṭottaraśatajape karttavye klībacatuṣṭayamādāvuccārya vilomasamāptāvapi 
taccatuṣṭayaṃ vilomena japedityekaḥ kalpaḥ | anulomavilomābhyāṃ pañcāśad 
varṇānuccārya śeṣe'ṣṭavargākṣarāṇyuccarediti aparaḥ kalpa ityarthaḥ | 
yāmale (-)

sabinduṃ varṇamuccārya paścān mantraṃ japet sudhīḥ |
kṣaṃ meruṃ kalpayitvā tu japet tannā'bhilaṅghayet ||

kṣaṃ sakṛdeva merutvena śuddhamuccaret na tu taduttaraṃ 
mantramuccaredityarthaḥ | tathā kulamūlāvatāre sārasaṃgrahe ca (-) 

brahmanāḍīgatānādikṣāntānarṇān vibhāvya ca |
arṇaṃ binduyutaṃ kṛtvā śreṣṭhaṃ mantraṃ japet sudhīḥ ||

akārādiṣu saṃyojya tathā kādiṣu ca kramāt |
kṣārṇaṃ merumatho tatra kalpayej jagadīśvarīm ||

tadā lipirbhavedakṣamālārdhaśatasaṃkhyayā |
anayā sarvamantrāṇāṃ japaḥ sarvārthasādhakaḥ ||

tathā (-) akārādikṣakārāntaṃ pañcāśanmaṇisūtrakam |
kṣakāraṃ merusaṃsthāne lakārādivilomataḥ ||

vargāṣṭakavibhedena śatamaṣṭottaraṃ bhavet |
ekaikāntaritaṃ mantraṃ yathādevaṃ phalapradam ||

anulomavilomasthaiḥ kḷptayā varṇamālayā |
pratyekamantrārṇayutā japtāḥ syuḥ śrīghrasiddhidāḥ |
vairimantrā api nṛṇāmanye mantrāśca kiṃ punaḥ ||

tenā'nyatra mālāpadaprayogo gauṇaḥ | tathā (-)

pañcaviṃśatibhirmokṣastriṃśadbhirdhanasañcayaḥ |
sarvārthāḥ saptaviṃśatyā pañcadaśyā'bhicārikam ||

pañcāśadbhiḥ karmasiddhiḥ syāt tathā caturuttaraiḥ |
saptaviṃśatibhiścākṣaiḥ sarvasādhāraṇo japaḥ ||

<224> mantratantraprakāśe (-) aṅgulījapasaṃkhyāne japamekaguṇaṃ smṛtam |
rekhāsvaṣṭaguṇaṃ vidyādakṣaiśca śatasaṃguṇaṃ ||

tatrā'ṅgulijapaṃ kurvan sāṅguṣṭhāṅgulibhirjapet |
aṅguṣthana vinā karma kṛtaṃ tadaphalaṃ bhavet ||

aṅgulīparvabhirmantraṃ japan nityaṃ prakalpayet |
tathā tantrāntare (-) anāmikādvayaṃ parva kaniṣṭhādikrameṇa tu |
tathā (-) anāmāmadhyamāparva meruṃ kṛtvā na laṅghayet ||

tarjanyagre madhyame ca yo japedatra sādhakaḥ |
catvāri tasya naśyanti āyurvidyā yaśo dhanam ||

tathā (-) ārabhyā'nāmikāmūlāt prādakṣiṇyakrameṇa tu |
madhyamāmūlaparyantaṃ japedaṣṭasu parvasu ||

anāmāmadhyamaṃ parva meruṃ kṛtvā na laṅghayet |

idaṃ ca tripurasundarībhinnaśakteraṣṭottaraśatasaṃkhyājapaviṣayam | 
śatamantrajape tu anāmāmadhyamārabhya tarjanīmūlaparyantaṃ daśadhā 
japamātraṃ bodhyam | tantrāntare (-)

anāmāmūlamārabhya prādakṣiṇyakrameṇa tu |
tarjanīmūlaparyantaṃ japen navasu parvasu ||

madhyamātritayagrāhyamanāmāmūlameva ca |
anāmāmadhyamaṃ caikaṃ meruṃ kṛtvā na laṅghayet ||

idaṃ ca dvādaśāvṛtyā aṣṭottaraśatasaṃkhyajapaparam | saundaryā tu yāmale (-)

anāmāmadhyamāyāśca mūlāgraṃ tu dvayaṃ dvayam |
kaniṣṭhāyāśca tarjanyāstrayaṃ parva maheśvari ||

anāmāmadhyamāyāśca meruṃ syād dvitayaṃ śubham |
pradakṣiṇakramād devi japet tripurasundarīm ||

vaiṣṇavādau tu sanatkumārasaṃhitāyām (-)

anāmāmadhyamārabhya kaniṣṭhādita eva ca |
tarjanīmūlaparyantaṃ daśaparvasu saṃjapet ||

tathā (-) aṅgulīrna viyuñjīta japakāle kadācana |
aṅgulīnāṃ viyogena chidreṣu sravate japaḥ ||

nollaṅghayecca gaṇanāṃ kiñcit saṃkocayet talam |
nityaṃ japaṃ kare kuryān na tu kāmyaṃ kadācana ||

<225> kāmyamapi kare kuryād yadi mālā na vidyate |
na vidyata iti | na vihitā'stītyarthaḥ | ata eva kulāmṛte (-)

śuddhirūpā yadā devī manaḥpīṭhārcanaṃ tadā |
pūrvameva mayā proktaṃ sahomaṃ te viśeṣataḥ ||

varṇamayyā manomayyā japo mānasa ucyate |
mālayā devadeveśi mokṣadaḥ kāmadastathā ||

citirūpā yadā devī kulakuṇḍalinī parā |
yantre pūjā tadā jñeyā homakuṇḍe vidhīyate ||

maṇyādi guṭikāmayyā japaścaivākṣamālayā |
upāṃśuḥ syān mahādevi śīghrasiddhipradāyakaḥ ||

yonirūpā yadā devī pūjayed yonimaṇḍale |
homastatraiva deveśi maithunena vidhānataḥ ||

japaḥ kāryo maheśāni tathaiva karamālayā |

ityuktam | kulamūlāvatāre (-)

maṇayaḥ śaṅkhasambhūtāḥ proktā lakṣmīpradāyakāḥ |
muktipradāḥ sphaṭikajāḥ padmākṣāḥ puṣṭivardhanāḥ ||

bhuktimuktipradāḥ puṇyā rudrākṣāḥ sarvasiddhidāḥ |
putrajīvabhavāḥ putrapaśudhānyarddhisiddhidāḥ ||

vidrumotthāśca maṇayo dhanasaubhāgyavaśyadāḥ |
mauktikā muktidāḥ proktāstathā sarvasamṛddhidāḥ ||

pāpāpahāḥ kuśamayāḥ kāmadāḥ svarṇarūpyajāḥ |
śāradātilake (-) rudrākṣamālikā sūte japena svamanorathān |
padmākṣairvihitā mālā śatrūṇāṃ nāśinī matā ||

kuśagranthīmayī mālā sarvapāpapraṇāśinī |
putrajīvaphalaiḥ kḷptā kurute putrasampadam ||

nirmitā rupyamaṇibhirjapamālepsitapradā |
hiraṇmayairviracitā mālā kāmān prayacchati ||

prabālairvihitā mālā prayacchet puṣkalaṃ dhanam |
saubhāgyaṃ sphāṭikī mālā mauktikairvihitā śriyam ||

nirmitā śaṅkhamaṇibhiḥ kurute kīrtimavyayām |
<226> sarverebhirviracitā mālā syān muktaye nṝṇām ||

etena (-) indrākṣairyadi japyeta rudrākṣaiḥ sphāṭikaistathā |
nānyanmadhye prayoktavyaṃ putrajīvādikaṃ ca yat ||

yadyanyat tu prayuñjīta mālāyāṃ japakarmaṇi |
tasya kāmaṃ ca mokṣaṃ ca na dadāti priyaṃkarī ||

janmāntare jāyate ca sarvo vedāntapāragaḥ |
mitralābhaṃ tato devi caṇḍālaiḥ pāpakarmabhiḥ ||

ityuttaratantravacanaṃ samastavyatiriktakiñcitprakṣepaparamiti jñeyam | nāradaḥ (-)

kuśagranthyā japed vipraḥ suvarṇamaṇibhirnṛpaḥ |
putrajīvairjaped vaiśyaḥ padmākṣaiḥ sarva eva ca ||

tantre (-) tathāmalakasambhūtaistulasīkāṣṭhanirmitaiḥ |
ebhiśca mālikāṃ kuryān matimān vaiṣṇave manau ||

gopālasya śuklapadmākṣaṃ praśastam samāhitamanāḥ 
śuklapadmabījākṣamālayeti gautamavacanāt | nāradapañcarātre (-)

japasya gaṇanaṃ prāhuḥ padmākṣairbhaktivardhanaiḥ |

yastu bhagavato bhūtvetyupakramya rudrākṣaiścottameti varāhavacanāt 
vaiṣṇavānāmapi rudrākṣamālā praśastā | rudrākṣamālayā divā 
śaktimantrajapo niṣiddhaḥ | taduktaṃ 

yoginītantre (-) rudrākṣaiḥ śaktimantrastu ahni yo japati priye |
sa durgatimavāpnoti niṣphalastasya tajjapaḥ ||

iti bhairavīvidyāyām | vārāhītantre (-)

suvarṇamaṇibhirmālāṃ sphāṭikīṃ śaṅkhanirmitām |
prabālaireva vā kuryāt putrajīvaṃ vivarjayet ||

padmākṣaiścaiva rudrākṣamindrākṣaṃ ca viśeṣataḥ |

atha mālāsaṃskārakālaḥ

yoginītantre (-) dvādaśyāṃ vaiṣṇavī mālā kartavyā sādhakottamaiḥ |
mantrajñairviṣṇumantreṇa divyabhāge prayatnataḥ |

divyabhāge pūrvāhne | tathā (-)

śaktīnāmapi karttavyā bhuktvā rātrau yathāvidhi |
aṣṭamyāṃ ca navamyāṃ ca caturdaśyāṃ tathaiva ca ||

trayodaśyāṃ tathā kuryācchivasyā'pi sureśvari |

<227> atha mālāsaṃskāraḥ

yoginītantre (-) paṭṭasūtrakṛtā mālā devyāḥ prītikarī sadā |
kārpāsairvaiṣṇavī mālā padmasūtrairathāpi vā ||

ūrṇābhirvalkalenā'pi śaivī mālā praśasyate |

kārpāsasūtre viśeṣa ukta umāmaheśvarasaṃvāde (-)

yā jīvavatsakā nārī sundarī pativallabhā |
tayā karttitasūtreṇa vyūḍhā mālā śubhāvahā ||

marusūtreṇa paṭṭena trasareṇa vinirmitā |
nirmitā svarṇarajataiḥ svarṇenāpi śubhāvahā ||

kanyākartitasūtreṇa grathitā guruṇā svayam |
maṇḍalīkṛtagopuccharūpadhṛṅ mālikā śubhā ||

hāridraṃ sarvathā sūtraṃ grāmakārpāsasambhavam |
caitrakārpāsajaṃ vātha tyajed granthanakarmaṇi ||

yoginītantre (-) tato dvijendrapuṇyastrīnirmitaṃ granthivarjitam |
triguṇaṃ triguṇīkṛtya sūtraṃ prakṣālayet tataḥ ||

prakṣālayet pañcagavyena | pañcagavyaiśca kṣālayediti vacanāt | tantre (-)

gomūtraṃ gomayaṃ kṣīraṃ dadhi sarpiḥ kuśodakam |
pañcagavyamiti proktaṃ mahāpātakanāśanam || iti |

pañcagavyaparimāṇaṃ tu (-) gautamīye (-)

palamātraṃ dugdhabhāgaṃ gomutraṃ tāvadiṣyate |
ghṛtaṃ ca palamātraṃ syād gomayaṃ(?) tolakadvayam ||

dadhi prasṛtimātraṃ syāt pañcagavyamidaṃ smṛtam |
athavā pañcagavyānāṃ samāno bhāga ucyate ||

ekabhuktiṃ vidhāyādau sādhako grathayet svayam |
kṛtanityakriyaḥ śuddha ukteṣvakṣeṣu mantravit ||

yathākāmaṃ yathālābhamakṣāṇyānīya yatnataḥ |
anyonyasamarūpāṇi nātisthūlakṛśāni ca ||

kīṭādibhiraduṣṭāni na jīrṇāni navāni vai |
gavyaistu pañcabhistāni prakṣālya tu pṛthak pṛthak ||

ādau pūrvadinai śaktivyatiriktaparamiti jñeyam |
<228> aśvatthapatrairnavakaiḥ padmākāreṇa kalpite |
sūtre maṇīṃśca gandhādbhiḥ kṣālitāṃstatra niḥkṣipet ||

tāraṃ śaktiṃ mātṛkāśca sūtre caiva maṇiṣvatha |
vinyasya pūjayedājyairjuhuyāccaiva śaktitaḥ ||

tathā (-) maṇimekaikamādāya sūtre tatra tu yojayet ||

tantrāntare tu (-) ekaikaṃ mātṛkāvarṇaṃ satāraṃ prajapan sudhīḥ |
maṇimādāya sūtreṇa grathayen madhyamadhyataḥ ||

brahmagranthiṃ vidhāyetthaṃ meruṃ ca granthisaṃyutam |
grathayitvā puro mālāṃ tataḥ saṃskāramārabhet ||

gautamīye yāmale ca (-) evaṃ vidhāya mālāṃ vai śodhayet parameśvari |
aśvatthapatranavakaiḥ padmākāraṃ tu kalpayet ||

tanmadhye sthāpayen mālāṃ mātṛkāṃ mūlamuccaran |
kṣālayet pañcagavyena sadyojātena sajjalaiḥ ||

tantre (-) pratyekaṃ mantrayen mantrī pañcamena sakṛt sakṛt |
gautamīye (-) samudāyamālāmadhikṛtya (-)

pañcamenaiva mantreṇa śatān nyūnena mantrayet | ityuktam |
māle māle mahāmāle sarvatattvasvarūpiṇi |
caturvargastvayi nyastastasmānme siddhidā bhava ||

māyābījādikaṃ kṛtvā raktapuṣpaiḥ samarcayet |
mantrayen mūlamantreṇa krameṇotkramayogataḥ ||

tathaiva mātṛkāvarṇairmantrayen mantratattvavit |
yoginītantre (-) homakarma tataḥ kuryād devatābhāvasiddhaye |
aṣṭottaraśataṃ hutvā sampātājyaṃ viniḥkṣipet ||

homakarmaṇyasaktaśced dviguṇaṃ japamācaret |
tvaṃ māle sarvalokānāṃ sarvasiddhipradā matā ||

tena satyena me siddhiṃ dehi mātarnamo'stu te |
ityuktvā paripūjyā'tha gopayed yatnato gṛhī |
śaivāgame (-) gopucchasadṛśī kāryā ekāgrīvā samerukā |
uttaratantre (-) eko merustatra deyaḥ sarvebhyaḥ sthūlasambhavaḥ |
vinyaset kramatastasmāt sarpākārā ca sā yataḥ ||

<229> brahmagranthiyutaṃ kuryāt pratibījaṃ yathāvidhi |
athavā granthirahitaṃ dṛḍharajjusamanvitam ||

trirāvṛttyātha madhyena cārdhāvṛttyā'ntadeśataḥ |
granthiḥ pradakṣiṇāvarto brahmagranthiritīritaḥ ||

rudrākṣe tu viśeṣaḥ (-) kālottare uktaḥ (-)

skanda uvāca (-)

deva deva mahādeva sṛṣṭisthitilayeśvara |
rudrākṣairjapamālā tu kathaṃ kuryān maheśvara ||

saṃskāraśca kathaṃ nātha kartavyaḥ kīdṛśaṃ phalam |

īśvara uvāca (-)

śṛṇu ṣaṇmukha vakṣyāmi rudrākṣaiḥ kriyate yathā |
japamālā vidhānena yena sā japasiddhidā ||

ekavaktrairdvivaktraiśca caturvaktraiśca pañcabhiḥ |
ṣaḍvaktrairvātha karttavyā mitho miśrāṃstu varjayet ||

mukhe mukhaṃ tu kartavyaṃ pucchaṃ pucche tu yojayet |
dhātrīphalapramāṇena śreṣṭhametadudāhṛtam ||

vadarāṇḍapramāṇena na kārye madhyamādhame |
navatritantunā cainad grathanīyaṃ samaṃ spṛśan ||

asyordhvavaktraṃ mervākhyaṃ karttavyaṃ tanna laṅghayet |
kṣālayet sadyojātena vāmadevena gharṣayet ||

dhūpayedatha ghoreṇa lepayet tatpuruṣeṇa tu |
mantrayet pañcamenaiva pratyekaṃ tu śataṃ śatam ||

meruṃ ca pañcamenaiva tathā ghoreṇa mantrayet |
mudrāṣṭakaṃ darśayitvā pratyekaṃ pūjayet kramāt ||

grathitaṃ pañcabhiḥ pūjyaṃ pūrvavacca yathāvidhi |
rudrākṣāṇāmayaṃ proktaḥ saṃskāraḥ śrutinoditaḥ ||

itareṣu ca tantroktaḥ karttavyo guhasādhakaiḥ |

kṣālayet pañcagavyeneti śeṣaḥ |

kṣālayet pañcagavyena sadyojātena sajjalaiḥ |

iti vacanād | gharṣayeccandanāgurugandhādyairiti | 
lepayeccandanasaugandhikastūrī kuṅkumādibhiriti | 
<230> mudrāṣṭakamāvāhanyādikam | anantaraṃ pūjābhidhānāt | 
anyamaṇyādiṣvapyayaṃ saṃskāra iti vadanti | prakārāntaramāha yoginītantre (-)

ukteṣvṛkṣeṣvuktamantrairgrathitāṃ sādhakottamaḥ |
mālāṃ nidhāya vai pātre kvacid gandhādicarcitām ||

bhūtaśuddhyādikāṃ pūjāṃ samāpya tatra pūjayet |
gaṇeśasūryaviṣṇvīśa durgāścāvāhya pūjayet ||

tantramālāyām (-)

pañcagavyena tāṃ siktvā hauṃmantraṇa ca mantrayet |
tasmāduttolya tāṃ mālāṃ svarṇapātre nidhāya ca ||

payo dadhi ghṛta kṣaudra śarkarādyairanukramāt |
tato dhūpāntaraiḥ kṛtvā pañcāmṛtavidhiṃ budhaḥ ||

kramāt tatraiva saṃsthāpya snāpayecchītalodakaiḥ |
tataścandanasaugandhikastūrīkuṅkumādibhiḥ ||

tāmālipya japed hsaurmantramaṣṭottaraṃ śatam |
tasyāṃ navagrahān paṅktiṃ dikpālāṃśca prapūjayet ||

tataḥ sampūjya ca guruṃ gṛhṇīyān mālikāṃ śubhām |

bhairavītantre (-) ādau gaṇapatiṃ devaṃ sūryaṃ viṣṇumumāpatim |
durgāṃ ca pūjayed vidvān mālāyāṃ susamāhitaḥ ||

pañcagavye kṣipen mālāṃ prāsādenā'bhimantrayet |
uttolya ca tato mālāṃ sthāpayeddhemapātrake ||

pañcāmṛtena saṃsthāpya śītalena jalena ca |
candanena sugandhena kastūrīkuṅkumādibhiḥ ||

abhiṣekaṃ tataḥ kṛtvā mantreṇā'nena mantravit |
prāṇaṃ jīvasamārūḍhamaukārasvarabhūṣitam ||

bindunādasamāyuktaṃ mantrarājaṃ pravinyaset |
navagrahān pūjayitvā tato dikpālapūjanam |
tilena ghṛtayuktena śaktito homayet tataḥ |

pravinyaset aṣṭottaraśatakṛtvaḥ | prāṇo hakāraḥ | jīvaḥ sakāraḥ |
kubjikātantre (-) śilpinaṃ pūjayedādau vastragandhānulepanaiḥ |
saṃhṛṣṭaḥ kārayen mālāṃ viśuddhāṃ varṇarūpiṇīm ||

<231> yathā yogyaṃ vedhavatīṃ mālāṃ kuryād vicakṣaṇaḥ |

varṇarūpiṇīṃ pañcāśadbījarūpātmikāṃ parām |

varṇamānena sā kāryā pañcagavyaṃ tryahaṃ kṣipet |
sūtraṃ vāpi caturthe'hni kṣālayedatra mantrakaiḥ ||

samānavarṇasūtreṇa grathayet hṛdayāṇunā |
suvarṇādiguṇairvāpi grathayet sādhakottamaḥ |
brahmagranthiṃ tato dadyān nāgapāśamathāpi vā ||

kavacena ca grathnīyān mālāṃ dhyānaparāyaṇaḥ |
sarvaśeṣe tato meruṃ sūtradvayasamanvitam ||

grathayet tārayogena badhnīyāt sādhakottamaḥ |
evaṃ niṣpādya deveśi pratiṣṭhāṃ ca samācaret ||

sthaṇḍile maṇḍalaṃ kṛtvā yathābhāgavidhikramāt |
pūjayitvā yathānyāyamiṣṭadevamanukramāt ||

nyāyapūrvaṃ japen mantramaṣṭottarasahasrakam |
juhuyācca daśāṃśena yasya devasya yat priyam ||

tato maṇḍalamadhye tu tāṃ mālāṃ sthāpayed budhaḥ |
astramantraṃ tato nyasya daivavat paricintayet ||

abhedarūpamāsādya mālāṃ kuryāt tathātmikām |
tato baliṃ yathānyāṃ dadhyannaiḥ sādhakottamaḥ ||

evaṃ pratiṣṭhāmāpādya mālāyāmiṣṭadevatām |
ācāryaṃ pūjayen mantrī śilpinaṃ ca yathāvidhi ||

nānyamantraṃ japet tatra yadīcchet siddhimātmanaḥ |
astrādirjaptavyamantrasya grāhyaḥ | baliṃ mālāyāḥ | tairhomadravyaiḥ | 
tathottaratantre (-)

dṛḍhaṃ sūtraṃ niyuñjīta jape tryuṭyati no yathā ||
jīrṇe sūtre punaḥ sūtraṃ yojayitvā śataṃ japet ||

śaivāgame (-) yadā saṃtryuṭyate mālā granthayitvā ca pūrvavat |
pratiṣṭhitāyāṃ tasyāṃ tu mantraṃ japyādananyadhīḥ ||

nāradīye (-) akṣasūtraṃ tu nipated bhūmau ced kurvato japam |
uddhāraṃ tasya kurvīta jāpako hṛdayena tu ||

hṛdayena nama iti mantreṇa | rudrayāmale (-)

<232> nākṣaterhastapavairvā na dhānyairna ca puṣpakaḥ |
na candanairmṛttikayā japasaṃkhyāṃ tu kārayet ||

lākṣā kuśīda sindūraṃ gomayaṃ ca karīṣakam |
viloḍya guṭikāṃ kṛtvā japasaṃkhyāṃ tu kārayet ||

nāradīye (-) anāmikāyāṃ saṃveśya karayorubhayorapi |
japaṃ kurvanna kurvīta saṃkhyāgranthikabandhanam ||

kurute yaḥ kṣaredasya na kṛte tu śataṃ japet |

atha sampradāyasiddho rahasyamālāsaṃskāravidhiḥ

oṃ hrīṃ śrīṃ hrīṃ klīṃ hūṃ phaṭ svāhā iti mantreṇa saptadhābhimantrya 
navake(?) nikṣipet | tata āvāhanādimantrādibhirbhagavatīmāvāhya saparivārāṃ 
ṣoḍaśopacārairabhyarcya mūlamāvartya tārtīyaṃ bījamanusmaran 
dhenumudrayā'mṛtīkṛtya kavacenā'vaguṇṭhya mahāmudrayā tadācchādayan 
devīrūpāṃ tāṃ mālāṃ dhyāyan binduprakṣepaṃ kuryāt | tatra mantraḥ oṃ 
hrīṃ svāhā oṃ hūṃ svāhā oṃ phaṭ svāhā oṃ strīṃ svāhā oṃ hrīṃ hūṃ 
svāhā oṃ phaṭ svāhā | anena śatadhā binduprakṣepaṃ kuryāt | 
kastūrikāgurusudhākarairdhūpādikaṃ ca dattvā caṣakāduttārya ebhirmantrayet 
| tatra mantraḥ (-) oṃ hrīṃ śrīṃ mahāvajriṇi mahāghorakarkaśamahāsthimaṇḍale 
praviśa sarvasiddhiṃ prayaccha | oṃ hūṃ hrīṃ hrīṃ svāhā mahākapālini 
mahāghorarūpe svāhā | oṃ hrīṃ hrīṃ hūṃ phaṭ svāhā | 
dūrvākṣatairabhyarcya kandarpabījenoddīpanaṃ kṛtvā 
ṣoḍaśopacārairabhyarcya mātṛkāmantreṇa saṃdīpya hūṃkāreṇa veṣṭayitvā 
baliṃ dadyāt | tad yathā oṃ hrīṃ hrīṃ hūṃ oṃ hūṃ hūṃ oṃ hūṃ phaṭ hūṃ 
oṃ oṃ hūṃ svāhā oṃ hūṃ mahāyogini tribhuvanatāriṇi 
mahāśaṅkhāsthimālāmadhye nivāsaṃ kuru sarvasiddhiṃ dehi dehi 
surāmāṃsopahārān gṛhṇa gṛhṇa gṛhṇāpaya gṛhṇāpaya hrīṃ strīṃ hūṃ 
phaṭ svāhā | anena yathoditadravyeṇa baliṃ dattvā devīṃ visarjya nibhṛtasthāne 
mālāṃ dhārayediti | mantratantraprakāśe (-)

aṣṭottarasahasraṃ tu kṛtvāntaryāgamādarāt |
japet pratidinaṃ yat tu nitya eṣa japaḥ smṛtaḥ ||

uttaratantre (-) na japet triśatān nyūnaṃ sādhakastu kadācana |
yoginītantre (-) aṣṭottaraśataṃ vāpi japānte śirasi kṣipet |
tvaṃ māle sarvadevānāṃ prītidā śubhadā mama ||

śivaṃ kuruṣva me bhadre yaśo vīryaṃ ca sarvadā |

śaivāgame (-) aṣṭottarasahasraṃ tu tadardhaṃ triśataṃ tu vā |
<233> aṣṭottaraśata vāpi japen nityamatandritaḥ ||

japaśca dhyānapūrvakaṃ karttavyaḥ | taduktaṃ nīlatantre (-)

mantradhyānaṃ pravakṣyāmi japāt sarvajñadāyakam |
mantradhyānān maheśāni sidhyate brahmahā yataḥ ||

mūlacakre tu hṛllekhāṃ sūryakoṭisamaprabhām |
svādhiṣṭhāne pītavarṇaṃ dvitīyaṃ paribhāvayet ||

nābhau jīmūtavarṇābhaṃ kūrcabījaṃ mahāprabham |
mantrī candrapratīkāśaṃ yogibhirdṛṣṭapūrvakam ||

kūrcabījaṃ hṛdi dhyāyet kālāgnisadṛśaprabham |
athavā pūrṇacandrābhaṃ kūrcaṃ mūrdhni sudhāprabham ||

tatprabhāpaṭalairjihvāṃ pradīptāṃ ca vibhāvayet |
mūlādibrahmarandhrāntaṃ sarvāṃ vidyāṃ vibhāvayet |
sūryakoṭipratīkāśāṃ yogibhirdṛṣṭapūrvikām |

hṛllekhā māyābījam | anyatrāpi (-)

sthānasthā varadā mantrā dhyānasthāśca phalapradāḥ |
dhyānasthānavinirmuktāḥ susiddhāḥ api vairiṇaḥ ||

prasaṅgenaiva tatsthānaṃ kathayāmi na saṃśayaḥ |
sakalaṃ niṣkalaṃ sūkṣmaṃ tathā sakalaniṣkalam ||

kalābhinnaṃ kalātītaṃ ṣoḍhāmantraṃ śivo'vravīt |
sakalaṃ brahmarandhrasthaṃ tadadho viddhi niṣkalam ||

bindusthitaṃ kalābhinnaṃ kalātītaṃ tadūrdhvataḥ |
kalā kuṇḍalinī saiva nādaśaktiḥ śivoditā ||

etatsthānasthitā mantrāḥ sthānasthāḥ parikīrtitāḥ |
manasā manavo dhyeyāḥ kuṇḍalinyāṃ samāhitaiḥ ||

tatastāṃ bhāvayed bindau dhyānasthāḥ parikīrtitāḥ |

japalakṣaṇamuktaṃ puraścaraṇacandrikāyām (-)

japaḥ syādakṣarāvṛttistasya bhedān vravīmyaham |
japaśca dvividhaḥ prokto vāciko mānasastathā ||

ādyo'pyupāṃśuruccaiśca dvividhaḥ parikīrtitaḥ |
dvitīyo'tha dvidhā jñeyo jihvācittaprabhedataḥ ||

 <234> mantramuccārayed vācā sa ukto vāciko japaḥ |
śannairuccārayen mantramīṣadoṣṭhau pracālayet ||

kiñcicchravaṇayogyaḥ syādupāṃśuḥ sa japaḥ smṛtaḥ |
jihvājapaḥ sa vijñeyaḥ kevalaṃ jihvayā tu yaḥ ||

dhiyā yaduccaren mantraṃ sa ukto mānaso japaḥ |
uccairjapād viśiṣṭaḥ syādupāṃśurdaśabhirguṇaiḥ ||

jihvājapaḥ śataguṇaḥ sahasro mānaso japaḥ |
devatāṃ hṛdgatāṃ kṛtvā hṛdayaṃ ca sthiraṃ nijam ||

śivādīṃśca gurūn natvā japen mantraṃ samāhitaḥ |
śanaiḥ śanairavispaṣṭaṃ na drutamavilambitam ||

tathā (-) uṣṇīṣī kacukī nagno muktakeśo galāvṛtaḥ |
aprāvṛtakaro'śuddhaḥ pralapan na japen manum ||

aprāvṛttau karau kṛtvā śirasā pravṛto'pi vā |
citāṃ vyākulacitto vā kruddho bhrāntastvarānvitaḥ ||

nirāsanaḥ śayāno vā gacchannutthita eva vā |
rathyāyāmaśirasthāne na japet timirāvṛte ||

upānadgūḍhapādo vā yānaśayyāgato'pi vā |

na japedityanuṣaṅgaḥ |

patitānāmantyajānāṃ darśane bhāṣaṇe śrute |
kṣute'dhovāyugamane jṛmbhāyāṃ japamutsṛjet ||

utthāyācamya tatprānte prāṇāyāmaṣaḍaṅgakam |
kṛtvācamya careccheṣaṃ yadvā sūryādidarśanam ||

caredityanuṣaṅgaḥ | kālītantre (-)

tejomayaṃ japaphalaṃ devyā haste samarpayet |
guhyātiguhyagoptrī tvamiti mantreṇa mantravit ||

mantrastu (-) guhyātiguhyagoptrī tvaṃ gṛhāṇāsmatkṛtaṃ japam |
siddhirbhavatu me mātastvatprasādān maheśvari ||

iti tantrāntarasiddhaḥ | imaṃ mantramuktvā somaśambhuḥ (-)

bhogaślokaṃ paṭhitvā ca dakṣahastena śambhave |
mūlamantrārghyatoyena varahaste samarpayet ||

<235> śambhave ityupalakṣaṇam | yā yatra devatā sā tatra bodhyā | varahaste 
pradhānahaste | tena puṃdevatāyā dakṣiṇahaste strīdevatāyā vāmahaste 
samarpayediti | devīnāṃ vāmahaste tu devānāṃ dakṣiṇe'rpayediti 
yāmalavacanāt | śaivāgame (-)

itthaṃ japaṃ samarpyā'tha ghaṇṭāvādanapūrvakam |
stuvīta stutibhiḥ samyak sādhako bhaktisaṃyutaḥ ||

stavaśca brahmasaṃhitokto dhyānaprakaraṇe proktaḥ | kavacaṃ 
tryailokyavijayākhyamagre vakṣyate | sahasranāmastotraṃ tu rudrayāmale (-)

kailāśanagare devaṃ mahādevaṃ maheśvaram |
bhavānī rahasi prītyā papraccha varadāyakam ||

devyuvāca (-) kathamīśāna sarvajña labhante śaktimuttamām |
sādhakāḥ sarvadā yena tanme kathaya suprabho ||

īśvara uvāca (-)

vinā pūjāṃ vinā dhyānaṃ vinā japaṃ vinā balim |
labhante yena kalyāṇi tanme nigaditaṃ śṛṇu ||

nāmnāṃ sahasraṃ tārāyāḥ kathayiṣyāmyaśeṣataḥ |
śṛṇu devi sadā bhaktyā bhaktānāṃ paramaṃ hitam ||

vinā pūjopacāreṇa vinā japen yat phalam |
tat phalaṃ sakalaṃ devi kathayiṣyāmi tacchṛṇu ||

oṃ yasyāḥ śrītārādevyā bhaktikulasarvasvanāmastotrasya śrītārādevatā sarva 
kāmārthe jape viniyogaḥ |

tārā rātrirmahārātriḥ kālarātriḥ kapālinī |
kālikā kāmadā māyā mahāmāyā mahotsavā ||

mahādānaratā yajñā yajñotsavavibhūṣitā |
candravaktrā cakorākṣī cārunetrā sulocanā ||

trinetrā padmapatrākṣī kuraṅgākṣī manoharā |
brāhmī nārāyaṇī jyotsnā cārukeśī sulocanā ||

vārāhī vāruṇī vidyā mahāvidyā maheśvarī |
piṅgā kuñcitakeśī ca mahāyajñasvarūpiṇī ||

gaurī campakavarṇā ca kṛśāṅgī kūlapūjitā |
sarvānandasvarūpā ca sarvasaṅkaṭatāriṇī ||

<236> nityā nityamayī nandā bhadrā nīlasarasvatī |
gāyatrī sucaritrā ca kaulavrataparāyaṇā ||

hiraṇyagarbhā bhūgarbhā viśvagarbhā yaśasvinī |
himavattanayā divyā divyāmbaravibhūṣaṇā ||

jaganmātā jagaddhātrī jagatāmupakāriṇī |
saindrī saumyā tathā yāmyā vāruṇī vāyavī tathā ||

āgneyī nairṛtī caiva aiśānī caṇḍikā'mbikā |
sumerutanayā bandyā sarveṣāmupakāriṇī ||

lalajjihvā sarojākṣī muṇḍasrajavibhūṣaṇā |
sarvānandamayī sarvā sarvānandasvarūpiṇī ||

dhṛtirmedhā tathā lakṣmīḥ śraddhāpannagaśāyinī |
rukmiṇī jānakī durgā satyā satyavatī ratiḥ ||

kāmākhyā mokṣadānandā nārasiṃhī sarasvatī |
mahādevaratā caṇḍī caṇḍadordaṇḍakhaṇḍinī ||

dīrghakeśī sukeśī ca piṅgakeśī mahatkacā |
bhavānī bhavapatnī ca bhavabhītiharā śacī ||

paurandarī tathā viṣṇorjāyā māheśvarī parā |
sarveṣāṃ jananī nityā cārvaṅgī daityanāśinī ||

ghorarūpā maheśāni kāminī varavarṇinī |
mahāvidyā mahāmāyā mahāmedhā mahotsavā ||

virūpā viśvarūpā ca mṛḍānī mṛḍavallabhā |
mahāpuṇyapradā bhīmā madhukaiṭabhanāśinī ||

koṭicandrapratīkāśā śatasūryasamaprabhā |
jahnukanyā manojñā ca pārvatī haravallabhā ||

kāmarūpā maheśānī nityotsāhā manasvinī |
vaikuṇṭhanāthapatnī ca tathā śaṅkaravallabhā ||

kāśyapī kamalā kṛṣṇā kañjapatrāyatekṣaṇā |
māheśvarī vṛṣārūḍhā pūrṇacandranibhānanā ||

mānyā mānavatī dhanyā kanyā himagirestathā |
aparṇā padmapatrākṣī nāgayajñopavītinī ||

<237> mahāśaṅkhadharā kāntā kamanīyā nagātmajā |
brahmāṇī vaiṣṇavī śambhorjāyā gaṅgā jaleśvarī ||

bhāgīrathī manobuddhinityānandamayī sadā |
harapriyā girisutā harapatnī tapasvinī ||

mahāvyādhiharā devī śumbhāsuraniṣūdinī |
mahāpuṇyapradā bhīmā madhukaiṭabhanāśinī ||

śaṅkhinī cakriṇī dhātrī haste pustakadhāriṇī |
cāmuṇḍā capalā tuṅgā bhadrā daityanikṛntanī ||

śāntirnidrā mahānidrā guhyanidrā ca reṇukā |
kaumārī kulajā kuntī kaulavrataparāyaṇā ||

navadurgā sadācārā draupadī drupadātmajā |
sṛṣṭiḥ sarvādyakālīnā niśumbhaprāṇanāśinī ||

padminī vasudhā pṛthvī rohiṇī vindhyavāsinī |
śivā śaktirmahāśaktiḥ sāṅkarī śaktivallabhā ||

daityaprāṇaharā dātrī dayā dāmodarapriyā |
kṣāntiḥ kṣemakarī buddhirbauddhācāraparāyaṇā ||

śrīvidyā bhairavī bhavyā bhāratī bhayanāśinī |
tāpasī tāriṇī tīkṣṇā tīkṣṇadaityavināśinī ||

dātrī dānaparā kālī durgā daityavināśinī |
padmā padmāvatī hṛṣṭā tuṣṭā puṣṭā tathorvaśī ||

vajriṇī vajrahastā ca tathā nārāyaṇī śivā |
khaṇḍinī khaḍgahastā ca kartṛkharparadhāriṇī ||

devāṅganā devamānyā devakanyā pulomajā |
sukhinī sukhadātrī ca sarvasaukhyavivardhinī ||

śīlā śīlāvatī sūkṣmā sūkṣmākārā varapradā |
vareṇyā varadā vāṇī jñāninī jñānadā'malā ||

ugrakālī mahākālī bhadrakālī ca dakṣiṇā |
bhṛguvaṃśasamudbhūtā bhārgavī bhṛguvallabhā ||

śūlinī śūlahastā ca mayūravaravāhanā |
mahāmāṃsaratā raktā raktakharparadhāriṇī ||

<238> raktāmbaradharā rāmā ramaṇī suranāyikā |
paramānandadā jyeṣṭhā yoginīgaṇasevitā ||

ambā jāmbavatī satyā satyabhāmā nagātmajā |
raudrī raudrasvanā raudrā raudradaityavināśinī ||

kumārī kauśikī vidyā kāladaityavināśinī |
śambhupatnī śambhuratā śambhujāyā mahodarī ||

śivapatnī śivaratā śivajāyāmbikā tathā |
harapatnī hararatā harajāyā ca śūlinī ||

madanāntakakāntā ca madanāntakavallabhā |
girijā girikanyā ca giriśasya ca vallabhā ||

bhūtabhavyā bhavā puṣṭā pāvanī paripālinī |
adṛśyā'vyaktarūpā ca iṣṭā sveṣṭapravardhinī ||

acyutā pracyutā prāṇā prāṇadā vāsaveśvarī |
apāṃnidhisamudbhūtā dhāriṇī ca pratiṣṭhitā ||

udbhavā kṣobhaṇā kṣemā śrīgarbhā parameśvarī |
karālā puṣṭadehā ca kāriṇī kañjalocanā ||

śaraṇyā kamalā prītā vimalānandavardhinī |
kapardinī kalpanābhā sumanānandavardhinī ||

udīrṇabhūṣaṇā bhavyā surasenā sureśvarī |
śrīmatī śiśirānandā śiśirācalakanyakā ||

suramānyā suraśreṣṭhā jyeṣṭhā prāṇeśvarī sthirā |
tamoghnī dhvāntasaṃhantrī prayatātmā pavitratā ||

pradyotinī rathārūḍhā sarvalokaprakāśinī |
medhāvinī mahāvīryā haṃsī saṃsāratāriṇī ||

praṇataprāṇināmārtihāriṇī daityanāśinī |
ḍākinī śākinī śīlā varakhaṭvāṅgadhāriṇī ||

kaumudī kumudā kundā kaulikā kulajātmajā |
garvitā guṇasampannā nagajā khagavāhinī ||

candrānanā mahogrā ca cārumūrdhajaśobhitā |
manojñā mādhavī mānyā mānanīyā mahadguṇā ||

<239> jyeṣṭhā maghā ca puṣyā ca dhaniṣṭhā pūrvaphālgunī |
raktabījādihantrī ca raktabījavināśinī ||

caṇḍamuṇḍārihantrī ca caṇḍamuṇḍavināśinī |
kartrī hartrī sukartrī ca vimalāmalavāhinī ||

nirmalā bhāskarī bhīmā mahiṣāsuraghātinī |
kālindī yamunā vṛddhā yuvatī bālakī tathā ||

kauśalyā kaumudī mādrī kandhatī cāpyarundhatī |
purārigṛhiṇī pūrṇā pūrṇarūpā yaśasvinī ||

sampūrṇacandravadanā vālacandrasamaprabhā |
revatī ramaṇī citrā vicitrāmbarabhūṣaṇā ||

vīṇā vīṇāvatī vidyā yaśodā ca yaśasvinī |
navapuṣpasamudbhūtā navapuṣpāsavotsukā ||

navapuṣpasrajā mālā mālyabhūṣaṇaśobhitā |
navapuṣpasamaprāṇā navapuṣpasamutsukā ||

navapuṣpātmakā puṣpā puṣpasrajavibhūṣaṇā |
navapuṣpaguṇopetā navapuṣpopaśobhitā ||

navapuṣpapriyā prītā premamaṇḍalamadhyagā |
kulaśāstrapradīptā ca kulamārgapravardhinī ||

śmaśānabhairavī kālabhairavī bhairavīpriyā |
ānandabhairavī dhyānabhairavī purabhairavī ||

mahābhairavapatnī ca bhairavī lokabhairavī |
suvidyā bhairavī nītirbhairavī guṇabhairavī ||

sammohabhairavī puṣṭibhairavī tuṣṭibhairavī |
sṛṣṭisthitibhairavī ca bhairavī sthitibhairavī ||

puṇḍarīkākṣagṛhiṇī puṇḍarīkākṣavallabhā |
ānandasundarī vīrasundarī sthitisundarī ||

ānandasundarī kālasundarī purasundarī |
yā māyā sundarī saumyā sundarī lokasundarī ||

yā vidyā sundarī nītisundarī guṇasundarī |
mallikāhārarasikā mallikāhāraśobhitā ||

<240> navacampakavarṇābhā nāgakeśaraśobhitā |
javākusumasaṅkāśā javākusumaśobhitā ||

priyā priyaṅkarī viṣṇordānavendravināśinī |
jñāneśvarī jñānadātrī jñānānandapradāyinī ||

guṇagauravasampannā guṇaśīlasamanvitā |
rūpayauvanasampannā rūpayauvanaśobhitā ||

guṇāśrayā guṇavatī guṇagauravasundarī |
lasattārāpatiprakhyā tāṭaṅkadvayaśobhitā ||

vṛkṣamūlasthitā devī vṛkṣaśākhoparisthitā |
vṛkṣamadhyāgranilaya vṛkṣamadhyānivāsinī ||

kumudvatī kumudinī kumudā kumudākarā |
kusumbharūparucirā kusumbhāruṇamastakā ||

svayambhūpuṣpasaṅkāśā svayambhūpuṣpadhāriṇī |
svayambhūpuṣpasarasā magnā dhyānavatī sadā ||

śukrapriyā śukraratā śukramajjanatatparā |
parṇā'parṇā suparṇā ca niṣpannā pāpanāśinī ||

madirā modasampannā madirā modadhāriṇī |
sarvāśrayā sarvaguṇānandakandalakāriṇī ||

nārīpuṣpasamaprāṇā nārīpuṣpasamutsukā |
nārī puṣpotsavā nārī nārīpuṣparatā mṛgī ||

caturbhujā daśabhujā aṣṭādaśabhujā tathā |
dvibhujā ṣaḍbhujāṣṭārapaṅkajā parisaṃsthitā ||

kauverī kauravī kaurvyā kurukullā kapālinī |
viparī kadalī jaṅghā rambhorūrāmavallabhā ||

niśācarī niśāmūrttirniśācandrasamaprabhā |
cāndrī candrakalā candrā cārucandrasamaprabhā ||

srotasvinī srotavatī sarvaduḥkhārtināśinī |
sarvādhārā sarvamayī sarvānandapravardhinī ||

sarvacakreśvarī sarvā sarvamantramayī sadā |
sahasranayanaprāṇā sahasranayanapriyā ||

<241> sahasraśīrṣā susamā sadambhā sarvabhakṣikā |
ṣaṣṭikā ṣaṭsucakrasthā ṣaḍvargaphaladāyinī ||

ṣaḍviṃśapadmamadhyasthā ṣaḍviṃśadalamadhyagā |
hakāravarṇanilayā hakārākṣarabhūṣitā ||

hāriṇī hāravanitā hārahīrakaśobhitā |
hrīṃkārabījasahitā hrīṃkārairupaśobhitā ||

kandarpasya kalā kulyā kaulinī kulatarpitā |
ketakī kusumaprāṇaketakī kṛtabhūṣaṇā ||

ketakīkusumāsaktā ketakīparibhūṣitā |
karpūrapūrṇavadanā kalānāthasamaprabhā ||

kalākelipriyā kīrṇakadambakusumotsukā |
kādambinī karigatiḥ kuñjareśvaragāminī ||

kharvā ca khañjanadvandvalocanā khaḍgabhūṣitā |
khadyota iva durlakṣyā khadyota iva cañcalā ||

gayā gadāguṇaprītā gītavādyapriyā gatiḥ |
gaṇeśvarī gaṇejyā ca gaṇapūjyā gaṇapradā ||

guṇāḍhyā guṇasampattirguṇadātrī guṇātmikā |
gurvī gurutarā gaurī gāṇapatyaphalapradā ||

dharmāṃśugṛhiṇī dharmā dharmasindhunivāsinī |
ghargharā ghoravadanā ghoradaityavināśinī ||

ghoṣā ghoṣavati ghoṣyā ghoṣaputrī ghanālayā |
carvarī cārunayanā cāruvaktrā caturguṇā ||

caturvedamayī cūrṇa candrāsyā caturānanā |
calaccakoranayanā calatkhañjanalocanā ||

caladambhojavadanā caladambhojaśobhitā |
chātrī chatrapriyā chatrā chatracāmaraśobhitā ||

chinnā chardichinnaśirā chinnanāsā chalānvitā |
chalādyā chalasantrasthā chalarūpā chalacchirā ||

chakāravarṇanilayā chakārādyā chalapriyā |
chadminī chadmaniratā chadmāchadmanivāsinī ||

<242> jagannāthapriyā jīvā jagannātharatā jarā |
jīrṇā jīmūtavanitā jīmūtairupaśobhitā ||

jāmātṛvaradā jṛmbhā jamalārjunadhāriṇī |
jarā jarānvitā jṛmbhā jambhārātivarapradā ||

jitā jayitrī jayadā jayadātrī jayapradā |
jhallarā jhītkṛtirjhillī jharī jharjharikā tathā ||

ṭāṅkārakāriṇī ṭītkākāriṇī ṭaṅkadhāriṇī |
ṭhakkurājñā ḍamarukarā ḍātkārī ḍamarupriyā ||

ḍhakkāravādyaḍhakkārī tulasī tālabhakṣikā |
tulā taulinikā tīrṇā tārā tāriṇīkā tathā ||

tantravijñā tantraratā tantravidyā ca tantradā |
tāntrikā tantragopyā ca tantrasārā ca tantrapā ||

tantradhātrī tantrakārī tantranārīratāturā |
tapaḥprabhāvā tantrajñā tantrasāraphalapradā ||

tapasyā taulinī tārtī tārtīyā tulasī tuṣā |
tuṣārakarapūrṇā syāt tuṣārakaramaṇḍitā ||

tuhināṃśusamābhāsā tuhināṃśusamaprabhā |
tuṣārakaratulyāṅgī tuṣārakarasundarī ||

tuṣāradhāmatulyāsyā tuṣārāṃśusamānanā |
tuhinādrisutā tārkṣā tālāṅgī tālavarjitā ||

tārasvareṇa sahitā tārasvaravibhūṣitā |
thakārakūṭanilayā thakārākṣaramālinī ||

dayāvatī dīnaratā duḥkhadāridryanāśinī |
daurbhāgyaduḥkhadalinī daurbhāgyāpadanāśinī ||

duhitā dīnabandhuśca dānavendravimardinī |
dānadātrī dānaparā dānasammānatoṣitā ||

dālbhyādisevitā dāntā dāmodaraparāyaṇā |
dadhīcī varadā duṣṭā dānavendavināśinī ||

dīrghanetrā dīrghakacā dīrghanāsā ca dīrghikā |
dāridryaduḥkhaśamanī duṣṭāsuraniṣūdinī ||

<243> dambhikā dambhahā dambhā danujendravināśinī |
dhanadhānyapradā dhanyā dhaneśvaravarapradā ||

dharmiṇī dharmikā dharmyā dharmādharmapravardhinī |
dharmeśvarī dharmadātrī dharmānandapravardhinī ||

dhanādhyakṣā dhanaprītā dhanāḍhyā dhanatoṣitā |
dhīrā dhairyavatī dhṛṣṇā dhavalāmbhojasannibhā ||

dhariṇī dhāriṇī dhātrī dhurīṇā dhavalāspadā |
dhārmikā dharmasahitā dharmanindakavarjitā ||

navīnā nirajā nimnā nimnanābhirnageśvarī |
nūtanāmbhojanayanā navīnāmbhojasundarī ||

nāgarī nāgarājejyā nāgarājasutā nagā |
nāgarājapatirnagnā nāgarājavibhūṣitā ||

nageśvarī nagārūḍhā nagarājakuleśvarī |
navīnendukalānandā nandīkeśvaravallabhā ||

nīrajā nīrajākṣī ca nīrajadvandvalocanā |
nīrasūtā nīrabhavā nīranirmaladehinī ||

nāgayajñopavītāḍhyā nāgayajñopavītikā |
nāgakesarasantuṣṭā nāgakesaramālinī ||

navīnaketakīkundamandārasrajabhūṣitā |
nāyikā nāyakaprītā nāyakaprematoṣitā ||

nāyakapremasahitā nāyakaprematoṣitā |
nāyakānandanilayā nāyakānandakāriṇī ||

narmakarmaratā nidrā narmakarmaparāyaṇā |
narmakarmapriyā narmā narmadharmaparāyaṇā ||

narmaprītā narmaratā narmadhyānaparāyaṇā |
narmakarmaikasahitā narmakarmaikapālikā ||

naranārīguṇaprītā naranārīvarapradā |
nārāyaṇapriyā niṣkā niṣkavarṇā nakārahā ||

puṣpapriyā puṣparatā pauṣpīpānaparāyaṇā |
puṣpaprītā ca puṣpejyā puṣpadāmavibhūṣaṇā ||

<244> puṇyadā pūrṇimā puṇyā puṇyakoṭiphalapradā |
purāṇāgamavedyā ca purāṇāgamagopitā ||

purāṇāgamagopyā ca purāṇāgamatoṣitā |
purāṇagocarā pūrvā pūrṇā proḍhavināśinī ||

prahlādahṛdayāhlādagehinī puṇyacāriṇī |
phālgunī phālgunaprītā phālgunapremadhāriṇī ||

phalguphalapradā caiva phaṇirājavibhūṣitā |
phaṇākārā phaṇiprītā phaṇihāravibhūṣitā ||

phaṇīśakṛtasarvāṅgabhūṣaṇā phaṇivāhinī |
phaṇiprītā phaṇiratā phaṇikaṅkaṇadhāriṇī ||

phaladātrī phalāsaktā phalābharaṇabhūṣitā |
phakārakūṭasarvāṅgī phālgunānandavardhinī ||

vāsudevaratā vijñā vijñavijñānakāriṇī |
vīṇāvatī balākīrṇā bālapīyūṣarociṣā ||

bālā vasumatī vidyā vidyāhāravibhūṣitā |
vidyāvatī vaidyapadā prītā vaivasvatī baliḥ ||

vāṇī vilāsakaraṇī varāṅgasthā varānanā |
viṣṇorvakṣasthalasthā ca vāgvatī bindhyagehinī ||

nivāratarusaṃsthā ca nīvārakusumotsukā |
bhītihā bhayadā bhānoraṃśujālasamaprabhā ||

bhārgavejyā bhṛgoḥ pūjyā bhāradvājanamaskṛtā |
bhītihā bhayasampannā bhīmākārābhrasundarī ||

māyādharī mānaratā mānasammānatatparā |
mādhavānandadā mādhvī madirā madirekṣaṇa ||

mahotsāhaguṇopetā mahatī mahadadbhūtā |
madirā modaramitā madirāmajjane ratā ||

yaśodharī yaśovidyā yaśodānandavardhinī |
yaśaḥkarpūradhavalā yaśodāmavibhūṣaṇā ||

yamarājasvasā yogamārgānandapravardhinī |
yādavānandakariṇī yādavānandavardhinī ||

<245> yajñaprītā yajñamayī yajñakarmavibhūṣaṇā |
rāmapriyā rāmaratā rāmatoṣaṇatatparā ||

rājñī rājakulejyā ca rājarājeśvarī ramā |
ramaṇī rāmaṇī ramyā rāmānandapradāyinī ||

rajanīkarapūrṇā syādraktotpalavilocanā |
lāṅgalī premasantuṣṭā lāṅgalīpraṇayapriyā ||

lākṣāruṇā ca lalanā līlā līlāvatī layā |
laṅkeśvaraguṇaprītā laṅkeśavaradāyinī ||

lavaṅgakusumaprītā lavaṅgakusumasrajā |
bālā vivasvadgṛhiṇī vivasvatpremadhāriṇī ||

śavalā śaralā śalyā śaraṇyā śrīḥ śaradguṇā |
ṣaṭkoṇacakramadhyasthā sampadā hrīviśobhitā ||

kṣemā ambā tathājñā ca iḍā īśvaravallabhā |
ugrākhyā ca tathā corṇā ṛkārā ṛsvarodbhavā ||

ḷkāravarṇakūṭasthā ḷkārasvarabhūṣitā |
ekāravarṇakūṭasthā ekārasvarabhūṣitā ||

epyā caipyā tathā coṣā aukārākṣararūpiṇī |
aṃsā akāravanitā sarvāgamasugopitā ||

ya idaṃ paṭhate stotraṃ pratyahaṃ bhaktisaṃyutaḥ |
divā rātrau tathā sandhyāsamaye sa maheśvaraḥ ||

stavamātrasya pāṭhena rājā kiṅkaratāmiyāt |
sarvāgameṣu pūjyaḥ syāt sarvatantre svayaṃ haraḥ ||

śivasthāne ca śayyāyāṃ śūnyāgāre catuṣpathe |
yaḥ paṭhecchṛṇuyād vāpi sa yogī nātra saṃśayaḥ ||

yāni nāmāni santyasmin prasaṅgān muravairiṇaḥ |
gāhyāni tāni kalyāṇi nānyāni tu kadācana ||

harernāma na gṛhṇīyānna spṛśet tulasīdalam |
nānyacintā prakartavyā nānyanindā kadācana ||

sindūrakaravīrādyaiḥ puṣpairlohitakaiḥ śubhām |
yo'rcayed bhaktibhāvena tasyā'sādhyaṃ na kiñcana ||

<246> vātastambhaṃ jalastambhaṃ gatistambhaṃ vivasvataḥ |
vahneḥ śaityaṃ karotyeva stavasyāsya ca kīrttanāt ||

striyamākarṣayet tūrṇamarīn mardayati haṭhāt |
mohayed rājadārāśca devānapi vaśaṃ nayet ||

yaḥ paṭhecchṛṇuyād vāpi ekacittena sarvadā |
sa dīrghāyuḥ sukhī vāgmī vāṇī tasya vaśaṅkarī ||

sarvatīrthābhiṣekena gayāśrāddhena yat phalam |
tat phalaṃ sakalaṃ tasya yaḥ paṭhedekacittataḥ ||

yeṣāmārādhane śraddhā ye ca sādhitumudyatāḥ |
teṣāṃ kṛtārthaṃ sarvatra gatirdevi padālaye ||

ṛtuyuktalatā madhye sthitvā daṇḍena tāḍayet |
japtvā stutvā ca bhaktyā ca gacched vai tārikāpadam ||

aṣṭamyāṃ ca caturdaśyāṃ navamyāṃ śanivāsare |
saṃkrāntau maṅgale rātrāvamāvasyāyāṃ yo'rcayet ||

varṣaṃ vāpya tu deveśi tasyādhīnāśca siddhayaḥ |
mṛtaputrā ca yā nārī mṛtagarbhā ca yā'ṅganā ||

mṛtapatyā ca yā nārī daurbhāgyapadapīḍitā |
bandhyā ca kākabandhyā ca mṛtaputrā ca yā'ṅganā ||

dhanadhānyavihīnā ca rogaśokākulā ca yā |
tābhiretan mahādevi bhūrjapatre likhāpayet ||

savye bhuje ca badhnīyāt sarvasaukhyavatī bhavet |
evaṃ pumānapi prāyo duḥkhena paripīḍitaḥ ||

sabhāyāṃ vyasane ghore vivāde śatrusaṅkaṭe |
caturaṅge tathā yuddhe sarvatrāpadapīḍite ||

smaraṇādasya kalyāṇi saṃkṣayaṃ yānti dūrataḥ |
pūjanīyā prayatnena śūnyāgāre śivālaye ||

vilvavṛkṣatale devi sarvadā kulamaṇḍale |
śarkarāsavasaṃyuktairbhaktairdugdhaiḥ sataṇḍulaiḥ ||

apūpa(-)piṣṭa(-)saṃyuktairnaivedyaiśca yathocitaiḥ |
niveditaṃ ca yad dravyaṃ bhoktavyaṃ cāvadhānataḥ ||

<247> na cet tad bhujyate mohād bhoktuṃ nṛtyanti devatāḥ |
anenaiva vidhānena yo'rcayet parameśvarīm ||

sa bhūmimaṇḍale devi sākṣādīśo na saṃśayaḥ |
mahāśaṅkhena kalyāṇi sarvaṃ kāryaṃ japādikam ||

kulasarvasvakasyaiva prabhāvo varṇito mayā |
na śakyate samākhyātuṃ varṣakoṭiśatairapi ||

kiñcinmayāpi cāpalyāt kathitaṃ parameśvari |
janmāntarasahasreṇa kathituṃ naiva śakyate ||

kulīnāya pradātavyaṃ tārābhaktiparāya ca |
anyabhaktāya no deyaṃ vaiṣṇavāya viśeṣataḥ ||

kulīnāya mahecchāya bhaktiśraddhāparāya ca |
mahātmane sadā deyaṃ parīkṣitaguṇāya ca ||

nā'bhaktāya pradātavyaṃ panthāntararatāya ca |
na deyaṃ devadeveśi gopyaṃ sarvāgame sadā |
paṭhanīyaṃ sadā devi sarvāvasthāsu sarvadā ||

yaḥ stotraṃ kulanāmakaṃ pratidinaṃ bhaktyā paṭhenmānavaḥ
sa syād vittacayairghaneśvarasamo vidyābhavairvākpatiḥ |
saundaryeṇa ca mūrtimān manasijaḥ kīrtyā ca śītadyutiḥ
śaktyāḥ śaṅkara eva śauryavibhavairbhūmipatirnānyathā ||

iti śrīharagaurīsaṃvāde tārāyāḥ kulasarvasvaṃ nāma stotram |

nityahomaḥ

atha nityahomaṃ kuryāt | taduktaṃ jñānārṇave (-)

saṅkalpya parameśāni nityahomavidhiṃ caret |

saṅkalpastu (-) amukadevatāprītyai etāvadāhutīrahaṃ homayeyamityevaṃ rūpaḥ |
nīlatantre (-) niyahomaṃ pravakṣyāmi sarvārthaṃ yena bindati |
saparyāṃ samyagāpādya baliṃ pūrvavadācaret ||

tato japaṃ tarpaṇaṃ ca smaret sādhakasattamaḥ |
balivaiśvādikaṃ caiva brāhmaṇaḥ samupācaret ||

vidhivad vahnimānīya kravyādāṃśaṃ parityajet |
tataśca mantramuccārya kuṇḍe vā sthaṇḍile'pi vā ||

<248> bhūmau vā saṃstared vahniṃ vyāhṛtitritayena tu |
āhutitrayamutkṣipya ṣaḍaṅgahavanaṃ tataḥ ||

tato devīṃ samāvāhya mūlena ṣoḍaśāhutim |
hutvā stutvā namaskṛtya visṛjedindumaṇḍale ||

kravyādāṃśamagnarekamaṅgāraṃ nairṛtyāṃ kravyādebhyo nama ityucārya 
kṣipediti sampradāyaḥ | sārasaṃgrahe (-)

itthaṃ tu saṃskṛ(hṛ)te vahnau devamāvāhya mantravit |
sampūjya mūlamanunā pañcaviṃśatimāhutim ||

hunedājyena haviṣā tilairvā pāyasaiḥ śubhaiḥ |
taṇḍulaistilasaṃmiśraiḥ kevalairvātha puṣpakaiḥ ||

aṅgāvaraṇadevānamekaikāmāhutiṃ hunet |
udvāsya devaṃ vahniṃ ca pūjāsthānaṃ vrajet tataḥ ||

upaviśyāsane mantrī dadyād bhūtabaliṃ tataḥ |

evaṃ pañcaviṃśatiṣoḍaśāhutyorvikalpaḥ | agnestu saṃskāro nīlatantrokta eva 
kartavyo nādhikaḥ | agnyādhānādikaṃ karma nityahome na vidyata iti 
vaśiṣṭhavacanāt |

athāratrikavidhiḥ

jñānārṇave (-) tata āratrikaṃ kuryāt sarvakāmārthasiddhaye |
sauvarṇe rājate kāṃsye lokanetramanoharam ||

kuṅkumena likhet padmaṃ vasupatraṃ varānane |
(candrarūpaṃ caruṃ kṛtvā tanmadhye mastake śive) ||

karṇikāyāṃ dīpamekaṃ vasupatreṣu dīpakān |
yavagodhūmaracitān śarkarādugdhasaṃyutān ||

balayāñcitaśobhābhiḥ śobhitān dhṛtapūritān |
abhimantrya tato mantrī ratneśvaryāstataḥ param ||

mūlamantreṇa cābhyarcya tataścāratrikaṃ caret |
tatpātraṃ tu samuddhṛtya mastakāntaṃ punaḥ punaḥ ||

navavāraṃ mahādevyāstena nīrājanaṃ caret |
nīrājane mahādevyāścakramudrāṃ pradarśayet ||

ratneśvarīvidyāpi tatraivoktā (-)

śrībījaṃ ca parābījaṃ saṃlikhen manuvittamaḥ |
<249> gasau ca mapalāḥ paścādindrasthāḥ kramato likhet ||

vāmakarṇasamāyuktā bindu(-)nāda(-)samanvitāḥ |
bījapañcakametat tu pañcaratnāni sundari ||

pūrvabījavilomena ratneśīyaṃ navākṣarī |

parā māyābījam | indro lakāraḥ | vāmakarṇa ūkāraḥ | pūrvabījaṃ śrībījaṃ 
parābījañca | evaṃ śrīṃ hrīṃ glūṃ slūṃ mlūṃ plūṃ llūṃ hrīṃ śrīṃ 
iti ratneśvarī sidhyati | cakramudrā uktā lakṣaṇasaṃgrahe (-)

viparyaste tale kṛtvā vāmadakṣiṇahastayoḥ |
aṅguṣṭhau grathayeccaiva kaniṣṭhānāmikāntare |
cakramudreyamuddiṣṭā sarvasiddhikarī sadā ||

atha pradakṣiṇam 

uttaratantre (-) paurāṇikairvaidikaiśca mūlamantreṇa caiva hi |
pradakṣiṇaṃ praṇāmaṃ ca kuryād dharmārthasādhakam ||

yāmale (-) trikoṇākārā sarvatra natiḥ śakteḥ samīritā |
(dakṣiṇād vāyavīṃ gatvā diśastasmācca śāmbhavīm |
tataśca dakṣiṇaṃ gatvā namaskārastrikoṇavat ||)

ardhacandraṃ paheśasya pṛṣṭhataśca samīritā ||

śivapradakṣiṇe mantrī ardhacandrakrameṇa tu |
savyāsavyakrameṇaiva somasūtraṃ na laṅghayet ||

prasārya dakṣiṇaṃ hastaṃ svayaṃ namraśirāḥ punaḥ |
darśayed dakṣiṇaṃ pārśvaṃ manasā'pi ca dakṣiṇam ||

tridhā ca veṣṭayet samyag devatāyāḥ pradakṣiṇe |
ekahastapraṇāmaśca ekaṃ vāpi pradakṣiṇam ||

akāle darśanaṃ viṣṇorhanti puṇyaṃ purā(kṛtaṃ)tanam |
tathā (-) ekaṃ caṇḍyāṃ ravau sapta trīṇi dadyād vināyake |
catvāri keśave dadyācchive cārdhaṃ pradakṣiṇam ||

atha natiḥ

sā cāṣṭāṅgā pañcāṅgā vā | tathāhi tantre (-)

sāṣṭāṅgaścātha pañcāṅgaḥ pūjākarmasu sammataḥ |
hastābhyāṃ caraṇābhyāṃ ca jānubhyāṃ cakṣuṣā tathā ||

<250> mūrdhnā dṛṣṭyā tathā vācā cittenā'ṣṭāṅga īritaḥ |
hasta(-)jānu(-)śiro(-)vākya(-)dhībhiḥ pañcāṅga īritaḥ ||

atra ca nateḥ prakārāntaramapyuktaṃ tantre (-)

sammukhaṃ caturasraṃ ca vṛttaṃ gomukhameva ca |
yonimudreti kathitā mudrāḥ pañca namaskṛtāviti ||

tatra bhūmisaṃlagnāñjaliḥ śiraḥsaṃyuktaḥ sammukhamudrā | 
bhūmisaṃlagnottānavāmakaratalopari 
tiryaksthāpitavāmāgrādhomukhadakṣiṇakarasaṃyukte śirasi caturasramudrā | 
bhūmisaṃlagnānuttānāṅguṣṭhā muṣṭidvayasaṃlagne śirasi vṛttamudrā | 
kecit tu(-)hasta(-)dvayāṅgulīrgrathayitvā vyatyastāṅguṣṭhadvayaniveśanena 
vṛttamudretyāhuḥ | bhūmisaṃlagnavistāritāṅgulīka(-)
saṃyugākārakaradvayopari śiraḥsaṃyoge gomukhamudrā | yonimudrā prasiddheti 
sāmpradāyikāḥ | kulārṇave (-)

kṛtārcanādikaṃ sarvaṃ samantrodapuraḥsaram |
itaḥpūrvādimanunā devatāyai samarpayet ||

mantroddhāraḥ sārasaṃgrahe (-)

vadeditaḥpadaṃ pūrvaṃ prāṇabuddhiṃ tato vadet |
dehadharmādhikārato jāgratsvapnasuṣuptiṣu ||

vadet sarvāsvavasthāsu vāceti padamuccaret |
karmaṇā caiva hastābhyāṃ padbhyāmuktvodareṇa ca ||

vadecchiśnā ca yacchabdaṃ smṛtaṃ yatpadamuccaret |
uktaṃ ca yat kṛtaṃ yacca sarvaṃ brahmārpaṇaṃ bhavatu ||

svāhāntaścāpi saṃprokto brahmārpaṇamanūttamam |

samarpaṇaprakārastu śaivāgame (-)

ityarghodakamutsṛjya kiñcid devasya dakṣiṇe |
kare samarpayed vidvān kṛtamārādhanaṃ priye ||

atra devānāṃ vāmahaste samarpaṇam | vāmahaste samarpayediti vīracūḍāmaṇi 
vacanāt | tato devatāṃ visarjayet | taduktaṃ haṃsaparameśvaratantre (-)

saṃhāramudrāṃ baddhvā'tha tejorūpāṃ maheśvarīm |
vibhāvya puṣpeṇoddhṛtya vahacchvāsādhvanā śive ||

praveśya dvādaśāntastha sahasrārasaroruhe |
viśramya madhyanāḍyāṃ tāmānīya hṛdayāmbuje ||

<251> saṃsthāpya samyak sampūjya svātmānaṃ tanmayaṃ smaret |
saṃhāramudrā yathā (-) pṛṣṭhalagnau karau kṛtvā aṅgulibhyo'nyamadhyataḥ |
parivartya tataḥ kuryāt tarjanyau saralākṛtī ||
visarjane nigaditā mudrā saṃhārasaṃjñikā |

iti tantroktā | tato nirmālyavāsinīṃ pūjayet | taduktaṃ kulamūlāvatāre (-)

aiśānyāṃ maṇḍalaṃ kṛtvā dvārapadmavivarjitam |
visarjanārthaṃ nirmālyadhāriṇyāḥ pūjanāya vai ||

lehyacoṣyānnapānādi(-)nirmālyasragvilepanam |
nirmālyabhojanaṃ tubhyaṃ dadāmi śrīśivājñayā ||

iti naivedyaśeṣaṃ tu dattvā natvā visarjayet |
nirmālyaṃ mastake dhāryaṃ mūlamantreṇa mantriṇā ||

prāśya pādodakaṃ devīnaivedyaṃ vibhajet priye |
tadbhaktebhyaḥ svayaṃ bhuktvā tanmayo viharet sukham ||

