vijayākalpe (-)

saṃvidānandayormadhye saṃvideva garīyasī |
saṃvitprayogasteneha pūjādau sādhakottamaiḥ |
karttavyā ca mahāpūjā karaṇīyā sunanditaiḥ ||

sā punaścaturdhā brāhmaṇī kṣatriyā vaiśyā śūdrā ca | 
śvetaraktapītakṛṣṇavibhedataḥ |

saṃvide brahmasaṃbhūte brahmaputri sadānaghe |
bhairavāṇāṃ ca dattvā tvaṃ pavitrā bhava sarvadā ||

oṃ brāhmaṇyai namaḥ svāhā brāhmaṇīṃ śodhayediti |
siddhamaulipriye devi hīnabodhaprabodhite ||

rājaprajāvaśakarī śatrukaṇṭhanisūdini |
oṃ kṣatriyāyai namaḥ svāhā kṣatriyāṃ śodhayet tataḥ ||

ajñānendhanadīpāgni jvālāgne jñānarūpiṇi |
ānandasyāgamaṃ prītiṃ samyag jñānaṃ prayaccha me ||

hrīṃ vaiśyāyai namaḥ svāhā vaiśyāṃ ca śodhayet tataḥ |
namasyāmi namasyāmi yogamārgapradarśini |
tryailokyavijaye mātarmamādhikaphalā bhava ||

klīṃ śūdrāyai namaḥ svāhā śūdrāṃ ca śodhayet tataḥ |

yadvā ekenaiva mantreṇa sarvāḥ śodhayet | taduktaṃ tatraiva (-)

amṛte amṛtodbhave'mṛtavarṣiṇipadaṃ tataḥ |
ākarṣayapadadvandvaṃ siddhiṃ dehipadaṃ tataḥ ||

