<253> saptadhā cārpayet brahmarandhre mantraṃ samuccaran |
gurupadme sahasrāre tathā tattvākhyamudrayā ||

tridhaiva tarpayed bhaktyā sādhakaḥ siddhimānasaḥ |
aiṃ vadavada padaṃ brūyād vāgvādinipadaṃ tataḥ ||

mama jihvāgre sthirīti bhava sarvapadaṃ tataḥ |
sattvavaśaṅkarī svāhā mantreṇa juhuyānmukhe ||

nanveṣu vacaneṣvadhikāriṇāmaśruteḥ kathaṃ brāhmaṇetaraparatocyata iti cet (-)

mādakaṃ sakalaṃ vastu varjayet caṇakādikam |
karañjaṃ pātakī yasmāt dharmo vedavidāṃ vara ||

brāhmaṇastu surāṃ dattvā brāhmaṇyādeva hīyate |
svagātrarudhiraṃ dattvā svātmahatyāmavāpnuyāditi ||

bhairavatantravacanād gṛhāṇa | tataḥ prāṇāyāmādikāmātmaśuddhimārabhet | 
taduktaṃ 

kulārṇave (-) sasnānabhūtasaṃśuddhi prāṇāyāmādibhiḥ priye |
ṣaḍaṅgādyakhilanyāsairātmaśuddhiritīritā ||

atha prāṇāyāmaḥ

tatrādau prāṇāyāmaḥ | sanatkumārīye (-)

sukhāsane samāviśya prāṇāyāmaṃ vidhāya vai |
bhūtaśuddhiṃ tataḥ kṛtvā nyāsaṃ kuryādanantaram ||

kumbhasambhavaḥ (-)

