atha pātrārpaṇam

atha brāhmaṇātiriktavīraścet tadā visarjanānantaraṃ tādṛśadivyaścet tadā 
brahmārpaṇāt prāk prathamaṃ gurave gurupātraṃ sabhaktyā'rcayitvā deyam | 
tathāhi tantre (-)

tataḥ śrīgururūpāya sākṣāt paraśivātmane |
karābhyāṃ pātramuddhṛtya sadvitīyaṃ nivedayet ||

bhāvacūḍāmaṇāvapi (-) tripātrapakṣe (-)

arghyabhāṇḍaṃ tridhā kṛtvā gurave caikabhāgakam |
ekaṃ kulāya dattvā vai caikena devatarpaṇam ||

kulāya śaktaye | tathā kulārṇave'pi (-)

anivedya tu yaḥ śaktau kuladravyaṃ niṣevate |
niṣphalā tasya sā pūjā devatā na prasīdati ||

devatarpaṇaṃ pānarūpameva | tathāhi kulārṇave (-)

ātmamūlatrikoṇodyatsūryakoṭisamaprabhe |
kuṇḍalyākṛticidrūpe kule dravyaṃ samantrakam ||

samayācāre'pi (-) kuṇḍalītarpaṇārthaṃ ca bhogapātraṃ samācaret |
antaḥśaktimanusmṛtya tarpayed dehadevatām ||

kaulikebhyo vīrapātrādaparaśaktibhyo yoginīpātrādamṛtaṃ śaśvaddhi dattvā 
svayaṃ svīkuryādityadhikapātratāpakṣe | kulārṇave (-)

nirmantraṃ na pibed dravyaṃ prāyaścittaṃ vidhīyate ||

manustatraivoktaḥ (-) idaṃ pavitramamaṛtaṃ pibāmi bhavabheṣajam |
paśupāśasamucchedakāraṇaṃ bhairavoditam ||

cittasvātantryasāratvāt tasyānandamayā(tvataḥ)tmanaḥ |
tanmayatvācca bhāvānāṃ bhāvāścāntarhitā rase ||

svasvātantryavikāśāya surasastena pīyate |
tasmādimāṃ surāṃ devīṃ pūrṇo'haṃ tāṃ pibāmyaham ||

mantreṇā'nena deveśi mūlamantreṇa mantravit |
anākulamanāḥ kuryādalipānaṃ śanaiḥ śanaiḥ ||

pānabhedaphalollāsapramāṇasthitilakṣaṇam |
<255> avijñāyācared yastu sa bhevedāpadāṃpadam ||

pānabhedastatraiva (-) pānaṃ ca trividhaṃ proktaṃ divyavīrapaśukramāt |
divyaṃ devyagrataḥ pānaṃ vīraṃ mudrāsane kṛtam ||

svecchayā paśuvat pītaṃ paśupānaṃ taducyate |
phalaṃ tu (-) mantrasaṃskārasaṃśuddhāmṛtapānena pārvati |
jāyate devatābhāvo bhavabandhavimocakaḥ ||

ityādi tatraivoktam | pramāṇamapi tatraiva (-)

ānandaṃ brahmaṇo rūpaṃ tacca mokṣe vyavasthitam |
tasyā'bhivyañjakaṃ matvā yogibhistena pīyate || ityādi |
ullāsabhedastatraiva (-) ārambhastaruṇaścaiva yauvanaḥ prauḍhaḥ eva ca |
tadantaśconmanāścānavasthākhyaścaiva saptamaḥ ||

athaiṣāṃ lakṣaṇam

tattvatrayaṃ syādārambhaḥ kathitaḥ kulanāyike |
kathitastaruṇollāsastaruṇaṃ sukhamambike ||

yauvano manasaḥ samyagullāsaḥ kathitaḥ priye |
skhalanaṃ dṛṅmanovācā prauḍha ityabhidhīyate ||

svābhīṣṭaceṣṭācaraṇaṃ prauḍhāntaḥ parikīrtitaḥ |
unmanāḥ patanotthāne mūrcchanā ca muhurmuhuḥ ||

dehendriyāṇāmavaśaścānavasthā nigadyate |

tattvatrayasya 
mantrapūrvakatvamadvitīyāmṛtaculukatrayapānasyārambhatvamūrdhnāmnāya 
eva | atra ca tattvaśuddheḥ prakārāntarasyoktatvāt | evaṃ cāmnāyāntare 
vāratrayagrahaṇamārambha iti pratibhāti | sthitirmaryādā | sā yathā (-)

niḥśaṅko nirmalo dhīro nirlajjo niṣkutūhalaḥ |
nirṇītavedaśāstrārtho varadāṃ vāruṇīṃ pibet ||

devān pitṝt samabhyarcya devīśāstroktavartmanā |
gurūn smaran piban madyaṃ khādan māṃsaṃ na doṣabhāk ||

pitaro'tra guruparamagurvādaya eva | tathā (-)

savyenoddhṛtya pātraṃ tu mudrāṃ kṛtvā'pasavyataḥ |
yathāvidhi dvitīyena gṛhṇīyān mantramuccaran ||

mudrāṃ śuddhim | dvitīyeneti sahayoge tṛtīyā |

<256> carvaṇena vinā pānaṃ kevalaṃ viṣabhakṣaṇam |

carvaṇaṃ bharjitacaṇakādīnām |

śrīcakrasya kuladravyaṃ yaḥ paśubhyaḥ prayacchati |
snehāllobhād bhayād vāpi sa bhaved yoginīpaśuḥ ||

yathādhikāraṃ tatrāpi kartavyaṃ pātramelanam |
adīkṣitairanācārairatantrajñairadaivataiḥ ||

dūṣitaiḥ samayabhraṣṭairna kuryād dravyasaṅgatim |
abhijñammanyamānaiśca prapañcavratacāribhiḥ ||

paśubhiḥ kṣudrakarmasthairna kuryād dravyasaṅgatim |
svapātrasthitahetuṃ ca na dadyād bhairavāya ca ||

yadi dadyān maheśāni devatāśāpamāpnuyāt |

bhairavāya sādhakāya | tathā (-)

srotobhedena vā kuryāt kaulikaḥ pātramelanam |

kadācidativiśrambhe srotasa āmnāyasyaikye ca saṅkaraṃ kuryādityarthaḥ | tathā 
(-)

pūrvadakṣiṇayoraikyamudakpaścimayorapi |
tasmin kramārcanaparairvīraiḥ svasvadṛśairapi ||

kāminībhiśca tat kuryāt srotasāṃ ca catuṣṭayam |

ityanena ūrdhvāmnāyasya na kenāpyanenaikyavadupacāra iti dhvanitam | tathā (-)

śaktyucchiṣṭaṃ pived dravyaṃ vīrocchiṣṭaṃ ca carvaṇam |
ātmocchiṣṭaṃ na dātavyaṃ parakīyaṃ na bhakṣayet ||

parakīyaṃ parapuruṣocchiṣṭam | tatrāpi viśeṣastatraiva (-)

guruśaktisutānāṃ ca gurujyeṣṭhakaniṣṭhayoḥ |
svajyeṣṭhasyāpi cocchiṣṭaṃ khādennānyasya pārvati ||

ucchiṣṭaṃ bhakṣayet strīṇāṃ tābhyo naiva pradāpayet |
kaniṣṭhānāṃ svaśiṣyāṇāṃ dadyāt svocchiṣṭamambike ||

dadyāt snehena yo'nyebhyaḥ sa bhavedāpadāṃpadam |
āsavocchiṣṭapātra ṃ tu yo gṛhṇāti vimūḍhadhīḥ ||

snehāllobhād bhayād vāpi devatāśāpamāpnuyāt |
atra jyeṣṭhakaniṣṭhatā satīrthyānāmupadeśakrameṇaiva | tathāhi (-) rudrayāmale 
(-)

vālo'pi dīkṣita pūrva jyeṣṭha suta kulāgame |
<257> dvijo'pi dīkṣitaḥ paścādantyajaḥ pūrvadīkṣitāt ||

dvijaḥ kaniṣṭhaḥ sa jyeṣṭha iti śāstraviniścayaḥ |
yāvanna calate dṛṣṭiryāvanna calate manaḥ ||

tāvat pānaṃ prakurvīta paśupānamataḥ param |

tathāca yauvanollāsaparyantameva pānaṃ kartavyamiti bhāvaḥ | idaṃ tu 
pūrṇābhiṣiktarahitānām | abhiṣiktānāṃ tu saptāpyullāsā vihitāḥ | tathāhi 
tatraiva (-)

pūrṇābhiṣekayuktānāṃ pānaṃ devi nigadyate |
karābhyāṃ pātramuddhṛtya smaran mūlaṃ ca pādukām ||

āgalāntaṃ piben madyaṃ sa mukto nātra saṃśayaḥ |
pītvā pitvā punaḥ pītva yāvat patati bhūtale ||

utthāya ca punaḥ pītvā punarjanma na vidyate |
ānandāt tṛpyate devī mūrcchanād bhairavaḥ svayam ||

vamanāt sarvadevāstu tasmāt tritayamācaret |

kulāmṛte (-) brahmajñānī kulācāre surāṃ pītvā skhalan muhuḥ ||

bhūmau patati tasyāṅge galanti yadi reṇavaḥ |
tāvat kālaṃ reṇusaṃkhyaṃ brahmaloke mahīyate ||

tathā (-) pītvā pītvā japitvā ca muktaḥ koṭikulaiḥ saha |
brahmaloke vased devi satyaṃ satyaṃ na saṃśayaḥ ||

tatraiva vyāptimāpnoti na punaḥ prapatediha |
pītvā ca pūjayitveśīmaīśatvaṃ labhate dhruvam ||

tatraiva layamāpnoti punarnaiva vivartate |

iti | idaṃ tu kaulikānāmāvaśyakam | taduktaṃ haragaurīsaṃvāde (-)

niveditaṃ tu yad devyai bhoktavyaṃ cāvadhānataḥ |
tanna ced bhujyate mohād bhoktuṃ nṛtyanti devatāḥ ||

atha pañcamayāgaḥ

kumārītantre (-) tatastutvā namaskṛtya kuryāt sambhogamelanam |
devatāgre tu sambhogo devatāprīṇanaṃ bhavet ||

tathā (-) naṭī kāpālinī veśyā rajakī nāpitāṅganā |
brāhmaṇī śūdrakanyā ca tathā gopālakanyakā ||

mālākārasya kanyā ca nava kanyāḥ prakīrtitāḥ |
<258> etāsu kāñcidānīya tatastadyonimaṇḍale ||

pūjayitvā mahādevīṃ tato maithunamācaret |
devīyāmale (-) atha pūjāphalaṃ vakṣye uttarottarato varam |
svaśaktyā ayutaṃ puṇyaṃ paraśaktiprapūjane ||

tato veśyā'dhikā jñeyā rajakī ca tato'dhikā |
rajakyāḥ kṣurakī śreṣṭhā kṣurakyāścarmakāriṇī ||

tato'dhikatarā proktā hetunārī varānane |
tato'pyantyajasambhūtā cāṇḍālī ca tato'dhikā ||

tato mātaṅginī śreṣṭhā mātaṅgyāḥ pukkaśī tathā |
pukkaśyā akṣatā śreṣṭhā tato'tisūdatī smṛtā ||

sundarī purataḥ proktā prītimatyanurāgiṇī |
tatparā parameśāni unmattā śubhalakṣaṇā ||

samayācārasampannā mantrajñā bhayavarjitāḥ |
vidagdhāstvaprasūtāśca dhyairyasvātantryasaṃyutāḥ ||

evaṃ guṇasamāyuktāḥ pūjayet sarvayoṣitaḥ |
ātmīyā ca parā caiva śaktimātraṃ maheśvari ||

mantrādhidevatābuddhyā pūjyāḥ sarvopacārakaiḥ |
vividhaiḥ phalatāmbulairvastrālaṅkārahemabhiḥ ||

sampūjya vidhivad bhaktyā bahuhetuṃ pradāpayet |
sambhogavāsanāṃ dhṛtvā yaḥ kuryācchaktipūjanam ||

sa dāridryamavāpnoti nārakī ca bhaved dhruvam |
vīracūḍāmaṇāvapi (-) ānīya yuvatīṃ ramyāṃ kulakarmaviśālinīm |
ṣoḍaśābdena yuvatīṃ pīnonnatapayodharām ||

unmattāṃ mattamātaṅgīṃ madāghūrṇitalocanām |
mṛgaśāvakanetrāṃ ca śāraṅgīṃ mṛduhāsinīm ||

krodhalobhabhayadambhamohamāyāvivarjitām |
svāmidharmaratāṃ satyavādinīṃ ca sadāśucim |
gaṇikā naṭī cāṇḍālī jīvanī jārajā'thavā ||

yogamudrādharā nāryo carmakārī ca citriṇī ||

caturvarṇasamāyuktā uttamā parvatodbhavā |
<259> vāmabhāge samālikhya uttamaṃ padmavarttulam ||

śvetaraktasamāyuktaṃ nīlaṃ sindūracarcitam |
sādhakaḥ prāṅmukho bhūtvā devīṃ pratyaṅmukhāṃ yajet ||

pīṭhaśaktividhānena navaśaktiṃ prapūjayet |
ratiḥ prītiḥ priyā kāntiḥ kāminī kāmamālinī ||

kandarpadalanī durgā bhāvinī nava śaktayaḥ |
viyadgaṅgaṃ samuccārya manubindukalānvitam ||

mahāpretapadaṃ paścād dhṛdayāntamimaṃ manum |
mūlamantraṃ samuccārya sambuddhyā tāriṇīpadam ||

ehyehi ca padaṃ paścāt pādukābhyāṃ punaḥ punaḥ |
gṛhītvā vāmahastena āsane copaveśayet ||

raktacandanaliptāṅgīṃ raktapuṣpavibhūṣitām |
sarvālaṅkārasaṃyuktāṃ vivastrāṃ pūjayet priye ||

vāruṇīmadamattāṃ ca hāvabhāvasamāvṛtām |
yāvadākaṇṭhaparyantaṃ tāvat pānaṃ pradāpayet ||

dhyānaṃ kuryān maheśāni gahvare makarānane |
tāmracūḍāśikhākāraṃ gajavaktrasamaprabham ||

tatrasthāṃ cintayed devīṃ vidyāṃ bhuvanamohinīm |
tāraṃ vai hṛdayānte ca paścān madanamandiram ||

caturthyante yajed devi bhage puṣpaṃ viniḥkṣipet |
prakṣālya kuladravyeṇa gandhapuṣpaiḥ samarcayet ||

dhūpadīpādikaṃ dattvā paścādāvaraṇaṃ yajet |
icchā jñānā kriyā paścād vāmā jyeṣṭhā ca raudrikā ||

ratiḥ prītistathā kāmaṃ puṣpabāṇadhanurdharam |
vasantaṃ pūjayet paścāt patrāṅkurasamanvitam ||

ciṃkuraṃ pūjayed devi alisyandasamanvitam |
virañciṃ pūjayennābhau hṛdaye ca haraṃ harim ||

stane vaktre maheśāni trimūrtiṃ pūjayet tataḥ |
kāmeśī caiva vajreśī parā tu bhagamālinī ||

bhrūvormūle maheśāni pañcabāṇān prapūjayet |
<260> drāmādyāṃ drāviṇīṃ mūrdhni drīmādyāṃ kṣobhiṇīṃ pade ||

klīṃ vaśīkariṇīṃ vaktre guhye blūṃ bījapūrvikām |
ākarṣiṇīṃ hṛdi punaḥ sarvāntarbhṛgusaṃyutām ||

sammohinīṃ kramādevaṃ bāṇapūjeyamīritā |
karṇayoḥ pūjayeccakre bhānuṃ candraṃ krameṇa ca ||

rasanāyāṃ vahniṃ sampūjya netre nakṣatramālinīm |
prāṇaṃ sampūjayed ghrāṇe ājñāyāṃ tripathagāminīm ||

akṣobhyaṃ pūjayen mūrdhni gandhapuṣpopacārakaiḥ |
puṣpamālāṃ gale dadyādatha śaktyā japed budhaḥ ||

jñānārṇave tu (-) mañcakaṃ gajadantasya hemaraupyādinirmitam |
viśuddhakṣaumaracitāṃ tulikāṃ tatra yojayet ||

puṣpāṃścākīrya madhye tu karpūrasya rajastathā |
maṇḍūkādīṃstatra devi uparyupari śailaje ||

maṇḍūkaṃ pūjayedādau rudraṃ kālāgnisannibham |
ādhāraśaktiṃ kūrmaṃ ca tathānantaṃ varāhakam ||

pṛthivīṃ ca tathā kandaṃ nālaṃ padmaṃ dalaṃ tathā |
keśarāliṃ ca sampūjya karṇikāṃ pūjayet tataḥ ||

mañcakaṃ ca samabhyarcya tatra pādacatuṣṭaye |
dharmaṃ jñānaṃ ca vairāgyamaiśvaryaṃ ca kramād yajet ||

apūrvāṃ pūjayedetāṃstastatpādānāṃ samīpake |
ātmāntarātmaparamajñānātmānaḥ prapūjayet ||

mañcakāṅgeṣu sampūjya guṇatrayamathārcayet |
dūtīṃ sulakṣaṇāṃ ramyāṃ sarvalakṣaṇalakṣitām ||

nānālaṅkārasubhagāṃ svavaśāṃ śāradāmiva |
pūjayet parameśāni pañcakāmaśaraistathā ||

vaṭukādīṃścaturdikṣu pūjayet siddhihetave |
mātṛkāṃ vinyaset tasyā dehe kāmaśarānvitām ||

trikoṇaṃ vinyasen mūrdhni tatra pūjāṃ yajet kramāt |
trikoṇamadhye bālākhyāṃ kāmeśīṃ paripūjayet ||

gaṇeśaṃ ca kulādhyakṣaṃ tathā lakṣmīṃ sarasvatīm |
<261> trikoṇeṣu ca sampūjya vasantaṃ madanaṃ priye ||

stanayoḥ pūjayet paścān mukhe tasyāḥ kalādharam |
vāgbhapaṃ kāmarājaṃ ca strībījaṃ kāmarājakam ||

hasablemātmakaṃ dattvā ādhāraśaktimuccaret |
śrīpādukāṃ tato dattvā pūjayāmi vadet tataḥ ||

anena manunā tasyā lalāṭe sumanoharam |
trikoṇaṃ tatra saṃlikhya sindūrādyairviśeṣataḥ ||

vaṭukaṃ yoginīṃ caiva kṣetrapālaṃ gaṇeśvaram |
lakṣmīṃ sarasvatīṃ caiva pūjayet tatra sundari ||

kāmabījaṃ samuccārya kāmarājaṃ tataḥ param |
śrīpādukāṃ tato dattvā pūjayāmi vadet tataḥ ||

dakṣapādatale devi pūjayen manunā'munā |
vaṃ vasantaṃ samuccārya nādahīnā ramā tataḥ ||

pādukāṃ pūjayāmīti tasyā vāmakare nyaset |
śaktibījaṃ samuccārya somapādapadaṃ tataḥ ||

śrīpādukāṃ tato dattvā pūjayāmi stanadvaye |
ārohakramataḥ kāmakalānyāsaṃ caret sudhīḥ ||

śraddhā prītī ratiścaiva dhṛtiḥ kāntirmanoharā |
manoramā manorāmā madanonmādinīti ca ||

mohinī dīpinī caiva śoṣiṇī ca vaśaṅkarī |
rañjanī subhagā devī ṣoḍaśī priyadarśanā ||

akārādisvarairarcyāḥ kalāḥ kusumadhanvanaḥ |
pūṣā'ryamā sumanasā(?) ratiḥ prītistathā dhṛtiḥ ||

ṛddhiḥ saumyā marīciśca daśamī cāṃśumālinī |
aṅgirā śaśinī caiva chāyā sampūrṇamaṇḍalā ||

puṣṭiścaivāmṛtā ceti kalāḥ somasya ṣoḍaśa |
akārādisvarayutāḥ pūjanīyā manīṣibhiḥ ||

dakṣe pādādimūrdhāntaṃ vāme mūrdhādi sundari |
pādāntaṃ pūjayet sarvāḥ kalā vai kāmasomayoḥ ||

tantrāntare (-) pṛṣṭhavaṃśāt samārabhya śiro'ntaṃ kāmacāpakam |
<262> vinyasya vidhivan mantrī pūjayet tat tu mūrdhani ||

dharmātmakaṃ samuccārya kāmacāpapadaṃ tataḥ |
pādaśrīpādukāṃ dattvā pūjayāmīti pūjayet ||

mūrdhni pāde mukhe guhye hṛdaye ca yathākramāt |
pañcabāṇaiḥ pañcabāṇān yathāsthāneṣu pūjayet ||

drāṃ drāvaṇapadaṃ dattvā bāṇapādapadaṃ tataḥ |
śrīpādukāṃ vadet paścāt pūjayāmīti pūjayet ||

hrīmātmakaṃ samuccārya unmādabāṇamuccaret |
pādaśrīpādukāṃ dattvā pūjayāmīti pūjayet ||

kāmabījapadaṃ dattvā mohabāṇapadaṃ tataḥ |
pādaśrīpādukāṃ dattvā pūjayāmīti pūjayet ||

vlāmātmakaṃ samuccārya sandīpanapadaṃ tataḥ |
bāṇapādapadaṃ dattvā śrīpādukāṃ tato vadet ||

pūjayāmīti sampūjya śeṣabāṇaṃ samuccaret |
śoṣaṇaṃ ca samālikhya bāṇapādapadaṃ tataḥ ||

śrīpādukāṃ tato dattvā pūjayāmīti pūjayet |
lalāṭamaṇḍale paścāt trikoṇaṃ pūjayet tataḥ ||

vāgbhavaṃ śubhapādaṃ ca śrīpādukāṃ tato vadet |
pūjayāmi tato dattvā dakṣarekhāsu pūjayet ||

hrīmātmakaṃ samuccārya bhagapādapadaṃ tataḥ |
śrīpādukāṃ tato dattvā pūjayamīti paścime ||

kāmabījaṃ samuccārya bhagasarpiḥpadaṃtataḥ |
śrīpādaśrīpadaṃ dattvā pādukāṃ ca tato vadet ||

pūjayāmīti cocārya pūjayed vāmapārśvake |
hsaurātmakamālikhya bhagāvahapadaṃ tataḥ ||

pādaśrīpādukāṃ dattvā pūjayen madhyadeśataḥ |
śrī(-)uḍḍīśīpadaṃ dattvā devīmuḍḍīśvarīṃ tataḥ ||

nāthadevapadaṃ dattvā śrīraktāmbāṃ tato vadet |
śrīcaryānāthamālikhya pādaśrīpādukāṃ tataḥ ||

pūjayāmītyuḍḍīyāne pūjayed hṛdi suvrate |
<263> śrīpadaṃ ca samālikhya jālandharapadaṃ tataḥ ||

mahāpīṭhe samālikhya nādahīnā ramā tataḥ |
jāleśvarī(-)padaṃ dattvā devī jālī samālikhet ||

nāthadevapadaṃ dattvā śrījālāmbāpadaṃ tataḥ |
śrīṣaṣṭhīśapadaṃ dattvā nātha devapadaṃ tataḥ ||

pādaśrīpādukāṃ dattvā pūjayāmīti pūjayet |
anena manunā devi pūjayen nābhimaṇḍale ||

śrīpadaṃ ca tato dattvā pūrṇeśvarīṃ vadet tataḥ |
devīśrīpādaśrīpūrṇa(-)nāthadevapadaṃ tathā ||

śrīcāmuṇḍāpadamābhāṣya devīśrīpadamālikhet |
uḍḍīśanāthamālikhya devapādapadaṃ tataḥ ||

śrīpādukāṃ tato dattvā kāmeśvarīṃ padaṃ tataḥ |
devīśrīpadamābhāṣya kāmeśvarānandanātha ca ||

śrīmahāpadamābhāṣya tuṣṭāmbāśrīpadaṃ tataḥ |
mitrīśanāthamābhāṣya pādaśrīpādukāṃ tataḥ ||

pūjayāmi tato dattvā pūjayet kāmaśāsane |
gṛhyapīṭhasya vāme tu gurupaṅktiṃ yajet sudhīḥ ||

anaṅgakusumādyena hṛtsaroje yajet punaḥ |
vāgbhavaṃ vlauṃ samuccārya vlīmātmakaṃ vadet tataḥ ||

vloṃ vluṃ vluḥ samuccārya mantreṇānena sādhakaḥ |
yonimudrāṃ pradarśyātha yonau kṣobhaṃ vicintayet ||

vāgbhavaṃ kāmarājaṃ ca strībījaṃ tadanantaram |
kṣobhaṇī nāma vidyeyaṃ stanayoḥ kṣobhamācaret ||

yonimudrāṃ pradarśyātha śanaireva hi sādhakaḥ |
vāgbhavaṃ sphṛṃ samuccārya bleṃ blīṃ blūṃ ca tato vadet ||

klīmātmakaṃ samuccārya hrīmātmakaṃ samuccaret |
kṣamātmakaṃ tato dattvā tasyāḥ kṣobhaṃ vicintayet ||

drāviṇī nāma vidyeyaṃ cintayed yonimadhyataḥ |
tataḥ parānandamayo bhūtvā nirbharamānasaḥ ||

cintayennijavidyāyā bījaṃ mūrdhni sarojake |
<264> tatastasyā yonimadhye mūlamantraiśca sādhakaḥ ||

puṣpāñjalitrayaṃ dattvā tataḥ kṣobhaṃ vicintayet |

jñānārṇave (-) dūtīdehakṛtān nyāsān svadehe'pi vicintayet |
vīracūḍāmaṇau (-) atha nyāsaṃ pravakṣyāmi śivātmānaṃ vibhāvayet |
śivātmānamiti śivamātmānamityarthaḥ | tathā (-)

pañcavaktre mahādevaṃ kalāyuktaṃ nyaset kramāt |
īśānaḥ sarvavidyānāṃ śaśinī prathamā kalā ||

īśvaraḥ sarvavidyānāmaṅgadā tadanantaram |
brahmādhipatiḥ śabdānte brahmaṇo'dhipatiḥ punaḥ ||

brahmeṣṭadā śivo me'stu marīcisaṃpuṭaṃ nyaset |
sadāśivoṃ samuccārya aṃśumālinyathāparā ||

tatpuruṣāya vidmahe kalāśāntiritīritā |
mahādevāya dhīmahi kalāvidyā tathaiva ca ||

tanno rudrapadaṃ paścāt pratiṣṭhā kathitā kalā |
pracodayāt samuccārya nivṛttiḥ syāt tataḥ param ||

pūrvapaścimayāmyeṣu uttareṣvatha tu kramāt |
hṛdaye vinyased devi aghorebhyastamaḥkalām ||

atha ghorebhyo mohānte grīvāyāṃ vinyaset tataḥ |
ghorānte syāt kriyā paścāt dakṣiṇāṃśe pravinyaset ||

nidrāṃ ghoratarebhyo vai vāmāṃse vinyaset tataḥ |
sarvataḥ sarvamuccārya vyādhiṃ nābhau pravinyaset ||

sarvebhyastat kalāṃ mṛtyuṃ kukṣau deśe pravinyaset |
namaste'stu kṣudhāṃ paścāt kalāṃ pṛṣṭhe nyaset kramāt ||

rudrarūpebhya ityante tṛṣāṃ tāranamo'ntakāḥ |
vāmadevāya namo'nte rajā syād guhyadeśake ||

muṣke savye pravinyasya rakṣāṃ jyeṣṭhāya vai namaḥ |
rudrāya namo ratiṃ paścād vāmamuṣke kalāmimām ||

kālāya nama ityante pālinī ūrudakṣiṇe |
kalakāmā ca deveśi vāme vikaraṇāya ca ||

namaḥpadaṃ samuccārya saṃyamanī dakṣajānuni |
<265> balakriyā samādiṣṭā vāme vikaraṇāya ca ||

namo'nte vṛddhimuccārya dakṣiṇe sphici vinyaset |
balapramathanāya namo rātriṃ vāme pravinyaset ||

sarvabhūtadamanāya namonte brāhmaṇīṃ kalām |
kaṭideśe pravinyasya namonte mohinīṃ kalām ||

dakṣiṇe pārśvake nyasya unmanāya manojvarām |
pādayostananāsāsu mūrdhni bāhuyuge nyaset ||

sadyojātodbhavāḥ samyagaṣṭau mantrī kalāḥ kramāt |
sadyojātaṃ prapadyāmi siddhiḥ syāt prathamā kalā ||

sadyojātāya vai bhūyo namaḥ syād vṛddhirīritā |
bhave dyutistṛtīyā syādabhave tadanantaram ||

lakṣmīścaturthī kathitā tato nātibhavepadam |
medhākhyā pañcamī proktā kalā bhūyo bhavasva mām ||

prajñā samīritā ṣaṣṭhī bhavānte syāt prabhā kalā |
udbhavāya namaḥ paścāt svadhā syādaṣṭamī kalā ||

praṇavādyāścaturthyantā namontāśca pravinyaset |
evaṃ nyāsavidhiṃ kṛtvā svayaṃ śaivaṃ vibhāvayet ||

pañcākṣaraṃ puraskṛtya rudradhyānaparāyaṇaḥ |
sāmarasyamayaṃ kṛtvā rakṣārthaṃ kavacaṃ paṭhet ||

baddhvā tu kṣobhiṇīṃ mudrāṃ yantramadhye viniḥkṣipet |
bhagaṃ kuṇḍaṃ sruvo liṅgamājyaṃ caiva tu vīryakam ||

sarvatattvaṃ samutsārya sahasraṃ japamācaret |

jñānārṇave tu (-) dhūpādikaṃ samarpyā'tha svaliṅge tadanantaram |
tāraṃ ca bhuvaneśāni mahātripurasundarī ||

namaḥ śivāya vidyeyaṃ daśārṇā parikīrtitā |
anayā vidyayā devi svaliṅge pūjayecchive ||

mahātripurasundarī tripūṭātmikā vidyā |

yajet tatpuruṣāghora sadyovāmeśasaṃjñakān |
nivṛttiṃ ca pratiṣṭhāṃ ca vidyāṃ śāntiṃ tathaiva ||

śāntyatītāṃ ca sampūjya ṣaḍaṅgāvaraṇaṃ yajet |
<266> samagravidyāmuccārya nandikeśaṃ prapūjayet ||

madhye vṛṣaṇayordevi gandhapuṣpākṣatādibhiḥ |
nivedya puṣpadhūpādi vijitendriyamānasaḥ ||

sarvasaṃkṣobhaṇāḥ mudrāḥ badhvā yoniṃ pracālayet |
kṣobhiṇyā cāthavā devi gajatuṇḍākhyayā'thavā ||

uccaran bhagamālākhyāṃ drāviṇībījamuccaran |
akṣubdhaḥ san varārohe yāvadretaḥ pravartate ||

bhagamālāmantrastu tatraiva (-)

vāgbhavaṃ bhagaśabdānte bhage bhagini cālayet |
bhagodari bhagānte tu bhagamāle bhagāvahe ||

bhagaguhye bhagaprānte yoniprānte bhagāntake |
nipātini ca sarvānte tato bhagavaśaṅkari ||

bhagarūpe tato lekhyaṃ nīrajāyatalocane |
nityaklīnne bhagaprānte svarūpe sarvamālikhet ||

bhagānimehyānayānte varade'tha samālikhet |
rete surete bhaga ca klinne klinnadrave tataḥ ||

kledaya drāvaya cātha sarvasatvān bhageśvari |
amoghe bhagavicce ca kṣubha kṣobhaya sarva ca ||

sattvān bhageśvari brūyād vāgbhavaṃ blūṃ jamādikam |
meṃ blūṃ mauṃ blūṃ ca heṃ blūṃ ca heṃ klinne ca tataḥ param ||

sarvāṇi ca bhagānyante me vaśaṃ cānayeti ca |
strībījaṃ ca haraprānte bleṃ māyātmakamakṣaram ||

bhuvaneśīṃ samālikhya vidyeyaṃ bhagamālinī |
vīratantre (-) dharmādharmahavirdīpte ātmāgnau manasā srucā ||

suṣumṇā vartmanā nityamakṣavṛttīrjuhomyaham ||

svāhānto'yaṃ mahāmantra ārambhe parikīrtitaḥ |
tato japet priyāṃ gacchan striyaṃ tribhuvaneśvarīm ||

kulāmṛte (-) svāhānto homamantro'yaṃ pratighātāhutipriye |
pūrṇāhutiṃ ratānte ca juhuyān manunā'munā ||

prakāśākāśahastābhyāmavalambyonmanīsrucā |
<267> dharmādharmau kalāsnehaṃ pūrṇavahnau juhomyaham ||

svāhānto'yaṃ bhaven mantro ghorapātakamuktidaḥ |
vīratantre (-) svāhānto'yaṃ mahāmantraḥ śukratyāge prakīrtitaḥ |
yadi ca adīkṣitā śaktirbhavati tadā prāk tacchuddhimapi kuryāt | taduktaṃ

kulatantre (-) abhiṣekād bhavecchuddhirmantrasyoccāraṇācchrutau |
ratikāle maheśāni dīkṣākāle ca kanyakāḥ ||

śudhyantīti śeṣaḥ |

surayā retasā vāpi jalena manunā'munā |
yāmale'pi (-) sudīkṣitā ca yā śaktiḥ saiva śuddhā bhavet sadā |
adīkṣitā tu yā śaktirmāyāṃ tasyai nivedayet ||

mātaṅgītantre'pyuktam (-)

dīkṣāmātreṇa śudhyanti striyaḥ sarvatra karmaṇi |

kulāmṛtadīpikāyām (-)

adīkṣitakulāsaṅgāt siddhihāniḥ prajāyate |
tathā (-) ādau bālāṃ samuccārya tripurāyai samuccaret |
namaḥśabdaṃ samuccārya imāṃ śaktiṃ tato vadet ||

pavitrīkuruśabdānte mama śaktiṃ kuru priye |
vahnijāyāṃ samuccārya śuddhimantraḥ prakīrtitaḥ ||

anena manunā devi abhiṣiktāḥ striyaḥ sadā |
ramamāṇo'tra sannityaṃ sarvasiddhimavāpnuyāt ||

tathā (-) pītvāliṅgya kulācāre pramadāṃ yauvanānvitām |
koṭijanmārjitaṃ pāpaṃ tatkṣaṇādeva nāśayet ||

ete ca dūtīsaṃskārā arghasthāpanāt prāk kuṇḍagolodbhavārtham | 
anācaraṇapakṣe tadartham | tatrācaraṇapakṣe tu dharmādharmahavirdīpta 
ityādimantrābhyāṃ nidhuvanāntam | iyāṃstu viśeṣaḥ (-) yatra 
nidhuvanāntameva karma tatra tu arghaprakṣepārthaṃ devatātarpaṇārthaṃ ca 
nidhuvanānte dravyagrahaṇamapi | taduktaṃ jñānārṇave (-)

saṃskāro mantrarūpastu vacanaṃ stavanaṃ bhavet |
āliṅganaṃ tu kastūrīkarpūraghusṛṇādikam ||

mathanaṃ tarpaṇaṃ viddhi vīryapāto visarjanam |
daśa dravyeṇa saṃśodhya śivaśaktimayaṃ priye ||

<268> bījāmṛtaṃ paraṃ brahmarūpaṃ vikṣipya sundari |
arghyapātrāmṛte mukto nirvikalpaḥ sadānaghaḥ ||

śrīvidyākramamabhyarcya paraṃ brahmamayo bhavet |
kaule (-) āliṅganaṃ cumbanaṃ ca stanayormadanaṃ śanaiḥ ||

darśanaṃ sparśanaṃ yonervikāro liṅgagharṣaṇam |
praveśaścālanaṃ śakternavapuṣpaiśca pūjanam ||

brahmayāmale (-) na dadyāccumbanaṃ yastu daridro jāyate dhruvam |
āliṅganaṃ vinā devi kuṣṭhī bhavati pārvati ||

vinā dantakṣatairdevi loke bhavati ninditaḥ |
tathā (-) āliṅgane haredrogān dhanadhānyādi cumbane ||

nakhadantakṣatādyaiśca tadā mokṣaḥ prajāyate |
sāyujyaṃ saṅgamena syāt satyameva na saṃśayaḥ ||

raudre (-) tadaṅgasparśanāt saukhyaṃ saṃyogāmṛtalakṣaṇam |
mahākāmakalāṃ dhyāyet saṃyogāmṛtarūpiṇīm ||

saṃyogājjāyate saukhyaṃ paramānandalakṣaṇam |
kuladravyāmṛtaṃ yatnād gṛhṇīyād durlabhaṃ naraḥ ||

kuṇḍagolagrahaṇaprakārastu kulāmṛte (-)

bhāvayet kāmabhāvena ātmatattvaṃ na cotsṛjet |
śuddhamantrauṣadhenaiva yonestu mathanaṃ caret ||

mathyamāne ca tasyāhi jāyate tattvamullanam |
gṛhṇīyāt tatprayatnena dravyaṃ kuṇḍodbhavaṃ śubham ||

brahmayāmale (-) tenāmṛtena divyena tripurāṃ tarpayet sadā |
sānnidhyāt tatkṣaṇād vāpi prītā siddhiṃ prayacchati ||

samastadevatānāṃ ca tarpaṇaṃ ca sadā'mṛtaiḥ |
gurūṇāṃ sādhakānāṃ ca sarveṣāṃ tarpaṇaṃ caret ||

tenāmṛtena dravyena sarve tuṣṭā bhavanti ca |
yat kāmaṃ kurute mantrī tatkṣaṇādeva sidhyati ||

kulāmṛtaṃ samādāya tatrārghe nikṣiped budhaḥ |
tataḥ somakalāḥ pūjyāḥ sādhakairnirmalāśayaiḥ ||

kaule (-) madhumāṇḍasahasraistu māṃsabhāraśatairapi |
<269> naiva tuṣṭā bhaved devi bhagaliṅgāmṛtādṛte ||

devīyāmala (-) dūtīyāgavidhiṃ vakṣye kauladharmottamottamam |
tasyānuṣṭhānamātreṇa svayaṃ brahmatvamāpnuyāt ||

tathā (-) dūtīyāge kṛte mantrī sarvajño jāyate dhruvam |
na tasya punarāvṛttiḥ kalpakoṭiśatairapi ||

yaiḥ kṛtaṃ yajanaṃ dūtyāstairiṣṭāḥ kratavro'khilāḥ |
sarvatīrthamayaḥ proktaḥ sarvadevamayo bhavet ||

puraścaryādisakalaṃ kṛtaṃ tena na saṃśayaḥ |
aśvamedhasahasrāṇi vājapeyaśatāni ca ||

āsamudrā ca dharaṇī dattā tena sadakṣiṇā |
merumandaratulyāni suvarṇānyarpitāni vai ||

gokoṭidānāt yat puṇyaṃ tat puṇyaṃ jāyate priye |
tasmāt sarvaprayatnena dutīyāgaṃ samācaret ||

pūjāsampūrṇadaṃ bhadre sarvāriṣṭapraśāmakam |
yonipūjāṃ vinā pūjā kṛtā cāpyakṛtā bhavet ||

āyurārogyavibhavānnamitān labhate naraḥ |
anenaiva vidhānena viṣārto nirviṣo bhavet ||

putrārthī labhate putraṃ dhanārthī labhate dhanam |
mātaṅgīśaktimabhyarcya tayā sākaṃ samarcayet ||

mātaṅgī manmathopetā sarvakāmārthasiddhaye |
śaktyā sākaṃ sadā pūjyā mātaṅgī mantradevatā ||

sā devī śaktihīnā tu na dadāti manoratham |

brahmayāmale (-) 

nārada uvāca (-)

sarvajña jagatāṃ nātha śāktaṃ cecchruticoditam |
mātaṅgīpūjanaṃ tatra kathaṃ muktipradāyakam ||

arcane prathitā veśyā veśyā sā tu rajasvalā |
rajasvalā ca mātaṅgī sā dūtī sarvamaṅgalā ||

iti proktaṃ tvayā pūrvamidānīṃ tadviparyayaḥ |
tava vākyamanubrahmannetad vada pitāmaha ||

brahmovāca (-) mā kuruṣvātra sandehaṃ vedoktaṃ śāktamuttamam |
<270> asti sarvajñakalpo'sau mataṅgo munisattamaḥ ||

varṣāṇāmayutaṃ vatsa tapa ugraṃ cacāra ha |
tena prītā mahādevī devānāṃ hitakāriṇī ||

varaṃ vṛṇīṣva bhagavan dāsyāmi tava vāñchitam |
tacchrutvā dvijavaryastāṃ yayāce dharmasādhanam ||

he devi jagatāṃ mātaḥ prītā ced yadi sāmpratam | 
apatyatāṃ samāsādya matkulālambanaṃ kuru ||

ityabhyarcya muniśreṣṭho janayāmāsa tāṃ sutām |
śyāmalāṃ cāruvadanāṃ cīnāṃśukasamanvitām ||

sārikāṃ jñānasampannāṃ japamālāṃ karāmbujaiḥ |
dhārayantīṃ viśālākṣīṃ śaṅkhatāṭaṅkaśobhinīm ||

sā babhūva mahādevī mataṅgakulanandinī |
mātaṅgīti tadā devī vikhyātā varadāyinī ||

tāṃ vilokya tadā śambhurdūtīṃ cakre sulakṣaṇām |
tripuraṃ jetukāmena yonipūjā tadā kṛtā ||

pratyālīḍhā sthitā devī pūjāṃ svīkṛtya niścalā |
tadā dṛṣṭarajobhūtāṃ tāṃ babre śaṅkaraḥ priyām ||

tadā prabhṛti sañjāto dūtīyāgo manoharaḥ |
praṇayena tadā śambhustayā sārdhaṃ rato bhavet ||

praṇavāntargataṃ mantraṃ mātaṅgyākhyaṃ vinirgatam |
sarvasaubhāgyajananaṃ mālāmantramabhūt tadā ||

ramā cāpi padaṃ divyamanindyaṃ lokarañjanam |
mātaṅgīmantramatyarthaṃ manmathapratipādakam ||

ādyantaśūnyā sā devī tasmāt khyātā tadantyajā |
mātaṅgī antyavarṇasthā tadā sā antyajā'bhavat ||

antyajānāṃ dvijānāṃ ca cakre aikyaṃ praśasyate |
sā devī sarvavarṇānāṃ varaṃ dattvā niruttaram ||

kṛtvā saṅketasamayaṃ cakre mātaṅgamuttamam |
na doṣaḥ sarvavarṇānāmiti dattvā varaṃ tadā ||

na doṣastatra vijñeyaḥ sarvaṃ te śruticoditam |
<271> devīmuddiśya mokṣārthaṃ kṛtaṃ yad doṣavarjitam ||

etacchāstramidaṃ divyaṃ na vācyaṃ śruticoditam |
antaryāgamidaṃ jñeyaṃ bahiryāgaṃ ca vaidikam ||

mantratantrasamāyuktaṃ taddvayaṃ brahmabodhakam |
cakrasaṅketasamayaṃ sarvaṃ tubhyaṃ prakāśitam ||

gopanīyaṃ prayatnena na vācyaṃ paśusannidhau |
tvaja śaṅkāṃ mahābhāga satyametanmayoditam ||

mātaṅgīpūjanaṃ śreṣṭha dūtīyāge manoharam |

dūtīyāgādau ca viprāṇāṃ nādhikāraḥ | taduktaṃ 
bṛhacchrīkramasaṃhitāyām (-)

vāmāgamo'pi viprastu madyaṃ māṃsaṃ na bhakṣayet |
svakīyāṃ parakīyāṃ vā nākṛṣya brahmaṇo yajet || iti |

agastyasaṃhitāyāmapi gaurīṃ prati śivavākyam (-)

āvābhyāṃ piśitaṃ raktaṃ sukhaṃ vāpi sureśvari |
varṇāśramocitaṃ dharmamavicāryā'rpayanti ye ||

bhūtapretapiśācāste bhavanti brahmarākṣasāḥ |

raktamārtavam | idamapi brāhmaṇaparameva anyathā tadvidhāyakavacanānāṃ 
nirviṣayatvāpatteḥ | brāhmaṇetarāṇāmapi yogināmeva dūtīyāge'dhikāraḥ | 
taduktaṃ siddhināthasaṃhitāyām (-) advaitajñānaniṣṭho yo yo'sau 
saṃsārapāragaḥ |

sa eva yajane dūtyā nā'dhikārī paro bhavediti ||

āgamaprāmāṇyavicāraḥ

nanu kūrmapurāṇa(-)godāvarīkhaṇḍa(-)sūtasaṃhitādau 
gautamasaptabrāhmaṇavyāmohāya tat preritaśivapraṇītānyetāni tantrāṇīti 
pratipādanāt kathamāgamānāṃ prāmāṇyam (?) atha nṛsiṃha(-)rāma(-)
gopālatāpinyādi(-)pratyakṣaśrutimūlakatvena teṣāṃ prāmāṇyamiti cen | na | 
pratyakṣaśrutimūlakānāṃ tathātve'pi tadamūlakānāmapramāṇatvāditi 
cenmaivam | phalasaṃvādenā'yurvedādiprāmāṇyena 
sakalavedaprāmāṇyavadapratyakṣaśrutimūlakānāmapi 
pratyakṣaśrutimūlakavat prāmāṇyopapatteḥ | bhāratādau 
pañcarātrapāśupatādīnāṃ praśaṃsāpratipādanāt |

abhāve vedamantrāṇāṃ pañcarātrodito vidhiḥ | iti varāhapurāṇavacanācca |

evaṃ ca (-) na ca vedādṛte kiñcichāstraṃ dharmābhidhāyakam |
yo'nyatra ramate so'sau na sambhāṣyo dvijātibhiḥ ||

yāni śāstrāṇi dṛśyante loke'smin vividhāni ca |
<272> śrutismṛtiviruddhāni niṣṭā teṣāṃ hi tāmasī ||

kāpālaṃ pañcarātraṃ ca yāmalaṃ vāmamārhatam |
evaṃvidhāni cānyāni mohanārthāni tāni tu |
mayā sṛṣṭāni śāstrāṇi mohāyaiṣāṃ pravartate ||

iti kūrmapurāṇavacanāni vedastutimātraparāṇi na 
tvāgamāprāmāṇyabodhakāni | vastutaḥ kāpālaṃ pañcarātraṃ 
cetyādikūrmapurāṇavacanena vedāmūlakatvabodhanāt īśvarapraṇītatvena 
vedavat svātantrayeṇaivāgamānāṃ prāmāṇyam | īśvareṇa vedasya 
praṇayanācca | prāsādaśrīkarādimantre 
