śivena devadevena bhaktānāṃ hitakāmyayā |
vedāt ṣaḍaṅgānuddhṛtya yogaśāstrācca sarvataḥ ||

tapaśca vipulaṃ taptvā devadānavaduścaram |
abdairdeśādisaṃyuktaṃ gūḍhamaprājñaninditam ||

varṇāśramakṛtairdharmairviparītaṃ kvacit samam |
śivena kathitaṃ śāstraṃ dharmakāmārthamuktaye ||

śatakoṭipramāṇena tatra pūjā kathaṃ vibho | iti |

gūḍhamiti anabhivyaktatātparyakamityarthaḥ | aprājñaninditamiti 
tātparyānabhijñaninditamityarthaḥ | tātparyaṃ kvacit tantre vyaktīkṛtaṃ kvacinna 
| ata evoktaṃ (-) varṇāśramakṛtairdharmairviparītaṃ kvacit samamiti | tena (-)
