[saptamastaraṅgaḥ]

atha naimittikam

svatantre (-) nityaṃ naimittikaṃ kāmyaṃ sāpekṣaṃ pūvapūrvataḥ |
anyathā tu bhaved vyarthaṃ kuryādāvaśyakaṃ tataḥ ||

nīlatantre (-) nityācārarato mantrī kuryānnaimittikārcanam |
naimittikārcane siddhaḥ kuryāt kāmyamakhaṇḍitam ||

kulārṇave (-) kṛṣṇāṣṭamī caturdaśī cāmāvāsyā ca pūrṇimā |
saṃkrāntiḥ pañcaparvāṇi teṣu puṇyadineṣu ca ||

pīṭhopagamane devi vīrasvajanadarśanāt |
deśikāgamane puṇyatīrthe daivatadarśane ||

yathābalaṃ yathāśrāddhaṃ yathādeśaṃ yathocitam |
yathājalaṃ yathādravyaṃ yathā pūjāṃ samācaret ||

na kuryāt kauliko mohād devatāśāpamāpnuyāt |

kulacūḍāmaṇau (-) devatātithinakṣatra vīrayogeṣu ceśvari |
somasūryoparāgeṣu manvādiṣu yugādiṣu ||

pūjā kāryeti śeṣaḥ | atra devatātithyādayaḥ kulākhyā eva | te ca vakṣyante |
yāmale (-) ātmano janmadivase tathā nijagurorapi |
vidyāyāḥ prāptidivase nāthavyāptidene tathā ||

darśe yugādāvayane viṣuve saṃkrame tathā |
pūjāṃ ca mahatīṃ kuryād devatātoṣahetave ||

tantrarāje (-) gurostu janmadivase vidyāprāptidineṣu ca |
svajanmadivase nāthavyāptivāsara eva ca ||

akṣaratrayasampātadine pūrṇādine tathā |

pūjā kāryeti śeṣaḥ | nāthavyāptirgurumaraṇam | akṣaratrayasampātaḥ 
yugākṣara dinākṣarodayākṣarāṇāmaikyam | tattu sundarīmadhikṛtyaivoktam | 
atastatraiva nimittam |

kulacūḍāmaṇau (-) kulavāre kulāṣṭamyāṃ caturdaśyāṃ viśeṣataḥ |
yoginīpūjanaṃ tatra pradhānaṃ kulapūjanam ||

yathā viṣṇutithau viṣṇuḥ pūjito vāñchitapradaḥ |
<275> tathā kulatithau durgā pūjitā vāñchitapradā ||

kulatithāviti vāranakṣatrayorupalakṣaṇam | kulavārādayo yāmale uktāḥ (-)

raviścandro guruḥ sauriścatvārastvakulā matāḥ |
bhaumaśukrau kulākhyau tu budhavāraḥ kulākulaḥ ||

dvitīyā daśamī ṣaṣṭhī kulākulamudāhṛtam |
viṣamāścākulāḥ proktāḥ śeṣāśca tithayaḥ kulāḥ ||

vāruṇārdrābhijinmūlaṃ kulākulamudāhṛtam |
kulāni samadhiṣṇyāni taccheśāṇyakulāni tu ||

trikule tu pūjāvaśyakī |

kulavāre kularkṣe ca kulalagne kulakṣaṇe |
yoginīnāṃ sadā pūjā manasāpi na hīyate ||

iti kulacūḍāmaṇivacanāt (-)

tathā (-) kulavṛkṣe yajed devīṃ kulavṛkṣān namet sadā |
na svapyāt kulavṛkṣādho nāroheta kadācana ||

na caitāṃścedayen mantrī na pādaistān spṛśedapi |
tatpatreṣu na bhoktavyaṃ prāṇaiḥ kaṇṭhagatairapi ||

sahakāraḥ karṇikāraḥ kesarastilakastathā |
kadambaḥ sindhuvāraśca kaṅkeliścampakāhvayaḥ ||

śleṣmātakaḥ kuruvako nimbaścaladalastathā |
yajñāṅgo jaṭilo vilvaḥ kulavṛkṣā matā amī ||

eṣu sannihitā nityaṃ yoginyaḥ sarvakāmadāḥ |
sarvapīṭheṣu pīṭhaṃ tat kāmarūpaṃ phalapradam ||

sakṛdapyarcitā yatra devī vāñchitasiddhidā |
tasmācchataguṇaṃ puṇyaṃ kāmākhyāyonimaṇḍalam ||

dvividhaṃ tat samākhyātaṃ vyaktamavyaktameva ca |
vyaktādavyaktamanaghaṃ mahāpuṇyaphalapradam ||

labhyate yadi bhāgyena kulajñena manīṣiṇā |
tadā tatra yajed devīmanekairupacārakaiḥ ||

dṛśyate'pi yadā bhāgyāt tadārcāṃ manasācaret |
parvate vipinoddeśe nirjane maṇḍape tathā ||

<276> catuṣpathe śmaśāne vā gacchan sādhakasattamaḥ |
dhyātvā devīṃ manuṃ japtvā natvā sthāne vrajet tataḥ ||

paśuśaktiṃ pakṣiśaktiṃ gṛdhraṃ vīkṣya namecchivām |
kṛśodari mahācaṇḍe muktakeśi balipriye ||

kulācāraprasannāsye namaste śaṅkarapriye |
śmaśāne ca śavaṃ vīkṣya mantrapūrvakamānayet ||

pradakṣiṇamanuvrajya labhate siddhimuttamām |
ghoradaṃṣṭre kaṭhorākṣi kiṭiśabdapraṇādini ||

ghore ghorakarāsphāle namaste citivāsini |
raktaṃ vastraṃ tathā puṣpaṃ vilokya tripurāṃ namet ||

bandhūkapuṣpasaṅkāśe tripure bhayanāśini |
bhāgyodayasamutpanne namaste varavarṇini ||

rājānaṃ rājaputraṃ vā hastyaśvasyandanānyapi |
astrāṇi vīrapuruṣaṃ mahiṣaṃ kulanāyakam ||

kṛṣṇavarṇaṃ tathā puṣpaṃ dṛṣṭvā durgāṃ named budhaḥ |
jaya devi jagaddhātri tripurārcitadaivate (?) ||

bhaktebhyo varade devi mahiṣaghni namo'stu te |
prathamaṃ ca dvitīyaṃ ca krīḍālolāṃ kumārikām ||

yuvatīnāṃ samūhaṃ ca yuvatīmekavṛkṣakam |
nirīkṣya mantravanmūlaṃ prajaped bhairavaṃ namet ||

namāmi varade devi muṇḍamālāvibhūṣite |
raktamālāsamākīrṇe varade tvāṃ namāmyaham ||

praṇamet sarvasiddhyarthaṃ dṛṣṭvaitāni vicakṣaṇaḥ |
anyathā na bhavet tasya mantrasiddhiḥ kadācana ||

matsyasūkte (-) aṣṭamyāṃ pūjanaṃ devyā sarvakāmaphalapradam |
rambhāpuṣpaṃ bījapūraṃ sugandhiparimiśritam ||

miśrīkṛtya baliṃ dadyādaṣṭamyāṃ ca viśeṣataḥ |
kulaṃ kṣīraṃ tathā dadyād dadhiśarkarayā'nvitam ||

dānamakṣayyasiddhyarthaṃ dadyād daivyaiḥ prayatnataḥ |
udayākare (-) ṣaṣṭhī bhādrapade māsi kṛṣṇāśvinacaturdaśī |
<277> kārtika navamī śuklā mārge kṛṣṇā tu pañcamī ||

pauṣe tu pūrṇimā devi māghe sitacaturthikā |
phālgunaikādaśī kṛṣṇā caitre kṛṣṇā trayodaśī ||

vaiśākhe ca tṛtīyā syāj jyaiṣṭhe daśaharā smṛtā |
āṣāḍhe dvādaśī kṛṣṇā amāvāsyā ca śrāvaṇe |
etāni devīparvāṇi kṣapārdhe sādhayed budhaḥ ||
arcāṃ kṛtvā yathānyāyamaśvamedhaphalaṃ labhet |

atra ca yatra viśeṣo na śrūyate tatra śuklaiva grāhyeti tāntrikāḥ | yāmale (-)

vaiśākhe māsi śuklāyāṃ tithau pratipadi dhurvam |
brāhme muhūrte cotthāya kṛtanityakriyaḥ sudhīḥ ||

ardhodite dinamaṇau pūjayediṣṭadevatām |
arghyaṃ nivedya taccheṣaṃ śaktyā saha pibet svayam ||

prajapet prayato mantrī aṣṭottarasahasrakam |
evambhūtadinaṃ yāvat kṛtvā darśadine punaḥ ||

samayācāracaturāḥ śaktīrabhyavahārayet |
pūjayed vidhinā mantrī labhate vāñchitaṃ phalam ||

madhyāhne vātha sāyāhne pūjayeduktamārgataḥ |
trisandhyaṃ vā japen mantrī vāñchitāṃ siddhimāpnuyāt ||

māghe māsi site pakṣe sādhakaḥ pratipattithau |
sāyaṃ sandhyāmupāsyā'tha divāhāravivarjitaḥ ||

udite pūrvavaccandre yajed devīmananyadhīḥ |
candrāstamayaparyantaṃ mūlamantraṃ japet sudhīḥ ||

evaṃ pratidinaṃ kuryāccaturdaśyantikaṃ sudhīḥ |
paurṇamāsyāṃ yathāpūrvaṃ pūrtiṃ kuryād vicakṣaṇaḥ ||

evamevāsite pakṣe vidadhīta viśāladhīḥ |
mucyate sarvapāpebhyaḥ sveṣṭāṃ siddhimavāpnuyāt ||

ūrje śuklapratipadi tato vrataparāyaṇaḥ |
maṇḍale sarvatobhadre cāmbunā pūrṇamuttamam ||

saṃsthāpya kalaśaṃ tatra kāṃsyapātraṃ nidhāpayet |
jvālayedatra dīpaṃ tu sthūlavartikamuttamam ||

<278> dhyātvā dīpe mahādevīmarcayedupacārakaḥ |
sāgraṃ sahasraṃ matimān prajapet kulamantrakam ||

evambhūtadinaṃ yāvat kṛtvā darśadine tataḥ |
pūrvavat tanuyāccheṣaṃ kāṅkṣitāṃ siddhimāpnuyāt ||

bhṛguvāre viśālākṣīṃ sundarīṃ yauvanoddhurām |
āhūya kusumollāsikulāṃ sarvāṅgasundarīm ||

abhyarcya snāpayen mantrī abhyaṅgavidhinā ca tām |
kausumbhacāruvasanāṃ nānābharaṇabhūṣitām |
upaveśyāsane divye devatābhāvasaṃyutaḥ ||

tasyā dehe nyasan nāsāṃstasyāmāvāhya devatām |
nirvikāramanā mantrī japedagre sahasrakam ||

japaṃ samarpayet tasyai devīmudvāsya sādhakaḥ |
bhogairnānāvidhai ramyaistayā saha niśāṃ nayet ||

evaṃ yo bhṛguvāre vai kuryāt pūjanamādṛtaḥ |
sarvasiddhimavāpnoti nātra kāryā vicāraṇā ||

kulārṇave (-) śrīcakraṃ kauliko mohād viśeṣadivaseṣu yaḥ |
na karoti samarthaḥ san sa bhaved yoginīpaśuḥ ||

evaṃ ca kvacit phalaśravaṇamapi na naimittikatvabādhakam | indro koṭīravirdaśeti 
phalaśravaṇe'pi grahoparāgasnānasyānyatrāpi naimittikatvavyavasthāpanāt 
akaraṇe pratyavāyasmaraṇasyāviśiṣṭatvāt | nīlatantre (-)

aṣṭamyāṃ ca caturdaśyāṃ pūjayecca prayatnataḥ |
yad yat prārthayate mantrī tattadāpnoti nityaśaḥ ||

labhate mañjulāṃ vāṇīṃ tathāṣṭamyāṃ sadā yajet |
aṣṭamyāṃ pūjanaṃ devyāḥ sarvakāmaphalapradam ||

rambhāpuṣpaṃ bījapūraṃ sugandhiparimiśritam |
miśrīkṛtya baliṃ dadyādaṣṭamyāṃ ca viśeṣataḥ ||

dvijanmanā'rjitaṃ pāpaṃ tatkṣaṇādeva nāśayet |
tathā (-) tāriṇī yatra pīṭhe tu śivārūpā'vatiṣṭhati |
tatra yatnena gantavyaṃ puṇyasaṃkhyā na vidyate ||

lakṣadvayaṃ japen mantrī tāriṇī yatra tiṣṭhati |
<279> niṣpṛhasthiracittena siddhirbhavati tatkṣaṇāt ||

samāhṛtāṃ mṛttikāṃ ca akṣataṃ ca tathaiva ca |
madhunā pāyasaṃ caiva kṣīramājyaṃ ca śarkarām ||

baliṃ dadyācca godhāṃ vai āsavaṃ ca praśasyate |
rambhāpuṣpaṃ śālamatsyaṃ juhuyān mantravittamaḥ ||

sarvāṃ siddhimanukramya cānte mokṣamavāpnuyāt |
sākṣataṃ bilvapatraṃ ca juhuyācca sahasrakam ||

labhate mañjulāṃ vāṇīṃ mahāṣṭamyāṃ ca sādhakaḥ |
triśaktiratne (-) caitraprabhṛtimāsānāṃ paurṇamāsyāṃ mahāśivām |
arcayed vakṣyamāṇena vidhinā sādhakottamaḥ ||

caitre damanakaiḥ pūjyā kṛtvā nityārcanaṃ śive |
vasantasambhavaiḥ puṣpaiścandanāgurumiśritaiḥ ||

vaiśākhe hemakamalairathavā raktacandanaiḥ |
upacārairhimaiḥ sarvairyajecchaṅkaravallabhām ||

jyaiṣṭhe māsi yajed devīṃ panasaiḥ kadalīphalaiḥ |
sahakāraphalairamyaiḥ sarvakāmārthasiddhaye ||

āṣāḍhe māsi sampūjyā candanaiḥ kusumānvitaiḥ |
elālavaṅgakakkolai ramyairvāpi mahāśivām ||

śrāvaṇe māsi sampūjyā pavitraiḥ parameśvarīm |
pavitrāropaṇaṃ nāma tathā damanakotsavam ||

jānīyāt sādhakaśreṣṭho matkṛte tantraśekhare |
māsi bhādrapade pūjyā ketakaiḥ śaṅkarapriyām ||

āśvine māsi darśādi yajet pūrṇāntikaṃ sudhīḥ |
pratyahaṃ juhuyān mantrī dinavṛddhyā śataṃ śatam |
mahāntamutsavaṃ kuryāt sarvasiddhimavāpnuyāt ||

sādhakaḥ kārtike māsi kuṅkumena samarcayet |
pradīpān juhuyād vahnau niśīthinyāṃ ghṛtaplutān ||

ghṛtapradīpān devyagre vidyayā ṣoḍaśārpayet |
ekaikamarpayed vidvān parivāragaṇāya ca ||

athavaikaṃ tu saṃsthāpya madhye tamabhito nava |
<280> devyai samarpayen mantrī mūloccaraṇapūrvakam ||

mārgaśīrṣe japan mantraṃ māṣāpūparmanoharaiḥ |
nārikelāmbusaṃmiśraṃ karpūraṃ vinivedayet ||

pauṣe guḍaiḥ śarkarābhiḥ pūjayitvā maheśvarīm |
sādhakaḥ sveṣṭasampattyai gavyaṃ dugdhaṃ nivedayet ||

māghe'bhyarcya tilairdevīmapūpān dugdhamarpayet |
phālgune pūjayed devīṃ sauvarṇairvātha rājataiḥ ||

kamalaiścūtapuṣpaiśca tathā nānopacārakaiḥ |

pavitraṃ granthiyutapaṭṭādisūtram | tadvidhiśca vakṣyate | yatra māsi tithiviśeṣo 
noktastatrārcanādikaṃ paurṇamāsyāmeva prakramāt | pratisaṃvatsaraṃ 
damanotsava āvaśyakaḥ |

jñānārṇave (-) damanena ca yo mantrī varṣamadhye na pūjayet |
tasya sāṃvatsarī pūjā damanāya bhaviṣyati || iti |

tathā (-) damanāropaṇaṃ vakṣye sādhakānāṃ hitāya vai |
saṃvatsarakṛtā pūjā pūrṇāya na bhavet priye ||

mahākālasaṃhitāyām (-)

damanāropaṇākhyaikā pavitrāropaṇī parā |
pratisaṃvatsaraṃ caite yo na kurvīta sādhakaḥ ||

tasya varṣakṛtā pūjā vyarthā bhavati bhāmini |
kṛtāmapi vilumpanti bhūtapretādayo gaṇāḥ ||

pratisaṃvatsaraṃ tasmāt kuryāt yatnena sādhakaḥ |
damanāropaṇaṃ karma pavitrāropaṇaṃ tathā ||

pūjākālo dakṣiṇāmūrtisaṃhitāyām (-)

caitrādayastrayo māsāḥ pakṣau sitasitetarau |
eteṣāṃ pūrvapūrvastu kālaḥ sarvottamottamaḥ ||

mahākālasaṃhitāyām (-)

kālastadīyo mukhyastu śuklapakṣo madhormataḥ |
madhyamo mādhavo jyeṣṭhaḥ śucistvadhama ucyate ||

cāturmāsye praviṣṭe tu yaḥ kuryād dāmanaṃ vidhim |
na tasya durmateḥ siddhirviparītaṃ ca jāyate |
bhūtāḥ pretāḥ pranṛtyanti kṣudhāsaṃpīḍitodarāḥ ||

<281> asmākaṃ bhāgyayogena cet kaścit sādhako'dhamaḥ |
supte janārdane kuryād damanāropaṇaṃ vidhim ||

tadā vayaṃ vilumpābho bhakṣayāmo'rcanaṃ ca tat |
ato vasante śiśire grīṣme kuryādamuṃ vidhim |
naiva varṣāsu śaradi hemantartau na ca priye ||

tasmādṛtutraye pūrvodite damanakārcanam |
na parartutraye kāryaṃ devīprītiṃ vidhitsatā ||

tathā (-) ādyottaraphalgunī bhaṃ tithiścāpi trayodaśī |
śuklapakṣaścaitramāso yogo vṛddhistathaiva ca ||

tathā (-) iyaṃ tithiranaṅgākhyā tava nāmnā bhaviṣyati |
tvāmasyāṃ ye'rcayiṣyanti gandhapuṣpādivistaraiḥ ||

naivedyadhūpadīpādyairgītavādyādinartanaiḥ |
suślīlavacanākṣepairmādakadravyabhojanaiḥ ||

yoniliṅgādiśabdānāṃ pralāpairhāsyakārakaiḥ |
tattadākāravacanairmahotsavasamanvitaiḥ ||

tvaṃ varānīpsitān dadyāsteṣāṃ madvacanaṃ smara |
tatpare'hani vistāryā matpūjā makaradhvajā ||

dakṣiṇāmūrtisaṃhitāyām (-)

aṣṭamyāṃ vā caturdaśyāṃ paurṇamāsyāmathāpi vā |
pūrvarātrau prakurvīta sadyo vāpyadhivāsanam ||

mahākālasaṃhitāyām (-)

adhivāsanakarmāṅgabhūtaṃ saṅkalpamācaret |
rāśitithyādikaṃ procya varttamānatayā sthitam ||

vārṣikārcā samāptyarthaṃ śvaḥkartavyasya karmaṇaḥ |

damanāropaṇasyāṅgabhūtamadhivāsanaṃ kariṣya iti saṅkalpya 
pañcāyatanamarcayet |
dakṣiṇāmūrtisaṃhitāyām (-) āmantrya damanaṃ cādau catuḥkalpalatādibhiḥ | 
catuḥkalpalatāmantrastu (-) oṃ hrīṃ hraṃ kheṃ cache kṣastrīṃ hūṃ kṣeṃ hrīṃ 
phaṭ oṃ hrīṃ aiṃ hrīṃ oṃ sarasvatyai namaḥ hrīṃ śrīṃ klīṃ drāṃ drīṃ klīṃ 
clūṃ saḥ |

kāmanetrasamudbhūta ratinetrajalāpluta |
ṛṣigandharvasiddhānāṃ vimohaka namo'stu te ||

<282> śivakārye samucchidya netavyo'si śivājñayā |
ityāmantrya śivaṃ kāmaṃ tatra sampūjayet sudhīḥ ||

anyadevopāsakenāpi mantre śivapadasthāne ūho na kartavyaḥ śaktitantra 
evābhidhānāt | śivamityupalakṣaṇam | sveṣṭadevatāṃ pūjayediti kecit |

athādhivāsanakṛtyam

mantramuktāvalyām (-) pūvedyuḥ saṃyato bhūtvā mantrī vāditranisvanaiḥ |
gacched damanakārāmaṃ yatrāśokaḥ pratiṣṭhitaḥ ||

tatropaviśya mantreṇa pūjayitvāsane śubhe |
natvā guruṃ gaṇeśānaṃ sveṣṭadevaṃ ca mantravit ||

svātmānaṃ sakalīkṛtya kalaśaṃ sthāpayed budhaḥ |
vardhanīṃ caiva saṃsthāpya vidhinā mantravittamaḥ ||

dattvā baliṃ tu bhūtebhyastāni niḥsārya mantravit |
aśokaṃ tatra sampūjya tadabhāve vidhāya tat ||

maṇḍale candanenātha phalapuṣpopaśobhitam |
kālaṃ tatraiva sampūjya tadabhāve vidhāya tat ||

maṇḍale candanenātha phalapuṣpopaśobhitam |
kālaṃ tatraiva sampūjya vasantaṃ ca yathāvidhi ||

aghoravidyayā paścād damanaṃ prokṣya vāriṇā |
astramantreṇa saṃrakṣya kavacenā'vaguṇṭhayet ||

triśūlamudrāṃ badhvā'tha bhrāmayed damanopari |
nṛtyagītādibhiḥ samyak kuryāj jāgaraṇaṃ niśi ||

vardhanī karakaṃ kṣudrajalapātramiti yāvat | tatsthāpanaṃ kumbhanairantaryeṇa 
kumbhalagnaṃ nyasedityabhidhānāt | bhūtabalidānaṃ hrīṃ trīṃ 
sarvavighnakṛdbhyaḥ sarvabhūtebhyo hūṃ phaṭ svāhetyanena kartavyam | 
tadapasāraṇamantrastatraiva (-)

pāṣaṇḍakāriṇo bhūtā bhūmau ye cāntarikṣagāḥ |
bhuvi loke sthitā ye ca te naśyantu śivājñayā ||

rakṣā'bhiṣekarūpaiva vardhanījalena | aghore ghore hrīṃ ghoraghoratare śrīṃ 
sarvataḥ sarvasarvebhyo namaste'stu rudrarūpebhyo hrīṃ śrīṃ iti aghoramantraḥ | 
triśūlamudrā śivarahasye uktā (-) aṅguṣṭhena kaniṣṭhāgraṃ baddhvā 
śiṣṭāṅgulitrayam |

<283> prasārayet triśūlākhyamudreyaṃ parikīrtitā ||

atha damanamutpāṭayet | tathāhi dakṣiṇāmūrtisaṃhitāyām (-)

svayamutpāṭya damanaṃ samūlaṃ pallavairyutam |
ānītamathavānyena mūlyādānītamīśvari ||

vāmataḥ sthāpayed devi sarvatobhadrakāmbuje |
vasvāre dāmanaṃ pātraṃ sthāpayet pūjayet tataḥ ||

praṇavaṃ bhuvaneśāni rataye nama ityapi |
ratimantro maheśāni kāmamantrastathocyate ||

praṇavaṃ kāmabījaṃ ca kāmāya nama ityapi |
mantreṇa pūjayet tatra madanaṃ karṇikāgatam ||

tatastatpadmapūrvādi patreṣu pratipūjayet |
aṣṭāśāṣvaṣṭakairmantrairaṣṭadravyayutaiḥ kramāt ||

kāmo bhasmaśarīraśca anaṅgo manmathastathā |
vasantasakhanāmā ca smara ikṣudhanurdharaḥ ||

puṣpabāṇaśca tārādyā ṅehṛdantāḥ prakīrtitāḥ |
karpūraṃ rocanāyugmaṃ kastūrīi ca tataḥ priye ||

aguruṃ kuṅkumaṃ caiva dhātrī candanameva ca |
sugandhipuṣpayuktāni aṣṭadravyāṇi pārvati ||

sampūjya madanaṃ samyag gandhapuṣpākṣatādibhiḥ |
japedanaṅgagāyatrīṃ yathāśaktyā prasannadhīḥ ||

kāmadevāya ityuktvā vidmahe ca vadet tataḥ |
puṣpabāṇāya ityuktvā dhīmahi tu padaṃ tataḥ ||

bhavedanaṅgagāyatrī tanno'naṅgaḥ pracodayāt |
namo'stu puṣpavāṇāya jagadānandakāriṇe ||

manmathāya jagannetre ratiprītipriyāya ca |
anena manunā devi namaskuryādanantaram ||

atha vijñāpanaṃ devyai kuryād damanapāṇiyuk |
āmantritāsi deveśi sadyaḥ kāle mayā śive ||

kartavyaṃ ca yathālābhaṃ pūrṇaṃ parva tavājñayā |
vijñāpanākhyamantreṇa tripurāṃ paritoṣayet ||

<284> tataḥ sampūjayeda devīṃ gandhapuṣpākṣatādibhiḥ |
naivedyaṃ vidhivad dattvā śrīvidyāṃ prārthayet tataḥ ||

ṣoḍaśārṇe jaganmātarvāñchitārthaphalaprade |
hṛtsthāna pūraya me devi kāmān kāmeśvareśvari ||

anena prārthayed devīṃ paścād damanamīśvari |
vāmāvaguṇṭhitaṃ kuryādastreṇāpi surakṣitam |
tato jāgaraṇaṃ kuryāt sadyaścej jāgaro nahi ||

damanasyānyānayanapakṣe'pi utpāṭanaṃ pūrvameva kāryam | 
damanasthalīmityādipadasya damanāvasthitisthānamātravācitvāt yadi tu 
damanārāmaṃ savidhasthaṃ syāt tadā yathoktasthāna evotpāṭanamiti viśeṣaḥ | 
vasvāre'ṣṭadale'mbuja ityanvayaḥ | pūjayet ratikāmo'grimagranthānurodhāt | 
rocanāyugmaṃ gorocanā vaṃśarocanā ca | tripurāṃ śrīvidyāmityubhayamapi 
upalakṣaṇam | sarvatraitatkarmaṇo vihitatvenākāṃkṣātaulyāt | ṣoḍaśārṇa 
ityādimantre śrīvidyābhinnadevīpūjane ṣoḍaśārṇe iti padasthāne sarvarūpe iti 
yojyam |

atha pūjādinakṛtyam

mahākālasaṃhitāyām (-)

tataḥ prabhāte utthāya kṛtvā nityakriyāṃ svakām |
kṛtārcāsaṃbhṛtiḥ pūjāmaṇḍapaṃ samupāviśet ||

mūrtiyantrālayādīni kuryādujjvalitāni hi |
saṅkalpaṃ purataḥ kuryāt tadanantaramīśvari ||

damanāropakarmāhaṃ kariṣya iti collikhet |

dakṣiṇāmūrtisaṃhitāyām (-)

atha prātaḥ samutthāya kuryād vai nityapūjanam |
tato namittikaṃ kuryād damanaṃ ca supūjayet ||

naimittikaṃ vakṣyamāṇaṃ mukhyamiṣṭadevatāpūjanarūpam | yadyapyatra 
taduttaraṃ damanapūjā śrūyate tathāpi damanasya svato'devatvāt tatpūjanasya 
mukhyapūjanopayuktadamanasaṃskāratvenopādeyatvāt prathamameva 
tadācaraṇaṃ yuktam | asya kramatātparyakatvāt | ata eva ca jñānārṇave 
tathaivoktam | tathāhi (-)

damanaṃ navadhā kuryāt pūjayet tadanantaram |
ānandeśvarabījena tato bhinnena sundari ||

<285> ānandeśvarībījena navadhā bindunā saha |
navaprakārasaṃbhinnaṃ damanaṃ pūjayet kramāt ||

tenaiva mahatīṃ pūjāṃ madhye tatpuṣpamiśritām |
manoharāṃ ca vidhivat kṛtvā naivedyamuttamam ||

sakarpūraṃ ca tāmbūlaṃ dattvā saṃprārthayet tataḥ |
samastacakracakreśi sarvavidyāśarīriṇī ||

vedamātarmamaitat tu bhavatviṣṭaṃ tavājñayā |
tataḥ svagurumabhyarcya puṣpabhūtāmbarādibhiḥ ||

dattvā damanakaṃ tasmai praṇipatya prasādya ca |
jalakeliṃ tataḥ kuryāt sākaṃ samayibhiḥ sukham ||

ante dānaṃ prakurvīta rasaiḥ ṣaḍbhiḥ samanvitam |
evaṃ yaḥ kurute vidvān damanāropaṇaṃ kramāt ||

tasya sāṃvatsarī pūjā śrīvidyādhiṣṭhitā bhavet |

ānandeśvarānandeśvarīmantrayoḥ pūrvoktayoścaramasvarapṛthagbhāvena 
navākṣaratvam | atra sarvākṣareṣvanusvārayogo viśeṣaḥ | pūjā ca prathamaṃ 
bhairavamantrākṣaraistathā bhairavīmantrākṣarairnamontakaiḥ kāryeti 
sampradāyaḥ | prathamaṃ ca madhye tataḥ prāgādiprādakṣiṇyena 
kāmapūjāyāṃ tathādarśanāt | madhyaṃ pūrvalikhitāṣṭadalakamalasya | 
tatpuṣpamiśritāṃ damanapuṣpamiśritām | pūjā ceṣṭadevatāyā uttaravākye 
prārthanasya tadgatatvenaiva śrutatvāt | iyameva pūjā pradhānā | 
mahākālasaṃhitāyām (-)

śaktipūjā ca kartavyā damanāropaṇottaram |
kṛte purastāt sakalaṃ viphalaṃ jāyate priye ||

śaktyarcane'kṛte cāpi niṣphalaṃ jāyate tathā |
ataḥ kāryā śaktipūjā damanāropaṇottaram ||

tathā (-) samarcya damanaṃ caitre tena cābhyarcya kālikām |
saptajanmakṛtaiḥ pāpairmucyate nātra saṃśayaḥ ||

caitraśuklatrayodaśyāmadhivāsanapūrvakam |
āropya damanaṃ durgāṃ vidhinā'nena pūjayet ||

mayoktena varārohe tathā puṇyaphalaṃ śṛṇu |
aśvamedhasahasrasya rājasūyaśatasya ca ||

tatphalaṃ samavāpyā'sau devavad divi modate |
<286> tathā (-) evaṃ yaḥ kurute pūjāṃ damanāropaṇābhidhām |
bhavanti nāpadastasya kadācidapi sundari ||

sidhyanti tasya mantrāśca nārīṇāṃ vallabho bhavet |
sarvasampadyutaḥ śrīmān modate divi devavat ||

iti damanāropaṇavidhiḥ

atha pavitrāropaṇam

tacca prativarṣamāvaśyakam | dakṣiṇāmūrtisaṃhitāyāmīśvaravākyam (-)

atha vakṣye maheśāni pavitrāropaṇaṃ mahat |
yasmin kṛte kṛtaṃ sarvamanyathā śūnyamucyate ||

gate saṃvatsare yastu na karoti pavitrakam |
ekīkṛtya phalaṃ tasya nīyate durgaṇairbalāt ||

kālo'pyuktastatraiva (-)

āṣāḍha uttamo māsaḥ śrāvaṇo madhyamaḥ priye |
hīno bhādrapado māsaḥ pakṣau sitasitetarau ||

praśastaḥ śuklapakṣastu tadabhāve sitetaraḥ |
caturdaśyaṣṭamīpūrṇamāsītithiṣu vai yajet ||

mahākālasaṃhitāyāmapi (-)

kālo grīṣmaḥ śarad varṣā eṣa mukhyatamaḥ priye |
kecid vasantamicchanti kālaṃ mādhyamikaṃ budhāḥ ||

naiva hemantaśiśirau praśasyete kadācana |

tathā (-) tacca kārpāsajaṃ jñeyaṃ śāṇaṃ vā paṭṭajaṃ tathā |
tathā (-) kṛtaṃ navaguṇaṃ sūtraṃ navaguṇamudīryate |

(..........) taddhi varṇānāmaṃse tiṣṭhati sundari ||

tadeva sūtraṃ devānāṃ kaṇṭhe bahuguṇīkṛtam |
pavitramiti nāmnaiva kathyate nigamādiṣu ||

tathā (-) āmnāyabhedād bhidyante sūtravarṇāḥ sureśvari |
pūrvārdhayoḥ sitaṃ sūtraṃ raktasūtraṃ tathottare ||

paścime'pyatha pītaṃ hi adhodakṣiṇayormatam |
na nīlāktaṃ bhavet sūtraṃ ṣaḍāmnāyeṣu karhicit ||

āmnāyeṣvatha savaṣu praśastaṃ sitameva vā |
<287> kumārīkartitaṃ sūtramatiprāśastyakārakam ||

patimatyā kṛtaṃ madhyamadhamaṃ vidhavākṛtam |
viprakṣatrāryajātīnāṃ patnībhī racitaṃ śuci ||

āvarjitaṃ yacchūdrābhistadaśucyeva kathyate |
viśeṣato hyamīṣāṃ hi vihitaṃ patihīnayā ||

vaiśyayā kartitaṃ sūtraṃ medhyamityapare jaguḥ |
rajakyā vātha yāntrikyā kāṣāyapaṭayā'thavā ||

gopyā vāpyatha muṇḍinyā mālinyā yad vinirmitam |
tatsūtrajapavitreṇa sādhako narakaṃ vrajet |
tasmāt sūtravinirmāṇe yatnaḥ kāryo viśeṣataḥ ||

madhyamastrīgṛhī(?) yastu puṃvāraḥ śreṣṭha ucyate |
ṣaṇṭāho'dhamakalpaḥ(?) syāt tithī riktāvivarjitā |
sāpi bhūtatithau grāhyā caturthī bhauma eva ca |
ravau tu saptamī varjyā riktā varjyā gurāvapi ||

tithistyājyā na kāpīha bhaumena sahitā yadi |
punnakṣatrasya yogena phalādhikyaṃ hi janyate ||

tānitvajīvadinakṛd viṣṇavo ni(-)ṛtistathā |
kaṣvapyateṣu pūrvedyuḥ paredyurapi vā punaḥ ||

dakṣiṇāmūrtisaṃhitāyām (-)

paṭṭasūtraṃ viśiṣṭaṃ tu kārpāsajanitaṃ tathā |
triguṇaṃ triguṇīkṛtya prakṣālyā'malavāriṇā ||

paścimāsyodgatairmantrairdākṣiṇyaiḥ śodhayet tataḥ |
mantrairatha pavitrāṇi manoramyāṇi kārayet ||

aṣṭottaraśataṃ śreṣṭhaṃ tadardhaṃ madhyamaṃ priye |
tadardhaṃ ca kaniṣṭhaṃ syād yathāśakti ca kārayet ||

uttarāsyoditairmantrairdaśa granthīstu kārayet |
vicitrayā citrayet tāḥ kuṅkumādibhiradrije ||

pavitradānadivasāt pūrvedyuradhivāsanam (-)

sadyo'dhivāsanaṃ vāpi kuryāt tu parameśvari |
rātrau samayibhiḥ sārdhaṃ nityapūjādyanantaram ||

<288> ūrdhvasiṃhāsanairmantraiḥ sūtrapātaṃ tu vāmataḥ |
sthāpayitvā'stravarmābhyāṃ kṛtvā rakṣāvaguṇṭhane ||

dantakāṣṭhaṃ tathā gandhaṃ bhasmacandanamṛttikāḥ |
siddhārthāṃśca tathā dhātrīphalaṃ vakulasambhavam ||

pūrvādidikṣu kramataḥ pavitrasūtrabhājanāt |
aśvatthapatrapātreṣu prakṣipet siddhihetave ||

kumārasoma svāheśa brahma nāga śikhidhvajāḥ |
sūryaḥ sadāśivaḥ śarvo devatā syurnavāmarāḥ ||

sūtreṣu pūjayed brahmaviṣṇvīśāṃśca trisūtrake |
kriyā ca pauruṣī vīrā gāyatrī cāparājitā ||

vijayā ca jayā devī muktidā ca sadāśivā |
manonmanī ca navamī daśamī sarvatomukhī ||

granthisthadevatāḥ pūjyā upacāraiḥ samarcayet |
nityāḥ ṣoḍaśa deveśi śrīvidyāṃ ca smaret priye ||

paścimāsyodgatairityādi śrīvidyāparam | atra tu mūlamantreṇa tūṣṇīmeva vā 
kṣālanaṃ kuryāt | kumāraḥ sanatkumāraḥ | śikhidhvajo guhaḥ | 
ṣoḍaśanityāpūjanamapi śrīvidyāparameva | mahākālasaṃhitāyām (-)

yāvatyo devatāḥ santi nitye naimittike'pi ca |
yāścāvṛttiparīvārāḥ pañcāyatanasaṃyutāḥ ||

apekṣitaṃ hi sarveṣāṃ pavitramatra karmaṇi |
tathā (-) kṛtāñjaliḥ padyamenaṃ mantrarūpamudīrayet ||

tvaṃ sucanād vedamakhakriyāṇāṃ prāpto'si karpāsajasūtrasaṃjñām |
tvayā vinirmāya bahūpavītaṃ dāsye'marebhyo bhavasūtrapūtam ||

dakṣiṇāmūrtisaṃhitāyām (-)

adhivāsa iti proktaḥ paścādārādhanaṃ bhavet |
nityārcanānantaraṃ tu naimittikamidaṃ bhavet ||

mahākālasaṃhitāyām (-)

atha naimittikasamamārabhetārcanaṃ budhaḥ |

tathā (-) naivedyadhūpadīpānāṃ kartavyā bhūyasī sthitiḥ ||

ākāraṇīyā yatnena svasvavargyāstu deśikaiḥ |
kusumaistoraṇaṃ kāryaṃ bahirantargṛhasya ca ||

<289> dakṣiṇāmūrtisaṃhitāyām (-)

samayibhyaśca citrāṇi kanakābhyaśca bhojanam |
svaguruṃ pūjayed bhaktyā vastrālaṅkāragodhanaiḥ ||

yathāvidhi namaskṛtya devīrūpeṇa cintayet |
āropayet pavitraṃ tu vittaśāṭhyavivarjitaḥ ||

guruḥ sampūjyate yatra tat karma saphalaṃ bhavet |
sa cenna pūjyate yatra kriyā sā niṣphalā bhavet ||

gurorabhāve tatputraṃ tadabhāve tadaṅganām |
bhāryābhāve'rcayedanyaṃ gurugotrasamudbhavam ||

kṛtvā pūrṇāhutiṃ paścādagnau dadyāt pavitrakam |
śrīcakramadhyasiddhāyai pūjayet tannivedayet ||

mahākālasaṃhitāyām (-)

yasya yasya tu devasya yo yo'rcāvasaro bhavet |
tasya tasya tu devasya tasmiṃstasmin varānane ||

pavitraṃ tasya dātavyaṃ tanmantroccārapūrvakam |
tathā (-) chāgāścāvaśyakatvena dātavyā balikarmaṇi ||

tantre (-) divā nityārcanaṃ kuryādrātrau naimittikaṃ bhavet |

iti pavitrāropaṇavidhiḥ

atha pīṭhārcanam

kulacūḍāmaṇau (-) parvate vipine caiva nirjane śūnyamaṇḍape |
catuṣpathe kalāmadhye yadi daivād gatirbhavet ||

kulaṃ dhyātvā manuṃ japtvā natvā gacched yathāsukham |

kalāmadhye pramadāmadhye | kulamiṣṭadevatām |

puraścaraṇakāle tu yadi syāt pīṭhadarśanam |
tadā tatra pīṭhapūjā manasā'pi na hīyate ||

devīkūṭe mahābhāgāmoḍḍiyāne ca bhairava |
yoganidrāṃ kāmarūpe mahiṣāsuramardinīm ||

kātyāyanīṃ kāmabhūmau kāmākhyāṃ kāmadāyinīm |
<290> jālandhare ca pūrṇeśīṃ pūrṇaśaile ca caṇḍikām |
kāmarūpāṃ tu cauhāre pūjyā dikkaravāhinīm |
athavā kāmarūpasya darśanaṃ yadi bhāgyataḥ ||

tadā bhagādidevīnāṃ pūjā tatra vidhīyate |
tathā (-) prathamaṃ sādhakaśreṣṭho devīkūṭasya mastake |
vilikhya yantraṃ pūrvoktaṃ pūjayet kulavartmanā ||
pīḍhādidevīṃ prathame pūjayed gandhapuṣpakaiḥ |
mahābhāgāṃ tato mūladevīmāvaraṇaiḥ saha ||

lakṣaikaṃ tatra japtvā tu uḍḍiyānaṃ tato viśet |
tatpīṭhe yoganidrākhyāṃ pūjayitvā tato yajet ||

nijeṣṭadevatāmantraṃ japellakṣaṃ samāhitaḥ |
kāmarūpaṃ tato gatvā tataḥ kātyāyanīṃ yajet ||

japtvā lakṣaṃ tato nābhau kāmākhyāṃ prathamaṃ yajet |
tato jālandhare gatvā pūrṇeśīṃ prathamaṃ yajet ||

tatrāpi lakṣasaṃkhyātaṃ mantraṃ japtvā samāhitaḥ |
tataḥ pūrṇagirau gatvā yajeccaṇḍīṃ tato japet ||

kāmarūpāntare vatsa kāmākhyāṃ prathamaṃ yajet |
tatprānte ca mahādevi yajed dikkaravāhinīm ||

evaṃ pīṭheśvarīmiṣṭvā pūjayitveṣṭadevatām |
saptapīṭhe saptalakṣaṃ japedrātrau samāhitaḥ ||

pīṭhānāṃ paramaṃ pīṭhaṃ kāmarūpaṃ mahāphalam |
tatra yā kriyate pūjā sakṛd vāpi maheśvara ||

vihāya sarvapīṭhāni tasya dehe vasāmyaham |
tasmācchataguṇaṃ proktaṃ kāmākhyāyonimaṇḍalam ||

atha kumārīpūjā

mahākālasaṃhitāyām (-)

na tathā tuṣyati śivā balihomastutīraṇaiḥ |
kumārīpūjanenā'tra yathā sadyaḥ prasīdati ||

na kevalaṃ pūjayet tāṃ bhojayeccāpi yatnataḥ |
vyaṅgatā cāpyakaraṇāt pūjāyāḥ parikīrtitā |
<291> karaṇāt sāṅgatā'pi syādanyasminnakṛte'pi hi ||

tathā (-) kaulānāṃ niśi pūjoktā smārtānāmaparāhnikī |
nityā tu śāradyarcāyāṃ kāmyā naimittikītarā ||

kumārīlakṣaṇam

susnātāṃ pītaraktādi nānārāgojjvalāṃśukām |
sarvālaṅkāracitrāṅgīmajñātānaṅgaceṣṭitām ||

ajātapuṃmanaḥsaṅgāṃ saptāṣṭanavavārṣikīm |
anīcajātiṃ gaurāṅgīṃ pitṛmātṛmatīmapi ||

adanturāmavāgdantāmadhikonāṅgavarjitām |
adīrghakeśīmuddīptāṃ susmitāsyāmalobhinīm ||

ninditakumārīlakṣaṇam

śyāmāṃ dīrghadatīmotunayanāṃ piṅgamūrddhajām |
tanumūnagatiṃ kruddhāṃ kubjāṃ khañjāṃ ca kharvikām ||

bhrūkeśālpatvasahitāṃ tathā caiva galadbraṇām |
jātastanarajo'naṅgāṃ prayatnena vivarjayet ||

etadbhinnā kumārī tu varaṇīyā'rcanakrame |

yāmale (-) yaḥ kumārīṃ yajenmantrī sarvaparvasu sarvadā |
tenārcitā mahādevī satyaṃ satyaṃ na saṃśayaḥ ||

sandhyaikavarṣā saṃproktā dvivarṣā ca sarasvatī |
tridhāmūrtistrivarṣā ca caturabdā ca kālikā ||

subhagā pañcavarṣeyamumā ṣaḍvārṣikī bhavet |
mālinī saptavarṣā ca aṣṭamī kubjikā matā ||

navābdā kālasaṅkarṣā daśavarṣā'parājitā |
ekādaśābdā rudrāṇī dvādaśābdā ca bhairavī ||

tatparā syānmahālakṣmīstatparā kulanāyikā |
kṣetrajñā tatparā proktā ṣoḍaśābdā ca caṇḍikā ||

evaṃ krameṇa vijñeyā vinā puṣpaṃ kumārīkā |

mahākālasaṃhitāyām (-)

gītavāditranirghoṣairānandādarapūrvakam |
nītvā pūjāgṛhadvāri kumārīstā ayugmikāḥ ||

 <292> pañca vā sapta vā cāpi navaikādaśa vā punaḥ |
mukhyaikā tāsu kartavyā yā syāt sarvāṅgasundarī ||

vahvīnāmapyabhāve hi bhavedekā kumārikā |
kāmye naimittike caikā vahvyaḥ śāradapūjane ||

śreṇībhūtā utthitāśca namrībhūtānanā api |
sthāpayitvā krameṇaitā mukhyāmādau niyojya ca ||

devībuddhiṃ vidhāyā'syāṃ sādhako vigatatvaraḥ |
gṛhītamadirāmattaḥ kalpitārcanasambhṛtiḥ ||

prāṇāyāmaṃ vidhāyādau tato bhūtāpasāraṇam |
guruṃ gaṇapatiṃ natvā vāmadakṣiṇayostataḥ ||

madhye kumārīṃ ca tathā mūladevīsvarūpiṇīm |
choṭikābhistathā tālatritayairbandhanaṃ diśām ||

tathā (-) kumāryā mūlabhūtāyāḥ pādau prakṣālayet tataḥ |
tathā (-) tajjalaṃ mastake dadyād devīpādodaprajñayā ||

sottarīyāṃśukenaiva pādāmbūpanayet tataḥ |
punarakṣatamādāya vighnānutsārayet priye |
udīryamāṇamantreṇa tālatrayapuraḥsaram ||

tārapāśakalākūrcāstrāṇi prathamato vadet |
bhūtānyapasāraya ca vighnānnāśaya cetyapi ||

hṛcchīrṣe carame dadyādekaviṃśākṣaro manuḥ |
kumāryā sahitāḥ sarve tayā devīsvarūpayā ||

darśanārthaṃ samāyānti yāvanto devayonayaḥ |
pretā bhūtāḥ piśācāśca gandharvā guhyakā api ||

rākṣasā dānavā yakṣā ye cānye krūrakarmiṇaḥ |
saha praviśya kaumāryā maṇḍapaṃ śāradārcanam ||

lumpanti ca kumāryarcāṃ pūjāṃ vidhvaṃsayanti ca |
ato vāradvayaṃ kāryaṃ vighnasyotsāraṇaṃ priye ||

tataḥ svavāmahastena kumāryā dakṣiṇaṃ karam |
gṛhītvā dakṣacaraṇa viniḥkṣepapuraḥsaram ||

bhīpaṅkta tāḥkumārīstāḥ ślokarūpaṃ manuṃ paṭhan |
<293> pūjāgṛhāntaḥ śanakairnamanmauliḥ praveśayet ||

samastajagatāmādye jagadādhārarūpiṇi |
kumārīrūpamāsthāya praviśedaṃ gṛhaṃ mama ||

bhavatyāḥ kīdṛśaṃ rūpaṃ jāne mātarahaṃ nahi |
kumārīrūpamevedaṃ paśyāmi naracakṣuṣā ||

bhaktiṃ madīyāṃ vijñāya tvatpādāmbujayoḥ śive |
tvayā prakaṭitaṃ rūpamīdṛśaṃ sarvasiddhaye ||

dṛṣṭiḥ kāryā na me pāpe sañcāreṇāsataḥ pathaḥ |
dṛḍhāyāṃ kevalaṃ bhaktau dātavyā suravandite ||

śivādyāstava rūpaṃ hi kīdṛśaṃ neti jānate |
jñāsyāmi ko varāko'haṃ pāñcabhautikavigrahaḥ ||

iti pañca paṭhan ślokān svapṛṣṭhenaiva tārayet |
anīkṣamāṇa eveśi gītavādyapuraḥsaram ||

yāmale (-) snāpitā gandhatailena nānābharaṇabhūṣitāḥ |
ānīya devatāpārśve sthāpanīyā sudhīmatā ||

mahākālasaṃhitāyām (-)

mukhyaṃ tatpūjanaṃ proktaṃ mukhyāyā eva tanmanum |
tatpūjayaiva tāḥ sarvāḥ pūjitāḥ syurna saṃśayaḥ ||

tathā (-) baliṃ dattvā tato devayonibhyaḥ parameśvari |
ārabheta nirālasyaḥ kumārīnyāsamuttamam ||

tathā (-) nāmānyādau khalu mahācaṇḍayogeśvarī matā |
tataḥ siddhikarālī ca punaḥ siddhivikarālyapi ||

mahāntā māryatha jñeyā vajrakāpālinī tataḥ |
muṇḍamālinyaṭṭahāsinyete dve parikīrtite ||

pratipadādipūrṇāntaṃ vṛddhibhedena pūjayet |
mahāparvasu tā devi viśeṣādyupacārakaiḥ ||

mahānavamyāṃ deveśi kumārīśca prapūjayet |
piṅgalāṃ pūjayed yastu ṣoḍaśaiścaiva bhaktimān ||

caṇḍakāpālinī kālacakreśvaryapyanantaram |
guhyakālī tataḥ kātyāyanī kāmākhyayā saha ||

<294> cāmuṇḍā siddhilakṣmīśca kubjikā tadanantaram |
mātaṅgī tadanu jñeyā caṇḍeścaryatha kīrtyate ||

sarvaśeṣe'tha kaumārī etā aṣṭādaśeritāḥ |
tathā (-) aṅgānyato vacmi śiro mukhaṃ tadanu cakṣuṣī ||

karṇau nāsāpuṭe cāpi kapolau tatpurau punaḥ |
adharoṣṭhau dantapaṅktī skandhau hṛdayameva ca ||

bāhū ca jaṭharaṃ pṛṣṭhamurujānū tathaiva ca |
jaṅghe pādau ca sarvāṅgaṃ tāvantyeva sthalāni ca ||

triśaktiratne (-) kalādi ca kalāntaṃ tāḥ pūjayed vidhinā budhaḥ |
upaveśyāsane divye kumārīṃ sādhakottamaḥ ||

vakṣyamāṇena vidhinā dehe'syā nyāsamācaret |
kumārikā syāt prathamā dvitīyā nāyikā matā ||

tṛtīyā bhairavī khyātā turyā vāgīśvarī bhavet |
pālikā pañcamī proktā sambuddhyantāḥ kulādikāḥ ||

nyasyāḥ pañcāṅgayogena kumārīṇāṃ kalevare |
vāmāvartakramādāsyacatuṣkaṃ pūjayet kramāt ||

tataḥ siddhā jayā pūrvā jayānyā kubjikā parā |
kālikā pañcamī proktā vijñeyā bodhitā imāḥ ||

pūrvādivaktrasaṃyuktāścaturthyantā namontakāḥ |
tattatsthāneṣu vinyasyāḥ svadhiyā kramapūrvakam ||

pañcapraṇavayogena caitanyamanunā saha |
nyāsajālaṃ hi pūrvoktaṃ kuryāt sādhakasattamaḥ ||

aiṃ hrīṃ śrīṃ hrīṃ hūṃ ete pañcapraṇavāḥ | sauḥ caitanyabhairavībījam | 
tahā yāmale (-)

bāṇī māyā tathā lakṣmīrmāyākūrcadvayaṃ tathā |
ete ca praṇavā jñeyāḥ kumāryā paripūjane ||

caturdaśasvareṇāḍhyo bhṛgurbindvindusaṃyutaḥ |
caitanyabījaṃ kathitaṃ sādhakānāṃ sukhāvaham ||

mahākālasaṃhitāyām (-)

tato'rghasthāpanaṃ kuryānnityake yadudāhṛtam |
pūjopakaraṇasyāpi śuddhiruktā puroktavat ||

<295> tathā (-) tato dhyānaṃ prakurvīta kumāryā vakṣyamāṇakam | 
tathā (-) upacārāṃstataḥ sarvān pādyādīn stutipaścimān ||

yāmale (-) yaṣṭavyāḥ pūrvamārgeṇa vakṣyamāṇena vā punaḥ |
svanāmabhiścaturthyantaistritārādyairnamo'ntakaiḥ ||

devatāpaścime mantrī yajedetāḥ su(sa)lakṣaṇāḥ |
ādyā śuddhā kālikā'nyā tṛtīyā lalitā smṛtā ||

caturthī mālinī khyātā pañcamī syād vasundharā |
sarasvatī ramā gaurī durgā tu navamī bhavet ||

pañcābdaṃ navavarṣaṃ ca yajed bālaṃ vicakṣaṇaḥ |
pañcābdo vaṭukaḥ prokto navavarṣo gaṇeśvaraḥ ||

tathā (-) pradadyādāsanaṃ vācā hriyā pādyaṃ samarpayet |
ramayā'rghya nivedyā'tha striyā candanamarpayet ||

kumārye śaktibījena pradadyāt kusumoccayam |
caitanyamanunā mantrī dhūpadīpādikaṃ nyaset ||

tārā ete samākhyātā bhṛgurbhavasamanvitaḥ |
bindunādasamākrāntaścaitanyamanurīritaḥ |
kvacid bhairavabījaṃ tu pañcamaḥ praṇavo mataḥ |

mahākālasaṃhitāyām (-)

bhūṣaṇāni dukūlāni sindūrālaktakāvapi |
kajjalādarśavikhyāta tālavṛntāni peṭikā ||

parikarmādhāracola mañcikā pīṭhadolikāḥ |
pañcālikā ca mañjūṣā pāduke kuthapaṭṭake ||

candrātapopasaṅkhyānaṃ tathodvartanabhājanam |
śayyopadhānaparyaṅkāḥ samudgā ca prasādhanī ||

prati grāhaśca hindolā tathā sīmantavartikā |

