(dhyānāntaraṃ tantrāntare) (-)

prasannavadanāmbhojāṃ prodyadbālārkasaprabhām |
raktāmbarāṃ raktamālyāṃ nānālaṅkārabhūṣitām ||

sasmitāṃ divyakanyābhiḥ krīḍārasaparāyaṇām |
dhyāyet kumārikāṃ bālāṃ svabhaktābhiṣṭasiddhidām ||

<296> gorocanā mṛgamadau karpūraṃ kuṅkumaṃ tathā ||

evamādīni cānyāni yāvacchakyāni sundari |
pradātavyāni vastūni kumārī tuṣyate yathā ||

tathā (-) tato yat sthāpitaṃ pātraṃ kumāryai pratipādayet |
svīkuryāt sā ca tatraiva tathā yatnaṃ samācaret ||

agṛhīte tu tatpātre mahān doṣo'bhijāyate |
ato yatnastathā kāryaḥ svīkriyeta yathā tathā ||

kumārīśaktināmāni

tato gṛhītvā kusumākṣataṃ tasyāḥ kalevare |
pañcāśatsaṃkhyakāḥ śaktīḥ kramataḥ paripūjayet ||

tā idānīṃ pravakṣyāmi sāvadhānā niśāmaya |
ādyā jayā ca vijayā ṛddhidā māyayā'nvitā ||

phalā ca siddhidā sūkṣmā prabhā syāt suprabhā tataḥ |
vidyutā ca viśuddhiśca nandinī ca viśuddhiyuk ||

aparājitā ca lalitā lakṣmīgaurī tathaiva ca |
atha medhā ca gāyatrī sāvitrī ca svadhā punaḥ ||

svāhecche ca kriyā vidyā prajñā dīptā ca cetanā |
bhadrā jyeṣṭhā tathomā ca śivā ca muditā kṣamā ||

śraddhātha vimalā kaumudyapi vai viśadā tataḥ |
aśokā jñānadā caiva baladā rājyadāpi ca ||

maitrī tadanu rudrāṇī bhavānī ca mṛḍānyapi |
sarvajñā caṇḍikā vāpi kumārī sarvaśeṣagā ||

pañcāśatsaṃkhyakā etā kumāryāḥ śaktayaḥ smṛtāḥ |
bhairavānaṣṭa tadanuṃ pūjayedakṣatādibhiḥ |
bhairavībhyastato vighnavināyakebhya eva ca ||

vaṭukakṣetrapālābhyāṃ yoginībhyastathaiva ca |
bhūtebhyaḥ pretayakṣebhyo ḍākinībhyastathaiva ca ||

kurvīta pūjanaṃ devi kusumākṣatacandanaiḥ |
punaraṣṭau sarvaśeṣe ṅentā devīryajet priye ||

mahāmāyā kālarātristato vai sarvamaṅgalā |
<297> pūjyā ḍamarukā paścādrājarājeśvarī tathā ||

sampatpradā bhagavatī kumārī tadanantaram |

yāmale (-) kulāntaḥ pūjayedenāṃ kulakoṇeṣvimān yajet |
kāmeśvarī ca vajreśī tṛtīyā bhagamālinī ||

upariṣṭāt kuladvandvakoṇeṣvetāḥ samarcayet |
anaṅgakusumā'naṅgamanmathā'naṅgapūrvikā ||

madanā'naṅgaśabdādyā caturthī kusumottarā |
pañcamyanaṅgamadanā'turā'naṅgapadādikā ||

śiśirā kathitā hyetāḥ śaktayo rasasaṃkhyakāḥ |
anena vidhinā pūjyā kumārī sādhakottamaiḥ ||

mahākālasaṃhitāyām (-)

samāpyetthaṃ kumāryarcāṃ tatpuro bhuvi vāriṇā |
varttulaṃ maṇḍalaṃ kṛtvā tanmadhye kulakāminīm ||

vilikhya jalakusumākṣatacandananāgajaiḥ |
pūjayenmaṇḍalaṃ tacca śubhadāyai namo vadet ||

sthālīgataṃ tataḥ sarvamannaṃ tatra niveśya hi |
nānāvidhāṃ ca sāmagrīṃ lehyacoṣyādighaṭṭitām ||

māṃsamīnasurāpūrṇāṃ bhakṣyacarvyādipūritām |
kumārīdakṣahastaṃ ca sthāpayitvā'nnamūrdhani ||

uttānaṃ vakṣyamāṇena manunā'nnaṃ samutsṛjet | 
tathā (-) itarāsāṃ kumārīṇāṃ pratyekaṃ pūjanaṃ caret |
gandhapuṣpairdhūpadīpairnaivedyairannasaṃbhṛtaiḥ ||

tathā (-) annāni yādṛśānyasyai mukhyāyai kalpitāni hi |
anyābhyastādṛśānyeva dātavyānyeṣa niścayaḥ ||

phalāphalaṃ tu mukhyāyā jñeyamatra vipaścitā |
bhuñjānāsu kumārīṣu na tūryadhvanimācaret ||

nānyatra ca mano dadyāt saṃvādhaṃ naiva kalpayet |

annotsargamantrastyevaṃ (-) aiṃ hrīṃ śrīṃ strīṃ sauṃḥ sarvaśaktisvarūpāyai 
sarvasiddhidāyai bhagavatyai kumāryai 
bhakṣyabhojyanānāvidhānnakalpitaṣaḍrasopetamidaṃ mahābhoganaivedyaṃ 
tubhyamahaṃ nivedayāmi gṛhāṇa gṛhāṇa bhuṅkṣva bhuṅkṣva prasīda prasīda 
sarvasiddhiṃ me prayaccha prayaccha aiṃ hrīṃ śrīṃ namaḥ svāhā |

<298> kolāhalaṃ niṣedheta amaṅgalyāni yāni ca ||

ruditāpānavāyuṃ ca prayatnena vivarjayet |
sāvadhāno bhavedatra kimādau bhakṣayanti tāḥ ||

mithaḥ kiṃ vā prajalpanti kutra vā vastuni spṛhā |
kutra dṛṣṭiṃ prakṣipanti bhītāḥ kiṃ vā vadantyamūḥ ||

ityādinānājātīyāśceṣṭā āsāṃ prayatnataḥ |
sāvadhānatayā jñeyā bhadrābhadrasya sūcakāḥ ||

bhakṣayantīsu tāsvevaṃ paṭhet tat stotramatvaram |
kṛtāñjalirnamraśirā āsāmaśne kṣipan dṛśau ||

kumārīstotram

jayakāli mahābhīme bhīmarāve bhayāpahe |
saṃsāradāvāgniśikhe vṛjinārṇavatāriṇi ||

brahmendropendrabhūteśa prabhṛtyamaravandite |
sargapālanasaṃhāra kāriṇyahitamāriṇi ||

guhyakāli parānanda rasapūritavigrahe |
parabrahmarasāsvāda kaivalyānandadāyini ||

guṇātīte'pi saguṇe mahākālpāntanartaki |
kumārīrūpamāsthāya vijñe prajñāsvarūpiṇi ||

āgatāsi mamāgāraṃ śāradyarcāsamāptaye |
sāṃvatsarikakalyāṇa sūcanāya tathaiva ca ||

dhanyo'smi kṛtakṛtyo'smi saphalaṃ jīvitaṃ mama |
yasmāt tvamīdṛśaṃ kṛtvā kaumāraṃ rūpamuttamam ||

guhyakāli samāyātābdikapūjājighṛkṣayā |
tvamevaitena rūpeṇa devebhyaḥ prārthitā purā ||

dattavatyasi sāmrājyaṃ varānapi samīhitān |
mahyamapyadya deveśi varaṃ dehi supūjitā ||

brahmaṇe sṛṣṭisāmarthyaṃ tvaṃ purā dattavatyasi |
viṣṇave ca tvamevādāstathā pālanaśaktitām ||

mahārudrāya saṃhārakartṛtvamadadaḥ śive |
devebhyaścāpi daityānāṃ nāśane dakṣatāmapi ||

<299> antaryāminyasīśāni trilokīvāsināmapi |
nivedayāmi kiṃ te'haṃ sarvakarmaikasākṣiṇi ||

śatrunāśaṃ rājyalābhaṃ śarīrārogyameva ca |
tvatpādāmbujayorbhaktiṃ yāce'haṃ caturo varān ||

namaste bhagavatyamba namaste bhaktavatsale |
namaste jagadādhāraūpiṇi trāhi māṃ sadā ||

mātarna vedmi rūpaṃ te na śarīraṃ na vā guṇam |
bhaktyā hṛtsthitayā pūjāṃ tava jānāmyananyadhīḥ ||

tvaṃ mātā tvaṃ pitā bandhustvameva jagadīśvarī |
tvaṃ gatiḥ śaraṇaṃ tvaṃ ca svargastvaṃ mokṣa eva ca ||

vihāya tvāṃ jaganmātarnānyāṃ jānāmi devatām |
namaste'stu namaste'stu namaste'stu namo namaḥ ||

iti kumārīstotraṃ samāptam

kumārīpūjāphalam

ebhiḥ ślokaiḥ stutiṃ kuryāt kumārīṇāṃ varānane |
dadyādācamanīyaṃ hi bhojanānte gatatvaraḥ ||

tataḥ pradadyāt tāmbūlaṃ mṛgacandrābhivāsitam |
saha vādyādibhistāvadanuvrajya visarjayet ||

śubhāśubhaphalaṃ vacmi sāmprataṃ tava pārvati |
tatrāpyādau śubhaṃ vakṣye viparītaṃ tato'sya ca ||

taducchiṣṭaṃ tato dadyāj jambukebhyo'tha bhūtale |
nikhanedapsu vā devi samāloḍya visarjayet ||

ādau bhakte kare datte subhikṣaṃ viṣaye bhavet |
pāyase yajamānasya paśuvṛddhiḥ prajāyate ||

ghṛte syādāyurārogyaṃ pūjāmaiśvaryavṛddhaye |
tathā modakaśaṣkulyoḥ santatirbhūyasī bhavet ||

matsyajātiṣvarthalābhaḥ kṛśare yānasampadaḥ |
māṃse tu putralābhaḥ syāt temane kāminī bhavet ||

phalaṃ māṃsaviśeṣasya bhinnaṃ miśraṃ bruve hi tat |
arthalābhastu vārāhe khāṅge tu vijayo raṇe ||

<300> māhiṣeṇa tu māṃsena rājyaprāptirbhaved dhruvam |
ārogyaṃ hāriṇenāśu kārṣṇasāreṇa vāgmitā ||

śāśe medhāvitāṃ gacchedājeṣvajaratāmapi |
āveye palale devi sarvakalyāṇamāpnuyāt ||

kāmaṭhe medinīlābho vahvannatvaṃ ca rāṅkave |
vārdhrīṇase śatrunāśo hāṃse manujavaśyatā ||

taittire'bhīṣṭasiddhiśca vartake pāpasaṃkṣayaḥ |
manastoṣo balākāyāṃ phalekṣorviśvavaśyatā ||

kīrtistu mahatī dadhnī dugdhe sampadanuttamā |
piṣṭake tanayāvāptiḥ śāke ca ripusaṃkṣayaḥ ||

hālāyāṃ puṇyavṛddhiḥ syāccoṣye sampat suvāgmitā |
dhanāgamaḥ phāṇite tu kūrcikāyāṃ balonnatiḥ ||

tumbī vṛntākakuṣmāṇḍa kāravellapaṭolakaiḥ |
ghoṣaśūraṇadīrghāṅghrimūlakaistemane kṛte ||

vidyālābho bhaved devi takre vākpaṭutāpi ca |
godhūmacūrṇaghaṭite vastuni pratibhā raṇe ||

vedyāṃ dṛṣṭau bhavenmokṣo maṇḍape'pyunnatirbhavet |
cāmarachatrayostālavṛntaparyaṅkayorapi ||

ghaṇṭādarpaṇayoścāpi dṛgdāne bhūttiruttamā |
ākalpālaṅkaraṇayoḥ sparśa cālanadṛṣṭiṣu ||

nānāvidhāni saukhyāni bhavanti mahituḥ priye |
evaṃ vidhāni bhūyāṃsi ceṣṭitānyaśanāni ca ||

aśubhaphalanirūpaṇam

śubhādeśīni jāyante viparītānyataḥ śṛṇu |
mukhyabhūtā kumārī ced vamati dvitrivārakam ||

durbhikṣaṃ jāyate'vaśyaṃ prajāḥ syuḥ pīḍitā api |
rājā vināśamāyāti kumāryā rodane kṛte ||

uccāre tu mahāmārī purīṣe puradāhanam |
abhojane śatrubhayamāpado bahubhojane ||

abhāṣaṇe tvāmayāḥ syurvipado bahubhāṣaṇe |
<301> upasargā bahuvidhāśceṣṭayā karapādayoḥ ||

atilajjā vināśāya tathā nirlajjatā'śubhā ||

nānotpātāstu maune syuḥ svāpe bāhorvināśanam |
sarvanāśastu bhītāyāṃ kruddhāyāṃ mṛtyureva ca ||

āveśe tatkṣaṇādrājā mriyate nātra saṃśayaḥ |
śaṅkitāyāṃ śatruśaṅkā śrāntāyāmītito bhayam ||

cintitāyāntu vijñeyaṃ tadrāṣṭasyaiva pātanam |
mohe vittavināśaḥ syāj jāḍye pūjā ca niṣphalā ||

cāñcalye cañcalā lakṣmīḥ pūjakasyaiva jāyate |
viṣādavatyatha yadi kumārī tatra jāyate ||

sarujaṃ saprajaṃ rāṣṭraṃ tadā sīdati pārvati |
rogeṇa mriyate rājā yadi rugṇā prajāyate ||

durbhikṣamarakātaṅkā yadyaśrūṇi vimuñjati |
sarvanāśo bhavet tarhi dhunoti yadi mastakam ||

trastāyāṃ ripujastrāsastasya rājñaḥ pradiśyate |
kampe sati syād vimukhī kālikā parameśvarī |
nīcaiḥ śiraścet kurute asantuṣṭā tadeśvarī ||

hīnāyuḥ syāt tadā pṛthvīpatiśced gadgadasvarā |
pūjakasya bhaved dainyaṃ vyākulā yadi jāyate ||

mohena vyākulāyāntu sarvaṃ nagaramākulam |
vrīḍitāyāṃ bhavedrogaḥ svede dāradhanakṣayaḥ ||

adhovāyuṃ tyajati cet kumārī daivayogataḥ |
pīḍitaṃ paracakreṇa tadā bhavati pattanam ||

gītaṃ gāyati cet tatra kumārī rahitakriyā |
saprajārāṣṭratanayadārasya nṛpatermṛtiḥ ||

sahāgatābhiḥ kadācinmukhyā vivadate yadi |
tadā samāyātyakasmāt paracakraṃ sudāruṇam ||

yayā kayācit sārdhaṃ vā yena kenacideva vā |
kumārī bhāsate vītabhayaṃ mandākṣasādhvasā ||

prajāyante tadā tasya viṣayeṣu ṣaḍītayaḥ |
<302> vyatyāsaṃ yadi bhakṣyasya kurvate karacālanaiḥ ||

grastaṃ samastaṃ bhavati manaso vāñchitaṃ priye |
upāyanīkṛtaṃ yad yad dravyaṃ devyai tu maṇḍape ||

taccet karābhyāṃ spṛśati kāndiśīko bhavennṛpaḥ |
nirvāpayati ced dīpaṃ kumārīmukhamārutaiḥ ||

buddhibhraṃśo bhavet tarhi jñānadīpaśca naśyati |
daivayogācca nṛtyanti kumāryaścet surākulāḥ ||

sarājakaḥ saviṣayaḥ śmaśānamiva jāyate |
vāsāṃsyutsṛjya nagnāḥ syuryadi tatra kumārikāḥ ||

śatrubhirdhriyate tarhi rājā samaramurdhani |
yadi phutkṛtya kurdante karau dhṛtvā bhramanti ca ||

bhūtāveśaḥ kṣitiśasya jāyate nātra saṃśayaḥ |
uccariṣyāmi hāsye vā vadantītthaṃ kumārikāḥ ||

bhojanāvasare tarhi mahāmārībhayaṃ bhavet |
vāme vā dakṣiṇe vāpi calattārakayā dṛśā ||

raktograyā ghūrṇayate śiraḥ svasya kumārikā |
kurute vāṭṭahāsaṃ sā yena trasyanti mānavāḥ ||

bhūtāveśo bhavet tarhi pretā nṛtyanti vā pure |
dantairdantān pīḍayitvā kuryāt kaṭakaṭāravam ||

prayāti sadanaṃ mṛtyoḥ sadārasutabāndhavaḥ |
dṛśāvanimeṣe kṛtvā sandasyauṣṭhaṃ radena hi ||

santarjayati śīrṣaṃ cet kalpayantī kumārikā |
tadeva phalamuddiṣṭaṃ yat syāt kaṭakaṭārave ||

ādyantikaṃ bhavenmaunaṃ kareṇānnaṃ spṛśenna ca |
śirotyarthaṃ ca namayedaṅguṣṭhena likhed bhuvam ||

vidadhyād bhūtale rekhāṃ karajairniṣprayojanam |
saṃhṛtābhyāṃ karābhyāṃ ca kaṇḍūyedathavā śiraḥ ||

tṛṇānyakāraṇācchindyādaṅgulīsphoṭamācaret |
pāṇibhyāṃ mudrayennetre dvau karṇau pidadhāti vā ||

kurvīta vā bāhurikāṃ pārṣṇighṛṣṭiṃ karoti vā |
<303> mahāntaṃ grāsamādatte mukhaṃ vyādāya tiṣṭhati ||

annopari kṣutaṃ dhatte jṛmbhaṇaṃ vā muhurmuhuḥ |
gṛhītvā pāṇinā vānnaṃ caturdikṣu kṣipatyapi ||

utthāya vā pracalati tyaktānnaṃ pūjanaṃ tathā |
āyāti vamanaṃ vāsyāḥ syātāṃ romāñcavepathū ||

nirgacchato vā tadgātrāt pūyāsre hetumantarā |
akasmādeva kurute kākuṃ cet kāraṇaṃ vinā ||

aślīlaṃ valgati tathā svavargyārthe praroditi |
āmuktālaṅkṛtirmuñced gṛhaṃ yāsyāmi vā vadet ||

yasya kasyāpi vā kuryād bhartsanaṃ tatsthale sthitā |
upālabheta vā kāñcit sahaivāsyā upeyuṣī ||

bhinatti vā nidānaṃ vā svahastabalayāni vā |
kṛte mṛtasya kasyāpi bandhoḥ śocati tatra sā ||

yat kiñcid vā pralapati nirnimittaṃ kumārikā |
sarvametadamaṅgalyaṃ vijñeyaṃ tridaśārcite ||

durbhikṣaṃ dhananāśaṃ ca rogo mārībhayaṃ tathā |
pade pade ca vipadaḥ śoko vyādhī ripūnnatiḥ ||

paracakrāgamo'kasmādagnidāhaḥ pure gṛhe |
mṛtyutrāsaśca dāridryaṃ vicchedo bandhubhiḥ saha ||

bhūtapretapiśācābhiniveśo'pi gṛhe gṛhe |
aṣṭabhistu mahārogaiḥ prajānāṃ nidhanaṃ bhavet ||

itastataḥ pradhāvanti kākā bhayanipīḍitāḥ |
kiṃ bahūktena deveśi śilī ākālikī bhavet ||

itareṣāmamībhistu bhayaṃ rājñāṃ mahad bhavet |
kumārīceṣṭitadvārā jñāyate hi śubhāśubham ||

vārṣikaṃ ca phalaṃ rājño jayo vātha parājayaḥ |
mṛtyurduḥkhaṃ bhayaṃ saukhyaṃ śatrubhītirbalonnatiḥ ||

rājyavṛddhiḥ prajāpīḍā vyaṅgatā'nīkasaṃkṣayaḥ |
kumārīpūjanāt sarvaṃ jñāyate bhojanādapi ||

parīkṣya yatnatastasmādrājñā svasya śubhāśubham |
<304> arcāto'pi viśeṣeṇa bhojanena sureśvari ||

jāte śubhe samīcīnaṃ vṛtte taditaratra hi |
kāmyārcā bahusambhārairdoṣaṃ tajjaṃ nivārayet ||

nivṛttya svagṛhaṃ rugnā yātā yadi kumārikā |
tasminnevā'hani bhavet tathāpi na śubhaṃ phalam ||

ityādiphalabāhulyaṃ śubhasyāpyaśubhasya ca |
mayā vivicya kathitaṃ dhriyasva hṛdi yatnataḥ ||

tato niśīthasamaye vidhivat pūjanaṃ punaḥ |
pīṭhamūrtyoḥ prakurvīta dhūpadīpānulepanaiḥ ||

naivedyairupahāraiśca gītavādyādibhistathā |
yāmale (-) kumārī pūjitā hanti kuluṣaṃ pūrvasañcitam |
kumārikāṃ vijānīyāt sākṣāt prakṛtirūpiṇīm ||

patraṃ puṣpaṃ phalaṃ toyaṃ yat kiñcid vastu śobhanam |
anantaphaladaṃ proktaṃ kumāryai cet samarpayet ||

bhojitā cet kumārī syād bhojitaṃ bhuvanatrayam |
brāhmaṇāya suśīlāya kumārīṃ yaḥ samarpayet ||

pṛthivīdānajaṃ puṇyaṃ so'śnute nātra saṃśayaḥ |
sa sarvasiddhimāpnoti yaḥ kumārīṃ samarcayet |
vasanti satataṃ dehe kumāryā yoginīgaṇāḥ |
ataḥ pūjyā namasyā sā lālanīyā tadicchayā ||

aśaktyā pūjayedekāṃ kumārīṃ sādhakottamaḥ |
vinā kumārikāpūjāṃ na parva parihāpayet ||

yo nityamarcayedetāṃ tasya syāt siddhiruttamā |
navarātre samāyāte navamyantaṃ niśīthadhīḥ ||

nānopahārairabhyarcya kumārīṃ vṛddhipūrvakam |
vṛddhikrameṇa prayajed vāñchitāṃ siddhimāpnuyāt |
athavā pūjayen mantrī yuvatīrnavasaṃkhyakāḥ |
hṛllekhā gaganā raktā mahocchuṣmā karālikā ||

icchā jñānā kriyā durgā nava nāmabhirīritāḥ |
pūrvavat pūjayen mantrī japet sāgraṃ sahasrakam ||

<305> yadi sā kṣobhamāyāti svayameva vilāsinī |
tayā saha nayedrātriṃ vāsaraṃ vā niśātadhīḥ ||

kumārīṃ na spṛśedeva bhāvayuktena cetasā |
anyathā mṛtyumāpnoti no ced devī parāṅmukhī ||

iti kumārīpūjāvidhiḥ

atha śivābaliḥ

kulacūḍāmaṇau (-) vilvamūle prāntare vā śmaśāne vāpi sādhakaḥ |
māṃsapradhānaṃ naivedyaṃ sandhyākāle nivedayet ||

mahākālasaṃhitāyām (-)

purād bahirniśākāle mahāraṇyasamīpataḥ |
gṛhītvā bhakṣyavastūni pūjāsambhṛtimapyuta ||

āptairanugato dvitraiḥ pradadyāt pheravībalim |
āmāni pakvānyapi ca māṃsāni vidhinā'rpayet ||

tatrodīcīdigvadano vītabhīḥ śucirūrjitaḥ |
prāṇāyāmaṃ ṣaḍaṅgaṃ ca vidhāyā'rghyaṃ prapūjya vai ||

utthāya muktacikuraḥ śivā ākārayecchanaiḥ |

kulacūḍāmaṇau (-) kāli kālīti vaktavyaṃ tatra sā śivarūpiṇī |
paśurūpā samāyāti parivāragaṇaiḥ saha ||

bhuktvā rauti yadaiśānyāṃ mukhamuttolya susvaram |
tadaiva maṅgalaṃ tasya nānyathā kulabhūṣaṇa ||

avaśyamannadānena niyataṃ toṣayecchivām |
nityaśrāddhaṃ yathā sandhyāvandanaṃ pitṛtarpaṇam ||

tatheyaṃ kuladevīnāṃ nityatā kulapūjane |
paśurūpāṃ śivāṃ devīṃ yo nārcayati nirjane ||

śivārāveṇa tasyāśu sarvaṃ naśyati niścitam |
japapūjāvidhānāni yatkiñcitsukṛtāni ca ||

gṛhītvā śāpamāsādya śivā roditi nirjane |
ekayā tvaśyate yatra śivayā devabhairava ||

tatraiva sarvaśaktīnāṃ prītiḥ paramadurlabhā |
paśuśaktirnare śaktiḥ pakṣiśaktiśca bhairava ||

<306> pūjitā viguṇaṃ karma saguṇaṃ kārayed yataḥ |
tena sarvaprayatnena kartavyaṃ pūjanaṃ mahat ||

rājādibhayamāpannaṃ deśāntarabhayādikam |
śubhāśubhāni karmāṇi vicintya balimāharet ||

gṛhṇa devi mahābhāge śive kālāgnirūpiṇi |
śubhāśubhaphalaṃ vyaktaṃ brūhi gṛhṇa baliṃ tava ||

evamuccārya dātavyo baliḥ kulajanapriye |
mahākālasaṃhitāyām (-) sthānādasmādapasaret kiñcid dūrataraṃ priye |
śivā yathā vītabhayā āgacchantyannasannidhau ||

tatra sthitvā nirīkṣeta kiṃ kiṃ tā bhakṣayanti hi |
sarvā āgatya cet sarvaṃ pradattaṃ bhakṣayanti hi ||

vinirdiśet sarvasiddhiṃ rājyalābhaṃ dhanāgamam |
yad yat tā bhakṣayantyannaṃ tattat phalamavāpnuyāt ||

yad yacca naiva khādanti tattannaiva phalaṃ bhavet |
kumārīpūjanādau tu viśeṣo'syopavarṇitaḥ ||

tena nātra bruve devi granthādhikyabhayādapi |
kumārīrūpamāsthāya yathāyāti maheśvarī ||

śivārūpaṃ tathā kṛtvā svayamāyāti kālikā |
tato bhaktiḥ prakartavyā tāsu yatnena sādhakaiḥ ||

śivāsu bhakṣayantīṣu sarvebhyo balimāharet |
saṃhārabhairavāyādau vaṭukebhyastataḥ param ||

vināyakebhyo mātṛbhyaḥ kṣetrapālebhya eva ca |
yoginībhyo ḍākinībhyaḥ śivadūtībhya eva ca ||

purokto mantra āsiddhiṃ tena tena baliṃ haret |
mahadaiśvaryamāpnoti niḥśeṣaṃ bhakṣayanti cet ||

ardhe tu madhyamā siddhirabhakṣe tu vipad bhavet |
kulacūḍāmaṇau (-) yadi no gṛhyate vatsa tadā naiva śubhaṃ bhavet |
śubhaṃ yadi bhavet tatra bhakṣyate tadaśeṣataḥ ||

mahākālasaṃhitāyām (-) khāditvotthāya tiṣṭhatsu śivāvṛndeṣu tatra hi |
daṇḍavat praṇamet sarvāḥ sveṣṭadevīdhiyā svayam ||

<307> puṣpāñjaliṃ samādāya gandhacandanacarcitam |
utthāya muktacikuro mīlitākṣo digambaraḥ ||

 bhaktiśālī vītabhayaḥ kiñcit praṇatakandharaḥ |
stutiṃ kuryāt stavairetairvaraprārthanapūrvakam ||

śivārūpadhare devi guhyakāli namo'stu te |
ulkāmukhi lalajjihve ghorarāve śṛgālini ||

śmaśānavāsini prete śavamāṃsapriye'naghe |
araṇyacāriṇyanaghe śive jambukarūpiṇi ||

namo'stu te mahāmāye jagattāriṇi kālike |
mātaṅgi kukkuṭe raudri mahākāli namo'stu te ||

sarvasiddhiprade bhīme bhayaṅkari bhayāpahe |
prasannā bhava deveśi mama bhaktasya caṇḍike ||

saṃsārasāgaratare jaya sarvaśubhaṅkariṃ |
visrastacikure caṇḍi cāmuṇḍe muṇḍamālini ||

saṃhārakāriṇi kruddhe sarvasiddhiṃ prayaccha me |
durge kirāti śavari pretāsanagate'bhaye ||

anugrahaṃ kuru sadā kṛpayā māṃ vilokaya |
rājyaṃ prayañcha vikaṭe vittamāyuḥ sutān striyam ||

śivābalipradānena tvaṃ prasannā bhaveśvari |
namaste'stu namaste'stu namaste'stu namo'stu te ||

ityetairaṣṭabhiḥ ślokaiḥ śivāstotramudīrayet |
tatastaccheṣamannaṃ yad bhājanaṃ cānyadeva vā ||

sarvaṃ hi nikhaned bhūmau prayatnenaiva pārvati |
yadi kākāḥ kharāḥ śvāno ye cānye pāpajātayaḥ ||

bhakṣayanti taducchiṣṭaṃ tadā vighnaḥ prajāyate |
rātrāveva samāgacchennirbhayo vipināntarāt ||

āgatya gandhapuṣpādyaiḥ punardevīṃ prapūjayet |
kulacūḍāmaṇau (-) evaṃ jñātvā mahādeva śāntisvastyayanaṃ caret |
kulācāraṃ dakṣiṇākhyaṃ kathitaṃ tava suvrata ||

na kasmaicit pravaktavyaṃ yadīcchecchāśvataṃ sukham |
<308> nirjane caiva kartavyaṃ na ca mānuṣasannidhau ||

kiṃ vā pakṣipataṅgādi darśane naiva kārayet |
pātālamaṇḍape vāpi gahvare vā suyantrite ||

niśchidramaṇḍape vāpi kartavyaṃ tava sannidhau |

atha prāyaścittam

triśaktiratne (-) niṣiddhācaraṇe puṃsāṃ vihitākaraṇe tathā |
prāyaścittopapātaḥ syāditi ||

nityātikramavidyānāṃ śāntyai vidyāśataṃ japet |
naimittikātikramaṇe sahasraṃ prajapen manum ||

liṅgāgame (-) śṛṇu devi pravakṣyāmi prāyaścittavidhiṃ tava |
gurutyāgakaraḥ śiṣyaḥ prāyaścittī bhaved dhruvam ||

lakṣaṃ śrīpādukāṃ japtvā tasmāt pāpād viśudhyati |
mantratyāgakaro yastu tatsaṅgaṃ varjayet priye ||

lakṣamekaṃ japen mantraṃ homatarpaṇataḥ śuciḥ |

śrīpādukāṃ gurupādukām | tyāgastu kaulikasyaiva guroḥ kaulikānāṃ 
niṣiddhaḥ na tvakaulikasyāpi | tathāhi (-) yāmale (-)

madhulobhād yathā bhṛṅgaḥ puṣpāt puṣpāntaraṃ vrajet |
gurulubdhastathā śiṣyo gurogurvantaraṃ vrajet ||

guroḥ paśoḥ | gurvantaraṃ kulīnam | etacca (-)

yadi daivāt paśorvidyā labhyate kulajairnaraiḥ |
dvijaṃ tu kaulikaṃ prāpya punarvidyāmupālabhet ||

iti vacanena sutarāṃ vyaktam | evaṃ paśūnāmapi paśugurutyāge doṣo bodhyaḥ | 
lakṣajapastanmantrasyaiva | homo japadaśāṃśena | tarpaṇaṃ tu 
homadaśāṃśena anyatra tathā darśanāt | mantro'pyaduṣṭa evātyājyaḥ | 
duṣṭastyājya eva (-)

śakalo bījahīnastu sandigdho ninditastathā |
manavastu na sidhyanti guruḥ syād brahmaghātakaḥ ||

tadā taṃ sahasā jñātvā mantraṃ devaṃ guruṃ tyajet |

śakalādidoṣāstūpalakṣaṇamātram | anye'pi tattacchāstroktā boddhavyāḥ | 
aduṣṭamantratyāge (-) kṣamasva mātastat pāpaṃ hara devi kṛpāṃ kuru | iti 
kṣamāpyatāmeva vidyāṃ gṛhṇīyāditi viśeṣaḥ |

<309> tathā (-) anekadhā paśorannaṃ bhuñjate ye tu kaulikāḥ |
lakṣatrayaṃ japellopāṃ lakṣaṃ vāpyajapāṃ japet ||

homayeddhaviṣā'nnena niṣpāpaḥ syāt tathā dhruvam |

anekadhā varṣaparyantam | atrāpi home japadaśāṃśataiva tarpaṇādau tu na 
pramāṇam |

tathā (-) ekapātre pibed dravyaṃ vīro māheśvaro yadi |
śvānocchiṣṭaṃ bhavet pānaṃ prāyaścittaṃ sa kaulikaḥ ||

gāyatryāstu sahasreṇa upavāsatrayeṇa vā |
samyacchodhitacittastu suvarṇaṃ gurave dadet ||

gāyatrī svadevagāyatryeva | mantrārṇave (-)

balāt svarasato vāpi yo ramen mantramātaram |
daśalakṣaṃ manuṃ japtvā tuṣānalaṃ samācaret ||

mantramātā guruśaktiḥ gurureva vā |

mantraputryāḥ svaputryāśca bhaginyāśca kulastriyaḥ ||
ramaṇāllakṣajāpena pūto bhavati kaulikaḥ |

mantraputrī putratvena kṛtopadeśā śuddhyarthaṃ svabhogyāyā 
apyupadeśābhidhānāt | kulastrī vīrapatnī | tadgamanaṃ ca bhartrananujñayaiva 
doṣāyeti | brahmayāmale (-)

kṛtvā vīravadhaṃ mantrī vṛthā pānaṃ guroḥ snuṣām |
mantraputrīṃ vīrapatnīṃ ramitvā lakṣamājapet ||

idamācārāpakṛṣṭavīraviṣayam | evaṃ ca (-)

trayodaśa sahasraṃ tu divyavīravadhe japet |

iti akāmakṛtavadhaviṣayaṃ vadhānukūlavyāpāramātraviṣayaṃ vā 
ātatāyiviṣayaṃ vā |

tathā (-) anasthiprāṇisaṃghātaṃ hatvā ca narakaṃ vrajet |
hatvā ca pakṣiṇaḥ sarvān striyaṃ caikādaśaṃ japet ||

anasthiprāṇisaṃghātaṃ jalaukādi | striyaṃ teṣāmeva | ekādaśaṃ 
ekādaśaśatam | ekādaśamityanusvārastāntrikaḥ | tathā (-)

sarpamārjāranakula mūṣamuṣṭraṃ kharaṃ hayam |
gajādyāṃśca mṛgān sarvān hatvā cāṣṭaśataṃ japet ||

japedaṣṭasahasraṃ tu kṣudrajantuvadhe kṛte |
aṣṭasahasramaṣṭottarasahasram | kṣudrajantavaḥ uktabhinnā chāgādayaḥ | yat tu (-)

chāgadihanane japyāt trisahasramiti tantrāntare uktaṃ tadabhyāsakṛtaviṣayam |

<310> triśaktiratne (-) balidānaṃ vinā mantrī pātayenna paśūn kvacit |
anyathā smārtamuditaṃ prāyaścittaṃ manīṣibhiḥ ||

tathā (-) govadhe daśabhirlakṣairmucyate narakārṇavāt |
lakṣairdvādaśabhirmantrī vṛṣaṃ hatvā vimucyate ||

guruṃ hatvā pramādena pañcalakṣairbhavecchuciḥ |
idaṃ codyamātraparam | vadhe tu prāṇāntikasyaivoktatvāt | tathā (-)

daśabhiḥ koṭibhirmantrī strīvadhāt pratimucyate |
naktāśī khyāpayan pāpaṃ pīṭhakṣetre paribhramet ||

pramādāt pātite vipre lakṣairviṃśatibhiḥ śuciḥ |
kṣatrādayo yathoktena mucyante kilviṣāditaḥ ||

yathoktena brāhmaṇāpekṣayā yathākramaṃ dvaiguṇyādyādhikyena | tathāhi 
tantre ca (-)

brāhmaṇasya vadhe lakṣaṃ kṣatriye dviguṇaṃ smṛtam |
vaiśye triguṇamuddiṣṭaṃ pādaje ca caturguṇam ||

atra lakṣaṃ vadha ityubhayamapyupalakṣaṇam | yasmin pāpe viprasya 
prāyaścittaṃ tasmiṃstadvarṇasya tadādhikyamiti |

arhadbauddhavadhe mantrī khābdhilakṣaṃ manuṃ japet |

arhadbauddhā ārhatopāsakā bauddhāḥ | khābdhilakṣaṃ catvāriṃśallakṣam |

tathā (-) babhrośca śūkarāṇāṃ ca vadhe pañcasahasrakam |

japedityanuṣaṅgaḥ | babhrurnakulaḥ | tathā (-)

pakṣiṇāṃ hanane mantrī dvisahasreṇa śudhyati |
sarpamārjāramatsyānāṃ vadhe vedasahasrakam ||

devadrohād gurudrohād triṃśatkoṭimanuṃ japet |

pakṣiṇāṃ sarpamārjārayośca prāyaścittavādo(tadbhāso(?)'kāmakṛtaviṣayaḥ 
| droho maraṇānukūlavyāpāraḥ | etacca guṇavadguruviṣayam | tathā (-)

devadravyaṃ gurudravyaṃ bhuktvā tāvan manuṃ japet |

bhuktvā tadananujñayā | tāvat triṃśatkoṭim |

tadanujñāviplavayostadardhaṃ japamācaret |

viplavaḥ udvegaḥ |

nindane samayānāṃ ca yoginī vīrayoḥ śivaḥ |
śāstrāṇāṃ mantriṇāṃ strīṇāṃ sahasraṃ japamācaret ||

<311> vāmadakṣiṇasiddhānte śaivavradhare hate |
catuṣkoṭimitaṃ mantrī japan śudhyati kilviṣāt ||

ādyādinindane mantrī daśāvartena śudhyati ||

arghāmṛtaṃ pibet pūrvaṃ devīmutthāpayet tataḥ |
paśupānaṃ bhavet tasya tatkṣayo lakṣato bhavet ||

arghāmṛtaṃ viśeṣārghāmṛtam |

anivedya tu yo bhuṅkte prajapet sa śatāṣṭakam |

anivedya devyanujñāmagṛhītvā | tathā (-)

vīrapatnīṃ vṛthāpānaṃ vīrapatnīsnuṣe tathā |
prāyaścittaṃ caren mantrī divyavīrārcanādikam ||

dīpanāśe pātranāśe pātrapraskhalane tathā |
pūjayitvā mahādevīṃ japedaṣṭottaraṃ śatam ||

ajñānādevamuddiṣṭaṃ jñānato dviguṇaṃ bhavet |

idaṃ tu kāmato dvaiguṇyaṃ sarvatra bodhyam | bhūtabhairave (-)

bhagnaṃ ca sphuṭitaṃ yantraṃ hṛtaṃ caureṇa vā priye |
upavāsaṃ prakurvīta dinamekamatandritaḥ ||

lakṣamātraṃ japed vidyāṃ homatarpaṇapūrvikām |
sabhaktyā ca guruṃ toṣya brāhmaṇānapi bhojayet ||

kadācilluptacihnaṃ vā sphuṭitādivibhūṣaṇam |
bhagnaṃ karoti yo marttyo mṛtyustasya bhaved dhruvam ||

tasmāt sa tīrtharāje vā gaṅgādisaritāntare |
samudre vā kṣiped devi anyathā duḥkhamāpnuyāt ||

athāntyeṣṭiḥ

tatraiva (-) ambike yo yadā mantrī dehadharmamupāśritaḥ |
antyeṣṭistatra kartavyāstacchiṣyādyairvidhānataḥ ||

karttā nityakriyāṃ kṛtvā pañcaratnairviśodhayet |
pretaṃ netrādimārgeṇa lokāntaravinirgatam ||

ākṛṣya sthāpayet prete jīvātmānaṃ gurūktitaḥ |
pañcapraṇavayogena viyadvahnyanilātmabhiḥ ||

mokṣade padamuccārya cakṣurādi samuccaret |
<312> pretanāma samuccārya vadedāvāhayāmi ca ||

anenāvāhayet pretaṃ tatra prāṇāṃśca vinyaset |
aṅgaprakalpanaṃ kuryān māyayā dīrghasaṃyujā ||

pratiṣṭhāpya ghaṭaṃ mantrī paretaṃ sthāpayet sudhīḥ |
pañcagavyairaghoreṇa vardhanyā tvabhiṣicya tam ||

śuddhatoyena saṃsthāpya bhasmanā sthāpayet punaḥ |
pretaṃ dakṣiṇamurdhānaṃ nyasya darbhāstare sudhīḥ ||

navavastrasragālepairalaṅkṛtya vibhūṣaṇaiḥ |
abhyarced gandhapuṣpādyairmūlamantreṇa sādhakaḥ ||

samyagvimānaṃ saṅkalpya mṛtakaṃ tatra vinyaset |
grāmaṃ pradakṣiṇīkurvan śaṅkhabheryādiniḥsvanaiḥ ||

pretasthānaṃ samāviśya dakṣiṇottaramāyatam |
upalipya samāṃ bhūmiṃ tatra lājatilākṣatān ||

vikiret sarṣapopetān vimānamatha vinyaset |
saṃsthāpya tatra cityagniṃ paristīrya vilomataḥ ||

pātrāṇyāsādayen mantrī dakṣiṇe viṣṇudaivatam |
praṇītāpātramāsādya sampūjya kuṅkumādibhiḥ ||

darbhairācchādite mantrī vahnikoṇe pravinyaset |
dakṣabhāge yajed devaṃ bhairavaṃ maṇḍalaṃ kramāt ||

uktena vidhinā kṛtvā vahnerjihvādikalpanam |
tilataṇḍulasaṃmiśraṃ śrapayeccarumuttamam ||

mṛtyuñjayena mantreṇa śatamaṣṭottaraṃ sudhīḥ |
sājyena ca (?) hutvā pañcaratnairviśeṣataḥ ||

juhuyān mūlamantreṇa kramādāvaraṇāntikam |
evaṃ vilomato homān sarvamantrān gurostanau ||

krameṇa vilayaṃ nītvā juhuyād vāgbhavena ca |
hutvātha mūlamantreṇa pretadehe vilomataḥ ||

tattvāni vilayaṃ nītvā sarvamātmani yojayet |
puṇyapāpe paretasya juhuyān mantramuccaran ||

tataḥ pūrṇāhutiṃ dattvā yojayet parame pade |
<313> śivaśaktyātmake śuddhe punarāvṛttivarjite |
saccitsukhamaye sākṣāt tattvātīte nirākule |
iti saṃyojitaḥ pretaḥ śiṣyeṇa parame pade ||

santyajya malakāluṣyaṃ śambhubhāvāya kalpate |
ājyena juhuyād vahnāvaghorāstreṇa mūlataḥ ||

anulomavidhānena prāyaścittāya sādhakaḥ |
paretadehamānena śayanaṃ parikalpayet ||

vahnerdakṣiṇadigbhāge kulavṛkṣasamudbhavaiḥ |
śaṅkubhirdakṣiṇāgraistu vilvairjavākuśaistathā ||

āstīrya śayanaṃ mantrī triguṇīkṛtatantunā |
saṃveṣṭya pūjayed gandhapuṣpādyairupacārakaiḥ ||

ācchādya navavastreṇa tatra yantraṃ likhet sudhīḥ |
padmaṃ trikoṇa ṣaṭkoṇa karṇikaṃ sāṣṭapatrakam ||

sordhvarekhaṃ tatastatra puṣpāṇyākīrya sarvataḥ |
pretaṃ dakṣiṇamūrdhānaṃ vinyasediha sādhakaḥ ||

rakṣāmantreṇa saṅkalpya jvālāmālinīvidyayā |
prajvālyā'ghoramantreṇa dahet pādādito budhaḥ ||

aghorāstreṇa mantreṇa mantrī pāśupatena vā |
yāvad bhasmībhavatyeṣa tāvaddhomaṃ karotviha ||

stotramantrajapaṃ kuryuḥ samayajñāḥ samāgatāḥ |
bhasmībhūte parete'smin devān samyak samarcayet ||

cityagniṃ rakṣayen mantrī samprāpte saptame'hani |
nirvāpya payasāsthīni veṣṭayen navavāsasā ||

tadbhasma niḥkṣipet kvāpi viśuddhe salilāśaye |
asthikūṭaṃ khanena mantrī devamātṛgṛhe'thavā ||

svagṛhe vā nikhanyaitat trisandhyaṃ pūjayeditidam |
parvapūjāṃ mṛtadine pratimāsaṃ prakalpayet ||

sampūrṇe vatsare kuryān mahotsavamatandritaḥ |
tato kūṭaṃ samuddhṛtya nadyāṃ vā vidhisaṃspṛśi(?) ||

niḥkṣipen nikhanet kvāpi viśuddhe dharaṇītale |
<314> kenāpi kīkaśenā'sya pratimāṃ pāduke'thavā ||

kṛtvā sampūjayen mantrī gurubhaktiparāyaṇaḥ |
deśāntaramṛtānāṃ ca jīvatāmapi sādhakaḥ ||

darbhapuñjaiḥ palāśairvā śālipiṣṭena vā punaḥ |
dehaṃ kṛtvā yathāpūrvaṃ kuryād vicakṣaṇaḥ ||

athavā manasā kuryādekānte svayamāstikaḥ |
vāgbhavaṃ dīpini jvālāmālinīti padaṃ tataḥ ||

krodhahaṃsenduhetyarṇān saṃpuṭatvena yojayet |
etāni tatra bījāni praṇavo jīvake śave ||

haṃsendvaṅgāntakuṭilavahnibindun bhagāśritān |
śivaśaktikṣamendrāmbu vahnivātārghisañcayam ||

jvālāmālinīmantro'yaṃ kathito mantrakovidaiḥ |
māyābīja sphuradvandvaṃ prasphuradvitayaṃ tathā ||

ghoraghorataretyante tanurūpapadaṃ vadet |
caṭa pracaṭadvitayaṃ kahadvandvaṃ vamadvayam ||

bandhadvayaṃ samuccārya ghātayadvayamūcaret |
varmāstrāntaḥ samuddiṣṭo varṇātmā'ghoramantrakaḥ ||

tāraśrīṃ paśuvarṇānte kavacāstrākṣarauṃ vadet |
manuḥ pāśupatāstro'yaṃ kṣudragrahanivārakaḥ ||

pañcāntakendupārśvārṇān samadhāntasamanvitān |
indrānūḍhān sudhīṃ kuryād vāmakarṇendusaṃyutān ||

pañcaratnamidaṃ proktaṃ manobhilaṣitapradam |


[iti mahāmahopādhyāya ṭhakkura śrīnarasiṃhaviracite tārābhaktisudhārṇave 
naimittikavidhiḥ saptamastaraṅgaḥ] || 7 ||


[aṣṭamastaraṅgaḥ]

atha puraścaraṇam

vāyavīyasaṃhitāyām (-)

sādhanaṃ mūlamantrasya puraścaraṇamucyate |
puraścaraṇīyatvād viniyogākhyakarmaṇī ||

purato viniyogasya caraṇād vā tathoditam ||

jīvahīno yathā dehaḥ sarvakarmasu na kṣamaḥ |
puraścaraṇahīno'pi tathā mantraḥ prakīrtitaḥ ||

vīracūḍāmaṇau (-) puraścaraṇahīnasya mantrasiddhirna jāyate |
ādau puraskriyāṃ kuryān niyamena yathāvidhi ||

kulacūḍāmaṇau (-) pañcāṅgāni mahādevi japo homaśca tarpaṇam |
abhiṣekaśca viprāṇāmārādhanamapīśvari ||

pūrvapūvadaśāṃśena puraścaraṇamucyate |
kulamūlāvatāre (-) saṃsāre duḥkhabhūyiṣṭhe yadīcchecchreya ātmanaḥ |
pañcāṅgopāsanenaiva mantrajāpī sukhaṃ vrajet ||

pañcāṅgāni mahādevi japo homo hi tarpaṇam |
abhiṣekaśca viprāṇāmārādhanamapīśvari ||

pūrvapūrvadaśāṃśena puraścaraṇamucyate |

atra kaulikānāṃ jape lakṣasaṃkhyaiva | taduktaṃ tārātantre (-)

svecchācāraparo mantrī puraścaraṇasiddhaye |
rahasyamālāmādāya lakṣamekaṃ japet sadā |

surendrasaṃhitāyām (-) lakṣamātraṃ japen mantraṃ daśāṅgalohitāmbujeḥ(?) |
juhuyādarcite vahnau mantraḥ siddho bhavet tataḥ ||

vīracūḍāmaṇau (-) caturlakṣaṃ japen mantrī daśāṃśaṃ juhuyāt sudhīḥ |
padmaistrimadhuropetairvākpatirjāyate naraḥ ||

ekavīrākalpe (-) bhāvanārahitānāṃ ca kṣudrāṇāṃ kṣudracetasām |
caturguṇo japaḥ proktaḥ siddhaye nānyathā bhavet ||

tārārṇave (-) evaṃ dhyātvā haviṣyāśī japellakṣacatuṣṭayam |

<316> rahasyamālāmādāya japed vā lakṣameva ca ||

vaiśampāyanasaṃhitāyām (-)

kalpoktaiva kṛte saṃkhyā tretāyāṃ dviguṇā bhavet |
dvāpare triguṇā proktā kalau saṃkhyā caturguṇeti ||

atraivaṃ pratibhāti (-) vīrasya satyayuge ekalakṣaparimitaḥ paśunāṃ ca 
lakṣacatuṣṭayaparimito japaḥ | kaliyuge vīrasya lakṣacatuṣṭayaparimitaḥ paśośca 
ṣoḍaśalakṣaparimito japaḥ | anyathā vīrasya satyayuga kaliyugayoḥ 
samānasaṃkhyāpatteḥ | na ceṣṭāpattiḥ | 
vaiśampāyanīyasāmānyavacanavirodhāt | yacca kaliyuga eva paśūnāmeva 
caturlakṣavidhiriti | tanna | satyayuge paśuvīrayorekasaṃkhyāpatteriti | vastutaḥ 
siddhamantrayuga yuga sevā pariśramaḥ(?) iti tantracūḍāmaṇivacanavirodhāt (-)

svācāranirato nityaṃ divālakṣaṃ japet paśuḥ |
dīvyo vā'pyathavā vīro rātrau lakṣajapaṃ caret ||

iti kālīkalpoktakālīmantrapuraścaraṇakālasyātrāpyākāṅkṣitatvāt |

lakṣamātraṃ japed vidyāṃ haviṣyāśī divā śuciḥ |
aśuciśca tathā rātrau lakṣamāvartayet sudhīḥ ||

iti tārāpuraścaraṇaprakaraṇīyabrahmasaṃhitāvacanācca vīrasya | rātrau 
paśordivā sadaikalakṣajapaḥ | caturlakṣajapastu bhraṣṭapaśuviṣayaḥ | 
matsyasūkte (-)

mṛdukomalamāsīno mahāśaṅkhākṣamālayā |
māsatrayaṃ tripakṣaṃ vā japed vidyāṃ samāhitaḥ ||

naktaṃbhojī haviṣyāśī japed vidyāṃ dvilakṣakam ||

iti vacanaṃ ca bhraṣṭavīraparamiti tattvam | tantre (-)

yasmin kāle bhaved dīkṣā tasmin kāle bhavedidam |

dakṣiṇāmūrtikalpe (-) ārabhet pravaro vidvān pūrvapakṣaṃ samāśritaḥ |

puṇye muhūrte nakṣatre tithau snātvā yathāvidhi |
natvā guruṃ gaṇeśānaṃ natvā durgāṃ ca mātaram ||

pūrvapakṣaṃ śuklapakṣam | vaiśampāyanasaṃhitāyām (-)

candratārānukūle ca śuklapakṣe śubhe'hani |
ārabhenmakarādau tu supte viṣṇau japenna ca ||

yoginītantre (-) gurorājñāṃ samādāya śuddhāntaḥkaraṇo naraḥ |
tataḥ puraskriyāṃ kuryān mantrasaṃsiddhikāmyayā ||

<317> tathā (-) tasmādādau svayaṃ kuryād guruṃ ca kārayed budhaḥ |

gurorabhāve vipraṃ vā sarvaprāṇihite ta(?)taḥ ||

snignaṃ śāstravidaṃ mitraṃ nānāguṇasamanvitam |
striyaṃ vā śīlasampannāṃ sadācārāṃ pativratām ||

atha deśāḥ

mahākapilapañcarātre (-) kṣetratīrthavanārāma devālayanadīhṛdāḥ |
kuṭī viraktamityete deśāḥ syurmantrasiddhidāḥ ||

prapañcasāre (-) samudratīre'pyatha vādriśṛṅge samudragānāṃ saritāṃ ca tīre 
|
japed vivikte nija eva gehe viṣṇorgṛhe vā puruṣo manasvī ||

śivālayaśca vṛṣaśūnyo japasthānam |

pratyaṅmukhaḥ śivasthāne vṛṣabheṇa vivarjite |

iti kumbhasambhavavacanāt | yāmale (-)

mlecchaduṣṭamṛgavyāla śaṅkātaṅkavivarjite |
ekānte pāvane cintārahite bhaktisaṃyute ||

sudeśe dhārmike rāṣṭre subhikṣe nirupadrave |
ramye bhaktagaṇasthāne nivasenna parāśraye ||

atha puraścaraṇaniṣiddhasthānāni

rājānaḥ sacivā rāja puruṣāḥ prabhavo janāḥ |
caranti yena mārgeṇa na vaset tatra tattvavit ||

jīrṇadevālayodyāna gṛhavṛkṣataleṣu ca |
nadīkulādrikūṭeṣu bhūchidrādiṣu no vaset ||

jīrṇatvaṃ vṛkṣaparyantamanveti | nadīkulaniṣedhastu samudragākūlabhinnaparaḥ | 
tathā (-)

puṇyakṣetrādikaṃ gatvā kuryād bhūmiparigraham |
brūyādamukamantrasya puraścaraṇasiddhaye ||

mayeyaṃ gṛhyate bhūmirmantro me siddhyatāmiti |
bhīmeḥ parigrahaṃ kṛtvā parimāṇācca sarvataḥ ||

grāme krośamitaṃ sthānaṃ nagare taddvayaṃ smṛtam |
nadīparvatatīrthādau parimāṇena varjitam ||

kṣīravṛkṣamayān kīlānastramantrābhimantritān |
nikhaned daśadigbhāge teṣvastraṃ ca prapūjayet ||

<318> kṣetre ca kīlite mantrī na vighnaiḥ paribhūyate |
kṣetrapālādikāṃstatra pūjayed vidhivittamaḥ ||

dikpatibhyo baliṃ dattvā tataḥ kṣetraṃ samāśrayet |

pūrveśānayormadhye ūrdhvabuddhyā nairṛtapaścimayormadhye adhobuddhyā 
kīlake nikhanet | astramiti | yasya yasya yā yā dik tatra taddikpālāstrāṇi pūjayediti 
kecit | mūlamantrasyāstraṃ ṣaḍaṅgaṃ tadīyāstramantreṇa pūjayedityapare | 
tataḥ kṣetramadhye kṣetrapālabaliṃ dadyāt | taduktaṃ prathamamatantre (-)

kṣetrapālaṃ ca sampūjya baliṃ dadyād yathā vidhi |
pūrvamehi dvayaṃ paścād viduṣi syānmurudvayam ||

bhañjaya dvitayaṃ bhūyo narttaya dvitayaṃ punaḥ |
tato vighnapadadvandvaṃ mahābhairavatatparam ||

kṣetrapālabaliṃ gṛhṇa dvayaṃ pāvakasundarī |
balimantro'yamākhyātaḥ sarvasiddhiphalapradaḥ ||

vīracūḍāmaṇau tu (-) ṛṣicchandādi vinyasya digdevebhyo baliṃ haret |
asitāṅgabhairavabrāhmīpadaṃ ṅentaṃ samālikhet ||

baliṃ gṛhṇa dvidhā kuryād dviṭhānto digbalermanuḥ |
asitāṅgo ruruścaṇḍaḥ krodha unmatta bhairavaḥ ||

kapālī bhīṣaṇaścaiva saṃhāraścāṣṭa bhairavāḥ |
brāhmī māheśvarī paścāt kaumārī vaiṣṇavī tathā |
vārāhī ca tathendrāṇī cāmuṇḍā tadanantaram ||

mahālakṣmīḥ samākhyātā svasvabījādyanukramāt |
dhūpadīpaiḥ samabhyarcya paścāt kīlaṃ niveśayet ||

praṇavaṃ pūrvamuccārya māyā lakṣmīśca manmathaḥ |
indrāṇyai padamuccārya cāmuṇḍe ca padaṃ tataḥ ||

vicce iti padaṃ paścādidaṃ kṣetraṃ ca kīlaya |
rakṣarakṣapadaṃ paścāt kāliketi samālikhet |
vahnijāyāntamantro'yaṃ pūrvādikramato yajet ||

mūlamantraṃ samuccārya āgneyyai padamuccaret |
yāmyai iti padaṃ paścān nairṛtyai ca manuṃ punaḥ ||

vāruṇya vāyavī ceti kauverīśānabhairavī |
<319> ādau mantraṃ samuccārya punardevī vadet priye ||

baliṃ dadyāt krameṇaiva digvidikṣu baliṃ haret |
praṇavaṃ pūrvamuddhṛtya hṛllekhābījamūddharet ||

vaṭukāya padaṃ paścādāpaduddhāraṇāya ca |
kurudvayaṃ samuccārya māyāṃ tāraṃ samuddharet ||

vahnijāyānvito mantrī vaṭukasya baliṃ haret |
āgneyyāṃ balimutsṛjya māyālakṣmīśca manmathaḥ ||

vārāhībījamuddhṛtya bījaṃ pañcāntakaṃ punaḥ |
gaṇapataye padaṃ paścādvaravaradaṃ tathā punaḥ ||

sarvajanaṃ vadeccaiva vadenme vaśamānaya |
ante vahnivadhūṃ dadyād gaṇanātho mahāmanuḥ ||

vārāhībījaṃ glauṃ |

raudraṃ triguṇamuddhṛtya nārāyaṇaṃ tathoddharet |
bījaṃ sūkṣmeśamuddhṛtyāmareśaṃ bījamuddharet ||

ṅentaṃ tu kṣetrapālaṃ ca baliṃ gṛhṇadvayaṃ tataḥ |
vahnijāyānvito mantraḥ kṣetrapālasya kīrtitaḥ ||

vāyubījaṃ tridhā likhya ananto mādhavastathā |
varttulākṣīmathoddhṛtya yoginībhyastathaiva ca ||

vahnijāyānvito mantro vāyavyāṃ yoginībaliḥ |

raudraṃ kṣakāraḥ | triguṇaṃ trivāram | nārāyaṇam āṃ | sūkṣmeśam īṃ | 
amareśam ūṃ | vāyubījaṃ yakāraḥ | ananta ākāraḥ | mādhava ikāraḥ | 
vartulākṣī ukāraḥ |

kṣakāraṃ kālamārūḍhaṃ tadante mā'nalākṣaram |
sarvavighnapadaṃ kṛdbhyaḥ sarvebhyo bhūta uddharet ||

bhyo varma phaṭ samuddhṛtya baliṃ gṛhṇadvayaṃ tataḥ |
dviṭhāntaḥ siddhidaḥ proktaḥ sarvabhūtabaliṃ haret ||

kālo makāraḥ mā īkāraḥ tena kṣmīṃ |

odanaṃ pāyasaṃ kṣīraṃ matsyaṃ māṃsaṃ tathaiva ca |
modakaṃ pūlikāpūpaṃ vaṭakaṃ trividhā surā ||

hṛdyodanādi pakvānnamājyaṃ madhu saśarkaram |
sarvatra vidhivat kuryād dugdhenotsargamācaret ||

<320> yāmale (-) kṣetramadhyaṃ samāśritya kūrmacakraṃ vicintayet |
kūrmacakramavijñāya yaḥ kuryād japayajñakam ||

tajjapasya phalaṃ nāsti sarvānarthāya kalpate |
sārasaṃgrahe (-) taccaturddhā sthitaṃ loke tatprakārastathocyate |
prathamastuḥ paraḥ kūrmastato deśagatastathā ||

grāmago gṛhagaśceti caturdhā sa vyavasthitaḥ |
tantrarāje (-) vyañjanaṃ deśakūrme syād gṛhakūrme svarāstathā |
grāmakūrme taddvitayaṃ parakūrme na taddvayam ||

devīyāmale (-) kurukṣetre prayāge ca gaṅgāsāgarasaṅgame |
mahākāle ca kāśyāṃ ca dīpasthānaṃ na cintayet |

gautamīye (-) parvate sindhutīre vā puṇyāraṇye nadītaṭe |
yadi kuryāt puraścaryāṃ tatra kūrmaṃ na cintayet ||

deśaṃ grāmaṃ gṛhaṃ vāpi navadhā vibhajennaraḥ |
prāgādipaścimāntaṃ tu kādimāntāni vinyaset ||

akṣarāṇyatha yādīni tathāṣṭau koṣṭhayornyaset |
īśadvayamadho madhye svarān prāgādi vinyaset ||

īśāntāstu diśaḥ paścānnāmādyakṣarato bhavet |
tanmukhaṃ pārśvayoḥ pāṇī kukṣī pādau tatastataḥ ||

pucchamekamatho madhyaṃ pṛṣṭhamevaṃ ṣaḍaṅgavān |
mukhe sarvārthasiddhiḥ syāt karayoralpasiddhayaḥ ||

kukṣo tu nityaṃ naiṣphalyaṃ pādayonava siddhayaḥ |
pucche mṛtyustu niyataḥ pṛṣṭhe sarvārthasiddhayaḥ ||

tasmāt tat sādhu vijñāya kuryāt sarvaṃ japādikam |
siddheśvarītantre (-) tasmānmukhaṃ samāśritya sarvakārya samārabhet |
tadalābhe karaṃ vāpi kūrmasthānaṃ samāśrayet ||

kālikodbhave (-) sthānasādhakayonāmnoraritvaṃ yatra vidyate |
tadakṣaśāstrato jñātvā tattatsthānaṃ parityajet ||

gautamīye (-) mantrākṣareṇa maitraśca dāpanāmno bhaved yadi |
sādhakasya ca nāmā'tha kinna sidhyati mantriṇaḥ ||

pañcāśadavarṇarūpeṇa kṣetrapālaviśva(?)vigrahaḥ |
<321> tasmāt tat saguṇaṃ kṣetraṃ siddhaye syānna cānyathā ||

viguṇaścen mukhastho'pi na tena siddhimāpnuyāt |
tasmāccakraṃ vicāryaiva mitraṃ ca sarvasiddhidam ||

yasmin deśe dvipapatiḥ saguṇaṃ nāmamantrayoḥ |
tatra yatnena gantavyaṃ sa pīṭho durlabho mataḥ ||

maitrāmaitramuktaṃ tantrāntare (-)

aritvamadvayasyoktaṃ gakāreṇa parasparam |
ṛdvayasya cakāreṇa makārasya khakārataḥ ||

ḷdvayasya yakāreṇa pakārasya ca ḷdvaye |
odvayasya ṣakāreṇa ṣakārasyauyugena tu ||

jakārasya ḍhakāreṇa ūkārasya khakārataḥ |
ukārasya ca takāreṇa phakārasya dhakārataḥ |
makārasya ca repheṇa yakārasya sakārataḥ ||
aritvameṣāṃ varṇānāmanyeṣāṃ mitrabhāvanā ||

sthānasādhakayornāmnoraritvaṃ yatra vidyate |
tadakṣaśāstrato jñātvā sādhako yatnatastyajet ||

yathā gargasya vairi syādaṭṭahāsaṃ mahāpuram |
auḍḍiyānaṃ ṣaṇmukhasya ṛjubhaṭṭasya cakrakam ||

jayantī ṭaṅkaṇasyāriḥ khadhāra ujhakasya ca |
ukadevasya tārākhyaṃ phajerghūmākhyameva ca ||

bhadrasya ramyakaṃ somanagaraṃ yajñaśarmaṇaḥ |
evaṃ krameṇa vijñāya ripusthānaṃ tyajed budhaḥ ||

merutantre (-) kṣetrasādhakamantrāṇāmekamevādyamakṣaram |
yadi syāt sa dhruvaṃ mantraḥ sarvasiddhiphalapradaḥ ||

tantrāntare (-) riputve niścite tasya dvitīyārṇādi śodhayet |
itthaṃ sthānagṛhaṃ kṛtvā tatra mantrī baliṃ haret ||

gautamīye (-) dvīpanāthaṃ likhen madhye pūjayet taṃ vibhāvayet |
tantre (-) pūrvādinavakoṣṭheṣu kṣetreśāṃstatra pūjayet |
amṛtaḥ prathame prokto dvitīye vṛṣabhastathā ||

śailarājastṛtīye syāccaturthe vāsukiḥ smṛtaḥ |
<322> arthakṛt pañcame proktaḥ śaktikṛt ṣaṣṭha īritaḥ ||

padmayoniḥ saptame syān mahāśaṅkho'ṣṭame mataḥ |
chāyāchatragaṇaḥ prokto navame mantrināyakaiḥ ||

puraścaraṇacandrikāyām (-)

mukhaṃ tasya samāśritya vātātapasahāṃ kuṭīm |
caturhastāṃ caturasrāṃ hastonnatasuvedikām ||

candrātapapatākādi toraṇairapyalaṅkṛtām |
viraktāmatiliptāṃ ca prākāreṇā'bhiveṣṭitām ||

nirmāya ca tataḥ kuryādekabhaktaṃ śubhe dine |
prātaḥ snātvātha gāyatryā ayutaṃ prayato japet ||

jñātājñātasya pāpasya kṣayārthaṃ prathamaṃ tataḥ |

gāyatrī vaidikīti bahavaḥ | svadevagāyatrīti rahasyavidaḥ | sanatkumāraḥ (-)

atha vakṣyāmi mantrasya puraścaraṇamuttamam |
kṛtvābhiṣeko vidhivan mantraṃ labdhvā gurormukhāt ||

śubhe muhūrte nakṣatre tithau snātvā yathāvidhi |
viprān santoṣya yatnena bhojanācchādanādibhiḥ ||

bhūvittavastrabhūṣāḍhyaiḥ santoṣya gurumātmanaḥ |
ārabheta japaṃ paścāt tadanujñāpuraḥsaram ||

agastyasaṃhitāyām (-)

bhuñjāno vā haviṣyānnaṃ śākaṃ yāvakameva vā |
payo mūlaṃ phalaṃ vāpi yatra yatropalabhyate ||

ciñcāṃ ca nālikāśākaṃ kalāyaṃ lakucaṃ tathā |
kadambaṃ nārikelaṃ ca vrate kuṣmāṇḍakaṃ tyajet ||

malināmbarakeśādi mukhadaurgandhyasaṃyutaḥ |
yo japet taṃ dahatyāśu devatā guptisaṃsthitā ||

ālasyaṃ jṛmbhaṇaṃ nidrāṃ dyūtaṃ niṣṭhīvanaṃ bhayam |
nīcasaṃsparśanaṃ kopaṃ japakāle vivarjayet ||

tantrāntare (-) adhaḥśāyī brahmacārī niśāśī prajapen manum |
kulārṇave (-) niyamavyatirekeṇa yad yat karma karoti yaḥ |
kiñcidapyasya na phalaṃ sidhyatyakramadoṣataḥ ||

<323> nyūnātiriktakarmāṇi na phalanti kadācana |
yathāvidhi kṛtānīha tatkarmāṇi phalanti hi ||

tadvidhānakṛtaṃ karma japahomārcanādikam |
devatāprītidaṃ bhūyād bhuktimuktiphalapradam ||

atra ṛtukāle svastrīsambhogo na niṣiddhaḥ |

ṛtukālaṃ vinā mantrī na svastriyamapi spṛśet |

iti gautamīyatantravacanāt | japaśca saṅkalpya kartavyaḥ | taduktaṃ 
kumbhasambhavena (-)

tataḥ saṅkalpya kurvīta puraścaraṇamādarāt ||

saṅkalpaśca sanatkumārasaṃhitāyām (-)

praṇavaṃ tatsadadyeti māsapakṣatithīrapi |
amukagotro'muko'haṃ mūlamuccārya tatparam ||

siddhikāmo'sya mantrasya iyatsaṃkhyājapaṃ tataḥ |
daśāṃśaṃ havanaṃ homād daśāṃśaṃ tarpaṇaṃ tataḥ ||

daśāṃśa mārjanaṃ tasmād daśāṃśaṃ viprabhojanam |
puraścaraṇamevaṃ hi kariṣye prāgudaṅmukhaḥ ||

nāradapañcarātre (-) sampūjyā'tha japaṃ kuryād yāvad vai praharadvayam |
tantre (-) trisandhyamarcayed devaṃ dviḥ sakṛd vā vidhānataḥ ||

puraścaraṇacandrikāyām (-)

sampūjyaiva japaṃ kuryānna mantraṃ kevalaṃ japet |
tantrāntare (-) ekadā vā bhavet pūjā na japet pūjanaṃ vinā |
japānte ca bhavet pūjā pūjānte ca japen manum ||

muṇḍamālāyām (-) yadi pūjādyaśaktaḥ syād dravyābhāvena sundari |
kevalaṃ japamātreṇa puraścaryā vidhīyate ||

strīṇāṃ viśeṣamāha yāmale (-)

niyamaḥ puruṣe jñeyo na yoṣitsu kadācana |
vīratantre (-) na nyāso yoṣitāṃ cātra na dhyānaṃ na ca pūjanaṃ |
kevalaṃ japamātreṇa mantrāḥ sidhyanti yoṣitām ||

atha japavidhiḥ

gautamīyatantre (-) paśubhāve sthitā mantrāḥ kevalā varṇarūpiṇaḥ |
sauṣumṇadhvanyuccaritāḥ prabhutvaṃ prāpnuvanti te ||

<324> mantrākṣarāṇi citsūtre protāni paribhāvayet |
tāmeva paramavyomni paramāmṛtasaṃjñake ||

darśayedātmasadbhāvaṃ pūjāhomādibhirvinā |
rudrayāmale (-) svāpakāle tu mantrasya japo na ca phalapradaḥ |
svāpakālo vāmavaho jāgaro dakṣiṇāvahaḥ ||

kulārṇave (-) jātasūtakamādau syādante ca mṛtasūtakam |
sutakadvayasaṃyukto yo mantraḥ sa na sidhyati ||

brahmabījaṃ manordattvā cādyante parameśvari |
saptavāraṃ japen mantraṃ sūtakadvayamuktaye ||

evaṃ japaṃ purā kṛtvā tejorūpaṃ samarcayet |
devasya dakṣiṇe haste gandhapuṣpārghavāribhiḥ ||

saphalaṃ tadvibhāvyaiva prāṇāyāmaṃ samācaret |
japasyānte japādau ca tritayaṃ tritayaṃ caret ||

tantrāntare (-) manasā yaḥ smaret stotraṃ vacasā ca manuṃ japet |
ubhayaṃ niṣphalaṃ yāti bhagnabhāṇḍodakaṃ yathā ||

rudrayāmale (-) japaṃ yasya śṛṇotyanyaḥ sa mantraḥ śūnya ucyate |
ṛṣicchandodevatābhiḥ parityakto bhujaṅgamaḥ ||

strīśūdrābhyāṃ na bhāṣeta rātrau japaparo na ca |
na jale sandhyākāle ca na pradoṣe na cāturaḥ ||

vaiśampāyanaḥ (-) yajjale śuṣkavastreṇa sthale caivārdravāsasā |
japo homastathā dānaṃ sarvaṃ tanniṣphalaṃ bhavet ||

rudrayāmale (-) viśvāsāstikyakaruṇā śraddhāniyamaniścayaiḥ |
santoṣaiḥ śuddhakarmādiguṇairyukto japet priye ||

atyāhāraḥ prayāsaśca prajalpo niyamāgrahaḥ |
janasaṅgo'tha laulyaṃ ca ṣaḍabhirmantro na sidhyati ||

kulārṇave (-) mānasaḥ siddhikāmānāṃ puṣṭikāmairupāṃśukaḥ |
vāciko māraṇe caiva praśasto japa īritaḥ |
aśucirvā śucirvāpi gacchaṃstiṣṭhan svapannapi |
mantraikaśaraṇo vidvān manasaiva sadā'bhyaset |
na doṣo mānase jāpye sarvadeśe'pi sarvadā ||

<325> uttaratantre (-) japādau pūjayen mālāṃ toyairabhyukṣya yatnataḥ |
vidhāya maṇḍalasthāṃ tāṃ savyahastagatāṃ ca vā ||

iṣṭamantreṇa mālāyāḥ prokṣaṇaṃ parikīrtitam |
oṃ māle māle mahāmāye sarvaśaktisvarūpiṇi |
caturvargastvayi nyastastasmānme siddhidā bhava ||

pūjayitvā tato mālāṃ gṛhṇīyād dakṣiṇe kare |
japaṃ samācaret paścāt pūrvavad dhyānamāsthitaḥ ||

cintayecca guruṃ mūrdhni yathā varṇādikaṃ bhavet |
mantraṃ dhyāyet kaṇṭhamadhye pītavarṇaṃ hiraṇmayam ||

mahāmāyāṃ ca hṛdaye svātmānaṃ gurupādayoḥ |
ājñācakre tataḥ paścād gurumantrasya cātmanaḥ ||

devyāścāpyekatāṃ nītvā suṣumṇāvartmanā tataḥ |
tattvasvarūpamekaṃ tad yaccakraṃ pratilaṅghayet ||

ṣaṭcakre tu mahāmāyāṃ kṣaṇaṃ dhyātvā prayatnataḥ |
lambayen mūlamantreṇa cādiṣoḍaśacakrakam |
ādiṣoḍaśacakra(madhya)sthāṃ sādhakānandadāyinīm |
cintayet sādhako devīṃ japakarma samācaret ||

ṣoḍaśacakramuktaṃ tatraiva (-)

tisṛṇāmapi nāḍīnāṃ hṛdaye caikatā bhavet |
tatsthānaṃ ṣoḍaśāraṃ syāt saptāṅgulapramāṇataḥ ||

tat pītamuktaṃ yogajñairādiṣoḍaśacakrakamiti |
tathā (-) mālāṃ sahṛdayāsannāṃ dhṛtvā dakṣiṇapāṇinā | japediti śeṣaḥ |

śaivāgame (-) tarjanyā na spṛśet sūtraṃ kampayenna vidhūnayet |
na spṛśed vāmahastena karabhraṣṭānna kārayet |
akṣāṇāṃ cālane'ṅguṣṭhenā'nyamakṣaṃ na saṃspṛśet |
japakāle sadā vidvān meruṃ naiva vilaṅghayet ||

parivartanakāle ca saṃghaṭṭaṃ naiva kārayet ||

kaliḥ khaṭakhaṭāśabde dolamāne calanmatiḥ ||
calite caiva vidveṣaḥ sphuṭite vyādhisambhavaḥ |
hastacyute mahāvighnaḥ sūtrachede vinaśyati ||

<326> tathā (-) karacyute ca jṛmbhāyāmekamāvartanaṃ tyajet |
pramādāt tarjanīsparśo bhavedāvartanaṃ tyajet ||

āvartanaṃ mantrasyetyāhuḥ | tathā (-)

jape niṣiddhasaṃsparśe kṣālayitvā punarjapet |
uttaratantre (-) madhyamāyāṃ madhyabhāgaṃ varjayitvā tu tarjanīm |
anāmikākaniṣṭhābhyāṃ yuktābhyāṃ namrabhāvataḥ ||

sthāpayitvā tatra mālāmaṅguṣṭhāgreṇa taddhṛtam |
pratyekaṃ bījamādhāya aṅkādūrdhvena bhairava ||

prativāraṃ paṭhen mantrī śanairoṣṭhau ca cālayet |

mahākapilapañcarātre (-)

ekacittaḥ prasannātmā hyakṣasūtrakaraḥ śuciḥ |
bhugnagrīvonnataḥ śāntaḥ kaṇḍūnmīlanavarjitaḥ ||

savisargaṃ samātraṃ ca sabinduṃ sākṣaraṃ sphuṭam |
na drutaṃ vāpi viśrāntaṃ kramān mantraṃ japet sudhīḥ ||

atra mantradhyānaṃ prakārāntareṇa | taduktaṃ nityajapaprakaraṇa eva | anye ca 
japavidhā japabhedāstatsamarpaṇaprakārāśca tatraivoktā iti neha vitanyate | 
vāyavīya (-)

saṃhitāyām (-) devatāgurumantrāṇāmaikyaṃ sambhāvayan dhiyā |
japedekamanāḥ prātaḥkālān madhyandināvadhi ||

yatsaṃkhyayā samārabdhaṃ tat karttavyamaharniśam |
yadi nyūnādhikaṃ kuryād vratabhraṣṭo'bhijāyate ||

muṇḍamālāyām (-) prātarmadhyandinaṃ yāvaj japakālaḥ prakīrtitaḥ |
na nyūnaṃ nātiriktaṃ vā japaṃ kuryād dine dine ||

nairantaryāvadhi prokto na dinānyatilaṅghayet |
divasātikrame puṃsāṃ siddhirodhaḥ prajāyate ||

mantrajaptānnapānīya snānācamanabhojanam |

prātarityādi divātanapuraścaraṇaviṣayam | puraścaraṇacandrikāyām (-)

dhyātveṣṭadevatārūpamātmānaṃ prajapen manum |
saṃkhyāpūrtau punaḥ kuryādṛṣyādiprāṇasaṃyamāna ||

saṃkhyāpūrtau dainandinasaṃkhyāpūrtau | ṛṣyādīti | 
ṛṣ.yādinyāsābhiprāyam | siddhasārasvate (-) evaṃ japaṃ tathā kṛtvā 
daśāṃśamasitotpalaiḥ |
<327> ājyāktairjuhuyān mantrī tad daśāṃśena tarpayet ||

kālāgurudravopetairvimalairgandhavāribhiḥ |

puraścaraṇacandrikāyām (-)

tato japadaśāṃśena homaṃ kuryād dine dine |
athavā lakṣasaṃkhyāyāṃ pūrṇāyāṃ homamācaret ||

kiṃ vā yasya japo yāvāṃstatpūrtau homamācaret |

lakṣapūrttāviti pṛthagupādānāṃ yatra bahulakṣātmakapuraścaraṇaṃ tatparam |
siddhasārasvate (-) evaṃ japaṃ tathā kṛtvā daśāṃśamasitotpalaiḥ |
akoḍairjuhuyān mantrī(?) taddaśāṃśena tarpayet |

matsyasūkte (-) homaṃ kuryād daśāṃśena vilvapatraiśca sādhakaḥ |
homārthamagnisaṃskāraśca dīkṣātaraṅge draṣṭavyaḥ | sārasaṃgrahe (-)

tato homadaśāṃśena jale sampūjya devatām |
tarpayāmīti mantrānte proktvā'dbhirmūrdhni tarpayet ||

tato mārjanaṃ kuryāt | tathāhi vaiśampāyanaḥ (-)

tarpaṇasya daśāṃśena namo'ntaṃ mantramuccaran |
abhiṣiñcet svamūrdhānaṃ jalaiḥ kumbhākhyamudrayā ||

atra śīrṣe amukamabhiṣiñcāmīti yojayanti | kumbhamudrā nityasnānaprakaraṇa 
evoktā | vīracūḍāmaṇau tu (-)

tarpaṇānte mahāmantrī abhiṣekaṃ tu kārayet |
gomayenopaliptāyāṃ bhūmau padmadalaṃ likhet ||

kalaśaṃ sthāpayet tatra kalāṃ caiva prapūjayet |
gandhadūrvāṅkurairvāpi aśokaiścūtapallavaiḥ ||

sampūjya gandhapuṣpādyairupacāraiḥ prapūjayet |
mātṛkāmantramuccārya pratyekaṃ mantramuccaret ||

abhiṣiñcāmīti padaṃ śirasi cābhiṣecayet |

tato mārjanadaśāṃśena pūrvoktadravyaiḥ sveṣṭadevatābhaktān kaulikān 
bhojayet |

tantre (-) homakarmādyaśaktānāṃ viprāṇāṃ dviguṇo japaḥ |
itareṣāṃ tu varṇānāṃ tricatuḥpañcasaṃkhyayā ||

dvaiguṇyādi homādyapekṣayaiva | sanatkumārīye (-)

yad yadaṅgaṃ bhaved bhagnaṃ tatsaṃkhyādviguṇo japaḥ |
<328> homābhāve japaḥ kāryo homasaṃkhyācaturguṇaḥ ||

viprāṇāṃ kṣatriyāṇāṃ ca rasasaṃkhyāguṇaḥ smṛtaḥ |
vaiśyānāṃ vasusaṃkhyākameṣāṃ strīṇāmayaṃ vidhiḥ ||

yaṃ varṇamāśritaḥ śūdraḥ sa ca tasya vidhiṃ caret |

agastyasaṃhitāyām (-)

yadi home na śaktaḥ syāt pūjāyāṃ tarpaṇe'pi vā |
tāvatsaṃkhyājapenaiva brāhmaṇārādhanena ca ||

bhavedaṅgadvayenaiva puraścaraṇamatra vai |

strīśūdrayośca homasthāne yathokta japa eva na tu śaktāvapi homaḥ |

strīśūdrābhyāṃ na hotavyaṃ mantroccāraṇapūrvakamiti vacanāt |

vārāhītantre (-) dvijānāmadhikāro'sti tāntrike homakarmaṇi |
yadi kāmī bhaveccaiva śūdro'pi homakarmaṇi ||

vahnijāyāṃ parityajya svāhānte ca namo mataḥ | ityuktam |

tantre (-) homābhāve dvijānāṃ tu yaḥ proktaḥ sūribhirjapaḥ |
tatsubhruvāṃ ca tadbhaktaśūdrāṇāṃ ca sa eva hi ||

sāmānyatastu śūdrāṇāṃ pañcaguṇatvamuktameva | 
puraścaraṇacandrikāyām (-)

puraścaryāṃ vidhāyetthaṃ samyak sādhakasattamaḥ |
tadante mahatīṃ pūjāṃ kuryād brāhmaṇabhojanam ||

bahubhirvastrabhūṣābhiḥ pūjayed gurumātmanaḥ |
dīnānāthāṃśca santoṣya mantrāḥ sidhyanti mantriṇām ||

homāṅganirūpaṇe (-) japahomārcanairmantrā niyatasyāsya siddhidāḥ |
japena triguṇenāpi manavaḥ siddhidāḥ smṛtāḥ ||

kulamūlāvatāre rudrayāmale ca (-)

bhojanena vinā devi tarpaṇena vinā punaḥ |
homenāpi vinā siddhayai mantrāṇāṃ triguṇaṃ japet ||

atha vīrapuraścaraṇe viśeṣaḥ

tatra japādau kālo rātrireva | mālā ca mahāśaṅkhanirmiteti prāgevoktam | 
viśeṣāntaraṃ tu kulacūḍāmaṇau (-)

puraścaraṇakāle ca paraśaktiṃ prapūjayet |
dīkṣite vastrapuṣpādyairbhojyaiḥ pāyasasambhavaiḥ ||

<329> śūnyagehe samānīya cārghyodakaviśodhitam |
amṛtīkaraṇaṃ kṛtvā śaktīrabhimukhaṃ nayet ||

samānīya śaktipūjopayuktadravyādi | amṛtīkaraṇaṃ teṣāmeva | tathā (-)

arghyodakena sarvāstāḥ saṃprokṣya vidhipūrvakam |
amṛtīkaraṇaṃ kuryāt sakalīkaraṇaṃ tataḥ ||

atrāmṛtaukaraṇādikaṃ śaktīnām | pūjyaśaktīrāha (-)

athāṣṭa kanyakā vakṣye devīrūpadharā yataḥ |
brāhmaṇī kṣatriyā vaiśyā śūdrā ca kulabhūṣaṇā |
veśyā nāpitakanyā ca rajakī yoginī tathā ||

viśeṣavaidagdhyayutāḥ sarvā eva śubhā(kulā)ṅganāḥ |
aṣṭakanyārūpabhedaṃ vilokyā'marṣaceṣṭitāḥ ||

brāhmaṇyādyaṣṭaśaktīnāṃ nāmabhiḥ kṛtasaṃjñakāḥ |
gaurakṛṣṇādikaṃ rūpaṃ saumyatvaṃ ca guṇādikaṃ ||

śaktīnāṃ nāmāni vakṣyamāṇastotra eva vaktavyāni | pūjāprakāramāha (-)

āsanaṃ prathamaṃ dattvā svāgataṃ ca vadet punaḥ |
arghyaṃ pādyaṃ ca pānīyaṃ madhuparkaṃ jalaṃ tataḥ ||

snāpayed gandhapuṣpādbhiḥ keśasaṃskāramācaret |
dhūpayitvā tataḥ keśaṃ kauśeyaṃ vinivedayet ||

tataḥ sthānāntare pīṭhamāstīrya pādukādvayam |
dattvā tatra samāsīnāṃ nānālaṅkārabhūṣaṇaiḥ ||

bhūṣayitvā'nulepaṃ ca gandhamālyaṃ nivedayet |
tāṃ tāṃ śaktiṃ samāvāhya mūrdhni tāsāṃ samānayet ||

bhojyamaṇḍapamadhye tu svarṇapātre suśobhane |
carvyaṃ coṣyaṃ lehyapeyaṃ bhojyaṃ caiva hi bhakṣaṇam ||

adīkṣitā yadā syustāstadā māyāṃ nivedayet |

tāṃ tāmiti | yasyā nāmnā yā saṅketitā tasyāḥ śirasi tāṃ śaktimāvāhya 
pūjayedityarthaḥ | idaṃ cāvāhanaṃ madhye'pyuktamādāvevā'rhati sarvatra 
tathā darśanāt |

tatrāsāṃ savyakarṇeṣu tatastotraṃ samācaret |

śaktistotram

mātardevi namaste'stu brahmarūpadhare'naghe |
<330> kṛpayā hara vighnaṃ me mantrasiddhiṃ prayaccha me ||

māheśi varade devi paramānandarūpiṇi |
kṛpayā hara vighnaṃ me mantrasiddhiṃ prayacchame ||

kaumāri sarvavighneśi kumārakrīḍane'vare |
kṛpayā hara vighnaṃ me mantrasiddhiṃ prayaccha me ||

viṣṇurūpadhare devi mahāgaruḍavāhini |
kṛpayā hara vighnaṃ me mantrasiddhiṃ prayaccha me ||

vārāhi varade devi daṃṣṭroddhṛtavasundhare |
kṛpayā hara vighnaṃ me mantrasiddhiṃ prayaccha me ||

śakrarūpadhare devi śakrādisurapūjite |
kṛpayā hara vighnaṃ me mantrasiddhiṃ prayaccha me ||

cāmuṇḍe muṇḍamālāsṛkcarcite vighnanāśini |
kṛpayā hara vighnaṃ me mantrasiddhiṃ prayaccha me ||

mahālakṣmi mahāmoha kṣobhasantāpanāśini |
kṛpayā hara vighnaṃ me mantrasiddhiṃ prayaccha me ||

pitṛmātṛmaye devi pitṛmātṛbahiṣkṛte |
eke bahutare devi viśvarūpe namo'stu te ||

etat stotraṃ paṭhed yastu karmārambhe susaṃyataḥ |
vidagdhāṃ vā samālokya tasya vighno na jāyate ||

yadi brīḍāparāstāstu bhojane tad gṛhād bahiḥ |
sthitvā stotraṃ paṭhet tāvad yāvat tṛptiḥ prajāyate ||

ācamya mukhavāsādi tāmbūlaṃ ca nivedayet |
tathā (-) tato dadyāt punarmālyaṃ candanaṃ paṅkitaṃ śubham |
visṛjya pradakṣiṇīkṛtya varaṃ prārthya sukhī bhavet ||

anyā yadi na gacchanti nijakanyā nijānujā |
agrajā mātulānī vā jananī tatsapatnikā ||

vayasyā jñātijā vā'pi sadhavā vāpi niṣpatiḥ |
pūrvābhāve parā pūjyā madaṃśā yoṣito yataḥ ||

ekā ced yuvatī tatra pūjitā vā vilokitā |
sarvā eva tadā devyaḥ pūjitāḥ kulabhairava ||

<331> idaṃ ca puraścaraṇasyādau madhye cānte ca karttavyam | tathāhi tatraiva (-)

ādāvante ca madhye ca lakṣapūrtau viśeṣataḥ |
na pūjayati cet kāntāṃ tadā vighnairvilupyate ||

vīracūḍāmaṇau (-) kṣetramādau tu saṃśodhya samasūtraṃ manoharam |
vedikāṃ kārayet tatra madhye muṇḍaṃ viniḥkṣipet ||

alinā lepanaṃ kuryān madhye cāṣṭadalaṃ likhet |
pūrvādikramato jñeyaṃ svarayugmaṃ likhet kramāt ||

vargāṣṭakaṃ likhet tatra madhye prāsādamālikhet |
gaganaṃ bindusaṃyuktaṃ lāṅgalīśaṃ tathaiva ca ||

savisargaṃ varārohe keśareṣu likhet tataḥ |
tatrādhārādi sampūjya āsanaṃ sthāpayed budhaḥ ||

upaviśyāsane vīro yatra kutrāpyacūḍake |
pārṣṇighātatrayaṃ kuryācchoṭikātritayaṃ tataḥ ||

digbandhamastramantreṇa pūrvādikramato budhaḥ |
vakeśānte pinākīśaṃ nādabinduvibhūṣitam ||

paśupadaṃ samuccārya ramānte'stramanūttamam |
pāśupatākhyavidyeyaṃ sarvavighnavināśinī ||

vakeśaḥ śakāraḥ | pinākīśo lakāraḥ |

bhūtaśuddhiṃ vidhāyādau nyāsapūrvaṃ vidhānataḥ |
tathā (-) gomayena viliptāyāṃ bhūmau maṇḍalamālikhet |
alinā lepanaṃ kuryād yakṣakardamakena vā ||

sūtreṇa sūtritaṃ padmaṃ samasūtraṃ manoharam |
raktaṃ śvetaṃ haridvarṇaṃ kṛṣṇapatraṃ sukeśaram ||

caturasraṃsuśobhāḍhye tanmadhye yoniyugmakam |
trikoṇaṃ caiva tanmadhye śūnye śūnyaṃ vicintayet ||

yojayed dīpitāṃ nārīṃ tatra sampūjayen manum |
tatraiva devīṃ saṃsthāpya īṣaddhāsāṃ sulocanām ||

ṣoḍaśābdena yuvatīmaprasūtāṃ tapasvinīm |
svādhīnāṃ svacchavastrāṃ ca bhītihīnāṭṭahāsinīm ||

tīvraśuddhiṃ dṛḍhācārāṃ muktakeśīṃ digambarām |
<332> yogamudrādharāṃ vāpi yogācāraparāyaṇām ||

īdṛśīṃ mantrasaṃyuktāṃ yāgakāle prapūjayet |
mātaṅgīṃ tantukārīṃ ca bhavābdhibhītināśinīm ||

khaṭvākārīṃ carmakārīṃ śilpinīṃ nāpitāṅganām |
haṭṭanārīṃ viśeṣāt tu supuṣpakeṇa komalām ||

sāmānyārghyaṃ viśeṣārghyaṃ svapātraṃ śaktipātrakam |
tanmadhye nikṣiped dravyaṃ sāmarasyāmṛtodbhavam ||

tattvapañcakamantreṇa ekaikaṃ śodhayed budhaḥ |
vahnisūryakalācandra kalānte hṛdayaṃ manum ||

trikoṇaṃ vilikhen madhye trikoṇamakathādikam |
khāntaṃ ṣāntaṃ tathā nāntaṃ yāntaṃ dhāntaṃ saśatrukam ||

vāmakarṇasamāyuktaṃ bindunādairalaṅkṛtam |
ratneśvarīti vidyākhyaṃ pañcaratnātmakaṃ manum ||

ṣaḍaṅgenaiva sampūjya mūlamantreṇa mantrayet |

antaryāgaḥ

athāntaryajanaṃ kuryān mahogratāriṇi svayam ||

kuṇḍalinīṃ samutthāpya tripade tripathagāmini |
prāṇaṃ nāḍyāṃ samāpūrya tatra nādasamudbhavam ||

nādabindusamudbhūtaṃ tatra dhūmraṃ vicintayet |
kadambagolakākāra bilāntare layātmakam ||

śivaśaktyātmakaṃ viśvaṃ sudhādhārāsvarūpakam |
tadānandasamudbhūtaṃ vyaktāvyaktaṃ paraṃ śivam ||

tatrotpannaṃ mahābauddhamudbhūtaṃ vā parāyaṇam |
mudrāṃ sandarśayet tasyāṃ mṛgīṃ haṃsīṃ ca vajriṇīm ||

trivāraṃ tarpayed devi ekaikāmiha mūrdhani |
trikālaṃ cintayen mūrdhni dakṣiṇottarataḥ kramāt ||

vyomakeśordhvakeśau ca nīlakaṇṭhaṃ tathā punaḥ |
nādāntaṃ pūjayet paścād vyomāmbāpūrvamarcayet ||

ūrdhvakeśaṃ tathā nīlaṃ divyaughāṃśca prapūjayet |
<333> matsyaṃ kūrma vaśiṣṭhaṃ ca maheśvarānandameva ca ||

tārāṃ bhānumatīṃ cāpi jayāṃ vidyāṃ mahodarīm |
ambāntāṃ pūjayen madhye bhāvādekajaṭāṃ śivām ||

iti siddhaugho vijñeyaḥ sampradāyagurukramaḥ |
sukhānandaḥ parānandaḥ pārijātaḥ kuleśvaraḥ ||

virūpākṣastathā bhīmo bhairavo mānavaughataḥ |
suṣumṇāṃ ca parāṃ buddhiṃ paśyantīṃ caiva vaikharīm ||

pārijāteśvarīṃ vācaṃ dhyāyennīlasarasvatīm |
tritārāmādau saṃyojya namo'nte mantramuccaret ||

śirasi paṅktiṃ sampūjya mūlādhāre svanāma ca |
santarpya kuṇḍalīṃ śaktiṃ pañcamudrāvidhānataḥ ||

alinā piśitaṃ mīnaṃ mudrāṃ maithunamaiva ca |
makārapañcamaṃ yatra tatra devī na saṃśayaḥ ||

na madyaṃ mādhavī madyaṃ madyaṃ śaktirasodbhavam |
suṣumṇā śaṅkhinī matsyaṃ mudrā unmanyanuttamā ||

sāmarasyāmṛtollāsaṃ maithunaṃ tat sadāśivam ||

divyaṃ vīraṃ paśuṃ caiva pānaṃ trividhameva ca |
paśupānarato vīraḥ sa bhakṣyo yoginīgaṇaiḥ ||

divyapānarato vīro devīsāyujyamāpnuyāt |
deśiko vīrapānena devīlokaṃ sa gacchati |
sādhakaḥ paśupānena rauravaṃ narakaṃ vrajet ||

prāṇāpānau samāhārau pratyāhāraṃ manaḥ sthiram |
bhānumaṇḍalaṃ bheditvā idaṃ maṇḍalamadhyagam ||

suṣumṇā vartmanā nityaṃ sudhādhārāpravarṣiṇī |
divyapānamidaṃ proktaṃ sarvasiddhikaraṃ param ||

tyaktasarvāśayamūlavāsanāmūlasañcayaḥ |
kaulikācārayogena pañcatattvena tarpayet ||

ṣaṭcakrakramabhedena huned dravyaṃ samantrakam |
dhyānārcanamanāvasthā vīrapānamanuttamam ||

āsaktalolupo dambho mantrārthe aprasaṅgataḥ |
<334> kāmukaḥ kāryanirdeśe paśupānaṃ taducyate ||

siddheśvaratantre'pi (-) mūlakandeṣu yā śaktirbhujaṅgākārarūpiṇī |
tadbhramāvartajāteyaṃ tasmādityucyate budhaiḥ ||

calantī vyaktamadhurā kūjantī sā tathotthitā |
gacchantī brahmarandhreṇa praviśantī svaketanam ||

yātāyātakrameṇaiva tatra kuryān manolayam |
tena mantraśikhā jātā sarvasiddhipradīpikā ||

tamoyukte tathā gehe na kiñcit pratibhāṣate |
śikhāhīne tathā mantre na siddhiḥ kalpakoṭibhiḥ ||

ayamantaryāgo nityapūjāyāmapyarghyasthāpanāt prāk paśunāpi kāryaḥ |
svatantratantre (-) rātrau māṃsāsavairdevīṃ pūjayitvā vidhānataḥ |
tato nagnāṃ striyaṃ nagno raman kledayuto'pi vā |
japellakṣaṃ tato devīṃ homayejjvalitānale ||

yonikuṇḍe sthitaṃ sarpirmatsyaṃ māṃsaṃ phalaṃ tathā |
daśāṃśaṃ tarpayen madyaṃ māṃsamiśraistu sādhakaḥ ||

tarpaṇasya daśāṃ'saṃ tu abhiṣicya jaganmayīm |
daśāṃśaṃ bhojayet sādhu sādhakaṃ kālikāpriyam ||

madyaṃ māṃsaṃ ca matsyaṃ ca carvaṇaṃ ca pradāpayet |
tatastu toṣayed bhaktyā guruṃ svarṇādibhiḥ priye ||

idaṃ ca yadyapi kālikāmantramadhikṛtyoktaṃ tathāpi yathā kālī tathā 
tāretyādi vacanādatrāpyācaranti | ata eva vīracūḍāmaṇāvapi (-)

tarpaṇaṃ vidhivat kuryādraktadhāreṇa saṃkhyayā |
madhvājyasurayā vāpi pāyasenodakena tu ||

atra vīreṇa surādinā paśunā jalādineti vivekaḥ | agastyasaṃhitāyām (-)

samyak siddhaikamantrasya pañcāṅgopāsanena ca |
sarve mantrāḥ prasidhyanti tvatprasādān maheśvari ||

tantraśekhare (-) evaṃ prakurvatastasya prathame vatsaratraye |
bhavanti bahavo vighnāḥ śraddhābhāvādayo'śubhāḥ ||

asminnarthe bhaven mantrī yadi nodvignamānasaḥ |
setsyatīti ca viśvastastadāsau siddhibhāgbhavet ||

<335> dīkṣāpuraścaraṇādyārambhadine samāptidine vā rātrau svapnaṃ 
prārthayet | tatprakārastu dīkṣāyāga evoktaḥ |

atha siddhicihnāni

vakratuṇḍakalpe (-) cittaprasādo manasaśca tuṣṭiralpāśitā 
svapnaparāṅmukhatvam |
svapneṣu yānādyupalambhanaṃ tu siddhasya cihnāni bhavanti sadyaḥ ||

bhairavītantre (-) jyotiḥ paśyati sarvatra śarīraṃ vā prakāśayuk |
nijaṃ śarīramathavā devatāmayameva hi ||

nāradapañcarātre (-) mantrārādhanaśaktasya prathame vatsaratraye |
jāyante bahavo vighnā niyamasthasya nārada ||

nodvegaṃ sādhako yāti karmaṇā manasā yadi |
tṛtīyavatsarādūrdhvaṃ rājānaśca mahībhṛtaḥ ||

prārthayante'nurodhena garvitā api māninaḥ |
prasādaḥ kriyatāṃ nātha mamoddhāraṇakāraṇam ||

prajvalantaṃ ca paśyantī tejasā vibhavena ca |
ataste muniśārdūla niṣṭhuraṃ vaktumakṣamāḥ ||

navamād vatsarādūrdhvaṃ svayaṃ sidhyati mantrarāṭ |
nānāścaryāṇi hṛdaye mantrasiddhimayāni vai ||

atyānandapradānyāśu pratyakṣeṇa bahistathā |
jaḍadhīstu kṣaṇaṃ vipra kṣaṇamasti prahaṣitaḥ ||

kṣaṇaṃ dundubhinirghoṣaṃ śṛṇotyapyantarikṣagam |
kṣaṇaṃ ca madhuraṃ vādyaṃ nānāgītasamanvitam ||

ājighrati kṣaṇaṃ gandhān karpūramṛganābhijān |
utpatantaṃ kṣaṇaṃ vāpi paśyatyātmānamātmanā ||

candrārkakiraṇākīrṇaṃ kṣaṇamālokayannabhaḥ |
gajagovṛṣanādāṃśca śṛṇuyācca kṣaṇaṃ dvijaḥ ||

nirbharāmbudasaṃkṣobhaṃ kṣaṇamākarṣayatyapi |
tārakāṇi vicitrāṇi yogino nabhasi sthitān ||

paśyatyudgrāhayantaṃ ca kṣaṇaṃ mantravatāṃ sadā |
kṣaṇaṃ kilikilārāvaṃ haṃsabarhiravaṃ tathā ||

kṣaṇaṃ meghodayaṃ paśyet kṣaṇaṃ rātrindine sati |
<336> rātrau ca divasālokaṃ sasūryaṃ kṣaṇamīkṣate ||

balena paripūrṇaśca tejasā bhāskaropamaḥ |
pūrṇendusadṛśaḥ kāntyā gamane vihagopamaḥ ||

śamena yuktaḥ prauḍhena gāmbhīryeṇa sukhena ca |
svalpāśanenākṛśatā bahunāpi na khidyate ||

viṇmūtrayoralpatā hi bhavennidrājayastathā |
japadhyānagato mantrī na khedamadhigacchati ||

vinā bhojanapānābhyāṃ pakṣamāsādikaṃ mune |
ityevamādibhiścihnairmahāvismayakāribhiḥ ||

pravṛttaiḥ sampraboddhavyaṃ prasanno mantrarāḍiti |
baudhāyanaḥ (-) siddhestu trīṇi cihnāni dātā bhoktā ayācakaḥ |
prapañcasāre (-) tato'sya pratyayāstvevaṃ jāyante japato manum |
adhiṣṭhitaṃ niśyadīpaṃ nistamiśraṃ gṛhaṃ bhavet ||

arkābhastejasā'sau bhavati nalinajā santataṃ kiṅkarī syā (-)
drogā naśyanti dṛṣṭyā drutamatha dhanadhānyākulastatsamīpam |
devā nityaṃ namo'smai vidadhati phaṇino naiva daṃśanti putrān
pautrān mitrāṇi vṛddhāṃstanuvipadi paraṃ dhāma viṣṇoḥ prayāti ||

phetkāriṇītantre (-) karmaṇā prabalenaiva pratibandhāvirodhinā |
yadi siddhiṃ na labhate dvistrirvā punarācaret || iti |

puraścaraṇāntaram

pūrvoktapuraścaraṇāśaktaṃ prati puraścaraṇāntaramapyuktam | 
muṇḍamālāyām (-)

kṛṣṇāṣṭamīṃ samārabhya yāvat kṛṣṇāṣṭamī bhavet |
sahasrasaṃkhye japte tu puraścaraṇamiṣyate ||

candrapīṭhe (-) mahālakṣmīṃ samārabhya amahānavamīśvari |
kṛṣṇāṣṭamyā ñānavamī madhau śākte manau smṛtam ||

ūrje tapasi rādhe vā śuklapakṣastu vaiṣṇave |
ekādaśyanta aiśe tu bhūtāntaḥ phālgune smṛtaḥ ||

bhādre'pi vaighnarāje tu māghabhādrau svavāsarāt |
anyeṣvapi ca mantreṣu pūrvoktaṃ navarātrakam ||

japo mātṛkayā prātaḥkālīn madhyandināvadhi |
<337> rātrā yāmamitaḥ kāryaḥ payomūlaphalāhṛtiḥ ||

caturthayāme kartavyā mālāmantre daśāṃśataḥ |
viṃśāṃśād vā daśāṃśād vā anyeṣvapi hutaṃ matam ||

dakṣiṇā ca yathoktā'tra vittaśāṭhyaṃ na kārayet |
evaṃ mantraḥ prayogārho bhavatyeva na saṃśayaḥ ||

muṇḍamālāyām (-) kṛṣṇāṃ caturdaśīṃ prāpya tapasyantaṃ mahotsave |
aṣṭamī navamī rātrau pūjāṃ kuryād viśeṣataḥ ||

daśamyāṃ pāraṇaṃ kuryān matsyamāṃsādibhiryutam |
ṣaṭsahasraṃ japennityaṃ bhaktibhāvaparāyaṇaḥ ||

tathā (-) athavā'nyaprakāreṇa puraścaraṇamucyate |
caturdaśīṃ samārabhya yāvadanyā caturdaśī ||

tāvaj japte maheśāni puraścaraṇamiṣyate |
kevalaṃ japamātreṇa mantrāḥ siddhā bhavanti hi ||

balihomādidānena viśeṣāt pīṭhapūjane |
yonipīṭhaṃ mahāpīṭhaṃ kāmarūpaṃ tahā param ||

tayorekatamaṃ pūjyaṃ rudradeha ivā'paraḥ |

kālītantre (-) athavā'nyaprakāreṇa puraścaraṇamiṣyate |
kuje vā śanivāre vā naramuṇḍaṃ samāhṛtam ||

pañcagavyena militaṃ candanādyairviśeṣataḥ |
niḥkṣipya bhūmau hastārdhamānataḥ kānanāntare ||

tatra tad divase rātrau sahasraṃ yadi sādhakaḥ |
ekākī prajapen mantraṃ sa bhavet kalpapādapaḥ ||

tatraiva (-) athavā'nyaprakāreṇa puraścaraṇamucyate |
śavamānīya tadvāre tenaiva parikhanyate ||

taddināntadinaṃ yāvat tāvadaṣṭottaraṃ śatam |
sa bhavet sarvasiddhīśo nātra kāryā vicāraṇā ||

tadvāre śanimaṅgalavāre | tenaiva prakāreṇa hastārddhamānata iti yāvat | 
pratyaha (?)'ṣṭottaraśataṃ japedityanuṣaṅgaḥ | tatraiva (-)

athavā'nyaprakāreṇa puraścaraṇamucyate |
aṣṭamyāṃ vā caturdaśyāṃ pakṣayorubhayorapi ||

<338> sūryodayāt samārabhya yāvat sūryodayāntaram |
tāvajjaptvā nirātaṅkaṃ sarvasiddhīśvaro bhavet ||

atra homādikamapi kartavyaṃ puraścaraṇatvaśruteḥ |
kālītantre (-) athavā'nyaprakāreṇa puraścaraṇamucyate |
candrasūryagrahe caiva grāsāvadhi vimuktitaḥ ||

yāvatsaṃkhyaṃ manuṃ japtvā tāvaddhomādikaṃ caret |

sanatkumārasaṃhitāyām (-)

athavā'nyaprakāreṇa pauraścaraṇiko vidhiḥ |
candrasūryoparāge ca snātvā prayatamānasaḥ ||

saṃsparśādi vimokṣāntaṃ japen mantramananyadhīḥ ||

dṛṣṭvā snātvā ca saṅkalpya vimokṣāntaṃ japaṃ caret ||

tāvaddhomādikaṃ kuryād grahaṇānte śuciḥ pumān |
evaṃ japān mantrasiddhirbhavatyeva na saṃśayaḥ ||

tāvaditi yāvān japo jāta ityarthaḥ | idaṃ ca gopālaviṣayam | vacanasya 
sanatkumārīyatvāditi vadanti | pumānityanena strīṇāṃ 
homaniṣedho'bhyanujñātaḥ |

tantrāntare (-) grahaṇe candrasūryasya śuciḥ pūrvamupoṣitaḥ |
nadyāṃ samudragāminyāṃ nābhimātre jale sthitaḥ ||

yadvā śuddhodake snātvā śucau deśe samāhitaḥ |
sparśād vimuktiparyantaṃ japaṃ kuryādananyadhīḥ ||

anantaraṃ daśāṃśena kramāddhomādikaṃ caret |
tadante mahatīṃ pūjāṃ kuryād brāhmaṇabhojanam ||

tato mantrasya siddhyarthaṃ guruṃ sampūjya toṣayet |
tataḥ prayogān kurvīta mantravit kalpanoditān ||

candrapīṭha mantradevaprakāśikā ratnābalyādau (-)

upavāsatrayaṃ kṛtvā evaṃ vā śaktyapekṣayā |
śrāddhādi cātisaṃkṣepād grahaṇe sparśamātrataḥ ||

samudragāyāṃ sariti kaṇṭhamātre jale sthitaḥ |
japaṃ kuryādudgrahāntaṃ homādyaṃ taddaśāṃśataḥ ||

sampūrṇāṃ dakṣiṇāṃ dattvā mantrasiddhimavāpnuyāt |
tataḥ prayogān kurvīta mantravit kalpanoditān ||

<339> atra sparśapadaṃ sparśajñānaparamanyathā tatsamayasya sūkṣmatvāt 
ananuṣṭhānalakṣaṇamaprāmāṇyaṃ syāt |

cakṣuṣā darśanaṃ rāhoryat tad grahaṇamucyate |
tatra karmāṇi kurvīta gaṇanāmātrato nahi ||

iti smārtavacanāt | tathā (-)

sūryagrahaṇakālādirnānyaḥ kālaḥ praśasyate |
yastu śrāddhānurodhena grahaṇe candrasūryayoḥ ||
na karoti puraścaryāṃ narake sa vipacyate ||

iti vacanān mantriṇāṃ tu grahaṇapuraścaraṇamāvaśyakam |
evaṃ ca (-) sarvasvenāpi kartavyaṃ śrāddhaṃ vai rāhudarśane |
akurvāṇastu nāstikyāt paṅke gauriva sīdati ||

iti śrādhākaraṇe smārttanindārthavādo dīkṣitānyaparaḥ | kecit tu brāhmaṇādi 
dvārā śrāddhamāmananti | apare tu (-)

annābhāve dvijābhāve pravāse putrajanmani |
hemaśrāddhaṃ sagrahe ca śūdraḥ kuryāt sa eva hi ||

iti vacanāt pitruddeśena kiñciddhiraṇyaṃ dattvā puraścaraṇamicchanti |
athavā'nyaprakāreṇa puraścaraṇamiṣyate |
śaratkāle caturthyādi navamyantaṃ viśeṣataḥ ||

bhaktitaḥ pūjayitvā tu rātrau tāvat sahasrakam |
japedekastu vijane kevalaṃ timirālaye ||

aṣṭamyādi navamyanta mupavāsaparo bhavet |
sa bhavet sarvasiddhīśo nātra kāryā vicāraṇā ||

śaratkāle devīpakṣe | tāvat sahasraṃ ṣaṭsahasram | caturthīmārabhya 
navamīparyantaṃ pratirajani ṣaṭsahasraṃ japedaṣṭamīnavamyorupavāsaṃ 
kuryādityarthaḥ | muṇḍamālāyām (-)

athavā'nyaprakāreṇa puraścaraṇamucyate |
śaratkāle mahāpūjā kriyate yā ca vārṣikī ||

tasmin pakṣe viśeṣeṇa puraścaraṇatatparaḥ |
aṣṭamyādinavamyantamupavāsaparo bhavet ||

pūjayed bhaktito rātrau ṣaṭsahasraṃ japaṃ caret |

atra pratipadādi navamyantaṃ japaḥ pratibhāti |

<340> kālītantre (-) athavā'nyaprakāreṇa puraścaraṇamucyate |
aṣṭamīsandhivelāyāmaṣṭottaralatāgṛham ||

praviśya mantrī vidhivat tāḥ samabhyarcya yatnataḥ |
pūrvoktakalpamāsādya pūjādikaṃ samācaret ||

kevalaṃ kāmadevo'sau japedaṣṭottaraṃ śatam |
tāsāṃ tu patramūle ca japtvā saṃgṛhā mastake ||

mahāsiddhirbhavet sadyo latādarśanapūjanāt |

aṣṭamīsandhivelāyām aṣṭamīnavamyoḥ sandhivelāyām | aṣṭottaralatāgṛhaṃ 
yathāsambhavamaṣṭaparyantānāṃ śaktīnāṃ gṛhaṃ madanamandiram | 
pūrvoktakalpaṃ dūtīyāgākhyam | trimūle varāṅge japtvā bījaṃ nirasya tadeva 
bījaṃ mastake saṃgṛhya tilakaṃ kṛtvetyarthaḥ | idaṃ tu vīraparam | evamagre'pi 
boddhavyam | tathā (-)

athavā'nyaprakāreṇa puraścaraṇamucyate |
ākṛṣṭāyāḥ kulāgāre likhitvā mantrameva ca ||

sampūjya tatra saṃskāraṃ kṛtvā tasyai nivedya ca |
kiñcij japtvā manuṃ nītvā devatābhāvatatparaḥ ||

tāṃ visṛjya namaskṛtya svayaṃ suptvā susaṃyataḥ |
prātaḥ strībhyo baliṃ dattvā mantrasiddhirna saṃśayaḥ |
saṃskāraṃ pañcamayāgoktam | atra pūjanamātraṃ na tu 
saṃbhogo'pītyavadheyam |

gurumānīya saṃsthāpya devavat pūjanaṃ vibhoḥ |
vastrālaṅkārahemādyaiḥ santoṣya gurumeva ca ||

tatsutaṃ tatsutāṃ caiva tatpatnīṃ caiva pūjya ca |
pūjayitvā manuṃ japtvā svayaṃ siddhīśvaro bhavet ||

[iti mahāmahopādhyāya ṭhakkura śrīnarasiṃha viracite 
tārābhaktisudhārṇave'ṣṭamastaraṅgaḥ] || 8 ||



[navamastaraṅgaḥ]

atha vīrasādhanam

yoginīhṛdaye

devyuvāca (-)

bhagavan sarvadharma(mantra)jña sarvaśāstraviśārada |
śmaśāne ca puraścaryā tvayā saṃsūcitā purā ||

kathayasva tadedānīṃ yadi sneho'sti māṃ prati |

īśvara uvāca (-)

yasmin pariśrameṇā'pi nṝṇāṃ siddhiḥ samīritā |
na jātā tatra kartavyā sādhakairvīrasādhanā ||

bhayamuktena śucinā sarvasiddhimabhīpsatā |
nānayā durlabhaṃ kiñcit sādhakasya samīhitam ||

girije tat prayatnena mayā ceyaṃ prakāśyate |
aṣṭamyāṃ ca caturdaśyāṃ pakṣayorubhayorapi ||

kṛṣṇapakṣe viśeṣeṇa sādhayedanayā hitam |

vīratantre (-) mahāvīrakramaṃ deva sūcitaṃ na prakāśitam |
kathayasva mahādeva sarvasiddhipradaṃ mahat ||

bhairava uvāca (-)

sarvasiddhipradaṃ sākṣāt sarvadevanamaskṛtam |
sarvapāpaharaṃ devi sarvarogavināśanam ||

brahmaviṣṇuśivādīnāṃ dikpālānāṃ ca bhāvini |
bhairavāṇāṃ ca sarveṣāṃ gandharvāṇāṃ ca yoginām ||

śaśvatsiddhipradaṃ devi sarveṣāmālayaṃ mahat |
nānyat siddhipradaṃ devi vīrasādhanavarjitam ||

mahābalo mahāvīro mahāsāhasikaḥ śuciḥ |
mahāsvacchā dayāvāṃśca sarvabhūtahite rataḥ ||

teṣāṃ kṛte mahādevi kathitaṃ vīrasādhanam |
tathā (-) ghaṭībandhanavastraṃ vai mūlena paridhāya ca |
tadbāhye ca punarvastraṃ mūlenā'ṅgavilepanam ||

kṛtoṣṇīṣaśca mūlena sindūreṇordhvapuṇḍrakam |
<342> iṣṭadevaṃ guruṃ natvā yātrā praharamadhyataḥ ||

kāryā ca sādhakaiḥ sārdhaṃ hṛdi mantraṃ parāmṛśan |
akṣubdho bhuktabhojyastu yadi syād vīrasādhakaḥ ||

divyo vā na paśustatra bhuktvā sādhanamācaret |
aṣṭamyāṃ ca caturdaśyāṃ pakṣayorubhayorapi ||

bhaumavāre tamisrāyāṃ sādhayet siddhimuttamām |
upacāraṃ samādāya kulāmṛtarasaṃ tathā ||

sāmiṣānnaṃ guḍaṃ chāgaṃ surā piṣṭakameva ca |
nānāphalaṃ ca naivedyaṃ svasvakalpoktasādhanam ||

citāsthāne samānīya suhṛdbhiḥ śastrapāṇibhiḥ |
samānaguṇasampannaiḥ sādhako gatabhīḥ svayam ||

na nirīkṣeccaturdikṣu devatādhyānatatparaḥ |
bhītaścet sādhakastatra caturdikṣu ca sādhakaḥ ||

svaguruṃ bhrātṛvargaṃ vā brāhmaṇān vāpi suvratān |
suhṛdānapi rakṣārthaṃ kiyad dūre niveśayet ||

no cet kevalamevā'sau bhairavaḥ parikīrtitaḥ |
akṣālitāṃ citābhūmiṃ gatvā sādhakasattamaḥ ||

prakṣālitāṃ yadi prāyaḥ kārayedasthisaṃcayam |

vīratantre (-) astrāntamūlamantreṇa prokṣaṇaṃ yāgabhūmiṣu ||

gurupādayugaṃ dhyātvā gaṇeśaṃ vaṭukaṃ tathā |
yoginīṃ mātṛkāṃ caiva vāmapādapuraḥsaram ||

ye cātra saṃsthitā devā rākṣasāśca bhayānakāḥ |
piśācāḥ siddhayakṣāśca gandharvāḥ sarasāṃ gaṇāḥ ||

yoginyo mātaro bhūtāḥ sarvāśca khecarastriyaḥ |
siddhidāstā bhavantvatra tathā ca mama rakṣakāḥ ||

praṇamya manunā'nena puṣpāñjalitrayaṃ kṣipet |
śmaśānādhipatiṃ paścād bhairavaṃ kālabhairavam ||

mahākālaṃ yajed yatnāt pūrvādidikcatuṣṭaye |
pādyādibhiśca mantrajño baliṃ paścānnivedayet ||

śabdabījaṃ tataḥ paścāt śmaśānādhipatatparam |
<343> imamante sāmiṣānnaṃ baliṃ gṛhṇapadaṃ tataḥ ||

gṛhṇa gṛhṇāpaya yugaṃ vighnanivāraṇaṃ tataḥ |
kuru siddhiṃ me samuktvā (*) prayaccha svāhayā'nvitam ||

tārādyamanunā devi prathamo balirīritaḥ |
māyānte bhairavāt paścād bhayānakapadaṃ tataḥ ||

pūrve baliṃ samuddhṛtya dakṣiṇe balimāharet |
hūmante ca mahākālāt paścāt pūrvavaduddharet ||

paścime kāladevāya praṇavādyena kalpayet |
śabdānte kālaśabdānte bhairaveti padaṃ tataḥ ||

śmaśānādhipa ityevaṃ pūrvavaccottare haret |
citāmadhye tato dadyād balitrayamanuttamam ||

kālarātri mahākāli kālike ghoraniḥsvane |
gṛhāṇemaṃ baliṃ mātardehi me siddhimuttamām ||

hūṃ kālikāyai svāheti baliṃ dattvā bhūtanāthāya cārpayet |
śabdānte bhūtanāthānte śmaśānādhipa ityapi ||

praṇavādyena mantreṇa dāpayed balimuttamam |
hūṃ sarvagaṇanāthānte adhipatipadaṃ tathā ||

śmaśāne mastake dattvā pūrvavacca samuddharet |
tārādyena baliṃ dattvā pañcagavyena sundari ||

asthisaṃprokṣaṇaṃ kṛtvā pīṭhamantraṃ nyaset punaḥ |
bhūrje vā vaṭapatre vā tatra pīṭhamanuṃ nyaset ||

tantrāntare (-) tataścitā paścimata ekīkṛtyā'sthisañcayam |
oṃ hrīṃ ādhāraśaktaye nama ityaṇunā punaḥ ||

pañcagavyena saṃprokṣya bhūrje vā vaṭapatrake |
hsauriti likhen mantraṃ sthāpayet tatra tat punaḥ ||

kambalādyāsanaṃ tatra vinyasyādhāraśaktaye |
nama ityaṇunā tatra hrīmādyāṃ ca prapūjayet ||

vīratantre (-) pīṭhamāstīrya tasmin vai baddhavīrāsanastataḥ |
(_______________)
(tāntrikaprayogo'yam) |

<344> vīrārdanena deveśi loṣṭān dikṣu viniḥkṣipet ||

kūrcabījadvayaṃ devi māyāyugmaṃ tataḥ param |
kālike ghoradaṃṣṭre ca pracaṇḍe caṇḍanāyike ||

dānavān dārayetyuktvā haneti dvitayaṃ tataḥ |
paravīraṃ mahāvīraṃ chedayadvitayaṃ tataḥ ||

varmā'strānto dviṭhānto'yaṃ virārdanamanurmataḥ |
anena mantritaṃ loṣṭaṃ daśadikṣu viniḥkṣipet ||

tanmadhye bhairavo devo na vighnaiḥ paribhūyate |
yadi pramādād deveśi sādhako bhayavihvalaḥ ||

taistaiḥ sarvaiḥ suhṛdbhiśca rakṣito nā'bhibhūyate |
arkendusitavāṭyālatūlairnirmitavartikām ||

pradīpaṃ tatra saṃsthāpya astraṃ tatra prapūjayet |
ha(ga)te tasmin mahādīpe vighnaiśca paribhūyate ||

tadadhaścāstramantreṇa nikhanet kuladīpikām |
tattatkalpavidhānena bhūtaśuddhyādikaṃ caret ||

po (?) vā tārakāṃ vāpi vinyasya pūjayet tataḥ |

atraiva yāmalādiḥ (-) tataḥ pañcopacāreṇa purato devatāṃ yajet |

nimīlya cakṣuṣī paścād devaṃ dhyātvā manuṃ japet ||

ekākṣarī yadi bhaved diksahasraṃ tato japet |
dvyakṣare cāṣṭasāhasraṃ tryakṣare cāyutārddhakam ||

tataḥ paraṃ tu mantrajño gajāntakasahasrakam |
niśārdhāt tu samārabhya udayāntaṃ samācaret ||

gajāntakasahasrakam aṣṭottarasahasram |

yadyasahyaṃ bhayaṃ karṇanetre vastreṇa bandhayet |
tato'rdharātraparyantaṃ yadi kiñcinna lakṣyate ||

jayadurgāṇunā'rghyaṃ ca tenaiva sarṣapān kṣipet |
oṃ tilo'si somadaivatyo gosavastṛptikārakaḥ ||

pitṛṇāṃ sargadātā tvaṃ martyānāṃ mama rakṣakaḥ |
bhūtapretapiśācānāṃ vighneṣu śāntikārakaḥ ||

iti kṣiptvā tilāṃstatra caturbhāgaiḥ śivāditaḥ |
<345> tataḥ saptapadaṃ gatvā punastatraiva saṃviśet |
evaṃ tatrāpi sampūjya pūjayen manumuttamam ||

nirbhayaḥ prajapet tāvad yāvat siddhiḥ prajāyate |
bhayaṃ tu svapnavaj jñeyaṃ parehni śeṣamācaret || iti ||

vāmakeśvaratantre (-) japānte ca baliṃ dadyād devatāyai yathāvidhi |
mahiṣaṃ chāgalaṃ vāpi gṛhītvā varameva ca ||

gṛhe gacchet suhṛdvargeḥ sārdhaṃ saṃhṛṣṭamānasaḥ ||

iti citāsādhanavidhiḥ |

atha śavasādhanavidhiḥ

bhūtaḍāmare (-) yaduktaṃ bhāvasarvasve sarvatantreṣu gopitam |
vīrasiddhividhānaṃ hi devadevena śambhunā ||

yasya vijñānamātreṇa mandabhāgyo'pi sidhyati |
tathā (-) puraścaraṇasampanno vīrasiddhiṃ samācaret ||

putradārādhanasneha(-)lobhamohavivarjitaḥ |
mantraṃ vā sārdhāyaṣyāmi dehaṃ vā pātayāmyaham |
pratijñāmīdṛśīṃ kṛtvā balidravyāṇi cintayet ||

vīratantre (-) pūrvoktamupahārādi samādāya tu sādhakaḥ |
sādhayet svahitāṃ siddhiṃ sādhanasthānamāśrayet ||

gurudhyānādikaṃ sarvaṃ pūrvoktamāśrayet sudhīḥ |
vīrārdanāntake bhūmau māyā moho na vidyate ||

ye cātretyādimantreṇa bhūmau puṣpāñjalitrayam |
śmaśānādhipatīnāṃ tu pūrvavad balimāharet ||

aghorākhyena mantreṇa balisādhanamācaret |
sudarśanena vā rakṣāmubhābhyāṃ vā prakalpayet ||

māyā sphuradvayaṃ bhūyaḥ prasphuradvitayaṃ punaḥ |
ghoraghorataretyante tanna rūpapadaṃ tataḥ ||

caṭa yugmāntarānte ca pracaṭadvitayaṃ tataḥ |
he yugmaṃ rama yugmaṃ ca tato bandhayugaṃ tataḥ ||

pātaya dvitayaṃ varma phaḍantaḥ samudāhṛtaḥ |
ekapañcāśadarṇo'yamaghorāstramayo manuḥ ||

<346> hālāhalaṃ samuddhṛtya sahasrārasvarūpakam |
varmāstrāntaṃ mahāmantraṃ sudarśanasya kīrtitam ||

bhūtaśuddhiṃ tataḥ kṛtvā nyāsajālaṃ pravinyaset |
jayadurgākhyamantreṇa sarṣapān dikṣu niḥkṣipet ||

oṃ durge durge rakṣiṇi svāhā iti jayadurgākhyo mantraḥ |
tilo'sīti mantreṇa tilānapi viniḥkṣipet |
yaṣṭividdhaṃ śūlaviddhaṃ khaḍgaviddhaṃ payomṛtam ||

rajjuviddhaṃ sarpadaṣṭaṃ cāṇḍālairvābhibhūtakam |
taruṇaṃ sundaraṃ śūraṃ raṇe naṣṭaṃ samujjvalam ||

palāyanaviśūnyaṃ ca sammukhe raṇavittamam |
svecchāmṛtaṃ dvivarṣaṃ ca vṛddhāṃ strīṃ ca dvijaṃ tathā ||

annābhāvamṛtaṃ kuṣṭhaṃ saptarātrordhvagaṃ tathā |
evaṃ cāṣṭavidhaṃ tyaktvā pūrvoktānyatamaṃ śavam ||

gṛhītvā mūlamantreṇa pūjāsthāne samānayet |
cāṇḍālādyabhibhūtaṃ vā śīghraṃ siddhiphalapradam ||

praṇavādyastramantreṇa śavasya prokṣaṇaṃ caret |
praṇavaṃ kūrcabījaṃ ca mṛtakāya namo'stu phaṭ ||

puṣpāñjalitrayaṃ dattvā praṇamet sparśapūrvakam |
re vīra paramānanda śivānanda kuleśvara ||

ānandabhairavākāra devīparyaṅkaśaṅkara |
vīro'haṃ tvāṃ prayacchāmi uttiṣṭha caṇḍikārcane ||

paṇamyānena mantreṇa kṣāla(sthāpa)yet tadanantaram |
tāraśabdaṃ mṛtakāya namo'nto mantra ucyate ||

śavasnāpanamantro'yaṃ sarvatantreṣu deśitaḥ |
dhūpena dhūpitaṃ kṛtvā gandhādinā pralipya ca ||

raktākto yadi deveśa bhakṣayet kulasādhakam |
gatvā śavasya sānnidhyaṃ dhārayet kaṭideśataḥ ||

yadyupadrāvayet tasya dadyānnīṣṭhīvanaṃ mukhe |
punaṃ prakṣālitaṃ kṛtvā japasthānaṃ samānayet ||

kuśaśayyāṃ paristīrya tatra saṃsthāpayecchavam |
<347> elālavaṅgakarpūra jātīkhadirasārdrakaiḥ ||

tāmbūlaṃ tanmukhe dattvā śavaṃ kuryādadhomukham |
sthāpayitvā tasya pṛṣṭhe candanena vilepayet ||

bāhumūlādikaṭyantaṃ caturasraṃ vibhāvayet |
madhye padmaṃ caturdvāraṃ dalāṣṭakasamanvitam ||

tataścaiṇeyamajinaṃ kambalāntaritaṃ nyaset |
dvādaśāṅgulamānena yajñakāṣṭhāni dikṣu ca ||

imaṃ baliṃ gṛhṇa yugaṃ gṛhṇāpaya yugaṃ tataḥ |
vighnanivāraṇaṃ kṛtvā siddhiṃ prayaccha ṭhadvayam ||

anena manunā pūrvaṃ baliṃ dadyācca sāmiṣam |
svasvanāmādikaṃ dattvā pūrvavad balimāharet ||

sarveṣāṃ lokapālānāṃ tataḥ sādhakasattamaḥ |
śavādhiṣṭhānadevebhyo baliṃ dadyāt surayā saha ||

catuḥṣaṣṭiyoginībhyo ḍākinībhyo baliṃ diśet |
pūjādravyaṃ sannidhau ca dūre cottarasādhakam ||

saṃsthāpyāsanamabhyarcya svamantrānte trapāṃ tataḥ |
phaḍityanena mantreṇa tatrāśvārohaṃ viśet ||

kuśān pādatale dattvā śavakeśān pramārjya ca |
dṛḍhaṃ nibadhya juṭikāṃ kṛtasaṅkalpasādhakaḥ ||

śavopari samāruhya prāṇāyāmaṃ vidhāya ca |
vīrārdanena mantreṇa dikṣu loṣṭān samākṣipet ||

tato devaṃ ca sampūjya upacāraiḥ suvistaraiḥ |
śavāsye vidhivad devi devatāpyāyanaṃ caret ||

utthāya sammukhe sthitvā paṭhed bhaktiparāyaṇaḥ |
vaśo me bhava deveśa mamāmukapadaṃ tataḥ ||

siddhiṃ dehi mahābhāga bhūtāśrayapadāmbaraḥ |
mūlaṃ samuccaran mantrī śavapādadvayaṃ tataḥ ||

paṭṭasūtreṇa badhnīyāt tadotthātuṃ na śakyate |
oṃ bhīrubhīma bhayābhāva bhavyalocanabhāvuka ||

trāhi māṃ devadeveśa śavānāmadhipādhipa |
<348> iti pādatale tasya trikoṇaṃ cakramālikhet ||

tadotthātuṃ na śaknoti śavo'pi niścalo bhavet |
upaviśya punastasya bāhū niḥsārya pārśvayoḥ ||

hastayoḥ kuśamāstīrya pādau tatra nidhāpayet |
auṣṭhau tu sampuṭau kṛtvā sthiracittaḥ sthirendriyaḥ ||

sadā devīṃ hṛdi dhyātvā maunī tu japamācaret |
śmaśāne proktasaṃkhyābhirjapaṃ kuryāt kuleśvari ||

athavārambhakālāt tu yāvaccodayate raviḥ |
yadyardharātraparyantaṃ japte kiñcinna lakṣyate ||

tadā pūrvavadarghyādi samayādāgatāni ca |
kṛtvopaviśya tatraiva japaṃ kuryādananyadhīḥ ||

calāsanād bhayaṃ nāsti bhaye jāte vadet tataḥ |
yat prārthayasi deveśi dātavyaṃ kuñjarādikam ||

dināntare pradāsyāmi svanāma kathayasva me |
ityuktvā saṃskṛtenaiva nirbhayastu punarjapet ||

punaścen madhuraṃ vakti vaktavyaṃ madhuraṃ tataḥ |
tadā satyaṃ ca saṃskāryaṃ naraṃ ca prārthayet tataḥ ||

yadi satyaṃ na kuryācca vayaṃ vā na prayacchati |
tadā punarjapeddhīmānekāgraṃ mānasaṃ bhajan ||

nararūpo nātra devo yo naro vopasarpati |
yatnatastena boddhavyaṃ naro vā devayonayaḥ ||

mātā vā tatsutā vāpi mātulānī tathāpi vā |
āgatya vighnaṃ carate māyayācchādya vigraham ||

uttiṣṭha vatsa te kāryaṃ sarvaṃ jātaṃ na saṃśayaḥ |
prabhātasamayo jātastatpitā krośate gṛhe ||

prāyeṇa sakalā lokā rājāno daṇḍadhāriṇaḥ |
kadācit kenāpyādiṣṭastadā kiṃ te kariṣyati ||

ityādi vividhairvākyairna japaṃ saṃparityajet |
mṛtāḥ pitṛgaṇāstatra dūradeśanivāsinaḥ ||

bāndhavāstatra āyānti devarūpadharāstataḥ |
<349> strīputrasevakodīṃśca gṛhītvā nīyate paraiḥ ||

rudanti putrakāḥ sarve bhrātaro'nujaśiṣyakāḥ |
nijakāntāṅgasaṃsparśaṃ vastrādyābharaṇādikam ||

gṛhītvā nīyate patnī pālakaistadbhayaṃ tyajet |
yadi na kṣubhyate tatra tadā kiṃ vā na labhyate ||

strīrūpadhāriṇī devī dvijarūpadharaḥ pumān |
varaṃ gṛhṇeti śabdaṃ vai trivārānte varaṃ labhet ||

sādhunā'sādhunā vāpi yoṣicced varadāyinī |
tadā vīrapatestasya kinna sidhyati bhūtale ||

niṣpāpaḥ puruṣaścaiva kule caiva susaṃskṛtaḥ |
asaṃskṛtavarā devī pāpayuktā na saṃśayaḥ ||

sammukhe'sammukhe vāpi saṃskṛtaṃ vakti cāparam |
saiva devī na sandehaḥ sa devo bhairavaḥ svayam ||

na cedevaṃ bhaveccaiva māyāpuṭitavigrahāt |
varayenna varaṃ tatra na varaṃ pravadet kvacit ||

sa cet saṃskṛtamākhyātaṃ vakti vaktavyamīdṛśam |
na cet svayaṃ kaulikoktyā varaṃ grāhyaṃ nirākulam ||

athavā utkaṭaṃ kiñcillabhetāpyātmano hitam |
śabdo vā jāyate samyagamṛtaṃ vāpi labhyate ||

sarvaṃ vicārya gṛhītavyamevaṃ dik prakīrtitā |
devyākṛtayo bahudhā narādyākṛtayaḥ kvacit ||

avaśyaṃ tatra bhetavyaṃ na tatra pratyayaḥ kvacit |
bhairavā vaṭukāścaiva kulaśāstraparāyaṇāḥ ||

etacchāstraprasaṅgena kṛtyāḥ kuṭilavigrahāḥ |
putro bhūtvā varayet taṃ nārī bhūtvā vimohayet ||

tasmāt tattvaparo vīra ācāre yatnamācaret |
satye kṛte varaṃ labdhvā saṃtyajecca japādikam |
jātaṃ phalamiti jñātvā juṭikāṃ mocayet tataḥ ||

saṃprakṣālya ca saṃsthāpya juṭikāṃ mocayet pade |
padacakraṃ mārjayitvā pūjādravyaṃ jale kṣipet ||

<350> śavaṃ jale'tha garte vā niḥkṣipye snānamācaret |
tatastu svagṛhe gatvā baliṃ dattvā dināntare ||

agrimarātrau tu yeṣāṃ devānāṃ yajamāno'ham |
te gṛhṇantu mayā dattvaṃ balimimaṃ ca sāmiṣam ||

atha yairyācitaścāśva nara kuñjara śūkarān |
dattvā piṣṭamayāneva kartavyaṃ samupoṣaṇam ||

tantrāntare'pi (-) yavakṣodamayaṃ vāpi śālikṣodamayaṃ ca vā |
candrahāsena vidhivat tattanmantreṇa pātayet ||

pare'hni nityamācarya pañcagavyaṃ pibet tataḥ |
brāhmaṇān bhojayet tatra pañcaviṃśatisaṃkhyakān ||

pañca pañca gṛhītān vā kramāccaiva daśāvadhi |
tataḥ snātvā ca bhuktvā ca nivaseduttamasthale ||

yadi na syād viprabhojyaṃ tadā nirdhanatāṃ vrajet |
tena cennirdhanatvaṃ syāt tadā devaḥ prakupyati ||

trirātraṃ vātha ṣaḍrātraṃ gopayet kulasādhanam |
śayyāyāṃ yadi gacched vā tadā vyādhiḥ prajāyate ||

gītaṃ śrutvā ca vadhiro niścakṣurnṛtyadarśanāt |
yadi vakti dine vākyaṃ tadā sa mūkatāṃ vrajet ||

pañcadaśadināntā hi dehe devasya saṃsthitiḥ |
gobrāhmaṇānāṃ devānāṃ nindāṃ kuryānna kutracit ||

devagobrāhmaṇādīṃśca pratyahaṃ tu spṛśecchuciḥ |
prātarnityakriyānte tu vilvapatrodakaṃ pibet ||

tataḥ snāyāt tu tīrthādau prāpte ṣoḍaśavāsare |
svāhāntaṃ mūlamuccārya tarpayāmi namaḥ padam ||

evaṃ padatrayādūrdhvaṃ devānāṃ tarpaṇaṃ jalaiḥ |
munitarpaṇaśūnyasya na syād devasya tarpaṇam ||

tarpaṇamiti tṛptirityarthaḥ |

ityanena vidhānena siddhiṃ prāpnoti niścitam |
iha bhuktvā varān divyānante yāti hareḥ padam ||

<351> kṛtvā sādhanamevaitacchakteḥ priyatamo bhavet ||

śavābhāve śmaśāne vā kartavyā vīrasādhanā |
ye bhāvā yasya vai proktāstairbhāvairyadi nārcayet ||

īdṛśakramayogena bhraṣṭo bhavati sādhakaḥ |
nopadiśet tatra bhāvaṃ na pūjāṃ tatra saṃdiśet ||

śmaśānāntaṃ gṛhītvā tu tāvacchuddhiḥ prajāyate |

[iti mahāmahopādhyāya ṭhakkura śrīnarasiṃha viracite tārābhktisudhārṇave 
vīrasādhanavidhirnavamastaraṅgaḥ] || 9 ||



[daśamastaraṅgaḥ]

athakāmyam

ṣaṭkarmalakṣaṇam

kālītantre (-) ādau puraskriyāṃ kuryānniyamena yathāvidhi |
tataḥ siddhamanurmantrī prayogārho na cānyathā ||

phetkāriṇītantre (-) śāntikādīni karmāṇi yadvāratithiyogataḥ |
prārabdhavyāni vidhinā tacca samprocyate'dhunā ||

śāntivaśyastambhanāni dveṣaṇoccāṭane tataḥ |
māraṇāntāni śaṃsanti ṣaṭkarmāṇi manīṣiṇaḥ ||

pañcamī ca dvitīyā ca tṛtīyā saptamī tathā |
budhejyavārasaṃyuktā śāntikarmaṇi pūjitā ||

gurucandrayutā ṣaṣṭhī caturthī ca trayodaśī |
saptamī pauṣṭike śastā cāṣṭamī navamī tathā ||

daśamyekādaśī caiva bhānuśukradinānvitā |
ākarṣaṇe tvamāvāsyā navamī pratipat tathā ||

paurṇamāsī mandabhānuyuktā vidveṣakarmaṇi |
kārṣṇī caturdaśī tadvadaṣṭamī mandavārakā |
uccāṭane tithiḥ śastā pradoṣeṣu viśeṣataḥ ||

caturdaśyaṣṭamī kṛṣṇā amāvāsyā tathaiva ca |
mandabhaumadinopetā śastā māraṇakarmaṇi ||

budhacandradinopetā pañcamī daśamī tathā |
paurṇamāsī tu vijñeyā tithiḥ stambhanakarmaṇi ||

śubhaṃ śubhodaye kuryādaśubhānyaśubhodaye |
raudrakarmāṇi riktārke mṛtyuyoge ca māraṇam ||

ijyo guruḥ | mandaḥ śaniḥ | kārṣṇī kṛṣṇapakṣasambandhinī | āraḥ kūjaḥ |
piṅgalāmate (-) śṛṇu devi pravakṣyāmi vāratithyarkṣadevatāḥ |
ravau sūrya śivau devi candre somāntakau tataḥ ||

<353> bhaume ca maṅgala guhau budha viṣṇū tataḥ pare |
pare guru caturvaktrau bhṛgau śukra purandarau |
mande śanaiśvaraḥ kālo vāreśā devi kīrtitāḥ ||

tithyadhipakathanam

brahmā vidhātā viṣṇiśca yamaḥ śītakaro guhaḥ |
indraśca vasavo nāgā dharmaḥ śiva divākarau ||

manmathaśca kaliścaiva viśvedevāstithīśvarāḥ |
darśe tu pitaro devi pūjyāḥ sarvopacārakaiḥ ||

nakṣatrādhipakathanam

aśvinau ca yamau vahnirbrahmenduśca śivo'ditiḥ |
guru kadrūja pitaro bhagāryama dineśvarāḥ ||

tvaṣṭā vāyurathendrāgnī mitra indrastava priye |
nirṛtiścaiva toyaṃ ca viśvedevāḥ prajāpatiḥ ||

viṣṇuśca vasavo devi varuṇaścājapādakaḥ |
ahirbraghnaśca pūṣā ca proktā nakṣatradevatāḥ ||

etāḥ sarvopacāraistu taddineṣu samarcayet |
praṇavādyaiścaturthyantayutairnāmabhirīśvari ||

brahmayāmale (-) māraṇe varjayed viprānanyāṃścāpi sudhārmikān |
strījanavyatirekeṣu rājavairiṣu yojayet ||

svaroṣato vā lokānāṃ rakṣārthaṃ vā tadācaret |
na tu lobhād bhayād vāpi kuryān mantrī tu māraṇam ||

prāyaścittaṃ ca karttavyaṃ devi taddoṣaśāntaye |
ayutaṃ prajapen mantrī juhuyāt tāvadīśvari ||

sadhṛtaiḥ pāyasairdevi tilairvā vīravandite |
ātmarakṣā ca kartavyā karmakāle sadā budhaiḥ ||

pañcamīśvarītantre (-) krūrakarmasu deveśi karma kṛtvā yathāvidhi |
tailābhyaktaḥ punaḥ snātaḥ sāṅgāṃ sāvaraṇāṃ budhaḥ ||

abhyarcya devatāmiṣṭvāmātmarakṣārthamadrije |
japen mantraṃ prasannātmā sahasraṃ sāṣṭakaṃ priye ||

<354> māṃ rakṣa rakṣa cetyuktvā praṇamya visṛjecchive |
anyaiḥ suhṛdbhiḥ susnigdhairātmarakṣāṃ tu kārayet ||

mṛtyuñjayādibhirdevi prayogastena cāṇunā |
japahomārcanādyai'sca brāhmaṇārādhanādibhiḥ ||

cakrapūjāvaśyakatā |

kulārṇave (-) prayogānte tathā cakrapūjāṃ mantrī samācaret |
ekalakṣaṃ japen mantrī dhyānanyāsasamanvitaḥ ||

prayogadoṣaśāntyarthamātmarakṣārthameva ca |
na cenna phalamāpnoti devatāśāpamāpunyāt ||

idaṃ ca krūrataraviṣayam | tathā (-)

kāmyaprayogakartṝṇāṃ paraloko na vidyate |
prayogasiddhirevaiṣāṃ phalamanyanna vidyate ||

ekasya hi vidhānasya na kutrāpi phaladvayam |
deveśi dṛśyate yasmānniṣkāmo devatāṃ bhajet ||

tantrāntare (-) gāyatrīmayutaṃ japtvā siddhau vighnavināśinīm |
kṛtvā cābhyudayaśrāddhaṃ haviṣyāśī cared vidhim ||

māraṇādiprayogeṣu jñātvā śatrorgrahādikam |
prayogaṃ prārabhet prājñaścānyathā'niṣṭamāpatet ||

śatroryadi śubhaḥ kālastadā naiva samācaret |
yadā tasyāṣṭame bhaumo rāhuḥ ketuśca candramāḥ ||

tvaṣṭā nabhaśca vā kendre lagneśo'staṃ samāgataḥ |
aṣṭamastho'thavā ṣaṣṭhaḥ krūramadhyamito'thavā ||

dvādaśeśastathā krūramadhye tvāpo klimasthitaḥ |
dagdhaścāstaṃ samāyātastadā māraṇamārabhet ||

anye tu yadi vā yogā syuraniṣṭasya sūcakāḥ |
jyotiḥśāstrāt tadā jñātvā prārabhen māraṇādikam ||

āyurdāyaṃ tathā jñātvā daśāpākaṃ viśāladhiḥ |
satyāyuṣi kṛtaḥ puṃbhiḥ prayogo niṣphalo bhavet ||

bhaumasya ca śanervāpi rāhorvā ced daśā bhavet |
tadā tu māraṇaṃ karma kuryān māntrīkasattamaḥ ||

<355> śatroraśubhanakṣatre candre vāre tithau tathā |
lagne tattatprayogādi kāle svasya śubhe tathā ||

prārabhet krūrakarmāṇi vidhimāsthāya māntrikaḥ |
navameśastṛtīyeśo lagneśaśca yadā ripoḥ ||

ekatra syāt tathā candro dṛṣṭirvātha parasparam |
tadaivoccāṭanaṃ kuryādanyathāniṣṭamāpatet ||

yadi sādhyagraho duṣṭo māsaḥ saṃvatsarastathā |
tadā tasya śubhaṃ karma na kuryāditi niścitam ||

ārambhe mahatī pūjā kṛtvā devasya yatnataḥ |
guruṃ sampūjya yatnena brāhmaṇānapi bhojayet ||

kulārṇave (-) tithivārarkṣakaraṇayogamāsartupakṣakam |
dīpeśakūrmacakrāṇi jñātvā karmāṇi sādhayet ||

kūrmacakraṃ ca prāguktam | tathā (-)

pañcaśuddhyāsanaprāṇāyāmanyāsākṣamālikāḥ |
doṣasaṃskārarāśyādīn jñātvā karmāṇi sādhayet ||

doṣāśchinnādayaḥ | saṃskārā jananādayaḥ |

rāśicakram

yathā (-) bālaṃ gauraṃ khuraṃ śoṇaṃ śamī śobheti rāśiṣu |
krameṇa bheditā varṇāḥ kanyāyāṃ śādayaḥ smṛtāḥ ||

lagno dhanaṃ bhrātṛ bandhu putra śatru kalatrakāḥ |
maraṇaṃ dharmakarmāyavyayā dvādaśa rāśayaḥ || 

tathā ca svadvitīyarāśīyamantreṇa dhanārthaṃ pañcamarāśīyena putrārthaṃ 
saptamarāśīyena bhāryārthaṃ prayogaḥ kāryaḥ | evamanyadapyūhyam | atra 
rāśīnakṣatrayoścakre mantravannāmādyakṣaraṃ yatra patati tadeva 
sādhakasyāpi rāśinakṣatram | na tu janmarāśinakṣatram |
tathā satyetaccakrapraṇayanavaiyarthyam | mantramātrārthatāyāṃ 
vinigamakābhāvāt | rāśicakramadhikṛtya (-) 

tena mantrādyavarṇena nāmnaścādyakṣareṇa ca |
gaṇayed yat tu ṣaṣṭhaṃ vāpyaṣṭamaṃ dvādaśaṃ tu vā ||

<356> ripormantrādyavarṇaṃ syāt tanna tasya hitaṃ bhavet |

iti tantrarājavacanācca | vastutastu (-)

prakaṭaṃ yasya janmarkṣaṃ tasya janmarkṣato bhavet |
praṇaṣṭajanmabhaṃ yasya nāmarkṣato vadet ||

iti piṅgalāmatavacanād vyavasthā | tathā (-)

koṣṭhabāndhavatārākhya rāśivarṇānukūlatā |
bhūtamaitrīṃ tathā yantraṃ jñātvā mantrāṇi sādhayet ||

koṣṭhamakathahādicakram | yathā tantrarāje (-)

prākpratyagdakṣiṇodak ca sūtrapañcakayogataḥ |
koṣṭhāni ṣoḍaśātra syusteṣu varṇān kramāllikhet ||

catuścaturvibhāgena kalpayet tāni vai kramāt |
prathamaprathame cādyaṃ dvitīyaprathame tathā ||

dvitīyamanyataścānyat tathānyadapi kalpayet |
tattatkoṣṭheṣu vilikhet tattatpañcamamakṣaram ||

evaṃ caturṣu koṣṭheṣu kṣāntāvadhi samālikhet |
svanāmādyakṣaraṃ yatra koṣṭhe saṃdṛśyate yathā ||

siddhādigaṇanam

siddhādīn gaṇayed yāvad mantrādyakṣaradarśanam |
siddhasiddho japāt sidhyet dviguṇāt siddhasādhyakaḥ ||

siddhasusiddhaḥ samprāptaḥ siddhārirhanti gotrajam |
sādhyasiddho'tisaṃkleśāt sādhyasādhyo'tiduḥkhakṛt ||

sādhye susiddho bhajanāt sādhyāriḥ svāṃ śriyaṃ haret |
susiddhasiddho'dhyayanāt phalaṃ dadyād yathepsitam ||

susiddhasiddho japādyaiḥ siddhaye syādito'nyathā |
susiddhe tu susiddhastu pūrvajanmakṛtaśramaḥ ||

tasmāt taṃ sarvasidhīnāṃ sādhane yojayen manum |
susiddhāriraśeṣeṇa svakulaṃ nāśayed dhruvam ||

arisiddhaḥ sutaṃ hanyāt arisādhyaḥ svayoṣitam |
arisusiddhamantrastu kulotsādanakṛd bhavet ||

aryariḥ svātmahā mantraḥ saṃprāptyaiva suniścitam |
<357> piṅgalāmate tu (-) yathoktāt siddhasiddhastu tatsādhyo dviguṇāj japāt |
japārddhāt tatsusiddhastu tadarirbāndhavāpahaḥ |
vighnājjapāt sādhyasiddhastatsādhyastu nirarthakaḥ ||

tatsusiddhaḥ sārdhajapāt tadarirgotrajāpahaḥ |
susiddhasiddho'rddhajapāt tatsādhyo dviguṇāj japāt ||

tatsusiddho grahādeva tadarirjñātijātihā |
arisiddhaḥ sutaṃ hanyādarisādhyastu kanyakām ||

tatsusiddhastu patnīghnastadariḥ sādhakāpahaḥ || iti |

piṅgalāmate (-) prasiddhaṃ yad bhavennāma kiṃ vāsya janmanāma ca |
yatīnāṃ puṣpapātena guruṇā yat kṛtaṃ bhavet ||

nāmnastasyaiva varṇāni vibhaktāni ca kārayet |

anyatrāpi (-) loke prasiddhanāmātha mātrā pitrā tathā kṛtam |
anyatrāpi (-) supto jāgartti yenāsau dūrasthaśca prabhāṣate |
vadatyanyamanasko'pi tannāma grāhyamatra tu |
anyatrāpi (-) mātrā pitrā kṛtaṃ nāma śodhanīyaṃ prayatnataḥ ||

yacca (-) janmarkṣākṣarato vīkṣyaṃ tatra mantrādimākṣaram ||

ityuktam | tajjanmanāmnaiva yatra prasiddhistatparam | tatraiva pratyakṣaraṃ 
siddhādi gaṇanoktā |

mātāpitṛkṛtaṃ nāma yaccāpyabhijanaiḥ kṛtam |
viśliṣya tasya vai varṇān svaravarṇavibhedataḥ ||

tathaiva mantravarṇāstu tataḥ śodhanamārabhet |
bindudvibindukopadhmānīyajihvāṅghrisambhavān ||

saṃhatoccāraṇaprāptamadhikākṣarameva ca |
apabhraṃśākṣaraṃ lakṣau tyaktvā ṣaṇḍhacatuṣṭayam ||

mantrākṣaraiḥ sahaikaikaṃ nāmavarṇān viśodhayet |
vyañjanairvyañjanānyeva svaraiḥ sārdhaṃ svarāṃstathā ||

ādyamādyena saṃśodhya dvitīyena dvitīyakam |
mantre vā'pyathavā nāmni varṇāḥ syurviṣamā yadā ||

tadā mantraṃ samārabhya samaṃ yāvat prayojayet |
ādyantayoḥ siddhavarṇau mantre yasmin varānane ||

<358> acireṇaiva kālena sa bhavet sarvasiddhidaḥ |
sādhyāntādiyuto yastu so'tikṛcchreṇa sidhyati ||

ādāvante susiddhastu sarvakāmavibhūtidaḥ |
ādāvante ripuryasya bhavet tyājyaḥ sa mantrakaḥ ||

ādau siddho'ntyasādhyo yo dviguṇena sa sidhyati |
ādau siddhaḥ susiddhāntyo yathoktāt sidhyate japāt ||

ādau siddho'ntyaśatrurya sa tyājyo mantrisattamaiḥ |
sādhyādiścaiva siddhāntyastriguṇāt sidhyate japāt ||

ādau sādhyaḥ susiddhāntyaḥ proktamārgeṇa sidhyati |
ādau sādhyo'ntyaśatruryastaṃ yatnāt parivarjayet ||

susiddhādistu siddhāntyo yathoktādeva sidhyati |
susiddhādistu sādhyāntyaścaturguṇamapekṣate || 

susiddhādiścāntaśatrurmadhyamaḥ parikīrtitaḥ |
ādyāriścāntasiddhādiḥ so'pi tyājyo'tra karmaṇi ||

ādau madhye tathā cānte siddhaḥ śubhaphalapradaḥ |
sarvasādhya udāsīnaḥ proktastantre svayambhuvā ||

sthānatritayasusiddhaḥ sarvānarthāṃśca sādhayet |
sthānatritayagatārirmantro mṛtyurna sandehaḥ |
siddhādiḥ sādhyayugmānto vyartha ityucyate budhaiḥ ||

siddhādirdvisusiddhāntaḥ sarvakāryārthasādhakaḥ |
siddhādirariyugmānto nāśakaḥ saṃprakīrtitaḥ ||

śatrurbhavati yadādau madhye siddhastadantake sādhyaḥ |
kaṣṭena kāryasiddhistasya phalaṃ svalpameva bhavati ||

ante yadi bhavati ripuḥ prathame madhye ca bhavati sādhyayugam |
kāryaṃ vilambitaṃ syāt praṇaśyati kṣipramevānte ||

ādyantayoryadā sādhye madhye siddhaḥ prajāyate |
ādyantayoryadā siddho madhye sādhyaḥ prajāyate ||

tāvubhau sādhyasiddhau hi japādhikyena sidhyataḥ |
arisaṃpuṭitaḥ siddhaḥ susiddho'pi tathā bhavet ||

sarvanāśakaro jñeyaḥ sādhakasya na saṃśayaḥ |
<359> siddhenā'ntaritaḥ sādhyaḥ susiddhāntarito bhavet ||

śīghraṃ sidhyati mantro'yamīśānaḥ svayamavravīt |
siddhenā'ntaritaḥ śatruḥ susiddhenāpi ced bhavet ||

nāsau ripurbhavet mantraḥ kintu kaṣṭena sidhyati |
sādhyāntaritasiddhastu susiddho'pi tathā yadi ||

īdṛśaṃ lakṣaṇaṃ dṛṣṭvā dūrataḥ parivarjayet |
ripuṇā dūṣito mantro naiva deyaḥ kadācana || iti

nārāyaṇīye'pi (-) duṣṭārṇapracuro mantro yaḥ syāt sa ca vininditaḥ |
evañcānukūlena sveṣṭaṃ parānanukūlena mantreṇa parāniṣṭaṃ 
sādhayedityarthaḥ |

piṅgalāyām (-) eṣu doṣeṣu sarvatra māyāṃ kāmamathāpi vā |
kṣiptvādau ca śriyaṃ dadyād doṣāṇāṃ ca vimuktaye ||

tārācakram

tārākhyeti | tārācakraṃ yathā (-)

prāpalobhātpaṭuprājyaṃ rudrasyādri ruruḥ karam |
lokalopapaṭuḥ prāpaḥ khalau dyaubheṣu bheditāḥ ||

varṇāḥ kramāt svarāntyau tu revatyaṃśagatau sadā |
janma sampad vipat kṣemaḥ pratyariḥ sādhako vadhaḥ ||

mitraṃ paramamitraṃ ca janmādīni punaḥ punaḥ |

atrāpi pūrvavadeva jñeyam | vārāhītantre (-)

koṣṭhaśuddhirvarāhe ca mahālakṣmyā kulākulam |
nāmādicakraṃ sarveṣāṃ bhūtacakraṃ tathaiva ca ||

tārāśuddhirvaiṣṇavānāṃ koṣṭhaśuddhiḥ śive bhavet |
traipure rāśiśuddhiḥ syād gopāle'kaḍamaḥ smṛtaḥ ||

akaḍamacakram

yathā (-) niḥṣaṇḍhakānakārādīn meṣādikramato likhet |
siddhādīn kalpayet tatra svanāmādyakṣarāditaḥ ||

bhūtamaitrīmiti kulākulacakramityarthaḥ |

kulākulacakram

kulākulaparīkṣāyāṃ prakāraḥ kathyate'dhunā |
<360> vāyvagnibhūjalākāśāḥ pañcāśallipayaḥ kramāt ||

pañca hrasvāḥ pañca dīrghā bindvantāḥ sandhisambhavāḥ |
pañcaśaḥ kādayaḥ pakṣa lasahāntāḥ samīritāḥ ||

sādhakasyākṣaraṃ pūrva mantrasyāpi tathā'kṣaram |
yadyekabhūtadevatyaṃ jānīyāt svakulaṃ hi tat ||

pārthivaṃ vāruṇaṃ maitramāgneyasyāpi mārutam |
pārthivānāmakṣarāṇāṃ śatrutve mārutaṃ matam || 

āgneyasyāmbhasaṃ śatrurambhasastaijasaṃ tathā |
eṣāmapi ca sarveṣāmavirodhi tu nābhasam ||

parasparaviruddhānāṃ na kuryān melanaṃ budhaḥ |

khadyadacakram

yantra khadyadacakram | yathā kulamūlāvatāre (-)

khadyadaṃ cakramālikhya prāgādiṣu daleṣu tu |
arkādivarṇānekaikaṃ likhen niḥṣaṇḍhakūṭakān ||

svanāmādyakṣaraṃ yatra tadārabhya vicārayet |
udite sampaduddiṣṭā dvitīye sampadāṃ kṣayaḥ ||

tṛtīye tu dhanaṃ vidyāccaturthe bandhuvigrahaḥ |
pañcame saṃśayātmā syāt ṣaṣṭhaḥ sarvavināśakaḥ ||

idamupalakṣaṇaṃ gaṇa yoni phaṇi 
vargacakrarṇadhanacakrānukūlamapyavalokanīyam |

gaṇacakram

gaṇacakraṃ yathā (-) hastāsvātīśrutimṛgapuṣyamaitrāśvirevatī |
punarvasurgururiti bhāni daivāni māntrikāḥ ||

pūrvottaratrayaṃ cārdrā bharaṇī rohiṇī tathā |
marttyapriyagaṇaḥ prokto bhānyetāni viśāradaiḥ ||

citrāśleṣe mūlamaghe dhaniṣṭhājyaiṣṭhike tathā |
varuṇaḥ kṛttikendrāgnī rakṣogaṇa udāhṛtaḥ ||

ekayoruttamā prītirdvaivapuṃsostu madhyamā |
daivairmattyairapi mahadrakṣaso vairamucyate ||

evaṃ buddhā budho mantraṃ vidhinātmani yojayet |

<361> atha yonicakram

aśvebhājaphaṇidvayaṃ śvavṛṣabhuṅmeṣautavo mūṣika(-)
ścākhurgauḥ kramaśastato'pi mahiṣī vyāghrī punaḥ sairibhī |
vyāghreṇau mṛga maṇḍalau kapiratho vabhrudvayaṃ vānaraḥ
siṃhāśvau mṛgarāṭ paśuśca karaṭī yonistu bhānāmivam ||

vṛṣabhuk viḍālaḥ | sairibhī mahiṣī | maṇḍalaḥ śvā | vabhrurnakulaḥ | karaṭī 
hastī
virodhastu (-) govyāghraṃ gajasiṃhamaśvamahiṣaṃ śainaṃ ca vabhrūragaṃ
vairaṃ vānarameṣakaṃ ca sumahat mārjāramūṣaṃ tathā |
lokānāṃ vyavahārato'nyadapi ca jñātvā prayatnādidaṃ
dampatyornṛpabhṛtyayorapi sadā varjya śubhasyārthibhiḥ || iti

atha phaṇicakram

krameṇa ca vilekhyāni saptaviṃśatibhāni ca |
aṅkāni dāpayet tatra ūrdhvādhaśca tribhistribhiḥ ||

sarpākāraṃ bhaveccakraṃ nāḍīcakraṃ pracakṣate |

yāmale'pi (-) aśvinyādyaṃ likheccakraṃ sarpākāraṃ trināḍīkam |
trināḍīvedhanakṣatramaśvinyārdrā yugottarā ||

hastendramūlavāruṇyaḥ pūrvabhādrapadā tathā |
yāmyaḥ saumyo gururyoniścitrāmitraphaṇidvayam ||

dhaniṣṭhā cottarā dhanyā madhyanāḍī vyavasthitā |
kṛttikā rohiṇī sarpo maghā svātīviśākhake ||

uttarā śravaṇe pauṣṇaṃ pṛṣṭhanāḍī vyavasthitā |

yoniḥ pūrvaphalgunī | paṇidvayaṃ pūrvāṣāḍhā | phalaṃ ca (-)

ekanāḍīsthitā yasya gurumantrasvadevatāḥ |
tatra dveṣamṛṇaṃ mṛtyuṃ krameṇa phalamādiśet ||

athāṣṭavargacakram

vargaśuddhiṃ samāsādya mantraṃ dadyād gurūttamaḥ |
avargaḥ pakṣiṇo jñeyo mārjāraśca kavargakaḥ ||

cavargaśca tathā siṃhaṣṭavargaścaiva kukkuraḥ |
tavargo nāga ityukto mūṣikaśca pavargakaḥ ||

yavargaśca gajo jñeyaḥ śavargo'pyaja meṣakau |
<362> garuḍa bhujagayorvairaṃ tathā ca gaja siṃhayoḥ ||

mārjāra mūṣayorvairaṃ tathā kukkura meṣayoḥ |
bhujaṅga siṃhayormaitrī meṣa mūṣakayostathā ||

lokādanyacca vijñeyaṃ vyavahāraprayogataḥ |

ṛṇaghanacakram

tathāmantrakaumudyāṃ (-) dhanādikaṃ viditvā tu manau siddhādike'pi ca |
pravartitavyaṃ dhīmadbhirvaiphalyaṃ yadato'nyathā ||

dakṣottarāyataṃ kuryāt navasūtrakamūttamam |
prākpratyagāyatāścaiva bhānurekhāḥ prakalpayet ||

dvau dvau svarau likhed vidvān pañcakoṣṭhe tathā parān |
ṣaṭsvekamekamālikhya kādihāntaṃ tato'kṣaram |
ekaikamekādaśasu trikeṣu matimān likhet ||

digbhūgiriśrutigajāgnimunīṣvabdhiṣaṭtrikaiḥ |
guṇayet sādhakasyārṇān svaravyañjanabheditān ||

indra nakṣatra nayana ravi pañcadaśartubhiḥ |
śrutyagnyāyudhanāgendra navabhiśca tathā manoḥ ||

nāmārṇakoṣṭhāṅkamatho ādyantanihitaṃ kramāt |
anyakoṣṭhaguṇenaiva pañcamaṃ pañcabhiryathā ||

evaṃ paryavasannāste guṇakāṅkāḥ samāsataḥ |
rurumīnanarodyānabhāvakāḥ sādhakākṣare ||

mantravarṇeṣu tattat tu nagabhūbhānunimnagāḥ |
nāmājjalādakaṭhavādaṣṭabhaktādhikaṃ budhaiḥ ||

jñātvobhayorṛṇaṃ vidyādadhikaṃ śeṣamaṅkavit |
uktaṃ ca vasubhirbhāgamāharedubhayorapi ||

bāhulyaṃ yatra dṛśyeta so'dhamarṇaḥ prakīrtitaḥ |
dhāryate yasya yairmantrairgṛhṇīyāt tān manūn sa vai |
tadabhāve samadhanaṃ dhanikaṃ na kadācana ||

vārāhītantre (-) mantro yadyadhikāṅkaḥ syāt tadā mantraṃ japet sudhīḥ |
same'pi ca japen mantrī na japet tadṛṇādhike ||
śūnye mṛtyuṃ vijānīyāt tasmācchūnyaṃ parityajet |

<363> kādimate ṛṇaśodhanaprakāraḥ

yathā nāmādyakṣaramārabhya yāvan mantrādivarṇakam |
tridhā kṛtvā svarairbhinnaṃ tadanyad viparītakam || iti |

svaraiḥ saptabhiḥ | viparītakamiti | saptabhirguṇanaṃ tribhirvibhajanamiti 
rāghavabhaṭṭāḥ | taccintyam | sādhakāṅkasya tribhirvibhāge 
aṅkatrayādhikāṅkasyāprāpteḥ |
tasmān kavarṇagaṇanāyāmeva vaiparītyaṃ tadarthaḥ | tantrāntare (-)

sādhyamantradviguṇitaṃ sādhakena samanvitam |
aṣṭābhiśca hareccheṣaṃ tadanyad viparītakam | iti ||

asyārthaḥ (-) mantrākṣarāṇi svaravyañjanarūpeṇa pṛthakpṛthakkṛtāni 
dviguṇitāni dvirguṇayet | sādhakanāmākṣarāṇyapi svaravyañjanarūpeṇa 
pṛthakkṛtāni dviguṇitāni svaravyañjanarūpeṇa pṛthakpṛthaṅmantrākṣaraiḥ 
saṃyojitāni aṣṭabhirharet | evaṃ sādhakarāśiḥ evaṃ yasyottamarṇo yo 
mantrastena tadaniṣṭaṃ yasya cādhamarṇo yastena tadiṣṭaṃ sādhayedityarthaḥ |

cakrabhede (-) haracakraṃ ṣaḍdalaṃ ca siddhādicakrameva ca |
rāśinakṣatracakre ca svakulākulameva ca ||

akaḍavaṃ cākaṭhavaṃ vargacakraṃ tathaiva ca |
uktāni navacakrāṇi mantrasiddhikarāṇi ca ||

navacakraviśuddhātmā mantro'bhīṣṭāya kalpate |
gaṇacakravicāro'pi keṣāñcit sammataḥ priye ||

atha haracakram

athātaḥ sampravakṣyāmi haracakraṃ mahodayam |
yaj jñātvā jñānavān loke jāyate mantravittamaḥ ||

anyathā varjayen mantramityāha bhagavān śivaḥ |
tasmāt sarvaprayatnena yaḥ sudhīḥ sa vicārayet ||

kuryāt kṣetraṃ tu devānāṃ tārākoṣṭhaṃ susannibham |
tanmadhye vibhajet koṣṭhacatuṣkaṃ karṇasūtrakaiḥ ||

tārākoṣṭhaṃ rāśikoṣṭham | tena dikṣu catuḥkoṣṭhāni vidikṣu catuḥkoṣṭhāni 
madhye koṣṭhamekam | koṣṭhacatuṣkamiti | madhye sūtrasya pātanaṃ nāstīti 
catuṣṭayatvamanyathā karṇasūtrasya dvitīyatvameva kiṃ tu sūtracatuṣṭaye datte 
rāśikātmakaṃ koṣṭhaṃ bhavatītyarthaḥ |

pātayed dikṣu durgāṃ ca bāṇīṃ tārāṃ ca bharavīm |
karṇasūtrasyobhayata īśānādiṣu yojayet ||

<364> tripurāṃ bhuvaneśā ca pīṭheśīṃ caiva tryambakam |
vāsudevaṃ śriyaṃ caiva chinnamastāṃ ca caṇḍikām ||

īśānādyaṃ vivasvantaṃ kramācca tvaritāṃ tathā |
indrākṣīṃ caiva herambaṃ pitāmahamanantaram ||

mahāmāyāṃ ca kālīṃ ca yadanyat saumyadaivatam |

īśānādyamiti | īśānakoṇamādyaṃ kṛtvetyarthaḥ | pañcāśad vilikhed 
varṇānīśakoṣṭhādikaṃ kramāditi vacanāt | atra kramapadena 
diggatakoṣṭhānāmapi grahaṇam |

mātāpitṛkṛtaṃ nāma vedamantrapariṣkṛtam |
sarvakarmaṇi yad yogyaṃ śastaṃ tan mantravīkṣaṇe ||

iti tu haracakraparam |

nāmārṇaṃ tu samārabhya yāvad devārṇagocaram |
saṃśuddhau grahaṇaṃ kuryādaśuddhau na kadācana ||

dhanaṃ putraṃ ca lābhaṃ ca nidhanaṃ caiva vihvalam |
muktiṃ saukhyaṃ ca dharmaṃ ca apisvinna ca kāmadam |
bhīṣaṇaṃ cintayet koṣṭhe haracakramitīritam ||

atra pradakṣiṇakramaḥ | iti haracakram | vijayamālinītantre (-)

alpadoṣā bahuguṇā mantrā deyā vicakṣaṇaiḥ | iti |

tārādimantreṣvapi siddhādivicārāpekṣā

nanu (-) nātra siddhādyapekṣāsti na vā mitrādidūṣaṇamiti 
tārādakṣiṇādimantramadhikṛtya nīlatantrādivacanāt kathaṃ 
kāmyaprayogeṣvapi tadvicārāpekṣā | evaṃ (-)

nṛsiṃhārkavarāhaṇāṃ prāsādapraṇavasya ca |
sapiṇḍākṣaramantrāṇāṃ siddhādīn na vicārayet ||

ityādi tantrāntarasaṃgṛhītamantraprayogeṣvapi kathametad vicāra iti cet (-)

nityānāṃ traipurāṇāṃ ca nāvekṣāstvaṃśakādayaḥ |
tathāpyatrocyate kiñcidabhicārādisiddhaye ||

iti tantrarājavacanād gṛhāṇa | evaṃ ca prayogārthināṃ tārādimantragrahaṇe'pi 
koṣṭhādiśodhanamāyāti | tacchodhananiṣeddhasya ca mokṣārthimātraparateti 
pratibhāti |

tantre (-) sūryodayaṃ samārabhya ghaṭikādaśakaḥ kramāt |
ṛtavaḥ syurvasantādyā ahorātraṃ dine dine ||

vasanta grīṣma varṣākhya śaraddhemanta śaiśirāḥ |
<365> hemantaḥ śāntike prokto vasanto vaśyakarmaṇi ||

śiśiraḥ stambhane jñeyo vidveṣe grīṣma īritaḥ |
prāvṛḍuccāṭane jñeyā śaran māraṇakarmaṇi ||

phetkāriṇītantre (-) saṃlikhet stambhanaṃ kumbhe haryakṣe vṛścikodaye |
dveṣoccāṭādikaṃ nakrakulīrājatulodaye ||

yamakanyādhanurmīne vaśya śāntika pauṣṭikam |
māraṇaṃ cāṣṭame rāśau ripośchedādinigraham ||

haryakṣaḥ siṃha | nakro makaraḥ | kulīraḥ karkaṭaḥ | ajo meṣaḥ | yamo mithunaḥ |

tathā (-) vaśyaṃ pūrve'hni madhyāhne vidveṣoccāṭanaṃ likhet |
śānti puṣṭī tvahanyante sandhyākāle tu māraṇam ||

ardharātre likhet stambhamākṛṣṭiṃ prāg dinodayāt |
yadanyacchobhanaṃ kāryaṃ tatpratyūṣe likhed budhaḥ ||

indre stambhanamuccāṭamagnau sarvābhicārakam |
yāmye rakṣasi vidveṣaṃ śāntiṃ varuṇa somayoḥ ||

kulotsādaṃ marudbhāge yakṣe kalahavigrahau |
kurvīta noditaṃ karma yacchubhaṃ brahmaṇaḥ pade ||

vaśyākṛṣṭī likhed bhūrje likheduccāṭanaṃ dhvaje |
gardabhatvaci vidveṣaṃ stambhanaṃ gajacarmaṇi ||

pretacīre samālekhyaṃ jvaratāpādimāraṇam |
vivādasainyastambhāni śilāyāmapi mohanam ||

vaśyaṃ kuṅkumakarpūra rocanābhirharidrayā |
yāvena stambhanākṛṣṭiṃ likheccānāmikāsṛjā |
vidveṣaṃ pheruraktena kākaraktena māraṇam |
mohanaṃ vṛkaraktena uccāṭaṃ coṣṭrajāsṛjā ||

yāvo'laktakam | anāmikāsṛjā anāmikāṅgulirudhireṇa | pheruḥ śṛgālaḥ
tathā (-) vaśyādau lekhanī dūrvākarṣaṇe śikhipicchalā |
vidveṣoccāṭanaṃ kākapakṣeṇāpi ca māraṇam ||

vaśye cākarṣaṇe stambhe raktavarṇaṃ vicintayet |
nirviṣīkaraṇe śāntau puṣṭau cāpyāyane sitam ||

pītaṃ stambhanakāryeṣu dhūmramuccāṭane smaret |
<366> unmāde śakragopābhaṃ kṛṣṇaṃ māraṇakarmaṇi ||

āsanaṃ śvetarūpantu sāttvikaṃ samudāhṛtam |
yānamārge sthitaṃ pītaṃ rājasaṃ parikīrtitam ||

daṇḍamānasthitaṃ raudraṃ kṛṣṇaṃ tāmasamucyate |
sāttvikaṃ mokṣakāmānāṃ rājasaṃ rājyamicchatām ||

tāmasaṃ śatrunāśārthaṃ sarvavyādhinivāraṇam |
sarvopadravaśāntyarthaṃ tāmasaṃ tu vicintayet ||

kulaprakāśatantre (-) ścetadravyairyajecchāntyāmāraktairvaśyakarmaṇi |
stambhane pītavarṇaiśca dhūmrairvidvaṣaṇe yajet ||

uccāṭane māraṇe ca kṛṣṇadravyaiḥ prapūjayet |
ātmānaṃ tādṛśaireva vastrādyarbhūṣayet tadā ||

ratirvāṇī ramā jyeṣṭhā durgā kālī yathākramāt |
ṣaṭkarmadevatā proktāḥ karmādau tāḥ prapūjayet ||

kātyāyanyabhicāre ca dakṣiṇāplāvagā mahī |
vasanaṃ lohitaṃ proktamuṣṇīśaṃ lohitaṃ smṛtam ||

saumye suvarṇaduvarṇaṃ yajñasūtramudāhṛtam |
stambhavidveṣayoḥ proktaṃ mārjārāntrasamudbhavam ||

kukkuṭāntrasamudbhūtaṃ yajñasūtraṃ manīṣibhiḥ |
uccāṭane vakāntrāṇāmupavītamudāhṛtam ||

ulūkāntrasamudbhūtaṃ yajñasūtraṃ tu māraṇe |
vaśyaśāntyorhaviṣyaṃ syāt stambhane pāyasaṃ matam ||

vidveṣe māṣamaudgāḥ syurgodhūmā vāyudaivate |
śyāmākānnaṃ masūrānnaṃ śālyajādugdhapāyase ||

māraṇe bhakṣyametat syādityukto bhakṣasaṃyamaḥ |

ṣaṭkarmayogyāsanam

padmāsanaṃ svastikaṃ ca vikaṭaṃ kukkuṭaṃ tathā ||

vajraṃ bhadrakamityāhurāsanāni manīṣiṇaḥ |

lakṣaṇamuktaṃ tantrāntare (-)

vāmorūpari dakṣiṇaṃ tu caraṇaṃ saṃsthāpya vāmaṃ tathā
yāmyorūpari paścimena vidhinā dhṛtvā karābhyāṃ dṛḍham |
<367> aṅguṣṭhau hṛdaye nidhāya cibukaṃ nāsāgramālokayet
tattadvyādhivighātakāri yamināṃ padmāsanaṃ procyate ||

jānūrvorantare samyak kṛtvā pādatale ubhe |
ṛjukāyaḥ samāsīnaḥ svastikaṃ tadudīritam ||

ekapādamathaikasmin vinyasyoruṇi saṃsthitaḥ |
itarasmiṃstathā coruṃ vikaṭāsanamīritam ||

padmāsanaṃ tu saṃyojya jānūrvorantare karau |
niveśya bhūmau saṃsthāpya vyomasthaṃ kukkuṭāsanam ||

meḍhrādupari vinyasya savyaṃ gulphaṃ tathopari |
gulphāntaraṃ ca nikṣipya vajrāsanamiheritam ||

gulphe ca vṛṣaṇasyādhā sīvanyāḥ pārśvayoḥ kṣipet |
pārśvapādau ca pāṇibhyāṃ dṛḍhaṃ baddhvā suniścalaḥ ||

bhadrāsanaṃ bhavedetat sarvavyādhivināśanam |

āsanādhāranirūpaṇam

āsanādhāramadhunā vakṣye tantrānusārataḥ |
sarvasiddhyai dvīpicarma jñānasiddhyai mṛgājinam ||

vastrāsanaṃ rogaharaṃ vetrajaṃ śrīvivarddhanam |
kauśeyaṃ pauṣṭikaṃ proktaṃ kevalaṃ duḥkhamocanam ||

abhicāre kṛṣṇavarṇaṃ raktaṃ vaśyādikarmasu |
śāntike dhavalaṃ proktaṃ citrakaṃ sarvakarmasu ||

stambhane gajacarma syān māraṇe māhiṣaṃ tathā |
meṣīcarma tathoccāṭe khaḍgijaṃ vaśyakarmaṇi ||

vidveṣe jāmbūkaṃ proktaṃ bhaved gocarma śāntike |
vaśīkaraṇakarma syād devatāyatane śubhe ||

śāntikarma bhaved gehe śmaśāne krūrakarma ca |
athavā sarvakarmāṇi bhaveyurdevatāgṛhe ||

ṣaṭkarmayogyamudrā

ṣaṇmudrāḥ kramato jñeyāḥ padmapāśagadāhvayāḥ |
muśalāśanikhaḍgākhyāḥ śāntikādiṣu darśayet ||

hastau tu sammukhau kṛtvā sannatāvunnatāṅgulī |
<368> talāntarmilitāṅguṣṭhau mudraiṣā padmasaṃjñikā ||

vāmamuṣṭhisthatarjanyā dakṣamuṣṭhisthatarjanīm |
saṃyojyāṅguṣṭhakāgrābhyāṃ tarjanyagre svake kṣipet ||

eṣā pāśāhvayā mudrā vidvadbhiḥ parikīrtitāḥ |
anyonyābhimukhau hastau kṛtvā tu grathitāṅgulī ||

aṅgulyau madhyamau bhūyaḥ saṃlagne suprasārite |
gadāmudreyamākhyātā viṣṇoḥ santoṣavarddhinī ||

muṣṭiṃ kṛtvā tu hastābhyāṃ vāmasyopari dakṣiṇam |
kuryān muśalamudreyaṃ sarvavighnavināśinī ||

kaniṣṭhāṅguṣṭhasaṃyogāt trikoṇāśanisaṃjñitā |
kaniṣṭhānāmike baddhvā svāṅguṣṭhenaiva dakṣataḥ ||

śiṣṭhāṅgulī ca prasṛte saṃsṛṣṭe khaḍgamudrikā |

ṣaṭkarmayogyakuṇḍam

caturasramardhacandraṃ trikoṇaṃ ca ṣaḍasrakam ||

varttulaṃ ca pṛthivyādimaṇḍalākṛtayaḥ kramāt |
pītaṃ śvetaṃ tathā raktaṃ kṛṣṇaṃ dhūmramiti kramāt ||

nābhau smaren maṇḍalaṃ tu vāyostadbījasaṃyutam |
trikoṇaṃ piṅgalaṃ vahnimaṇḍalaṃ hṛdi cintayet ||

caturasraṃ gale pītaṃ pṛthivīmaṇḍalaṃ smaret |
ardhacandraṃ lalāṭe tu śvetapadmadvayāṅkitam ||

mastake dhūmravarṇābhaṃ varttulaṃ vyomamaṇḍalam |
svasvabījayuteṣveṣu caitanyaṃ paricintayet ||

jalaṃ śāntividhau śastaṃ vaśye vahnirudrāhṛtam |
stambhane pṛthivī śastā vidveṣe vyoma kīrtitam ||

uccāṭane smṛto vāyurbhūyo'gnirmāraṇe mataḥ |
tattadbhūtodaye samyak tattanmaṇḍalasaṃyutam ||

tattat karma vidhātavyaṃ mantriṇā niśitātmanā |
daṇḍākārā gatirbhūmeḥ puṭayorubhayoradhaḥ ||

toyasya pāvakasyordhvaṃ gatistiryag nabhasvataḥ |
gatirvyomno bhaven madhye bhūtānāmudayaḥ smṛtaḥ ||

<369> dharaṇerudaye kuryāt stambhanaṃ vaśyamātmavit |
śāntikaṃ pauṣṭikaṃ karma toyasya samaye vasoḥ ||

māraṇādīni maruto vipakṣoccāṭanādike |
kṣveḍādināśane śastamudaye ca vihāyasaḥ ||

dharādipañcabhūtānāṃ nivṛttādyāḥ kalāḥ smṛtāḥ |
nivṛttiḥ sapratiṣṭhā syād vidyā śāntiranantaram ||

śāntyatīteti tā jñeyāḥ sampūjyāstatra tatra tāḥ |
mantrānte yojanaṃ nāmnaḥ pallavaḥ sa tu kathyate ||

māraṇe viṣasaṃhāre grahabhūtavinigrahe |
uccāṭane ca vidveṣe pallavastu praśasyate ||

nāmānte mantrasaṃsthānaṃ yoga ityabhidhīyate |
śāntike pauṣṭike vaśye prāyaścitte viśodhane ||

mohane dīpane yogaṃ prayuñjanti manīṣiṇaḥ |
stambhanoccāṭanodbhedavidveṣeṣu sa cocyate ||

nāmna ādyantamadhyeṣu mantraḥ syād rodha iṣyate |
mantrābhimukhyakaraṇe sarvavyādhinivāraṇe ||

jvaragrahaviṣādyārttiśāntike rodha ucyate |
sammohane sa evātha mantranāmākṣarāṇi ca ||

ekaikāntaritaṃ yat tu grathanaṃ tat prakīrtitam |
tacchāntike vidhātavyaṃ nāmādyante tathā manuḥ ||

tat sampuṭaṃ bhavet tat tu kīlane paribhāṣitam |
stambhe mṛtyuñjaye divye rakṣādivye ca saṃpuṭaḥ ||

mantrākṣarābhyāmekaikaṃ sādhyanāmākṣaraṃ kramāt |
kathyate sa vidarbhastu vaśyākarṣaṇapauṣṭike ||

evaṃ yogakramaḥ proktaḥ sarvakārye manīṣibhiḥ ||
(bandhanoccāṭane dveṣe saṃkīrṇe huṃ prayojayet |

phaṭkāraṃ chedane hūṃ phaṭ vighnagrahanivāraṇe ||

puṣṭau cāpyāyane vauṣaṭ rodhane malinīkṛte |
agnikārye japet svāhā namaḥ sarvatra cārcane ||

śānti puṣṭi vaśa dveṣākṛṣṭaṭyuccāṭanamāraṇe |
<370> svadhā svāhā vaṣaṭ hūṃ ca vauṣaṭ phaṭ yojayet kramāt ||)

vaśyākarṣaṇasantāpajvare svāhāṃ prayojayet |
krodhopaśamane śāntau prītau yojyaṃ namo budhaiḥ ||

vauṣaṭ sammohanoddīpapuṣṭimṛtyuñjayeṣu ca |
hūṅkāraṃ prītināśe ca chedane māraṇe tathā ||

uccāṭane ca vidveṣe vaṣaṭ paṅgukṛtau vaṣaṭ |
mantroddīpanakāryeṣu lābhālābhe vaṣaṭ smṛtaḥ ||

ṣaṭkarmaṇi mantrabhedāḥ

mantravidyāvibhāgena dvividhā mantrajātayaḥ |
mantrāḥ puṃdevatā jñeyā vidyāḥ strīdaivatāḥ punaḥ ||

strīpuṃnapuṃsakātmāno mantrāḥ sarve samīritāḥ |
puṃmantrā hūṃ phaḍantāḥ syurdviṭhāntāstu striyo matāḥ ||

napuṃsakā namo'ntāḥ syurvibhaktā manavastridhā |
śastrāste trividhā mantrā vaśyaśāntyabhicārike ||

agnīṣomātmakā mantrā vijñeyā krūrasaumyayoḥ |
karmaṇorvahnitārānte viyatprāyāḥ samīritāḥ ||

āgneyā manavaḥ saumyā bhūyiṣṭhendumṛtākṣarāḥ |
āgneyāḥ samprabudhyante prāṇe carati dakṣiṇe ||

bhāge'nyasmin sthite prāṇe saumyā bodhaṃ prayānti ca |
nāḍīdvayagate prāṇe sarve bodhaṃ prayānti ca ||

prayacchanti phalaṃ sarve prabuddhā mantriṇāṃ sadā |
śītāṃśu salila kṣauṇī vyoma vāyu havirbhujām ||

varṇāḥ syurmantrabījāni ṣaṭkarmasu yathākramam |

ṣaṭkarmaṇi japabhedāḥ

japaḥ svādakṣarāvṛttistasya bhedān bravīmyaham |
japaḥ syād dvividhaḥ prokto vāciko mānasastathā ||

ādyo'pyupāṃśuruccaiśca dvividhaḥ parikīrtitaḥ |
dvitīyo'pi dvidhā prokto jihvācittaprabhedataḥ ||

yaduccanīcasvaritaiḥ śabdaiḥ spaṣṭapadākṣaraiḥ |
manumuccārayed vācā sa ukto vāciko japaḥ ||

<371> śanairuccārayen mantramīṣadoṣṭho pracālayet |
kiñcicchravaṇayogyaḥ syādupāṃśuḥ sa japaḥ smṛtaḥ ||

jihvājapaḥ sa vijñeyaḥ kevalaṃ jihvayā budhaiḥ |
dhiyā yaduccaren mantraṃ sa ukto mānaso japaḥ ||

uccairjapād viśiṣṭaḥ syādupāṃśurdaśabhirguṇaiḥ |
jihvājapaḥ śataguṇaḥ sahasro mānaso japaḥ ||

mānasaḥ siddhikāmaistu puṣṭikāmairupāṃśukaḥ |
vāciko māraṇe caiva praśasto japa īritaḥ ||

tathā (-) praṇavādyā muktikarī śrībījādyā dhanāgame |
hṛllekhādyā mahāsiddhikarī sarvavaśaṅkarī ||

vāgbhavādyāṃ cared vidyāṃ kāmādyā janarañjinī |
rudrayāmale (-) ūrdhvadṛṣṭirjapecchāntāvadhodṛṣṭistu mohane |
samadṛṣṭiḥ stambhane ca pārśvato darśanakramāt ||

virodhe ca samuccāṭamāraṇe sūryadarśanaḥ |
vidyārthaṃ jalamadhyastho bhānumaṇḍaladarśanāt ||

bhūmadhyadarśanād devi mokṣaśāntau śubhe'khile |
nāsāgradarśato devi sarvatra śubhakarmaṇi ||

tantra (-) nityaṃ japaṃ kare kuryānna prayoge kadācana |
prayoge vihitā mālā tattatkarmānurūpataḥ ||

ṣaṭkarmaṇi mālābhedāḥ

tantraśekhare (-) vaśye padmākṣamālā syācchāntau śaṅkhamayī bhavet |
nivāriṣṭātmikā stambhe dveṣaṇe pretadantajā |
aśvadantodbhavoccāṭe māraṇe kharadantajā ||

tantre (-) rudrakṣairvihitā mālā sarvakarmaprasādhanī |
nirmitā śaṅkhamālābhirdhanaṃ kīrtiṃ ca yacchati ||

padmākṣaiḥ puṣṭilakṣmīdā śatrunāśakarī tathā |
putrañjīvabhavā putrapaśudhānyasamṛddhidā ||

muktābhī racitā mālā saubhāgyaṃ vipulaṃ śriyam |
mantrapratyakṣadā siddhiṃ śāntikaṃ cātha pauṣṭikam ||

muktiṃ ca tanute tadvat sphāṭikyapyakṣamālikā |
<372> sārasvate (-) padmarāgodbhavāṃ lābhe puṣkale ca dhane tathā |
sauvavarṇī rājatī mālā sarvān kāmān prayacchati ||

sārasvate prabālotthā vaśye'dhikadhanāgame |
pāpakṣayakarī kauśī rudrākṣādikuśāntakaiḥ ||

sarvairetairviracitā mālā syān muktaye nṛṇām |
uccāṭane'śvadantānāṃ mālā proktā'śvavālakaiḥ ||

kharadantairadhobhūtairmanuṣyasnāyutantunā |
grathitairnirmitā mālā śatrūṇāṃ nāśinī matā ||

pretadantairadhobhūtaiḥ kartavyā japamālikā |
sādhyadehabhavaiḥ keśaiḥ protavyā dveṣakarmaṇi ||

ṣaṭkarmaṇi japasaṃkhyāniyamaḥ

śataṃ vātha tadardhaṃ vā sarvasādhāraṇe jape |
pañcāśadbhiḥ kāmyakarmasiddhiḥ syāccaturuttaraiḥ ||

aṣṭottaraśataiḥ sarvasiddhiruktā kṛtasrajā |
mokṣārthī pañcaviṃśatyā pañcadaśābhicārike ||

madhyamāṅguṣṭhakābhyāṃ tu japedākarṣaṇe'nvaham |
aṅguṣṭhatarjanībhyāṃ tu vidveṣoccāṭayorjapet ||

japejjyeṣṭhakaniṣṭhābhyāṃ śatrumāraṇakarmaṇi |
aṅguṣṭhānāmikābhyāntu japedanyeṣu karmasu ||

ṣaṭkarmaṇi mālāgrathananiyamaḥ

sūtraṃ sampātayed vidvān mālāgrathanahetave |
sitaraktapītamiśra kṛṣṇadhūmrāḥ prakīrtitāḥ ||

varṇato mantraḥ saṃproktā devatāḥ ṣaṭsu karmasu |
kvacit kalpaviśeṣeṇa prayoge dhyānamīritam ||

tatsarvaṃ samyagālocya prayogavidhimācaret |
ākarṣaṇaṃ vaśyavat syāt śubhaṃ śāntivadīritam ||

ugraṃ māraṇavaj jñeyaṃ karma sarvatra sādhakaiḥ |

ṣaṭkarmaṇi kuṇḍaviśeṣaphalam

homaprayoge kuṇḍāni tattatkarmānurūpataḥ |
darśitāni budhaiḥ samyagīryate vidhivanmayā ||

<373> sarvasiddhikaraṃ kuṇḍaṃ caturasramudāhṛtam ||

putrapradaṃ yonikuṇḍamardhendvābhaṃ śubhapradam |
śatrukṣayakaraṃ tryasraṃ varttulaṃ śāntikarmaṇi ||

chedamāraṇayoḥ kuṇḍaṃ ṣaḍasraṃ padmasannibham |
vṛṣṭidaṃ rogaśamanaṃ kuṇḍamaṣṭāsramīritam ||

kuṇḍabhedaphalaṃ prāhuranye ca munayo'nyathā |
aindryāṃ stambhe catuṣkoṇamagnibhāge bhagākṛti ||

candrārdhaṃ māraṇe yāmye tryasraṃ dveṣe tu nairṛte |
vāruṇyāṃ śāntike vṛttaṃ ṣaḍasryuccāṭane'nile ||

udīcyāṃ pauṣṭike padmaṃ raudryāmaṣṭāsri muktidam |
pañcāsrikuṇḍaṃ vāyavyāṃ bhūtādigrahanigrahe ||

abhicāropaśāntyarthamīśe saptāsri vinyaset |
śuklamṛsnā ca yā bhūmirbrāhmī sā parikīrtitā ||

kṣatriyā raktamṛtsnā ca harid vaiśyāpi kīrtitā |
kṛṣṇavarṇā tathā śūdrā bhūmiruktā manīṣibhiḥ ||

brāhmī sarvārthasiddhiḥ syāt kṣatriyā rājyadā matā |
dhanadhānyakarī vaiśyā śūdrā tu ninditā budhaiḥ ||

kuṇḍamadhye trikoṇāntaḥkarṇikāyāṃ likhed budhaḥ |
śaktibījaṃ ca paritastattadbhūtārṇamālikhet ||

mūlamantrasya varṇena grathitaṃ vā vidarbhitam |
sampuṭaṃ vā tathā mantrī tattatkarmānurūpataḥ ||

sādhyanāmākṣaraṃ mantrī likhenniyatamānasaḥ |
agnerjihvā tathā proktā guṇabhedena karmasu ||

ṣaṭkarmaṇi agnerjihvābhedāḥ

hiraṇyā gaganā raktā kṛṣṇānyā suprabhā matā |
bahurūpā'tiraktā ca sāttikyaḥ śubhakarmasu ||

padmarāgā suvarṇānyā tṛtīyā bhadralohitā |
lohitā ca tataḥ śvetā dhūminī ca karālikā ||

rājasyo rasanā vahnervihitā vaśyakarmasu |
viśvamūrti sphuliṅginyau ghūrmavarṇā manojavā ||

<374> lohitā ca karālākhyā kālī tāmasya īritāḥ |
etāḥ sapta niyujyante kūrakarmasu mantribhiḥ ||

aṣṭābhirājyāhutibhiḥ praṇavena pṛthak pṛthak |
garbhādhānaṃ puṃsavanaṃ sīmantonnayanaṃ tathā ||

anantaraṃ jātakarma syānnāmakaraṇaṃ tathā |
bahirniṣkramaṇaṃ paścādannaprāśanamīritam ||

cūḍopanayane bhūyo mahānāmnyaṃ mahāvratam |
athopaniṣadaṃ paścād godānodvāhakau mṛtiḥ ||

śubheṣu syurvivāhāntāḥ kriyāstā krūrakarmasu |
maraṇāntāḥ samuddiṣṭāḥ vahnerāgamavedibhiḥ ||

prokṣaṇyādīni pātrāṇi svarṇaraupyamayāni ca |
tāmrāṇi śāntikādau ca dveṣaṇoccāṭanādiṣu ||

bahuvārakākṣaśobhāñjanānyatamakādiṣu |
śrotrādikalpanā vahnerākhyātā tantravedibhiḥ ||

mukhaṃ madhye śiro dakṣe pādāvuttaradiggatau |
indreśayormukhaṃ śāntau diśyagneḥ kāmyakarmaṇi ||

rakṣaso māraṇe vāyorākarṣe'nyatra madhyataḥ |

homīyamudrā

rudrayāmale (-) home mudrātrayaṃ proktaṃ mṛgī haṃsī ca śūkarī |
haṃsī syāt tarjanīmuktā tridhā mudrā prakīrtitā |
śāntike pauṣṭike caiva māraṇoccāṭane tathā ||

vidveṣe stambhane caiva vaśye ca parameśvari |
śāntike ca mṛgī jñeyā haṃsī pauṣṭikakarmaṇi ||

abhicāre śūkarī syād vidveṣoccāṭanādiṣu |

homāṅganirūpaṇe (-) na devāḥ pratigṛhṇanti mudrāhīnāmathāhutim |
mudrāhīnaṃ tu yo mohāddhotumicchati mandadhīḥ ||

yajamānaṃ tathātmānaṃ pātayatyeva niścitam |
homaścāgnisthitiṃ jñātvā kartavyaṃ karma niścitam ||

agnicakram

atha vakṣye mahādevi homakarmasu siddhidam |
<375> agnicakraṃ varārohe sarvacakreṣu gopitam ||

navagrahamayo vahniste ca vahnimayā grahāḥ |
atasteṣāṃ sthitiṃ jñātvā vahnau homaṃ samācaret ||

śāntike pauṣṭike vṛddhau krūreṣvapi ca karmasu |
teṣāṃ sthitikramaṃ vakṣye nakṣatreṣu yathāvidhi |
sūryo budho bhṛguścaiva śaniścandro mahīsutaḥ |
jīvo rāhuśca ketuśca navaite devi khecarāḥ ||

trīṇi trīṇi ca ṛkṣāṇi ravimādīni dāpayet |
sūryabhāccandrabhaṃ yāvat gaṇayecca maheśvari ||

sūryādīnāṃ phalaṃ devi śṛṇu vakṣye yathākramam |
āditye tu bhavecchoko budhe caiva dhanāgamaḥ ||

śukre lābhaṃ vijānīyācchanau pīḍā na saṃśayaḥ |
candra lābho mahādevi bhaume caiva tu bandhanam ||

guruṇā ca dhanaprāptiḥ rāhau hānistathaiva ca |
ketunā jāyate mṛtyuḥ phalamevaṃ maheśvari ||

evaṃ jñātvā maheśāni homakarma samācaret |
saumyagrahamukhe yasmin dine viṃśatirāhutiḥ ||

ārambhaḥ somyahomasya dine tasmin vidhīyate |
krūrahomastathā devi krūragrahamukhe bhavet ||

iti jñātvā maheśāni kāmyahomaṃ samācaret |
anyathā kriyamāṇe tu naiṣphalyaṃ cātmanāśanam ||

gaṇeśvaravimarśiṇyāntu viśeṣāntaramuktam (-)

navakoṣṭhaṃ samālikhyāpyeṣaṇairṛkṣayoḥ kramāt |
vāruṇyaṃ(?)dīrvāyuvahnyordakṣiṇottarayornyaset ||

sūryādīn madhyakoṣṭhe tu ketuṃ nyasya phalaṃ diśet |
āditye'rthaṃ bhavecchoko budhe dhanasamāgamaḥ ||

śukrasthāne'rthalābhaḥ syāchanirhānikaro bhavet |
candre lābhaṃ vijānīyād bhaume ca vadhabandhanam ||

guruḥ syādarthalābhāya rāhurhānikaro mataḥ |
ketunā mṛtyumāpnoti hyagnicakre sadaiva hi ||

<376> trayaṃ trayaṃ ca gaṇayet sūryarkṣāddinabhāvadhi |
kuṇḍe ca sthaṇḍile caiva hotavyaṃ deśikottamaiḥ ||

nitye naimittike durgāhomādau na vicārayet |
brahmayāmale (-) atha vahneḥ sthitiṃ vakṣye homakarmasusiddhaye |
svargaloke ca pātāle bhūmau tiṣṭhati havyarāṭ |
tatprakāramahaṃ vakṣye sādhakānāṃ hitāya ca ||

dhṛtiśca tithivārāṃśca saptadvīpaṃ caturyugam |
ekīkṛtya hared bhāgaṃ tribhiḥ śeṣeṇa pāvakaḥ ||

ekena vasati svarge dvaye pātāla eva ca |
śūnye ca martyaloke syādevaṃ vasati pāvakaḥ ||

utpātaḥ svargalokasthe pātālasthe dhanakṣayaḥ |
martyaloke sthite vahnau homo'bhīṣṭaphalapradaḥ ||

itthaṃ vijñāya mantrajño homakarma samācaret |

ṣaṭkarmaṇi sruksruvasamillakṣaṇam

tantre (-) sauvarṇau sruksruvau syātāṃ saumyakarmaṇi sarvataḥ |
bhavetāmāyasāvetau stambhanādiṣu karmasu ||

laukikāgnau śāntikaṃ syād vaśyaṃ laukikapāvake |
stambhanākhyaṃ bhavet karma vaṭaje jātavedasi |
vidveṣo'kṣaśucau jñeyaḥ śmaśāno kharbudhe smṛte (?) ||

uccāṭamāraṇe proktā ṣaṭkarmajvalanā ime |
vaśye dāḍimapuṣpāṇi śāntau syurdūrvayā saha ||

samidho goghṛtasnātāḥ stambhane rājavṛkṣajāḥ |
meṣīghṛtena saṃyuktā dveṣe kṣatarujā matāḥ ||

uccāṭane rasālotthāḥ kaṭutailena saṃyutāḥ |
māraṇe khādirāḥ proktāḥ kaṭutailena saṃyutāḥ |
homadravyamidaṃ proktaṃ ṣaṭsu karmasu mantribhiḥ ||

tathā (-) ghṛtahome dhanāvāptiḥ siddhārthaiḥ kīrtiruttamā |
kiṃśukaiḥ sarvakāmāptiḥ phalahome sukhaṃ bhavet ||

guḍena priyatā proktā campakaiḥ pāṭalai ramā |
putrahome sutāvāptiḥ karavīraistriyo vaśāḥ ||

<377> āyuṣkarī bhaved dūrvā guḍucī rogaśāntidā |
tilā api tathā proktāḥ saubhāgyaṃ gandhahomataḥ ||

śrīphalairvilvapatraiśca tathā jalaruhairapi |
rājyabhraṣṭasya rājyāptirmallikā kīrtidā matā ||

karṇikāraiḥ kiṃśukaiśca bhaveyurvibudhā vaśāḥ |
kāśamadairnṛpā vaśyāḥ kṛtamālairviśo vaśāḥ ||

śūdrāḥ syuḥ pāṭalairvaśyā nīlapadmairbhavedramā |
jātīpuṣpairbhaved vāṇī madhurairiṣṭasampadaḥ ||

aśvatthodumbaraplakṣasamidbhirvāñchitāptayaḥ |
iṣṭadravyairbhavediṣṭaṃ yavaiśca brīhibhistathā ||

māṣai ripūṇāṃ mūkatvaṃ kodravairvyādhisambhavaḥ |
kalāpahomato'rīṇāṃ bhītiḥ syānmahatī dhruvam ||

vibhītakasamidbhiḥ syādunmattaṃ dviṣatāṃ kulam |
śālmaleḥ samidhā śatroḥ pakṣānnāśo bhaved dhruvam ||

homadravyāṇi

phetkāriṇītantre (-) atha dravyāṇi vakṣyāmi tattatkarmānurūpataḥ |
śāntike tu payaḥsarpistilakṣīrakrameṇa tu ||

amṛtākhyā latā caiva pāyasai tatra kīrtitam |
pauṣṭike vilvapatraiśca jātīpuṣpairnṛpo bhavet |
kanyārthī juhuyāllājaiḥ śrīkāmaḥ kamalaistathā ||

daghnā ca śriyamāpnoti annairannaṃ ghṛtaplutaiḥ |
kṣīreṇa sarpiṣā vāpi kamalairmadhunāplutaiḥ ||

samṛddhyairjuhuyān mantrī mahānairdhanyaśāntaye |
lakṣahomāllabhecchāntiṃ ghṛtavilvatilairnidhim ||

ākarṣaṇe tu lavaṇaṃ priyaṅgurvilvakaṃ phalam |
jātīpalāśakusumaiḥ sarvairekaikameva vā ||

rājīlavaṇakairvaśyaṃ vaśyaṃ vā pauṣṭikoditaiḥ |
vaśyārthī jātīkusumairākṛṣṭau karavīrajaiḥ ||

kārpāsanimbaistakrāktairnarakeśaistathāpi vā |
ekīkṛtya hunet mantrī śatrumāraṇakāṅkṣayā ||

<378> juhuyāt sārṣapaistailairathavā śatrumāraṇe |
rohībījaistilopetairuccāre juhuyānnaraḥ ||

tuṣakaṇṭakasaṃyuktairbījaiḥ kārpāsikairapi |
sarpiṣaistilasaṃmiśrairhunet sarvābhicārake ||

kākolūkachadaiḥ krūraiḥ kāraskaravibhītakaiḥ |
maricaiḥ sarṣapaiḥ siddhairarkakṣīraiḥ kaṭutrayaiḥ ||

kaṭutailaiḥ snuhīkṣīraiḥ kuryān māraṇakarmaṇi |

śatrunāśakarahome agneḥ karṇādihomācchatroḥ karṇādināśaḥ | taduktam (-)

vahneḥ śirasi nāśāyāṃ śrotreṣvakṣiṣu vā tathā |
juhuyāccet tadā kṣīpraṃ tatra (śatruṃ vi)nāśayediti ||

agneḥ karṇādilakṣaṇaṃ tu pūrvamevoktam | tathā (-)

āyuṣkāmo ghṛtatilairdūrvābhiścāmrapallavaiḥ |
payasāktairāmrapatrairjvaraṃ sadyo vināśayet ||

guḍūcī mṛtyujayane tathā śāntau gajāhvayoḥ |
gauraistu sarṣapairhutvā sadyo rogaṃ harejjvarī ||

vṛṣṭhīkāmo vetasībhiḥ samidbhiḥ patrakaistathā |
hutvā puṣṭimavāpnoti putrañjīvaistu putrakam |
ghṛtaguggulahomena vākpatitvaṃ prajāyate |
mallikājātikusumairnāgapunnāgasambhavaiḥ ||

puṣpaiḥ sarasvatīsiddhistathā sarvārthasādhanam |
payasā lavaṇairvāpe huned vṛṣṭinivāraṇe ||

raktapuṣpairapāmārgeraṅkolaiśca subhadrakaiḥ |
ebhirmadhurasaṃyuktairmantrī kuryāt tu vaśyakam ||

vātoddhataiḥ śuṣkapatraiḥ kāṣṭhairaśanipātitaiḥ |
uṣṭrāsthinā vā cāṅgāraiḥ śatroruccāṭanaṃ bhavet ||

dūrvāguḍūcīgavyena sar.piṣā tilataṇḍulaiḥ |
annaiḥ samidbhiḥ pālāśaiḥ śāntiṃ kuryād vicakṣaṇaḥ ||

tantrāntare (-) saumyakarmaṇi saṃproktā haridrā jalasaṃyutā |
uṣṇodakaṃ samārīcaṃ māraṇa stambhayorbhavet ||

dveṣoccāṭanayoḥ proktaṃ jalaṃ meṣasṛjāyutam |
<379> tarpaṇadravyamākhyātamidamāgamapāragaiḥ ||

saumyakarmaṇi mantrajñaḥ sukhāsīnaḥ pratarpayet |
jānubhyāmavanīṃ gatvā tarpaṇaṃ stambhane bhavet ||

dveṣādāvekacaraṇastarpayet sādhakāgraṇīḥ |
vaśyaśāntyoḥ svarṇapātraṃ mṛtpātraṃ stambhane matam ||

vidveṣe khādiraṃ pātramuccāṭe lauhanirmitam |
māraṇe kukkuṭāṇḍaṃ syāt pātrāṇīmāni tarpaṇe ||

iti saptānyaprayogāḥ

atha viśeṣaprayogaḥ

pheravīye (-) vidyākāmena hotavyaṃ tilājyaṃ madhusaṃyutam |
siddhasārasvate (-) bandhūkapuṣpahomena dāsavat kurute nṛpān |
sarpirlavaṇahomena cākarṣayati kāminīm ||

vakulaprasūnairhomāt saubhāgyaṃ labhate naraḥ |
mallikājātipunnāgaiḥ kadambaiḥ puṣṭimāpnuyāt ||

candanāgurukāśmīra karpurairhomataḥ punaḥ |
mantrī nīlasarasvatyāḥ sarvābhīṣṭamavāpnuyāt ||

rājavṛkṣaprasūnasya homāt sampadamāpnuyāt |
sampūjya mūlamantreṇa vilvapatrairghṛtānvitaiḥ ||

sahasraṃ pratyahaṃ hutvā prāpnoti paramāṃ gatim |
ghṛtāktamālatīpuṣpahomād drutakavirbhavet ||

surendrasaṃhitāyām (-) vidyākāmena hotavyaṃ padmairmadhuralolitaiḥ |
trimadhvaktaistilairhutvā dhane vaiśravaṇo bhavet ||

raktapuṣpaṃ trimadhvaktaṃ hunedaṣṭaśataṃ sudhīḥ |
rājāno vaśamāyānti kṣaṇārdhena na saṃśayaḥ ||

kṣīrāktatagarairhomān mahatīṃ kavitāṃ labhet |
vilvapatrasahasraistu yāvad varṣaṃ dine dine ||

paramāṃ gatimāpnoti devānāmapi durlabhām |
haviṣyāśī muktakeśo japedayutasaṃkhyayā ||

gadyapadyamayī vāṇī sabhāyāṃ tasya jāyate |
padmāvatīmanuṃ japtvā sahasraṃ prayato'vravīt ||

<380> catuṣpathe baliṃ dadyāt sa syād drutakāvardhruvam |
śatābhijaptamātreṇa rocanātilakaṃ naraḥ ||

kṛtvā paśyati yaṃ mantrī taṃ kuryād dāsavad vaśam |
udayāt pūrvamārabhya japedastaṃ dināvadhi ||

ekaviṃśaddinaṃ yāvanniśi harmye baliṃ haret |
kahakahapadaṃ brūyāt kāliketi padaṃ tataḥ ||

piśācipadamuccārya piṇḍaṃ gṛhṇa dviṭha dvayam |
iti mantrairbaliṃ dattvā sarvajñaḥ sādhako bhavet ||

matsyasūkte tu (-) vidyākāmena hotavyaṃ pāyasairmadhusaṃyutaiḥ |
dhanakāmena hotavyaṃ tilājyaṃ madhusaṃyutam ||

homasya niyamastantre kathito'pyayutāvadhi |
ayutaṃ vilvapatreṇa madhutrayayutena ca ||

havanānnātra sandeho vāṇī sarvavidhā bhavet |
tatpatralakṣahomena śriyā sākṣād dhaneśvaraḥ ||

raktacandanahomena sarvajño jāyate naraḥ |
śvetacandanahomena sākṣād bhūmipurandaraḥ ||

raktacandanahomena sākṣād bhūmivṛhaspatiḥ |
yavānāṃ lakṣahomena saṃskṛtāṃ vāpyasaṃskṛtām ||

sarvabhāṣā parijñāya sarvajño jāyate'cirāt |
aśrutānyapi śāstrāṇi vyācaṣṭe nātra saṃśaya ||

śālamatsyādihomena śivapratinidhiḥ smṛtaḥ |
lakṣamātreṇa hotavyaṃ tilājyena sureśvari ||

sādhakaḥ sarvavidyānāṃ pārago bhavati dhruvam |
prātarmātṛkayā sārdhaṃ vidyayā ca trijaptayā ||

pānācca sarvavidyānāṃ māsamātreṇa sādhakaḥ |
utthāya cottare yāme kuṇḍalīmāsanaṃ kṛtam ||

cintayedugratārāṃ vai muktibhāgī bhavennaraḥ |
śāntyai kundendudhavalāṃ cintayet sādhakottamaḥ ||

dhūmrābhāṃ pūjayed vāyumaṇḍale pūjitā tathā |
unmādayati śatrūṇāṃ balaṃ buddhiṃ na saṃśayaḥ ||

<381> surendrasaṃhitāyām (-) kulākulasamudbhūtamamṛtānandamarcayet |
sūryakoṭisamaṃ sūtraṃ vāṭamadhye vyavasthitam ||

yajet kulāmṛtaṃ dattvā liṅgayonisamudbhavam |
tathā kulaṃ yajelliṅge kuṇḍalīdṛḍhabandhanāt ||

ādhārapadmamadhye tu dvipade dvipadālaye |
ṣoḍaśāre yajelliṅge dvādaśe maṇipūrake ||

hṛdaye daśapatre tu dvādaśārdhe caturdale |
kaṇṭhe bhāle yajed devīṃ jihvālalanasaṅkule ||

dhavalāgāramadhye tu brahmacarye rato naraḥ |
pūjayed dhavalairdevīṃ śvetavastrāvaguṇṭhanaiḥ ||

dhavalaireva naivedyairdadhikṣīraudanādibhiḥ |
saṅkalpairvā vidhāyetthaṃ dhyāyed vāgīśvarīṃ parām ||

gacchantīṃ brahmamārgeṇa liṅgabhedakrameṇa tu |
visargasthāmṛtaṃ divyaṃ kṣīradhārāsamudbhavam ||

pītvā kulāmṛtaṃ tatra punareva viśet kulam |
punareva kulaṃ gacched dvādaśānte niveśayet ||

sahasrāre mahāpadme vāgbhavaṃ pūrṇacandrakam |
brahmagranthiṃ tato bhitvā dattvā saptāṣṭadhārayā ||

lambikāṃ brahmamārgeṇa tālumūle praveśayet |
jihvāmāpūrya tāṃ vidyāṃ mātṛkāvarṇarūpiṇīm ||

bahirgatāṃ varṇarūpāṃ jihvāgre dīparūpiṇīm |
āmūlād brahmarandhrāntaṃ tathā jihvāgradeśagaḥ ||

vāgbhavādyāṃ mahāvidyāṃ dīpākārāṃ vicintayet |
hastayoḥ pādayorvidyāṃ tathā nāḍītrayeṣu ca ||

ādhārāt tu samutthāpya vāgīśīṃ dvādaśe nayet |
dvādaśādhāramādāya tadgranthiṃ paribhedayet ||

tasmājjihvāgramānīya dīpākārāṃ vicintayet |
lakṣamekamidaṃ japtvā sarvapāpāni nirdahet ||

tataścarācaraṃ sarvaṃ jñātvā sarvajñatāṃ labhet |
tato japen mahāvidyāṃ vākpatirjāyate naraḥ ||

<382> vāda sadasi yā vākpastambhinī prativādinām |
tatpaṇḍitaghaṭāṭopa tejaḥpratihataprabhaḥ ||

sattarkapadavākyārtha śabdālaṅkārasāravit |
jihvāyāṃ nyasanādeva mūko'pi satkavirbhavet ||

sukumāratarasphāra śabdālaṅkārasāravit |
vātoddhutasamudrormīmālātulyairupanyaset ||

padagulphairmahākāvyavarakārayitā bhavet |
avyāhatā matiḥ śāstre vijayo vākpateriva ||

bālakasya tu jihvāyāṃ tridinābhyantare likhet |
suvarṇamayyā lekhanyā madhunā śvetadūrvayā ||

vāgbhavādyāṃ likhed vidyāṃ samārādhya prajapya ca |
sa eva paṇḍitaḥ śrīmān na tu mūrkhaḥ kadācana ||

etadvāgīśvarīvidyāṃ vyālikhya(bālamū)rdhani |
karaṃ dattvā japed vidyāṃ śatamaṣṭottaraṃ naraḥ |
so'pi ślokānaśeṣāṃstu karoti vākpatiryathā ||

vīracūḍāmaṇau (-) pāyasaṃ sarvakāryeṣu cottamāni phalāni ca |
nīlotpalasya homena vākpatirjāyate naraḥ ||

hayārikusumairhutvā sarvasiddhiḥ prajāyate |
javākusumahomena kuraṅgākṣī vaśī bhavet ||

mālatyā mahatī prajñā kadambaiḥ kālacandanam |
raktotpalairmahālakṣmīstambhane puṣpacampakam |
vilvapatrāṇi ramyāṇi homayecchāntikarmaṇi ||

kevalaṃ tilahomena sarvapāpaiḥ pramucyate |
dūrvāhomena dīrghāyurvetasairvṛṣṭido bhavet ||

aṣṭadhā nārikelaistu homaṃ kuryāt susādhakaḥ |
gṛhe tasya sthirā lakṣmī rājāno'nucarā iva ||

kadalīphalahomena devī santuṣyate kṣaṇāt |
kapitthairmātuliṅgaiśca sarvarogavināśanam ||

vibhītakena nimbena śatruṃ mārayate kṣaṇāt |
sarpaṣaṃ rājilavaṇaṃ marīcaṃ hiṅgurarkajam ||

<383> māraṇe cābhicāre ca tattaddravyamudāhṛtam |
ekaikaṃ phalapuṣpādi drākṣā caiva tu pañcakam ||

guggulaṃ vadarītulyaṃ kapitthaṃ tu tridhā smṛtam |
caturdhā mātuliṅgaṃ tu śatamātraṃ tilāḥ smṛtāḥ ||

mārīcena pramāṇena candraṃ coraṃ ca kuṅkumam |
sarṣapaṃ rājikaṃ caiva dvātriṃśat tu pramāṇataḥ ||

lavaṇaṃ karṣamātraṃ tu hiṅguṃ guñjācatuṣṭayam |
karṣamātraṃ ghṛtaṃ caiva tadeva dugdhamucyate ||

śuktimātraṃ dadhi cāpi palamātraṃ tu dhānyakam |
triṃśikā caiva dūrvāpi ve(re)tasaṃ dvādaśāṅgulam ||

sarvaistrimadhuropetaiḥ śāntivaśyādisādhane |
kaṭutailaplutairdravyairmāraṇoccāṭanādike ||

kaukkuraṃ rurumāṃsaṃ ca chāgalaṃ mahiṣaṃ tathā |
ayutaṃ homayet kuṇḍe dhane vaiśravaṇo bhavet ||

kapotaṃ gṛdhraṇīmāṃsaṃ ulūkaṃ caiva vāyasam |
kukkuṭaṃ caiva jambūkamabhicāre palaṃ smṛtam ||

vīratantre (-) jihvāyāṃ bhāvayed yastu tāriṇīṃ dīpasannibhām |
bṛhaspatisamastasya kavitā śukranirmitā ||

nīlatantre (-) brāhme muhūrte utthāya kṛtāvaśyaḥ susaṃyataḥ |
jihvāyāṃ bhāvayan vidyāṃ tejorūpāṃ japet sudhīḥ ||
amṛtasyandinī tasya vāṇī sarvavidhā bhavet |
ekavīrākalpe (-) prātarvidyāṃ vibhāvyaiva jihvāyāṃ dīparūpiṇīm |
mātṛkāsahitāṃ vidyāṃ trirāvṛtya jalaṃ pibet ||

jalapānavidhānena mūko'pi sukavirbhavet ||

matsyasūkte (-) jihvāyāṃ cintanādeva trikālajño bhavennaraḥ |
yastu vidyāmabhedena cintayet sādhakottamaḥ ||

jīvanmukto vimuktaśca ante so'pi bhaved dhruvam |
madhunā tarpaṇaṃ devyā sarvakāmaphalapradam ||

aṣṭasiddhikaraṃ sākṣān mahāpātakanāśanam |
haviṣyāśī muktakeśo japedayutamādarāt ||

<384> gadyapadyamayī vāṇī tasya sarvavidhā bhavet |

siddhasārasvate (-) śatābhijaptamātreṇa rocanātilakaṃ naraḥ |
kṛtvā paśyati yaṃ mantrī taṃ kuryād dāsavad vaśam ||

dehasiddhiḥ

matsyasūkte (-)

devyuvāca (-)

bhagavan sarvatattvajña lokānugrahakāraka |
kenopāyena deveśa dehasiddhiḥ prajāyate |
tanme kathaya sarvajña yadi sneho'sti māṃ prati ||

īśvara uvāca (-)

deveśi bhaktisulabhe cauṣadhaṃ kathayāmi te |
na prakāśyamidaṃ kvāpi triṣu lokeṣu durlabham ||

kumārī chatradhārīṃ ca rājamāṣeṇa peṣayet ||

ekavarṇagavāṃ kṣīrai rambhābījarasena ca |
prabhāte lepayedaṅge vaśyasiddhiḥ prajāyate ||

śvetāparājitāmūlaṃ madhunā saha bhakṣayet |
śvetakuṣṭhavināśaśca lepayitvā raverdine ||

aśokasya phalaṃ puṣpameraṇḍasya phalaiḥ saha |
nirmanthayet pūrvadine bhakṣayedapare'hani ||

vātājīrṇabhavo rogastasya dehe na jāyate |
phetkāriṇītantre (-) puṣkariṇyāṃ jale gādhe yaṣṭikāṣṭhaṃ tamograhe |
yatnenānīyate tūrṇaṃ kī (------------------------------) kārayet ||

tenaiva madhunāktena padminīpatramātrake |
likhed vajrāvalīmadhye mūlamantraṃ tu siddhidam ||

amukaṃ kuru māyānte vadet sādhakasattamaḥ |
tatkuṇḍe caturasrai tu nikṣipya juhuyādapi ||

satpatraṃ kṣīranīrāktaṃ padmānāṃ lohitatviṣām |
praṇavaṃ pūrvamuccārya padme yugalameva ca ||

mahāpadme padaṃ brūyāt padmāvati padaṃ tataḥ |
hūṃ hūṃ svāheti mantreṇa yathāpūrvaṃ baliṃ haret ||

evaṃ yaḥ kurute karma sa syād drutakavirdhruvam |
<385> ardharātre tato nityaṃ baliṃ dadyāccatuṣpathe ||

praṇavaṃ pūrvamullikhya hṛllekhāṃ ca tataḥparam |
ekajaṭe padānte tu mahāśabdamudīrayet ||

yakṣādhipadamābhāṣya pataye ca tato mayā |
upanītaṃ padaṃ coktvā baliṃ gṛhṇeti ca dvidhā ||

gṛhṇāpaya dvidhā coktvā mama sarvapadaṃ tataḥ |
śāntiṃ kuru padaṃ caiva paravidyāmanantaram ||

dvidhākṛṣye(tve)ti ca brūyāt truṭa chindhīti ca dvidhā |
sarvādi ca tato jagadvaśamānaya śabdataḥ ||

māyā svāheti mantro'yaṃ balyādau vṛddhisiddhidaḥ |
parasainyagrahāriṣṭa rogakṛtyādināśanaḥ ||

nīlatantre (-) prayoge balimantro'yaṃ prayogān sādhayed yadi |
ardharātre tato(gate) nityaṃ baliṃ dadyāccatuṣpathe ||

parasainyagrahāriṣṭa rogakṛtyā vināśanaḥ |
praṇavaṃ pūrvamuccārya cogratāre tataḥ param ||

vikaṭadaṃṣṭre parapakṣaṃ kṣobha(moha)yadvayamuccaret |
khādayadvayaṃ pacamatha tathā dvayaṃ vadet ||

ye māṃ hiṃsitumudyatāstathā ninditumudyatāḥ |
yoginīcakrasahitaistān nāśaya hūṃ phaṭ svāhā ||

paravidyāmākarṣaya chedaya svāhā kapile gṛhṇa gṛhṇa svāheti | phetkāriṇyām 
(-)

athavā madhulājābhyāṃ jihvāyāṃ bālakasya ca |
nāḍīchedāt tadā pūrvaṃ likheddhemaśalākayā ||

mūlamantraṃ likhen mantrī ya(syo)dvoṣṭhe śvetadūrvayā |
vākyoccāraṇato vālo vāgmī drutakavirbhavet ||

mahogratārākalpe matsyasūkte ca (-)

janmasaṃskārakaṃ sadyaḥ putre jāte praśasyate |
jihvāyāntu likhen mantraṃ yajñadāruśalākayā ||

vāratrayaṃ tu sampūjya dakṣiṇenaiva pāṇinā |
mantramuccārya pratyekaṃ paṅktiṃ kuryāt suśobhanām ||

ādau saṃskāraḥ karttavyastadante vilikhen manum |
<386> gandhacandanapuṣpaiśca pūjayet tāriṇīṃ śivām ||

uttarābhimukho bhūtvā sthāpayet pīṭhamuttamam |
pūjayet tāriṇīṃ devīṃ nānābhakṣaiḥ suśobhanaiḥ ||

kavirvāgmī bhavet putraḥ satyavādī jitendriyaḥ |
kuśamūlena madhunā likhen mantraṃ prayatnataḥ ||

piturbhrātā'thavā mantraṃ māturbhrātā'thavā punaḥ |
pitā vāpi likhen mantraṃ nānya eva kadācana ||

atha bhrātā praśastaśca cāgragaśca bhavet sadā |
tasmād devi nyasen mantraṃ sarvakāmaphalapradam ||

mātuḥ kroḍe tu saṃsthāpya darbhānāstīrya yatnataḥ |
śāntiṃ kuryād bālakasya sādhakaiḥ saha saṃyutaḥ ||

mātuḥ savye tu karṇe ca tatastotraṃ samācaret |

atha stotram

mātardevi namaste'stu brahmarūpadhare'naghe |
kṛpayā hara vighnaṃ me mantrasiddhiṃ prayaccha me ||

māheśi varade devi paramānandarūpiṇi |
kṛpayā hara vighnaṃ me mantrasiddhiṃ prayaccha me ||

kaumāri sarvavidyeśe kaumārakrīḍane pare |
kṛpayā hara vighnaṃ me mantrasiddhiṃ prayaccha me ||

viṣṇurūpadhare devi mahāgaruḍavāhini |
kṛpayā hara vighnaṃ me mantrasiddhiṃ prayaccha me ||

vārāhi varade devi daṃṣṭroddhṛtavasundhare |
kṛpayā hara vighnaṃ me mantrasiddhiṃ prayaccha me ||

śakrarūpadhare devi śakrādisurapūjite |
kṛpayā hara vighnaṃ me mantrasiddhiṃ prayaccha me ||

cāmuṇḍe muṇḍamālāsṛkcarcite vighnanāśini |
kṛpayā hara vighnaṃ me mantrasiddhiṃ prayaccha me ||

mahālakṣmi mahotsāhe mahākṣobhavināśini |
kṛpayā hara vighnaṃ me mantrasiddhiṃ prayaccha me ||

mitimātṛmaye devi mitimātṛbahiṣkṛte |
<387> eke bahuvidhe devi viśvarūpe namo'stu te ||

etat stotraṃ paṭhed yastu karmārambheṣu saṃyataḥ |
vidagdhāṃ vā samālokya tasya vighno na jāyate ||

stutvā japtvā mahāmantraṃ brāhmaṇān bhojayet tataḥ |
devyuvāca (-) jihvāmārjanakaṃ dravyaṃ (rakṣā dehasya(?) kīdṛśī |
putrarakṣā ca kiṃ deva veśmarakṣā kimauṣadham |
śrotumicchāmyahaṃ deva kathyatāṃ madanugrahāt ||

īśvara uvāca (-)

kṛṣṇājayantīmūlaṃ ca apāmārgasya mūlakam |
lepayitvā ca jihvāyāṃ ṣaṣṭhe ca divase sutam ||

śvetāparājitāmūlamarkasya dakṣiṇatvacam |
rakṣādravyaṃ ca jānīyād yajjanmadivase kṛtam ||

vipradārupadmamūlaśuṣkagomuṇḍameva ca |
sthāpayed vāmadeśe ca nāsti kiṃcid bhayaṃ tadā ||

jambūtvacaṃ śimbipatraṃ jātānāṃ dhārayecchire |
rākṣasānāṃ bhayaṃ nāsti rogakṛtyādikaṃ tathā ||

catuṣkoṇe tu gehasya ropayitvā tu pippalam |
bahiḥ saṃsthāpayed dvāre badhnīyācchagalaṃ kapim ||

rambhāmūladvayaṃ rohet ṣaṣṭhe ca divase niśi |
tatraiva sthāpayet khaḍgaṃ brāhmaṇaṃ ca suśobhanam ||

vṛddhāṃ striyaṃ pratiṣṭhāpya śyālaṃ vā vinayānvitam |
jayantyā svarasenaiva kumāraṃ snāpayet tataḥ ||

jayantīghṛtayogena codakena ca secayet |
aṣṭapatre pratiṣṭhāpya sa putro matimān bhavet ||

nāgeśvarasya mūlaṃ ca tvacamānīya yatnataḥ |
cūrṇaṃ kṛtvā ghṛtāktaṃ ca vartikāṃ kārayet tataḥ ||

dīpaṃ kṛtvā tu mantrajñaḥ putranāḍīṃ tu chedayet |
suvinīto bhavet putro medhāvī ca guṇānvitaḥ ||

sthāpayed dvāradeśe ca aśokadakṣiṇatvacam |
etāni sthāpayitvā tu jambutvacaṃ salomakam ||

<388> yaḥ sthāpayet sadā dvāre tasya vighnavināśanam |
niśābhāge trayodaśyāṃ pūjayitvā tu tāriṇīm ||

arkatvacaṃ kare dhṛtvā sparśayet tāriṇīṃ śilām |
kāmamuddiśya yatnena labhate nātra saṃśayaḥ ||

cūtamūlaṃ kare dhṛtvā yaḥ spṛśet tāriṇīṃ manum |
trayodaśyāṃ viśeṣeṇa sarvakāmaphalaṃ labhet ||

sparśamantraḥ

kulluke tāramāre ca paramānandadāyini |
saṃsāre dustare ghore trāhi māṃ parameśvari ||

sarvatā(pā)pavināśe ca sarvapāpavināśini |
citkalājñānarūpe ca trāhi māṃ parameśvari ||

phetkāriṇītantre (-) śmaśānāṅgāramādāya maṅgale vāsare niśi |
kṛṣṇavastreṇa saṃveṣṭya vadhnīyād raktatantunā ||

śatābhimantritaṃ tacca nikṣiped vairiveśmani |
saptāhābhyantare teṣāmuccāṭanamidaṃ mahat ||

narāsthani likhen mantraṃ kṣīrayuktaṃ haridrayā |
sahasraṃ parisaṃjapya niśāyāṃ ravivāsare ||

kṣipyate yasya gehe tu mṛtyustasya trimāsataḥ |
kṣetre tu śasyahāniḥ syād javahānisturaṅgame ||

dhanahānirdhanāgāre grāmamadhye tu tatkṣayaḥ |
dveṣyadveṣakayornāmni tasya dveṣo mahān bhavet ||

atha vīraprayogāḥ

gandharvatantre (-) pṛthvīmṛtumatīṃ vīkṣya sahasraṃ yadi nityaśaḥ |
tadā vādī susiddhāntahataḥ kṣititalaṃ viśet ||

parvate hastamāropya nirbhayo yatamānasaḥ |
kavitāṃ labhate so'pi cāmṛtatvaṃ ca gacchati ||

nīlatantre (-) mahācīnadrumalatāveṣṭitaḥ sādhakottamaḥ |
rātrau yadi japen mantraṃ saiva kalpalatā bhavet ||

tithikrameṇa saṃkhyābhirlatābhirveṣṭito yadi |
tadā māsena siddhiḥ syāt sahasrajapamānataḥ ||

<389> aṣṭamyāṃ ca caturdaśyāṃ dviguṇaṃ yadi japyate |
tadaiva mahatī siddhirdevānāmapi durlabhā ||

mahācīnadrume bījaṃ likhitvā kuṅkumena ca |
tatpārśve sādhyamālikhya tāḍayed dṛṣṭivṛṣṭibhiḥ ||

tatra gacchati kāmārtā yatra tiṣṭhati sādhakaḥ |
mahācīnadrumarasenāktaṃ piṇḍaṃ vidhāya ca ||

yannāmnā dīyate devi so'cirān mṛtyumarhati |
mahācīnadrumasūnasiktābhirvilvapatrakaiḥ ||

sahasraṃ devīmabhyarcya śmaśāne sādhakottamaḥ |
tadā rājyamavāpnoti yadi nā sa palāyate ||

mahācīnadrumalatāveṣṭanena ca yat phalam |
tasyāpi ṣoḍaśāṃśena kalāṃ nārhanti cāpsarāḥ ||

śavāsanādhikaphalaṃ latāgehe praveśanam |
evambhūtaḥ sadā devi sādhako bhuvi durlabhaḥ ||

etatprakāśanād devi mṛtyurbhavati nānyathā |
athavā cādharaṃ dṛṣṭvā athavā stanamaṇḍale |
athavā yonimadhye ca hastaṃ dattvā japen manum ||

ṛtukālaṃ samārabhya yāvadṛtvantaraṃ bhavet |
tāvaj japtvā nirātaṅkaḥ sarvasiddhīśvaro bhavet ||

pheravīye (-) kālikāmantratantroktān prayogāniha cācaret |
atroktamapi tatrāpi prayogān samyagācaret ||

phetkāriṇītantre (-) yoniyugme likhed bhūrje lākṣārasena mantravit |
tanmadhye sādhyasaṃyuktaṃ manurājaṃ likhet tataḥ ||

klībahīnān dīrghavarṇān ṣaṭkoṇe vilikhet tataḥ |
aṣṭapatre cāṣṭavarṇān tadbahirbhūpuradvayam ||

aṣṭavargaṃ bhūpure ca vilikhet sādhakottamaḥ |
svarṇapaṭṭe ca bhūrje vā ropye vāpyatha suvrate ||

vilikheddhemalekhanyā gandhāṣṭakasamanvitam |
dūrvākāṇḍena vā likhyāt kuśamūlena vā punaḥ ||

veṣṭitaṃ pītavastreṇa jatunā pariveṣṭayet |
<390> badhnīyāt paṭṭasūtreṇa śiśūnāṃ kaṇṭhabhūṣaṇam ||

strīṇāṃ vāmabhuje caiva cānyeṣāṃ dakṣiṇe bhuje |
bandhyā tu labhate putraṃ nirdhano dhanavān bhavet ||

eṣā rakṣā purā baddhā jñānārthaṃ gautamādibhiḥ |
jayārthaṃ pārthivaiścānyaiḥ saṃgrāme jayakāṅkṣibhiḥ ||

aṣṭavarṇāniti | vāgbhavaṃ kuladevīṃ ca tārakaṃ vāgbhavaṃ tathā |
hṛllekhā cāstramantrānte vahnijāyāvadhirmanuḥ |
aṣṭākṣaraḥ paraḥ prokto mantrāṇāṃ sāra īritaḥ ||

ityuktamantravarṇānityarthaḥ |

atha yantram

rudrayāmale (-) atha yantraṃ pravakṣyāmi śṛṇuṣva haravallabhe |
trikoṇaṃ vinyaset padmaṃ ṣaṭkoṇapariveṣṭitam ||

aṣṭapatraṃ mahāyantraṃ tritattvaṃ ca tataḥ param |
bhūpuratritayaṃ dadyād vasuśūlasamanvitam ||

kaṇṭhe ṭhaṃ vaṃ samāyuktaṃ dadyād yatnena deśikaḥ |
idaṃ yantraṃ samuddiṣṭaṃ sarasvatyāḥ prasādataḥ ||

patramūle svarayugmaṃ patre vargāṣṭakaṃ smṛtam |
vivare tasya gāyatrīṃ trikoṇe mantravarṇakam ||

sādhyasya nāmasaṃyuktaṃ ṣaṣṭhyantaṃ vilikhet sudhīḥ |
tathā (-) pūrvoktaṃ vilikhet yantraṃ caturdalasamanvitam |
gomaye vā tataḥ kuryāt śuklacandanake'pi vā ||

kāñcanaṃ rajataṃ vāpi vidrumaṃ vā maheśvari |
anyena caiva pūjyena likhed yantraṃ śalākayā ||

caturaṅgulamānena śalākā ca vinirdiśet |
suveśāṃ caiva kurvīta śalākāṃ sumanoharām ||

tataḥ pūrvadale lekhyaṃ hrīṃkāraṃ padmabhājane |
dakṣe strīṃ ca likhed dhīmān paścime phaṃ likhet tataḥ ||

uttare ṭaṃ samuddiṣṭaṃ madhye hūṃ vilikhet sudhīḥ |
idaṃ yantraṃ samuddiṣṭamakṣobhyena sureśvari ||

badhnīyāt paṭṭavastreṇa śiśūnāṃ kaṇṭhabhūṣaṇam |
<391> strīṇāṃ vāmakare dhāryaṃ pusāṃ savyakare tathā ||

bandhyā'pi labhate putraṃ nirdhano dhanamāpnuyāt |
iyaṃ rakṣā purā baddhā jñānārthaṃ gautamādibhiḥ ||

kīrtyarthaṃ pārthivaiścānyaiḥ saṃgrāme jayakāṅkṣibhiḥ |
tryailokye'sya samaṃ nāsti vidyāvākyaviśuddhaye ||

tārākavacam

atha yantrārthaṃ gandharvatantroktakavacaṃ likhyate |

bhairavyuvāca (-)

yad guhyaṃ paramākhyātaṃ tāriṇyāṃ viśvatāraṇam |
tryailokyavijayaṃ nāma kavacaṃ mantravigraham ||

ṣaḍāmnāyānubhirjuṣṭaṃ ṣaṭkaṣaṭkasamanvitam |
sādhakānāṃ hitārthāya kṛpayā vada bhairava ||

bhairava uvāca (-)

śṛṇu devi pravakṣyāmi sādhakānāṃ sukhāvaham |
tryailokyavijayaṃ nāma kavacaṃ mantravigraham ||

yad dhṛtvā bhagavān viṣṇurajayad dānavān muhuḥ |
tapobhirūrjitān vīraḥ saṃharatyacyuto'vyayaḥ ||

sṛṣṭiṃ karoti bhagavān brahmā yasya prasādataḥ |
śivo yasya prasādena avadhīt tripuraṃ purā ||

vṛtraṃ yena jaghānendro gupto vyāhatavikramaḥ |
yenāgnirapi durdharṣo hyajeyo dharmarāḍ yamaḥ ||

niṛtirvaruṇo vāyuḥ kuvera īśvarādayaḥ |
yaddaśāṃśopāsanātaḥ saṃharanti raṇe ripūn ||

yasyopadeśataḥ skandaḥ senānīstridivaukasām |
tārakākhyaṃ jaghānogramanyān daityān sudurmadān ||

yaj jñātvā bhārgavo rāmaḥ kṣatriyānajayad raṇe |
varorjitān mahātejāḥ kālikāṃ cānvatarpayat ||

piśitaiḥ kṣatradehotthaiḥ rudhiraiḥ sagaṇāṃ prabhuḥ |
vyāsādyā ṛṣayo yena bhāratādīn pracakrire ||

vivasvānatitejasvī sarvajño bhagavān bhavaḥ |
<392> jagad vijayate'naṅgo jagadānandakṛcchaśī ||

kalayatyakhilaṃ kālo yasya vīryeṇa bhairavi |
tacchṛṇuṣva mayākhyātaṃ yathoktaṃ śaṅkareṇa ca ||

skandāya suralokānāmaśubhaskandahetave |
tatskandena purā proktaṃ parśurāmāya dhīmate ||

ājñayā śrībhagavataḥ śaṅkarasya mahāprabhoḥ |
tat te vakṣyāmi deveśi yathā labdhaṃ mahātmanā ||

kārttikeyena devānāṃ guptaye samaraiṣiṇā |
ekadā nandane ramye nānāpuṣpairalaṅkṛte ||

kūjatkokilabhṛṅgaugha śikhaṇḍibhirninādite |
padmakairavakalhāra śatapatraśriyojjvale ||

sugandhiśītalānandimandamārutasevite |
divyasiṃhāsane ramye pārijātataroradhaḥ |
niviṣṭaṃ praṇipatyāha ardhanārīśvaraṃ guhaḥ ||

kārtikeya uvāca (-)

deva deva mahādeva bhaktānugrahakāraka |
tvaṃ dhātā tvaṃ pitā nātha tvameva vijayapradaḥ ||

tvaṃ vai gatimatāṃ gamyastvaṃ caitanyaṃ parā citiḥ |
parāparagatistvaṃ vai tvameva śaraṇaṃ vibho ||

bhairava uvāca (-)

itthaṃ vijñāpitaṃ tena girīśaṃ tridaśeśvaram |
vakṣaḥsthale samāsīnā kṛpayovāca pārvatī ||

śrīpārvatyuvāca (-)

bhagavan sarvadeveśa sarvadevārihā vibhuḥ |
tvameva sarvalokeśaḥ sarvasākṣī sanātanaḥ ||

bhavatā devarakṣāyāmabhiṣikto'tibālakaḥ |
kumāraḥ sukumārāṅgaḥ priyo me śikhivāhanaḥ ||

yena gupto jayecchatrūn tadasmai kṣipramādiśa |
yena māyāsurī daivī gāndharvī mānuṣī prabho ||

yakṣavidyādharāṇāṃ ca rākṣasī dānavī tathā |
<393> na bādhante kūṭamāyāśastrāṇyenaṃ tathā kuru ||

bhairava uvāca (-)

itthamabhyarthitaḥ śrīmān śaṅkaraḥ priyayā prabhuḥ |
kṛpayā kavacaṃ prāha caturvargaphalapradam ||

śrīmahādeva uvāca (-)

asti guhyaṃ mahādevi kavacaṃ brahmasammitam |
tāriṇyā brahmarūpiṇyā ugrāpattāraṇaṃ nṛṇām ||

tryailokyavijayaṃ nāma kavacaṃ mantravigraham |
sarvaśaktimayaṃ devi sarvāriṣṭavimardakam ||

sarvakāmapradaṃ sarva vairihṛdayaśoṣaṇam |
oṃ tryailokyavijayasyāsya ṛṣirakṣobhya ucyate ||

chandā'nuṣṭub devatā śrīdevī mattogratāriṇī |
hrīṃ bījaṃ trīṃ parā śaktirhūmasya kīlakaṃ smṛtam ||

amukavijayakāme viniyogaḥ prakīrtitaḥ |
kullukāṃ jānataḥ puṃsaścājñāpālanatatparāḥ ||

brahmaviṣṇumaheśādyāstridaśāḥ sarvasiddhayaḥ |
māheśvarī bhayaṅkaryau nārasiṃhī tathaiva ca ||

kullukāḥ syurmahogrāyāḥ sarvatantreṣu gopitāḥ |
vāsudevo haro brahmā tāriṇī prakṛtiḥ sadā ||

ekamūrtiḥ sadā cintyā ekamūrtistu saṃsthitā |
tāṃ ca śrīmūrtimūrdhādhaḥ saṃyojya madhyadeśataḥ ||

kullukā vividhā caryā pratyekaṃ tryakṣarī sadā |
māheśvarīti vikhyātā śrīmatkullukatāriṇī ||

ūrdhvaṃ rakṣatu sā nityaṃ caturvargaphalāptaye |
mahāmeghaprabhāṃ śyāmāṃ kalābāhusamanvitām ||

khaḍgakartadharāṃ pītavastrāṃ śavāsanāṃ smaret |
praṇavaṃ bhuvaneśānīmanantādyaṃ śivaṃ tathā ||

bindunādasamāyuktaṃ kūrmabījaṃ tadantaram |
namastārāyai sakaladustarāṃstārayadvayam ||

svāhānto'yaṃ bhayaṅkarī śrīmadbhuvanatāriṇī |
<394> śyāmāṃ dvādaśahastāṃ ca raktavastrāṃ śavāsanām ||

khaḍgakartṛdharāṃ nityāṃ saṃsmared hṛdayāmbuje |
kūrcaṃ nṛsiṃhaṃ kroṃ kūrcaṃ lajjāmastraṃ ca kūrcakam ||

nārasiṃhīti vikhyātā śrīmatsaṅkaṭatāriṇī |
śyāmāṃ daśabhujāṃ khaḍgakartṛhastāṃ śavāsanām ||

śuklavastrāṃ sadā dhyāyen mūlādhāranivāsinīm |
oṃ śiro me satataṃ pātu hsauṃ kullukatāriṇī ||

śikhāṃ me pātu kalahrīṃ devī yā brahmatāriṇī |
śiraso dakṣiṇe bhāge hasastrīṃ vajratāriṇī ||

pātu māṃ vāmabhāge tu vaṃ sahūṃ durgatāriṇī |
śirasaḥ paścime bhāge rakṣa phaṭ ugratāriṇī ||

ṣaḍakṣarī kullukeśī vijayānandatāriṇī |
khaḍgāmbhojavarābhītidhāriṇī māṃ sadā'vatu ||

maṇidhari vajriṇi hrīṃ hūṃ trīṃ sarvavaśaṅkari |
pratisare rakṣa rakṣa māṃ hrīṃ hūṃ hūṃ phaṭ svāhayānvitā ||

śikhāgranthisthitā'vyānmāṃ devī śrīmaṇitāriṇī |

oṃ hrīṃ hūṃ kṣrauṃ sarvavighnānutsādaya vidāraya hūṃ phaṭ svāhā 
vighnatārā dikṣu māṃ pātu sarvadā || oṃ hrīṃ strīṃ āḥ surekhe hūṃ 
vajrarekhe ṭhaḥ hūṃ phaṭ svāhā pātu bhuvi prītā māṃ surekhogratāriṇī || 
ityaṣṭau kullukāmantrān vinyasya sādhakottamaḥ | caturaśītibhedāṃstān 
mūlasthān vigrahe nyaset || oṃ śiro me hrīṃ strīṃ hūṃ phaṭ pātu māṃ 
pañcatāriṇī | yā devyekajaṭā nāma tryailokye jāḍyahāriṇī || netrayorhrīṃ 
strīṃ hūṃ pātu nīlā devī trilocanā | bhāle śrīṃ hrīṃ strīṃ haṃ saḥ hūṃ 
phaṭ svāhā bhīmatāriṇī || bhruvormadhyaṃ pātu nityaṃ oṃ hrīṃ haṃsaḥ 
sahrīṃ sahuṃ | phaṭ svāhā jñānatārā yā ajñānendhanadāhinī | oṃ hrīṃ 
haṃsaḥ śrīṃ haṃ saḥ strīṃ hūṃ phaṭ śrīṃ prāṇatāriṇī | pātuṃ māṃ 
nāsikāmadhye sarvāpatkṣayakāriṇī | klīṃ hrīṃ strīṃ hūṃ oṃ klīṃ hūṃ 
phaṭ pātu mohanatāriṇī || mukhapadme'ṅkuśāmbhoja varābhayakarāmbujā | oṃ 
hrīṃ hūṃ phaṭ pātu oṣṭhaṃ lamboṣṭhī viśvamohinī || āṃ hrīṃ aiṃ hūṃ 
hūṃ hasastrīṃ phaṭ ṭa(-)adharaṃ pātu me sadā | anantatāriṇī devī 
bhogamokṣaphalapradā | aiṃ oṃ hūṃ aiṃ strīṃ hrīṃ ph hūṃ ai vāktāriṇī 
parā || māṃ pātu vākpradā devī vacane maṅgalapradā | oṃ tāre strīṃ 
mahātāre hūṃ tāriṇyugratāriṇī | rakṣa rakṣa jagattāre hūṃ phaṭ tāriṇī 
pāhi mām | 
