cāmuṇḍe śavavakṣaḥsthe khaṭvāṅgāyudhadhāriṇi hrauṃ hrīṃ hsauṃ 
bhīṣaṇākhye udīcyāṃ rakṣa māṃ sadā aiṃ hrīṃ śrīṃ ūṃ īṃ laṃ hrīṃ 
oṃ hrīṃ srīṃ strīṃ hūṃ phaṭ namo namo bhagavati mahālakṣmi 
padmāsanasaṃsthite pare padmāyudhadhare oṃ hrīṃ hklīṃ hklauṃ hsaiṃ hastrīṃ 
vibhūtide saṃhārabhairavānande aiśānyāṃ pāhi māṃ sadā | aiṃ haiṃ hauṃ 
hetukaḥ pātu pūrve aiṃ vaṃ hūṃ phaṭ hrauṃ slauṃ saḥ phaṭ āgneye 
tripurāntakaḥ klauṃ hūṃ yāmye aiṃ vaṃ vahnivetālaḥ pātu māṃ bhayād 
dakṣiṇe'vyādagnijihvaḥ aiṃ aṃ kaṃ naiṛta eva me hūṃ hrīṃ kreṃ īṃ kāṃ 
bhrūṃ hrīṃ hūṃ kālākṣaḥ pātu māṃ sadā | vāyukoṇe aiṃ maṃ hūṃ 
matayo bhairavo'vatu | udīcyāṃ eṃ aiṃ hūṃ phaṭ ekapādaḥ sadā'vatu aiṃ 
bhīmā māṃ pātu bhīmavaṭuka aiśānyāṃ pātu māṃ sadā | oṃ tāre tāre 
mahātāre uttāre bhayatāriṇī | oṃ hrīṃ śrīṃ jrīṃ hūṃ kroṃ vaṃ kroṃ laṃ 
vajrāśmāstrāṇi mardaya mardaya drāvaya hrīṃ haḥ kahakaha vimoḍaya 
vimoḍaya hasastrīṃ phaṭ svāhaindrāstrāt pāhi tāriṇī || oṃ tāre vaṃ viśvatāre 
hrīṃ strīṃ vāruṇatāriṇī | vaṃ kroṃ vaṃ kroṃ agnyastrāṇi stambhaya 
drāvaya drutaṃ parivartaya kartayāśu bhrāmayāstraṃ vidāraya saṅkocaya 
chedaya strīṃ sarvaśatrūn vināśāya agnyastrebhyaḥ pāhi māṃ tvaṃ 
vahnistambhanatāriṇī || oṃ hrīṃ tāre mahātāre kāladaṇḍavināśini hūṃ kroṃ 
yaṃ kroṃ hasakroṃ phaṭ daṇḍāstrāṇi nivāraya bhañjaya troṭaya kṣunna 
chindhi chindhi vipāṭayāstraṃ stambhaya stambhaya kṣrīṃ hrīṃ yāmyāstrād 
rakṣa tāriṇī || oṃ klīṃ hrīṃ trīṃ viṣṇutāre sarvāsuravidāriṇi asurāstrāṇi 
sarvāṇi nivāraya vidāraya bhañjaya troṭaya kunte mardaya troṭaya druha 
sarvāsuraprararaṇebhya āḥ surekhe surekhe hūṃ vajrarekhe vidāriṇi kṣāṃ 
kṣīṃ kṣuṃ hrīṃ hūṃ phaṭ hsauḥ kṛtyādrohaṃ praṇāśaya māyāvyūhaṃ 
vidāraya trīṃ trāsini māṃ rakṣa āsurāstrebhya īśvari || oṃ hrīṃ trīṃ hūṃ 
mahātāra hraṃ hraḥ kroṃ vaṃ kroṃ vaṃ kroṃ kṣūṃ kṣauṃ vaṣaṭ jvala jvala 
śūlini kṣrīṃ duṣṭagrahabhayāpahe hūṃ phaṭ svāhā varuṇāstrakṛtyādrohān 
nivāraya śoṣaya kṣobhaya kṣycaṃ phaṭ bhindi bhindi vilopaya āpyadurgā 
āpado'smān duge durge rakṣiṇi phaṭ svāhā māṃ paścime pātu 
śrīdurgottāriṇī tu yā || 
<400> oṃ hrīṃ śrīṃ bhīmatārā yā jñeyā girivarāśrayā | mahākaṭā 
mahāvegā mahādhīrā mahāvalā | hrāṃ hrāṃ sthāṃ sthīṃ  mahocchuṣmā 
vādyastrāṇi vināśaya | dhūṃ dhūṃ dhūmāvati klinne kledaya 
drāvayā'hitān ādhāratāriṇi chindhi samīrāstrāṇi me ripoḥ || oṃ hrīṃ hūṃ 
vajravairocanīye vajratāriṇī hūṃ hūṃ phaṭ svāhā hraiṃ saklīṃ gadāṃ 
cūrṇaya bhañjaya yakṣāstrāṇi yakṣamāyāṃ drīṃ drāvaya drīṃ vimocaya 
udīcyāṃ rakṣa māṃ devi parito vajratāriṇi | oṃ hrīṃ strīṃ klīṃ strīṃ 
kālarudraśaktitattvasvarūpiṇi hraiṃ hrauṃ kṣrauṃ mahātāre tāriṇi 
brahmasvarūpiṇi pracaṇḍe pramathāstrāṇi bhañjaya hrīṃ haḥ khaṇḍaya 
raudrakṛtyāpaśūnugrān pramathān sarparākṣasān 
brahmarākṣasavetālānutsāraya nivāraya rudrāstrebhyaḥ sadā pāhi māṃ tvaṃ 
pracaṇḍatāriṇī || oṃ hrīṃ haṃ saḥ kroṃ oṃ haṃsaḥ chrāṃ sohaṃ kroṃ vaṣaṭ 
hklīṃ saklīṃ hasaklīṃ phaṭ hūṃ strīṃ brahmogratāriṇi drutaṃ 
brahmāstrāṇyupaśāntiṃ tvaṃ naya viśvātmike śive vedoditāḥ kriyāḥ 
sarvāḥ kṛtyādrohaphalapradāḥ | ye māmuddiśya kurvanti tāṃstān hiṃsantu 
hiṃsakān |
pracaṇḍatāriṇī cakrabhītyā krodhāgnidharṣitāḥ || oṃ hrīṃ strīṃ hūṃ 
hasastrīṃ hrīṃ gāṃ gīṃ gūṃ gaiṃ gauṃ gaḥ saḥ phaṭ aiṃ hrīṃ śrīṃ 
hūṃ slūṃ suparṇe kroṃ ambāntāṃ sahauṃ hsauḥ haṃsaḥ sohaṃ 
nāgabāṇān hana saṃhana drāṃ drīṃ hrīṃ clūṃ strīṃ hasastrīṃ khaiṃ 
khaiṃ kṣaḥ tārkṣyatāriṇi viṣasarpabhayāstrāṇi 
saṃharākhilabhītihetināgapāśān saṃharaihi devi śrītārkṣyatāriṇī | iti 
śatrorastradurgaṃ nirākṛtya viśuddhadhīḥ | paṭhedimaṃ mahāmantraṃ 
sarvabhītivināśanam || oṃ hsauṃ vasahūṃ kalahrīṃ hasastrīṃ phaṭ 
narāntramālābharaṇabhūṣite mahākaulini mahābrahmavādini 
mahādhanonmādakāriṇi mahābhogaprade asmadīyaṃ śarīraṃ vajramayaṃ kuru 
kuru durjanān hana hana mahīpālān kṣobhaya kṣobhaya paracakraṃ bhañjaya 
bhañjaya jayaṅkari gaganagāmini yamalavarayūṃ hayamalavarayūṃ 
bhamalavarayūṃ śamalavarayūṃ kṣamalavarayūṃ bhamalavarayūṃ 
hasakṣamalavarayūṃ sahakṣamalavarayūṃ haṃsaḥ sohaṃ hūṃ hrīṃ strīṃ 
hsauṃ drāṃ drīṃ drūṃ trāṃ trīṃ trūṃ tryaiṃ trauṃ traḥ 
śrīmatkullukatāriṇī sarvatra māṃ rakṣa rakṣa svāhā || oṃ hrīṃ strīṃ śrīṃ 
hrīṃ mahādevi aśvārūḍhā jayapradā vāhanāni pātu nityaṃ mama 
sarvārthasādhinī | hrīṃ hraiṃ surekhe devi hūṃ hūṃ phaṭ rathaṃ mamā'vatu 
rāṃ rīṃ rūṃ raiṃ rauṃ raḥ rakṣiṇi hūṃ phaṭ paramānandatāriṇi || oṃ hūṃ 
puṣpaketu rājārhate gatāgatāyai samyaguditāyai sagraharāśinakṣatrāyai 
uditādityamaṇḍalavartinyai nityacaitanyoditāyai hrīṃ trīṃ parajyotistārāyai 
hūṃ phaṭ svāhā hrīṃ jyotistāriṇi klinne kledini me dhvajaṃ sadā rakṣa rakṣa 
vairipakṣān kṣayaṃ kuru namo'stu te || oṃ klīṃ kāmākarṣiṇī māṃ pātu 
sarvārthasādhinī teja ākarṣiṇī buddhyākarṣiṇī jñānākarṣiṇi 
cittākarṣaṇadevī ca mohākarṣakarūpiṇī tapa ākarṣiṇī
<401> śastrākarṣiṇī bhūtākarṣiṇī vāhanākarṣiṇī mantrākarṣiṇī 
kṣetrākarṣiṇī durgākarṣaṇarūpā ca ratnākarṣaṇarūpiṇī || ahaṅkārākarṣiṇī 
ca yogākarṣaṇarūpiṇī | vidyākarṣaṇarūpā ca śraddhākarṣaṇarūpiṇī || oja 
ākarṣiṇī caiva stambhinī mohinī tathā | drāviṇī kṣobhiṇī caiva 
vaśīkaraṇarūpiṇī || ākarṣiṇī sammohinī pañcavāṇeśvarī parā | sarvarūpā 
mahātārā samare pātu māṃ sadā || araṇye prāntare bhīme nirālambe jalaplave | 
varābhayāmbhojahastā pātu māmugratāriṇī || viṣame saṅkaṭe ghore kāntāre 
parvatālaye | khaḍgāmbhojadharā devī pātu māṃ durgatāriṇī || 
siṃhavyāghrasamākīrṇe kānane bhīṣaṇālaye | bhīmadaṃṣṭrā pātu nityaṃ 
khaḍgakharpara dhāriṇī || sabhāyāṃ śāstravāde tu ripusaṃghasamākule | 
muṣṭiyantritahastā māṃ pātu nīlasarasvatī || kharvā pratyālīḍhapadā 
śavāsanagatā śivā | muṣṭihastā smṛtā devī sadyaḥ stambhayate'khilān || 
kṣaratpīyūṣakalikā saumyasmerāmbujānanā | rogebhyaḥ pātu māṃ nityaṃ 
devī yā'mṛtatāriṇī || pramathebhyaḥ piśācebhyo rākṣasebhyo grahādapi | 
brahmarākṣasavetāla kuṣmāṇḍādibhya eva ca || sarvatra rakṣamāṃ devi 
siṃhāsyād bhūtatāriṇī || oṃ pūrvasyāṃ diśi cāgneye dakṣiṇe nairṛte tathā || 
vāruṇe caiva vāyavye kaubere raudragaurave | chidrasthāneṣu sarveṣu 
randhradeśeṣu ca kramāt || kartṛkharpadharā devī pātu māmugratāriṇī | 
sainyāni vāhanānyeva gajāśvādīni me'vatu || ugrāpattāriṇī devī 
sarvamaṅgaladāyinī | gotraṃ mitrāṇi me rakṣa patnīḥ praṇayaśālinīḥ || 
mahogratāriṇī pātu sarvabhītivināśinī || oṃ hūṅkārabījodbhave lolajihve 
bhayaṅkari | kartṛkharpadhare ugre ugratāre namo'stu te | ākāśanilaye tāre 
tryakṣare brahmavādini | siddhānāṃ śuddhide śuddhe namaste cogratāriṇi || 
sarvatra rakṣa māṃ devi bhayebhyaścogratāriṇi | prasādādugratārāyā na māṃ 
hiṃsanti hiṃsakāḥ | oṃ hrīṃ hrīṃ hūṃ strīṃ hasastrīṃ sphura sphura 
hasastrīṃ phaṭ prasphura prasphura strīṃ hrīṃ caṭa caṭa hūṃ hrīṃ śrīṃ 
hasakalarīṃ pracaṭa pracaṭa hūṃ hrīṃ kaha kaha kṣrīṃ kṣīṃ kroṃ hūṃ vama 
vama strīṃ hūṃ me ripūn ghātaya ghātaya hūṃ phaṭ klīṃ kroṃ ṭhaḥ kṣrīṃ 
saḥ hasakṣamalavarayūṃ hasakṣamalavarayīṃ hasakhaphreṃ hsauṃ sahūṃ 
haṃsaḥ sohaṃ hūṃ phaṭ sohaṃ sarvāṅgaṃ me'vatu tāriṇī | pātu me sarvadā 
nityā sarvamantraprabodhinī | bhairavī sundarī kālī mātaṅgī chinnamastakā || 
nīlasarasvatī ceti mantraṣaṭkamudāhṛtam | iti te kathitaṃ vatsa kathitaṃ 
devadurlabham || tryailokyavijayaṃ nāma brahmamantraikavigraham | anena kavacī 
bhūtvā bhāvayannugratāriṇīm | ādhārasthāṃ parāṃ śaktimākucyānīya 
yatnataḥ || ṣaḍaṅgasahitāṃ mūrdhni parānande nimīlya ca | sahajānandajaṃ teja 
ātmābhedena bhāvaya || śivo'haṃ bhairavaścāhaṃ nityānando'hamavyayaḥ | 
<402> saṃharttā'haṃ ripūṇāṃ vai mahogratāriṇī hya(?)ham || sarvaśaktimayo 
brahmarūpo'haṃ tāriṇīmayaḥ | ityātmānaṃ bhāvayastvaṃ mantrāṇyaripu 
yojaya || brahmamantraṃ smaran mantratejobhirujjvalānyapi | brahmantvaviralānyeva 
svaśuṣkānyanalo yathā || brahmamantraiḥ puṭaṃ kṛtvā yo japet tārikāmanum | 
kavacaṃ vā tārikāyāstasya siddhirbhaved dhruvam || oṃ klīṃ hrīṃ aiṃ klīṃ 
sauṃ ka e ī la hrīṃ hasakahalahrīṃ sakalahrīṃ strīṃ aiṃ kroṃ hrīṃ hūṃ 
śrīmadekajaṭe brahmaṣoḍaśīsvarūpiṇi tripurasundari hrīṃ trīṃ hūṃ phaṭ ka e 
ī la hrīṃ strīṃ hūṃ nīlasarasvati mahātāre sarvasiddhiṃ prayaccha oṃ hrīṃ 
klīṃ lauṃ strīṃ phaṭ svāhā |

atha yantram

atha yantravaraṃ vakṣye yad dhṛtvā kavacī bhavet |
ṣaṭkoṇaṃ vinyasedādau madhye mūlaṃ tu vinyaset ||

tāramantargataṃ kuryāt sasādhyaṃ lajjayānvitam |
ṣaṭkoṇe mantraṣaṭkaṃ ca koṇakroḍe ca kullukam ||

kesareṣvaṣṭa tārāḥ syurdale vargāśca sasvarāḥ |
praṇavagrathitān varṇān vāhye tenaiva mudrayet ||

śṛṅkhalāṃ praṇavaiḥ kuryād digdaśānte'tha bījakān |
śeṣān varṇān koṇasaṃsthān śṛṅkhalānteṣu tāriṇīm ||

yojayet tadbahiḥ padmaṃ ṣoḍaśāraṃ tadantataḥ |
kāmavāṇamantravarṇaiḥ kesarāṇi tu veṣṭayet ||

nṛsiṃhakroḍatārārṇairveṣṭayet patramadhyamān |
tadbahiḥ śṛṅkhalā kāryā lajjayā tatra tāriṇīm ||

yojayet pratyarṇabhedaiḥ kalābhirvijayotsukaḥ |
bahiḥ kuryādantapatramabjaṃ prāṇānvitacchadam ||

jayatārābījayuktaṃ tryakṣaraṃ jayaśabdataḥ |
tārābījagarbhitaṃ syājjayabījaṃ nirāmayam ||

kālīmālāmantravarya veṣṭanaṃ kūrcaśṛṅkhalam |
bhūbimbatritayaṃ kuryādādye padmāntakādikān ||

tāropetān koṇabhāge kūrcān kṣārṇān sajātikān |
tadbahirdigastratārān siddhamantramudāhṛtam ||

indrādīnāṃ manūn bāhye kuryāt phaṭkāragarbhitān |
<403> tadbahiḥ kavacaṃ yojyaṃ likhed gandhāṣṭakaiḥ sudhīḥ |
bhūrjatvaci kṛtāvaśyo likheddhemaśalākayā ||

pītakauśeyavastreṇa raktavastreṇa veṣṭayet |
gandhāṣṭakena saṃlikhya lākṣayā veṣṭayet punaḥ ||

svarṇamadhye sthāpayet tat saptāvaraṇasaṃyutam |
devatābhedataḥ pūjyaṃ jīvanyāsapuraḥsaram ||

homaṃ kuryāt trimadhvaktairaṣṭottarasahasrakam |
sahasraṃ tu japet tatra mūlaṃ sādhyasamanvitam ||

guruṃ sampūjya vidhivad gobhūsvarṇāmbarādibhiḥ |
santoṣya tatkarād grāhyaṃ dhārayed yatamānasaḥ ||

ajeyaḥ sarvadevānāmasurāṇāṃ bhaved dhruvam |
idaṃ yantraṃ mahāvīryaṃ śirasthaṃ śavabhītiham ||

bāhusthaṃ jayadaṃ yuddhe kaṇṭhasthaṃ viśvamohanam |
hṛdisthaṃ kāmadaṃ nābhau stambhanaṃ roganāśanam ||

muṣṭisthaṃ dyutakalahe jayadaṃ kāṇḍavāraṇam |
śikhāsthaṃ śastrasaṅghānāṃ vāraṇaṃ nātra saṃśayaḥ ||

yasya mūrdhni mahābāho kavacaṃ brahmasammitam |
ta tasya gātraṃ kṛntanti raṇe śastrāṇi kānicit ||

brahmāstrādīni śastrāṇi taṃ dṛṣṭvā vimukhānyapi |
yānti nivīryatāṃ vatsa satyaṃ satyaṃ vadāmyaham ||

bhairavā yātudhānāśca rākṣasā brahmarākṣasāḥ |
chāyāṃ tasya na laṅghanti kiṃ punastasya vigraham ||

daṃṣṭriṇaḥ śṛṅgiṇaḥ krūrāḥ siṃhavyāghrādayastathā |
taṃ dṛṣṭvā tu palāyante tejasā bhayapīḍitāḥ ||

ta tatpīḍāṃ prakurvanti grahā nāgā surādayaḥ |
siddhagandharvayakṣādyā vidyādharamahoragāḥ ||

kṛtyādrohaṃ tasya kecid ye kurvanti svataḥparaiḥ |
tāṃstāṃneva hi khādanti ugratārāprabhāvataḥ ||

śatrutāṃ tasya ye mūḍhāḥ kurvanti digvidiksthitāḥ |
ātmakopāgninā dagdhāḥ praṇaśyanti sabāndhavāḥ ||

<404> kṛtyādrohāḥ śamaṃ yānti sādhakasyāsya darśanāt |
mucyante rogiṇo rogairviṣamapyamṛtāyate ||

yenedaṃ dhāryate mūrdhnā kavacaṃ cakrasaṃyutam |
taṃ dṛṣṭvā tridaśāḥ sarve praṇamanti sasiddhayaḥ ||

ye kecicchatravastasya ugrā rākṣasamāninaḥ |
patanti pādayostasya ugrākarṣitamānasāḥ ||

sāgarāḥ sthalatāṃ yānti vahnirgacchati śītatām |
girayaḥ samatāṃ yānti tamo bhāsvaratāṃ vrajet ||

pracaṇḍāḥ saumyatāṃ yānti sādhakasyāsya darśanāt |
yaḥ paṭhet kavacaṃ divyaṃ mahogrāyā idaṃ śubham ||

mantrasiddhirbhavet tasya puraśvaryāṃ vinā drutam |
siddhayo'ṣṭau karasthāḥ syurdevīputro'yamīritaḥ ||

dharmārthakāmamokṣāṇāṃ bhājano'yaṃ na saṃśayaḥ |
citādhūmaṃ yasya paśyet kavacī paryaṭan bhuvam ||

so'pi mokṣamavāpnoti kā kathā siddhimāgatāḥ |
yasmin yajñe prayātyeṣa brahmavarmavibhūṣitaḥ ||

darśanāt tṛptimāyānti pitaraḥ sāgnayaḥ surāḥ |
nāriṣṭaṃ tatra durbhikṣaṃ dharmavyatikramo nahi ||

yatrāste kavacī śuddhaḥ sadā japaparaḥ sudhīḥ |
paṭhitvā kavacaṃ yastu puṣpāñjaliṃ dadāti vai ||

namo mahogratārāyai pūjā varṣāyutaṃ phalam |
labhate kena tuṣṭā sā ugrāpattāriṇī śubhā ||

mahāvidyopāsakā ye te paṭhanti śubhecchayā |
anye bhaktyā dhārayantu te cāpnuvanti tatphalam ||

yā striyo bhāgyato labdhvā dhārayanti idaṃ mahat |
kavacaṃ tatprabhāveṇa divyān putrān samāpnuyuḥ ||

sobhāgyaṃ vipulaṃ bhogyamārogyaṃ sarvasampadaḥ |
prāpnuvanti jayaparāḥ sākṣād devīti socyate ||

itīdaṃ kavacaṃ vatsa kathitaṃ tava bhaktitaḥ |
mama prāṇādhikaṃ hyetad goptavyaṃ tat prayatnataḥ ||

<405> rājyaṃ deyaṃ śiro deyaṃ nedaṃ kavacamadbhutam |
na kasmaicit pradātavyaṃ satyaṃ satyaṃ śikhidhvaja ||

tvaṃ me prāṇādhiko yasmād devānāmapi rakṣakaḥ |
ataste gaditaṃ vatsa sāvadhānaṃ tu sādhaya ||

anena kavacī pūrvaṃ tripuraṃ jitavānaham |
tārakākhyaṃ jaghānograṃ saṃharā'nena darpitaḥ ||


śrībhairava uvāca (-)


iti brahmamayaṃ divyaṃ kavacaṃ śaṅkaroditam |
samprāpya kārtikeyastu jaghāna tārakāsuram ||

idaṃ guhyaṃ mayā devi kavacaṃ prakaṭīkṛtam |
gopanīyaṃ prayatnena svayoniriva bhairavi ||

aśvamedhasahasrāṇi rājasūyaśatāni ca |
kavacasya samaṃ naiva ye cā'nye kratukoṭayaḥ ||

brahmahatyāṃ surāpānamagamyāgamanaṃ tathā |
sakṛt smṛtaṃ dahatyāśu yathāgnistūlarāśikān ||

tāriṇyāḥ kālikāyāstu yaḥ kaścit sādhako bhavet |
ajñātvā kavacaṃ hyetanna siddhimadhigacchati ||

api koṭijapenaiva suprītā devatā bhavet |
yathā tārā tathā kālī yā tārā saiva kālikā ||

ubhayornahi bhedo'sti kavacasyāsya dhāraṇe |
triśṛṅkhalamayaṃ divyaṃ kavacaṃ brahmasammitam ||

dhārayed yastu vidhinā gurūpūjāpuraḥsaram |
tasya prītā tāriṇī syāt siddhayastu kare sthitāḥ ||

gobhūhiraṇyavastrādyaiḥ santoṣya gurumātmanaḥ |
gṛhītvā kavacaṃ divyamabhiṣiñcecchivoditaiḥ ||

aghorādyairmahāmantrairāpaduddharaṇena ca |
mūlena ca surāstvādyairguṭikāmabhiṣecayet ||

pañcāmṛtaiḥ pañcagavyaiḥ svarṇādipātramadhyataḥ |
sthāpayitvā'rcayeddhīmānupacārairudāhṛtaiḥ ||

puraścaraṇametasya śatārddhenopapadyate |
<406> yathoktakuṇḍe vihite sthāpayitvā hutāśanam ||

juhuyāt trimadhuyuktairvilvapatraiḥ savajakaiḥ |
aṣṭottarasahasraistu sampātaiḥ secayedidam ||

śāntimantraiḥ samabhyarcya dhārayed yatamānasaḥ |
yad yad vāñchati tat sarvaṃ prāpnotyatra na saṃśayaḥ ||

iti nigaditamādyaṃ tāriṇīvarma divyaṃ
kavacamatisuguptaṃ dhārayed yastu bhaktyā |
śivamaya udagīśo(?) brahmatārāprasādāt
tribhuvanajayalakṣmīstasya hastasthitaiva ||

ityuttaragandharvatantre tārākalpe trailokyavijayaṃ nāma kavacaṃ sampūrṇam |

atha sāmānyato yantralikhanaprakāraḥ

kālike (-) hsauryantrasya jīvaḥ syānmadhyabījādadho nyaset |
hasaḥ sohamiti prāṇaśvaiśānyādikramāllikhet ||

i īṃ netre nyaset pārśve u ūṃ śrotre tathaiva ca |
viśeṣo'ṣṭadalādau tu gāyatrīlekhanaṃ smṛtam ||

ityarṇān yantragāyatryāḥ pratipatraṃ triśo likhet |
agne rekhāvakāśeṣu pratiṣṭhāṃ prāṇadāṃ likhet || iti ||

tantrāntare'pi (-) yantrasya hṛdayaṃ binduyutaṃ ca lekhanaṃ smṛtam |
haṃsaḥ sohaṃ prāṇajīvau yantre lekhyau prayatnataḥ ||

hsaurvisargasaṃyuktau yantrāntarvilikhed budha || iti |

yantragāyatrī yathā (-) yantrarājāya vidmahe varapradāya dhīmahi tanno yantraḥ 
pracodayāditi |

atha yantrasaskāraḥ

vāmakeśvaratantre (-)

bhairavyuvāca (-)

cakrabhedo mahādeva tvatprasādān mayā śrutaḥ |
idānīṃ śrotumicchāmi pratiṣṭhākarmanirṇayam ||

śrīśaṅkara uvāca (-)

śṛṇu devi pravakṣyāmi jagattāriṇi kaulini |
tasyodyāpana karmāṅga sarvavarṇa vinirṇayam ||

snātvā saṅkalpayenmantrī gurorarcanamācaret |
<407> gurumantreṇa vilikhed yantraṃ svarṇaśalākayā ||

pañcagavyaṃ tataḥ kṛtvā śivamantreṇa mantritam |
tatra cakraṃ kṣipenmatrī praṇavena samākulam ||

tasmāduddhṛtya taccakraṃ sthāpayet svarṇapīṭhake |
pañcāmṛtena dugdhena śītalena jalena ca ||

snāpayeccandanenā'pi kastūrīkuṅkumena ca |
hāṭakaiḥ kalaśairdevi aṣṭabhirvāripūritaiḥ ||

kaṣāyajalasampannaiḥ snāpayen mantramuccaran |
tata uttolya tadyantraṃ sthāpayeddhemapātrake ||

yantrarājāya vidmahe mahāyantrāya dhīmahi |
uccaredetadante tu tanno yantraḥ pracodayāt ||

spṛṣṭvā yantraṃ kuśāgreṇa gāyatryā cābhimantrayet |
aṣṭottaraṃ śataṃ devi devatābhāvasiddhaye ||

ātmaśuddhiṃ tataḥ kṛtvā ṣaḍaṅgairdevatāṃ yajet |
tatrāvāhya mahādevīṃ jīvanyāsaṃ ca kārayet ||

phalatāmbūlanaivedyairdevīṃ tatra samarcayet |
paṭṭasūtrādikaṃ dadyād vastrālaṅkaraṇādibhiḥ ||

mukuraṃ cāmaraṃ ghaṇṭāṃ yathāyogyaṃ maheśvari |
sarvametat prayatnena dadyādātmahite rataḥ ||

tato japet sahasraṃ ca sakalepsitasiddhaye |
balidānaṃ tataḥ kṛtvā praṇamed yantrarājakam ||

aṣṭottaraṃ śataṃ hutvā sampātājyaṃ viniḥkṣipet |
hetisampātarītyā tu guruḥ sarvaṃ samācaret ||

gurave dakṣiṇāṃ dattvā yathāśaktyā visarjayet |

atha kāmyabaliḥ

dakṣiṇāmūrtiḥ (-) pūrvāhne balidānaṃ tu kuryād vighnopaśāntaye |
dvividho balirākhyāto rājasaḥ sātviko budhaiḥ ||

rājaso māṃsaraktād yaḥ phalatrayavibhūṣitaḥ |
madhupāyasasaṃyukto madhuratrayalolitaḥ ||

sāttviko māṃsarahitaḥ śeṣamanyat puroktavat |
<408> brāhmaṇo niyataḥ śuddhaḥ sāttvikaṃ balimāharet ||

balihomakriyārthaṃ hi vinā pātraṃ na sidhyati |
annodakaiḥ pūrṇapātraṃ tanmadhye nikṣiped balim ||

narasiṃhapurāṇe (-) ārdrāmalakamānena kuryāddhomahavirbalīn |
tryaipurapaddhatyām (-) balyante chāgalabaliṃ tathā meṣaṃ sureśvari |
pradadyāt sarvakāleṣu sarvakāmārthasiddhaye ||

nitye naimittike kāmye māhiṣaṃ balimāharet |
jayāya sarvakāmāya devīlokāptisiddhaye ||

sarvalakṣaṇasaṃyuktaṃ paśuṃ saṃsnāpya mantrataḥ |
devyagre sthāpayitvā'rghyodakaiḥ saṃprokṣayet tataḥ ||

astramantreṇa saṃrakṣya kavacenā'vaguṇṭhya ca |
mūlamantraṃ samuccārya dhenumudrāmṛtīkṛtam ||

gandhapuṣpākṣataiḥ samyak paripūjyopacārakaiḥ |
karṇe tasya paṭhen mantraṃ paśupāśavimocanam ||

oṃ paśupāśāya vidmahe viprakarṇāya dhīmahi tanno jīvaḥ pracodayāt |
gāyatrīyaṃ samākhyātā paśupāśavimocinī |
imāṃ paṭhed dakṣakarṇe tasya muktiprasiddhaye ||

khaḍgamantraḥ

tataḥ khaḍgaṃ yajen mantrī mantreṇā'nena dakṣataḥ |
tāraṃ ca bhuvaneśānīṃ kāliyugmaṃ samālikhet ||

vajreśvaripadaṃ paścāllohadaṃṣṭrāṃ tataḥ param |
ṅentāṃ hṛd vasuyugmaikasaṃkhyavarṇo manurmataḥ ||

anena gandhapuṣpādyaiḥ khaḍgamabhyarcayed budhaḥ |
tatastasya muṣṭideśe madhye cāgre yathākramam ||

gandhapuṣpākṣatairmantrī mithunatritayaṃ yajet |
vāgīśīsahito brahmā lakṣmīnārāyaṇau tathā ||

umāmaheśvarau ceti saṃproktaṃ mithunatrayam |
tataścā'nena mantreṇa taṃ khaḍgamabhimantrayet ||

khaḍgāyā'suranāśāya śaktikāryāya tatpara |
paśuśchedyastayā śīghraṃ khaḍganātha namo'stu te ||

<409> tatastu tāmrapātrastha kuśākṣatajalādikam |
gṛhītvā mūlamuccārya saṅkalpya paśumutsṛjet ||

gṛhītvā'kṣatatoyādi paśoḥ śirasi saṃtyajet |
tatastenaiva khaḍgena mūlamantreṇa sādhakaḥ ||

paśucchedaṃ prakūrvita svayaṃ devīmanusmaran ||

balimastakapatanaphalam 

dakṣiṇe patite vṛddhirvāmabhāge ca ninditam |
savye tu patite chede devīmantraṃ smared budhaḥ ||

tataḥ kuṇḍādike hutvāhutibhirdaśapañcabhiḥ |
śamayeddhuṃkṛterdoṣaṃ balilakṣaṇalakṣitam ||

śrīkramasaṃhitāyām (-) yatnatastaṃ baliṃ dadyānna hanyādātmanā punaḥ |
na hiṃsedakhilān jantūn na hiṃsed vīravanditān ||

svahastairna baliṃ dadyādato hiṃsāṃ vivarjayet |
yadi hanyāt pramādena rauravaṃ narakaṃ vrajet ||

etatprāyaścittaṃ tu (-) sarvaṃ bhuktvā jagaddhūtvā durgāṃ natvā vimucyate |

grāhyabaliḥ

kālikāpurāṇe (-) sādhakairbalidāneṣu grāhyaḥ sarvasurasya tu |
pakṣiṇaḥ kacchapā grāhyā matsyā navavidhā mṛgāḥ ||

mahiṣo gavayo gāvaśchāgo vabhrūśca śūkaraḥ |
khaḍgaśca kṛṣṇasāraśca godhikā sarabho hariḥ |
śārdūlaśca naraścaiva svagātrarudhiraṃ tathā ||

caṇḍikābhairavādīnāṃ balayaḥ parikīrtitāḥ |
balibhiḥ sādhyate muktirbalibhiḥ sādhyate divam ||

balidānena satataṃ jayecchatrūn nṛpān nṛpaḥ |
matsyānāṃ kacchapānāṃ ca rudhiraiḥ satataṃ śivā ||

māsaikaṃ tṛptimāyāti grāhairmāsāṃstu trīnatha |
mṛgāṇāṃ śoṇitairdevī narāṇāṃ ca viśeṣataḥ ||

aṣṭau māsānavāpnoti tṛptiṃ kalyāṇadā ca sā |
gogodhikānāṃ rudhirairvārṣikīṃ tṛptimāpnuyāt ||

kṛṣṇasārasya rudhiraiḥ śūkarasya ca śoṇitaiḥ |
<410> prāpnoti satataṃ devī tṛptiṃ dvādaśavārṣikīm ||

ajāvikānāṃ rudhiraiḥ pañcaviṃśativārṣikīm |
mahiṣāṇāṃ ca khaḍgā(chāgā)nāṃ rudhiraiḥ śatavārṣīkīm ||

tṛptimāpnoti paramāṃ śārdūlarudhiraistathā |
siṃhasya sarabhasyā'tha svagātrasya ca śoṇitaiḥ ||

devī tṛptimavāpnoti sahasraṃ parivatsarān |
māṃsairapi tathā tṛptī rudhirairyasya yāvatī ||

kṛṣṇasārasya māṃsena tathā khaḍgena caṇḍikā |
varṣān pañcaśatānyeva tṛptimāpnoti niścitam ||

rohitasya tu matsyasya māṃsairvārdhrīṇasasya ca |
tṛptimāpnoti varṣāṇāṃ śatāni trīṇi caṇḍikā ||

nīlagrīvo raktaśīrṣaḥ kṛṣṇapādaḥ sitacchadaḥ |
vārdhrīṇasaḥ syāt pakṣīśo devyāḥ śambhorapi priyaḥ ||

nareṇa balinā devī sahasraṃ parivatsarān |
tṛptimāpnoti kāmākhyā bhairavo mama rūpadhṛk ||

mantrapūtaṃ śoṇitaṃ ca pīyūṣaṃ jāyate sadā |
mastakaṃ cāpi tasyātti māṃsaṃ cāpi sadā śivā ||

tasmāt tatpūjane dadyād baleḥ śīrṣaṃ ca lohitam |
amantrapūtaṃ yad dattaṃ dātuḥ sarvavināśakṛt ||

bhojye home ca māṃsāni niyu~jīyād vicakṣaṇaḥ |
pūjāsu nāma māṃsāni dadyād vai sādhakaḥ kvacit ||

ṛte tu lohitaṃ śīrṣamamṛtaṃ tat tu jāyate |
kuṣmāṇḍamikṣudaṇḍaṃ ca madyamāsavameva ca ||

ete ca balayaḥ proktāstṛptau chāgasamāḥ smṛtāḥ |
candrahāsena kartryā vā chedanaṃ mukhyamucyate ||

dātrāsi dhenu krakaca śaṅkulābhistu madhyamam |
(asidhenuḥ svalpakhaḍgaḥ śaṅkulā vakrakartarī ||)

kṣurakṣuraprabhallaiścaivā'dhamaṃ parikīrtitam |
ebhyo'nyaiḥ śaktibāṇādyairbaliśchedyaḥ kadāpi na ||

nātti devo baliṃ taṃ tu dātā mṛtyumavāpnuyāt |
<411> hastena chedayed yastu prokṣitaṃ sādhakaḥ paśūm ||

pakṣiṇaṃ vā brahmahatyāṃ samāpnoti suduḥsahām |
nāmantrya khaḍgaṃ tu baliṃ niyuñjīta vicakṣaṇaḥ ||

khaḍgasyāmantraṇe mantrā yāvantaḥ kathitāḥ purā |
mahāmāyābalau te vai yojyāstatroditā budhaiḥ ||

khaḍgamantraḥ

dviḥ kālīti tato devyā vajreśvaripadaṃ tathā |
tato'nu lohadaṇḍāyai namaḥ śeṣe niyojayet ||

sampūjyā'nena mantreṇa khaḍgamādāya pāṇinā |
kālarātryāstu mantreṇa taṃ khaḍgamabhimantrayet ||

netrabījasya madhyaṃ tu dvirāvṛtya prayojayet |
tatastu kālīkālīti vikaṭadaṃṣṭre karālini ||

hāntādīnāṃ tṛtīyena svareṇaikādaśena vai ||

yojito nādabindubhyāṃ dvau tatpaścān niyojayet |
phetkāriṇipadaṃ paścāt khādaya chedayeti ca |
sarvaduṣṭāniti tato dvirmāraya lulāpakam ||

khaḍgena chindhi chindhīti tataḥ kila kileti vai |
tataściki cikītyevaṃ tataḥ piva pibeti ca ||

tato ruṃ rudhiraṃ ceti sphauṃ sphauṃ kirikirīti ca |
kālikāyai nama iti kālarātryāstu mantrakam ||

ityanena tu mantreṇa karavāle'bhimantrite |
kālarātriḥ svayaṃ tasmin prasīdatyarihānaye ||

tato devatāmuddiśya kāmamuddiśya cātmanaḥ |
chedayet tena khaḍgena baliṃ pūrvamukhaṃ tu tam ||

atha uttaravaktraṃ taṃ svayaṃ pūrvānanastathā |
pūrvoktān saindhavādīṃśca rakte tasya niyojayet ||

uttarābhimukho bhūtvā baliṃ pūrvamukhaṃ tathā |
nirīkṣya sādhakaḥ paścādimaṃ mantramudīrayet ||

paśustvaṃ balirūpeṇa mama bhāgyādupasthitaḥ |
praṇamāmi tataḥ sarvarūpiṇaṃ balirūpiṇam ||

<412> caṇḍikāprītidānena dāturāpadvināśanam |
cāmuṇḍābalirūpāya bale tubhyaṃ namo'stu te ||

yajñārthe paśavaḥ sṛṣṭāḥ svayameva svayambhuvā |
atastvāṃ ghātayāmyadya tasmād yajñe badho'vadhaḥ ||

imaṃ dehaṃ parityajya bhūtvā devavapurdharaḥ |
modasva pramathaiḥ sārddhaṃ yāvadindrāścaturdaśa ||

aiṃ hrīṃ śrīṃ iti mantreṇa taṃ baliṃ mastyarūpiṇam |
cintayitvā nyaset puṣpaṃ tasya mūrdhani bhairava ||

tato devīṃ samuddiśya kāmamuddiśya yatnataḥ |
abhiṣicya tataḥ paścāt karabālaṃ prapūjayet ||

dhyānaṃ yathā (-) kṛṣṇaṃ pinākapāṇiṃ ca kālarātrisvarūpiṇam |
raktākṣaṃ raktavastraṃ ca sapāśaṃ pītaśoṇitam ||

oṃ asirviśasanaḥ khaḍgastīkṣṇadhāro durāsadaḥ |
śrīgarbho vijayaścaiva dharmapālanamo'stu te ||

pūjayitvā tataḥ khaḍgaṃ āṃ hūṃ phaḍiti mantrakaiḥ |
gṛhītvā vimalaṃ khaḍgaṃ chedayed balimuttamam ||

oṃ hrīṃ aiṃ hrīṃ śrīṃ kauśiki rudhireṇāpyāyatāmiti |
pātre niyojayedraktaṃ śirasi ca pradīpakam |
evaṃ dattvā baliṃ pūrṇaṃ phalaṃ prāpnoti sādhakaḥ ||

hīnaṃ tu syāddhīnatāyāṃ niṣphalaḥ syād viparyayāt |
balidāne tu durgāyāḥ sarvatrā'yaṃ viniścayaḥ ||

balipātranirūpaṇaṃ

sauvarṇaṃ rājataṃ tāmraṃ raityaṃ patrapuṭaṃ tathā |
māheyaṃ kāṃsyamathavā yajñakāṣṭhamaya ca vā ||

pātraṃ rudhiradānāya karttavyaṃ vibhavāvadhi |
na lauhe vālkale vāpi na trapau nāpi sīsake ||

dadyādraktaṃ valīnāṃ tu bhūmau sruci sruve'thavā |
na ghaṭe bhūtale nāpi na kṣudre pāna bhājane ||

rudhirāṇi pradadyāt tu bhūtikāmo narottamaḥ |
hayamedhamṛte dadyānna kadācid baliṃ hayam ||

<413> tathā dikpālamedheṣu gajaṃ dadyānnarādhipaḥ |
na kadācit tathā devyai pradadyāddhayahastinau ||

siṃhaṃ vyāghraṃ naraṃ vāpi svagātrarudhiraṃ tathā |
na dadyād brāhmaṇo madyaṃ tathā devyai kathañcana ||

siṃhavyāghranarān dattvā brāhmaṇo narakaṃ vrajet |
ihāpi syāt sa hīnāyuḥ sukhasaukhyavivarjitaḥ ||

svagātrarudhiraṃ dattvā cātmahatyāmavāpnuyāt |
madyaṃ dattvā brāhmaṇastu brāhmaṇyādeva hīyate ||

na kṛṣṇasāraṃ vitared baliṃ tu kṣatriyādayaḥ |
dadataḥ kṛṣṇasārāṃstu brahmahatyāmavāpnuyāt ||

prabhūtabalidāne tu dvau vā trīn svāgrataḥ kṛtān |
pūjayet pramukhān kṛtvā sarvān tantreṇa sādhakaḥ ||

dadyācca mahiṣaṃ devyai bhairavyai bhairavāya ca |
anenaiva tu mantreṇa tathā taṃ pūjayed balim ||

yathāvāhaṃ bhavān dveṣṭi yathā vahasi caṇḍikām |
tathā mama ripūn hiṃsa śubhaṃ baha lulāpaka |
yamasya vāhanaṃ tvaṃ tu bahurūpadharā'vyaya |
āyurvittaṃ yaśo dehi kāsarāya namo'stu te ||

anyebhyo'pi ca devebhyo devyai yad yat pradīyate |
tadā'rcitaṃ pradadyāt tu pūjitāya surāya vai ||

niṣiddhabaliḥ

kāṇaṃ vyaṅgaṃ cātivṛddhaṃ rogiṇaṃ ca galabraṇam |
klīvaṃ hīnāṅgamathavā vṛddhaliṅgaṃ galatkapha(dvraṇa)m ||

śvitriṇaṃ cātihrasvaṃ ca mahāpātakinaṃ tathā |
paśūnāṃ pakṣiṇāṃ cāpi narāṇāṃ ca viśeṣataḥ ||

striyaṃ na dadyāt tu baliṃ dattvā narakamāpnuyāt |
na ca tripakṣakān nyūnaṃ pradadyād vai patatriṇam ||

kāṇavyaṅgādiduṣṭaṃ vai na paśuṃ na patattriṇam |
chinnalāṅgulakarṇādi bhagnaśṛṅgaṃ tathaiva ca ||

bhagnadantādikaṃ cāpi na dadyāt tu kadācana |
<414> siṃhaṃ ca dakṣiṇe dadyān mahiṣaṃ vitaret puraḥ ||

pakṣiṇaṃ vāmato dadyādagrato dehaśoṇitam |
kravyādānāṃ paśūnāṃ ca pakṣiṇāṃ ca śiro'sṛjam ||

vāme nivedayet pārśve jalajānāṃ tu sarvaśaḥ |
kṛṣṇasārasya kūrmasya khaḍgasya śaśakasya ca ||

grāhāṇāmatha matsyānāmagra eva nivedayet |
pṛṣṭhadeśe na dadyāt tu śiro vā rudhiraṃ valeḥ ||

mahākālasaṃhitāyām (-)

kṛṣṇasāraṃ tathā chāgaṃ mṛgādānāṃ vidhānapi |
meṣaṃ ca mahiṣaṃ ghṛṣṭiṃ tathā pañcanakhānapi ||

kapotaṃ ṭiṭṭimaṃ haṃsaṃ cakravākaṃ ca lāvakam |
śarāli tittirimatsyān kalaviṅkaṃ ca pheravam ||

anuktaṃ naiva dātavyaṃ dvijavargaṃ kadācana |
siṃhaṃ vyāghraṃ naraṃ tadvat kṣatriyaḥ parikalpayet ||

vihāya kṛṣṇasāraṃ ca kṣatriyāderbhaved baliḥ |
siṃhaṃ vyāghraṃ naraṃ dattvā brāhmaṇo brahmahā bhavet |
mūṣaṃ mārjārakaṃ cāṣaṃ śūdro dattvā patatyadhaḥ ||

candrahāsena khaḍgena hanyādekaprahārataḥ |
utthāya hananaṃ kuryān nopaviśya kadācana ||

svahastena paśuṃ hattvā paśuyonimavāpnuyāt |
kiṃ ca tripakṣato nyūnaṃ mahiṣādīṃstrivarṣataḥ ||

anyaṃ trimāsato nyūnaṃ na dadyācca kadācana |
vṛddhaṃ vā vikṛtāṅgaṃ vā na kuryād balikarmaṇi ||

svagātrarudhiraṃ dātuṃ kṣatriyāderbhaved vidhiḥ |
sāttviko jīvahatyāṃ hi kadācidapi no caret ||

ikṣudaṇḍaṃ ca kuṣmāṇḍaṃ tathā vanyaphalādikam |
kṣīrapiṇḍaiḥ śālicūrṇaiḥ paśuṃ kṛtvā cared balim ||

tattatphalaviśeṣeṇa tattatpaśumupānayet |
kūṣmāṇḍaṃ mahiṣatvena chāgatvenaiva karkaṭīm ||

[iti mahāmahopādhyāya ṭhakkura śrīnarasiṃha viracite tārābhakti sudhārṇave 
kāmyavidhirnāma daśamastaraṅgaḥ] || 10 ||


[ekādaśastaraṅgaḥ]

atha tārābhedāḥ

brahmasaṃhitāyām (-) vidyā bahuvidhā vakṣye śṛṇuṣvaikamanā mune |
parvate ujjaṭe vāpi nirjane vā catuṣpathe ||

jalāvarte daṃṣṭribhaye rājādibhaya āgate |
nagare haṭṭake vāpi mahāvṛkṣataleṣu ca ||

nadītīre vyālabhaye vṛścikādibhayeṣu ca |
japed bahuvidhānetān bhayamāśu vināśayet ||

parvate vigatiṃ yāti imaṃ mantramudīrayan |
oṃkāraṃ ca samuddhṛtya bhaye mahābhaye tataḥ ||

ramābījaṃ vahnijāyā daśākṣarīmanūttamam |
mūlavidyāṃ puro japtvā imaṃ mantraṃ tataḥ param ||

ugratārāprasādena parvate viharen mudā |
ujjaṭe ca bhaye jāte imaṃ mantraṃ śataṃ japet ||

oṃkārabījamuddhṛtya vikaṭe ca tataḥ param |
śīghraṃ vighnaṃ tataḥ paścānnāśayadvitayaṃ tataḥ ||

svāheti ca tataḥ paścād daśakṛtvo japen manum |
imāṃ vidyāṃ ca daśadhā cānte mūlamanuṃ daśa ||

ekajaṭāprasādena ujjaṭe viharen mudā |
nirjane ca bhaye prāpte japed vidyāṃ daśākṣarīm ||

kālīti ca samuddhṛtya mahākāli tataḥ param |
oṃ oṃ svāheti ca tato mantro'yaṃ sarvasiddhidaḥ ||

mahāvidyāṃ pravakṣyāmi anuttaramanūttamam |
yasyāḥ sādhanamātreṇa vaśyo bhavati cāparaḥ ||

ṛṣirvākstambhako devaśchando nivṛttathaiva ca |
devatānuttaraḥ proktaḥ śivo'hamityudīritam ||

tatra pūjāṃ vidhāyādau saptalakṣaṃ japen manum |
tasya darśanamātreṇa vairiṣvindra ivā'paraḥ ||

<416> daśadaśaguṇaṃ japtvā rocanātilakaṃ yadi |
rājāno'pi ca dāsatvaṃ kiṃ punaḥ kṣudramānuṣāḥ ||

parvate vipine durge vighnaṃ ca yadi jāyate |
kṣaṇaṃ dhyātvā manu japtvā naro gacched yathāsukham ||

śṛṇu vipra mahāguhyaṃ guhyād guhyataraṃ param |
yena vijñānamātreṇa satvaraṃ sukhadāyakam ||

ratiyogāt sadā jāpyaṃ mahāpātakanāśanam |
kevalaṃ kulayogena prasannā mokṣadāyinī ||

dhanārthī prajaped vidyāṃ parayoṣitsamāgame |
vidyārthī prajaped vidyāṃ kulīnāśrayameva vā ||

viparītaratāsakto bhavecca hṛdayopari |
tasyā haste sadā kāryaṃ pūjādravyaṃ samucchritam ||

makārapañcakairyuktaṃ dadyād devyairviśeṣataḥ |
pañcadravyavihīnena na sidhyati kadācana ||

kulayogavihīnena tārāmantraṃ na sidhyati |
etadrahasyamatulaṃ saṃkṣepād gaditaṃ mayā ||

etatprakāreṇa tārāṃ yo daśavārān japet sudhīḥ |
ugratārāprasādena nirjane ca sukhī bhavet ||

catuṣpathabhaye vidyāṃ japedaṣṭādaśākṣarīm |
praṇavaṃ pūrvamuddhṛtya mathayugmaṃ tataḥ param ||

sphoṭa sphoṭa tatastūktvā mahāmaheśvarīti ca |
svāhānte praṇavaṃ dadyād daśavārān japet sudhīḥ ||

catuṣpathanivāsinīmugratārāsvarūpiṇīm |
ugratārāprasādena catuṣpathe bhayaṃ na hi ||

prajapecchamanīṃ tārāṃ rakṣiṇī sarvasiddhidām |
praṇavaṃ pūrvamuddhṛtya tāre tutāre ture ca ||

tataḥ svāheti mantro'yaṃ mayā prokto daśākṣaraḥ |
tatkṣaṇāt smaraṇādeva bhayamāśu vināśayet ||

jalād bhayaṃ bhavennaiva ugratārāprasādataḥ |
daṃṣṭriṇāṃ bhayamutpanne dṛḍhaṃ bhūtvā japen manum ||

<417> praṇavaṃ pūrvamuddhṛtya ugratāre tataḥ param |
māṃ tāraya tāraya svāhā daśavārān japen manum ||

daṃṣṭribhayāt samuttīrya ugratārāprasādataḥ |
yadi rājabhayāpattistadā vidyāṃ japet sudhīḥ ||

praṇavaṃ pūrvamuddhṛtya ramābījaṃ tataḥ param |
sarvavaśaṅkari svāhā vedādyaṃ triguṇīkṛtam ||

sarvasammohinī svāhā ekaviṃśatimeva ca |
japed dvādaśavārāṇi rājā vaśyaśca tatra vai ||

nagare yadi bhayaṃ vindyādimaṃ mantramudīrayet |
kāmabījaṃ samuccārya praṇavaṃ svāhayā yutam ||

japed vidyāṃ daśakṛtvastatkṣaṇād bhayanāśanam |
haṭṭake vigatiṃ yāti kāmabījaṃ tato japet ||

prajaped daśavārāṇi bhayamāśu vināśayet |
mahāvṛkṣatale jñātibhayaṃ yadi pramādataḥ ||

makāraṃ bindunā yuktaṃ pañcavāraṃ japet sudhīḥ |
bhayaṃ nāśayate tatra devīputrastu jāyate ||

nadītīre ca kugatiṃ japed vidyāṃ tathā śuciḥ |
praṇavaṃ vāyubījaṃ ca kāmabījaṃ trapātmakam ||

ante vahnivadhūṃ dadyād daśakṛtvo japen manum |
vyālaṃ dṛṣṭvā yadi bhayaṃ darpadṛṣṭirjapen manum ||

vyālavyālaṃ samuccārya garuḍāya tataḥ param |
svāhā svāheti vaktavyaṃ vyālabhītirna jāyate ||

vṛścikālokanāt trāse japen mantramananyadhīḥ |
sadā oṃkārān japtvā tu tat sthāne karamardanam ||

dūrībhavati tatsarvaṃ sarveśvarīprasādataḥ |
etanmantrāṇi sarvāṇi japedayutamātrayā ||

tena vīryavatī vidyā viniryāt tajjapaṃ vinā |
tathā (-) rājavaśyakarā mantrāḥ karivaśyakarāstathā ||

lulāpa khara śārdūlavaśyā mantrāḥ prakāśitāḥ |
siddhimantrastu tārāyāḥ kathito bhuvi durlabhaḥ ||

<418> dhanurvidyāvaśyamantraṃ khaḍgavaśyaṃ tathaiva ca |
śastranivāriṇī vidyā kāṇḍanivāriṇī tathā |
agnistambhaṃ vairistambhaṃ jalasthabhaṃ yathāvidhi |
śrīmadekajaṭā devī sarvasiddhipradāyinī ||

unmattakariṇo bājikarṇapuṭe japed yadi |
tatkṣaṇaṃ vaśyatāṃ yāti cūrṇakumbhasamo bhavet ||
kaṅkālīti ca vaktavyaṃ guhyakālī vadet tataḥ |
oṃ kāli svāheti mantraṃ tathā yathā daśāvadhi ||

vatsalohikarī (?)yasmāddhastaṃ dattvā śiropari |
ayutaṃ ca japaṃ kṛtvā sarvaguṇānvito bhavet ||

pañcāntakaṃ binduyutaṃ gaṇeśvarāya tataḥ param |
evaṃkarī sthirīkṛtya oṃ oṃ svāheti taddvidhā ||

gajavaśyakamantro'yaṃ rājaputrapriyaṅkaraḥ |
mahiṣaṃ mahattaraṃ dṛṣṭvā mudrāṃ baddhvā tu aṅkuśam ||

agre bhūtvā manuṃ japtvā vaśyaṃ yāti dine dine |
oṃkāraṃ bījamuddhṛtya śivāyeti tataḥparam ||

durge durge tataḥ paścādagnijāyāntako manuḥ |
ṣaḍvāraṃ prajapen mantraṃ siddhireva na saṃśayaḥ ||

kharaśca dṛṣṭimātreṇa svāheti ca japen manum |
svarasya yāti vaśatāṃ siddhiśca nānyathā bhavet ||

śārdūladarśamātreṇa japet kālīmahāmanum |
daśavāraṃ japed vidyāṃ bhayamāśu vināśayet ||

kārmukasiddhiprakāraḥ

athātaḥ saṃpravakṣyāmi dhanurmantraṃ viśeṣataḥ |
kārmukasya madhyadeśe kāmabījaṃ likhet tataḥ ||

pūjayet kāmabījaṃ sadgandhapuṣpaiśca dhūpakaiḥ |
iṣvagre praṇavaṃ lekhyaṃ madhye māyāṃ likhet tataḥ ||

ante vahnivadhūṃ dadyāt pūjayecca yathāvidhi |
evaṃ vidhikrameṇaiva māsamekaṃ prapūjya ca ||

māsānte ca baliṃ dattvā kare dhṛtvā tu kārmukam |
<419> yasyoddeśe kṣipyate tu yadgātre patati khalu ||

brahmāstrasya samo bhūtvā tiṣṭhed bāṇaḥ sakārmukaḥ |

khaḍgasiddhiprakāraḥ

aṣṭalohaṃ samāhṛtya khaḍgaṃ kṛtvā tu niścitam |
tanmadhye ca likheccakraṃ ramyaṃ vasudalātmakam ||

ṣaṭkoṇaṃ madhyadeśe tu tatra bījaṃ samālikhet |
bījaṃ kāmakalāyuktaṃ pakṣamātraṃ japen manum ||

japānte tu śmaśāne ca nikhanen madhyadeśake |
ayutaṃ tatra saṃjapya khaḍgasiddhistato bhavet ||

khaḍgaṃ dhṛtvā tu vaktavyaṃ vairiskandhaṃ dvidhā kuru |
evamuktvā tu khaḍgaṃ vai muñcecchatrupradeśake ||

chitvā chitvā punaśchitvā punarāyāti kaulikam |

astranivāriṇī vidyā

astranivāraṇīṃ vidyāṃ kathayāmi mahāmune |
hṛllekhāṃ caramāṃ śaktiṃ kāmaṃ vahnivadhūṃ tathā ||

ṭhāntatrayaṃ binduyutaṃ praṇavādyena saṃyutam |
catuṣpathasya rajasā mantritaṃ gātrabhūṣitam ||

evaṃ kṛtvā dṛḍho bhūtvā parāstreṇa na bādhyate |
imāṃ vidyāṃ japitvā tu śrībījādau yadā bhavet ||

rajasā pāṭalaṃ gātraṃ kāṇḍanivāraṇī tathā |
likhitvā svakare mantraṃ muṣṭibandhaṃ tu kārayet ||

stambhayatyāśu sarvāṇi yāvan muṣṭiṃ na muñcati |
agniṃ jalaṃ vairiṇaṃ ca eṣa stambhavidhiḥ paraḥ ||

ekajaṭāprasādena mahāsiddhīśvaro bhavet |
ugratārāprasādena siddhayo'ṣṭau bhavanti hi ||

mahānīlaprasādena vāṇī prasaratā bhavet |
haṃsatārāprasādena vairipakṣakṣayaṅkarī ||

bījakhaṇḍāprasādena rājavallabhatāṃ vrajet |
ugrajaṭāprasādena hṛṣṭiḥ puṣṭiḥ prajāyate ||

<420> śrīvajriṇīprasādena vajradeho bhaviṣyati |
mahākālīprasādena guṭikā caiva sidhyati ||

mahāghorāprasādena nānāvidyā prasiddhyati |
mūlavidyā japitvā tu etāṃ vidyāṃ japed yadi ||

sarvasiddhipariprāptirdevavad viharet bhuvi |

atha mahāmantrāḥ

māyātantre (-)

śrībhagavānuvāca (-)

atha tārāmanūn vakṣye bhuktimuktiphalapradān |
yasya smaraṇamātreṇa jagad vaśyaṃ bhaved dhruvam ||

tārā cogrā mahogrā ca vajrā nīlā sarasvatī |
kāmeśvarī bhadrakālī ityaṣṭau tāriṇī smṛtā ||

uṣmavarṇagato jīvo nigamasvarasaṃyutaḥ |
nādabindusamākrāntastatvaraśmisamanvitaḥ ||

kapilā vāmakarṇaśca nādādyaṃ binduśekharam |
pārśvāntyaṃ ca tathā āntaṃ śavārṇaṃ parikīrtitam ||

jīvo hakāraḥ | ūṣmavarṇo rephastadgataḥ | nigamasvaraḥ īkāraḥ | etena 
bhuvaneśvarībījam | tattvaraśmiśabdena vadhūbījamucyate | kapilā hakāraḥ | 
vāmakarṇo dīrgha ukāraḥ | etena kūrcabījam | pārśvaḥ pakāraḥ | tadantyaḥ 
phakāraḥ | antaṣṭakāraḥ | tena phaḍiti siddham |

madhyādimāyākavacaṃ dvitīyaṃ mantramuttamam |
viparītaṃ tridhā jñeyaṃ kūrcādyaṃ ca turīyakam ||

māyādikavacāntaṃ ca pañcamaṃ parikīrtitam |
māyāmadhyagataṃ ṣaṣṭhaṃ dvitīyāntyaṃ ca saptamam ||

aṣṭamaṃ kavacamadhyaṃ syādevaṃ bhedāṣṭakaṃ bhavet |
tryakṣarasya viśeṣo'yaṃ phaṭo yatra na tatra vai ||

jape tu tryakṣaraṃ jñeyaṃ nyāse sarvaṃ pratiṣṭhitam |

tridheti tṛtīyāmityarthaḥ |

ṛṣiḥ syādaṣṭakaśchando hyanuṣṭub devatā tathā |
śambhupatnī maheśāni caturvargeṣu yo japet ||

kālalakṣaṃ japen mantramevamuktena vartmanā |
<421> dhyānapūjādikaṃ sarvaṃ pūrvavat samupācaret ||

kālalakṣaṃ ṣaḍlakṣam | bhairavatantre (-)

vedādyaṃ caiva lajjāṃ ca vadhūkūrcaṃ namo'nvitam |
tārā ṣaḍakṣarī vidyā sarvatantreṣu gopitā ||

kūrcaṃ māyāṃ vadhūṃ caiva punaḥ kūrcaṃ ca phaṭyutam |
eṣā vidyā mahāvidyā bījatārā prakīrtitā ||

kāmaṃ lajjāṃ ca strībījaṃ kūrcabījaṃ tathāhi phaṭ |
eṣā hi paramā vidyā sarvakāmapradāyikā ||

praṇavaṃ caiva lajjāṃ ca kūrcayugmaṃ namo'nvitam |
eṣā ṣaḍakṣarī vidyā sarvatantreṣu gopitā ||

vāgbhavaṃ prathamaṃ devi bālāyāśca tṛtīyakam |
vedādyaṃ vāgbhavaṃ devi kāmaṃ ca svāhayā yutam ||

eṣā tvaṣṭākṣarī vidyā brahmavidyā prakīrtitā |
bījamantrāḥ svatantrāḥ syustāriṇyāḥ sarvasiddhidāḥ ||

ete bhedā mahogrāyāḥ puruṣārthapravartakāḥ |
āyuḥśrīkāntikavitā vidyāsaubhāgyadāyikāḥ ||

ante nirāmayaṃ brahma jīvanmuktipradāyikāḥ |

svacchandasaṃgrahe (-) śivabījaṃ maheśāni śaktibījaṃ tataḥ param |
bindusargasamāyuktaṃ vedādyaṃ tadadhaḥ paṭhet ||

māyā trīṃ varmabījāntaṃ haṃsabījamudāhṛtam |
eṣā tvaṣṭākṣarī vidyā kathitā bhuvi durlabhā ||

ājñāsiddhimavāpnoti tryailokyaṃ vaśamānayet |
vaśamāyānti sahasā vedavidyāścaturdaśa ||

haṃsatārāmahāvidyā tava snehāt prakāśitā |
kavitvamāharet puṃsāṃ dhanārthī dhanamāpnuyāt ||

mokṣārthī labhate mokṣaṃ nātra kāryā vicāraṇā |

mātṛkārṇave (-) vidyāntaraṃ pravakṣyāmi śṛṇu sāvahitā'naghe |
vāgbhavaṃ kuladevīñca tārakaṃ vāgbhavaṃ tathā ||

hṛllekhā cāstramantrānte vahnijāyāvadhirmanu |
aṣṭākṣaraḥ paraḥ prokto vedamāturanuttamaḥ ||

<422> pañcāṅgaṃ cāsya mantrasya pañcabījena kalpayet |
astraṃ śeṣākṣarairnyasya kṛtakṛtyo bhavennaraḥ ||

dhyānapūjādikaṃ sarvaṃ pūrvavat samupācaret |
ugratārā mahāvidyā kathyate mama pauruṣam ||

pañcākṣarī mahāvidyā haṃsādyantā mahodayā |
kevalaṃ tatprayatnena tava snehāt prakāśitā ||

anayorjapapūjādīn pañcākṣarīvadācaret |
bījakhaṇḍā mahāvidyāstārādyāśca pṛthak pṛthak ||

kevalaṃ kavitāsiddhidāyikāḥ kulabhūtidāḥ |
ṣaḍdīrghamāyayā caiva ṣaḍaṅgaṃ samupācaret ||

pūjā pūrvavaduddiṣṭā prayogā api tatsamāḥ |
ekavīrākalpe (-) śivaśaktistato māyā phaṭkāraśca udāhṛtaḥ |
sārdhatryakṣaramantro'yaṃ jñānadīpaḥ kavitvadaḥ ||

śivaśaktiḥ hrīṃ | māyā hūṃ |

tāro māyā śaivaśaktiḥ phaṭkārāntā parā smṛtā |
etayoḥ kalpamuditamahogrākalpamuttamam (?) ||

tathā (-) likhet khaṃ kūrcasaṃyuktaṃ raudraṃ tryaiguṇyameva ca |
vidhiviṣṇumaheśānāṃ svaśaktikramayogataḥ ||

eṣā matā mahāvidyā sarvasiddhipradā satām |

khaṃ binduḥ | raudraṃ prāsādam | tryaiguṇyaṃ praṇavam | 
vidhiśaktirvāgbhavam | viṣṇuśaktiḥ śrībījam | 
maheśaśaktirbhuvaneśvarībījam |

dhyānārcanaprayogāṃśca tāriṇyāḥ pūrvavad bhavet |
gandharvatantre (-) jalāpacchamanīṃ tārāṃ vakṣye'nyāṃ śṛṇu tattvataḥ |
yasyāḥ smaraṇamātreṇa bhayamāśu vināśayet ||

praṇavaṃ pūrvamuddhṛtya tāre tattāre ca tathā |
ture svāheti mantrā'yaṃ daśākṣara itīritaḥ ||

dhyānaṃ vakṣye śṛṇu prājñe samastāpannivāraṇam |
yasmāt sarvatra toyeṣu bādhā na bhavati smṛte ||

śyāmavarṇāṃ dvinayanāṃ dvibhujāṃ varapaṅkaje |
dadhānāṃ bahuvarṇābhirbahurūpābhirāvṛtām ||

<423> śaktibhiḥ smarevadanāṃ sphuranmauktikabhūṣaṇām |
ratnapādukayornyastapādāmbujayugāṃ smaret ||

varṇalakṣaṃ japed vidyāṃ niyamena yathā vaśī |
daśāṃśaṃ juhuyān mantrī ghṛtāktai raktapuṣpakaiḥ ||

iti siddhā mahāvidyā dadyāt sarvamanorathān |

bhairavatantre (-) tāraṃ māyā vadhūḥ kūrcaṃ kālī kāmakalā tataḥ |
ugratāre bhagaṃ kāmaḥ parā lakṣmīḥ śivāṃkuśau ||

sā mahāṣoḍaśī proktā tārā devyā mayā'dhunā |

tāraṃ praṇavam | māyābījaṃ bhuvaneśvarī | vadhūbījaṃ strībījam | 
kūrcabījaṃ kavacabījam | kālībījaṃ krīṃ | kāmakalā sabindurīkāraḥ | 
ugratāre svarūpam | bhagaṃ binduyukta ekāraḥ | kāmaḥ kāmabījam | parābījaṃ 
bhuvaneśvarī | lakṣmībījaṃ śrībījam | śivabījaṃ prāsādabījam | 
aṅkuśabījaṃ kromiti |

iti te kathitaṃ devi guhyād guhyataraṃ tataḥ |
yasmai kasmai na dātavyaṃ nā'śiṣyāya kadācana ||

dhyānapūjādikaṃ sarvaṃ pūrvavacca samācaret |


atha guptaṣoḍaśīmantraḥ

matsyasūkte (-) praṇavaṃ pūrvamuccārya padmeyugmaṃ tathaiva ca |
mahāpadme padaṃ brūyāt padmāvatipadaṃ tataḥ ||

māye svāheti mantro'yaṃ proktaḥ saptadaśākṣaraḥ |
pūjāṃ ca pūrvavat kṛtvā ardharātre catuṣpathe ||

japamasyāścared yastu sa vai drutakavibhavet |

tathā (-) athā'nyāṃ saṃpravakṣyāmi tārāṃ bhuvanatāriṇīm |
smaraṇāt sarvasattvānāṃ bhayamāśu vināśayet ||

praṇavaṃ pūrvamuddhṛtya hṛllekhābījamuddharet |
gaganaṃ śeṣasaṃyuktaṃ bindunādavibhūṣitam ||

kūrcabījaṃ ca hṛdayaṃ tārāyai ca samuddharet |
sakaladustarāṃstāraya tāraya tathā punaḥ ||

tārayugmaṃ vahnijāyā mantro'yaṃ surapādapaḥ |
gadyapadyamayīṃ vāṇīṃ kathayāmi vidhāyinīm ||

caturlakṣaṃ japed yastu siddhayo'ṣṭau bhavanti hi |
<424> dhyānapūjādikaṃ sarvaṃ pūrvavat samupācaret ||

siddhasārasvate (-) vāṅmāyākamalābījamīśo bhṛguniṣeṣitaḥ |
caturdaśendusaṃyuktaḥ parābhṛgumaheśvarau ||

caturdaśavisargāḍhyo vadadvandvaṃ ca vākpadam |
vādinīti padaṃ paścāt trīṃkāratritayāt tataḥ |
nīlasarasvatipadaṃ tridhāvṛttiśca vāṅmanoḥ |
kahaśabdadvayaṃ paścāt kalarīṃ vahnivallabhā ||

catustriṃśadvarṇayukto nīlasārasvato manuḥ |
ṣāṭkauśikau'sau vijñeyaḥ ṣaḍbhirmantrairyutaḥ kṛtaḥ ||

ṛṣicchandodevatānāṃ vibhāgaṃ śṛṇu pārvati |
gaṅgāpravāhanāmarṣi matsyarūpī janārdanaḥ ||

atiśayavākkavitā chando nīlasarasvatī |
sarvavāgaiśvaryamayī samastābhīṣṭadāyinī ||

hūṃ bījaṃ kīlakaṃ jñeyaṃ hsauḥ śaktiḥ samīritā |
nīlo varṇaśca vijñeyastaritā kavitāphalam ||

mudrā tu sarvavāgīndramukhamudrā samīritāḥ |
hṛllekhayā ṣaḍaṅgāni kuryāt ṣaḍdīrghayuktayā ||

dhyānam

nīlāṃśukāṃ maṇimayīṃ ca kareṣu vīṇāṃ
mudrāṃ ca pātramatha pūrṇasudhaṃ dadhānām |
udyañcaturmukhavahatkavitāṃ(?) pravāhāṃ |
nīlāṃ bhajāmi hṛdayena sarasvatīṃ tām ||

lakṣamekaṃ japed vidyāṃ taddaśāśaṃ sitotpalaiḥ |
hunet pūjā puraścaryā sarvaṃ nīlāsamaṃ bhavet ||

tantrāntare (-) lajjābījaṃ vadhūbījaṃ tato dīrghatanucchadam |
sārasvataḥ paro mantraḥ saṃproktaścaturakṣaraḥ ||

tadante yadi phaṭkāro manuḥ pañcākṣaro bhavet |
tathā (-) tāraśaktivadhūbījānyante dīrghatanucchadam |
astramagnivadhūrante manuḥ saptākṣaro bhavet ||

mantraśāstreṣu saṃproktastathā dīrgheṇa varmaṇā |
<425> puṭitaṃ ca vadhūbījamaparo'sau guṇākṣaraḥ ||

tantraśekhare (-) tṛtīyaṃ bhuvaneśānī varmaśaktī tanutrakam |
astrāntā praṇavādyeyaṃ vidyā dhātṛprapūjitām ||

tṛtīyaṃ trīm | tathā (-)

tṛtīyaṃ bhuvaneśānī kamalāmīnaketanaḥ |
bhṛgurmanuyutaḥ sargī śivaḥ karṇendusaṃyutaḥ ||

ugratāre punarvarma phaḍantā viṣṇupūjitā |
praṇavo varma hṛllekhā smarau tārtīyavarmaṇī ||

astrameṣā samādiṣṭā dvitīyā viṣṇupūjitā |
hṛllekhā (-) smarau hrīṃkāra (-) klīṃkārau |

tathā (-) etāsu pūrvayuktāsu tārtīyaṃ tryaipuraṃ yadi |
tadā caturmukhopāsyā bhaveyustāḥ suśobhanāḥ ||

tārttīyaṃ pūrvamādau yadītyanvayaḥ |

tṛtīyarahitā vidyā pūrvoktaikajaṭā matā |
māyayā praṇavenā'tha rahitā saiva sā punaḥ ||

pūrvoktavidyā pañcākṣarī tṛtīyarahitā satī ekajaṭā bhavati | tena 
caturakṣaro'yam | saiva pañcākṣarī māyayā praṇavena ca rahitā saiva ekajaṭā 
bhavediti | tena tryakṣaro'yam |

tṛtīyakavacāstrāṇi ratīśo vāgbhavāntimaḥ |
eṣā nārāyaṇopāsyavidyā sarvasamṛddhidā ||

tṛtīyaṃ kavacāstrāṇi trīṃ hūṃ phaṭrūpāṇi | ratīśaḥ klīṃ | vāgbhava 
aikāraḥ antimo yasyeti ratīśaviśeṣaṇam | tena pañcākṣaro'yam |

tathā (-) amīṣāṃ mantrarājānāmṛṣiḥ śaktriḥ samīritaḥ |
gāyatrī chanda ādiṣṭaṃ tārā syād devatā parā ||

pūrvavannyāsakḷptiḥ syādatho devīṃ vicintayet |

karpūrendunityāṃ sitāṃ varayugāṃ ratnollasadbhūṣaṇāṃ
candrārdhāṅkitabhālakāṃ trinayanāṃ hārābalībhūṣitām |
bibhrāṇāṃ nṛkapālakartṛkalate saṃśobhivaktrāmbujāṃ
ceṭībhiḥ parivāritāṃ bhagavatīṃ tārāṃ parāmāśraye ||

pūrvokte pūjayet pīṭhe pūrvavat parameśvarīm |
vidyākāmaścareddhomaṃ śarkarāpāyasaiḥ śubhaiḥ ||

<426> raktāṃ dhyāyedimāṃ vaśye stambhe svarṇanibhāṃ smaret |
dhūmrāmuccāṭane dhyāyet kṛṣṇāṃ māraṇakarmaṇi ||

tāro'parā namo vāntabhagavatyekajaṭe mama |
vajrapuṣpaṃ pratīccheti dviṭhānto manurucyate ||

muniḥ patañjaliḥ prokto gāyatrī chando bhāvitam |
devataikajaṭā proktā śavasaṃsādhanī parā ||

ṣaḍdīrghabhājā bījena māyākhyenā'ṅgakalpanam |
dhyānapūjādikaṃ sarvaṃ vidadhyāt pūrvavartmanā ||

tāraḥ śrīśaktitārtīye hūṃ phaṭ nīlasarasvatī |
ṅentā vahnivadhūmantraḥ prokto manulipiḥ paraḥ ||

ṛṣirbrahmā samuddiṣṭo gāyatrī chanda ādṛtam |
devatā procyate devi sadbhirnīlasarasvatī ||

dvekaikadvayaṣaṇṇetre mantrārṇairaṅgakalpanam |
khaḍgaṃ triśūlaṃ karapallavaiḥ svairghaṇṭādṛtaṃ chinnaśiro dadhānā |
paśuṃ padādhaḥ parimardayantī tanotu bhavyāni sarasvatī naḥ ||

pūrvokte pūjayet pīṭhe pūrvoktavidhinā sudhīḥ |
atha nyāsaṃ pravakṣyāmi vidyāṃ devi sudurlabhām ||

vāk śaktiḥ kamalā kāmo bhṛguraubindumaṇḍitaḥ |
pañcabāṇaḥ parāvācau kuṭilāntendrasaṃyuktaḥ ||

vāmakarṇo lavādhārastataḥ strīmātmako manuḥ |
nīlatāre padāt paścāt sarasvati padaṃ vadet ||

atrī rephayutau dīrgha vāmanetrendubhūṣitau |
kāmabījaṃ balau ṣaṣṭhasvarakuṇḍala maṇḍitau ||

candraḥ sargī tataḥ pañcabāṇādyaṃ bījapañcakam |
sauḥ parā vahnijāyā syān mantro dvātriṃśadakṣaraḥ ||

vāk aiṃkāraḥ | śaktiḥ hrīṃkāraḥ | kamalā śrīṃkāraḥ | kāmaḥ klīṃ | 
bhṛguḥ sakāraḥ | aubindumaṇḍita aukārānusvārayuktaḥ | pañcabāṇaḥ 
klīṃkāraḥ | parāvācau hrīṃ aiṃ rupau | kuṭilāntā phakārāntā bakāraḥ | 
indro lakāraḥ | vāmakarṇo dīrgha ūkāraḥ | lavo binduḥ | tena blūṃ | 
strīmātmakaḥ strīṃ | nīlatāre svarūpam | sarasvatītyapi svarūpam | atrī dakārau 
rephayutau | dīrgha ākāraḥ | 

<427> vāmanetra īkāraḥ | induranusvāraḥ tairyuto | tena drāṃ drīṃ | kāmabījaṃ 
klīṃ | valoṃ bakāra lakārau | ṣaṣṭhasvara ūkāraḥ | kuṇḍalamanusvāraḥ | 
candraḥ sakāraḥ | sargī visargavān | pañcabāṇa aikāraḥ | tadādyaṃ 
bījapañcakaṃ aiṃ klīṃ blūṃ strīṃ saḥ ityātmakam | sauriti svarūpam | parā 
hrīṃkāraḥ | vahnijāyā svāhā | tathā (-)

ṛṣyādyāḥ pūrvamuktāḥ syuḥ pūrvavannyāsakalpanam |
naukārūḍhaṃ trinetrāmahilasitatanuṃ sambidānandarūpāṃ
hastaiḥ svīyaiḥ kapālaṃ triśikhakrakacake karttṛkāṃ saṃdadhānā |
aṭṭāṭṭāhāsyayuktāmanavaratalasanmuṇḍamālābhiramyāṃ
cīrodañcatkaṭīrasthalalalitalasatkiṅkiṇīṃ bhāsamānām ||

iti dhyātvā japen mantraṃ caturlakṣaṃ samāhitaḥ |
juhuyāt kiṃśukaiḥ phullairmadhuratrayalolitaiḥ |
caturasre vahnivāyvormāheśe vidhurakṣasoḥ |
vighneśaṃ vaṭunāmānaṃ kṣetreśaṃ bhairavaṃ tathā ||

yoginīmatha sampūjya gurumīśe samarcayet |
bhūgṛhasyādyarekhāyāmaṇimādyāḥ samarcayet ||

aṇimā prathamā proktā dvitīyā laghimā tathā |
tṛtīyā mahimā proktā caturthīśitvasaṃjñikā ||

vaśitāpañcamī khyātā ṣaṣṭhī prākāmyasaṃjñikā |
saptamī bhuktirākhyātā bhavedicchāṣṭamī tataḥ ||

asitāṅgo ruruścaṇḍaḥ krodhonmattakapālinaḥ |
bhīṣaṇākhyaṃ ca saṃhāraṃ dvitīyāyāṃ samarcayet ||

tṛtīyāyāṃ yajen mantrī brāhmyādyāḥ proktalakṣaṇāḥ |
prathamāvaraṇe mantrī yonimudrāṃ pradarśayet ||

kuleśī kulanandā ca vāgīśī bhairavī umā |
śrīśānte ca tathā caṇḍā dhūmrā kālī karālinī ||

mahālakṣmī ca kaṅkālī rudrakālī sarasvatī |
vāgvādinī ca nakulī bhadrakālī śivā prabhā ||

pratyaṅgirā siddhalakṣmīramṛteśī ca caṇḍikā |
khecarī bhūcarī siddhā kāmākhyā hiṅgulā balā ||

jayā ca vijayā'jitā nityāyuktā'parājitā |
<428> vilāsinī tathā ghorā citrā mugdhā kuleśvarī ||

someśvarī mahācandrā vidyā haṃsā vināyakī |
vedagā ca tathā bhīmā ugrā vaidyā satī gatiḥ ||

ugreśvarī candragarbhā jyotsnā satyā yaśovatī |
kulikā kāminī jñānā ḍākinī kākinī tataḥ ||

lākinī kākinī paścāt sākinī hākinī tathā |
catuḥṣaṣṭidale pūjyā dvitīyāvaraṇe tvimāḥ ||

khecarīṃ darśayen mudrāṃ khecaratvapravartinīm |
kirātā yoginī vīrā vetālā yakṣiṇī harā ||

ūrdhvakeśī ca mātaṅgī mohinī vaṃśavarddhinī |
mālinī lalitā dūtī manojñā padminī parā ||

varvarī chatrahastā ca raktanetrā vicarcikā |
mātṛkā dūradarśā ca kṣetreśī raṅgiṇī naṭī ||

śāntā dīptā vajrahastā dhūmrā śvetā sumaṅgalā |
amūḥ samarcayen mantrī dvātriṃśatpatramadhyagāḥ ||

tṛtīyāvaraṇe mudrāṃ bījāhvāmabhidarśayet |
mugdhā śrīkurukullā ca tripurā trotanā kriyā ||

ratiḥ prītistathā vālī sumukhī śyāmalā vilā |
piśācī ca vidārī ca śītalā vajrayoginī ||

sarveśvarī śaktiyuktā caturthāvaraṇe imāḥ |
pūjayed darśayen mudrāmaṅkuśākhyāṃ maheśvari ||

aṣṭapatre yajen mantrī sarasvatyaṣṭakaṃ śubhaḥ |
praṇavo hṛdayaṃ padmāsane śabdapadāt punaḥ ||

rūpe vāk śambhuvanitā kāmo vadavadeti ca |
vāgvādini priyā vahneścaturviṃśākṣaro manuḥ ||

anenā'bhijayed devīṃ vāgīśīṃ śubhalakṣaṇām |
śambhujīvakaleśāgnimaṇḍitā bindumālinī ||

vadayugmaṃ tataścitreśvari vāgvahnisundarī |
citreśvarīṃ yajed devīmamunā manunā sudhīḥ ||

śambhurhakāraḥ | jīvaḥ sakāraḥ | kala iti svarūpam | īśo hakāraḥ | agnī rephaḥ 
| 
<429> maṇḍitetyanantaramakārapraślepaḥ | tena ca bindurūpaṃ lakṣyate | 
bindumālinī īkāraḥ | tena hasakalahrīṃ | vāk aiṃ | vahnisundarī svāhā | śeṣaṃ 
svarūpam |

vāgruddhaḥ kulaje śabdaḥ sarasvati śiro namaḥ |
kulajāṃ pūjayed devīṃ mantreṇā'nena sādhakaḥ ||

vāk aiṃ | śiraḥ svāhā |

parā vāk kamalā ruddhā vadaśabdayugaṃ tataḥ |
kīrtīśvari priyā vahne hṛdayaṃ manunā'munā ||

kīrtīśvarīṃ yajen mantrī tato vāk śambhusundarī |
antarikṣapadādagre sarasvati śucipriyā ||

amunā manunā devīmantarikṣapadāntikām |
sarasvatīṃ yajen mantrī hasakhapreṃ manusvaraḥ ||

śivajīvāgnisaṃyukto bindunādavibhūṣitaḥ |
varāhahaṃsakuṭilavalipradyumnasaṃyutam ||

vāmākṣi vāk parā lakṣmīrvāṇoghnīṃ ghaṭaśabdataḥ |
sarasvati ghaṭe śabdād vadedavataradvayam ||

tṛtīyāntā ca rudrājñā mamā'bhilaṣitaṃ vadet |
kuruyuk preyasī vahneramunā manunā yajet ||

trilokīprathitāṃ devīṃ mantrī ghaṭasarasvatīm |

manusvara ityasya viśeṣaṇaṃ śivetyādidvayam | śivo haḥ | jīvaḥ saḥ | agnī 
rephaḥ | vāmākṣītyasya viśeṣaṇaṃ varāhetyādi | varāho hakāraḥ | haṃsaḥ 
sakāraḥ | kuṭilaḥ phakāraḥ | balī rephaḥ | pradyumno'nusvāraḥ | vāmākṣi 
īkāraḥ | tena hasaphrīṃ | vāk aiṃ | parā hrīṃ | lakṣmī śrīṃ | vāṇo drāṃ 
drīṃ klīṃ blūṃ saḥ | ghnīmiti svarūpam | tṛtīyānteti rudrājñāviśeṣaṇam | 
tena rudrājñayā | śeṣaṃ sugamam |

bhūdharo bhūdharaḥ prokto vāmakarṇendukhaṇḍavān |
bhagavaccandravannīraṃ vadayugmaṃ tṛtīyakam ||

krodhaḥ phaṭ manunā tena mantrī nīlāṃ samarcayet |

bhūdharo vakāraḥ | bhūdharo lakāradharaḥ | vāmakarṇa ūkāraḥ | 
indukhaṇḍo'rdhacandraḥ | tena blūṃ | bhaga ekāraḥ | tadvat tadyuktam | 
candro'rdhacandraḥ | tadvat tadyuktam | nīraṃ vakāraḥ | tena veṃ | tṛtīyakaṃ 
trīṃkāraḥ | krodhaḥ hūṃkāraḥ |

vāgbhavo vāgyutaḥ śambhurhrīṃ punaḥ kiliyugmakam |
<430> vicce navākṣarīmenāṃ kilināmnīṃ samarcayet ||

vāgyutaḥ ekārayutaḥ | śambhurhakāraḥ | tena haiṃ | śeṣaṃ svarūpam |

pañcamāvaraṇe kṣobhamudrāmādarśayet sudhīḥ |
ḍākinyādyā yajedaṅgaṃ koṇeṣu manuvittamaḥ ||

darśayed drāviṇīṃ mudrāṃ ṣaṣṭhamāvaraṇaṃ matam |
parāṃ bālāṃ bhairavīṃ ca trikoṇe ca samarcayet ||

darśayet karṣaṇīṃ mudrāṃ saptamāvaraṇaṃ smṛtam ||

punardevīṃ samabhyarcedupacārairmanoharaiḥ |
atha mantrī baliṃ dadyāt pratyahaṃ ca catuṣpathe ||

gaṇapa kṣetrapālābhyāṃ yoginyai bhairavāya ca |
devyai rudhiramāṃsānnamāṣadīpāśritaṃ dadhi ||

balidravyamiti khyātaṃ samīhitasamṛddhidam |
trividhaṃ dhyānamākhyātaṃ sṛṣṭisthitilayakramāt ||

tattatkarmaviśeṣe tu tattaddhyānaṃ samācaret |
caturvaktrāmaṣṭabhujāṃ muktābharaṇabhūṣitām ||

śvetāmbarāmakṣamudrāṃ śaktiṃ pāśaṃ kamaṇḍalum |
paṅkajaṃ puṣpamālāṃ ca varābhītī bhujeṣu ca ||

śabdāmbhonidhimadhyasthāṃ haṃsayāne vicintayet |
raktāmbarāṃ hemaratna nānālaṅkārabhūṣitām ||

ratnadīpe mahātanyāṃ(?) parivāraiḥ samāvṛtām |
ratnasiṃhāsanārūḍhāṃ varābhītyakṣamālikām ||

dadhatī ratnacaṣakaṃ sthitirūpe vicintayet |
raktāmbhonidhimadhye tu naukārūḍhāṃ vicintayet ||

navavaktrāṃ bhālanetrāṃ kṛṣṇāmbarabhayānakām |
varābhaye ca dadhatīṃ paraśuṃ darvikāṃ tathā ||

saṃhārāstraṃ vāmahaste dakṣe pāśupataṃ tathā |
triśīrṣaṃ vāmahastena triśūlaṃ khaḍgakartṛke ||

padmaṃ pāśaṃ halaṃ śaktiṃ trimūrtiṃ ḍiṇḍimaṃ tathā |
khaṭvāṅgaṃ muśalaṃ dorbhiḥ śatrubhakṣaṇamānasām ||

bhaktānāṃ varadātrīṃ ca rakṣayantīṃ ca sādhakam |
<431> anena dhyānayogena tat tat karma samācaret ||

evaṃ siddhamanurmantrī kavīnāmagraṇīrbhavet |
achinnanālabālasya rasanāyāṃ likhen manum ||

aṣṭame vatsare bālaḥ sarvāśāsātigo bhavet |
abhimantrya vacākāṇḍamayutaṃ ca vasūttaram ||

baliṃ dattvā yathā pūrvaṃ tad kuryād bālakaṇṭhagam |
samprāpte dvādaśe varṣe bhakṣitaṃ kavitākaram ||

candrasūryoparāge tu tailaṃ jyotiṣmatībhavam |
karṣamātraṃ prajaptaṃ tanmantreṇā'nena bhakṣayet ||

jalamadhyasthito'neḍaḥ śiśurvācaspatirbhavet |
śmaśāne ca caturmārge pretamāruhya sādhakaḥ ||

bhayalajjāvinirmukto japed vidyāmananyadhīḥ |
arddharātre bhavecchabdo bhavavidyārthapāragaḥ ||

aṣṭavarṣaśiśudvandvaṃ susnātaṃ svakulodbhavam |
saṃsthāpya sādhako dadyāt tayormūrdhni karābubhau ||

kuruto nyāyavedāntavivādaṃ tumulaṃ mahat |
vipine vijane'raṇye rambhāmaṇḍapamaṇḍite |
vidhāya vedikāṃ tatra niṣaṇṇaḥ sasmitaḥ sukham ||

campakāśokapunnāga kadalīmaṇḍite vane |
dolārūḍhāṃ prasannāsyāṃ ceṭībhiḥ preṣitāṃ śubhām ||

iti dhyāyan japenmantraṃ ravilakṣaṃ samāhitaḥ |
japānte vitared devyai parivārayuje balim ||

amunā vidhinā devī labhate susamīhitam |

atha tāriṇīkalpaḥ

tāriṇītantre (-)

īśvara uvāca (-)

śrūyatāṃ śailatanaye jāḍyanāśakarī parā |
catuvargaphalā vidyā mantrasiddhipradāyikā ||

vargādyaṃ vahnisaṃyuktaṃ vāmākṣiparibhūṣitam |
nādabindusamāyuktaṃ vasusiddhipradāyakam ||

punaścaturmukhaṃ devi takāreṇa vibhūṣitam |
<432> svareṇaiva caturthena candrakhaṇḍena ca priye ||

lācchitaṃ vai mahābījaṃ caturvargaphalapradam |
tataḥ kṛṣṇapadaṃ coktvā tato devi padaṃ smṛtam ||

hrīṃkāraṃ ca tato dadyāt vapūrvamuddharet tataḥ |
īkāreṇa ca repheṇa makāreṇa ca bhūṣitam ||

tato vāgbhavamuccārya mantramenaṃ samuddharet |
navākṣaro manurdevi tāriṇyāḥ samudīritaḥ ||

iyameva mahāvidyā svarge martye sudurlabhā |
aṣṭasiddhipradā devi caturvargaphalapradā ||

nānayā sadṛśī vidyā nānena sadṛśo manuḥ |
anayā sadṛśī siddhirna bhūtā na bhaviṣyati ||

yo vidyāṃ labhate devi kiṃ vā tasya na jāyate |
acirāllabhate vāṇīṃ gadyapadyapradāyinīm ||

jñānamātreṇa vidyāyāḥ kṣipraṃ drutakavirbhavet |
vinā chando vinā śikṣāṃ vinā'bhyāsena pārvati ||

vinā jñānaṃ vinā yatnaṃ vinālāpaṃ kaverapi |
jihvāyāṃ jāyate tasya kavitvaṃ rasanirmitam ||

tatra pūjākramaḥ

prathamaṃ jalamānīya pādaprakṣālanaṃ smṛtam |
dvirācamya śikhāṃ baddhvā tato bhūmiviśodhanam ||

vighnasyotsāraṇaṃ kṛtvā tataḥ puṣpaviśodhanaṃ |
karau saṃśodhya deveśi cā'stramantreṇa tatparaḥ ||

gurūn gaṇapatiṃ natvā bhūtaśuddhiṃ samācaret |
svādhiṣṭhāne sthitaṃ bījaṃ vāgbhavaṃ sarvasiddhidam |
tattadbhūtāgnirarcirbhiḥ śarīraṃ dahate budhaiḥ |
tadbhasmapuñjamutsārya hrīṃ samudbhūtavāyunā |
lalāṭe kāmabījaṃ tu tadudbhūtāmṛtena ca |
tadasthiplāvitaṃ kṛtvā dṛḍhībhūtaṃ caret tataḥ ||

nirlapaṃ nirguṇaṃ śuddhamātmānaṃ devatāmayam |
sarvapāpavinirmuktaṃ dehaṃ saṃcintya sādhakaḥ ||

<433> śarīrasya viśodhena prāṇāyāmaṃ caret tataḥ |
aghoramūlabījena prāṇāyāmatrayaṃ smaret ||

mantranyāsaṃ tato devi śrūyatāṃ mantrasiddhidam |
śaktrirasya ṛṣiḥ prokto vṛhatī chanda īritam ||

tāriṇī devatā proktā hrīṃkāraṃ bījamucyate |
vāgbhavaṃ śaktirityuktamiti ṛṣyādikaṃ caret ||

bījena tu ṣaḍaṅgena ṣaḍaṅgāni prakalpayet |
dharmādi vinyasen mantrī tato'dharmādi vinyaset ||

uparyupari madhye ca krameṇaitān nyaset tataḥ |
kalpavṛkṣaṃ samuccārya maṇipīṭhaṃ samuccaret ||

śavamuṇḍaṃ dhārayitvā tato raktakapālakam |
caturdikṣu nyased devi citāmagnisamanvitām ||

hṛtpadmāṣṭadale tatra cāṣṭaśaktīrnyaset tataḥ |
durgā jayā tato medhā vijayā suprabhā matā ||

kālī gaurī śivā caiva ityaṣṭa śaktayaḥ smṛtāḥ |
ata evaṃ svadeheṣu pañcayoniṃ nyased budhaḥ ||

keśānte dakṣiṇe bhāge yonivīrāṃ nyaset tataḥ |
keśānte vāmabhāge ca yonirvidyāṃ tato nyaset ||

nāsāmūle ca deveśi yonirūpāṃ vibhāgataḥ |
yonikāmāṃ yonihārāṃ netrayoḥ savyavāmayoḥ |
yonirūpāṃ nyasedoṣṭhe sarvakāmārthasiddhaye |
mukhe karṇe ca deveśi dakṣavāmādibhedataḥ ||

cibuke ca mahādevi nyaset sādhakasattamaḥ |
yonihārāṃ yonikāyāṃ yonirūpāṃ tataḥ param ||

bāhumūle tathā vāme hṛdi caiva varānane |
yonicittāṃ yoniniṣṭhāṃ yonirūpāṃ smaret tataḥ ||

stanayornābhideśeṣu yonisthānaṃ sadā smaret |
yonisiddhāṃ yonividdhāṃ yonirūpāṃ nyaset tataḥ ||

etāḥ smṛtāścaturthyantā namo'ntāśca vicakṣaṇaiḥ |
dehapīṭhe tato devīṃ dhyāyet susthiramānasaḥ ||

<434> kṛṣṇāṃ lambodarīṃ bhīmāṃ nāgakuṇḍalaśobhitām |
raktamukhī lalajjihvāṃ raktāmbadharāṃ kaṭau ||

pīnonnatastanīmugrāṃ mahānāgena veṣṭitām |
śavasyopari deveśi tasyopari kapālake ||

nāsāgradhyānaniratāṃ mahāghorāṃ varapradām |
caturbhujāṃ dīrghakeśīṃ dakṣiṇasyordhvabāhunā ||

vibhratīṃ nalinīmekaṃ vāmārddhe pānapātrakam |
varābhayadharāṃ devīmadhastād dakṣavāmayoḥ ||

pibantīṃ raudhirīṃ ghārāṃ pānapātre sadāśive |
sarvasiddhipradāṃ devīṃ nityāṃ girinivāsinīm ||

locanatrayasaṃyuktāṃ nāgayajñopavītinīm |
dīrghanāsāṃ dīrghajaṅghāṃ dīrghāṅgīṃ dīrghajīhvikām ||

candrasūryāgnibhedena trilocanasamanvitām |
śatrunāśakarīṃ devīṃ mahābhīmāṃ varapradām ||

vyāghracarmaśirobaddhāṃ jagattrayavibhāvitām |
sādhakānāṃ sukhakartrīṃ sarvalokabhayaṅkarīm ||

evambhūtāṃ mahādevīṃ tāriṇīṃ praṇamāmyaham |
evaṃ dhyātvā mānasaiḥ sampūjyā'rghasthāpanaṃ tārāvat | asyāḥ 
pūjāyantraṃ tathā (-)

yantraṃ nirmāya deveśi sthāpayed yantramadhyataḥ |
raktamalayajenāpi vasupatraṃ likhet tataḥ ||

tadbāhye dvyaṣṭapatrāṇi likhet sādhakasattamaḥ |
vahnermaṇḍalayugmaṃ ca yantramadhye likhet tataḥ ||

pūrvadale ca deveśi cādyabījaṃ likhet tataḥ |
dvitīyaṃ dakṣiṇe patre tṛtīyaṃ paścime dale ||

uttarapatre deveśi phaṭ vāṇīṃ ca likhet tataḥ |
caturdvārasamāyuktamaṣṭavajrasamanvitam ||

tataḥ pūrvoktakrameṇa pīṭhaṃ sampūjya sarvataḥ |
tatrāvāhya maheśānīṃ yajed vai mantramuccaran ||

ṣaḍaṅgenaiva deveśi pūjayitvā tu pārvatīm |
kṣetrapālaṃ bhairavaṃ ca gaṇanāthaṃ mahāntakam |
<435> etaccatuṣṭayaṃ devi yajed dvāracatuṣṭaye |
pūrvādyaṣṭadale devi etān sampūjya sādhakaḥ ||

aṇimā'naṅgamadanā laghimā madanāturā |
anaṅgakusumā devi tato'ṣṭakarṇikā tathā ||

kapālikā ca deveśi tato'ṣṭayoginī tathā |
tathā ṣoḍaśapatreṣu pūjayet paricārikāḥ ||

sukhadāṃ mokṣadāṃ tatra bhaktidāṃ bhogadāṃ tathā |
muktidāṃ siddhidāṃ caiva kāmadāṃ kuladāṃ tathā ||

kṣemadāṃ śivadāṃ vāpi varadāmātmadāṃ tathā |
rāgadāṃ bhogadāṃ devi muktidāṃ sarvasiddhidām ||

aṇimādyaṣṭasiddhiṃ ca pūrvadvāre yajet tataḥ |
vahnerdaśakalāṃ devi dvāre ca dakṣiṇe tathā ||

pāścāttyadvāradeśe'pi kalāścandrasya pūjayet |
uttare ca tathā devi raverapi kalāṃ tataḥ ||

ṣaḍaṅgena yajed devīṃ tato'strāṇi prapūjayet |
etāśca devadeveśi caturthyantāḥ samīritāḥ ||

namo'ntāśca mahādevi proktāḥ sakalasiddhidāḥ |
puṣpairbahuvidhaiścaiva raktacandanacarcitaiḥ ||

raktapuṣpairmahādevi nānāgandhasamanvitaiḥ |
vilvapatraistathā gandhairjavāpuṣpairviśeṣataḥ ||

śvetaraktaparāgaiśca campakaiḥ ketakaistathā |
ebhiḥ puṣpairmahādevīṃ pūjayennityatāriṇīm ||

mālatī vakapuṣpaiśca sadūrvairnārcayet tadā |
kadambaiḥ śvetakusumaiḥ kuṅkumaiḥ kāñcanaistathā ||

evaṃ sampūjayitvā ca ebhirdravyairmaheśvari |
lakṣamekaṃ japenmantraṃ haviṣyāśī jitendriyaḥ ||

[iti tāriṇīkalpaḥ samāptaḥ]


[iti mahāmahopādhyāya ṭhakkura śrīnarasiṃha viracite tārābhaktisudhārṇave 
ekādaśastaraṅgaḥ] || 11 ||


